"Is this a dagger which I see before me, the handle toward my hand?  Come, "
"let me clutch thee."
msgstr "目の前に見えるのは短剣か？取っ手を俺の方に向けている。よし、掴んでみよう。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Jack the Ripper"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Gain piercing weapons skill level 10"
msgstr "刺突武器スキルがレベル10に達した"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Road to Shaolin"
msgstr "少林寺への道"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Road to Shaolin"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "I feel an army in my fist."
msgstr "拳に軍団が宿っている気がします。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Road to Shaolin"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Gain unarmed combat skill level 7"
msgstr "素手格闘スキルがレベル7に達した"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Mr. Miyagi"
msgstr "ミヤギ先生"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Mr. Miyagi"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "To be your own weapon."
msgstr "お前自身が武器となるのだ。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Mr. Miyagi"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Gain unarmed combat skill level 10"
msgstr "素手格闘スキルがレベル10に達した"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Periodic Table"
msgstr "周期表"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Periodic Table"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "It's somewhat like cooking.  Just don't lick the spoon."
msgstr "大体は料理と同じですが、スプーンを舐めるのは止めましょう。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Periodic Table"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Gain applied science skill level 7"
msgstr "応用科学スキルがレベル7に達した"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Heisenberg"
msgstr "ハイゼンベルク"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Heisenberg"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "You all know who I am.  I'm the cook.  Say my name."
msgstr "すでに知ってるはずだ。私はメスを作っている。私の名は。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Heisenberg"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Gain applied science skill level 10"
msgstr "応用科学スキルがレベル10に達した"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Reality is falling apart"
msgstr "現実崩壊"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Reality is falling apart"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "You will be baked, and then there will be cake."
msgstr "あなたは焼かれ、ケーキが振る舞われます。"

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Reality is falling apart"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Survive a portal storm"
msgstr "ポータルの嵐を生き抜く"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Arcade Mode"
msgstr "アーケードモード"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Arcade Mode"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "STOP HAND-HOLDING ME!!!"
msgstr "お節介はもう要らない！！！"

