"Anxiety, nausea, hallucinations, and general malaise."
msgstr ""
"感覚 -1 / 知性 -1\n"
"不安 / 嘔吐誘発 / 幻覚症状 / 全身の倦怠感"

#. ~ Name of the "marloss_r" addiction's effect as it appears in the player's
#. status
#: data/json/addictions.json
