#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Crack Cocaine Dependence"
msgstr "高純度コカイン依存症"

#. ~ Description of profession "Crack Cocaine Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Cocaine.  It is, indeed, a helluva drug.  You blew your money on some rocks,"
" and before you knew it you were turning tricks behind the local pharmacy "
"just to score a little more.  Where are you going to get your next fix now?"
msgstr ""
"コカイン、それは実にヤバいヤクです。気付けば近所にある薬局の裏手に向かい、大枚をはたいて白い粉を買ってしまいます。次のブツはどこで手に入れればいいのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
