#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Piloting"
msgstr "航空機操縦"

#. ~ Description of profession "Piloting" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're probably one of the last people alive who knows how to safely operate"
" a flying vehicle.  It remains to be seen whether you'll live long enough to"
" make use of that skill."
msgstr ""
"おそらくは、空を飛ぶ乗り物の安全な操縦技術を身に着けている最後の人類です。この技術を生かせる場面がやってくるまで長生きできるとは限りません。"

