#. ~ Description of profession "Knife Throwing" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You learned how to throw knives before the world ended, a skill that can be "
"deadly in the right situation."
msgstr "世界が崩壊する以前から、ナイフ投げを習っていました。状況によっては致命的な技術になりそうです。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sewing"
msgstr "裁縫"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to sew torn clothes back together, and have even made your own "
"clothes a few times."
msgstr "破れた衣類を縫い直したり、服を自作した経験があります。"

