#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Football Player"
msgstr "フットボール選手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your epic touchdown was ruined when your coach's guts were torn out by "
"undead fans.  Now you're first pick in the apocalypse draft."
msgstr ""
"ゲーム中にファンがコーチの内臓を引き裂いていては、華麗なタッチダウンも台無しです。これからは崩壊した世界のドラフト1位として注目を集めることになりそうです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Football Player"
msgstr "フットボール選手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
