#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Marine Infantrymen"
msgstr "海兵隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrymen" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Some call you a 'Jarhead', other’s a 'Devil Dog', and still others have "
"dubbed you a 'Leatherneck'.  Before the Cataclysm, you were a soldier of the"
" US Marine Corps, a military professional forming the backbone to any "
"amphibious assault.  Whether it had been paratrooping out of helicopters or "
"storming enemy strongholds, the name of the Marines had become renowned all "
"across the world.  Now that that world has come to an end and military "
"command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you suppose that "
"its up to you to carry the memory of the Marines forwards into the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"「ジャーヘッド」や「デビルドッグ」、「レザーネック」などと呼ばれています。大変動以前は海兵隊に所属し、水陸両用作戦の要となる軍事行動の専門家として活躍していました。ヘリコプターからの降下や敵の本拠地への突撃など、部隊の名は世界中に知れ渡っていました。世界が終焉を迎え、軍の司令部も崩壊した今、海兵隊の記憶を未来に残せるか否かはその双肩にかかっています。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Marine Infantrywoman"
msgstr "海兵隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrywoman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Some call you a 'Jarhead', other’s a 'Devil Dog', and still others have "
"dubbed you a 'Leatherneck'.  Before the Cataclysm, you were a soldier of the"
" US Marine Corps, a military professional forming the backbone to any "
"amphibious assault.  Whether it had been paratrooping out of helicopters or "
"storming enemy strongholds, the name of the Marines had become renowned all "
"across the world.  Now that that world has come to an end and military "
"command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you suppose that "
"its up to you to carry the memory of the Marines forwards into the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"「ジャーヘッド」や「デビルドッグ」、「レザーネック」などと呼ばれています。大変動以前は海兵隊に所属し、水陸両用作戦の要となる軍事行動の専門家として活躍していました。ヘリコプターからの降下や敵の本拠地への突撃など、部隊の名は世界中に知れ渡っていました。世界が終焉を迎え、軍の司令部も崩壊した今、海兵隊の記憶を未来に残せるか否かはその双肩にかかっています。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naval Sailor"
msgstr "海軍水兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naval Sailor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’re a grizzled sailor of the US Navy, having spent the last few years "
"working shipside aboard an aircraft carrier.  Maintaining your vessel had "
"been your primary duty: conducting needed repairs, and generally being one "
"of hundreds of people whose job it was to insure that things were shipshape "
"and running smoothly.  Now that your ship has become a floating graveyard, "
"you’re not too sure that all the monkey wrenches and mugs of coffee in the "
"world can patch up this particular problem."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ海軍の水兵として、数年間空母の艦内で働いていました。機関部の修理など艦の安定した運用に不可欠な作業を、何百人もの船員の一人として遂行することが主な任務でした。艦が墓場と化した今、世界中のモンキーレンチやブラックコーヒーを集めたとしても、この問題を解決できる気がしません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Naval Sailor"
msgstr "海軍水兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naval Sailor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
