"you're sent to take medical treatment in one of the health care centers.  "
"Just when you thought you've overcome your war-time traumas and readjusted "
"to the normal life, the world has come to and end and your worst nightmare "
"has become a reality: living in an hellish battlefield."
msgstr ""
"軍を除隊した後、健康管理施設で治療を受けていました。戦時中のトラウマを克服してようやく普通の生活に戻れたと思った矢先、世界は終焉を迎え、夢の中で何度もうなされてきた地獄のような戦場が現実のものとなりました。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "新兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"軍に入隊することが長年の夢でした。ようやく夢を叶えたちょうどその時、何らかの国家緊急事態によって訓練が中断されました。唯一分かるのは、放棄命令が下され、この地獄で見捨てられたという事です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "新兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
