msgstr "若い頃、兵士になることを夢見ていました。確かに戦争は地獄と言いますが、まさかこんな状況になるとは思っても見ませんでした。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy SEAL"
msgstr "海軍特殊部隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you used to be a member of the SEALs: a key component "
"of the US Navy’s special forces contingent, a highly trained soldier in all "
"respects, and a proficient combatant in both maritime and ground operations."
"  Called upon to eliminate high-value targets and conduct specialised marine"
" missions, the greatest test of your capabilities now rests before you.  "
"'The only easy day was yesterday', and now its time to square your shoulders"
" and embark on your last and hardest mission to date."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前はネイビーシールズの一員でした。アメリカ海軍の特殊部隊の主要構成員であり、あらゆる分野の高度な訓練を受け、海上および地上での作戦行動に熟達していました。重要ターゲットの排除や特殊な洋上作戦など、日頃の成果が試される場は、目の前に山ほど存在しています。「楽できたのは昨日まで」のスローガン通り、威勢を示し、最も困難な作戦を実行に移す時がやってきたのです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy SEAL"
msgstr "海軍特殊部隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you used to be a member of the SEALs: a key component "
"of the US Navy’s special forces contingent, a highly trained soldier in all "
"respects, and a proficient combatant in both maritime and ground operations."
"  Called upon to eliminate high-value targets and conduct specialised marine"
" missions, the greatest test of your capabilities now rests before you.  "
"'The only easy day was yesterday', and now its time to square your shoulders"
" and embark on your last and hardest mission to date."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前はネイビーシールズの一員でした。アメリカ海軍の特殊部隊の主要構成員であり、あらゆる分野の高度な訓練を受け、海上および地上での作戦行動に熟達していました。重要ターゲットの排除や特殊な洋上作戦など、日頃の成果が試される場は、目の前に山ほど存在しています。「楽できたのは昨日まで」のスローガン通り、威勢を示し、最も困難な作戦を実行に移す時がやってきたのです。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "特殊作戦部隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"特殊部隊というエリートの中でも群を抜くエリートです。部隊の中で自分だけが未だに生存しているのがその証拠です。唯一言えるのは、放棄命令と共にこの地獄で見捨てられたという事です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "特殊作戦部隊員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
