#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Used Car Salesman"
msgstr "中古車販売員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Used Car Salesman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"They said you'd sell your own mother for a dollar.  How dare they!  You've "
"been around the block a few times, and you'd charge way more than a dollar -"
" and get it, too!"
msgstr ""
"1ドルのためなら母親でも売るような奴だと蔑まれていましたが、そんなことは一切していません！少し街を歩くだけで1ドル以上の価値ある情報を見つけ、手に入れることもできる才能を持っています！"

