#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "消防機関員"

#. ~ Description of profession "EMT Firefighter" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"On your way to respond to an emergency call, you nearly drove straight into "
"a riot in the city.  Turning off of the burning, debris-covered streets, you"
" took a long detour only to find yourself lost.  That call will have to wait"
" - you're in an emergency of your own now."
msgstr ""
"緊急事態に対応するため車両を走らせていると、街で発生していた暴動に出くわしました。燃え盛る瓦礫を迂回しようとしましたが、道に迷ってしまいました。緊急通報は後回しにせざるを得ません。緊急事態に巻き込まれたのは自分自身なのですから。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "消防機関員"

#. ~ Description of profession "EMT Firefighter" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
