#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "パトカー乗務警官"

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"An on-duty officer, you received the call and were ready to respond to the "
"robbery.  It all went to shit, your backup got eaten, and you were lucky to "
"escape with your life and patrol car."
msgstr ""
"強盗発生の通報を受けて現場に向かおうとしていました。しかし全てが滅茶苦茶になり、副官も食われ、幸運にも自分の命とパトカーだけを守り切って逃げ出しました。"

