#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ballroom Dancer"
msgstr "社交ダンサー"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr "毎週のダンス教室へ向かう途中で、騒ぎに巻き込まれました。踊り方を知らないゾンビにつま先を踏ませるつもりはありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
