#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Kannushi"
msgstr "神主"

#. ~ Description of profession "Kannushi" for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the maintainers of a Shinto shrine, performing rituals and "
"sacred tasks.  You preferred it when only the spirits of the dead inhabited "
"your shrine, and not their rotting corpses."
msgstr ""
"神社の管理を任されており、祭事や式典を執り行ってきました。死者の魂が神社で安らかに眠るのを願っていましたが、どうやら腐った死体達はそれを許してくれないようです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
