#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paperboy"
msgstr "新聞配達の少年"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paperboy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The undead "
"hordes don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle"
" is still in working order."
msgstr ""
"世界の終焉という知らせを届けるために、朝から仕事へ出かけました。アンデッドの大群は最新のニュースには無関心なようですが、信頼する自転車は役に立ってくれるはずです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Papergirl"
msgstr "新聞配達の少女"

#. ~ Description of profession "Papergirl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
