#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "National Guard"
msgstr "州兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guard" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"政府は蔓延する感染症に対処するため、州兵を動員しました。死力を尽くしましたが、隊列を組む前から通信は途絶しており、いつの間にか死者の群れの中に一人、取り残されていました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "National Guard"
msgstr "州兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guard" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
