#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Historical Reenactor"
msgstr "歴史劇の演者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Historical Reenactor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world permanently derailed your "
"plans."
msgstr ""
"毎年恒例の「ニューイングランド独立戦争再現劇」に向かう道すがら、それは起こりました。思い描いていた線路から世界は永久に脱線してしまいました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
