#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "教師"

#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If zombies have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"生涯にわたって子供たちを教育し、若い心に知識を与える喜びと難しさを経験してきました。直接聞いたわけではありませんが、ゾンビが教育に関心を持っているようには見えません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
