#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ninja"
msgstr "忍者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ninja" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always dreamed with being a ninja, so you practiced your movements, "
"dressed all in black and carried some common ninja weapons with you.  Now, "
"after much practice, you can finally call yourself a real ninja."
msgstr ""
"忍者になることを夢に見続け、動きを訓練し、黒い衣装を着、一般的な忍者が用いる武器を持ち歩いていました。そして今、ついに本物の忍者を名乗る機会が訪れたのです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Kunoichi"
msgstr "くノ一"

#. ~ Description of profession "Kunoichi" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always dreamed with being a ninja, so you practiced your movements, "
"dressed all in black and carried some common ninja weapons with you.  Now, "
