#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Patriot"
msgstr "愛国者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Patriot" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a true American patriot, dressed with star-spangled clothing from "
"head to toes.  The government has fallen, but the nation lives on with its "
"people."
msgstr "頭からつま先まで星条旗に包まれた、真の愛国者です。政府は倒れましたが、国家は国民とともに生き続けます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
