#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Tourist Swimmer"
msgstr "海水浴客"

#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist Swimmer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to the beach to have a nice and relaxed vacation.  What you didn't "
"know was that the people in there would become crazy and try to use your "
"head to play beach volleyball, at least you managed to grab your bag with "
"your things before running away."
msgstr ""
"休暇を満喫するためにビーチへやってきましたが、頭部でビーチボールをしようとする狂人でひしめき合っているなどと、誰が想像できたでしょう。かろうじて自分の荷物が入ったバッグを掴み、その場から逃げ出しました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Tourist Swimmer"
msgstr "海水浴客"

#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist Swimmer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
