#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lifeguard"
msgstr "ライフガード"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was to safeguard the lives of everyone in the beach, but when the "
"swimmers started drowning each other you knew the situation was out of your "
"hands."
msgstr "ビーチに来た人々の命を守ることが一番の使命でしたが、客同士が互いを溺れさせようとする今の状況は、お手上げとしか言いようがありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
