#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Diver"
msgstr "ダイバー"

#. ~ Description of profession "Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were enjoying the company of submarine life when you noticed something "
"weird on the nearby beach, you decided to swim away when you heard the "
"screams."
msgstr "水中での活動を楽しんでいましたが、近くの浜辺から聞こえた悲鳴に異変を感じ、ここから泳ぎ去ることに決めました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Diver"
msgstr "ダイバー"

#. ~ Description of profession "Diver" for female
