#. ~ Description of scenario "Large Building" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation, and are stuck in a large building full of the risen dead."
msgstr "意固地、無知、それとも単なる不運が原因か。逃げ遅れてしまい、死者が跋扈する広い建物の中で立ち往生しています。 "

