#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Nuclear Power Plant"
msgstr "原子力発電所"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Nuclear Power Plant"
msgstr "原子力発電所"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Nuclear Power Plant" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  "
"Your power plant has been shut down.  And your colleagues have become "
"zombies.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"原子力発電所で働いている時に大変動が起こりました。発電機能は停止し、同僚もゾンビになってしまいました。どうやら独力で生き抜くしかないようです..."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Nuclear Power Plant" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
