msgstr "分解するアイテムを置く区域です。"

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid "Loot: Strip Corpses"
msgstr "抜取: 死体所持アイテム"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Strip Corpses"
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid ""
"Corpses in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have everything taken off"
" them and dropped on the same tile."
msgstr "この区域内の死体から所持アイテムを抜き取り、該当分類区域に移動します。分類が設定されていない場合は死体と同じタイルに置きます。"

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid "Start Point"
msgstr "開始地点"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Start Point"
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid "A prioritized spawn point."
msgstr "優先順位の高いプレイヤー開始地点です。"

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid "Loot: Unload Everything"
msgstr "抜取: 容器内アイテム"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Unload Everything"
#: data/json/zones.json
msgid ""
"Any containers in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have their "
"contents dumped out and placed on the same tile.  This includes corpses, "
"magazines, and magazine wells."
msgstr ""
"この区域内の容器からアイテムを抜き取り、該当分類区域に移動します。分類が設定されていない場合は容器と同じタイルに置きます。容器には死体、弾倉、銃器も含まれます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Vortex"
msgstr "旋風召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Vortex"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Summon vortexes."
msgstr "複数の旋風を召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Vortex"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Space twists and deforms around you."
msgstr "周囲の空間が捻じれ、変化しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Call of Tindalos"
msgstr "ティンダロスの呼び声(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Call of Tindalos"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Summon hostile hounds of Tindalos."
msgstr "複数の敵対的なティンダロスの猟犬を召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Call of Tindalos"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid ""
"The world unravels into geometric shapes, and between the chaos you spot a "
"horrid prowling beast."
msgstr "世界が幾何学的な形状に解きほぐされ、混沌の中を徘徊する恐ろしい獣が現れました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Force Pull"
msgstr "強制引き寄せ(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Force Pull"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Pull objects."
msgstr "オブジェクトを引き寄せます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Force Pull"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "An unnatural implosion sends objects flying."
msgstr "超自然的な力によって物体が引き寄せられました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Teleportitis"
msgstr "強制テレポート(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Teleportitis"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Causes you to teleport uncontrollably."
msgstr "制御不能のテレポートを引き起こします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Teleportitis"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid ""
"The world loses coherence, with images of nearby places forming and "
"disappearing around you."
msgstr "世界が一貫性を失い、周囲に付近の光景が浮かんだり消えたりしています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Slow"
msgstr "鈍足(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Slow"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Slows you for a few turns."
msgstr "数ターン速度が低下します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Slow"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "The world shifts blue, and reality accelerates around you."
msgstr "世界が青く変化し、現実世界が加速しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Time Stop"
msgstr "時間停止(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Time Stop"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Grants you a few turns of super speed."
msgstr "数ターン速度が急上昇します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Time Stop"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Stale golden light floods the world, and reality stands still."
msgstr "くすんだ金色の光が世界に溢れ、現実世界が停止しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Darkness"
msgstr "暗闇(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Darkness"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Grants you the Darkness effect."
msgstr "暗闇の効果を付与します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Darkness"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Persistent shadows invade your field of view."
msgstr "絶え間ない闇が視界を覆いました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Hurtall"
msgstr "全体攻撃(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Hurtall"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Hurts you for random damage."
msgstr "ランダムなダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Hurtall"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "You feel hollow inside."
msgstr "虚無感に包まれました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid "Artifact Close Tear"
msgstr "事象の裂け目閉鎖(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Close Tear"
#: data/json/artifact/altered_object_active.json
msgid ""
"Closes a tear in reality and transfers strange energy to the artifact user."
msgstr "事象の裂け目を塞ぎ、アーティファクト使用者に不可思議な力を与えます。"

