msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age."
"  Ready to be played."
msgstr "直立型の大きなアーケードゲーム筐体です。鮮やかな塗装が施されていますが、若干の経年劣化が見られます。すぐに遊べる状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "electric forge"
msgid_plural "electric forges"
msgstr[0] "電動炉"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "electric forge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An electric forge for metalworking.  When plugged in and powered you could "
"use this for metalworking.  If you attempt to craft an item that needs a "
"forge, you will be given the option of selecting it as a tool."
msgstr ""
"金属加工に用いる電動炉です。コンセントに繋いで電源を入れると、金属加工に利用できます。炉が必要なアイテム製作を実行する際は、自動的に道具として適用されます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/rigs.json data/json/vehicleparts/utilities.json
msgid "FOODCO kitchen buddy"
msgid_plural "FOODCO kitchen buddies"
msgstr[0] "FOODCOキッチンセット"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "FOODCO kitchen buddy"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"Assembled from a set of instructions you found in an old book of DIY "
"projects, the *FOODCO kitchen buddy* claims to be *the perfect solution to "
"all your home-cooking needs!*.  While it is surprisingly handy for vacuum-"
"sealing as well as dehydrating food, the cheery sales pitch neglected to "
"mention A - how awkward the damn thing is, B - That you still need a normal "
"kitchen and C - how it doesn't take batteries.  You're going to have to weld"
" it to a vehicle, or something else with a supply of electricity, if you "
"want to use it.  In addition to the food preservation features, it also has "
"a food processor, a water-purification system, a drawer for holding extra "
"tools, and for some insane reason, a press and die set for hand-loading "
"ammunition."
msgstr ""
"「FOODCO "
"我が厨房の戦友」という古いDIYの書に従って構築された車両用装置セットです。書によれば「あらゆる家庭料理への究極の解答！」だそうです。食料の真空パックや脱水乾燥の際は非常に役立ちますが、ご機嫌な売り文句は3つの弱点...A:クソ使いにくい、B:普通のキッチンに劣る性能、C:電力が必要...を無視しています。使いこなすには、電力が供給できる車両に設置する必要があります。食品保存、フードプロセッサー、浄水、用具を入れる引き出し、更には手詰め弾薬を作るためのプレスと鋳型すら備えています。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "Stereo System"
msgstr "ステレオシステム"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "Stereo System"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "stereo system"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "A stereo system.  When turned on, it plays music, improving your mood."
msgstr "電源を入れるとステレオシステムが音楽を再生し、意欲が上昇します。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "chemistry lab"
msgstr "化学実験装置"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chemistry lab"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A small chemistry station, including a hotplate and electrolysis setup "
"powered by the vehicle's batteries."
msgstr "車両のバッテリーで稼働する、ホットプレートや電気分解装置などを搭載した小型の化学実験装置です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/utilities.json
msgid "welding rig"
msgstr "溶接装置"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "welding rig"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A welding rig mounted in the vehicle, that draws power from the vehicle's "
"batteries.  You still need glare protection.  'e'xamine the tile with the "
"rig to use it to repair items in your inventory.  If you attempt to craft an"
" item or perform a repair that requires a welder, you will be given the "
"option of using the welding rig."
msgstr ""
"車両のバッテリーの電力を消費して稼働する溶接装置です。このタイルを調べる(e)ことで装置を使用して所持アイテムを修復できます。溶接装置が必要なアイテム製作や修復を実行する際は、自動的に道具として適用されます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "welding kit rig"
msgstr "溶接キット"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "welding kit rig"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A welding rig combined with a fireproof insulating blanket allows for "
"advanced welds and repairs to tempered steels that draws power from the "
"vehicle's batteries.  You still need glare protection.  'e'xamine the tile "
"with the rig to use it to repair items in your inventory.  If you attempt to"
" craft an item or perform a repair that requires a welder, you will be given"
" the option of using the welding rig."
msgstr ""
"車両のバッテリーの電力を消費して稼働する、耐火シートと溶接装置のセットです。焼戻炭素鋼の溶接や補修など、高度な金工作業が可能です。このタイルを調べる(e)ことで装置を使用して所持アイテムを修復できます。溶接装置が必要なアイテム製作や修復を実行する際は、自動的に道具として適用されます。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An electric kiln for baking brick or clay.  When plugged in and powered you "
"could use this to harden bricks or clay.  If you attempt to craft an item "
"that needs a kiln, you will be given the option of selecting it as a tool."
msgstr ""
"レンガや陶器を焼くための電動窯です。コンセントに繋いで電源を入れると、レンガや粘土を焼いて固めることができます。窯が必要なアイテム製作を実行する際は、自動的に道具として適用されます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off JET J-2500 Drill Press
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "drill press"
msgid_plural "drill presses"
msgstr[0] "ボール盤"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "drill press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  "
"Useful in all kinds of projects from industrial fabrication to home "
"woodworking.  Ready to be plugged in."
msgstr ""
"正確な位置に穴を開けられる強力なドリルです。工業加工品から家庭の木工品まで、あらゆる製作の場面で役立ちます。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off Powermatic PM1000 Table Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "table saw"
msgid_plural "table saws"
msgstr[0] "テーブルソー"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "table saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large flat table, for making straight "
"measured cuts, a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Ready to be plugged "
"in."
msgstr "広く平らなテーブルに回転のこぎり刃が固定されており、まっすぐ正確に素材を切ることができます。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off DEWALT 12-Inch Sliding Compound Miter Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "mitre saw"
msgid_plural "mitre saws"
msgstr[0] "マイターソー"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "mitre saw"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "band saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Ready to be "
"plugged in."
msgstr "大抵の木材加工をこなせる、角度を変えられるアームに丸ノコギリ刃が取り付けられた装置です。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off JET JWBS-18-3 Woodworking Band Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "band saw"
msgid_plural "band saws"
msgstr[0] "バンドソー"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Based off Powermatic TS29 Shaper.  TODO: When support for multi-tile
#. appliances is added, this can stretch two tiles
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "router"
msgid_plural "routers"
msgstr[0] "ルーターテーブル"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "router"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves and stuff.  Ready to be "
"plugged in."
msgstr "交換可能なブレードを使って様々な素材の切断や溝彫りをこなすルーターが、テーブルに取り付けられています。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off JET JWP-15BHH Woodworking Planer
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "planer"
msgid_plural "planers"
msgstr[0] "プレーナー"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "planer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but "
"also good just for shaving wood down to size.  Ready to be plugged in."
msgstr ""
"大きな板材の平滑化や凹凸の研削を行なう大型機械です。特に生材の加工に適していますが、加工済みの木材のかんな掛けも得意です。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off Powermatic PJ-882 Jointer.  TODO: When support for multi-tile
#. appliances is added, this can stretch two tiles
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "jointer"
msgid_plural "jointers"
msgstr[0] "手押かんな盤"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "jointer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, "
"and square off a board to make it very smooth and nice indeed.  Ready to be "
"plugged in."
msgstr ""
"回転する刃が付いたテーブルです。木材を切り分け、滑らかにし、四角形に切り落とす一連の作業を素早く正確にこなします。通電すればすぐに使える状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off Daytona DSP20T Hydraulic Shop Press
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "hydraulic press"
msgid_plural "hydraulic presses"
msgstr[0] "水圧プレス"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hydraulic press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this would be exactly the "
"right industrial tool for you.  Ready to be plugged in."
msgstr "何かを大量に潰したいと思っている人にうってつけの工業用機械です。もちろん、電力があればの話ですが。通電すればすぐに起動する状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Based off Renegade Industrial 2.2HP 210LPM Air Compressor
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "air compressor"
msgid_plural "air compressors"
msgstr[0] "エアーコンプレッサー"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "air compressor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the"
" tank as possible.  Ready to be plugged in."
msgstr "大量の空気を吸入するモーターが搭載された、頑丈なタンクです。通電すればすぐに起動する状態です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "large heater"
msgstr "高出力ヒーター"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "small heater"
msgstr "低出力ヒーター"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Energy efficiency is 40%, consuming 355 MJ and 8.936 L of water for 1 kg
#. of H2 and 7.936 kg of O2.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "makeshift water electrolyzer"
msgid_plural "makeshift water electrolyzers"
msgstr[0] "簡易水電解装置"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift water electrolyzer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift appliance which decomposes water into oxygen and hydrogen via "
"electrolysis of sodium hydroxide solution, with a power cord to connect it "
"to an electric grid."
msgstr "水酸化ナトリウム水溶液の電気分解によって水を酸素と水素に分解する装置です。電気配線と接続できるケーブルが備わっています。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Consumes 200 MJ for 1 kg of NH3.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "makeshift ammonia machine reactor"
msgid_plural "makeshift ammonia machine reactors"
msgstr[0] "簡易アンモニア発生装置"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift ammonia machine reactor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A huge appliance built from salvaged industrial equipment which produces "
"ammonia via the Haber-Bosch process from hydrogen and nitrogen, with a power"
" cord to connect it to an electric grid."
msgstr ""
"ハーバーボッシュ法によって水素と窒素からアンモニアを生成する、産業廃棄物処理施設で使われるような巨大装置です。電気配線と接続できるケーブルが備わっています。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Consumes 20 MJ for 1 kg of NH3.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "makeshift ammonia machine pipework"
msgid_plural "makeshift ammonia machine pipeworks"
msgstr[0] "簡易アンモニア配管"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift ammonia machine pipework"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A rather complicated system of thick-walled pipes, powerful compressors and "
"wiring meant to interface with a reactor producing ammonia from nitrogen and"
" hydrogen via Haber-Bosch process, with a power cord to connect it to an "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"頑丈なパイプ、強力なコンプレッサー、配線、電気配線と接続できるケーブルなどを備えた、かなり複雑そうな装置です。ハーバーボッシュ法によって水素と窒素からアンモニアを生成する装置に接続して使います。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Uses up 1.2 MJ for 1 m^3 of N2 (1.253 kg), assuming 99.5% purity.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "makeshift nitrogen generator"
msgid_plural "makeshift nitrogen generators"
msgstr[0] "簡易窒素ガス発生装置"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift nitrogen generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large makeshift appliance which captures nitrogen from the air for use in "
"chemistry projects, with a power cord to connect it to an electric grid."
msgstr "大気中の窒素を取り込む機能をもつ、科学実験用の大型装置です。電気配線と接続できるケーブルが備わっています。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "power cord"
msgid_plural "power cords"
msgstr[0] "電源ケーブル"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "power cord"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A power cord sticking out of an appliance.  You need to plug it in a powered"
" grid for the appliance to work properly."
msgstr "設備に繋げる電源ケーブルです。設備を正常に稼働させるには、電気配線と接続する必要があります。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "standing lamp"
msgid_plural "standing lamps"
msgstr[0] "スタンドライト"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing lamp"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An electrical device containing an electric lamp that provides illumination."
msgstr "周囲を照らす照明器具です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "standing floodlight"
msgid_plural "standing floodlights"
msgstr[0] "投光照明"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing floodlight"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A very bright, circular light that illuminates the area around it when "
"switched on."
msgstr "非常に明るい照明です。起動すると周囲を円状に照らします。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "wall wirings"
msgstr "壁配線"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wall wirings"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "Electric wires embedded in the wall."
msgstr "壁に埋め込まれた配線です。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "solar panel"
msgid_plural "solar panels"
msgstr[0] "ソーラーパネル"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "solar panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "A solar panel mounted on a frame and ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "フレームに取り付けられたソーラーパネルです。設備に電力を供給できます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
