#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "肉瘤(内臓)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the"
" dimly outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative"
" goo."
msgstr "細い茎の先端に半透明の瘤が吊るされています。瘤の内部には、粘液と共に人間の臓器のようなものが入っているようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "肉瘤(異星樹脂)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, "
"clear resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the "
"stalk and take it with you."
msgstr "細い茎の先端に半透明の瘤が吊るされています。瘤の内部には、樹脂のような透明な液体が入っています。肉瘤は茎から簡単に取り外せそうです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr "肉の祭壇"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living Autodoc."
msgstr ""
"脈打つ祭壇が床からせり出し、その側面は鱗の生えたヌメヌメの皮で覆われています。正体不明の突起が側面から生えており、この祭壇がある種の生きたオートドクであるという悪夢のような事実を示しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "奇妙なアンテナ部品"

#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap antenna"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a heft metal box."
msgstr ""
"送信機や受信機の、アンテナのような装置を適当に寄せ集めたものです。金属製の重い箱に、不規則に点滅するライト、回転するサーボ、垂れ下がるワイヤーなどが備わっています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "pictographic signpost"
msgstr "ピクトグラム看板"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pictographic signpost"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This simple scrap metal sign has a series of pictographs on it depicting "
"what seems to be a trade interaction.  There is a crude but understandable "
"directions map beneath it."
msgstr ""
"金属屑で作られたシンプルな看板に、取り引きを表していると思われるピクトグラムが描いてあります。絵文字の下には、簡素ながら分かりやすい経路図が載っています。"

