#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "mannequin"
msgid_plural "mannequins"
msgstr[0] "マネキン人形"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mannequin"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A life-size wooden figure of a person, most commonly used to display "
"clothing in stores, or for tailors to design outfits on.  Considering all "
"that's happened, something about it is somewhat unnerving."
msgstr ""
"一般的には店舗で服を展示したり、仕立屋が服をデザインする際に使われる、等身大の木像です。今起きているあらゆる現象を考えると、何故か不安な気持ちになります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "birdbath"
msgstr "バードバス"

#. ~ Description of furniture "birdbath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A wide stone bowl mounted to a pedestal, usually filled with rainwater, "
"meant for birds to play or bathe in."
msgstr "台座に取り付けられた広い石の鉢です。通常は雨水で満たされており、鳥が遊んだり水浴びをしたりするための置物です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "gazing ball"
msgstr "ガラスオブジェ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "gazing ball"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A mirrored glass globe mounted on a cement pedestal.  It warps your "
"reflection when you look into it"
msgstr "ミラーガラスの球体がセメントの台座に置かれています。覗いてみると、歪んだ顔が映ります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "rotary clothes dryer line"
msgstr "物干しパラソル"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rotary clothes dryer line"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A central metal pole holding up a wide rotating frame, this would be used to"
" hang up clothes to dry in the sunlight."
msgstr "大きな回転するフレームを中央の金属製の棒が支えています。衣類を干して日光で乾燥させるために使う装置です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "floor lamp"
msgstr "フロアランプ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "floor lamp"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A light mounted on the top of a metal pole, this would be plugged into a "
"wall socket to illuminate a room."
msgstr "金属製の棒の上にライトが取り付けられています。コンセントに電気が来ていれば室内を照らします。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "floor lamp"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "bonk!"
msgstr "カン！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "pine wreath"
msgstr "クリスマスリース"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pine wreath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "A decorative wreath for the winter holidays."
msgstr "冬の祭日に飾るリースです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "sand castle"
msgstr "砂の城"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sand castle"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A glorious castle made of sand.  This mighty fortress will stand tall for "
"the ages to come, a true testimony of the skills of its builder."
msgstr "砂でできた立派な城です。来たるべき時代のために高くそびえ立ち、その建設者の技術の証となる、強大な要塞です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid "decorative tree"
msgstr "クリスマスツリー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "decorative tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A decorative pine tree littered with ornaments for the winter holidays."
msgstr "冬の祭日のために飾り付けた松の枝です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "indoor plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. ~ Description of furniture "indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A small potted plant, used for decoration indoors.  It appears to have dried"
" up and died a while ago."
msgstr "室内で使われる観賞用の小さな鉢植えです。植物はしばらく前に枯れてしまったようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "yellow indoor plant"
msgstr "枯れた観葉植物"

#. ~ Description of furniture "yellow indoor plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A decorative potted plant with a yellow flower, it looks to have wilted and "
"died some time ago."
msgstr "黄色い花を咲かせていた観葉植物です。いつの間にか枯れてしまったようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "harvestable plant"
msgstr "収穫できる植物"

#. ~ Description of furniture "harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"This plant is fully grown and ready to be harvested.  Identifying how to "
"harvest it requires closer examination."
msgstr "この植物は完全に成熟しており、収穫する準備が整っています。調べることで収穫できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "mature plant"
msgstr "成長した植物"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "This plant has matured, and will be ready to harvest before long."
msgstr "この植物は成長しており、もうすぐ収穫できるようになります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "seed"
msgstr "種"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A freshly planted seed.  If properly tended to, it could grow into a healthy"
" plant."
msgstr "小さな種が植わっています。きちんと世話をすれば、上手く成長するかもしれません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "seedling"
msgstr "苗木"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "A seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "発芽したばかりの種です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "planter"
msgstr "プランター"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  Can "
"be used for planting crops."
msgstr "排水性を高めるすのこが付いた、土が入った状態の園芸用プランターです。使用すると作物を植えます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "planter with harvestable plant"
msgstr "プランター(完熟)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with harvestable plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr "排水性を高めるすのこが付いた、土が入った状態の園芸用プランターです。植物は完全に成熟しており、調べることで収穫できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "planter with mature plant"
msgstr "プランター(成長)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with mature plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a matured plant that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr "排水性を高めるすのこが付いた、土が入った状態の園芸用プランターです。植物は成長しており、もうすく収穫できるようになります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "planter with seed"
msgstr "プランター(播種)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one contains a planted seed, and will need attention to grow fully."
msgstr "排水性を高めるすのこが付いた、土が入った状態の園芸用プランターです。種が植わっており、注意深く世話をすれば成長します。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid "planter with seedling"
msgstr "プランター(発芽)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planter with seedling"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "排水性を高めるすのこが付いた、土が入った状態の園芸用プランターです。発芽したばかりの種が植わっています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "spider egg sack"
msgstr "卵塊(クモ)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid ""
"A sizable, off-white sac of large eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see "
"them moving slightly.  Gross."
msgstr "大きなオフホワイトの卵の集合体です。近寄ってみると、わずかに動く中身が見えます。気持ち悪いですね。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid ""
"A bulbous mass of off-white spider eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see "
"them moving a bit.  Really gross."
msgstr "球根のような形状の、クモが産んだ大きなオフホワイトの卵の集合体です。近寄ってみると、わずかに動く中身が見えます。本当に気持ち悪いですね。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spider egg sack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic sac of spider's eggs, each one larger than your fist.  They're "
"definitely moving around.  Really gross, just seeing it makes your skin "
"crawl."
msgstr ""
"一粒が人間の拳よりも大きなサイズの、クモが産んだ巨大な卵の集合体です。内部で動き回っているのがよく見えます。本当に気持ち悪いですね。見ているだけで鳥肌が立ちます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "ruptured egg sack"
msgstr "卵塊(破裂)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ruptured egg sack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid ""
"A disgusting ruptured sac of giant spider eggs.  The thought of all those "
"massive baby spiders pouring out of it is almost terrifying on its own."
msgstr "気味の悪い巨大な卵塊が破裂して残った殻です。巨大なクモの幼体が飛び出していったかと思うと、それだけでぞっとしますね。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "swamp gas"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid ""
"This is a pool of murky water, it occasionally bubbles, releasing a mildly "
"toxic gas."
msgstr "濁った水が時々泡立ち、毒性のガスを放出しています。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "swamp gas"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "swamp gas"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "splash!"
msgstr "ピチャッ！"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fog"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a misty cloud of fog."
msgstr "霧がかかり、雲のようにぼやけています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "metal grate"
msgstr "側溝蓋"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal grate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel cool air seeping out of it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。冷気が漏れ出ているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_cold_air2_blast"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel cold air blasting out of it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。冷気が噴き出しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_hot_air2_stream"
#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_hot_air2_blast"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel hot air seeping out of it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。熱気が漏れ出ているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_smoke_plume"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can see smoke seeping from it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。煙が漏れ出ているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_smoke_stream"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can see smoke streaming out of it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。煙が噴き出しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_toxic_leak"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, toxic looking clouds seep from it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。有毒ガスが漏れ出ているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_toxic_belch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent, toxic looking clouds emerge from it."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。有毒ガスが噴き出しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_rad_leak"
#. ~ Description of furniture "f_vent_rad_cloud"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is a metal vent."
msgstr "金属製の通気口です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_fog_breather"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-emitters.json
msgid "This is misty water vapor."
msgstr "霧状の水蒸気です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "seeing this is a bug"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "Seeing this is a bug.  If seen, please report and destroy."
msgstr "これが見えている場合はバグが発生しています。見つけ次第報告し、破壊してください。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "fake workbench hands"
msgstr "疑似作業台(装備)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fake workbench hands"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "This fake workbench holds the stats for working on a wielded item."
msgstr "装備中のアイテムに作用する疑似作業台です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid "ground crafting spot"
msgstr "製作場所"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ground crafting spot"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fakes.json
msgid ""
"A cleared spot on the ground for crafting.  Slower than using a workbench or"
" holding a project in your hands, but readily available."
msgstr "製作するために片付けておいた場所です。作業台や手に装備した状態での製作作業よりは時間がかかりますが、簡単に用意できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "fireplace"
msgstr "暖炉"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fireplace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A common fixture for safely hosting a fire indoors, with a chimney to vent "
"the smoke to the outside."
msgstr "室内で安全に火を起こすために使う、一般的な家具です。煙を屋外に排出するための煙突が付いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "wood stove"
msgstr "薪ストーブ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wood stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or "
"heating food, and safe to have indoors."
msgstr "薪を燃料にして火をおこす、シンプルな金属製のストーブです。調理や加熱に適しており、室内でも安全に使えます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "brazier"
msgid_plural "braziers"
msgstr[0] "火鉢"

#. ~ Description of furniture "brazier"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things."
msgstr "安全に物を燃やすための、脚が付いた金属製の皿です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "hobo stove"
msgid_plural "hobo stoves"
msgstr[0] "ホーボーストーブ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hobo stove"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"This is a small improvised wood stove, made from a metal can.  It's too "
"small to fit anything much larger than splintered wood."
msgstr "金属の缶等から作った、木材を燃料とする簡易ストーブです。それほど大きくないため、裂けた木材程度のサイズの燃料しか燃やせません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ values based on real world 55 gallon metal barrel
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "fire barrel (200L)"
msgid_plural "fire barrels (200L)"
msgstr[0] "ドラム缶ストーブ(200L)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (200L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A huge metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the walls for air supply."
msgstr "内部で安全に火を起こせる巨大なドラム缶です。側面には空気供給用の穴が複数開いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ values based on real world 30 gal metal barrel
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "fire barrel (100L)"
msgid_plural "fire barrels (100L)"
msgstr[0] "ドラム缶ストーブ(100L)"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire barrel (100L)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A large metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the walls for air supply."
msgstr "内部で安全に火を起こせる大きなドラム缶です。側面には空気供給用の穴が複数開いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "fire ring"
msgstr "石かまど"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fire ring"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "A ring of stones to safely contain a fire."
msgstr "延焼を防ぎ安全に物を燃やすための石の囲いです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid "clay oven"
msgstr "陶製オーブン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "clay oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fireplaces.json
msgid ""
"A simple clay oven with a chimney, with a firebrick alcove in the middle "
"that can be used to cook food or just to contain a fire."
msgstr "煙突が付いたシンプルな陶製の窯です。中心部に耐火レンガが平らに並べてあり、火を焚いて食材を調理できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "mutated poppy flower"
msgstr "変異したケシの花"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mutated poppy flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"These strange flowers have appeared in the wake of the Cataclysm, and their "
"buds can be used for medicinal purposes, like the seeds of the mundane poppy"
" they're named after.  The dirt around them gently churns as their roots "
"writhe beneath the soil, and it's surrounded by an overwhelming floral smell"
" that makes you feel sleepy."
msgstr ""
"大変動をきっかけに出現した植物ですが、採集できる蕾や種は一般的なケシと同じく薬品に加工できます。周囲の地面はうねった根の影響で柔らかくなっており、眠気すら感じる強烈な花の香りが漂っています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "dandelion seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "dandelion"
msgid_plural "dandelion"
msgstr[0] "タンポポ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "dandelion"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A common weed with a yellow flower.  Produces seeds that get carried on the "
"wind by thin, gray filaments."
msgstr "黄色い花をつける一般的な雑草です。灰色の綿毛が付いた種を風に乗って飛ばします。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "burdock seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "burdock"
msgid_plural "burdock"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "burdock"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A common weed with a purple thistle-like flower.  Its seeds tend to stick to"
" clothing and fur."
msgstr "アザミのような紫色の花をつける一般的な雑草です。種子は衣類や毛皮に付着しやすい性質をもっています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild carrot"
msgstr "ノラニンジン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild carrot"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A common white wildflower which could be harvested for its root."
msgstr "白い花を咲かせる一般的な野草です。根を収穫して食べられます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "starry false Solomon's seal seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "starry false Solomon's seal"
msgstr "マイヅルソウ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "starry false Solomon's seal"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"The blossoms of this flower look like stars in the night sky.  Its crimson "
"berries are edible."
msgstr "夜空に輝く星のような花を付ける植物です。真紅の実は食用になります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "salsify seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "salsify"
msgstr "サルシファイ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "salsify"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Tragopogon porrifolius, a ragged-looking purple flower with a nutritious "
"root."
msgstr "バラモンジン属バラモンジンの学名でも知られる、ギザギザした形状の紫色の花を付ける植物です。根に栄養を多く蓄えています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "chamomile seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "chamomile"
msgstr "カモミール"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chamomile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "Ahh, soothing chamomile tea."
msgstr "あぁ、美味しいカモミールティーが飲みたいですね。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "tulip"
msgstr "チューリップ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tulip"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A bright, colorful flower with petals forming a small cup at its top."
msgstr "上向きの杯のような明るく鮮やかな花を咲かせます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "spurge flower"
msgstr "スパージの花"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spurge flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A yellow-green flower that grows in densely packed bushes."
msgstr "密集した葉の中で黄緑色の花が咲いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "cattails"
msgstr "ガマ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cattails"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"This useful plant is available all year round.  Many parts of the plant are "
"edible."
msgstr "一年中採取できて食べられる部位も多い、有用な植物です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "black eyed susan"
msgstr "テトラテカ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black eyed susan"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A yellow flower that has a dark ball in the middle.  Sometimes known as an "
"ox-eye daisy."
msgstr "中央部が黒く丸い黄色の花です。オックスアイデージーとも呼ばれます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "lily"
msgstr "ユリ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "lily"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A pretty flower that comes in a variety of colors."
msgstr "色とりどりのかわいらしい花です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "lotus"
msgstr "ハス"

#. ~ Description of furniture "lotus"
#. ~ Description of "lotus flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A lovely flower that grows on the surface of bodies of freshwater.  "
"Traditionally connected with many Eastern cultures."
msgstr "淡水の水面に咲く美しい花です。古くから様々な東洋文化と関連しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "sunflower seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "sunflower"
msgid_plural "sunflowers"
msgstr[0] "ヒマワリ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sunflower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tall, wide-headed flower with a large dark center.  Produces many "
"nutritious seeds."
msgstr "中央部が黒ずんだ大きな花を咲かせる、背の高い草です。栄養価の高い種子をたくさん実らせます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "Jerusalem artichoke plant"
msgstr "キクイモ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Jerusalem artichoke plant"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Looking similar to the sunflower, this tall plant has a nutritious tuber."
msgstr "栄養価の高い根茎をもつ、ヒマワリに似た姿をした背の高い植物です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "lilypad"
msgstr "スイレンの葉"

#. ~ Description of furniture "lilypad"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"These lilypads don't look they'd support the weight of the things you've "
"heard croaking in the swamp."
msgstr "沼地でよく鳴いている大きなカエルが乗れるほど頑丈だとは思えません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "bluebell"
msgstr "ブルーベル"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bluebell"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A common bluebell flower.  Pretty."
msgstr "一般的なブルーベルの花です。かわいいですね。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "dahlia seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "dahlia"
msgstr "ダリア"

#. ~ Description of furniture "dahlia"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A puffy flower with many tightly layered petals."
msgstr "沢山の花びらが重なった丸い花が咲いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "chicory seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "chicory"
msgid_plural "chicory"
msgstr[0] "チコリ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chicory"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A blue flower imported from Europe, also known as a Cornflower."
msgstr "コーンフラワーという名でも知られる、ヨーロッパから輸入された青い花です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "datura seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "datura"
msgstr "ダチュラ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "datura"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A pretty moonflower."
msgstr "かわいらしいダチュラの花です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "pile of leaves"
msgstr "枯れ草の山"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pile of leaves"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A sizable pile of leaves.  You could sleep on it if you don't care about "
"comfort or warmth."
msgstr "積み上げられた枯れ草です。快適さや暖かさを気にしないなら、ベッドとして使えます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "mustard seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "mustard"
msgstr "マスタード"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mustard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Yellow flower known as Brassica Nigra.  Known for its seeds that can be used"
" for making table mustard."
msgstr "黄色い花を咲かせることで知られる、アブラナ科の植物です。種子はマスタードの原料となることで有名です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "wild sarsaparilla seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "wild sarsaparilla"
msgstr "ワイルドサルサパリラ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild sarsaparilla"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A small, flowering plant known as 'Aralia nudicaulis'.  It is colored in "
"vibrant shades of orange and red in autumn, making it easy to spot."
msgstr "タラノキ属ヌディカウリスの学名でも知られる、小さな花を付ける植物です。秋にはオレンジや赤の鮮やかな色合いに変化し、よく目立ちます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "wintergreen seeds"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "wintergreen"
msgstr "ウィンターグリーン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wintergreen"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A small shrub native to North America.  The leaves, which remain green even "
"in winter, are valued for medicinal purposes.  It produces edible and sweet "
"berries, too!"
msgstr "北アメリカ原産の小さな低木です。緑色の葉は冬でも褪せず、薬草として重宝されています。甘い実も食用になります！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "Japanese knotweed stems"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Japanese knotweed"
msgstr "イタドリ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Japanese knotweed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"An invasive species originating from Japan.  The stem looks like it might "
"contain some water."
msgstr "日本原産の外来植物です。茎はたっぷりと水を含んでいるようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "short hedge"
msgstr "低い生垣"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short hedge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a squared shape."
msgstr "四角く刈り揃えられた背の低い生垣です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "tall hedge"
msgstr "高い生垣"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall hedge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a squared shape.  You "
"can't see past this thick hedgerow."
msgstr "四角く刈り揃えられた背の高い生垣です。視界が遮られます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "abstract topiary"
msgstr "抽象的なトピアリー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "abstract topiary"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a fanciful abstract "
"shape."
msgstr "小さな緑の葉を茂らせた背の高い庭木です。抽象的で不思議な形状に刈り込まれています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "animal topiary"
msgstr "動物のトピアリー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "animal topiary"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into an animal shape."
msgstr "小さな緑の葉を茂らせた背の高い庭木です。動物の形に刈り込まれています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "animal topiary"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a dragon shape."
msgstr "小さな緑の葉を茂らせた背の高い庭木です。ドラゴンの形に刈り込まれています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/furniture.json
msgid "Marloss flower"
msgstr "マーロスの花"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Marloss flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This flower is like the other flowers taken by the mushrooms, but its bulb "
"is colored a brilliant cyan color.  It emits an aroma both overwhelming and "
"strangely alluring."
msgstr ""
"真菌花とよく似ていますが、根元が鮮やかな青緑に色づいています。濃厚な香りを放っていますが...なんだか美味しそうですね？妙に魅惑的な強い香りを放っています。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "Marloss flower"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "Marloss flower"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "fungal flower"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "fungal flower"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "fungal mass"
