#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "net hammock"
msgid_plural "net hammocks"
msgstr[0] "ネットハンモック"

#. ~ Description of furniture "net hammock"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid ""
"A large net with ropes on two sides tied to nearby objects.  It's quite "
"comfortable to sleep in, but provides no warmth."
msgstr "大きなネットの両端をロープで付近に縛り付けて固定する寝具です。寝心地はかなり良いですが、寒さは防げません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid "makeshift bed"
msgstr "簡易ベッド"

#. ~ Description of furniture "makeshift bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid ""
"An improvised mattress on a flimsy wooden frame.  Almost as good as a normal"
" bed, albeit with a slightly lumpy mattress.  Considering the circumstances,"
" it's not too bad at all."
msgstr ""
"薄っぺらい木枠に即席のマットレスをはめ込んだベッドです。少しゴワゴワしていますが、一般的なベッドと比べても遜色ありません。今の状況を考えれば、まったく悪くない寝床です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid "straw bed"
msgstr "藁ベッド"

#. ~ Description of furniture "straw bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid ""
"An improvised bedding pile made of hay.  Better than nothing, but not "
"particularly comfortable, and quite itchy."
msgstr "干し草の山で作った即席の寝床です。地べたで眠るよりはマシですが、特に快適でもなく、痒みが気になります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid "bookcase"
msgstr "本棚"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bookcase"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple wooden shelf for storing dozens of books.  While designed for "
"books, it does a decent job of storing anything else that'll fit."
msgstr "何十冊もの本を収納できるシンプルな木製の棚です。本を並べるために作られたものですが、他の物品を置いても問題ありません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid "entertainment center"
msgstr "AVラック"

#. ~ Description of furniture "entertainment center"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid ""
"While not quite as cool by itself as the name might imply, this large wooden"
" cabinet can store a variety of things, like a TV and media systems, with "
"shelving space and cupboards for anything that'll fit."
msgstr "この家具自体に格好いい要素はありませんが、テレビやメディアシステムなど、様々なものを収納でき、食器を置くスペースや棚も付いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid "coffin"
msgstr "棺"

#. ~ Description of furniture "coffin"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid ""
"A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a "
"standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honor for one "
"to be given a proper final resting place.  An honor that countless many will"
" likely never receive."
msgstr ""
"死者を敬い埋葬するための、簡素な木製の棺です。大変動前は葬儀は一般的な慣習でしたが、今の状況でまともな眠りにつける場所を用意してもらえるのは、極めてまれで名誉あることです。大多数の人々は、この名誉を享受できません。"

