msgstr "閉じたカーテン付きの強化二重窓"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced double glazed window with closed
#. curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed reinforced double glazed window with a fancy curtain on the inside "
"that is closed to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr "ガラス製の強化二重窓の内側には洒落たカーテンがかかっており、視界や光を遮っています。"

