#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "reinforced plastic window with closed curtains"
msgstr "閉じたカーテン付きの強化プラスチック窓"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced plastic window with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift reinforced window with a closed curtain.  It's three "
"sheets of translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame.  There's a "
"sheet drawn across it to block the light.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr "木製の窓枠に半透明の硬質プラスチック板が3枚嵌っています。カーテンが付いており、閉めれば光を遮断できます。非常時の窓はこれで十分です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "reinforced plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "カーテン付きの強化プラスチック窓"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift reinforced window with an opened curtain.  It's three "
"sheets of translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with sheets "
"strung about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"木製の窓枠に、半透明の硬質プラスチック板で作られた即席の窓が3枚嵌っています。カーテンが付いており、閉めれば光を遮断できます。非常時の窓はこれで十分です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open reinforced plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "カーテン付きの開いた強化プラスチック窓"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open reinforced plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift reinforced window with an opened curtain.  It's three sheets of "
"translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with a sheet strung "
"about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open "
"and can be crawled through."
msgstr ""
"木製の窓枠に、半透明の硬質プラスチック板で作られた即席の窓が3枚嵌っています。カーテンが付いており、閉めれば光を遮断できます。非常時の窓はこれで十分です。開いているためなんとか通り抜けられます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "skylight frame"
msgstr "天窓枠"

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A wooden skylight frame."
msgstr "天窓用の木製フレームです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
