msgstr "ライターに使われる一般的な可燃性の液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "aerosol paint"
msgid_plural "aerosol paint"
msgstr[0] "ラッカー塗料"

#. ~ Description of "aerosol paint"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A paint that comes in a sealed, pressurized container and is released in an "
"aerosol spray when a valve button is depressed."
msgstr "ボタンを押すと霧状に噴出する、密閉された加圧容器に入った塗料です。"

