msgid "BB"
msgid_plural "BBs"
msgstr[0] "BB弾"

#. ~ Description of "BB"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A box of small steel balls that can be fired from a BB gun.  They deal "
"virtually no damage."
msgstr "エアガンで発射できる、鋼で作られた一箱分の小さな球体です。当たってもほとんどダメージを与えられません。"

#. ~ Item name
