#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "rubber slug"
msgid_plural "rubber slugs"
msgstr[0] "ゴム弾"

#. ~ Description of "rubber slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Rubber slugs from a shotgun beanbag round.  You could use them to make new "
"beanbag rounds."
msgstr "ビーンバッグ弾用のゴム弾です。新たなビーンバッグ弾の材料になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "chunk of rubber"
msgid_plural "chunks of rubber"
msgstr[0] "ゴム片"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of rubber"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A chunk of useful rubber, can be molded easily."
msgstr "簡単に成型できる便利なゴムの塊です。"

#. ~ 80% of 8.63g/ml is 6.904g/ml.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "copper"
msgid_plural "copper"
msgstr[0] "銅"

#. ~ 80% of 8.63g/ml is 6.904g/ml.
#. ~ Description of "copper"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Copper bits.  Could be used to craft something, for example makeshift "
"shotgun shells."
msgstr "銅の断片です。ショットガン用弾薬などを自作する時に使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "medical tape"
msgid_plural "medical tape"
msgstr[0] "医療テープ"

#. ~ Description of "medical tape"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A roll of medical tape, similar to duct tape."
msgstr "ダクトテープのようにロール状に巻かれた医療用のテープです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "placeholder ammunition"
msgid_plural "placeholder ammunitions"
msgstr[0] "代替弾薬"

#. ~ Description of "placeholder ammunition"
#. ~ Description of "software"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/software.json
msgid "IF YOU ARE SEEING THIS IT IS A BUG."
msgstr "このアイテムが見えている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "charcoal"
msgid_plural "charcoal"
msgstr[0] "炭"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A flammable carbon-based material produced by slowly burning wood.  Utilized"
" in recipes requiring a pure, hot flame.  Can also be used in filters to "
"remove contaminants out of air and water."
msgstr ""
"木材をゆっくりと燃焼させることで生成される、可燃性の炭素系物質です。高温の炎が必要なレシピで利用できます。空気や水から汚染物質を除去するフィルターにも加工できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "carbon electrode rod"
msgid_plural "carbon electrode rods"
msgstr[0] "カーボン電極棒"

#. ~ Description of "carbon electrode rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This carbon electrode is basically made from wood and sugar, and it actually"
" works."
msgstr "要するに木と砂糖で作った棒ですが、実際に機能します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "calcium carbide premix"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide premix"
msgstr[0] "石炭石灰混合物"

#. ~ Description of "calcium carbide premix"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A powdered mixture of coke and lime ready to be smelted into usable calcium "
"carbide in an arc furnace."
msgstr "石炭と石灰の混合物です。アーク炉で炭化カルシウムに製錬できます。"

#. ~ Density somewhere around 1.5 g/cm3 (solid anthracite)
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "coal"
msgid_plural "lumps of coal"
msgstr[0] "石炭"

#. ~ Density somewhere around 1.5 g/cm3 (solid anthracite)
#. ~ Description of "coal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Flammable black chunks of carbon-based material commonly used for cooking "
"and heating."
msgstr "可燃性で黒色の、炭素を主成分とする鉱物の塊です。調理や暖房に用いられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "albuterol"
msgid_plural "albuterol"
msgstr[0] "アルブテロール"

#. ~ Description of "albuterol"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A bronchodilator that relaxes muscles in the airways and increases air flow "
"to the lungs."
msgstr "気道の筋肉を弛緩させて肺への空気の流れを改善する、気管支拡張剤です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "RA21E medical ampoule"
msgid_plural "RA21E medical ampoules"
msgstr[0] "RA21E医療アンプル"

#. ~ Description of "RA21E medical ampoule"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A tiny glass vial filled with advanced fast-healing chemicals which can only"
" be activated by a Rivtech jet injector device.  The packaged instructions "
"describe its efficacy in dealing with infections, wounds, intoxications, "
"envenomations, and general tiredness in enthusiastic detail.  A short safety"
" section at the end warn - in much smaller typeface - against using more "
"than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社製のジェット式注射デバイスでのみ使用できる、先進的な高速治癒薬で満たされた小さなガラス瓶です。同封の説明書には、感染症、創傷、中毒、注入毒、および一般的な倦怠感に対して高い有効性があると記載されています。それに続いて非常に小さな文字で、1時間につき2回以上は投薬しないようにとの警告が書かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "RA10K stimulant module"
msgid_plural "RA10K stimulant modules"
msgstr[0] "RA10K興奮剤モジュール"

#. ~ Description of "RA10K stimulant module"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pressurized multi-chamber glass vial filled with powerful chemical "
"stimulants which can only be activated by a Rivtech stimulant delivery "
"system."
msgstr "強力な興奮剤を充填した密閉加圧された連装式の注射筒です。このモジュールはRivtech社製の興奮剤投与装置によってのみ動作します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "rebreather filter cartridge"
msgid_plural "rebreather filter cartridges"
msgstr[0] "リブリーザーフィルター"

#. ~ Description of "rebreather filter cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A replacement filter cartridge for a rebreather."
msgstr "リブリーザーの交換用フィルターカートリッジです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "filter mask cartridge"
msgid_plural "filter mask cartridges"
msgstr[0] "小型マスクフィルター"

#. ~ Description of "filter mask cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Small replacement filter cartridge for air filtration masks."
msgstr "マスクに装填して空気をろ過する小型の交換用フィルターです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "gas mask cartridge"
msgid_plural "gas mask cartridges"
msgstr[0] "中型マスクフィルター"

#. ~ Description of "gas mask cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Medium replacement filter cartridge for air filtration masks."
msgstr "マスクに装填して空気をろ過する中型の交換用フィルターです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "nicotine liquid"
msgid_plural "nicotine liquid"
msgstr[0] "液体ニコチン"

#. ~ Description of "nicotine liquid"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A liquid that is made up of propylene glycol, vegetable glycerin, "
"flavorings, and nicotine."
msgstr "ポリプロピレングリコール、植物性グリセリン、香料およびニコチンで構成された液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "fish bait"
msgid_plural "fish bait"
msgstr[0] "寄せ餌"

#. ~ Description of "fish bait"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A bait used in traps to lure fish."
msgstr "魚をおびき寄せて捕まえるための餌です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "spiked homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "spiked homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自作ロケット弾(棘)"

#. ~ Description of "spiked homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a spike welded onto a pipe that was "
"filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Horribly inaccurate, as can be expected"
" of this grade of weapon, but packs a fierce punch… if it hits."
msgstr ""
"手作りのロケット弾です。即席の推進剤で満たされたパイプの先端に、スパイクが溶接してあります。命中精度は最悪ですが、威力はそれなりにあります...命中すればの話ですが。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "explosive homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "explosive homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自作ロケット弾(炸裂)"

#. ~ Description of "explosive homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a simple explosive warhead attached onto "
"a pipe, filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Not very powerful, but can be "
"made from scratch."
msgstr ""
"手作りのロケット弾です。即席の推進剤で満たされたパイプの先端に、簡単な炸裂弾頭が取り付けてあります。威力は期待できませんが、自作が可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "incendiary homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "incendiary homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自作ロケット弾(焼夷)"

#. ~ Description of "incendiary homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a container of flammable gel attached "
"onto a pipe, filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Short-range incendiary - "
"handle with care!"
msgstr ""
"手作りのロケット弾です。即席の推進剤で満たされたパイプの先端に、可燃性のゲルを詰めた容器が取り付けてあります。狭い範囲に焼夷効果を及ぼしますが...くれぐれも取り扱いに気を付けて！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "unfinished charcoal"
msgid_plural "unfinished charcoal"
msgstr[0] "炭(未完成)"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished charcoal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The result of an interrupted charcoal making process.  Useless, except as "
"fuel in a charcoal kiln."
msgstr "炭の製作行程を中断した際の生成物です。炭焼窯の燃料にする以外の使い道はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "unfinished calcium carbide"
msgid_plural "unfinished calcium carbide"
msgstr[0] "炭化カルシウム(未完成)"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished calcium carbide"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The incomplete process of converting coal and lime into calcium carbide.  "
"Useless in this state."
msgstr "石炭と石灰を炭化カルシウムに製錬する途中の不完全な状態です。このままでは役に立ちません。"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "low steel lamellae"
msgid_plural "low steel lamellae"
msgstr[0] "ラメラー(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Description of "low steel lamellae"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pile of small 3cm by 6cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled "
"into it.  For use in creating or repairing lamellar armor."
msgstr "3cm×6cmの小さな四角い金属板に穴を開け、重ねて連結したものです。ラメラーアーマーの製作や修理に使います。"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "hardened steel lamellae"
msgid_plural "hardened steel lamellae"
msgstr[0] "ラメラー(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellae"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pile of small 3cm by 6cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled "
"into it, then case hardened.  For use in creating or repairing hardened "
"lamellar armor."
msgstr "3cm×6cmの小さな四角い金属板に穴を開け、重ねて連結したものです。焼入炭素鋼製ラメラーアーマーの製作や修理に使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "chain link"
msgid_plural "chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク"

#. ~ Description of "chain link"
#. ~ link weighs 1/3 gram or so, make 425 per 150 gram wire to account for
#. loss
#. ~ Description of "mild steel chain link"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Small metal rings, suitable for constructing chainmail."
msgstr "チェーンメイルを製作するのに適した、小さな金属製の鎖です。"

#. ~ link weighs 1/3 gram or so, make 425 per 150 gram wire to account for
#. loss
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "mild steel chain link"
msgid_plural "mild steel chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "medium steel chain link"
msgid_plural "medium steel chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "high steel chain link"
msgid_plural "high steel chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "hardened steel chain link"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "tempered steel chain link"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "nitrox"
msgid_plural "nitrox"
msgstr[0] "ナイトロックス"

#. ~ Description of "nitrox"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Mixture of oxygen and nitrogen in proportions suitable for diving."
msgstr "酸素と窒素を潜水に適した比率で混合した気体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "extinguishing agent"
msgid_plural "extinguishing agent"
msgstr[0] "消火剤"

#. ~ Description of "extinguishing agent"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Dry chemical solution effective in extinguishing fires."
msgstr "消火に効果的な粉末薬品です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "tinder"
msgid_plural "tinder"
msgstr[0] "火口"

#. ~ Description of "tinder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Flammable material, finely divided for easy combustion."
msgstr "燃えやすい素材を細かく削り、より燃焼しやすくしたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "RPG die"
msgid_plural "RPG dice"
msgstr[0] "サイコロ"

#. ~ Description of "RPG die"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A die used to play various role-playing games."
msgstr "TRPGで使うサイコロです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "metal RPG die"
msgid_plural "metal RPG dice"
msgstr[0] "サイコロ(金属)"

#. ~ Description of "metal RPG die"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A metal die used to play various role-playing games."
msgstr "TRPGで使う金属製のサイコロです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "bronze"
msgid_plural "bronze"
msgstr[0] "青銅"

#. ~ Description of "bronze"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Decent-sized chunks of bronze, for fashioning some old-school items."
msgstr "古風なアイテムを製作するために用いる、適当なサイズの青銅片です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "glowstick juice"
msgid_plural "glowstick juice"
msgstr[0] "発光液"

#. ~ Description of "glowstick juice"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A mix of blue dye, base catalyst, and diphenyl oxalate used in glowsticks."
msgstr "ケミカルライトで使われている青色染料、塩基触媒、シュウ酸ジフェニルの混合液です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "graphite"
msgid_plural "graphite"
msgstr[0] "グラファイト"

#. ~ Description of "graphite"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Graphite powder mixed with a clay binder.  Produces gray or black marks that"
" are easily erased, but otherwise resistant to moisture, most chemicals, "
"ultraviolet radiation and natural aging."
msgstr ""
"粘土結合材が混じったグラファイト粉末です。触ると灰色あるいは黒色が手に移りますが、簡単に落とせます。湿気や大抵の化学物質、紫外線、経年劣化に耐性があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "black pen ink"
msgid_plural "black pen ink"
msgstr[0] "インク(黒)"

#. ~ Description of "black pen ink"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Carbon black pigment infused with polymers, stabilizers and water to help "
"the ink flow properly."
msgstr "ポリマー、安定剤、書き味をよくするための水を加えたカーボンブラックの顔料です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "blue pen ink"
msgid_plural "blue pen ink"
msgstr[0] "インク(青)"

#. ~ Description of "blue pen ink"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Prussian blue, crystal violet and phthalocyanine blue pigments infused with "
"polymers, stabilizers and water to help the ink flow properly."
msgstr "ポリマー、安定剤、書き味をよくするための水を加えたプルシアンブルー、クリスタルバイオレット、フタロシアニンブルーの顔料です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "green pen ink"
msgid_plural "green pen ink"
msgstr[0] "インク(緑)"

#. ~ Description of "green pen ink"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Chlorophyll pigment infused with polymers, stabilizers and water to help the"
" ink flow properly."
msgstr "ポリマー、安定剤、書き味をよくするための水を加えたクロロフィルの顔料です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "red pen ink"
msgid_plural "red pen ink"
msgstr[0] "インク(赤)"

#. ~ Description of "red pen ink"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Eosin dye infused with polymers, stabilizers and water to help the ink flow "
"properly."
msgstr "ポリマー、安定剤、書き味をよくするための水を加えたエオシンの染料です。"

