msgid "steel drum (200L)"
msgid_plural "steel drums (200L)"
msgstr[0] "ドラム缶(200L)"

#. ~ Description of "steel drum (200L)"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A massive steel barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "液体を溜められる巨大な鋼鉄製のドラム缶です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "canvas sack"
msgid_plural "canvas sacks"
msgstr[0] "帆布袋(大)"

#. ~ Description of "canvas sack"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large and sturdy canvas sack.  Smells faintly of earth and hard work."
msgstr "キャンバス地の丈夫な袋です。大地と重労働の香りがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "canvas bag"
msgid_plural "canvas bags"
msgstr[0] "帆布袋(小)"

#. ~ Description of "canvas bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "Small bag made of canvas.  Looks fine to store dried herbs in."
msgstr "キャンバス地の小さな袋です。乾燥させたハーブを入れたくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic bag"
msgid_plural "plastic bags"
msgstr[0] "ビニール袋"

#. ~ Description of "plastic bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small, open plastic bag.  Essentially trash."
msgstr "開封済みの小さなビニール袋です。ただのゴミですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "garbage bag"
msgid_plural "garbage bags"
msgstr[0] "ゴミ袋"

#. ~ Description of "garbage bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A hefty plastic bag, made to carry lots of trash.  It's sturdy and "
"waterproof, and could easily be repurposed."
msgstr "たくさんのゴミが入る、大きなビニール袋です。丈夫で防水性があり、何度でも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "reinforced garbage bag"
msgid_plural "reinforced garbage bags"
msgstr[0] "強化ゴミ袋"

#. ~ Description of "reinforced garbage bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "Garbage bags layered within each other, made to carry a heavier load."
msgstr "より重い荷物を運べるように、ゴミ袋を二枚重ねて強化しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "small powder paper bag"
msgid_plural "small powder paper bags"
msgstr[0] "紙袋"

#. ~ Description of "small powder paper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small but sturdy paper bag.  Rock solid when packed full with powder."
msgstr "粉末を大量に詰めても破れない、紙製の頑丈な小袋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "zipper bag"
msgid_plural "zipper bags"
msgstr[0] "保存袋S"

#. ~ Description of "zipper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"An inexpensive flexible rectangular storage bag on its typical small size.  "
"Transparent and made of plastic, it can be sealed and opened by a slider "
"which works in a similar way to a zip fastener."
msgstr "典型的な、安価で柔軟な長方形の保存袋です。透明のビニール製で、ジッパーのように機能するスライダーを使って密閉できるようになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "gallon-sized zipper bag"
msgid_plural "gallon-sized zipper bags"
msgstr[0] "保存袋L"

#. ~ Description of "gallon-sized zipper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"An inexpensive flexible rectangular storage bag, noticeably larger than its "
"more common counterpart.  Transparent and made of plastic, it can be sealed "
"and opened by a slider which works in a similar way to a zip fastener."
msgstr ""
"典型的なものより大きなサイズの、安価で柔軟な長方形の保存袋です。透明のビニール製で、ジッパーのように機能するスライダーを使って密閉できるようになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "body bag"
msgid_plural "body bags"
msgstr[0] "遺体袋"

#. ~ Description of "body bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large, human size, rectangular bag made of strong plastic, with a zipper "
"in the middle.  Used to hold a dead body."
msgstr "中央にジッパーが付いた、人間サイズの長方形の頑丈なビニール製バッグです。遺体を収納するために使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "heavy punching bag sack"
msgid_plural "heavy punching bag sacks"
msgstr[0] "サンドバッグカバー"

#. ~ Description of "heavy punching bag sack"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A nigh five foot long cylindrical leather sack, a foot in diameter, with "
"attachment points at the top.  With some bags of sand, some chains and a "
"bunch of blankets you could hang it from the ceiling as a heavy punching "
"bag."
msgstr ""
"上部にアタッチメントが付いた、全長約150cm、直径約30cmの円筒形の革袋です。砂袋とチェーンとブランケットが何枚かあれば、天井からサンドバッグを吊るせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "IV bag"
msgid_plural "IV bags"
msgstr[0] "輸液バッグ(500ml)"

#. ~ Description of "IV bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy."
msgstr "点滴治療で使われる輸液用の密封された小さなビニールバッグです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "glass bottle"
msgid_plural "glass bottles"
msgstr[0] "ガラス瓶(750ml)"

#. ~ Description of "glass bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A watertight glass bottle, holds 750 ml of liquid."
msgstr "液体を溜められるガラス製の瓶です。750mlの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic bottle"
msgid_plural "plastic bottles"
msgstr[0] "ペットボトル(500ml)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A watertight plastic bottle, holds 500 ml of liquid.  Some may be factory-"
"sealed to increase shelf life."
msgstr "液体を500ml保持できるペットボトルです。製造工場で密封されているものは内容物が長持ちします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "condiment bottle"
msgid_plural "condiment bottles"
msgstr[0] "ソースボトル(500ml)"

#. ~ Description of "condiment bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"An inverted plastic bottle for condiments.  Preserves content from rot until"
" opened."
msgstr "逆さにして立てられる、調味料を入れるプラスチック製のボトルです。開封しなければ内容物は腐りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "small plastic bottle"
msgid_plural "small plastic bottles"
msgstr[0] "ペットボトル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "small plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A watertight plastic bottle, holds 250 ml of liquid."
msgstr "液体を溜められるプラスチック製の容器です。250mlの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic prescription bottle"
msgid_plural "plastic prescription bottles"
msgstr[0] "処方薬ボトル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic prescription bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small orange pill bottle with a white screw top."
msgstr "白いネジ蓋が付いたオレンジ色の小さなボトルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic painkiller bottle"
msgid_plural "plastic painkiller bottles"
msgstr[0] "鎮痛剤ボトル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic painkiller bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small white pill bottle with a screw top."
msgstr "ネジ蓋が付いた白色の小さなボトルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic supplement bottle"
msgid_plural "plastic supplement bottles"
msgstr[0] "サプリボトル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic supplement bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small green pill bottle with a screw top."
msgstr "ネジ蓋が付いた緑色の小さなボトルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "large plastic bottle"
msgid_plural "large plastic bottles"
msgstr[0] "ペットボトル(2L)"

#. ~ Description of "large plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"It's a two-liter plastic bottle that can hold a lot of soda, or, nowadays, "
"boiled water."
msgstr "2Lの容量があるペットボトルです。たくさんのソーダ、あるいは飲料水を保存できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "clay bowl"
msgid_plural "clay bowls"
msgstr[0] "陶製ボウル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "clay bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A clay bowl with a waterproofed hide lid.  Can be used as a container or as "
"a tool.  Holds 250 ml of liquid."
msgstr "水密性のある粗皮の蓋が付いた陶器のボウルです。容器や道具として使えます。液体が250ml入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "wooden bowl"
msgid_plural "wooden bowls"
msgstr[0] "木製ボウル"

#. ~ Description of "wooden bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A crude-looking wooden bowl which can hold some liquid."
msgstr "中に液体を入れられる、粗末な作りの木製容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "skull bowl"
msgid_plural "skull bowls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨ボウル"

#. ~ Description of "skull bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A macabre-looking bowl made from the upper part of a skull."
msgstr "頭蓋骨の頭頂部で作った不気味なボウルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "cigarette pack"
msgid_plural "cigarette packs"
msgstr[0] "タバコ箱"

#. ~ Description of "cigarette pack"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"SURGEON GENERAL'S WARNING: Smoking Causes Lung Cancer, Heart Disease, "
"Emphysema And May Complicate Pregnancy."
msgstr "公衆衛生局長官による警告: 喫煙は肺がん、心臓病、肺気腫の原因になり、妊娠を困難にする恐れがあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "cigar case"
msgid_plural "cigar cases"
msgstr[0] "葉巻ケース"

#. ~ Description of "cigar case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small handmade wood and leather case meant to hold one or two cigars."
msgstr "葉巻を2本まで収納できる、木と革で作られた小さなケースです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "snack cardboard box"
msgid_plural "snack cardboard boxes"
msgstr[0] "菓子箱"

#. ~ Description of "snack cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small cardboard box for housing snacks.  Sized so you can take it on the "
"go."
msgstr "中に菓子を入れる小さな段ボール箱です。外出先にも手軽に持っていけるサイズです。"

#. ~ ~7x20x15 or ~4x22x22
#. ~ Item name
