"profile makes storage that little bit easier."
msgstr "長大な荷物も収納できる特大サイズの金属製の箱です。形状がスリムなのでそれほど場所を取りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "bucket"
msgid_plural "buckets"
msgstr[0] "バケツ"

#. ~ Description of "bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A galvanized bucket for peanuts, chilled wine, iced beer, lobster, crab "
"legs, French fries, animal feed, farm use, tailgating, crafts, planting "
"flowers, holding gift baskets, containing a fruit basket and herbs, loose "
"item storage or as an ice bucket."
msgstr ""
"ピーナッツ、冷やしたワインやビール、ロブスター、カニの脚、フライドポテト、動物飼料、農産物、工芸品、生花、ギフトセット、果物、適当な道具、氷塊...などを入れられる、亜鉛でメッキがけされたバケツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "wooden bucket"
msgid_plural "wooden buckets"
msgstr[0] "木製バケツ"

#. ~ Description of "wooden bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A wooden bucket.  Carefully chiseled out of hardwood log section, almost "
"like a dugout canoe.  Holds 5 liters of water and has wooden handle for "
"carry."
msgstr "広葉樹の丸太を丸木舟のように丁寧に彫って作ったバケツです。5Lの液体が入り、持ち運びやすいように木の取っ手が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "hydration pack"
msgid_plural "hydration packs"
msgstr[0] "ウォーターパック(3L)"

#. ~ Description of "hydration pack"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A slim and lightweight insulated plastic bladder worn on the back or within "
"a hydration pouch in a backpack.  It has a large pocket and a capped mouth "
"for filling with liquid with a hose that allows the wearer to drink hands-"
"free."
msgstr ""
"スリムで軽く断熱性のある、プラスチック製の大容量パックです。直接着用するか、バックパック内に収納した状態で利用します。飲み口付きのホースが付いているので、手を使わずに内部の液体を飲むことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "aluminum can"
msgid_plural "aluminum cans"
msgstr[0] "アルミ缶"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum can"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "An aluminum can, like what soda comes in."
msgstr "アルミニウムの缶です。炭酸系飲料によく使われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "paper carton"
msgid_plural "paper cartons"
msgstr[0] "密封紙パック"

#. ~ Description of "paper carton"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half gallon carton constructed of a paper, aluminum, and plastic laminate."
"  It has a threaded cap to keep liquid from leaking out."
msgstr "紙とアルミニウムをビニールでラミネート加工した紙パックです。中の液体が漏れないようにキャップが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "milk carton"
msgid_plural "milk cartons"
msgstr[0] "牛乳パック(2L)"

#. ~ Description of "milk carton"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-gallon carton constructed of thick, waterproof paper.  It has a "
"threaded cap to keep the contents from leaking out."
msgstr "厚手の防水紙で作られた2Lの容量がある紙パックです。中の液体が漏れないようにネジ式のキャップが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "egg carton"
msgid_plural "egg cartons"
msgstr[0] "卵パック"

#. ~ Description of "egg carton"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A cardboard container with 12 individual cavities for storing eggs."
msgstr "卵を12個収納できる窪みがある段ボール製の容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "vacuum-packed bag"
msgid_plural "vacuum-packed bags"
msgstr[0] "真空パック"

#. ~ Description of "vacuum-packed bag"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "This is a bag of vacuum-packed food."
msgstr "食品を真空包装する袋です。"

#. ~ Represents a 4 cm radius x 5 cm height steel can.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "small tin can"
msgid_plural "small tin cans"
msgstr[0] "ブリキ缶S"

#. ~ Represents a 4 cm radius x 5 cm height steel can.
#. ~ Description of "small tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small tin can, like what tuna comes in."
msgstr "ツナなどを入れられる、小さなブリキ製の缶です。"

#. ~ Represents a 4 cm radius x 10 cm height steel can.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "medium tin can"
msgid_plural "medium tin cans"
msgstr[0] "ブリキ缶M"

#. ~ Represents a 4 cm radius x 10 cm height steel can.
#. ~ Description of "medium tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A medium tin can, like what soup comes in."
msgstr "スープなどを入れられる、中くらいのブリキ製の缶です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic canteen"
msgid_plural "plastic canteens"
msgstr[0] "水筒(1.5L/ﾌﾟﾗｽﾁｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A military-style water canteen with a 1.5 liter capacity.  Commonly worn at "
"the hip."
msgstr "容量1.5Lの軍用水筒です。主に腰回りに装着します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "thermos"
msgid_plural "thermoses"
msgstr[0] "魔法瓶(1L)"

#. ~ Description of "thermos"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A Thermos brand vacuum flask.  Built for temperature retention, helps keep "
"things hot or cold.  Contains 1L of liquid."
msgstr "液体を保温できるサーモス社製の魔法瓶です。液体が1L入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "clay canister"
msgid_plural "clay canisters"
msgstr[0] "陶製円筒容器(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "clay canister"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A fragile clay vessel.  It can be used to make crude impact grenades or to "
"store liquid."
msgstr "陶器製の脆い容器です。簡単な手榴弾の製作や液体の貯蔵に使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "clay hydria"
msgid_plural "clay hydrias"
msgstr[0] "水瓶(15L)"

#. ~ Description of "clay hydria"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A 15-liter clay pot with three handles for carrying and for pouring."
msgstr "運んだり注いだりするための持ち手が3つ付いた陶器製の鉢です。15Lの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "large clay pot"
msgid_plural "large clay pots"
msgstr[0] "大型素焼鉢(37.5L)"

#. ~ Description of "large clay pot"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A bulky and heavy clay pot with a waterproofed hide lid, meant to store "
"water, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "水密性のある蓋がついた陶器製の鉢です。飲料水を入れる容器ですが、必要であれば他の液体も入れられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic cup"
msgid_plural "plastic cups"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てカップ"

#. ~ Description of "plastic cup"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small, vacuum formed cup."
msgstr "真空成形で作られた小さなカップです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "foil cup"
msgid_plural "foil cups"
msgstr[0] "アルミホイルカップ"

#. ~ Description of "foil cup"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"An improvised foldable cup made from aluminum foil.  It can contain liquid "
"and is usable for boiling water."
msgstr "アルミホイルで作った即席の折り畳みカップです。中に水を入れて煮沸できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "glass flask"
msgid_plural "glass flasks"
msgstr[0] "フラスコ(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "glass flask"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A 250ml laboratory conical flask, with a rubber stopper."
msgstr "ゴム栓付きの実験用三角フラスコです。250mlの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "test tube"
msgid_plural "test tubes"
msgstr[0] "試験管(10ml)"

#. ~ Description of "test tube"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A 10ml laboratory cylindrical test tube, with a rubber stopper."
msgstr "ゴム栓が付属した実験用の10ml試験管です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "beaker"
msgid_plural "beakers"
msgstr[0] "ビーカー"

#. ~ Description of "beaker"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A 250ml laboratory beaker.  Basically a cup with delusions of grandeur."
msgstr "容量250mlの実験用ビーカーです。色々な誇大妄想を注ぎ入れましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "graduated cylinder"
msgid_plural "graduated cylinders"
msgstr[0] "メスシリンダー"

#. ~ Description of "graduated cylinder"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A tall, narrow glass cylinder with precise markings for measuring fluid "
"quantities.  An important science tool, it is also useful for anal retentive"
" chefs."
msgstr ""
"液体量を正確に測定する目盛りが付いた、背が高く細いガラス製のシリンダーです。重要な化学実験ツールですが、細かいことにこだわるシェフにとっても有用です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "microcentrifuge tube"
msgid_plural "microcentrifuge tubes"
msgstr[0] "マイクロチューブ(1ml)"

#. ~ Description of "microcentrifuge tube"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"These plastic tubes, with little built in snap-caps, are a great way to "
"store a tiny amount of liquid.  Great for jello shooters if 1mL is enough "
"for a shot for you.  Cool people call these \"eppies\"."
msgstr ""
"ロック式の非常に小さな蓋が付属している、少量の液体を保存するのに最適なプラスチック製のチューブです。1mlで十分酔える人なら、これで酒を混ぜたゼリーを作るのも良いでしょう。お洒落な人はこの容器を「エピー」と呼んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "hip flask"
msgid_plural "hip flasks"
msgstr[0] "スキットル(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "hip flask"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A 250 ml metal flask with a hinged screw-on lid, commonly used to discreetly"
" transport alcohol."
msgstr "ネジで閉める蓋が蝶番で付いた、金属製のスキットルです。主にお酒を持ち歩くためのものです。250mlの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "3L glass jar"
msgid_plural "3L glass jars"
msgstr[0] "ガラス瓶(3L)"

#. ~ Description of "3L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A three-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves content from rot until opened."
msgstr "食品の保存に使われる、金属製のネジ蓋が付いた容量3Lのガラス瓶です。開封しなければ内容物は腐りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "0.5L glass jar"
msgid_plural "0.5L glass jars"
msgstr[0] "ガラス瓶(500ml)"

#. ~ Description of "0.5L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves content from rot until opened (assuming it was sterile before "
"sealing)."
msgstr ""
"食品の保存に使われる、金属製のネジ蓋が付いた容量500mlのガラス瓶です。(密封前の瓶の中が無菌であると仮定すれば、)開封しなければ内容物は腐りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "plastic jerrycan"
msgid_plural "plastic jerrycans"
msgstr[0] "ジェリカン(10L/ﾌﾟﾗｽﾁｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of "plastic jerrycan"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A bulky plastic jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids "
"in a pinch."
msgstr "プラスチック製の大きなジェリカンです。燃料を入れる容器ですが、必要であれば他の液体も入れられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "steel jerrycan"
msgid_plural "steel jerrycans"
msgstr[0] "ジェリカン(20L/鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "steel jerrycan"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A steel jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids in a "
"pinch."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の大きなジェリカンです。燃料を入れる容器ですが、必要であれば他の液体も入れられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "clay jug"
msgid_plural "clay jugs"
msgstr[0] "陶製水差し(1L)"

#. ~ Description of "clay jug"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A clay container with a lid, used to hold and pour liquids."
msgstr "液体を注ぐために使う、蓋が付いた陶器製の容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "gallon jug"
msgid_plural "gallon jugs"
msgstr[0] "ガロンジャグ(3.75L)"

#. ~ Description of "gallon jug"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A standard plastic jug used for milk and household cleaning chemicals.  Some"
" may be factory-sealed to increase shelf life."
msgstr "牛乳や家庭用洗剤を入れる、標準的なプラスチック製の容器です。消費期限を延ばすために製造工場で密封されているものもあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "aluminum keg"
msgid_plural "aluminum kegs"
msgstr[0] "アルミビア樽(50L)"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum keg"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A reusable lightweight aluminum keg, used for shipping beer.  It has a "
"capacity of 50 liters."
msgstr "再利用可能なアルミ製の軽いビア樽です。ビールの輸送に使われます。50Lの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "steel keg"
msgid_plural "steel kegs"
msgstr[0] "スチールビア樽(50L)"

#. ~ Description of "steel keg"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A reusable heavy steel keg, used for shipping beer.  It has a capacity of 50"
" liters."
msgstr "再利用可能な鋼鉄製の重いビア樽です。ビールの輸送に使われます。50Lの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "large sealed stomach"
msgid_plural "large sealed stomachs"
msgstr[0] "水筒(3L/大きな胃)"

#. ~ Description of "large sealed stomach"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"The stomach of a large creature, cleaned and sealed with strings.  It can "
"hold 3 liters of water."
msgstr "大きな動物の胃を綺麗に洗浄し、紐で密封した水筒です。3Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "metal tank (60L)"
msgid_plural "metal tanks (60L)"
msgstr[0] "金属タンク(60L)"

#. ~ Description of "metal tank (60L)"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A large metal tank for holding liquids.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr "液体を運ぶために使用する大型の金属タンクです。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "metal tank (2L)"
msgid_plural "metal tanks (2L)"
msgstr[0] "金属タンク(2L)"

#. ~ Description of "metal tank (2L)"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "A small metal tank for gas or liquids.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr "気体や液体を運ぶために使用する小型の金属タンクです。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "wooden canteen"
msgid_plural "wooden canteens"
msgstr[0] "水筒(1.5L/木)"

#. ~ Description of "wooden canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A water canteen made from wood, secured by metal bands and sealed with wax "
"or pitch.  Holds 1.5 liters and has a simple carry strap."
msgstr "木製の水筒です。金属製の輪で固定され、蝋や松脂で密封します。1.5Lの容量があり、携帯用の簡素な紐が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "sealed stomach"
msgid_plural "sealed stomachs"
msgstr[0] "水筒(1.5L/胃)"

#. ~ Description of "sealed stomach"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"The stomach of a creature, cleaned and sealed with a string.  It can hold "
"1.5 liters of water."
msgstr "動物の胃を綺麗に洗浄し、紐で密封した水筒です。1.5Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース"

#. ~ Description of "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect your "
"smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なスマートフォン向けに作られた防水ケースです。スマートフォンの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "police call box waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "police call box waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(ﾎﾟﾘｽﾎﾞｯｸｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "police call box waterproof smartphone case" of
#. item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has a drawing on it that makes it look like "
"an old English police call box."
msgstr "イギリスの古風なポリスボックスをイメージしたデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "black waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "black waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(黒)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A black waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect "
"your smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なスマートフォン向けに作られた黒色の防水ケースです。スマートフォンの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "pink waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "pink waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(桃)"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A pink waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect "
"your smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なスマートフォン向けに作られたピンク色の防水ケースです。スマートフォンの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "red waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "red waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(赤)"

#. ~ Description of variant "red waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A red waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect your"
" smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なスマートフォン向けに作られた赤色の防水ケースです。スマートフォンの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "bejewelled waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "bejewelled waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(豪華)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bejewelled waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A gold waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect "
"your smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なスマートフォン向けに作られた金色の派手な防水ケースです。スマートフォンの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "Hello Kitty waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Hello Kitty waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(ｷﾃｨ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hello Kitty waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has numerous versions of Hello Kitty posing "
"on it."
msgstr "色々なポーズをとっているハローキティがプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "zombie waterproof smartphone case"
msgid_plural "zombie waterproof smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(ｿﾞﾝﾋﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie waterproof smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has a green zombie on its rear side.  Would "
"using this be in poor taste now?"
msgstr "背面に緑色のゾンビがプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。今の状況でこれを使うのは悪趣味かもしれませんね？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "small waterskin"
msgid_plural "small waterskins"
msgstr[0] "水筒(1.5L/革)"

#. ~ Description of "small waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 1.5 liters of"
" water."
msgstr "水が漏れないように作られた革製の小さな水筒です。1.5Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "waterskin"
msgid_plural "waterskins"
msgstr[0] "水筒(3L/革)"

#. ~ Description of "waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 3 liters of water."
msgstr "水が漏れないように作られた革製の小さな水筒です。1.5Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "large waterskin"
msgid_plural "large waterskins"
msgstr[0] "水筒(5L/革)"

#. ~ Description of "large waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 5 liters of "
"water."
msgstr "水が漏れないように作られた革製の大きな水筒です。5Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "wooden barrel"
msgid_plural "wooden barrels"
msgstr[0] "樽(100L/木)"

#. ~ Description of "wooden barrel"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally made of white oak; these vessels are known for delivering "
"delicious whiskey to the future.  It has a capacity of 100 liters."
msgstr "美味しいウイスキー造りで有名な、ホワイトオーク製の伝統的な容器です。100Lの容量があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "paper wrapper"
msgid_plural "paper wrappers"
msgstr[0] "包装紙"

#. ~ Description of "paper wrapper"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "Just a piece of butcher's paper.  Good for starting fires."
msgstr "紙屑です。火を起こすのにちょうど良さそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "foil wrapper"
msgid_plural "foil wrappers"
msgstr[0] "アルミホイル包装紙"

#. ~ Description of "foil wrapper"
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A piece of aluminum foil, large enough to wrap around something.  You could "
"also cook food in it."
msgstr "ものを包むのに十分な大きさがあるアルミホイル包装紙です。食品を並べて調理するのにも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "wrapper"
msgid_plural "wrappers"
msgstr[0] "包装紙"

#. ~ Description of "wrapper"
#. ~ Daizu is Japanese for soy, hence DaiZoom
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"\"DaiZoom Protein Bar, brought to you by SoyPelusa\" is emblazoned proudly "
"upon this greaseproof wrapper."
msgstr "「SoyPelusaのダイズーム プロテインバー」という文字が誇らしげに印刷されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid "styrofoam cup"
