"A high-quality lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be "
"useful for starting a fire."
msgstr "光の収束や拡散ができる、小型の高性能レンズです。着火にも使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "small high-quality lens"
msgid_plural "small high-quality lenses"
msgstr[0] "小型高性能レンズ"

#. ~ Description of "small high-quality lens"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small high-quality lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be"
" useful for crafting."
msgstr "光の収束や拡散ができる、小型の高性能レンズです。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pair of tinted glass"
msgid_plural "pairs of tinted glass"
msgstr[0] "色付きレンズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of tinted glass"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pair of small darkened glass, like the one that sunglasses are made of."
msgstr "サングラスに使われるような2枚の小さな黒いレンズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "burnt out bionic"
msgid_plural "burnt out bionics"
msgstr[0] "壊れた生体部品"

#. ~ Description of "burnt out bionic"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Once a valuable bionic implant, it has not held up well under repeated use."
"  This object has been destroyed by excessive electric current and is now "
"useless."
msgstr "希少な生体部品ですが破損しています。過電流によるものでしょうか、このままでは何の役にも立ちません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "nanofabricator template"
msgid_plural "nanofabricator templates"
msgstr[0] "ナノ製造テンプレート"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system.  This small slate of transparent "
"glass holds, inscribed as a miniature pattern, the instructions required to "
"create an item through a nanofabricator."
msgstr ""
"最先端の光記憶システムです。小さなガラス板に刻まれた緻密な模様には、ナノ製造装置を使ってアイテムを組み立てるのに必要な命令が保存されています。"

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set to"
" replicate itself."
msgstr "自己複製命令セットをを含む、最先端の光メモリシステムです。"

#. ~ actually worth millions
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
msgid_plural "nanofabricator templates (silicon photonics)"
msgstr[0] "ナノ製造テンプレート (フォトニック回路)"

#. ~ actually worth millions
#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of complex silicon photonic circuitry.  The "
"data within was once clearly worth millions, but now, you are not sure if "
"it's anything more than a fancy, high-tech paperweight."
msgstr ""
"複雑なシリコン製回路の製造に必要な命令セットが入った、最先端の光記憶システムです。内部データにはかつて数百万ドルは下らない価値が付きましたが、今の状況でハイテク文鎮以上の用途があるのでしょうか。"

#. ~ given to HUB 01 for even better armor
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
msgid_plural "nanofabricator templates (UHMWPE)"
msgstr[0] "ナノ製造テンプレート (超高分子量ポリエチレン)"

#. ~ given to HUB 01 for even better armor
#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of advanced armor materials.  This seems to "
"just be routines to work with the materials not actual armor schematics."
msgstr ""
"複雑なシリコン製回路の製造に必要な命令セットが入った、最先端の光記憶システムです。アイテム自体の設計図ではなく、素材の製造に関する手順が記録されているようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "antenna"
msgid_plural "antennas"
msgstr[0] "アンテナ"

#. ~ Description of "antenna"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A simple thin copper shaft.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr "シンプルな銅製の細い棒です。多くの電子機器の製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "micro motor"
msgid_plural "micro motors"
msgstr[0] "マイクロモーター"

#. ~ Description of "micro motor"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A very small electric motor like those used in RC cars.  Useful in lots of "
"electronics recipes."
msgstr "ラジコンカーで用いられるような、非常に小さなモーターです。多くの電子機器の製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "circuit board"
msgid_plural "circuit boards"
msgstr[0] "回路基板"

#. ~ Description of "circuit board"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A printed card that supports and electrically connects electronic components"
" on a non-conductive substrate."
msgstr "非伝導性基板上の電子部品に接続対応したプリント基板です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "electronic scrap"
msgid_plural "electronic scraps"
msgstr[0] "廃電子機器"

#. ~ Description of "electronic scrap"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A random collection of resistors, capacitors, and diodes which have been "
"stripped from printed circuits."
msgstr "基板から剥ぎ取られてしまった抵抗器やコンデンサ、ダイオードなどです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "radio repeater mod"
msgid_plural "radio repeater mods"
msgstr[0] "無線中継モジュール"

#. ~ Description of "radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A system designed to convert a radio station into an autonomous repeater."
msgstr "無線局の切り替えができるように設計した、自立型の中継器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "desk fan"
msgid_plural "desk fans"
msgstr[0] "卓上扇風機"

#. ~ Description of "desk fan"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small fan, used to propel air around a room."
msgstr "室内の空気を循環させるのに使う卓上扇風機です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "ceramic armor plate"
msgid_plural "ceramic armor plates"
msgstr[0] "防弾プレート"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic armor plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A ceramic armor plate, specifically engineered for use in a bullet resistant"
" vest."
msgstr "防弾ベストに挿入して使う、セラミック製の防弾プレートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "fishbowl"
msgid_plural "fishbowls"
msgstr[0] "金魚鉢"

#. ~ Description of "fishbowl"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A filled fishbowl, the tag says 'to Ed' and the fish's name, 'Hoss'.  The "
"fish appears to have tiny antlers."
msgstr "金魚鉢には「エドへ」という宛名と「ホス」という魚の名前が書かれたタグ、そして魚が入っています。魚には小さな枝角が付いているように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pipe cleaner"
msgid_plural "pipe cleaners"
msgstr[0] "パイプブラシ"

#. ~ Description of "pipe cleaner"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This is a tool designed to clean interior surface of pipes, bottles, and "
"similar objects.  This one is thin enough to be used for cleaning firearm "
"barrels from dirt and fouling."
msgstr "パイプや瓶などの内部を掃除するための道具です。ブラシが非常に小さく、銃口に挿入して内部を掃除することも可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "clock"
msgid_plural "clocks"
msgstr[0] "時計"

#. ~ Description of "clock"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small mechanical clock, it's stopped at 10:10."
msgstr "小型の時計です。10時10分で時が止まっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "clockworks"
msgid_plural "clockworks"
msgstr[0] "時計用計時機構"

#. ~ Description of "clockworks"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small assortment of gears and other clockwork gubbins."
msgstr "歯車など時計の機構に必要となる小さな部品の詰め合わせです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "SD-Memory card"
msgid_plural "SD-Memory cards"
msgstr[0] "SDメモリーカード"

#. ~ Description of "SD-Memory card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A memory card, used.  Might be worth a look."
msgstr "使用された形跡のあるメモリーカードです。一見の価値がある...かもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "SD-Memory card (clean)"
msgid_plural "SD-Memory cards (clean)"
msgstr[0] "SDメモリーカード(空)"

#. ~ Description of "SD-Memory card (clean)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This memory card is either unused or has been wiped clean.  You could use it"
" to store your data, though!"
msgstr "このメモリーカードは新品なのかフォーマット済みなのか分かりませんが空っぽです。でも、これを使ってデータを保存することができますよ！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "SD-Memory card (encrypted)"
msgid_plural "SD-Memory cards (encrypted)"
msgstr[0] "SDメモリーカード(暗号化)"

#. ~ Description of "SD-Memory card (encrypted)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This memory card appears to have the firmware encryption set.  Hopefully it "
"contains something worth encrypting."
msgstr "このメモリーカードには暗号化されています。暗号化に値する中身にわくわくしますね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Science SD-Memory card"
msgid_plural "Science SD-Memory cards"
msgstr[0] "SDメモリーカード(科学)"

#. ~ Description of "Science SD-Memory card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This memory card appears to be related to 'XEDRA', and is certainly "
"encrypted.  Looks *Interesting*, though…"
msgstr "このメモリーカードは「XEDRA」に関するもののようで、しっかりと暗号化されています。なんとも*興味深い*ですね..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "hand mirror"
msgid_plural "hand mirrors"
msgstr[0] "手鏡"

#. ~ Description of "hand mirror"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small hand mirror."
msgstr "小さな手鏡です。"

#. ~ Description of "manhole cover"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy iron disc that typically covers a ladder into the sewers.  Lifting "
"it from the manhole is impossible without a crowbar."
msgstr "下水道への入り口となる梯子を塞いでいる、ずっしりと重い鉄の円盤です。バールがなければ持ち上げられそうにありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pine bough"
msgid_plural "pine boughs"
msgstr[0] "松の枝"

#. ~ Description of "pine bough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A branch from a pine tree, oozing sticky sap and bristling with prickly "
"needles."
msgstr "松の木の枝です。粘着性の樹液がにじみ出ており、ちくちくとした針葉が生えています。 "

#. ~ Commercial pinecones average 300g. We're assuming wild ones weigh less
#. than this.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pinecone"
msgid_plural "pinecones"
msgstr[0] "松かさ"

#. ~ Commercial pinecones average 300g. We're assuming wild ones weigh less
#. than this.
#. ~ Description of "pinecone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A spiny pod from a pine tree."
msgstr "松の木から採取できる尖った莢です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "unfinished koji rice"
msgid_plural "unfinished koji rice"
msgstr[0] "米麹(未完成)"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished koji rice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mold fragments, set aside to let "
"koji mold grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."
msgstr "炊いた米に酵母と麹菌の混合物を入れたものです。麹菌が上手く繁殖すれば、日本酒の材料として問題なく使えるようになります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the rice; this batch is usable "
"now."
msgstr "麹菌が米全体を覆っています。米麹として使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The koji mold is still growing."
msgstr "まだ麹菌が増殖していません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "koji rice"
msgid_plural "koji rice"
msgstr[0] "米麹"

#. ~ Description of "koji rice"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some rice covered in koji mold, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making "
"sake, but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."
msgstr ""
"麹菌に全体を覆われた、酵母入りの炊いた米です。日本酒造りに役立ちますが、そのまま食べてもあまり美味しくありません。ほのかな栗の香りがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "growing wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "growing wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "種麹培養袋(未完成)"

#. ~ Description of "growing wild koji mold"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left "
"alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mold."
msgstr "炊いた米に灰を振りかけ、トウモロコシの皮に包んだものです。しばらく放っておけば、麹菌が繁殖しているかもしれません。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The patches of koji mold have grown on the rice; you can now extract it."
msgstr "米に麹菌が付着し、斑点模様を作っています。種麹を採取できるようになりました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The koji mold hasn't grown yet."
msgstr "まだ麹菌が繁殖していません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "grown wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "grown wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "種麹培養袋"

#. ~ Description of "grown wild koji mold"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has "
"grown patches of koji mold inside; disassemble this item to extract it."
msgstr "炊いた米に灰を振りかけ、トウモロコシの皮に包んだものです。内部で繁殖している麹菌を、分解して採取しましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "soy and wheat dough"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough"
msgstr[0] "醤油麹(未完成)"

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in "
"wet paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary"
" for making soy sauce."
msgstr "大豆や穀物を煮て潰した生地を、濡れた紙で包んだものです。しばらく乾燥させておくと、醤油を作るのに必要な麹菌が内部で繁殖します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the dough; this batch is usable "
"now."
msgstr "麹菌が生地全体を覆っています。醤油麹として使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgstr[0] "醤油麹"

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough with koji"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour,"
" covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr "大豆や穀物を煮て潰した生地を乾燥させ、更に麹菌を繁殖させた素材です。醤油の原料として使われます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "poppy bud"
msgid_plural "poppy buds"
msgstr[0] "ケシの蕾"

#. ~ Description of "poppy bud"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A poppy bud.  Contains some substances commonly produced by a mutated poppy "
"flower."
msgstr "変異したケシの蕾です。変異したケシの花と同じ成分が含まれています。"

#. ~ Description of "sunflower"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The top of a sunflower, with yellow petals and some seeds that have yet to "
"be eaten by animals."
msgstr "ヒマワリの花には、黄色い花弁と動物にまだ食べられていない種が残っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "chamomile flowers"
msgid_plural "chamomile flowers"
msgstr[0] "カモミールの花"

#. ~ Description of "chamomile flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"White chamomile flowers, used as a herbal remedy since the ancient times."
msgstr "白いカモミールの花です。古くから薬草として利用されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "lotus flower"
msgid_plural "lotus flowers"
msgstr[0] "スイレンの花"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "spurge flowers"
msgid_plural "spurge flowers"
msgstr[0] "スパージの花"

#. ~ Description of "spurge flowers"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A handful of yellow-green flowers.  Can be brewed into a tea that prevents "
"asthma attacks."
msgstr "黄緑色の花です。煎じると喘息発作の予防効果をもつ茶になります。"

#. ~ Estimated weight is between 1.5-2 lb. When withered, assuming 60% weight
#. loss, gives us around 300 g.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "withered bouquet"
msgid_plural "withered bouquet"
msgstr[0] "枯れた花束"

#. ~ Estimated weight is between 1.5-2 lb. When withered, assuming 60% weight
#. loss, gives us around 300 g.
#. ~ Description of "withered bouquet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A mixed collection of flowers.  Unfortunately, they have all withered with "
"time."
msgstr "様々な種類の花の束です。残念ながら、どれも時間が経って枯れています。"

#. ~ dog tags are roughly 50mm x 28mm x 0.4mm, or 0.56 ml, but that's so small
#. I needed to round up to 1 ml
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "dog tag"
msgid_plural "dog tag"
msgstr[0] "ドッグタグ"

#. ~ dog tags are roughly 50mm x 28mm x 0.4mm, or 0.56 ml, but that's so small
#. I needed to round up to 1 ml
#. ~ Description of "dog tag"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An oval disk attached to a chain, worn by military personnel for "
"identification."
msgstr "軍人が身分証明のために身に着ける、チェーンが付いた楕円形の金属板です。"

#. ~ dog tags are roughly 50mm x 28mm x 0.4mm, or 0.56 ml, but that's so small
#. I needed to round up to 1 ml
#. ~ Description of "dog tag"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An identification tag for a pet, engraved with their name and their owner's "
"address and phone number."
msgstr "ペットの名前と飼い主の住所、電話番号を刻印したタグです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "lump of clay"
msgid_plural "lumps of clay"
msgstr[0] "粘土"

#. ~ Description of "lump of clay"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fresh piece of clay.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "湿り気のある粘度の塊です。アイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "brick"
msgid_plural "bricks"
msgstr[0] "レンガ"

#. ~ Description of "brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A fire hardened building block used in masonry construction."
msgstr "堅く焼成された石工建築用のレンガです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "mortar"
msgid_plural "mortar"
msgstr[0] "モルタル"

#. ~ Description of "mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some mortar, ready to be used in building projects."
msgstr "いつでも建築に使えるよう調整されたモルタルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "lime mortar"
msgid_plural "lime mortar"
msgstr[0] "石灰モルタル"

#. ~ Description of "lime mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some lime mortar, made from quicklime and aggregate and ready for building."
msgstr "消石灰と骨材を練り混ぜて作った、建築用の石灰モルタルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "soft adobe brick"
msgid_plural "soft adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガ(未乾燥)"

#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, still too wet to build with.  "
"Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."
msgstr "土と天然繊維を混ぜて固めた資材です。まだ湿っていて建設には不向きです。台に乗せて乾かしましょう。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soft adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "You test the brick, and it seems solid enough to use."
msgstr "レンガを確認すると、十分に硬くなっているようです。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soft adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "The brick is still too damp to bear weight."
msgstr "レンガはまだ湿っており、耐久性が不十分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "adobe brick"
msgid_plural "adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガ"

#. ~ Description of "adobe brick"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, baked dry enough to harden into"
" a brick."
msgstr "土と天然繊維を混ぜて固めた資材です。乾燥しており、レンガとして利用するのに十分な硬度があります。"

