#. ~ Description of "pair of thermal electric socks"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a pair of socks with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use"
" it to turn it on."
msgstr "電池式の保温機構が組み込まれた靴下です。使用すると電源を入れます。"

