msgid_plural ".22 rat-shot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.22口径/ﾗｯﾄｼｮｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of ".22 rat-shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
"A .22 caliber cartridge loaded with very small pieces of shot contained "
"within a fragmenting plastic capsule.  It has an extremely short range and "
"poor penetration ability, but the spread of shot can hit targets with "
"greater ease."
msgstr ""
"内部に細かいプラスチックの粒が充填された、非常に小さな.22口径の散弾です。飛距離は短く貫通力も低いですが、粒が飛び散るため命中しやすいのが利点です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 LR FMJ, black powder"
msgid_plural ".22 LR FMJ, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.22口径/LR FMJ/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of ".22 LR FMJ, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 30gr FMJ bullet.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  This type is "
"marginally better at piercing through targets, but deals even less damage as"
" a result.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded this one "
"- it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  Expect lower "
"velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2.6gの.22口径ロングライフル・アンジャケッテッド弾です。威力は極めて弱く、射程距離も短く、無視できない程度の反動も生じます。貫通力は多少ありますが、その結果として与えられるダメージが更に低下してしまいます。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 LR, black powder"
msgid_plural ".22 LR, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.22口径/LR/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of ".22 LR, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is"
" extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful "
"for target practice and hunting small animals.  Someone was down on their "
"luck when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder "
"instead of smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a "
"dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2.6gの.22口径ロングライフル・アンジャケッテッド弾です。威力は極めて弱く、射程距離も短く、無視できない程度の反動も生じます。射撃の練習や小動物狩りに最適な弾薬です。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 LR, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".22 LR, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.22口径/LR/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of ".22 LR, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is"
" extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful "
"for target practice and hunting small animals.  This one has been hand-"
"reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to "
"slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2.6gの.22口径ロングライフル・アンジャケッテッド弾です。威力は極めて弱く、射程距離も短く、無視できない程度の反動も生じます。射撃の練習や小動物狩りに最適な弾薬です。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ".22 FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".22 FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.22口径/LR FMJ/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of ".22 FMJ, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 30gr FMJ bullet.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  This type is "
"marginally better at piercing through targets, but deals even less damage as"
" a result.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-"
"Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to "
"factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2.6gの.22口径ロングライフル・アンジャケッテッド弾です。威力は極めて弱く、射程距離も短く、無視できない程度の反動も生じます。貫通力は多少ありますが、その結果として与えられるダメージが更に低下してしまいます。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ".223 Remington"
msgid_plural ".223 Remington"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.223口径/ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of ".223 Remington"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
".223 Remington ammunition with a 55gr FMJ-BT bullet, patterned after the "
"M193 loading.  The .223 round has been very popular with civilian shooters "
"for almost a century, finding use in a wide variety of weapons.  The "
"combination of high velocity with a thinly-jacketed, cannelured projectile "
"led to unexpected yaw and fragmentation in soft tissue, increasing this "
"round's performance."
msgstr ""
"M193に対応する、後部が絞られた形状になっている弾頭重量約3.6gの.223口径レミントン・フルメタルジャケット弾です。.223口径弾は約一世紀にわたって民間の狩猟者に親しまれており、様々な銃器に使われてきました。この弾薬は、高速度での発射を目指した薄い被覆と薬莢圧入溝を組み合わせることで、予測できない飛行制御と軟部組織に命中した際の破片化を引き起こす性能の高さが生まれました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(5.56mm/NATO Mk262)"

#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition, loaded for precision from the Mk 12 SPR rifles, and "
"later used by other SF units looking for more effective loadings for their "
"M4A1 and Mk 18 carbines.  The Mk 262 Mod 1 is loaded with a 77 grain Open "
"Tip Match bullet, enhancing lethality even at longer ranges when compared to"
" older M855 loadings."
msgstr ""
"5.56x45mm弾はMk12 "
"SPRライフルの精度向上を目指して使われていましたが、その後M4A1やMk18カービン用のより効果的な弾薬を求めていた他の特殊部隊でも用いられるようになりました。Mk262"
" Mod1は弾頭重量約5gでオープンチップマッチ構造が採用されており、旧式のM855に比べて長距離射撃の殺傷力が向上しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid "5.56 NATO Mk318"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO Mk318"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(5.56mm/NATO Mk318)"

#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO Mk318"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition, developed due to SOF dissatisfaction with the M855 "
"cartridge.  The Mk318 Mod 1 is loaded with a 62 grain Open Tip Match Rear "
"Penetrator bullet, a copper slug enclosed inside an open-tipped brass "
"projectile, providing for consistent loading, enhanced lethality and "
"increased penetration.  When compared to M855, the Mk318 fragments "
"consistently, even out of short-barreled carbines."
msgstr ""
"特殊部隊のM855弾に対する不満から開発された5.56x45mm弾です。MK318 "
"Mod1は弾頭重量約4gでオープンチップマッチ・リアペネトレーター構造と呼ばれる銅製の芯を真鍮の発射体で覆う形状になっており、確実な装填に加え、殺傷力と貫通力が強化されています。M855と比較すると、Mk318は銃身の短いカービン銃で発射しても確実に破片化します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid "5.56 NATO M855"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO M855"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(5.56mm/NATO M855)"

#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO M855"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition with a 62gr FMJ bullet containing a steel penetrator.  "
"Originally designed for the M249 FN Minimi, M855 was designed to penetrate "
"steel helmets and light cover at range, sacrificing terminal performance and"
" accuracy in the process.  The limited yaw and fragmentation is worsened "
"with shorter-barreled carbines shooting this round, and optimization of "
"barrel twist for stabilization of the tracer variant of M855 has resulted in"
" lackluster accuracy overall."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約4gの、スチールの芯が入った5.56x45mmフルメタルジャケット弾です。元々M249 "
"FNミニミ用に設計されたM855は、スチール製のヘルメットやライトカバーを遠距離射撃で貫通できるように作ってあり、性能実現のために破壊力と精度が犠牲になっています。また、曳光仕様の弾薬の飛行を安定させるために銃のライフリングを最適化する必要が生じた結果、精度が全体的に低下することになりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid "5.56 NATO M855A1"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO M855A1"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(5.56mm/NATO M855A1)"

#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO M855A1"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"An updated loading of M855 5.56x45mm ammunition, featuring a 62 grain "
"projectile containing an exposed steel penetrator and copper slug.  Designed"
" as a mostly lead-free projectile, the opportunity was further taken to "
"improve upon M855's penetration and lethality characteristics through "
"penetrator design and increased pressure.  Its improved accuracy, "
"penetration and lethality over M855 are appreciated by users of shorter-"
"barreled AR variants."
msgstr ""
"スチールの芯と銅製の発射体が露出した、弾頭重量約4gの、M855 "
"5.56x45mm弾を改良した弾薬です。鉛をほぼ使わない弾薬として設計され、芯の設計と圧力の増加によってM855の貫通力と殺傷力を更に向上させることができました。M855に比べて精度と貫通力、殺傷力が向上しているため、銃身の短いアサルトライフルの使用者に好まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid "5.56 NATO tracer"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO tracer"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(5.56mm/NATO曳光弾)"

#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO tracer"
#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"An M856 tracer round.  Traditional practice is to load one tracer per every "
"four normal rounds to help keep the weapon they are fired from on target.  "
"They have the potential to ignite flammable surfaces at their point of "
"impact."
msgstr ""
"M856曳光弾は通常弾4発につき1発を装填し、標的を見失わないために発射するのが伝統的な利用法です。着弾時に可燃物を発火させる可能性があります。"

