msgstr ""
"鋼製の小さなダーツが詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。高いダメージに加え、拡散による近距離での精度が期待出来ます。容易に各種装甲を貫通します。"

#. ~ $30/shot thanks to tight regulation, one way or another.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "explosive slug"
msgid_plural "explosive slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾/炸裂)"

#. ~ $30/shot thanks to tight regulation, one way or another.
#. ~ Description of "explosive slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  "
"While an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical "
"applications are limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate "
"an explosive give it much less impact force compared to traditional "
"ammunition.  The relatively small size of the slug can only accommodate a "
"limited amount of explosives, resulting in a fairly underwelming explosion."
"  These traits make it a utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting "
"other explosive devices, rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""
"小規模の爆発を引き起こす、ショットガン用の弾薬です。特定の州では使用が禁止されています。ショットガンで爆弾を発射できると聞くと魅力的に思えますが、実用性はそれほどでもありません。爆薬を搭載したことで全体の質量が減ったことで従来の弾薬より威力が大幅に低下しており、更に、通常より小さい単発弾には少量の爆薬しか入らないため、結果的に爆発力もあまり期待できません。これらの特徴から、対人戦よりも障壁の破壊や他の爆発物への引火を目的として使う方が実用的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/金属片)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "ショットガン弾の薬莢に金属屑を適当に詰め込んだ散弾です。小ペレット弾よりは威力がありますが、精度はかなり劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/金属片/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill"
" zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン弾の薬莢に適当な金属屑と黒色火薬を詰め込んだ、弾薬自作の論理性を突き詰めた産物です。ゾンビを殺すならこれで十分ですが、銃への負荷も大きくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾)"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr "ライフルの射程距離をショットガンで実現するための、重金属スラッグ弾です。威力は絶大ですが、精度はかなり不正確です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "paper cartridge base"
msgid_plural "paper cartridge bases"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(紙製薬莢/ﾍﾞｰｽ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "birdshot paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "birdshot paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製薬莢(20ga/小ﾍﾟﾚｯﾄ弾)"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of birdshot.  Used mostly for hunting small game or fowl."
msgstr "量を調整した黒色火薬と同じ重量のペレットを内包した紙製薬莢です。小動物や鳥類の狩猟に使われます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "pyrotechnic paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "pyrotechnic paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製薬莢(20ga/火花)"

#. ~ Description of "pyrotechnic paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of flammable metals.  When fired, burning chunks of metal and "
"sparks will shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything in their path."
msgstr ""
"量を調整した黒色火薬と同じ重量の可燃性金属を内包した紙製薬莢です。発射すると金属が火花を散らして燃焼しながら飛び散り、射線上のものに引火します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "buckshot paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "buckshot paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製薬莢(20ga/散弾)"

#. ~ Description of "buckshot paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of 00 buckshot."
msgstr "量を調整した黒色火薬と同じ重量の散弾を内包した紙製薬莢です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ".62 paper cartridge"
msgid_plural ".62 paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製薬莢(20ga/単発弾)"

#. ~ Description of ".62 paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and a .605"
" inch lead ball."
msgstr "量を調整した黒色火薬と.605口径の鉛球を内包した紙製薬莢です。"

#. ~ Description of "signal flare"
#: data/json/items/ammo/signal_flare.json
msgid ""
"A heavy plastic cartridge made for use in flare guns.  It appears to be a "
"modified 12 gauge shotgun shell."
msgstr "信号銃用に作られた重い合成樹脂製のカートリッジです。これは12ゲージの散弾を改造した弾薬のようです。"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 21 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "sling-ready Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用火炎瓶"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 21 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in "
"a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, "
"use it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in "
"your inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、長い導火線が付いた可燃性液体入りの瓶です。投石杖がなくても導火線に点火して投擲することはできますが、当然ライターやマッチなどの点火装置は必要です。点火した状態で投げると着弾点に火が発生します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "点火する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "火炎瓶に火をつけました！"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 35 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用手榴弾"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 35 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse "
"for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without"
" a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、時限信管に改良を加えた軍用の破片手榴弾です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、その場合5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げましょう。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "Activate grenade"
msgstr "起動する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "You snap the retaining fuse on the grenade."
msgstr "手榴弾の時限信管を起動しました。"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用自作小型手榴弾"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without "
"a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"投石杖を使って飛ばせる、余った部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、その場合5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げましょう。"

