#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts, modified with a "
"retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw "
"this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade."
"  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it "
"would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、数秒後には爆発します。爆発する前に投げましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "oxyacetylene"
msgid_plural "oxyacetylene"
msgstr[0] "オキシアセチレン"

#. ~ Description of "oxyacetylene"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A highly explosive fuel mixture composed of equal parts oxygen and acetylene"
" gas."
msgstr "同量の酸素とアセチレンガスを混合した、爆発性の高い燃料です。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding rod"
msgid_plural "welding rods"
msgstr[0] "溶接棒"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Description of "welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3mm thick steel rod coated in a "
"special flux.  During the welding process, the hot metal of the electrode "
"fills the seam, jointing parts together while the flux protects the surface "
"of the seam from atmospheric gases and rapid cooling.  Required for arc "
"welding."
msgstr ""
"被覆アーク溶接棒、簡単に言えば特殊な被覆剤でコーティングされた直径3mmの鋼鉄製の棒です。溶接過程で熱された溶接棒が溶け出して溶接部と一体化し、空気や急冷による劣化から溶接部を保護します。アーク溶接作業に必要な工具です。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding rods"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム溶接棒"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2mm thick aluminum rod coated in "
"a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminum alloys."
msgstr ""
"被覆アーク溶接棒、簡単に言えば特殊な被覆材でコーティングされた直径3.2mmのアルミニウム製の棒です。アルミニウム合金のアーク溶接作業に必要な工具です。"

#. ~ 360 charges = 1kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding wire"
msgid_plural "welding wires"
msgstr[0] "溶接ワイヤー"

#. ~ 360 charges = 1kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Description of "welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.8mm steel wire for MAG welding."
msgstr "MAG溶接で用いる直径0.8mmの鋼鉄製のワイヤーです。"

#. ~ 360 charges = 0.5kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding wire"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding wires"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム溶接ワイヤー"

#. ~ 360 charges = 0.5kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.9mm aluminum wire for MIG welding."
msgstr "MIG溶接で用いる直径0.9mmのアルミニウム製のワイヤーです。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "brazing rod"
msgid_plural "brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "ろう付け棒"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Description of "brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 3.2mm flux-coated bronze rod, for brazing steel."
msgstr "鋼鉄のろう付けに用いる、融剤でコーティングされた直径3.2mmの青銅製の棒です。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウムろう付け棒"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of 3.2mm aluminum rod, for brazing aluminum alloys.  Also suitable "
"for TIG welding."
msgstr "アルミニウム合金のろう付けに用いる、直径3.2mmのアルミニウム製の棒です。 TIG溶接にも適しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "strange pressure"
msgid_plural "strange pressures"
msgstr[0] "奇妙な圧迫感"

#. ~ Description of "strange pressure"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "You feel a strange force pressing you inwards and inside-out."
msgstr "奇妙な圧力によって肉体の内と外が反転しそうな気分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "temporal distortion"
msgid_plural "temporal distortions"
msgstr[0] "時空の歪み"

#. ~ Description of "temporal distortion"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you."
msgstr "わずかな歪みが一時的に周囲に集まっているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "弾倉ポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr "ほぼあらゆるの種類の小型弾薬を収納できる小さなポーチです。ただし、ロケット弾は入りません。使用すると弾薬を収納します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "弾倉鞄"

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single "
"large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "腰に取り付ける布製の弾倉鞄です。取り出しやすい位置に大型の弾倉を1個収納しておけます。"

