msgstr "大型プレートポケット"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "US ballistic vest"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy ballistic vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "Pocket for a medium armor plate."
