#. ~ ESAPI Medium are 24.13cm x 31.75cm and 2.5cm thick
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ESAPI ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "ESAPI ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "防弾プレート(ESAPI)"

#. ~ ESAPI Medium are 24.13cm x 31.75cm and 2.5cm thick
#. ~ Description of "ESAPI ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A polygonal ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile, made of "
"ceramic.  Its inner surface is coated with UHMW polyethylene and is labeled "
"\"TOP\", while the outer surface is labeled \"STRIKE FACE\".  This is "
"intended to be worn in a ballistic vest, and can withstand several high-"
"energy rifle rounds before breaking."
msgstr ""
"わずかな凹凸がある多角形のセラミック製防弾プレートです。超高分子量ポリエチレンのコーティングが施された内側には「TOP」、外側には「STRIKE "
"FACE」と表記されたラベルが付いています。このプレートは防弾ベストに収納して使うように設計されており、高エネルギーライフル弾にも複数回耐える性能をもっています。"

#. ~ based on https://www.highcomarmor.com/product/trooper-hcspike3/
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "soft stab panel"
msgid_plural "soft stab panels"
msgstr[0] "軟質防刃プレート"

#. ~ based on https://www.highcomarmor.com/product/trooper-hcspike3/
#. ~ Description of "soft stab panel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A soft armor insert designed to protect against stab wounds.  While it's not"
" great protection, it incurs no additional encumbrance.  This is intended to"
" be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
msgstr ""
"刺突から肉体を守るための、挿入式軟質プレートです。保護性能は高くありませんが、動作制限がほぼ増加しません。防弾ベストに収納して使うことを想定しており、単体では着用できません。"

#. ~ based on 3a plates. Discuss high temp quenching so gonna assume tempered
#. steel
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "steel ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "steel ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "防弾プレート(鋼鉄)"

#. ~ based on 3a plates. Discuss high temp quenching so gonna assume tempered
#. steel
#. ~ Description of "steel ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A concave ballistic plate made of hard steel, designed to stop small-caliber"
" rounds.  \"NIJ III A PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  "
"This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on "
"its own."
msgstr ""
"小口径弾から肉体を守るための、スチール製の湾曲した硬質防弾プレートです。プレート裏面に「NIJ III A "
"PROTECTION」と刻まれています。防弾ベストに収納して使うことを想定しており、単体では着用できません。"

#. ~ based on level 3 plates. Discuss high temp quenching so gonna assume
#. tempered steel
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "heavy steel ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "heavy steel ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "防弾プレート(重鋼鉄)"

#. ~ based on level 3 plates. Discuss high temp quenching so gonna assume
#. tempered steel
#. ~ Description of "heavy steel ballistic plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy concave ballistic plate made of tempered steel, designed to stop "
"small-caliber rounds.  \"NIJ III PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the"
" plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be"
" worn on its own."
msgstr ""
"小口径弾から肉体を守るための、重量がある焼戻炭素鋼製の湾曲した防弾プレートです。プレート裏面に「NIJ III A "
"PROTECTION」と刻まれています。防弾ベストに収納して使うことを想定しており、単体では着用できません。"

#. ~ some crude metal chopped and bent to fit into a plate carrier. not great,
#. but better than nothing. added the cotton component cause i'd imagine a
#. jagged piece of metal would cut through a ballistic vest and this is based
#. on the existing scrap armor
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "scrap ESAPI plate"
msgid_plural "scrap ESAPI plates"
msgstr[0] "廃棄防弾プレート(ESAPI)"

#. ~ some crude metal chopped and bent to fit into a plate carrier. not great,
#. but better than nothing. added the cotton component cause i'd imagine a
#. jagged piece of metal would cut through a ballistic vest and this is based
#. on the existing scrap armor
#. ~ Description of "scrap ESAPI plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A flat piece of salvaged steel, crudely cut and bent into the shape of an "
"ESAPI ballistic plate.  It's wrapped in rags to cover the sharp edges.  "
"Better than nothing, but it's heavier than the real thing, and not very "
"strong.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be"
" worn on its own."
msgstr ""
"割れて折れ曲がった、防弾プレートと思しき平らな鋼鉄片です。鋭い縁を覆うように、ぼろ布で包んであります。防弾ベストに何も入れないよりはマシですが、通常のプレートより重く、強度もありません。防弾ベストに収納して使うことを想定しており、単体では着用できません。"

