msgid_plural "humanitarian ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(人道支援)"

#. ~ Description of variant "humanitarian ballistic vest" of item "hard armor
#. vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr ""
"大変動の最初の数日間、秩序が完全に崩壊するまでボランティア団体や人道支援団体が使っていた、鮮やかな青色をした薄手の防弾ベストです。正面と背面に「FEMA」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "police ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "police ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(警察)"

#. ~ Description of variant "police ballistic vest" of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers,"
" and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in "
"addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written "
"on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr ""
"警察官がよく着用していた、チャコールグレーの防弾ベストです。小口径の銃弾に対する十分な防御力がありますが、付属のポケットにプレートを収納することが可能です。正面と背面に「POLICE」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "National Guard ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "National Guard ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(州兵)"

#. ~ Description of variant "National Guard ballistic vest" of item "hard
#. armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Styled in urban camo, this ballistic vest was issued to soldiers, and as "
"things got worse, to volunteers as well.  It was designed to stand out after"
" the chaos of the riots; \"US ARMY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel next "
"to a patch of the United States flag, and \"NATIONAL GUARD\" is written "
"across the back."
msgstr ""
"兵士に加えて、事態が悪化した頃には志願兵にも支給された、都市迷彩柄の防弾ベストです。正面には星条旗と「US ARMY」の文字、背面には「NATIONAL"
" GUARD」の文字が表記されており、暴動の混乱の中でも目立つデザインになっています。"

#. ~ Based on a true story related to the real-world design
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "dragon skin vest"
msgid_plural "dragon skin vests"
msgstr[0] "ドラゴンスキンベスト"

#. ~ Based on a true story related to the real-world design
#. ~ Description of "dragon skin vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"This type of ballistic vest once promised to be the future of body armor, claiming to allow a greater range of movement than conventional ballistic vests as well as better protection.  Created by the now-defunct company Meridian Ballistics, it features a unique design consisting of overlapping ceramic disks, and was once famously demonstrated on TV absorbing high-energy rifle rounds at point blank.\n"
"\n"
"The US Army quickly snapped up several hundred units of the armor, but testing soon revealed that they were extremely heavy, weighing almost fifty pounds, and that the design failed spectacularly in environmental tests.  After a series of investigations, claims of fraud, and court hearings, Meridian went bankrupt, and the Department of Justice subsequently dropped this design from its certifications.\n"
"\n"
"There were no known users of these vests by the time that the world ended; this one was either an original production in the hands of a collector, or a similar design from a different company.  Whatever the case may be, you have one now, in all its unwieldy glory."
msgstr ""
"従来の防弾ベストよりも可動域が広く防御力も高いことから、次世代の防弾装備として期待されていた防具です。今は亡きMeridian Ballistics社が開発したこのベストは、セラミック製のディスクを重ねた独自のデザインが特徴であり、至近距離から発射された高威力のライフル弾を無効化する様子がテレビで放映されたこともありました。\n"
"\n"
"アメリカ陸軍はこの防具をすぐに数百単位購入しましたが、間もなくして重量が20kg以上あることが判明し、実地試験でも防具が役に立つことはありませんでした。その後、監査や不正の告発、裁判などが相次いだことでMeridian Ballistics社は倒産し、司法省はこの防具をNIJ規格から外しました。\n"
"\n"
"このベストはコレクターの手に渡ったオリジナル製品か、もしくは他社製の類似品でしょう。いずれにせよ、このベストはその扱い辛さ故にここまでたどり着いたのです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "pistol bandolier"
msgid_plural "pistol bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "拳銃弾ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "pistol bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping pistol cartridges close to "
"hand.  If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."
