"Armored foot protectors constructed from steel and Nomex for use by "
"explosive ordnance disposal technicians."
msgstr "爆発物処理担当者が着用する、鋼鉄とノーメックスで作られた装甲フットプロテクターです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of toecaps"
msgid_plural "pairs of toecaps"
msgstr[0] "トゥキャップ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of toecaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Rubbery overshoes that cover your toes with sturdy, OSHA compliant steel "
"toes."
msgstr "OSHA規格を満たす頑丈なスチールでつま先を覆った、ゴム製のオーバーシューズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of fur boots"
msgstr[0] "ファーブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of fur boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Boots lined with fur for warmth."
msgstr "毛皮製の暖かいブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XL fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XLファーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XS fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XSファーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of hiking boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of hiking boots"
msgstr[0] "ハイキングブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of hiking boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Tough yet light leather boots, intended for outdoor activity."
msgstr "野外活動での着用を想定した、丈夫で軽量なレザーブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of leather armor boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather armor boots"
msgstr[0] "レザーアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of leather armor boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Thick leather boots made specifically to protect the feet.  Light yet tough."
msgstr "厚い生地で足を保護する特別仕立てのレザーブーツです。軽量ですが作りは丈夫です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XL leather armor boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL leather armor boots"
msgstr[0] "XLレザーアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XS leather armor boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS leather armor boots"
msgstr[0] "XSレザーアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of armored boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of armored boots"
msgstr[0] "プレートアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of armored boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "An extremely heavy set of armor plated boots."
msgstr "非常に重いプレートアーマーブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XL armored boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL armored boots"
msgstr[0] "XLプレートアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XS armored boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS armored boots"
msgstr[0] "XSプレートアーマーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of rubber boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of rubber boots"
msgstr[0] "ゴム長靴"

#. ~ Description of "pair of rubber boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of rubber boots, often used while cleaning with caustic materials."
msgstr "ゴム製の長靴です。腐食性物質を取り扱う際によく使われます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of scrap boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of scrap boots"
msgstr[0] "スクラップブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of scrap boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Boots made of random metal scraps attached to simple cloth wraps.  They're "
"uncomfortable, but provide decent protection."
msgstr "布と適当な金属屑で作ったブーツです。履き心地は悪いですが、それなりの防御性能があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XL scrap boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL scrap boots"
msgstr[0] "XLスクラップブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XS scrap boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS scrap boots"
msgstr[0] "XSスクラップブーツ"

#. ~ The weight assumes two small sheets of about 20cm x 10cm and two small
#. sheets of about 30cm x 10 cm.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of sheet metal sabatons"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal sabatons"
msgstr[0] "板金サバトン"

#. ~ The weight assumes two small sheets of about 20cm x 10cm and two small
#. sheets of about 30cm x 10 cm.
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal sabatons"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Some sheets of metal hammered to fit over the top of your foot and around "
"your ankles, meant to be worn over boots.  They make walking a fair bit more"
" awkward, but they'll keep your toes from being stomped on."
msgstr "足の甲と足首周りにフィットする形状の、靴の上から着用する板金製の防具です。歩きにくくなりますが、つま先を踏まれても痛くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of case hardened sheet metal sabatons"
msgid_plural "pairs of case hardened sheet metal sabatons"
msgstr[0] "板金サバトン(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of case hardened sheet metal sabatons"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Sabatons made of sheet metal, case hardened to protect your feet if you drop"
" something heavy on them.  No relation to the band, aside from being very "
"metal."
msgstr ""
"防御力の高い焼入炭素鋼の板金で作ったサバトンです。着用していれば、重い荷物を落としても足を守れます。メタルであること以外、スウェーデンのバンドと関連性はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of steeltoed boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of steeltoed boots"
msgstr[0] "安全ブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of steeltoed boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Leather boots with a steel toe, intended for use by workers."
msgstr "作業員が着用することを想定した、つま先が鋼鉄製のレザーブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of steeltoed sneakers"
msgid_plural "pairs of steeltoed sneakers"
msgstr[0] "安全スニーカー"

#. ~ Description of "pair of steeltoed sneakers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A descendant of the classic steeltoed boot, this modern footwear has become "
"popular amongst working class people over the last couple of decades."
msgstr "スチール製のつま先をもつ古典的なブーツの後継となる、現代的なスニーカーです。ここ数十年で、労働者階級の人々の支持を集めるようになりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of western boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of western boots"
msgstr[0] "ウエスタンブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of western boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Stiff leather boots with intricate embroidery and one-inch heels.  They look"
" good, but these boots are made for walking, not running for your life.  "
"Each boot is large enough to conceal a small holdout pistol."
msgstr ""
"凝った刺繍が施された、約2.5cmのヒールがある硬いレザーブーツです。見た目は素敵ですが、走るのには適しません。左右のブーツ内には、小型のピストルを隠しておくのに十分なスペースがあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of winter boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of winter boots"
msgstr[0] "防寒ブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of winter boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Wool-lined boots designed for warmth."
msgstr "暖かさを保つためのウールの裏地が付いたブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XL winter boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL winter boots"
msgstr[0] "XL防寒ブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of XS winter boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS winter boots"
msgstr[0] "XS防寒ブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of cleats"
msgid_plural "pairs of cleats"
msgstr[0] "スパイクシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of cleats"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Sport shoes with hard undersides and studs on the bottom designed to dig "
"into grass."
msgstr "運動に適した靴です。硬い靴底にはスパイクが並んでおり、芝生に食い込んでグリップ力を高めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of golf shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of golf shoes"
msgstr[0] "ゴルフシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of golf shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Snug sport shoes with hard ridges on the bottom."
msgstr "靴底に硬い突起が並んでいる、履き心地のいい運動靴です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of wooden clogs"
msgid_plural "pairs of wooden clogs"
msgstr[0] "木靴"

#. ~ Description of "pair of wooden clogs"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Known as klompen in the Netherlands and sabots in France, these wooden shoes"
" have endured through the ages due to their simple design and durability."
msgstr "オランダではクロンペ、フランスではサボと呼ばれる木製の靴です。そのシンプルなデザインと耐久性で古くから愛用されています"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of clown shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of clown shoes"
msgstr[0] "道化師の靴"

#. ~ Description of "pair of clown shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Gigantic shoes fit for a clown.  Incredibly difficult to walk in."
msgstr "道化師に似合う巨大な靴です。着用した状態では歩行が困難です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of dance shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of dance shoes"
msgstr[0] "ダンスシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of dance shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Expensive black dance shoes with large heels."
msgstr "高級そうな黒いダンスシューズです。ヒールが大きめに作られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of dress shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of dress shoes"
msgstr[0] "ドレスシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of dress shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Fancy patent leather shoes.  Not designed for running."
msgstr "エナメル革のお洒落な靴です。ランニングシューズの代わりにはなりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of flip-flops"
msgid_plural "pairs of flip-flops"
msgstr[0] "サンダル"

#. ~ Description of "pair of flip-flops"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Simple sandals.  Somewhat difficult to run in."
msgstr "シンプルなサンダルです。これを着用して走るのはかなり難しそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of expensive flip-flops"
msgid_plural "pairs of expensive flip-flops"
msgstr[0] "高級サンダル"

#. ~ Description of "pair of expensive flip-flops"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "These are upmarket \"luxury\" flip-flops.  Very difficult to run in."
msgstr "高所得層向けの「高級」なサンダルです。これを着用して走るのはかなり難しそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of foot rags"
msgid_plural "pairs of foot rags"
msgstr[0] "フットラグ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of foot rags"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Rags tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot,"
" but still better than nothing."
msgstr "足に巻き付ける布切れです。裸足とほぼ変わりませんが、何も無いよりはマシでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of fur foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of fur foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "フットラップ(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of fur foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Fur pelts tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being "
"barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "足に巻き付ける毛皮の端切れです。裸足とほぼ変わりませんが、何も無いよりはマシでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of leather foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "フットラップ(革)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of leather foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Leather patches tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over "
"being barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "足に巻き付ける革の端切れです。裸足とほぼ変わりませんが、何も無いよりはマシでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of wool foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of wool foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "フットラップ(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of wool foot wraps"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Felt patches tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being "
"barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "足に巻き付けるフェルトの端切れです。裸足とほぼ変わりませんが、何も無いよりはマシでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of geta"
msgid_plural "pairs of geta"
msgstr[0] "下駄"

#. ~ Description of "pair of geta"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Simple wooden geta."
msgstr "シンプルな木製の下駄です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of heels"
msgstr[0] "ハイヒール"

#. ~ Description of "pair of heels"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of high heels.  Difficult to even walk in."
msgstr "高いヒールを備えた靴です。着用した状態では歩行すら困難です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of knee-high boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of knee-high boots"
msgstr[0] "ニーハイブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of knee-high boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Very long leather boots that cover the lower legs, they are cumbersome to "
"wear."
msgstr "下腿を覆う、履きにくそうな非常に長いレザーブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of motorcycle police boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of motorcycle police boots"
msgstr[0] "警官用バイクブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of motorcycle police boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Custom-made knee-high leather boots issued to motor officers.  Warm, durable"
" and quite tough."
msgstr "バイク警官に支給される、特注のニーハイレザーブーツです。暖かく耐久性があり、長持ちします。"

#. ~ weight is based on an average of between 1 and 2 lbs for various hiking
#. sandals IRL.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of leather sandals"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather sandals"
msgstr[0] "サンダル(革)"

#. ~ weight is based on an average of between 1 and 2 lbs for various hiking
#. sandals IRL.
#. ~ Description of "pair of leather sandals"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Sturdy leather hiking sandals with a heel strap.  Offers little in the way "
"of protection, but keeps you cool during warmer months."
msgstr "踵にストラップの付いた頑丈なハイキング用のサンダルです。防御面は頼りないですが、暑い季節を涼しく過ごせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of lowtop tennis shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of lowtop tennis shoes"
msgstr[0] "ロートップテニスシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of lowtop tennis shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Lightweight shoes made of cloth and rubber."
msgstr "布とゴムで作られた軽い靴です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of moccasins"
msgid_plural "pairs of moccasins"
msgstr[0] "モカシン"

#. ~ Description of "pair of moccasins"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Simple shoes made from animal pelts."
msgstr "動物の革で作られたシンプルな靴です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of motorcycle boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of motorcycle boots"
msgstr[0] "バイクブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of motorcycle boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of durable boots used by dirt bikers and motorcyclists."
msgstr "ダートバイクなどに乗る際に着用する、耐久性に優れたブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of rollerblades"
msgid_plural "pairs of rollerblades"
msgstr[0] "ローラーブレード"

#. ~ Description of "pair of rollerblades"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of inline skates.  Very fast on flat floors, but they make it hard to"
" move on rough terrain, take hits, or dodge effectively."
msgstr ""
"車輪が縦一列に並んだローラースケートです。平らな地形では非常に素早く動けますが、攻撃や効果的な回避が困難になり、悪路では上手く移動できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of rollerskates"
msgid_plural "pairs of rollerskates"
msgstr[0] "ローラースケート"

#. ~ Description of "pair of rollerskates"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned pair of leather rollerskates with steel frames.  While "
"quite fast on flat floors, they make it difficult to take hits or to move on"
" rough terrain."
msgstr "鋼のフレームが付いた昔懐かしい革製のローラースケートです。平らな床では非常に素早く移動できますが、攻撃や起伏の多い地形での移動は困難です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of birchbark shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of birchbark shoes"
msgstr[0] "シラカバ靴"

#. ~ Description of "pair of birchbark shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Simple shoes woven from strips of birch bark.  Not very comfortable, but "
"better than going barefoot."
msgstr "シラカバの樹皮を剥いで織ったシンプルな靴です。快適とは言えませんが、裸足よりはましでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of bowling shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of bowling shoes"
msgstr[0] "ボウリングシューズ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of bowling shoes"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of flat-soled shoes designed to give you a grip on slippery surfaces."
msgstr "平底の靴です。滑りやすい床でもグリップが効くように作られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of slippers"
msgid_plural "pairs of slippers"
msgstr[0] "スリッパ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of slippers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Soft shoes that keep your feet warm.  Not suitable for running."
msgstr "暖かく柔らかな靴です。走り辛そうなデザインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of sneakers"
msgid_plural "pairs of sneakers"
msgstr[0] "スニーカー"

#. ~ Description of "pair of sneakers"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Guaranteed to make you run faster and jump higher!"
msgstr "より速く走り、より高く跳べる事を保障します！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of straw sandals"
msgid_plural "pairs of straw sandals"
msgstr[0] "サンダル(藁)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of straw sandals"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Sandals made from straw rope.  Not very comfortable, but can keep your feet "
"safe."
msgstr "藁を編んで作ったサンダルです。快適とは言えませんが、足を保護できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of swim fins"
msgid_plural "pairs of swim fins"
msgstr[0] "フィン"

#. ~ Description of "pair of swim fins"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of rubber flippers worn on the feet, which improve swimming speed "
"while greatly impeding the wearer's ability to walk."
msgstr "ゴム製の足ヒレです。歩行が困難になりますが、泳ぎは速くなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of thigh-high boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of thigh-high boots"
msgstr[0] "サイハイブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of thigh-high boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Very long leather boots that reach past the knees, they are cumbersome to "
"wear."
msgstr "膝上までを覆う、履きにくそうな非常に長いレザーブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of heelys (off)"
msgid_plural "pairs of heelys (off)"
msgstr[0] "ローラーシューズ(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of sneakers with integrated wheels.  Currently the wheels are "
"retracted, making these essentially normal lace-up athletic shoes."
msgstr "ホイールが付いたスニーカーです。現在ホイールは収納されており、運動に適した通常の紐靴と同じように扱えます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "Extend wheels"
msgstr "ローラーを展開する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of heelys (off)"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "You pop the wheels out."
msgstr "ホイールを展開しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of heelys (on)"
