#. ~ Description of "pair of XL wool socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Warm socks made of wool for a human larger than previously thought possible."
msgstr "今までの想定よりも更に巨大な人間のための、ウール製の暖かい靴下です。"

#. ~ Item name
