#. ~ Description of "pair of stockings"
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Long cotton socks that reach above the knees to help protect from the cold."
msgstr "長さが膝上まで達する綿製の靴下です。寒さを防ぎます。"

#. ~ Item name
