#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "American flag"
msgid_plural "American flags"
msgstr[0] "アメリカ国旗"

#. ~ Description of "American flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large American flag, made to fly in even the worst conditions."
msgstr "悪天候でも旗が翻るように作られた、大きなアメリカ国旗です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "pride flag"
msgid_plural "pride flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ"

#. ~ Description of "pride flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community"
" and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender."
msgstr "LGBTコミュニティの多様性や人間のセクシャリティとジェンダーを象徴する、大きな虹色の旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "progress pride flag"
msgid_plural "progress pride flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾌﾟﾛｸﾞﾚｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "progress pride flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large rainbow flag, The colors reflect the diversity of the LGBT community"
" and the spectrum of human sexuality and gender.  On the left side you can "
"see a chevron that features black, brown, light blue, pink, and white "
"stripes to bring those communities to the forefront; \"the arrow points to "
"the right to show forward movement, while being along the left edge shows "
"that progress still needs to be made\"."
msgstr ""
"LGBTコミュニティの多様性や人間のセクシャアリティとジェンダーを象徴する、大きな虹色の旗です。旗の左側には、黒色、茶色、水色、ピンク色、白色の縞模様になったV字形が付いています。右向きのV字形は前進を、左側に付いているのは未だ道半ばであることを表しており、このコミュニティの信条を特徴づけています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "agender flag"
msgid_plural "agender flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(Aｼﾞｪﾝﾀﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green grey and black agender flag.  The black and white stripes "
"represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-genderless,"
" and green represents non-binary gender."
msgstr "緑色と灰色と黒色からなる、Aジェンダーを象徴する大きな旗です。黒色と白色は無性、灰色は半無性、緑色は二元的ではない性別を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "bisexual flag"
msgid_plural "bisexual flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾊﾞｲｾｸｼｬﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bisexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink and blue bisexual flag.  The pink stripe represents "
"homosexuality, while the blue stripe represents heterosexuality.  The purple"
" stripe, the \"overlap\" of the blue and pink stripes, purple represents "
"attraction regardless of sex or gender a.k.a bisexuality."
msgstr ""
"ピンク色と青色からなる、バイセクシャルを象徴する大きな旗です。ピンク色は同性愛、青色は異性愛、そして青色とピンク色を重ね合わせた部分に生じる紫色は性別を問わない愛、すなわちバイセクシャルを表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "pansexual flag"
msgid_plural "pansexual flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾊﾟﾝｾｸｼｬﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "pansexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink, blue and yellow pansexual flag.  The pan-pride flag uses pink "
"for people on the female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and"
" yellow for non-binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr ""
"ピンク色、青色、黄色からなる、パンセクシャルを象徴する大きな旗です。ピンク色は女性的な傾向をもつ人、青色は男性的な傾向をもつ人、黄色はノンバイナリージェンダーやジェンダークィアの人を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "labrys lesbian flag"
msgid_plural "labrys lesbian flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾗﾌﾞﾘｭｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "labrys lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black and purple labrys lesbian flag.  On the flag you can see a "
"labrys, a type of double-headed axe, superimposed on a downward-pointing "
"black triangle, set against a violet background."
msgstr ""
"黒色と紫色のデザインに両刃斧が描かれた、レズビアンを象徴する大きな旗です。紫地に黒い逆三角形が描かれ、その上に両刃斧の一種であるラブリュスが重なっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "lesbian flag"
msgid_plural "lesbian flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾚｽﾞﾋﾞｱﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "lesbian flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large pink, white and orange lesbian flag.  The dark orange representing "
"\"gender non-conformity\", orange for \"independence\", light orange for "
"\"community\", white for \"unique relationships to womanhood\", pink for "
"\"serenity and peace\", dusty pink for \"love and sex\", and dark rose for "
"\"femininity\"."
msgstr ""
"ピンク色、白色、オレンジ色からなる、レズビアンを象徴する大きな旗です。三種のオレンジ色は「性の不一致」、「自立」、「共同体」を、白色は「女性としての独自の関係性」、三種のピンク色は「平穏と平和」、「愛と性」、「女性らしさ」を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "asexual flag"
msgid_plural "asexual flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(Aｾｸｼｬﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "asexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large purple, white, grey and black asexual flag.  Black for asexuality "
"(feeling no sexual attraction), grey for grey-asexuality and demisexuality "
"(feeling sexual attraction only sometimes), white for non-asexual partners "
"and allies, and purple for community."
msgstr ""
"紫色、白色、灰色、黒色からなる、Aセクシャルを象徴する大きな旗です。黒色はAセクシャル(性的魅力を感じない)、灰色はグレーAセクシャルやデミセクシャル(性的魅力を感じることもある)、白色はAセクシャルではないパートナーや賛同者、紫色は共同体を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "aromantic flag"
msgid_plural "aromantic flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(Aﾛﾏﾝﾃｨｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "aromantic flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black, grey, white and green aromantic flag.  The green and light "
"green stripes cover everyone under the aromantic spectrum, while represents "
"nonromantic forms of love and attraction, and the gray and black represent "
"all sexualities under the aromantic spectrum."
msgstr ""
"黒色、灰色、白色、緑色からなる、Aロマンティックを象徴する大きな旗です。二種の緑色はAロマンティック傾向にある人や恋愛を伴わない愛と魅力、灰色と黒色はAロマンティック傾向にあるあらゆるセクシャリティを表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "transgender flag"
msgid_plural "transgender flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾄﾗﾝｽｼﾞｪﾝﾀﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "transgender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white, pink, and blue transgender flag.  The stripes at the top and "
"bottom are light blue, the traditional color for baby boys.  The stripes "
"next to them are pink, the traditional color for baby girls.  The white "
"stripe is for people that are nonbinary, feel that they don't have a gender."
"  The pattern is such that no matter which way you fly it, it is always "
"correct, signifying finding correctness in one's life."
msgstr ""
"白色、ピンク色、水色からなる、トランスジェンダーを象徴する大きな旗です。水色とピンク色はそれぞれ伝統的な男女の赤ちゃん向けの色、白色は性別がないと感じているノンバイナリーの人を表しています。自らの人生に正しさを見出す方法を示すため、この旗はどの方向を上にして掲げても問題ないとされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "genderqueer flag"
msgid_plural "genderqueer flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ｼﾞｪﾝﾀﾞｰｸｨｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "genderqueer flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green, white, and purple genderqueer flag.  Lavender, a mixture of "
"blue and pink to represent androgynes and androgyny, white to represent "
"agender identity, and green, the inverse of lavender, to represent all those"
" who fall outside of the gender binary."
msgstr ""
"緑色、白色、紫色からなる、ジェンダークィアを象徴する大きな旗です。青色とピンク色を混ぜた紫色は中性と両性、白色はAジェンダーのアイデンティティ、紫色の補色である緑色は性別二元論に属さない全ての人を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "intersex flag"
msgid_plural "intersex flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(インターセックス)"

#. ~ Description of variant "intersex flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large yellow, and purple intersex flag.  It displays a purple circle on a "
"yellow field.  Yellow and purple were chosen as colours as they were viewed "
"as free from gender associations and were historically used to represent "
"intersex people.  The circle is described as \"unbroken and unornamented, "
"symbolizing wholeness and completeness, and our potentialities\"."
msgstr ""
"黄色と紫色からなる、インターセックスを象徴する大きな旗です。黄色地に紫色で円が描かれています。黄色と紫色はじぇんだーを連想させない色として、古くからインターセックスの人々を表現するために使われてきました。円は「切れ目がなく飾らない全体性と完全性、そして可能性」を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "genderfluid flag"
msgid_plural "genderfluid flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ｼﾞｪﾝﾀﾞｰﾌﾙｲﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "genderfluid flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue, black, purple, white and pink genderfluid flag.  The "
"genderfluid flag has a pink stripe for femininity, a blue stripe for "
"masculinity, a purple stripe for both masculinity and femininity, a black "
"stripe for lack of gender, and a white stripe for all genders."
msgstr ""
"青色、黒色、紫色、白色、ピンク色からなる、ジェンダーフルイドを象徴する大きな旗です。ピンク色は女性らしさ、青色は男性らしさ、紫色は両性、黒色は無性、白色は全ての性を表しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large green, white, grey and black agender flag.  The black and white "
"stripes represent complete absence of gender, grey represents being semi-"
"genderless, and green represents non-binary gender.  The symmetry of the "
"pattern makes it so that it's correct no matter how it flies."
msgstr ""
"緑色と白色と灰色と黒色からなる、Aジェンダーを象徴する大きな旗です。黒色と白色は無性、灰色は半無性、緑色は二元的ではない性別を表しています。縞模様が上下対称なため、どちらを上に掲げても正しいとされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "non-binary flag"
msgid_plural "non-binary flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾉﾝﾊﾞｲﾅﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "non-binary flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black, purple, white, and yellow non-binary flag.  Yellow for those "
"whose gender exists outside of and without reference to the binary, white "
"for those who have many or all genders, purple for those who feel their "
"gender is between or a mix of female and male, and black for those who feel "
"they are without gender."
msgstr ""
"黒色、紫色、白色、黄色からなる、ノンバイナリーを象徴する大きな旗です。黄色は二元論に属さない性別をもつ人、白色は多様な性、紫色は性自認が女性と男性の中間、あるいは混合であると感じる人、黒は性別がないと感じる人を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "polysexual flag"
msgid_plural "polysexual flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾎﾟﾘｾｸｼｬﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "polysexual flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue, green, and pink polysexual flag.  Pink for people on the "
"female-spectrum, blue for people on the male-spectrum, and green for non-"
"binary or genderqueer people."
msgstr ""
"青色、緑色、ピンク色からなる、ポリセクシャルを象徴する大きな旗です。ピンク色は女性的な傾向をもつ人、青色は男性的な傾向をもつ人、緑色はノンバイナリージェンダーやジェンダークィアの人を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "leather flag"
msgid_plural "leather flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾚｻﾞｰﾌｪﾁ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "leather flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black and blue leather flag.  A horizontally striped black and blue "
"flag with a white band in the middle and red heart in a corner.  The black "
"represents leather; the blue represents devotion, loyalty, and community; "
"the white represents purity and innocence; and the red heart represents love"
" for the community."
msgstr ""
"黒色と青色からなる、レザーフェティシズムを象徴する大きな旗です。黒色と青色の縞模様の中央に白い帯が入っており、左上に赤いハートマークが描かれています。黒色は革、青色は献身と忠誠と共同体、白色は純潔と無垢、赤いハートは共同体への愛を表しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "bear flag"
msgid_plural "bear flags"
msgstr[0] "プライドフラッグ(ﾍﾞｱｺﾐｭﾆﾃｨ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bear flag" of item "pride flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large black and orange international bear brotherhood flag.  The flag "
"displays seven horizontal stripes of colors ranging from black to brown "
"representing the colours of different bear species, you can see a black bear"
" paw in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""
"黒色とオレンジ色からなる、国際的なゲイコミュニティを象徴する大きな旗です。黒色から明るい茶色まで七色のグラデーションで描かれた横縞は、様々なクマの体毛を表しています。旗の右上には、ツキノワグマの手形がデザインされています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "state flag"
msgid_plural "state flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗"

#. ~ Description of "state flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "Massachusetts flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag with a shield featuring an American Native and a star "
"which represents the state of Massachusetts."
msgstr "白色の大きな旗です。ネイティブアメリカンの姿とマサチューセッツ州を表す星が盾に描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Massachusetts flag"
msgid_plural "Massachusetts flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(マサチューセッツ州)"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Maine flag"
msgid_plural "Maine flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(メイン州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maine flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a moose and pine tree emblem on a shield "
"supported by a farmer and a sailor, above is the north star and the Latin "
"motto “Dirigo” (“I direct”), below the shield reads out the state of "
"“Maine”."
msgstr ""
"青色の大きな旗です。ヘラジカと松が描かれた盾形の紋章を農夫と船乗りが支えており、上部には北極星とラテン語の標語「Dirigo(先頭に立つ者)」が載っており、下部には「MAINE」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "New Hampshire flag"
msgid_plural "New Hampshire flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(ニューハンプシャー州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "New Hampshire flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag with New Hampshire's state seal of the frigate Raleigh "
"surrounded by laurel leaves and nine stars against a field of blue."
msgstr "青色の大きな旗です。月桂樹の葉と9つの星に囲まれたフリゲート艦「ローリー」が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Vermont flag"
msgid_plural "Vermont flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(バーモント州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vermont flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a shield with wreaths on both sides, a pine tree"
" in a green field along with a cow and bales of wheat reside within the "
"shield representing Vermont."
msgstr "青色の大きな旗です。左右を植物で彩られた盾の中に、草原と松の木、ウシ、麦束が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Connecticut flag"
msgid_plural "Connecticut flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(コネチカット州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Connecticut flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a white baroque shield with three grapevines, "
"each bearing three bunches of purple grapes on a field of royal blue, below "
"the shield reads “Qui Transtulit Sustinet”, which is Latin for “He who "
"transplanted sustains” which represents the state of Connecticut."
msgstr ""
"青色の大きな旗です。ロイヤルブルーの背景に白いバロック風の盾が配され、その中に紫色の果実を3房ずつ実らせたブドウの木が描かれています。下部にはラテン語「Qui"
" Transtulit Sustinet(移住した者が維持する)」という標語が書かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Rhode Island flag"
msgid_plural "Rhode Island flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(ロードアイランド州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Rhode Island flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag of Rhode Island that features a golden anchor in the "
"middle of it surrounded by thirteen gold stars, below the anchor is a blue "
"banner that reads “hope”."
msgstr ""
"白色の大きな旗です。中央に金色の錨、その周囲に13個の金色の星が描かれています。錨の下には「HOPE」と書かれた青色のリボンが配されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Foodperson's cape"
msgid_plural "Foodperson's capes"
msgstr[0] "フードパーソンマント"

#. ~ Description of "Foodperson's cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A brightly-colored cape emblazoned with the \"Fp\" symbol."
msgstr "「Fp」のシンボルが描かれた色鮮やかなマントです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "grass cloak"
msgid_plural "grass cloaks"
msgstr[0] "草編み外套"

#. ~ Description of "grass cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A primitive cloak.  Ötzi wore one, too."
msgstr "原始的な外套です。氷河から見つかったミイラもこれに似た服を着ていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "cloak"
msgid_plural "cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套"

#. ~ Description of "cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "sinister cloak (black)"
msgid_plural "sinister cloaks (black)"
msgstr[0] "邪悪な外套(黒)"

#. ~ Description of "sinister cloak (black)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A sinister-looking hooded cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The "
"black side is currently facing outwards.  Use it to reverse it and show the "
"red side."
msgstr "羽織って身に着ける、不吉な雰囲気が漂うフード付き外套です。外側は黒色、内側は赤色の布地です。使用すると布地を裏返します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sinister cloak (black)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Reverse the colors"
msgstr "裏返す"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sinister cloak (black)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your cloak is now bathed in blood."
msgstr "外套が血の色に染まりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "sinister cloak (red)"
msgid_plural "sinister cloaks (red)"
msgstr[0] "邪悪な外套(赤)"

#. ~ Description of "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A sinister-looking hooded cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The red "
"side is currently facing outwards.  Use it to reverse it and show the black "
"side."
msgstr "羽織って身に着ける、不吉な雰囲気が漂うフード付き外套です。外側は赤色、内側は黒色の布地です。使用すると布地を裏返します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your cloak is now one with the night."
msgstr "外套が宵闇の色に染まりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "dark cloak"
msgid_plural "dark cloaks"
msgstr[0] "闇の外套"

#. ~ Description of "dark cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A black cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  Commonly used by witches "
"and other creatures of the night."
msgstr "魔女などの夜の住人が羽織って身に着ける黒い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "fur cloak"
msgid_plural "fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す毛皮製の分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "leather cloak"
msgid_plural "leather cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy leather cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す革製の分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool cloak"
msgid_plural "wool cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description of "wool cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す羊毛製の分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Jedi cloak"
msgid_plural "Jedi cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套(ジェダイ)"

#. ~ Description of "Jedi cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A long, flowing robe.  Be sure to tear it off dramatically before fighting "
"any foes!"
msgstr "ゆったりと垂れた長いローブです。敵と戦う前に、必ずドラマチックに脱ぎ捨てましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩外套"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a "
"unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr ""
"カメラとLEDが埋め込まれたプラスチック製の外套です。充電された状態で着用し、起動することで通常の視界から完全に姿を消します。使用するにはUPSまたはUPS互換の統合電源が必要です。使用することで起動します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your optical cloak flickers as it becomes transparent."
msgstr "光学迷彩外套が明滅し、姿が見えなくなりました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
#, c-format
msgid "You don't have enough UPS charges to turn on the %s"
msgstr "%sの電源を入れるのに十分なUPSの電力がありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks (on)"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩外套(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  It is turned on, and "
"continually draining power from a UPS.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"カメラとLEDが埋め込まれたプラスチック製の外套です。電源が入っており、通常の視界から完全に姿を消しています。UPSの電力を消費し続けており、使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flickers for a moment as it becomes opaque."
msgstr "%sが明滅して姿を現しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool poncho"
msgid_plural "wool ponchos"
msgstr[0] "ポンチョ(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description of "wool poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple wool garment worn over the torso."
msgstr "胴を覆うシンプルなウールの衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "makeshift poncho"
msgid_plural "makeshift ponchos"
msgstr[0] "簡易ポンチョ"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large plastic trash bag with holes cut out for the head and arms."
msgstr "頭と腕を入れる穴が開いた、大きなビニール袋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "snuggie"
msgid_plural "snuggies"
msgstr[0] "袖付きブランケット"

#. ~ Description of "snuggie"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Perfect for reading all those books you scavenged."
msgstr "拾ってきた本を読み耽るのに最適な衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "turnout coat"
msgid_plural "turnout coats"
msgstr[0] "消防士コート"

#. ~ Description of "turnout coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters, highly resistant to heat and "
"flame."
msgstr "熱や炎に対する耐性が高い、消防士が着用する重厚な防護服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "cassock"
msgid_plural "cassocks"
msgstr[0] "カソック"

#. ~ Description of "cassock"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "キリスト教の神父が普段着用している立襟の祭服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur coat"
msgid_plural "fur coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr "2つの小さなポケットが付いた毛皮製のコートです。非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XLファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS fur coat"
msgid_plural "XS fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XSファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "フェイクファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr "小さなポケットが複数ある、派手な色のフェイクファーコートです。天然の毛皮ほどは暖かくありませんが、個性的なおしゃれを楽しめます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XLフェイクファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "XS faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XSフェイクファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "コート(黒貂)"

#. ~ Description of "sable coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A very well-made fur coat, featuring thick panels of sable fur.  Very warm "
"and very good-looking."
msgstr "非常に上質な毛皮のコートで、厚手の黒貂皮を使用している点が特徴です。とても暖かく、実にお洒落です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "白衣"

#. ~ Description of "lab coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr "複数の大きなポケットが付いた白いロングコートです。とても素敵な胸ポケット用カバーが付属しています"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "レインコート"

#. ~ Description of "rain coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A plastic coat with a hood and two very large pockets, meant to provide "
"protection from rain."
msgstr "フードと2つの大きなポケットが付いた、身体を雨から保護するビニール製のコートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rain poncho"
msgid_plural "rain ponchos"
msgstr[0] "レインポンチョ"

#. ~ Description of "rain poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight plastic rain poncho with a hood.  It folds into a very compact"
" form when not in use."
msgstr "軽量プラスチック製のフード付き雨除けポンチョです。使わないときは小さく折り畳んでおけます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "straw cape"
msgid_plural "straw capes"
msgstr[0] "蓑"

#. ~ Description of "straw cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A bulky traditional Japanese raincoat made from straw, which covers the "
"entire body.  Also known as mino."
msgstr "藁で作られた、分厚いレインコートです。日本の伝統的な雨具であり、全身を覆います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "腸製衣"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin parka"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproof qualities among the indigenous peoples of the "
"arctic."
msgstr "北極圏の先住民族が着用する、洗浄した動物の腸を縫い合わせて作ったコートです。軽量性と防水性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "防寒コート"

#. ~ Description of "winter coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "深いポケットとフードが付いたパッド入りのコートです。非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート"

#. ~ Description of "duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "全身を覆う丈夫なダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の毛皮で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XLダスターコート(毛皮)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS fur duster"
msgid_plural "XS fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XSダスターコート(毛皮)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL duster"
msgid_plural "XL dusters"
msgstr[0] "XLダスターコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS duster"
msgid_plural "XS dusters"
msgstr[0] "XSダスターコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr "厚手のフェイクファーで作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用に複数のポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XLダスターコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "XS faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XSダスターコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の革で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XL leather duster"
msgid_plural "XL leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "XLダスターコート(革)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "XS leather duster"
msgid_plural "XS leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "XSダスターコート(革)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "グレートコート"

#. ~ Description of "greatcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "深いポケットが付いた、羊毛製の重い全身コートです。嵩張りますが、寒さをしのげます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakamas"
msgstr[0] "袴"

#. ~ Description of "hakama"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr "剣道や武道などに使用される無地の黒い袴です。"

#. ~ Description of "hakama"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "着物と併せて着用する、折りひだのあるゆったりとした衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "バスローブ"

#. ~ Description of "bathrobe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr ""
"風呂場へ出入りする際裸を見せないように古くから着用されてきた、吸水性の高いタオルのような素材で作られた衣服です。入浴できるだけの綺麗な水があれば良かったのですが。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A vintage army jacket, or at least a copy of one, with lots of pockets.  "
"Favored by the military."
msgstr "ポケットがたくさん付いているヴィンテージ物の軍用ジャケット、あるいはそのコピー品です。軍隊で愛用されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "combat blouse"
msgid_plural "combat blouses"
msgstr[0] "軍用トップス"

#. ~ Description of "combat blouse"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A sleek blouse in a camouflage pattern with angled breast pockets and lots "
"of loop velcro for affixing patches.  You might call it a jacket but it's "
"really a blouse.  It has a pocket for your pen!"
msgstr ""
"斜めに縫い付けられたポケットと、ワッペンを貼るためにあちこちに付いたマジックテープ素材が特徴的な、迷彩柄のなめらかなトップスです。ジャケットという呼び方もありますが、正式名称はブラウスです。ペンを入れるポケットも付いていますよ！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート"

#. ~ Description of "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A double-breasted uniform to protect against the heat of the kitchen."
msgstr "調理場の熱から肉体を保護する、ダブル仕立ての制服です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "white chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "white chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(白)"

#. ~ Description of variant "white chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "It's colored white, the most common color for chef's jackets."
msgstr "シェフコートとして代表的な白色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "black chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "black chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(黒)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "black long waist apron" of item "long waist
#. apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "black short waist apron" of item "short waist
#. apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "black cotton apron" of item "cotton apron"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black, commonly used by chefs working in the night or who just "
"want to look cool."
msgstr "夜勤の料理人や格好つけたい人がよく着用している、黒色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "blue chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "blue chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(青)"

#. ~ Description of variant "blue chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "blue toque" of item "toque"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "It's a royal blue color."
msgstr "このコートはロイヤルブルーのデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "red chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "red chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(赤)"

#. ~ Description of variant "red chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "red toque" of item "toque"
#. ~ Description of variant "red bikini bottom" of item "bikini bottom"
#. ~ Description of variant "red bikini top" of item "bikini top"
#. ~ Description of variant "red swimsuit" of item "swimsuit"
#. ~ Description of variant "red rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard shirt"
#. ~ Description of variant "red long waist apron" of item "long waist apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "red short waist apron" of item "short waist
#. apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "red cotton apron" of item "cotton apron"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "It's colored red."
msgstr "これは赤色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "pink chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "pink chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(桃)"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "It's colored pink, commonly used by women chefs or men who like pink."
msgstr "女性シェフやこの色が好きな男性シェフがよく着用している、ピンク色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "yellow chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "yellow chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(黄)"

#. ~ Description of variant "yellow chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "yellow toque" of item "toque"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "It's colored yellow."
msgstr "これは黄色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Variant name of item "toque"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "camo chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "camo chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "camo chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"It has a camouflage pattern, perfect for chefs that want to hide in the "
"wild."
msgstr "自然に紛れたい料理人に最適な、迷彩柄のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "skull chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "skull chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(骸骨)"

#. ~ Description of variant "skull chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"It's colored white, and the front and back are printed with a giant skull "
"between crossed kitchen knives.  Perfect for the apocalyptic chef."
msgstr "正面と背面に巨大な頭蓋骨と交差した包丁が描かれている、崩壊した世界の料理人にぴったりの白を基調としたデザインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "emergency jacket"
msgid_plural "emergency jackets"
msgstr[0] "非常用ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "emergency jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A bright, cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  One size,"
" fits none.  Helps keep you unfrozen & visible for rescuers."
msgstr ""
"FEMAが支給していた、フード付きの色鮮やかで安っぽいウインドブレーカーです。ワンサイズ品ですが、フィットする人は少ないようです。防寒性があり、救助されやすいように視認性が高くなっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "flannel jacket"
msgid_plural "flannel jackets"
msgstr[0] "フランネルジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "flannel jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from flannel-style denim, favored by outdoorsy types."
msgstr "アウトドア派に人気の、デニム調フランネル生地を使ったジャケットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "jean jacket"
msgid_plural "jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "デニムジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from denim."
msgstr "デニム生地のジャケットです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from denim.  This one is haphazardly covered with patches "
"featuring metal band logos."
msgstr "デニム生地のジャケットです。メタルバンドのロゴをあしらったワッペンが無造作に貼ってあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ninja jacket"
msgid_plural "ninja jackets"
msgstr[0] "ニンジャジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "ninja jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This is a wrap over black jacket.  Commonly used by stealthy individuals "
"hiding in the dark of the night.  It includes a pair of cotton gauntlets and"
" a sash."
msgstr "夜の闇に紛れて行動する際に使う、羽織って身に着ける黒いジャケットです。綿製のガントレットと帯が付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather jacket"
msgid_plural "leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "レザージャケット"

#. ~ Description of "leather jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from thick leather.  Offers more protection than your average "
"jacket."
msgstr "一般的なジャケットよりも保護性能が高い、厚手のレザージャケットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "red leather jacket"
msgid_plural "red leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "レザージャケット(赤)"

#. ~ Description of "red leather jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A candy-apple-red leather jacket with black strips and shoulder protrusions."
"  It has a number of zippers and snaps in the front."
msgstr "黒いラインと肩部の隆起が特徴的な、キャンディアップルレッドのレザージャケットです。複数のジッパーと留め具が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "light jacket"
msgid_plural "light jackets"
msgstr[0] "ライトジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "light jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thin cotton jacket with a hood.  Good for brisk weather."
msgstr "綿製のフードが付いた薄いジャケットです。爽快な天気の日に羽織りたい一品です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "windbreaker"
msgid_plural "windbreakers"
msgstr[0] "ウィンドブレーカー"

#. ~ Description of "windbreaker"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr "フードが付いた合成繊維製の軽量なジャケットです。非常に暖かいという訳ではないですが、雨を防いでくれます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "judo gi"
msgid_plural "judo gis"
msgstr[0] "柔道着"

#. ~ Description of "judo gi"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain white judo gi."
msgstr "真っ白な柔道着です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "karate gi"
msgid_plural "karate gis"
msgstr[0] "空手着"

#. ~ Description of "karate gi"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain white karate gi.  Made from loose and flowing cotton."
msgstr "真っ白な空手着です。ゆったりと垂れる綿素材を使っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kariginu"
msgid_plural "kariginus"
msgstr[0] "狩衣"

#. ~ Description of "kariginu"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Shinto robe with several layers and very wide "
"sleeves."
msgstr "神道で用いられる伝統的な七分丈の外套です。布地が何層にも重なっており、非常に幅の広い袖が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kasaya"
msgid_plural "kasayas"
msgstr[0] "袈裟"

#. ~ Description of "kasaya"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist robe, stitched together from three "
"pieces of traditional saffron dyed cloth."
msgstr "足首まで隠れる、仏教徒が身にまとう伝統的なローブです。伝統的なサフラン染めの技法を用いた3枚の布を縫い合わせて作られます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "keikogi"
msgid_plural "keikogis"
msgstr[0] "稽古着"

#. ~ Description of "keikogi"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain white keikogi for use in martial arts."
msgstr "武道で使用される無地の稽古着です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kimono"
msgid_plural "kimonos"
msgstr[0] "着物"

#. ~ Description of "kimono"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr "足首まである長着です。帯を結ぶ事によって身体に着付けます。日本の伝統的な民族衣装です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "yukata"
msgid_plural "yukatas"
msgstr[0] "浴衣"

#. ~ Description of "yukata"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese "
"pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr "帯で巻き付けて簡単に着用できる、涼しげな外衣です。日本では本来寝巻として使われており、夏の夜に最適です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "haori"
msgid_plural "haoris"
msgstr[0] "羽織"

#. ~ Description of "haori"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is worn unfastened over a kimono.  It is"
" jet black with sparse, tasteful golden embroidery."
msgstr "着物の上から締め付けずに着用する、幅広の袖があるゆったりとした上着です。漆黒の布地に上品な金色の刺繍が薄く入っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kittel"
msgid_plural "kittels"
msgstr[0] "キッテル"

#. ~ Description of "kittel"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special "
"occasions."
msgstr "木綿で作られた膝丈の白いローブです。ユダヤ教徒が特別な行事の時に身に纏う伝統的な民族衣装です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather police jacket"
msgid_plural "leather police jackets"
msgstr[0] "警官用レザージャケット"

#. ~ Description of "leather police jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick and heavy leather jacket emblazoned with the insignia of the local "
"police force."
msgstr "地元警察のマークをあしらった、分厚く重い革ジャンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "peacoat"
msgid_plural "peacoats"
msgstr[0] "ピーコート"

#. ~ Description of "peacoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy wool coat, warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "深いポケットが付いた、暖かい厚手のウールコートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "robe"
msgid_plural "robes"
msgstr[0] "ローブ"

#. ~ Description of "robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting outer garment with sleeves and a mysterious amount of well-"
"hidden pockets."
msgstr "袖のあるゆったりとした上着です。謎の隠しポケットがたくさん付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ghost's robe"
msgid_plural "ghost's robes"
msgstr[0] "ゴーストローブ"

#. ~ Description of "ghost's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A white hooded ghost's robe characteristic of souls that haunt the living "
"world."
msgstr "生者の世界に取り残された魂が身に着ける、フード付きの白いローブです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "cheap ghost's robe"
msgid_plural "cheap ghost's robes"
msgstr[0] "簡易ゴーストローブ"

#. ~ Description of "cheap ghost's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A cheap ghost costume comprised of a white sheet with two eye holes cut out."
"  A simple hat is worn underneath to keep the sheet in place."
msgstr "白いシーツに視界を確保する2つの穴を開けただけの、安価なコスチュームです。衣装がずれないように、帽子で固定して身に着けます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "grim reaper's robe"
msgid_plural "grim reaper's robes"
msgstr[0] "死神のローブ"

#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A black hooded grim reaper's robe with a face cover to hide the user's lack "
"of facial skin.  It pairs nicely with a scythe.  Use it to remove the face "
"cover and show yourself before your victims."
msgstr "骸骨の顔を隠すマスクとフードが付いた、大鎌がよく似合う死神向けの黒いローブです。使用するとマスクを外し、犠牲者に正体を明かします。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "grim reaper's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Remove face cover"
msgstr "マスクを外す"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grim reaper's robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "The darkness surrounding your face lightens."
msgstr "闇にとけ込んでいた死神の顔が露になりました。"

#. ~ 'Faceless' as in 'face cover'less and because, without the cover of
#. darkness (A black face cover) a real grim reaper would really be faceless
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
msgid_plural "grim reaper's robes (faceless)"
msgstr[0] "死神のローブ(開)"

#. ~ 'Faceless' as in 'face cover'less and because, without the cover of
#. darkness (A black face cover) a real grim reaper would really be faceless
#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A black hooded grim reaper's robe with the face cover removed to show user's"
" lack of facial skin.  It pairs nicely with a scythe.  Use it to hide your "
"lack of facial features."
msgstr ""
"フードが付いた、大鎌がよく似合う死神向けの黒いローブです。マスクが外され、骸骨の顔がよく見える状態になっています。使用するとマスクを被り、顔を隠します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Adjust face cover"
msgstr "マスクを被る"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "You shroud your face in darkness."
msgstr "死神の顔が闇にとけ込みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "wizard robe"
msgid_plural "wizard robes"
msgstr[0] "魔法使いのローブ"

#. ~ Description of "wizard robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious and arcane-looking robe, signifying status in the wizarding "
"world.  It has a hood and some pockets for your magical artifacts."
msgstr "魔法の世界で高位の者が身に着ける、神秘的で怪しげなローブです。フードと魔道具を入れるポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "samghati"
msgid_plural "samghatis"
msgstr[0] "僧伽梨"

#. ~ Description of "samghati"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, double-layered Buddhist coat.  Used as an outer cloak for "
"various occasions."
msgstr "仏教徒が様々な場面で羽織る、二重構造の伝統的なコートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "santa jacket"
msgid_plural "santa jackets"
msgstr[0] "サンタジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A red jacket, trimmed with white faux fur, commonly used by bearded men on "
"Christmas.  Warm and has a couple of small pockets."
msgstr "髭面の男がクリスマスによく着用している、白いフェイクファーで縁取られた赤いジャケットです。暖かく、小さなポケットが2つ付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "short santa jacket"
msgid_plural "short santa jackets"
msgstr[0] "袖無しサンタジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "short santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A short red jacket with white faux fur as trim, similar to a Santa jacket "
"but sleeveless, for a more revealing look on Christmas."
msgstr ""
"白いフェイクファーで縁取られた、丈が短い赤色のジャケットです。サンタジャケットによく似ていますが、袖がないため、露出度の高いクリスマスファッションに最適です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ski jacket"
msgid_plural "ski jackets"
msgstr[0] "スキーウェア"

#. ~ Description of "ski jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with"
" sizable pockets."
msgstr "アルペンスキー用の、断熱性と通気性の高いパーカーです。非常に暖かく、ポケットもたくさん付いています。"

#. ~ The general guideline for sleeveless dusters is the components, volume,
#. weight, time to craft, and value are 15% lower (rounded down) than the
#. original.  Making it from an original takes 50% the time.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless dusters"
msgstr[0] "袖無しダスターコート"

#. ~ The general guideline for sleeveless dusters is the components, volume,
#. weight, time to craft, and value are 15% lower (rounded down) than the
#. original.  Making it from an original takes 50% the time.
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length duster that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty "
"of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "丈夫で丈が長く袖がないダスターコートです。ポケットが多く、物をたくさん収納できます。"

