#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "袖無しトレンチコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat without sleeves.  Has plenty of storage space, "
"and looks pretty good."
msgstr "厚手のフェイクファーで作った袖なしトレンチコートです。収納用量が多く、見た目もお洒落です。"

#. ~ The general guideline for sleeveless trenchcoats is the components,
#. volume, weight, time to craft, and value are 15% lower (rounded down) than
#. the original.  Making it from an original takes 50% the time.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "袖無しトレンチコート(革)"

#. ~ The general guideline for sleeveless trenchcoats is the components,
#. volume, weight, time to craft, and value are 15% lower (rounded down) than
#. the original.  Making it from an original takes 50% the time.
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick leather trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered."
"  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "袖がない厚手の革製トレンチコートです。ポケットが多く、物をたくさん収納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless tunics"
msgstr[0] "袖無しチュニック"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "胴体と脚を覆う、袖の無い服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "thawb"
msgid_plural "thawbs"
msgstr[0] "トーブ"

#. ~ Description of "thawb"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves.  A traditional Arab garment."
msgstr "袖幅が広い、ゆったりとした長いローブです。アラブ諸国の伝統的な衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "トレンチコート"

#. ~ Description of "trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick canvas trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "厚手の帆布製トレンチコートです。複数のポケットが付いており、収納力に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "トレンチコート(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "厚手の毛皮製トレンチコートです。複数のポケットが付いており、収納力に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "トレンチコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage, and "
"makes you the talk of the town."
msgstr "厚手のフェイクファー製トレンチコートです。複数のポケットが付いており、収納力に優れています。街で評判のお洒落なデザインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "トレンチコート(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather trenchcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "厚手の革製トレンチコートです。複数のポケットが付いており、収納力に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "tunic"
msgid_plural "tunics"
msgstr[0] "チュニック"

#. ~ Description of "tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A simple garment long enough to cover down to the knees."
msgstr "膝の下までを覆う、簡素な布の服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rag tunic"
msgid_plural "rag tunics"
msgstr[0] "ラグチュニック"

#. ~ Description of "rag tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A poorly-made long tunic with a string tied around the waist to keep it all "
"in place."
msgstr "腰の周りに固定用のひもが通った、適当な作りのロングチュニックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "tuxedo"
msgid_plural "tuxedos"
msgstr[0] "タキシード"

#. ~ Description of "tuxedo"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr "上下がセットになったタキシードです。終末世界でも多少の高級感を味わえます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "waistcoat"
msgid_plural "waistcoats"
msgstr[0] "チョッキ"

#. ~ Description of "waistcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt "
"would be too casual and a suit would be overdoing it."
msgstr "上品なチョッキです。シャツだけではカジュアルすぎる、スーツだと堅苦しい、そんな場面で着用するのが理想的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army winter jacket"
msgid_plural "army winter jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用防寒ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "army winter jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by"
" the military."
msgstr "フードとたくさんのポケットを備えたジャケットです。保温のための厚いパッドが入っており、軍隊でも愛用されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "overgrown iridescent carapace plate"
msgid_plural "overgrown iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "肥大した虹色の甲羅"

#. ~ Description of "overgrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that looks like it was at one point shaped "
"like armor, but is now bulky and overgrown with sharp pieces jutting out "
"haphazardly.  Scarred into the outer surface you can barely make out the "
"label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it into a ballistic "
"vest."
msgstr ""
"地球外の素材でできた厚い甲羅です。元は鎧のような形をしていましたが、更に巨大化し、鋭い棘が無造作に飛び出しています。外側にはかろうじて「STRIKE "
"FACE」の文字が確認できます。防弾ベストになんとか挿入できそうな形状をしています。"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "iridescent carapace plate"
msgid_plural "iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "虹色の甲羅"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Description of "iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into "
"the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could "
"force it into a ballistic vest."
msgstr ""
"地球外の厚い甲羅を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の装甲板です。外側には「STRIKE "
"FACE」と表記されたラベルが付いています。防弾ベストになんとか挿入できそうな形状をしています。"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
msgid_plural "undergrown iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "収縮した虹色の甲羅"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Description of "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into "
"the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is "
"spotty and it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr ""
"地球外の厚い甲羅を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の装甲板です。外側には「STRIKE "
"FACE」と表記されたラベルが付いています。表面には斑点模様が浮き出ており、痛々しい粘液を垂らしながら脈打っています。"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "plate of scarred flesh"
msgid_plural "plates of scarred flesh"
msgstr[0] "傷んだ甲羅"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Description of "plate of scarred flesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly flesh that seems to have been forced into the shape "
"of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  There is no armor "
"left on this plate, just a mass of writhing alien flesh oozing in pain.  "
"However, it looks like it is slowly growing back."
msgstr ""
"地球外の肉塊を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の物体です。既に装甲が残っておらず、ただ痛みに悶え粘液を垂れ流す奇妙な肉の塊があるだけです。装甲は少しずつ再生しているようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "second skin"
msgid_plural "second skins"
msgstr[0] "セカンドスキン"

#. ~ Description of "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A slimy layer of liquid has completely engulfed your body from the neck down"
" and seems to move with you - the sensation is uncomfortable.  The liquid "
"appears bound to the resonating collar at your neck; the inside of the "
"collar reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\".  The ooze flows "
"freely, covering your entire body but never crossing the gorget to get to "
"your head."
msgstr ""
"首から下がぬるぬるした液体に包まれ、動きに完全にフィットする不快な感覚に襲われています。液体は首の部分にある装置から流れ出ており、装置と液体は連動しているようす。襟には「窒息に注意！上限ライン」と書いてあります。液体は全身の表面を自由に移動しますが、首の装置より上部に到達することはないようです。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Deactivate the device"
msgstr "停止"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "The gorget hums and the liquid gets sucked back into it."
msgstr "装置が音を立てながら、全ての液体を吸い込みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "resonating gorget"
msgid_plural "resonating gorgets"
msgstr[0] "喉当て型装置"

#. ~ Description of "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty gorget or collar made from odd materials that hums slightly.  "
"It feels damp to the touch and there is a mechanical button of some kind on "
"the front.  The inside reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\"."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な素材で作られた重厚な喉当てです。わずかに音を立てており、表面を触ると湿っています。前面には何らかのボタンが付いており、内側には「窒息に注意！上限ライン」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Activate the device"
msgstr "起動"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"Murky ooze begins to leak out of the gorget and engulf your body from the "
"neck down!"
msgstr "装置から濁った液体が漏れ出し、首から下を完全に包み込みました！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "feeding kit"
msgid_plural "feeding kits"
msgstr[0] "甲羅生育キット"

#. ~ Description of "feeding kit"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"This is a collection of syringes with nozzles, an aerosol sprayer, and a few"
" other attachments.  It seems designed for looking after some kind of "
"creature that wants to stay wet."
msgstr "ノズル付き注射器、エアゾール式噴霧器、その他道具類一式です。湿気を好む生物を生育するために使うようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of eclipse glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eclipse glasses"
msgstr[0] "日食グラス"

#. ~ Description of "pair of eclipse glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of cardboard-framed glasses with UV and IR-filtered lenses topped "
"with a layer of aluminum coating.  They allow safe viewing of extremely "
"bright and harmful sources of light, like the sun during a solar eclipse."
msgstr ""
"アルミでコーティングされた段ボールのフレームに、紫外線と赤外線をカットするレンズがはめ込まれたサングラスです。日食などの際に、太陽のような非常に強く有害な光を安全に観察できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "leather eyepatch"
msgid_plural "leather eyepatches"
msgstr[0] "革製眼帯"

#. ~ Description of "leather eyepatch"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A patch of black leather to cover an eye, with a string to keep it from "
"falling off.  If wearing this doesn't make you feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr "頭に固定するための紐が付いた、片目を覆う黒革の眼帯です。これを着用しても海賊気分を味わえないなら、もうどうしようもありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of stylish sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "お洒落なサングラス"

#. ~ Description of "pair of stylish sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses.  Look good while keeping the glare out of your"
" eyes."
msgstr "スタイリッシュなデザインの、眩しい光から目を守るサングラスです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of fit-over sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of fit-over sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "オーバーサングラス"

#. ~ Description of "pair of fit-over sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fit-over sunglasses designed to be worn over a pair of corrective "
