msgstr "弾丸や小さな破片から目を保護する最新の軍用保護メガネです。危険な環境から目をしっかりと保護します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of bifocal glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal glasses"
msgstr[0] "遠近両用メガネ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-"
"sighted.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr "遠近両用のメガネです。使用すると太陽光を一点に集中させます。"

