#. ~ Description of "hunting cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A red plaid hunting cap with ear flaps.  Notably warm."
msgstr "赤いチェック柄の耳当てが付いた非常に暖かいハンチング帽です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "knit hat"
msgid_plural "knit hats"
msgstr[0] "ニット帽"

#. ~ Description of "knit hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A snug-fitting wool hat.  Very warm."
msgstr "頭部にフィットする羊毛製の帽子です。非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "newsboy cap"
msgid_plural "newsboy caps"
msgstr[0] "キャスケット"

#. ~ Description of "newsboy cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A slouching wool cap with a short front brim, traditionally associated with "
"newspaper delivery boys.  Quite warm."
msgstr ""
"前方につばがある羊毛製の大きな帽子です。米国では新聞配達の少年が被っていた事からニュースボーイキャップとも呼ばれています。かなり暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "noise canceling headgear"
msgid_plural "noise canceling headgears"
msgstr[0] "消音ヘッドギア"

#. ~ Description of "noise canceling headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"Padding over your ears, kept in place by some string.  Blocks incoming "
"sounds."
msgstr "当て布を耳の上から紐で固定して着用します。外からの音を遮断します。"

#. ~ Head encumbrance stops you from wearing additional headgear.  No helmet
#. over a sombrero, sorry.  But brimmed gear gets the anti-glare flag!
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "sombrero"
msgid_plural "sombreros"
msgstr[0] "ソンブレロ"

#. ~ Head encumbrance stops you from wearing additional headgear.  No helmet
#. over a sombrero, sorry.  But brimmed gear gets the anti-glare flag!
#. ~ Description of "sombrero"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"An orange felt sombrero with traditional white and yellow hand stitching.  "
"The wide brim keeps the sun out of your eyes, and a thin strap hooks around "
"your chin."
msgstr "白と黄色の伝統的な刺繍がされた、フェルト製のオレンジ色のソンブレロです。顎に細い紐で固定して着用し、広いつばが日光から目を守ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "kippah"
msgid_plural "kippahs"
msgstr[0] "キッパー"

#. ~ Description of "kippah"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A thin, rounded skullcap.  A traditional headdress in Judaism."
msgstr "皿のような形をした小さくて薄い帽子です。ユダヤ教の伝統的な民族衣装です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "kufi cap"
msgid_plural "kufi caps"
msgstr[0] "クフィ"

#. ~ Description of "kufi cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A brimless, short and rounded cap."
msgstr "丸みを帯びたつばのない短い帽子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "French maid hat"
msgid_plural "French maid hats"
msgstr[0] "ホワイトブリム"

#. ~ Description of "French maid hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A frilly white headpiece."
msgstr "フリルの付いた白いヘッドピースです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "porkpie hat"
msgid_plural "porkpie hats"
msgstr[0] "ポークパイハット"

#. ~ Description of "porkpie hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A flat-topped hat with circular indent and a narrow brim.  Most popular in "
"the 40s and 50s, still common among those in the mod scene, hipsters, and "
"people named Heisenberg."
msgstr ""
"丸まった短いつばを持つ天辺が平らな帽子です。最も流行したのは1940～50年代ですが、モッズ・スタイルの若者やファッションに敏感なヒップスター、ハイゼンベルグという通り名をもつ男は未だにこの帽子を愛用しているようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "mail carrier hat"
msgid_plural "mail carrier hats"
msgstr[0] "郵便配達員制帽"

#. ~ Description of "mail carrier hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional mail carrier's cap, with the US postal service logo "
"embroidered on the front above the plastic brim.  A symbol of a bygone "
"world."
msgstr ""
"伝統的な郵便配達員のつば付き帽子です。プラスチック製のキャップの前頭部にはアメリカ合衆国郵便公社のロゴが刺繍されていますが、もはや過去のシンボルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "santa hat"
msgid_plural "santa hats"
msgstr[0] "サンタ帽"

#. ~ Description of "santa hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A red hat with white faux fur trim, commonly used by bearded men on "
"Christmas."
msgstr "髭面の男がクリスマスによく着用している、白いフェイクファーで縁取られた赤い帽子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "straw hat"
msgid_plural "straw hats"
msgstr[0] "麦藁帽子"

#. ~ Description of "straw hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A hat woven out of straw.  Its brim helps keep the sun out of your eyes."
msgstr "藁を編んで作った帽子です。つばが付いており、日光から目を守ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "tinfoil hat"
msgid_plural "tinfoil hats"
msgstr[0] "アルミ箔帽"

#. ~ Description of "tinfoil hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of aluminum foil that has been molded into a form-fitting hat.  "
"Perfect for protecting yourself from the government, Illuminati, aliens, and"
" THEM."
msgstr "頭の形状にぴったり合うように成形したアルミ箔の帽子です。政府やイルミナティやエイリアンが放つ洗脳電波から身を守るために必要不可欠です。"

#. ~ No, you're not wearing anything over your top hat.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "top hat"
msgid_plural "top hats"
msgstr[0] "シルクハット"

#. ~ No, you're not wearing anything over your top hat.
#. ~ Description of "top hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"The only hat for a gentleman.  Look exquisite while laughing in the face of "
"danger!"
msgstr "紳士のみが着用できる帽子です。紳士は危険に直面しても優雅に微笑みを浮かべているものです！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "tricorne"
msgid_plural "tricornes"
msgstr[0] "三角帽子"

#. ~ Description of "tricorne"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A classic design, the \"tricorne\", or three-cornered hat, simply pins a "
"large and floppy brim out of the way, though this example adds well-"
"embroidered designs and is oiled against water.  Whether you're the "
"\"guvnah\" of a settlement, or the captain of a post-apocalyptic crew, this "
"is the hat for you."
msgstr ""
"クラシックなデザインの「トリコーン」、別名三角帽子はだらりと下がった大きな鍔をたくし上げただけの作りですが、これには上質な刺繍が施され、油膜で水を弾くように作られています。開拓地の「親分」として、大変動の荒波を乗り越えたクルー達のキャプテンとして、いずれにしても、これはそんな人のためにある帽子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "turban"
msgid_plural "turbans"
msgstr[0] "ターバン"

#. ~ Description of "turban"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"Cloth wound around the head, worn by people of many cultures worldwide.  "
"Some historical examples could be huge and ostentatious, but this one is a "
"very simple design."
msgstr ""
"世界各地の様々な文化圏で着用されている、頭部に巻く布です。伝統的なターバンの中には非常に巨大で目立つものもありますが、これは非常にシンプルなデザインです。"

#. ~ Head encumbrance stops you from wearing additional headgear.  No helmet
#. over a ballcap, sorry.  But brimmed gear gets the anti-glare flag!
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "golf cap"
msgid_plural "golf caps"
msgstr[0] "ゴルフ帽"

#. ~ Head encumbrance stops you from wearing additional headgear.  No helmet
#. over a ballcap, sorry.  But brimmed gear gets the anti-glare flag!
#. ~ Description of "golf cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"You're not actually sure if this is called a golf cap, but it's the "
"stereotypical cap golfers wear."
msgstr "これをゴルフ帽と呼んでいいのか分かりませんが、ゴルファーがよく被っているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "wizard hat"
msgid_plural "wizard hats"
msgstr[0] "魔法使いの帽子"

#. ~ Description of "wizard hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"A blue pointed hat with stars stitched into it.  Wearing it makes you feel "
"like a powerful wizard."
msgstr "星形が刺繍された青いとんがり帽子です。着用すると強い魔法使いになったような気分に浸れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "pointed hat"
msgid_plural "pointed hats"
msgstr[0] "とんがり帽子"

#. ~ Description of "pointed hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "A black pointed hat suitable for a witch."
msgstr "魔女によく似合う、先端が尖った黒い帽子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "attachable ear muffs"
msgid_plural "attachable ear muffs"
msgstr[0] "取付型イヤーマフ"

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise "
"exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a working "
"position, blocking most sounds."
msgstr "ヘルメットや安全ヘルメットに取り付けて使うイヤーマフです。使用すると耳にしっかりと押し当て、周囲の音をほぼ遮断します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "attachable ear muffs"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Press tightly to ears"
msgstr "耳に押し当てる"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "attachable ear muffs"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "You put the ear muffs tightly to your ears."
msgstr "イヤーマフを耳にしっかりと押し当てました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "attachable ear muffs (on)"
msgid_plural "attachable ear muffs (on)"
msgstr[0] "取付型イヤーマフ(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise "
"exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a standby "
"position, letting you clearly hear again."
msgstr ""
"ヘルメットや安全ヘルメットに取り付ける、騒音を耳に害がないレベルまで軽減するイヤーマフです。使用するとイヤーマフを耳から離し、周囲の音がはっきり聞こえるようになります。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "attachable ear muffs (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "Put away from ears"
msgstr "耳から離す"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "attachable ear muffs (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "You put the ear muffs away from your ears."
msgstr "イヤーマフを耳から離しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "ballistic mandible guard"
msgid_plural "ballistic mandible guard"
msgstr[0] "防弾下顎プロテクター"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic mandible guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A ballistic jaw guard designed to be attached on a military helmet, but "
"easily adjustable to helmets with any kind of rail system installed."
msgstr ""
