#. ~ Description of "cataphract leggings"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"This leg armor, made of interlocking plates of burnished bronze, appears to "
"be either a high-quality recreation or a genuine artifact.  Despite having "
"an ancient design, it is in mint condition aside from some battle damage.  "
"It covers from the upper thigh to the lower shin, and is of extremely high "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"磨いた青銅板を組み合わせて作ったこの鎧は、品質の高いレプリカか、あるいは由緒ある本物のようです。古臭いデザインではありますが、戦闘によって受けたと思しきいくつかの損傷を除けば新品同様です。上腿から下腿までを覆う、非常に優れた防具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "leather chaps"
msgid_plural "leather chaps"
msgstr[0] "レザーチャップス"

#. ~ Description of "leather chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of black leather chaps.  Very tough and light, but doesn't offer any "
"storage."
msgstr "黒い革製のチャップスです。収納容量はありませんが、軽量で耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "chainsaw chaps"
msgid_plural "chainsaw chaps"
msgstr[0] "チェーンソーチャップス"

#. ~ Description of "chainsaw chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tough chaps made of Kevlar.  Chainsaw kickbacks are potentially "
"fatal; personal protective equipment like these chaps help protect your "
"femoral arteries.  The layered Kevlar is designed to fray on contact with "
"the chain and bind up the tool."
msgstr ""
"ケブラー製の頑丈なチャップスです。チェーンソーの反動による怪我は命に関わりますが、このチャップスのような保護具を着用しておけば、大腿動脈を守れます。層状のケブラーはチェーンと接触した際に擦り切れ、絡みついて動きを止めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
