#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards hammered out of metal and shaped to tie on to the upper"
" and lower leg, avoiding joints.  Perfect for the Post-Apocalyptic Warrior "
"look."
msgstr "板金を叩いて成形したレッグガードです。膝の位置にある繋ぎ目は関節に干渉しない形状になっています。文明崩壊後の戦士に最適な防具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "pair of case hardened sheet metal leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of case hardened sheet metal leg guards"
msgstr[0] "板金レッグガード(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of case hardened sheet metal leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"These crude leg guards have been case hardened to further protect your legs "
"from the mighty coffee table, destroyer of shins."
msgstr "焼入炭素鋼製の簡素なレッグガードです。もうローテーブルに脛を粉砕される心配はありません。"

#. ~ The weight assumes two sheets of about 25cm x 30cm x 1.5mm.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
