msgstr "焼入炭素鋼の板金を叩いて成形した、脛を守る粗雑な作りのグリーヴです。"

#. ~ The weight assumes 2 sheets of about 30cm x 50cm x 1.5mm and 2 sheets of
#. about 30cm x 25cm x 1.5mm
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "sheet metal skirt"
msgid_plural "sheet metal skirts"
msgstr[0] "板金スカート"

#. ~ The weight assumes 2 sheets of about 30cm x 50cm x 1.5mm and 2 sheets of
#. about 30cm x 25cm x 1.5mm
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"Four cut-down sheets of metal hanging off your waist to keep your hip and "
"groin safe.  They're held in place rather loosely, but still get in the way "
"a lot when running."
msgstr "切り揃えた4枚の板金を並べて腰にぶら下げることで、腰と股間を保護します。固定はかなり緩いですが、それでも走る際は邪魔になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "case hardened sheet metal skirt"
msgid_plural "case hardened sheet metal skirts"
msgstr[0] "板金スカート(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "case hardened sheet metal skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
