"hardened to provide maximum protection for your most vulnerable area."
msgstr "焼入炭素鋼の板金を切り出して作ったスカートです。非常に脆い部位を最大限保護します。"

#. ~ The weight assumes 3 sheets of about 15cm x 15cm x 1.5mm.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "pair of sheet metal knee guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal knee guards"
msgstr[0] "板金ニーガード"

#. ~ The weight assumes 3 sheets of about 15cm x 15cm x 1.5mm.
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal knee guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"Two small half-cylinders of sheet metal cut down and hammered to fit over "
"the front of your knees.  They make kneeling painful, but don't impede "
"running much."
msgstr "小さな半円筒状の板金をハンマーで叩き、膝に合う形状に整えた防具です。膝を付くと痛いですが、走るのにほとんど支障はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "pair of case hardened sheet metal knee guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of case hardened sheet metal knee guards"
msgstr[0] "板金ニーガード(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of case hardened sheet metal knee guards"
