#. ~ Description of variant "steampunk dust mask" of item "dust mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "It's colored black, with a steampunk design.  Very fashionable."
msgstr "黒地に白でスチームパンク風の模様が描かれた、非常に格好いいデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "dust mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "flag dust mask"
msgid_plural "flag dust masks"
msgstr[0] "防塵マスク(星条旗)"

#. ~ Description of variant "flag dust mask" of item "dust mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"It's printed with an American flag pattern.  Perfect for a real patriot."
msgstr "真の愛国者によく似合う、星条旗柄のデザインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "Guy Fawkes mask"
msgid_plural "Guy Fawkes masks"
msgstr[0] "ガイ・フォークス・マスク"

#. ~ Description of "Guy Fawkes mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "Remember, remember, the fifth of November."
msgstr "忘れるな、11月5日を、忘れるな。"

#. ~ Jason-type costume masks are much cheaper and less protective.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "hockey mask"
msgid_plural "hockey masks"
msgstr[0] "ホッケーマスク"

#. ~ Jason-type costume masks are much cheaper and less protective.
#. ~ Description of "hockey mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A protective face mask made of thick plastic.  Commonly worn by hockey "
"goalies."
msgstr "厚手のプラスチックで作られた顔面保護用のフェイスマスクです。ホッケーのキーパーがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "rioter mask"
msgid_plural "rioter masks"
msgstr[0] "暴徒マスク"

#. ~ Description of "rioter mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the sleeves tied behind the back of one's head.  These are "
"usually worn by rioters to hide their identity."
msgstr "Tシャツの袖を後頭部で縛ったものです。暴徒が身元を隠すために着用します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "skull mask"
msgid_plural "skull masks"
msgstr[0] "骸骨マスク"

#. ~ Description of "skull mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A plastic skull mask that covers the face.  Spooky."
msgstr "顔を覆うプラスチック製の骸骨マスクです。不気味ですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "white beard"
msgid_plural "white beards"
msgstr[0] "白髭"

#. ~ Description of "white beard"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A fake white beard that straps over the mouth.  Perfect for your Santa "
"costume!"
msgstr "紐で口元に固定する白い付け髭です。これで完璧なサンタになれますね！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "clown wig"
msgid_plural "clown wigs"
msgstr[0] "道化師のウィッグ"

#. ~ Description of "clown wig"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A colorful and ridiculous wig fit for a clown."
msgstr "道化師用の色鮮やかでおかしなウィッグです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "clown nose"
msgid_plural "clown noses"
msgstr[0] "道化師の赤鼻"

#. ~ Description of "clown nose"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A red latex nose often worn by clowns."
msgstr "道化師が付けるラテックス製の赤い丸鼻です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "golden crown"
msgid_plural "golden crowns"
msgstr[0] "金の王冠"

#. ~ Description of "golden crown"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A delicate golden crown featuring flowering trees."
msgstr "花が咲いた木を模した精緻な黄金の王冠です。"

#. ~ Description of "golden crown"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A golden crown for the monarch of survivors."
msgstr "生存者の王に相応しい黄金の王冠です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "protective mouthpiece"
msgid_plural "protective mouthpieces"
msgstr[0] "マウスプロテクター"

#. ~ Description of "protective mouthpiece"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A protective piece of equipment commonly used by athletes, worn inside the "
"mouth to protect your teeth."
msgstr "スポーツ選手がよく使っている、口の中に装着して歯を守る道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "skinny tie"
msgid_plural "skinny ties"
msgstr[0] "スリムタイ"

#. ~ Description of "skinny tie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A skinny black and white checkered necktie."
msgstr "白黒チェック柄の細身のネクタイです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "rolled sleeping bag"
msgid_plural "rolled sleeping bags"
msgstr[0] "寝袋(折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "rolled sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag that covers you head to toe, with a strap for carrying "
"it on your back when not in use.  This one is medium weight.  Activate it to"
" unroll it so you can use it for warmth."
msgstr ""
"頭から足先まですっぽりと包む大きな寝袋です。それなりの重量がありますが、使わないときは畳んで背負っておけます。使用すると展開されて暖かい寝具になります。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rolled sleeping bag"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rolled fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "Unroll"
msgstr "展開する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rolled sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "You unroll the sleeping bag."
msgstr "寝袋を広げました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "fur sleeping bag"
msgid_plural "fur sleeping bags"
msgstr[0] "寝袋(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag lined with fur, with a strap for carrying it on your "
"back when not in use.  Who needs a tent?  It is currently unrolled; activate"
" it roll it up for easy storage."
msgstr ""
"使わないときは畳んで背負っておける、裏起毛の大きな寝袋です。テントも一緒にいかがでしょうか？現在は展開している状態ですが、使用すると小さく畳みます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "fur sleeping bag"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "Roll up"
msgstr "折り畳む"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "You roll up the fur sleeping bag, preparing it for transport."
msgstr "寝袋(毛皮)を丸めて、持ち運びやすいようにまとめました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "rolled fur sleeping bag"
msgid_plural "rolled fur sleeping bags"
msgstr[0] "寝袋(毛皮/折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "rolled fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag lined with fur, with a strap for carrying it on your "
"back when not in use.  Who needs a tent?  Activate it to unroll it so you "
"can use it for warmth."
msgstr ""
"使わないときは畳んで背負っておける、裏起毛の大きな寝袋です。使わないときは畳んで背負っておけます。テントも一緒にいかがでしょうか？使用すると展開されて暖かい寝具になります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rolled fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "You unroll the fur sleeping bag."
msgstr "寝袋(毛皮)を畳みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "bow tie"
msgid_plural "bow ties"
msgstr[0] "蝶ネクタイ"

#. ~ Description of "bow tie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A simple black bow tie.  Best worn with a suit."
msgstr "スーツとの相性が抜群な、シンプルな黒色の蝶ネクタイです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "clip-on tie"
msgid_plural "clip-on ties"
msgstr[0] "クリップ式ネクタイ"

#. ~ Description of "clip-on tie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A clip-on necktie with blue and silver stripes.  It's quick and easy to put "
"on, and really, who's going to know the difference?"
msgstr "青とシルバーの縞模様のクリップ式ネクタイです。 素早く簡単に装着でき、見栄えもネクタイとほとんど変わらないのではないでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "necktie"
msgid_plural "neckties"
msgstr[0] "ネクタイ"

#. ~ Description of "necktie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"An ordinary green necktie.  Knowing how to properly tie it takes some "
"practice, but it's an important skill to learn.  Clip-ons are for children."
msgstr "ありふれた、緑色のネクタイです。正しく結ぶには練習が必要ですが、学ぶべき大切な技術です。クリップ式ネクタイなど、子供の付けるものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "vampire fangs"
msgid_plural "vampire fangs"
msgstr[0] "吸血鬼の牙"

#. ~ Description of "vampire fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A pair of white vampire fangs made of plastic."
msgstr "プラスチックでできた吸血鬼の白い牙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "wedding veil"
msgid_plural "wedding veils"
msgstr[0] "ウェディングベール"

#. ~ Description of "wedding veil"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A lacy white wedding veil."
msgstr "レースの付いた白いウェディングベールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "tarpaulin"
msgid_plural "tarpaulins"
msgstr[0] "防水シート"

#. ~ Description of "tarpaulin"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A plastic sheet with several grommets for securing it with rope or cord.  "
"Useful for improvised rain protection."
msgstr "縁に紐を通すハトメ金がついたビニールシートです。全身を覆えるほどの大きさがあります。手っ取り早く雨をしのぐには有効な手段となるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "cow armor"
msgid_plural "cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "Kevlar-lined cow peto"
msgid_plural "Kevlar-lined cow petos"
msgstr[0] "闘牛用装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar-lined cow peto"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, mattress-like armor of cloth, leather and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as protection in bullfighting.  You could put this on a "
"friendly cow."
msgstr "元々は闘牛に参加するウシが装着していた、革と厚手のケブラーを縫い付けたマットレスのような重い布製防具です。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin cow armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(シリコンキチン)"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a "
"friendly cow.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr ""
"シリコンキチンのメッシュ素材で自作した、それぞれクリニエール、ペイトレール、クルーピエと呼ばれる牛鎧です。友好的なウシに装着できます。耐酸性に優れていますが、耐久性はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "chitin cow armor"
msgid_plural "chitin cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(キチン)"

#. ~ Description of "chitin cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "キチンのメッシュ素材で自作した、それぞれクリニエール、ペイトレール、クルーピエと呼ばれる牛鎧です。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "chainmail cow armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(チェーンメイル)"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for cows as protection.  You "
"could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "ウシの体を保護する厚手のチェーンメイルです。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather cow barding with caprison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather cow bardings with caprison"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(硬化革)"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with caprison"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for cows consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts a battle between a monstrous dragon "
"and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる牛鎧一式です。布飾りには、巨大なドラゴンと豪奢なグリフォンが戦う様子が描かれています。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather cow barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather cow bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(骨)"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with bones"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to leather cow barding to invoke fear in bandits "
"and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "革製の牛鎧の表面に骨を貼り付けて装飾し、ごろつきや盗賊団、商人たちを恐怖に陥れます！友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "cow rain sheet"
msgid_plural "cow rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "牛用レインスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "cow rain sheet"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering designed to keep a cow dry in the rain.  You could "
"put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "ウシが雨に濡れるのを防ぐ、薄手のビニール製スーツです。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "iron cow armor"
msgid_plural "iron cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(鉄)"

#. ~ Description of "iron cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically-placed iron plates and leather, suitably "
"made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "ウシの肉体を保護する、鉄板と革を巧妙に配置した重厚な防具です。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "steel cow armor"
msgid_plural "steel cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(鋼鉄)"

#. ~ Description of "steel cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for cows as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "ウシの体を保護する、鋼鉄板と革でできた重厚な防具です。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid "bronze cow armor"
msgid_plural "bronze cow armors"
msgstr[0] "牛鎧(青銅)"

#. ~ Description of "bronze cow armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically-placed bronze plates and leather, suitably"
" made for cows as protection.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "ウシの肉体を保護する、青銅板と革を巧妙に配置した重厚な防具です。友好的なウシに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_dog_armor.json
msgid "Kevlar dog harness"
msgid_plural "Kevlar dog harnesses"
msgstr[0] "ドッグハーネス(ケブラー)"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar dog harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_dog_armor.json
msgid ""
"A blue bulletproof harness, designed to be worn by canines in the service of"
" local law enforcement, that protects from the shoulders to the abdomen.  "
"You could put this on a friendly dog."
