#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Secured under compression straps or with a tool loop."
msgstr "ストレッチバンド/紐輪"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "giant novelty backpack"
msgid_plural "giant novelty backpacks"
msgstr[0] "超大型バックパック"

#. ~ Description of "giant novelty backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge fabric backpack made mostly as a joke before the Cataclysm.  Now, "
"it's still rather silly, but it can store a lot of stuff."
msgstr "大変動前にジョークグッズとして作られた、非常に大きな布製バックパックです。今なお馬鹿げた代物ですが、たくさんの収納スペースが確保できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather backpack"
msgid_plural "leather backpacks"
msgstr[0] "バックパック(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small leather backpack.  Good storage for a little encumbrance."
msgstr "小型の革製バックパックです。最低限の動作制限で、十分な収納容積を確保できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "large tactical backpack"
msgid_plural "large tactical backpacks"
msgstr[0] "大型タクティカルバックパック"

#. ~ Description of "large tactical backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large tactical multi-compartment backpack that has great lower back "
"support."
msgstr "内部が複数に仕切られた大型のタクティカルバックパックです。腰回りに大きなサポーターがついています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "laundry basket"
msgid_plural "laundry baskets"
msgstr[0] "洗濯かご"

#. ~ Description of "laundry basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A plastic basket meant for storing and hauling clothing."
msgstr "衣類を入れて運ぶための、プラスチック製のかごです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "high-volume rucksack"
msgid_plural "high-volume rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "大容量リュックサック"

#. ~ Description of "high-volume rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a \"bigpack\", this rucksack is prized by pack rats but may "
"lead to a bad back."
msgstr "『ビッグパック』という名でも知られるこのリュックサックは収集癖がある人々に高く評価されていますが、使うと腰を痛める可能性があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "bindle"
msgid_plural "bindles"
msgstr[0] "放浪者の棒きれ"

#. ~ Description of "bindle"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"You're ready for a trip down some train tracks.  Also known as a hobo stick."
msgstr "線路沿いを旅する準備は万端です。この棒きれは放浪者の証として知られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "box backpack"
msgid_plural "box backpacks"
msgstr[0] "簡易バックパック"

#. ~ Description of "box backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A makeshift backpack comprised of a wooden box and a pair of ropes."
msgstr "木箱とロープを組み合わせて自作したバックパックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "briefcase"
msgid_plural "briefcases"
msgstr[0] "ブリーフケース"

#. ~ Description of "briefcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Useful for carrying money, documents, or smuggled goods."
msgstr "札束や書類、密輸品などを運ぶのに便利です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "violin case"
msgid_plural "violin cases"
msgstr[0] "ヴァイオリンケース"

#. ~ Description of "violin case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Useful to carry your precious musical instrument around protected from any "
"harm."
msgstr "貴重な楽器を安全に持ち運べます。"

#. ~ REI Co-op 22-liter daypack costs $54.95, so ballpark to $55
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "daypack"
msgid_plural "daypacks"
msgstr[0] "デイパック"

#. ~ REI Co-op 22-liter daypack costs $54.95, so ballpark to $55
#. ~ Description of "daypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight nylon backpack intended for one-day hiking trips.  Waterproof,"
" slim, and spacious."
msgstr "日帰りのハイキングなどで使われる、ナイロン製の超軽量バックパックです。防水加工がされており、嵩張らない形状で十分な容量が確保できます。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "daypack"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "travelpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Small pocket for a water bottle"
msgstr "小型水筒ホルダー"

#. ~ based on the condor deployment bag and it's derivatives, holds 6.4L and
#. has dimensions 6in H x 5.5in D x 12in W, max item lengths determined by
#. approximating a little less based on dimensions
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "deployment bag"
msgid_plural "deployment bags"
msgstr[0] "デプロイメントバッグ"

#. ~ based on the condor deployment bag and it's derivatives, holds 6.4L and
#. has dimensions 6in H x 5.5in D x 12in W, max item lengths determined by
#. approximating a little less based on dimensions
#. ~ Description of "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A durable nylon bag marketed towards military personnel.  It has clips on "
"the top and back, making it easy to attach a strap and wear it comfortably "
"as a fanny pack.  MOLLE webbing on the back lets you affix it to body armor "
"or a backpack."
msgstr ""
"軍人向けに販売されている丈夫なナイロンバッグです。上部と背面にストラップを固定できるクリップが付いており、ウエストポーチのように着用しても快適に動けます。背面にはMOLLEウェビングがあり、対応するボディアーマーやバックパックに取り付けることも可能です。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Center pocket."
msgstr "中央ポケット"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Front pocket."
msgstr "正面ポケット"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Side pocket."
msgstr "側面ポケット"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "dive bag"
msgid_plural "dive bags"
msgstr[0] "ダイビングバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "dive bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A lightweight mesh backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "軽量なメッシュのバックパックです。スイマーやダイバーがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "duffel bag"
msgid_plural "duffel bags"
msgstr[0] "ダッフルバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge duffel bag.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "巨大なダッフルバッグです。身体の動きを大きく妨げますが、十分な量の荷物を運べます。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "duffel bag"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor duffel bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Tucked under the carry handles."
msgstr "持ち手の隙間"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "tactical dump pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical dump pouches"
msgstr[0] "タクティカルダンプポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "tactical dump pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An expandable pouch secured with straps.  Provides a bit of extra storage "
"with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr "ストラップで固定する拡張型ポーチです。身体の動きをほとんど妨げず、多少の荷物を運べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "fanny pack"
msgid_plural "fanny packs"
msgstr[0] "ウエストポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "fanny pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric bag worn on the waist, with the pouch in front for easy "
"access.  Once used as a visual shorthand for unstylish geeks and silly "
"tourists, it was making a decent comeback before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"取り出しやすい前面にポケットが付いた、腰に着用する小型の布製バッグです。かつては野暮ったいオタクや間の抜けた観光客の代名詞として扱われていましたが、大変動が訪れる前に復権を果たしました。"

#. ~ The main section of the golf bag actually assumes things will stick out
#. of it, but specifically contains them, so some extra wiggle room was added.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "golf bag"
msgid_plural "golf bags"
msgstr[0] "ゴルフバッグ"

#. ~ The main section of the golf bag actually assumes things will stick out
#. of it, but specifically contains them, so some extra wiggle room was added.
#. ~ Description of "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A tall canvas and plastic bag with fold-out legs used for golfing.  It even "
"has straps to be worn on the back and a slot for an umbrella."
msgstr "折り畳めるスタンドが付いた、帆布とビニール製の背の高いバッグです。背負うためのストラップと、傘を入れるポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You awkwardly sheath your %s"
msgstr "ぎこちなく%sをバッグの中に収納しました。"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "golf bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Sheath golf club"
msgstr "ゴルフクラブを収納する"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "hide bag"
msgid_plural "hide bags"
msgstr[0] "粗皮袋"

#. ~ Description of "hide bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of an animal, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage."
"  It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "動物の生皮を手早く袋状にまとめました。このままでは腐敗してしまうため、乾かして鞣す必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "tainted hide bag"
msgid_plural "tainted hide bags"
msgstr[0] "汚染粗皮袋"

#. ~ Description of "tainted hide bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of a monster, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage."
"  It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "化け物の生皮を手早く袋状にまとめました。このままでは腐敗してしまうため、乾かして鞣す必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases (empty)"
msgstr[0] "H&K業務用ブリーフケース(空)"

#. ~ Description of "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"This is a plain, hard-sided black briefcase with a trigger in the handle and"
" a concealed hole in the side.  Squeezing the trigger would currently do "
"nothing, as it is empty.  Don't forget to put a suitable MP5 back inside "
"before you try to pay any ransom fees with lead."
msgstr ""
"持ち手に引き金、側面に目立たない銃口が付属した、硬くて平たい黒のブリーフケースです。中に何も入っていないため、引き金を引いても何も起こりません。適切なMP5を忘れずに入れておかないと、身代金を鉛玉で支払うこともできませんよ。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "jerrypack"
msgid_plural "jerrypacks"
msgstr[0] "ジェリカンパック"

#. ~ Description of "jerrypack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A jerrycan modified to be worn in a similar manner to a backpack."
msgstr "改造を施したジェリカンです。バックパックのように背負えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather pouch"
msgid_plural "leather pouches"
msgstr[0] "ポーチ(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag stitched together from leather scraps.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but "
"is easy to wear."
msgstr "革をつぎはぎしたバッグです。持ち運べる量は少量ですが、着用しても邪魔にはなりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "pair of drop leg pouches"
msgid_plural "pairs of drop leg pouches"
msgstr[0] "ドロップレッグポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of drop leg pouches"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This "
"variety is favored by the military."
msgstr "バックルストラップで太ももに巻き付けて着用できるポーチです。この種の収納用品は軍隊で愛用されています。"

#. ~ Based around https://www.amazon.com/HCoolfly-Waterproof-Motorcycle-Multi-
#. Function-Fishing/dp/B07TVNBPZK/.
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "ドロップレッグバッグ"

#. ~ Based around https://www.amazon.com/HCoolfly-Waterproof-Motorcycle-Multi-
#. Function-Fishing/dp/B07TVNBPZK/.
#. ~ Description of "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Provides some extra storage for outdoor activities."
msgstr "バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定するバッグです。野外活動での収納確保に便利です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A black bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled"
" straps.  Commonly used by motorcycle riders."
msgstr "バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定する黒いバッグです。バイク乗りがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A khaki bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled"
" straps.  Works nicely with a pair of khaki pants."
msgstr "バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定するカーキ色のバッグです。カーキ色のズボンによく似合います。"

#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A purple bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable "
"buckled straps.  Perfect for the ladies that want a cooler way of carrying "
"their personal items."
msgstr "バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定する紫色のバッグです。身の回りの品をスマートに持ち歩きたい女性によく似合います。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "camo drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "camo drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "ドロップレッグバッグ(迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "camo drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A green bag with camouflage print that can be worn on the thighs and hips "
"using adjustable buckled straps.  For those that have a military heart."
msgstr "バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定する、緑地に迷彩模様が入ったバッグです。軍人気質な人によく似合います。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "steampunk drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "steampunk drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "ドロップレッグバッグ(ｽﾁｰﾑﾊﾟﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "steampunk drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A black and dark gold bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using "
"adjustable buckled straps, with a steampunk design and chains all over it.  "
"Perfect for a wide variety of costumes."
msgstr ""
"バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定するバッグです。黒地にダークゴールドのスチームパンク風模様が入っており、そこかしこにチェーン装飾が施されています。幅広い服装に似合いそうなデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "skull drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "skull drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "ドロップレッグバッグ(骸骨)"

#. ~ Description of variant "skull drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A jet-black bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable "
"buckled straps, with skulls and spikes all over it.  Perfect for a rider of "
"the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"バックル付きのストラップで太股や腰に巻き付けて固定するバッグです。黒地に骸骨模様が入っており、そこかしこに鋲の装飾が施されています。崩壊した世界のバイク乗りによく似合います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "small leg purse"
msgid_plural "small leg purses"
msgstr[0] "レッグポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small purse that can be worn on the upper leg using buckled straps, easier"
" to use than on the arm.  For those who want to wear a dress without pockets"
" while carrying their phone and money.  Use it to adjust it to fit your arm."
msgstr ""
"バックル付きのストラップで太股に固定する小型のポーチです。腕に付けるより使いやすく、ポケットのない服を着ていてもスマートフォンや小銭を持ち歩きたい人におすすめです。使用すると腕に付け替えます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the arm"
msgstr "腕に付ける"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small leg purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your arm."
msgstr "%sを腕に着用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "armband pouch"
msgid_plural "armband pouches"
msgstr[0] "アームポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be worn on the upper arm using buckled straps.  This "
"is a favoured item among sports & camping enthusiasts.  Use it to adjust it "
"to fit your leg."
msgstr "バックルストラップで上腕に巻き付けて着用できる小さなポーチです。スポーツやキャンプの愛好家が好んで使います。使用すると脚に付け替えます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Adjust on the leg"
msgstr "脚に付ける"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "armband pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your leg."
msgstr "%sを脚に着用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "ankle wallet pouch"
msgid_plural "ankle wallet pouches"
msgstr[0] "アンクルポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "ankle wallet pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed wallet pouch worn on the ankle.  If you strap it under "
"your clothes, it can help you keep your wallet hidden and safe."
msgstr "足首に着用する小型のポーチです。衣服の下にこっそり着用しておけば、金銭を安全に持ち運べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "makeshift knapsack"
msgid_plural "makeshift knapsacks"
msgstr[0] "簡易ナップサック"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knapsack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A pair of pants with the bottom ends tied with string, and then passed "
"through the belt loops so the knapsack can be carried on the back."
msgstr "紐でズボンの裾を縛り、その紐をさらにベルト通しに通してナップサックのように背負えるようにしたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "makeshift sling"
msgid_plural "makeshift slings"
msgstr[0] "簡易スリングバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large sheet tied into a crude, over-the-shoulder sling."
msgstr "袋になるように適当に結んだシーツです。肩にかけて背負います。"

#. ~ KA101's ran about $90 but is ballistic nylon.  Bit tougher than the DDA
#. model.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "messenger bag"
msgid_plural "messenger bags"
msgstr[0] "メッセンジャーバッグ"

#. ~ KA101's ran about $90 but is ballistic nylon.  Bit tougher than the DDA
#. model.
#. ~ Description of "messenger bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Light and easy to wear, but doesn't offer much storage."
msgstr "軽量で簡単に着用できますが、収納容積も少量です。"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE assault pack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE assault packs"
msgstr[0] "MOLLEアサルトパック"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE assault pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"backpack.  Covered with pockets and straps, it strikes a fine balance "
"between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets to the "
"outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"モジュール式軽量荷物運搬用装備(MOdular Lightweight Load-carrying "
"Equipment)システムに対応した、先進的な軍用バックパックです。表面にポケットやストラップがあり、阻害性と収納性のバランスに優れています。外側のリグには装備品ポケットを追加で取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE medium rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE medium rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE中型リュックサック"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE medium rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"medium rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets"
" to the outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"モジュール式軽量荷物運搬用装備(MOdular Lightweight Load-carrying "
"Equipment)システムに対応した、先進的な軍用中型リュックサックです。表面にポケットやストラップがあり、阻害性と収納性のバランスに優れています。外側のリグには装備品ポケットを追加で取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE large rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE large rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE大型リュックサック"

#. ~ Based upon own service and wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MOLLE
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE large rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"large rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets"
" to the outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"モジュール式軽量荷物運搬用装備(MOdular Lightweight Load-carrying "
"Equipment)システムに対応した、先進的な軍用大型リュックサックです。表面にポケットやストラップがあり、阻害性と収納性のバランスに優れています。外側のリグには装備品ポケットを追加で取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "net backpack"
msgid_plural "net backpacks"
msgstr[0] "紐編みバックパック"

#. ~ Description of "net backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag woven together from strings, with straps to wear it on back.  Lighter "
"than a standard backpack, but more awkward to carry when loaded and unable "
"to hold small or heavy items."
msgstr ""
"背中に担ぐためのストラップが付いた、紐を編んで作ったバッグです。標準的なバックパックより軽量ですが、荷物を入れすぎると持ち運び辛くなり、小さいものや重いものは入れられません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "petpack"
msgid_plural "petpacks"
msgstr[0] "ペットパック"

#. ~ Description of "petpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm this would allow your four-legged friend to see the "
"world, now it's used to shield them from the world."
msgstr "大変動以前、ペットパックは四つ足の友に世界を見せて回るツールでしたが、今は世界から友を守るために使われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "plastic shopping bag"
msgid_plural "plastic shopping bags"
msgstr[0] "買物袋"

#. ~ Description of "plastic shopping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag used to carry groceries home."
msgstr "食料品を家に持って帰る時に利用する袋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "purse"
msgid_plural "purses"
msgstr[0] "ポシェット"

#. ~ Description of "purse"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A fancy leather purse from a well-known designer.  A bit cumbersome to wear,"
" but provides some storage."
msgstr "有名デザイナーブランドの派手な革製ポシェットです。着用していると動きを少し妨げますが、ある程度の収納力はあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "pouch"
msgid_plural "pouches"
msgstr[0] "ポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift bag, cobbled together from rags.  Really gets in the way, but "
"provides a decent amount of storage."
msgstr "布切れから適当に作った手製のバッグです。かなり邪魔になりますが無いよりはマシでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "military rucksack"
msgid_plural "military rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "軍用リュックサック"

#. ~ Description of "military rucksack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge military rucksack, provides a lot of storage."
msgstr "十分な収納容積を備えた大型の軍用背嚢です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "runner pack"
msgid_plural "runner packs"
msgstr[0] "ランニングバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "runner pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The obvious choice for outdoor athletes, this ergonomic backpack is light "
"and easy to wear, ensuring comfort when carrying heavy and bulky items."
msgstr ""
"この人間工学に基づいて設計されたバックパックは、野外スポーツ愛好家の必需品です。着用も簡単で軽く、重い物やかさばる物を運ぶ際の快適さは保証できます。"

#. ~ Depends on if you're getting a cheap school version or something more
#. like a range bag.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "sling pack"
msgid_plural "sling packs"
msgstr[0] "スリングバッグ"

#. ~ Depends on if you're getting a cheap school version or something more
#. like a range bag.
#. ~ Description of "sling pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple single-sling backpack.  Easier to access than a normal backpack, "
"but can't comfortably hold as much."
msgstr "吊り帯が1つだけ付いたシンプルなバックパックです。通常のバックパックよりも簡単に荷物を出し入れ出来ますが、収納性は劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "straw basket"
msgid_plural "straw baskets"
msgstr[0] "藁かご"

#. ~ Description of "straw basket"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A handmade straw basket.  Carry it with you for extra storage."
msgstr "藁で編んだ手製のかごです。収納容積を増やし、物を多く持ち運べるようになります。"

#. ~ You drag it along with you, so it taking a hit is Rare.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "suitcase"
msgid_plural "suitcases"
msgstr[0] "スーツケース"

#. ~ You drag it along with you, so it taking a hit is Rare.
#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it"
" around is neither fast nor comfortable."
msgstr ""
"主に旅行中の衣服を運ぶのに用いる、ホイールの付いた大きいスーツケースです。収納用量は非常に大きいですが、着用時の素早い移動や持ち運びやすさは期待できません。"

#. ~ Description of "suitcase"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A mid-sized wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it"
" around is not exactly comfortable."
msgstr "主に旅行中の衣服を運ぶ用途に使う、車輪が付いた中型サイズのスーツケースです。収納性は抜群ですが、持ち運びにはあまり適しません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "swag bag"
msgid_plural "swag bags"
msgstr[0] "泥棒袋"

#. ~ Description of "swag bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large canvas sack, re-purposed for makeshift storage.  Goes well with a "
"striped shirt and a domino mask."
msgstr "帆布袋(大)を収納目的に転用したものです。しま模様のシャツとドミノマスクがお似合いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "travelpack"
msgid_plural "travelpacks"
msgstr[0] "トラベルパック"

#. ~ Description of "travelpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A hiking pack used for short trips."
msgstr "小旅行に使うようなバックパックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "utility vest"
msgid_plural "utility vests"
msgstr[0] "多機能ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "utility vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A light vest covered in pockets and straps for storage."
msgstr "ポケットとストラップが複数付いた軽量のベストです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "wicker backpack"
msgid_plural "wicker backpacks"
msgstr[0] "背負い籠"

#. ~ Description of "wicker backpack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large handmade straw basket with a lid and shoulder straps to wear it like"
" a backpack.  Less comfortable than a proper backpack, but will do the job."
msgstr ""
"背中に担ぐためのショルダーストラップと蓋が付いた、手作りの大きな編み籠です。一般的なバックパックよりも付け心地が快適ではありませんが、問題なく使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "debug pocket universe"
msgid_plural "debug pocket universes"
msgstr[0] "デバッグ用ポケットユニバース"

#. ~ Description of "debug pocket universe"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A pocket universe.  Can store approximately 384 * 10^6 bugs."
msgstr "約384×10^6個のバグを格納できるポケットユニバースです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "longarm bag"
msgid_plural "longarm bags"
msgstr[0] "ロングアームバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "longarm bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long duffel bag.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  Quite "
"cumbersome."
msgstr "背が高いダッフルバッグです。ライフルなどの長い銃器を収納できますが、扱いやすくはありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "rifle case"
msgid_plural "rifle cases"
msgstr[0] "ライフルケース"

#. ~ Description of "rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles.  "
"Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "長い形状のソフトケースです。ライフルなどの長い銃器を収納できます。小さなポケットやストラップ、持ち手が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather rifle case"
msgid_plural "leather rifle cases"
msgstr[0] "レザーライフルケース"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "double rifle case"
msgid_plural "double rifle cases"
msgstr[0] "ダブルライフルケース"

#. ~ Description of "double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and rifles.  "
"Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr "長い形状のソフトケースです。ライフルなどの長い銃器を2丁まで収納できます。ストラップと3つのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather double rifle case"
msgid_plural "leather double rifle cases"
msgstr[0] "レザーダブルライフルケース"

#. ~ Description of "leather double rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for 2 long arms and "
"rifles.  Includes 3 accessory pockets and a strap."
msgstr "長い形状の革製ソフトケースです。ライフルなどの長い銃器を2丁まで収納できます。ストラップと3つのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Description of "long leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An extra long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and "
"rifles.  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "非常に長い形状の革製ソフトケースです。ライフルなどの長い銃器を収納できます。小さなポケットやストラップ、持ち手が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "camera bag"
msgid_plural "camera bags"
msgstr[0] "カメラバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "camera bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple bag used to hold a camera, with a small pocket on the side for "
"accessories.  Comes with a carry strap."
msgstr "側面に付属品用の小さなポケットがある、カメラを収納するためのシンプルなバッグです。キャリーストラップが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "bookstrap"
msgid_plural "bookstraps"
msgstr[0] "ブックバンド"

#. ~ Description of "bookstrap"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned book strap carrier.  Guaranteed to make you feel like a "
"proper scholar."
msgstr "本を縛って持ち運ぶための、昔ながらの道具です。身に着けると、まるで本物の学者のように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "loop of rope"
msgid_plural "loops of rope"
msgstr[0] "ループロープ"

#. ~ Description of "loop of rope"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A length of rope tied with a sliding knot into a loop.  You can slip all "
"sorts of large objects in and carry them as a bundle; if you want to tie a "
"single item more securely you'd have to disassemble this loop.  It takes a "
"while to untie it and get things out, and attackers might pull the whole "
"thing undone if you're not careful."
msgstr ""
"ロープを輪にしてスライディングノットで結んだものです。大きなアイテムを束ねて背負えますが、単一のアイテムをより強固に縛り付けたい場合は、分解して輪を解いた状態で使うべきです。収納アイテムを取り出す際は結び目を解く時間が必要なため、気を付けていないと敵に隙を見せることになります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "big trapper pack"
msgid_plural "big trapper packs"
msgstr[0] "大型トラッパーパック"

#. ~ Description of "big trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A wooden frame with waterproofed cloth stretched around it, and a drawstring"
" at the top to hold things in.  It has straps to wear it on your back."
msgstr "木製のフレームに防水加工した布袋を張り、上部を紐で引き絞れるようにしたものです。ストラップが付いており、背負えるようになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "trapper pack"
msgid_plural "trapper packs"
msgstr[0] "トラッパーパック"

#. ~ Description of "trapper pack"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An L-shaped wooden frame with a waterproofed cloth sack attached to it.  "
"There's a drawstring to hold things in and straps to carry it on your back."
msgstr "木製のL字型フレームに防水加工した布袋を張り、上部を紐で引き絞れるようにしたものです。ストラップが付いており、背負えるようになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "bondage suit"
msgid_plural "bondage suits"
msgstr[0] "ボンデージスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "bondage suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A suit of snug black leather.  Has no pockets, but does feature an abundance"
" of unusually located zippers."
msgstr "肌に密着する、黒いレザースーツです。ポケットは付いていませんが、妙な位置にジッパーが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "lycra bodysuit"
msgid_plural "lycra bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tight-fitting bodysuit made of lycra.  Covers the whole body from neck to "
"toe."
msgstr "肌に密着するライクラ素材のボディスーツです。首からつま先まで全身を覆います。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "futuristic blue bodysuit"
msgid_plural "futuristic blue bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(青)"

#. ~ Description of variant "futuristic blue bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored neon blue and has a bright pink symbol on the back.  Perfect "
"for hunting space pirates and parasitic aliens."
msgstr ""
"ネオンブルーを基調としており、背面には鮮やかなピンク色のシンボルマークが描かれています。スペースパイレーツや寄生生物狩りにぴったりの装いです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "futuristic red bodysuit"
msgid_plural "futuristic red bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(赤)"

#. ~ Description of variant "futuristic red bodysuit" of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored neon red and has a bright orange symbol on the back.  Perfect "
"for hunting space pirates and parasitic aliens."
msgstr ""
"ネオンレッドを基調としており、背面には鮮やかなオレンジ色のシンボルマークが描かれています。スペースパイレーツや寄生生物狩りにぴったりの装いです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "futuristic black bodysuit"
msgid_plural "futuristic black bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(黒)"

#. ~ Description of variant "futuristic black bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black and has a bright blue symbol on the back.  Perfect for "
"hunting space pirates and parasitic aliens."
msgstr ""
"ネオンブラックを基調としており、背面には鮮やかな青色のシンボルマークが描かれています。スペースパイレーツや寄生生物狩りにぴったりの装いです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "black infiltration bodysuit"
msgid_plural "black infiltration bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ｽﾊﾟｲ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black infiltration bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black and seems to fade into the background.  Commonly used by "
"special agents when on a mission."
msgstr "黒を基調とした、風景に溶け込みそうなデザインです。特殊工作員が任務でよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero blue bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero blue bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ｽｰﾊﾟｰﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero blue bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored blue and has a big \"S\" symbol on the front.  It would combine"
" nicely with a red cape."
msgstr "青色を基調としており、正面に大きな「S」のマークが描かれています。赤いマントが似合いそうです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero black bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero black bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ﾊﾞｯﾄﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero black bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black and has a symbol in the shape of a bat on the front.  It "
"would combine nicely with a black cape and mask."
msgstr "黒色を基調としており、正面にコウモリを表すシンボルマークが描かれています。黒いマントやマスクが似合いそうです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero spider bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero spider bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ｽﾊﾟｲﾀﾞｰﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero spider bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored red and blue and has web-like lines all over it, as well as a "
"big spider symbol on the front and back.  It makes you want to climb "
"buildings and shoot webs."
msgstr ""
"赤と青を基調としたスーツの全身にクモの巣のようなラインが入り、正面と背面には大きなクモのマークが描かれています。ビルに登ったり、クモの糸を撃ち出したりしたくなるデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero green bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero green bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ｸﾞﾘｰﾝﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero green bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "It's primarily colored green and has a superhero design."
msgstr "緑色を基調とした、スーパーヒーロー風のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero purple bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero purple bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ﾊﾟｰﾌﾟﾙﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero purple bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "It's primarily colored purple and has a superhero design."
msgstr "紫色を基調とした、スーパーヒーロー風のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "super hero pink bodysuit"
msgid_plural "super hero pink bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(ﾋﾟﾝｸﾋｰﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "super hero pink bodysuit" of item "lycra
#. bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "It's primarily colored pink and has a superhero design."
msgstr "ピンク色を基調とした、スーパーヒーロー風のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "bondage lycra bodysuit"
msgid_plural "bondage lycra bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボンデージスーツ"

#. ~ Description of variant "bondage lycra bodysuit" of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black and looks pretty kinky.  A great alternative to the "
"leather version."
msgstr "変態的なデザインの黒いボディスーツです。レザースーツの代用品として最適です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "skeleton bodysuit"
msgid_plural "skeleton bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(骸骨)"

#. ~ Description of variant "skeleton bodysuit" of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored jet-black and has a skeleton design printed on it.  Maybe the "
"zombies would ignore you in this."
msgstr "全身に骸骨の模様が入った漆黒のデザインです。ひょっとするとゾンビに気付かれないかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "lycra bodysuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "flag bodysuit"
msgid_plural "flag bodysuits"
msgstr[0] "ライクラボディスーツ(星条旗)"

#. ~ Description of variant "flag bodysuit" of item "lycra bodysuit"
#. ~ Description of variant "flag bikini bottom" of item "bikini bottom"
#. ~ Description of variant "flag bikini top" of item "bikini top"
#. ~ Description of variant "flag swimsuit" of item "swimsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "It's printed with an American flag pattern."
msgstr "星条旗柄のデザインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "clown suit"
msgid_plural "clown suits"
msgstr[0] "道化師のスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "clown suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A colorful and ridiculous costume fit for a clown.  Provides decent storage."
msgstr "道化師用の色鮮やかでおかしな衣装です。十分な収納容積があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dinosaur suit"
msgid_plural "dinosaur suits"
msgstr[0] "着ぐるみ(恐竜)"

#. ~ Description of "dinosaur suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic dinosaur.  It is quite"
" encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "恐竜を擬人化したデザインの全身着ぐるみです。かなり動き辛いですが、中は非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "shark suit"
msgid_plural "shark suits"
msgstr[0] "着ぐるみ(サメ)"

#. ~ Description of "shark suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic bull shark.  It is "
"quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "オオメジロザメを擬人化したデザインの全身着ぐるみです。かなり動き辛くポケットも少ないですが、中は非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dragon suit"
msgid_plural "dragon suits"
msgstr[0] "着ぐるみ(ドラゴン)"

#. ~ Description of "dragon suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A cartoonish recreation of a western dragon remade into a suit.  Effectively"
" useless nowadays, unless you think the mutants will treat you as one of "
"their own if you wear this.  The wings really get in the way."
msgstr ""
"漫画に登場するようなデザインの、西洋のドラゴンの着ぐるみです。これを着ていれば変異体が仲間として扱ってくれる、というようなことはなく、今の状況では役に立ちません。それにしても、背中の翼は本当に邪魔ですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "feline suit"
msgid_plural "feline suits"
msgstr[0] "着ぐるみ(ネコ)"

#. ~ Description of "feline suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic feline of indistinguishable "
"breed.  It's a decent source of faux fur if you need it."
msgstr "よく分からない品種のネコを擬人化したデザインの、毛皮製の着ぐるみです。十分な量の毛皮の生地が入手できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "flag jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "flag jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(星条旗)"

#. ~ Description of "flag jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A jumpsuit embroidered with a pattern of the American flag.  Provides decent"
" storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr "星条旗柄のジャンプスーツです。着用してもそれほど動きを妨げず、収納力も十分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved jumpsuit similar to those worn by prisoners.  Provides"
" decent storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr "囚人が着ているような、薄手の半袖ジャンプスーツです。着用してもそれほど動きを妨げず、収納力も十分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "XL jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "XL jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "XLジャンプスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "XL jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved jumpsuit updated for the trans-human who needs full-"
"body clothing.  Provides some storage and is adjustable to minimize "
"encumbrance."
msgstr "人間を超えた者のために調整された薄手の半袖ジャンプスーツです。最小限の阻害性である程度の収納箇所を備えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "XS jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "XS jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "XSジャンプスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "XS jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved jumpsuit; similar to those worn by prisoners.  "
"Provides decent storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr "囚人が着ているような、半袖の薄いジャンプスーツです。着用してもそれほど動きを妨げず、収納力も十分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "skeleton jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "skeleton jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(骸骨)"

#. ~ Description of "skeleton jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black jumpsuit with a skeleton pattern printed on it.  It can be zipped "
"all the way up to cover your head and face in a skull pattern too.  Use it "
"to zip the head portion closed."
msgstr ""
"骨の柄がプリントされた黒いジャンプスーツです。頭まですっぽり覆ってジッパーを完全に閉じれば、スケルトンの仮装ができます。使用すると頭のジッパーを閉じます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "skeleton jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Zip the head portion"
msgstr "ジッパーを閉じる"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "skeleton jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "You now have a skull as head."
msgstr "頭を覆ってスケルトンに扮しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "skeleton jumpsuit (zipped)"
msgid_plural "skeleton jumpsuits (zipped)"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(骸骨/閉)"

#. ~ Description of "skeleton jumpsuit (zipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black jumpsuit with a skeleton pattern printed on it.  It covers all the "
"way up to your head and displays a skull pattern over your face.  Use it to "
"unzip the head portion."
msgstr "骨の柄がプリントされた黒いジャンプスーツです。頭まですっぽり覆われており、顔もスケルトンに扮しています。使用すると頭のジッパーを開きます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "skeleton jumpsuit (zipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Unzip the head portion"
msgstr "ジッパーを開く"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "skeleton jumpsuit (zipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "You facial skin is now visible."
msgstr "ジッパーを開いて顔を出しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Hub 01 jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01ジャンプスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A brown jumpsuit worn by the staff of Hub 01."
msgstr "ハブ01の職員が着用する茶色のジャンプスーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "mummy jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "mummy jumpsuit"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(ミイラ)"

#. ~ Description of "mummy jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An off-white jumpsuit printed to look like the tattered wrappings of an "
"ancient mummy.  Very easy to move in, but it doesn't offer any type of "
"protection."
msgstr "古代のミイラを模して作られた、古めかしい白色の衣装です。非常に動きやすい作りですが、防御力はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "subject suit"
msgid_plural "subject suits"
msgstr[0] "被験者スーツ"

#. ~ Description of "subject suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved and short-legged one-piece suit.  Judging by the odd "
"tailoring and adjustment points… maybe you don't want to know who wore it.  "
"Provides nominal storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr ""
"半袖で脚の丈が短い、薄手のつなぎ服です。奇妙な仕立て方や調整部分から察すると...ああ、誰が着ていたかは知らない方がよさそうです。収納容積はわずかですが、着心地は良好です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "union suit"
msgid_plural "union suits"
msgstr[0] "ユニオンスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "union suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A one-piece suit of full-body long underwear that helps to maintain body "
"temperature.  It laces closed in the front."
msgstr "全身の体温の維持を補助する肌着です。前に結んだ留め紐が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "wolf suit"
msgid_plural "wolf suits"
msgstr[0] "着ぐるみ(オオカミ)"

#. ~ Description of "wolf suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body fursuit in the form of an anthropomorphic wolf.  It is quite "
"encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "オオカミを擬人化したデザインの、毛皮製の全身着ぐるみです。かなり動き辛いですが、中は非常に暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "thick wool onesie"
msgid_plural "thick wool onesies"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description of "thick wool onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An encumbering wool suit covered in nice patterns.  It looks like full body "
"armor but it only protects against cold, sadly."
msgstr "素敵な模様が付いた、羊毛製のかさばる服です。見た目は全身鎧のようですが、残念ながら寒さからしか守ってくれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "zentai"
msgid_plural "zentais"
msgstr[0] "全身タイツ"

#. ~ Description of "zentai"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Short for 'zenshin taitsu', a zentai is a form-fitting full-body nylon and "
"spandex garment.  Though it covers your face, you can see through the thin "
"fabric.  With a couple of these and some friends, you could put on some "
"kabuki or harass a rival sports team."
msgstr ""
"「全タイ」という略称でも知られる、ナイロンと合成繊維で作られた全身を覆う衣装です。頭部は一体型のフード状になっており、顔を完全に覆っても視界を妨げません。この衣装と協力者を集めれば、皆で演劇を披露したり、試合でライバルチームに嫌がらせをしたりできます。"

