#. ~ Description of "faraday chainmail suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit with integrated rubber boots that can be "
"worn over your normal clothing.  The suit is conductively interconnected, "
"protecting against electricity."
msgstr "通常の衣服の上から着用できる、ゴム長靴と繋がった特別仕立てのチェーンメイルスーツです。導電性があり、電撃から肉体を保護します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
