msgid "gambeson"
msgid_plural "gambesons"
msgstr[0] "ギャンベソン"

#. ~ Description of "gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick jacket of quilted fabric, designed to be worn underneath mail or "
"other armor.  Or worn on its own, if you can't afford proper armor.  Use it "
"to loosen it if you want to wear it over your clothes."
msgstr ""
"厚みのあるキルト生地の上着です。装甲の下に着るよう作られていますが、鎧が用意できない場合はそのまま着てもかまいません。他の服の上に着用する場合は、使用してベルトを緩めましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "gambeson vest"
msgid_plural "gambeson vests"
msgstr[0] "ギャンベソンベスト"

#. ~ Description of "gambeson vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick vest of quilted fabric, designed to be worn underneath mail or other"
" armor.  This one has had its sleeves removed.  Use it to loosen it if you "
"want to wear it over your clothes."
msgstr ""
"鎧などの下に着込むための、厚みのあるキルト生地の上着です。袖の部分が切り取られています。他の服の上に着用する場合は、使用してベルトを緩めましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "gambeson (loose)"
msgid_plural "gambesons (loose)"
msgstr[0] "ギャンベソン(緩)"

#. ~ Description of "gambeson (loose)"
#. ~ Description of "gambeson vest (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick jacket of quilted fabric, loosened to be worn as outer armor.  Use "
"it to wear it tighter and be able to put proper armor over it."
msgstr ""
"ベルトを緩めて他の服の上に着用できるよう調整した、厚みのあるキルト生地の上着です。使用するとベルトをしっかりと締め、上からきちんとした鎧を着用できるようになります。"

