#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
msgid "arming pants"
msgid_plural "arming pants"
msgstr[0] "アーミングパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "arming pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Thick pants made of quilted fabric, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson "
"under or without armor."
msgstr "装甲の下、あるいはギャンベソンと共に着用するように作られた、厚みのあるキルト生地のズボンです。"

#. ~ materials on this guy are slightly weird since it is trying to quilt soft
#. armor panels, so at thickest it is their thickness
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Kevlar gambeson"
msgid_plural "Kevlar gambesons"
msgstr[0] "ケブラーギャンベソン"

#. ~ materials on this guy are slightly weird since it is trying to quilt soft
#. armor panels, so at thickest it is their thickness
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Designed to mimic a thick jacket of quilted fabric that would be worn "
"underneath mail or other armor.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had "
"strips of soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting.  Use it to loosen "
"it if you want to wear it over your clothes."
msgstr ""
"鎧などの下に着込むための、厚みのあるキルト生地風の上着です。アラミド繊維の表面に短冊状の柔らかい装甲をキルティング加工で縫い付けてあります。他の服の上に着用する場合は、使用してベルトを緩めましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Kevlar gambeson vest"
msgid_plural "Kevlar gambeson vests"
msgstr[0] "ケブラーギャンベソンベスト"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar gambeson vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Designed to mimic a thick vest of quilted fabric that would be worn "
"underneath mail or other armor.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had "
"strips of soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting.  Use it to loosen "
"it if you want to wear it over your clothes."
msgstr ""
"鎧などの下に着込むための、厚みのあるキルト生地風のベストです。アラミド繊維の表面に短冊状の柔らかい装甲をキルティング加工で縫い付けてあります。他の服の上に着用する場合は、使用してベルトを緩めましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Kevlar gambeson (loose)"
msgid_plural "Kevlar gambesons (loose)"
msgstr[0] "ケブラーギャンベソン(緩)"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar gambeson (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick jacket of quilted fabric, loosened to be worn as outer armor.  This "
"one incorporates Kevlar layers added for better protection.  Use it to wear "
"it tighter and be able to put proper armor over it."
msgstr ""
"ベルトを緩めて他の服の上に着用できるよう調整した、厚みのあるキルト生地の上着です。ケブラー素材が使われており、一般的な素材のものより高い防御力を発揮できます。使用するとベルトをしっかりと締め、上からきちんとした鎧を着用できるようになります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Kevlar gambeson (loose)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Kevlar gambeson vest (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "You adjust your Kevlar gambeson a bit tighter."
msgstr "ケブラーギャンベソンのベルトをしっかりと締めました。"

