"A cuirass made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for "
"durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr "硬い革を繋いで作った胴鎧です。紐で胴体に固定して着用し、耐久性と柔軟性を両立します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "XL leather lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "XL leather lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "XLレザーラメラーキュイラス"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
