msgid "cloth-padded shirt"
msgid_plural "cloth-padded shirts"
msgstr[0] "布補強シャツ"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick cotton sweatshirt that an amateur tailor sewed ever-increasing "
"amounts of cloth onto, providing noticeable, if haphazard padding."
msgstr "素人の仕立て屋のように無造作に布を縫い付けた、厚手の綿製スウェットシャツです。粗雑な作りのようですが、確かな効果が実感できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "cloth-padded sleeveless shirt"
msgid_plural "cloth-padded sleeveless shirts"
msgstr[0] "布補強袖無しシャツ"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded sleeveless shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick cotton shirt with the sleeves cut off and large amounts of cloth "
"sewn in to make a padded vest.  It would be fashionable, if not for all the "
"disparate colors from the patchwork cotton cannibalized from other random "
"clothes."
msgstr ""
"袖を切り取った厚手の綿製シャツに、大量の布を縫い付けて中綿入りベストのようにしたものです。様々な生地から適当に集めた布のデザインがバラバラでさえなければ、いい雰囲気の服に見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "hard chest guard"
msgid_plural "hard chest guards"
msgstr[0] "ハードチェストガード"

#. ~ Description of "hard chest guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid vest of plastic padding protecting your torso."
msgstr "プラスチック製プロテクターで補強された硬いベストです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "cuirass"
msgid_plural "cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "キュイラス"

#. ~ Description of "cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A steel breastplate, and a vital part of plate armor.  Even as full armor "
"went into decline, cuirasses remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr "プレートアーマーの重要なパーツである、鋼鉄製の胸当てです。鎧装備が衰退した後も、胸当ては騎兵用装備としてヨーロッパで使われ続けました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "XL cuirass"
msgid_plural "XL cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "XLキュイラス"

#. ~ Item name
