msgstr[0] "対爆ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "EOD jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick armored jacket constructed from Kevlar and Nomex for use by "
"explosive ordnance disposal technicians."
msgstr "爆発物処理担当者が着用する、ケブラーとノーメックスで作られた厚手の装甲ジャケットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "light EOD jacket"
msgid_plural "light EOD jackets"
msgstr[0] "軽装対爆ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "light EOD jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"An armored jacket constructed from Kevlar and Nomex for use by explosive "
"ordnance disposal technicians.  It is lighter than normal EOD armor to "
"provide more maneuverability and can be worn over ballistic armor."
msgstr ""
"爆発物処理担当者が着用する、ケブラーとノーメックスで作られた装甲ジャケットです。通常の対爆ジャケットよりも軽いため機動性に優れており、防弾ベストと重ねて着用できます。"

