msgid "smg"
msgstr "サブマシンガン"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/json/items/classes/magazine.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/rifle.json
msgid "ammo belt"
msgid_plural "ammo belts"
msgstr[0] "弾帯"

#. ~ Description of magazine "ammo belt"
#: data/json/items/classes/magazine.json
msgid ""
"An ammo belt consisting of metal linkages which disintegrate upon firing."
msgstr "弾薬が長い帯状に連なった弾帯です。金属製の部品が発射時に分解され、空薬莢とともに地面にばら撒かれます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Mycus wine"
msgid_plural "Mycus wine"
msgstr[0] "ミカズワイン"

#. ~ Description of "Mycus wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Goopy white wine, made of the Mycus fruit."
msgstr "ミカズフルーツから作られた濃厚な白ワインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Marloss wine"
msgid_plural "Marloss wine"
msgstr[0] "マーロスワイン"

#. ~ Description of "Marloss wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A viscous, soft pink wine, made from the fruit of the Marloss."
msgstr "マーロスの果実から作られた、薄桃色の濃厚なワインです。"

#. ~ Booze uses nonstandard charge counts: 15 shots of wine to the 750mL
#. bottle.  Priced at 1100 translates to $33 per, because it's still priced
#. per 250 mL charge.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Riesling"
msgid_plural "Riesling"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ﾘｰｽﾘﾝｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Booze uses nonstandard charge counts: 15 shots of wine to the 750mL
#. bottle.  Priced at 1100 translates to $33 per, because it's still priced
#. per 250 mL charge.
#. ~ Description of "Riesling"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Sparkling white wine, made from the world's noblest grape."
msgstr "世界で最も高貴な葡萄から作られた発泡性の白ワインです。"

#. ~ The PLCB can get you some for around $10 per 750mL, but I imagine you
#. want to pay for better ~fermentation~.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Chardonnay"
msgid_plural "Chardonnay"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ｼｬﾙﾄﾞﾈ)"

#. ~ The PLCB can get you some for around $10 per 750mL, but I imagine you
#. want to pay for better ~fermentation~.
#. ~ Description of "Chardonnay"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "America's most popular wine, and for good reason."
msgstr "米国で最も人気のあるワインです。評判通りのおいしさ。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Cabernet Sauvignon"
msgid_plural "Cabernet Sauvignon"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ｶﾍﾞﾙﾈ･ｿｰﾋﾞﾆﾖﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of "Cabernet Sauvignon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"The heavily disputed king of red wines.  Pairs well with red meats and "
"pasta."
msgstr "賛否はありますが、赤ワインの王様です。赤身肉やパスタとの相性が抜群です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Pinot noir"
msgid_plural "Pinot noir"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ﾋﾟﾉ･ﾉﾜｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of "Pinot noir"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Prized by collectors and adored by critics, this is one of the rarer and "
"more elegant wines."
msgstr "収集家に珍重され批評家に愛されている、世にも珍しく優雅なワインの一つです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "marsala"
msgid_plural "marsala"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ﾏﾙｻﾗ)"

#. ~ Description of "marsala"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A wine popularly used in dishes served in Italian restaurants."
msgstr "イタリア料理レストランで一般的に提供されるワインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vermouth"
msgid_plural "vermouth"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ﾍﾞﾙﾓｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "vermouth"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A soft wine with a pleasant herbal flavor and aroma.  It is a common "
"cocktail ingredient, and can be used as a substitute for white wine."
msgstr "香草の風味と香りが心地よい、口当たりの優しいワインです。一般的なカクテルの材料であり、白ワインの代替品としても利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "barley wine"
msgid_plural "barley wine"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ﾊﾞｰﾚｰﾜｲﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of "barley wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Despite the name, this is technically a strong beer and not wine, but "
"there's no need to be pedantic about it."
msgstr "ワインと呼ばれてはいますが、厳密にはアルコール度数の高いビールです。酒の前でそんな細かい話は止しましょう。"

#. ~ Given the comment, presuming we're taking bourbon here.
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Normal whiskey has been greatly devalued in the apocalypse by the
#. disproportionate quantity of endless whiskey flasks in comparison to the
#. number of survivors.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "whiskey"
msgid_plural "whiskey"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー"

#. ~ Given the comment, presuming we're taking bourbon here.
#. ~ Description of "whiskey"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled grain alcohol, made from, by, and for real Southern colonels!"
msgstr "南部の土地で南部人によって造られた、南部の名将のための蒸留酒です！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka"
msgid_plural "vodka"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカ"

#. ~ Description of "vodka"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A beverage of alcohol, water, and not much else.  In America, men make "
"vodka, but in Soviet Russia, vodka makes the man."
msgstr "アルコールと水分以外の何物でもない飲み物です。アメリカでは人間がウォッカを造りますが、ソビエトロシアではウォッカが人間を造ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "gin"
msgid_plural "gin"
msgstr[0] "ジン"

#. ~ Description of "gin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"An alcoholic beverage flavored with juniper berries.  It smells faintly of "
"berries, but mostly booze."
msgstr "ジュニパーベリーの風味を付けたアルコール飲料です。ほのかに果実の香りがしますが、ほぼ酒の味しかしません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "rum"
msgid_plural "rum"
msgstr[0] "ラム酒"

#. ~ Description of "rum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermenting molasses.  Drinking it "
"might make you feel like a pirate.  Or not."
msgstr "糖蜜を発酵させた蒸留酒です。飲めば海賊気分を味わえる、かもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "tequila"
msgid_plural "tequila"
msgstr[0] "テキーラ"

#. ~ Description of "tequila"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled alcoholic beverage made from a succulent plant with spiky "
"leaves.  Don't eat the worm!  Wait, there's no worm in this bottle."
msgstr "棘付きの葉をもつ多肉植物から作られた蒸留酒です。瓶の中の虫は食べないでください！おや、これは虫が入っていないタイプでした。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "triple sec"
msgid_plural "triple sec"
msgstr[0] "トリプルセック"

#. ~ Description of "triple sec"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "An orange-flavored liquor used in many mixed drinks."
msgstr "多くの混合酒に使われている、オレンジ風味のリキュールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sake"
msgid_plural "sake"
msgstr[0] "日本酒"

#. ~ Description of "sake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A Japanese alcoholic beverage made by fermenting rice with the use of yeast "
"and koji mold.  This one is mostly clear, as it has been filtered."
msgstr "米を酵母と麹菌で発酵させて作った、日本のアルコール飲料です。ろ過しているため、ほとんど透明です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "nigori sake"
msgid_plural "nigori sake"
msgstr[0] "濁り酒"

#. ~ Description of "nigori sake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A Japanese alcoholic beverage made by fermenting rice with the use of yeast "
"and koji mold.  This one has a cloudy white color because of fine rice "
"particles in it, as it has not been filtered."
msgstr "米を酵母と麹菌で発酵させて作った、日本のアルコール飲料です。ろ過していないため細かい米の粒子が残り、白く濁っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "cheap wine"
msgid_plural "cheap wine"
msgstr[0] "安物ワイン"

#. ~ Description of "cheap wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Really cheap fortified wine."
msgstr "非常に安価な酒精強化ワインです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "strong mixed alcohol"
msgid_plural "strong mixed alcohol"
msgstr[0] "混合アルコール(強)"

#. ~ Description of "strong mixed alcohol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Strong alcoholic drinks, mixed with no regard for taste."
msgstr "度数の高い酒類を、味などお構いなしに混合した飲み物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "weak mixed alcohol"
msgid_plural "weak mixed alcohol"
msgstr[0] "混合アルコール(弱)"

#. ~ Description of "weak mixed alcohol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Weak alcoholic drinks, mixed with no regard for taste."
msgstr "度数の低い酒類を、味などお構いなしに混合した飲み物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "fruit wine"
msgid_plural "fruit wine"
msgstr[0] "果実酒"

#. ~ Description of "fruit wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Cheap booze made from fermented fruit juice.  Tastes as good as it sounds."
msgstr "果汁を発酵させて作る手頃な酒です。味は意外と悪くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "brandy"
msgid_plural "brandy"
msgstr[0] "ブランデー"

#. ~ Description of "brandy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Wine that has been distilled to a higher proof.  Great as an after-dinner "
"drink, but packs a punch."
msgstr "果実酒を蒸留して作られる度数の高い酒です。食後酒として好まれますが、なかなかガツンと効きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Queen Mary cocktail"
msgid_plural "Queen Mary cocktail"
msgstr[0] "クイーンメアリー"

#. ~ Description of "Queen Mary cocktail"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A cocktail made by mixing beer and grenadine syrup.  It's quite sweet."
msgstr "ビールにグレナデンシロップを混ぜて作った、かなり甘いカクテルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Irish coffee"
msgid_plural "Irish coffee"
msgstr[0] "アイリッシュコーヒー"

#. ~ Description of "Irish coffee"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Sweetened coffee and whiskey topped with milk.  Start your day the closeted "
"alcoholic way!"
msgstr "砂糖入りコーヒーとウイスキーを混ぜて牛乳を加えた飲み物です。アルコール中毒者らしく一日を始めましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "karsk"
msgid_plural "karsk"
msgstr[0] "カシュク"

#. ~ Description of "karsk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A cocktail made by mixing coffee and pure alcohol, typically moonshine, "
"originating from Scandinavia.  Sometimes sugar is also added."
msgstr "自家醸造酒などの純アルコールをコーヒーで割った、北欧発祥のカクテルです。砂糖を加えて作ることもあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "gunfire cocktail"
msgid_plural "gunfire cocktail"
msgstr[0] "ガンファイア"

#. ~ Description of "gunfire cocktail"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A cocktail made by mixing black tea and rum, which has its origins in the "
"British Army."
msgstr "紅茶とラム酒を混ぜて作った、イギリス軍に起源をもつカクテルです。"

#. ~ Includes cola, so presumed to be a 250mL cocktail like the others.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Long Island iced tea"
msgid_plural "Long Island iced tea"
msgstr[0] "ロングアイランドアイスティー"

#. ~ Includes cola, so presumed to be a 250mL cocktail like the others.
#. ~ Description of "Long Island iced tea"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A blend of incredibly strong-flavored liquors that somehow tastes like none "
"of them.  It contains no tea, but the inclusion of cola gives it a tea-like "
"color."
msgstr ""
"どういうわけか、どの材料のものでもない非常に強い風味が感じられるカクテルです。紅茶は入っていませんが、コーラを使って紅茶のような色味を出しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "screwdriver cocktail"
msgid_plural "screwdriver cocktails"
msgstr[0] "スクリュードライバー"

#. ~ Description of "screwdriver cocktail"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mix of orange juice and vodka.  It's the surreptitious drunkard mechanic's"
" drink of choice.  A similar drink may be made by substituting cranberry "
"juice for orange juice."
msgstr ""
"オレンジジュースとウォッカを使ったカクテルです。飲んだくれの整備士がこっそり酔うために作ったと言われています。オレンジジュースの代わりにクランベリージュースを使っても似たようなカクテルが作れます。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "screwdriver cocktail" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. cranberry_juice
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka cranberry"
msgid_plural "vodka cranberry"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカクランベリー"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "wild apple"
msgid_plural "wild apple"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドアップル"

#. ~ Description of "wild apple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Like apple cider, only with vodka."
msgstr "アップルサイダー風味のウォッカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "rum & cola"
msgid_plural "rum & cola"
msgstr[0] "ラムコーク"

#. ~ Description of "rum & cola"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Suitable for tropical retreats and Canadian artists alike.  In certain "
"variants, whiskey or sake is substituted for rum."
msgstr "南国の別荘やカナダ人の芸術家によく似合うカクテルです。ラム酒の代わりにウイスキーや日本酒を使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "rum & cola" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. whiskey
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "whiskey and cola"
msgid_plural "whiskey and cola"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキーコーク"

#. ~ Conditional name for "rum & cola" when COMPONENT_ID matches sake_filtered
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sake and cola"
msgid_plural "sake and cola"
msgstr[0] "サケコーク"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "gin and tonic"
msgid_plural "gin and tonic"
msgstr[0] "ジントニック"

#. ~ Description of "gin and tonic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mixed alcoholic drink consisting of gin and tonic water, created in the "
"19th century as a way to make tonic water (a malaria prophylactic) more "
"palatable, but still popular to this day.  In certain variants, vodka is "
"substituted for gin."
msgstr ""
"ジンとトニックウォーターを使った混合アルコール飲料です。19世紀、マラリア予防に使われたトニックウォーターを飲みやすくするために作られ、現在も高い人気を誇っています。ジンの代わりにウォッカを使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "gin and tonic" when COMPONENT_ID matches vodka
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka and tonic"
msgid_plural "vodka and tonic"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカトニック"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "pina colada"
msgid_plural "pina colada"
msgstr[0] "ピニャコラーダ"

#. ~ Description of "pina colada"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A cocktail consisting of pineapple juice, coconut milk, and rum, originating"
" in Puerto Rico.  In certain variants, vodka, whiskey, or tequila are "
"substituted for rum."
msgstr ""
"パイナップルジュース、ココナッツミルク、ラム酒を使ったプエルトリコ発祥のカクテルです。ラム酒の代わりにウォッカやウイスキーを使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "pina colada" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. whiskey
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Scotsman colada"
msgid_plural "Scotsman colada"
msgstr[0] "スコッツマンコラーダ"

#. ~ Conditional name for "pina colada" when COMPONENT_ID matches vodka
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "chi chi"
msgid_plural "chi chi"
msgstr[0] "チチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for "pina colada" when COMPONENT_ID matches tequila
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "tequila colada"
msgid_plural "tequila colada"
msgstr[0] "テキーラコラーダ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "tequila sunrise"
msgid_plural "tequila sunrise"
msgstr[0] "テキーラサンライズ"

#. ~ Description of "tequila sunrise"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A cocktail consisting of tequila, orange juice, and grenadine syrup, "
"originating from California.  In certain variants, vodka or rum may be "
"substituted for tequila, and pineapple juice may be substituted for orange "
"juice."
msgstr ""
"テキーラ、オレンジジュース、グレナデンシロップを使ったカリフォルニア発祥のカクテルです。テキーラの代わりにウォッカやラム酒を、オレンジジュースの代わりにパイナップルジュースを使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "tequila sunrise" when COMPONENT_ID matches vodka
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka sunrise"
msgid_plural "vodka sunrise"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカサンライズ"

#. ~ Conditional name for "tequila sunrise" when COMPONENT_ID matches rum
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Caribbean sunrise"
msgid_plural "Caribbean sunrise"
msgstr[0] "カリビアンサンライズ"

#. ~ Conditional name for "tequila sunrise" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. pineapple_juice
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Panama sunrise"
msgid_plural "Panama sunrise"
msgstr[0] "パナマサンライズ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "beer"
msgid_plural "beer"
msgstr[0] "ビール"

#. ~ Description of "beer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A generic-brand grain alcohol flavored with hops.  It's best served cold, in"
" a glass, and with a lime - but you're not that lucky."
msgstr ""
"ホップの風味が香る、一般的な穀物アルコール飲料です。冷やしてからグラスに注ぎ、ライムを添えて飲むのが一番ですが...そこまで幸運ではありませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "hops spiced mead"
msgid_plural "hops spiced mead"
msgstr[0] "ホップスパイスミード"

#. ~ Description of "hops spiced mead"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Well-aged honey wine, spiced with a hint of hops.  Goes down bittersweet."
msgstr "ホップを加えて発酵させた蜂蜜酒です。ほろ苦い飲み口になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "hopped mead"
msgid_plural "hopped mead"
msgstr[0] "ホップミード"

#. ~ Description of "hopped mead"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Homebrewed honey wine, spiced with a bit of hops.  Goes down bittersweet."
msgstr "自家製の蜂蜜酒にホップを少し加えた、ほろ苦い飲み物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "plain mead"
msgid_plural "plain mead"
msgstr[0] "プレーンミード"

#. ~ Description of "plain mead"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Homebrewed honey wine, a smooth and silky golden beverage."
msgstr "自家製の蜂蜜酒です。滑らかで柔らかい飲み口の、黄金色の飲み物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiced mead"
msgid_plural "spiced mead"
msgstr[0] "スパイスミード"

#. ~ Description of "spiced mead"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Homebrewed spiced honey wine, a tasty beverage that can be served hot or "
"cold."
msgstr "温めても冷やしても美味しく飲める、スパイスを加えた自家製の蜂蜜酒です。"

#. ~ Nope, homebrew is not more expensive than pinot noir, sorry.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "dandelion wine"
msgid_plural "dandelion wine"
msgstr[0] "タンポポ酒"

#. ~ Nope, homebrew is not more expensive than pinot noir, sorry.
#. ~ Description of "dandelion wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A light and delicious wine made from dandelion flowers.  Slightly "
"effervescent, it is smooth and crisp."
msgstr "タンポポの花から作られた口当たりが軽く美味しいワインです。若干の発泡性があり、滑らかで清々しい味わいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "burdock wine"
msgid_plural "burdock wine"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウワイン"

#. ~ Description of "burdock wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A light and delicious wine made from burdock roots.  Somewhat sweet."
msgstr "ゴボウの根から作られた、口当たりが軽く美味しいワインです。ほのかな甘みがあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "pine wine"
msgid_plural "pine wine"
msgstr[0] "松脂ワイン"

#. ~ Description of "pine wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A potent wine flavored with pine resin.  Bold and pungent, its biting taste "
"and strong aroma takes some getting used to."
msgstr "香料として松脂を使った辛口のワインです。力強い芳香と刺激的な味が特徴的です。癖が強いので多少の慣れが必要でしょうか。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "homebrew beer"
msgid_plural "homebrew beer"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造ビール"

#. ~ Description of "homebrew beer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Not the finest drink you've had, but hey, it's alcohol by the gallon."
msgstr "最上の飲み物ではないでしょうが、ほら、ガロン単位のアルコールだよ。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "moonshine"
msgid_plural "moonshine"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造酒"

#. ~ Description of "moonshine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Only the strongest, purest, good ol' fashioned hooch, distilled from corn "
"(or pumpkin) and sugar.  Guaranteed to make you forget about the whole "
"Cataclysm thing, or you get your vision back."
msgstr ""
"トウモロコシ(またはカボチャ)と砂糖から蒸留された、最も強く、最も純粋な、古き良き時代の自家醸造酒です。大変動の諸々を忘れさせてくれる、あるいはかつての情景を蘇らせてくれること請け合いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "European pilsner"
msgid_plural "European pilsner"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ﾖｰﾛﾋﾟｱﾝﾋﾟﾙｽﾅｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "European pilsner"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A lager beer imported from Europe.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr "ヨーロッパから輸入されたラガービールです。冷やしてからグラスに注いで飲むのが一番ですが...そこまで幸運ではありませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "American pale ale"
msgid_plural "American pale ale"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ｱﾒﾘｶﾝﾍﾟｰﾙｴｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of "American pale ale"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A tasty domestic craft beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but you're not "
"that lucky."
msgstr "味わい深い国産クラフトビールです。冷やしてからグラスに注いで飲むのが一番ですが...そこまで幸運ではありませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "India pale ale"
msgid_plural "India pale ale"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ｲﾝﾃﾞｨｱﾍﾟｰﾙｴｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of "India pale ale"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful microbrewed beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr "非常に風味が豊かな地ビールです。冷やしてからグラスに注いで飲むのが一番ですが...そこまで幸運ではありませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "stout"
msgid_plural "stout"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ｽﾀｳﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "stout"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A tasty craft beer, as dark in color as the days ahead."
msgstr "味わい深い地ビールです。まるでこれからの未来を暗示するかのような暗色をしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Belgian ale"
msgid_plural "Belgian ale"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ﾍﾞﾙｼﾞｬﾝｴｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of "Belgian ale"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A flavorful and filling beer brewed by monks in Belgium.  Best served in a "
"goblet."
msgstr "ベルギーの修道士によって醸造された、風味豊かで濃厚なビールです。ゴブレットに注いで飲むのが一番です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "imperial stout"
msgid_plural "imperial stout"
msgstr[0] "ビール(ｲﾝﾍﾟﾘｱﾙｽﾀｳﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "imperial stout"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful beer that has been aged in bourbon barrels.  It is as black"
" as midnight on a moonless night and has the viscosity of oil.  While very "
"tasty, it also has an alcohol content on par with wine."
msgstr ""
"バーボン樽で熟成された、非常に風味豊かなビールです。新月の闇夜のような漆黒色の液体には、オイルのような粘性があります。非常に美味しいですが、ワイン並みの高アルコール飲料です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "strawberry surprise"
msgid_plural "strawberry surprises"
msgstr[0] "ストロベリーサプライズ"

#. ~ Description of "strawberry surprise"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Strawberries left to ferment with a few other choice ingredients offer up a "
"surprisingly palatable mixture; you barely even have to force yourself to "
"drink it after the first few gulps."
msgstr "イチゴと数種類の材料を発酵させた、素晴らしく風味の良い混合物です。一口飲んだら止まらないこと請け合いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "boozeberry"
msgid_plural "boozeberries"
msgstr[0] "ブーズベリー"

#. ~ Description of "boozeberry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This fermented blueberry mixture is surprisingly hearty, though the soup-"
"like consistency is slightly unsettling no matter how much you drink."
msgstr "発酵させたブルーベリーが入った、驚くほどボリュームたっぷりのお酒です。どろどろしたスープ状で、ちゃんと飲み干せるか不安になります。"

#. ~ Priced by the 100 liter barrel, this is multiplied by 400 to achieve the
#. final cost.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "single malt whiskey"
msgid_plural "single malt whiskey"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(ｼﾝｸﾞﾙﾓﾙﾄ)"

#. ~ Priced by the 100 liter barrel, this is multiplied by 400 to achieve the
#. final cost.
#. ~ Description of "single malt whiskey"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Only the finest whiskey straight from the bung."
msgstr "それぞれの蒸留所で作られた最上のウイスキーをその場で瓶詰めしたものが、シングルモルト・ウイスキーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "single pot still Irish whiskey"
msgid_plural "single pot still Irish whiskey"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(ｱｲﾘｯｼｭ)"

#. ~ Description of "single pot still Irish whiskey"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A whiskey made from a mixed mash of malted and unmalted barley."
msgstr "大麦の麦芽と生大麦を混合したマッシュから作ったウイスキーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "cheap whiskey"
msgid_plural "cheap whiskey"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(安物)"

#. ~ Description of "cheap whiskey"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Really cheap blended whiskey."
msgstr "非常に安価なブレンデッドウイスキーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Canadian whiskey"
msgid_plural "Canadian whiskey"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(ｶﾅﾃﾞｨｱﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of "Canadian whiskey"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A multi-grain liquor made from a mash of corn and rye."
msgstr "トウモロコシとライ麦のマッシュから作った酒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sherry"
msgid_plural "sherry"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ｼｪﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "sherry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"East India Solera.  A true drink of a British gentleman.  Sherry, Niles?"
msgstr "イースト・インディア・ソレラと呼ばれるこのワインは、英国紳士のための真の酒です。フレイジャー・クレイン氏もお勧めしていますよ？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Bristol Cream"
msgid_plural "Bristol Cream"
msgstr[0] "ワイン(ﾌﾞﾘｽﾄﾙ･ｸﾘｰﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of "Bristol Cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A fine sherry that has been aged in American oak casks and bottled in "
"Bristol, England."
msgstr "アメリカのオーク樽で熟成され、イギリスのブリストルで瓶詰めされた高級なシェリーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Madeira wine"
msgid_plural "Madeira wine"
msgstr[0] "マデイラワイン"

#. ~ Description of "Madeira wine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Fortified wine from Madeira.  A true Royal Navy drink."
msgstr "マデイラ島産の酒精強化ワインです。英国海軍のための真の酒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "fancy hobo"
msgid_plural "fancy hobo"
msgstr[0] "ファンシーホーボー"

#. ~ Description of "fancy hobo"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "This definitely tastes like a hobo drink."
msgstr "まるで浮浪者が飲む酒のような味です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "kalimotxo"
msgid_plural "kalimotxo"
msgstr[0] "カリモーチョ"

#. ~ Description of "kalimotxo"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mix of equal parts wine and cola, originating in Spain in the 1920s.  "
"Tastes better than it sounds."
msgstr "1920年代にスペインで生まれた、ワインとコーラを同量ずつ混ぜ合わせた飲料です。味は意外と悪くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "bee's knees"
msgid_plural "bee's knees"
msgstr[0] "ビーズニーズ"

#. ~ Description of "bee's knees"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This cocktail dates from the Prohibition era.  Gin, honey and lemon in a "
"delightful mix."
msgstr "禁酒法時代に考案されたカクテルです。ジンと蜂蜜とレモンの愉快な取り合わせです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "whiskey sour"
msgid_plural "whiskey sours"
msgstr[0] "ウィスキーサワー"

#. ~ Description of "whiskey sour"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mixed drink made of whiskey and lemon juice, with sugar added.  In certain"
" variants, gin is substituted for whiskey."
msgstr "ウイスキーにレモン汁と砂糖を加えたカクテルです。ウイスキーの代わりにジンを使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "whiskey sour" when COMPONENT_ID matches gin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "gin sour"
msgid_plural "gin sour"
msgstr[0] "ジンサワー"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "honeygold brew"
msgid_plural "honeygold brews"
msgstr[0] "黄金の蜂蜜酒"

#. ~ Description of "honeygold brew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mixed drink combining bee and ant honey.  It tastes great, and it's a good"
" source of nourishment."
msgstr "ミツバチが集めた蜜とアリが集めたハニーボールを混ぜた飲み物です。美味しく飲めて、栄養も補給できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "honey ball"
msgid_plural "honey balls"
msgstr[0] "ハニーボール"

#. ~ Description of "honey ball"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Droplet-shaped ant food.  It's like a thick balloon the size of a baseball, "
"filled with sticky liquid.  Unlike bee honey, this has mostly a sour taste, "
"probably because ants feed upon a variety of things."
msgstr ""
"しずく型をしたアリの食料です。野球ボール大の分厚い風船の中に、粘着質の液体が詰まっています。ミツバチとは違い、アリは様々な物から蜜を集めるので、酸っぱい味がします。"

#. ~ A 12-charge gallon currently goes for around US$4, and eggnog is a bit
#. more expensive than that.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiked eggnog"
msgid_plural "spiked eggnogs"
msgstr[0] "スパイクエッグノッグ"

#. ~ A 12-charge gallon currently goes for around US$4, and eggnog is a bit
#. more expensive than that.
#. ~ Description of "spiked eggnog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Smooth and rich, this spoon-coating mixture of milk, cream, eggs, and booze "
"is a popular traditional holiday drink.  Having been fortified with alcohol,"
" it will keep for a long time."
msgstr "牛乳、生クリーム、卵などを混ぜたクリスマスの定番飲料です。口当たりが滑らかでコクととろみがあります。アルコールに守られており長持ちします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "martini"
msgid_plural "martinis"
msgstr[0] "マティーニ"

#. ~ Description of "martini"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A popular cocktail made with gin and dry vermouth, dating from the "
"Prohibition era.  In certain variants, vodka or tequila is substituted for "
"gin."
msgstr ""
"禁酒法時代から存在する、ジンとドライベルモットで作る人気の高いカクテルです。ジンの代わりにウォッカやテキーラを使うバリエーションもあります。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "martini" when COMPONENT_ID matches tequila
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "tequini"
msgid_plural "tequini"
msgstr[0] "テキーニ"

#. ~ Conditional name for "martini" when COMPONENT_ID matches vodka
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka martini"
msgid_plural "vodka martini"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカマティーニ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Bloody Mary cocktail"
msgid_plural "Bloody Mary cocktails"
msgstr[0] "ブラッディメアリー"

#. ~ Description of "Bloody Mary cocktail"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Tomato juice mixed with vodka and some spices.  A hangover cure of choice "
"for many."
msgstr "トマトジュースにウォッカと複数の香辛料を混ぜたカクテルです。二日酔い時の迎え酒として広く飲まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "'very' Bloody Mary cocktail"
msgid_plural "'very' Bloody Mary cocktail"
msgstr[0] "ベリーブラッディメアリー"

#. ~ Description of "'very' Bloody Mary cocktail"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "This is definitely not tomato juice."
msgstr "間違いなくトマトジュース以外のものを使っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "hard seltzer"
msgid_plural "hard seltzer"
msgstr[0] "ハードセルツァー"

#. ~ Description of "hard seltzer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Alcoholic sparkling water infused with delicious fruit.  Perfect for a hot "
"summer day."
msgstr "美味しいフルーツが入ったアルコール入り炭酸水です。暑い夏の日の飲み物はこれに限ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "homebrew hard seltzer"
msgid_plural "homebrew hard seltzer"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造ハードセルツァー"

#. ~ Description of "homebrew hard seltzer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Alcoholic sparkling water infused with delicious fruit.  Perfect for a hot "
"summer day.  Tastes nearly as good as the one in the market."
msgstr "美味しいフルーツが入ったアルコール入り炭酸水です。暑い夏の日の飲み物はこれに限ります。市販の飲料とほぼ同じ味わいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/baked.json
msgid "pumpkin muffin"
msgid_plural "pumpkin muffin"
msgstr[0] "カボチャマフィン"

#. ~ Description of "pumpkin muffin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/baked.json
msgid "A baked pumpkin-apple muffin.  Perfect for a fall feast."
msgstr "カボチャが入ったリンゴ風味のマフィンです。秋のごちそうにぴったりですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "donut holes"
msgid_plural "donut holes"
msgstr[0] "ドーナツボール"

#. ~ Description of "donut holes"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"These balls of dough have been cut into shape, covered with sugar, and "
"cooked to a crisp.  A staple of fairgrounds everywhere."
msgstr "ボール状に整えられ、砂糖がまぶされ、カリカリに揚がったドーナツです。移動遊園地の定番スナックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "juvenile sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "juvenile sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "サワー種スターター"

#. ~ Description of "juvenile sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste that is slowly going bad.  Someday it will be sourdough."
msgstr "じわじわと発酵が進む粉っぽいペーストです。時間が経てばサワーブレッド生地に変化します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "juvenile sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"After feeding it and caring for it for a week, your sourdough starter is "
"finally ready for the big leagues."
msgstr "発酵が始まって数週間経ったサワー種です。大きく膨らむ準備が整いました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "juvenile sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"You've been caring for your starter for a while, but it's going to need "
"longer before you can do anything tasty with it."
msgstr "サワー種の発酵が始まってしばらく経ちましたが、美味しいパンを作るにはもう少し寝かせる必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "freshly fed sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "freshly fed sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "サワー種スターター(種継)"

#. ~ Description of "freshly fed sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste with sourdough starter mixed in.  It needs a day to recover "
"its strength before it can be used again."
msgstr "サワー種が混ざった粉っぽいペーストです。生地として使い物になるまで1日待つ必要があります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "freshly fed sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter is now stinky and bubbly, and looks ready for cooking."
msgstr "サワー種は匂いを放ち、泡立っています。準備は整ったようです。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "freshly fed sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter isn't quite ready to go."
msgstr "まだサワー種の準備が整っていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "サワーブレッド生地"

#. ~ Description of "sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A precious mix of flour, water, molds, and bacteria from the air.  When you "
"add flour and water to it, after a few hours it froths and rises."
msgstr "穀粉、水、空気中の菌を混ぜ合わせた生地です。穀粉と水を加えると、数時間後には泡を立てて発酵が始まります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough bread"
msgid_plural "sourdough bread"
msgstr[0] "サワーブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "sourdough bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling, with a sharper taste and thicker crust than yeast-only "
"bread."
msgstr "酵母のみで作ったものよりも酸味が強く表皮が硬いパンです。健康的かつお腹も膨れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "flatbread"
msgid_plural "flatbread"
msgstr[0] "フラットブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "flatbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Simple unleavened bread."
msgstr "無発酵のシンプルなパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free flatbread"
msgid_plural "wheat-free flatbread"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用フラットブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free flatbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Simple unleavened bread made with wheat-free flour."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないシンプルなパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "bread"
msgid_plural "bread"
msgstr[0] "パン"

#. ~ Description of "bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A humble piece of bread, one of the single most important staple foods of "
"human civilization since the dawn of agriculture."
msgstr "質素なパンです。農耕が始まって以来、人類の文明の中でも特に重要な主食の一つです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free bread"
msgid_plural "wheat-free bread"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用パン"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A piece of bread made from wheat-free flour, one of the single most "
"important staple foods of human civilization since the discovery of glucose "
"intolerance."
msgstr "材料に穀物を使っていない質素なパンです。グルテン不耐症の発見以来、人類の文明の中でも特に重要な主食の一つです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "garlic bread"
msgid_plural "garlic bread"
msgstr[0] "ガーリックトースト"

#. ~ Description of "garlic bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Bread cooked with garlic, oil, and seasonings."
msgstr "パンにニンニク、油、調味料を塗って焼いたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "toast"
msgid_plural "toast"
msgstr[0] "トースト"

#. ~ Description of "toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of bread with heat applied to crisp it up.  It's a bit dry and would"
" likely go better with some toppings."
msgstr "焼いて歯切れがよくなったパンです。少しパサパサしており、何かトッピングがあれば更に美味しくなりそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free toast"
msgid_plural "wheat-free toast"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of wheat-free bread with heat applied to crisp it up.  It's a bit "
"dry and would likely go better with some toppings."
msgstr "焼いて歯切れがよくなった、穀物が入っていないパンです。少しパサパサしており、何かトッピングがあれば更に美味しくなりそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "buttered toast"
msgid_plural "buttered toast"
msgstr[0] "トースト(バター)"

#. ~ Description of "buttered toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A slice of toast with butter spread on top to make it taste better."
msgstr "パンにバターを塗ったら、更に美味しくなりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free buttered toast"
msgid_plural "wheat-free buttered toast"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト(バター)"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free buttered toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of wheat-free toast with butter spread on top to make it taste "
"better."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないパンにバターを塗ったら、更に美味しくなりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "jam toast"
msgid_plural "jam toast"
msgstr[0] "トースト(ジャム)"

#. ~ Description of "jam toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of toast with jam added, to make it less dry and to add more flavor."
msgstr "パンにジャムを塗り、パサパサ感を解消して風味を出しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free jam toast"
msgid_plural "wheat-free jam toast"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト(ジャム)"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free jam toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of wheat-free toast with jam added, to make it less dry and to add "
"more flavor."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないパンにジャムを塗り、パサパサ感を解消して風味を出しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "peanut butter toast"
msgid_plural "peanut butter toast"
msgstr[0] "トースト(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "peanut butter toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slathering of peanut butter gives more heartiness and calories to a slice "
"of toast."
msgstr "パンにピーナッツバターを塗り、食べ応えとカロリーを増やしました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free peanut butter toast"
msgid_plural "wheat-free peanut butter toast"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free peanut butter toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slathering of peanut butter gives more heartiness and calories to a slice "
"of wheat-free toast."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないパンにピーナッツバターを塗り、食べ応えとカロリーを増やしました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "toad in a hole"
msgid_plural "toad in a hole"
msgstr[0] "トースト(卵)"

#. ~ Description of "toad in a hole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A cooked egg served inside a piece of toast, not to be confused with the "
"English recipe of the same name."
msgstr "パンの上に卵をのせて焼いた料理です。トード・イン・ザ・ホールとも呼ばれますが、同名のイギリス料理とは別物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free toad in a hole"
msgid_plural "wheat-free toad in a hole"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト(卵)"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free toad in a hole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A cooked egg served inside a piece of wheat-free toast, not to be confused "
"with the English recipe of the same name."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないパンの上に卵をのせてトーストしたものです。トード・イン・ザ・ホールとも呼ばれますが、同名のイギリス料理とは別物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "PBJ Toast"
msgid_plural "PBJ Toast"
msgstr[0] "トースト(PB&J)"

#. ~ Description of "PBJ Toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of toast with peanut butter and jelly on top, with added butter for "
"flavor."
msgstr "パンにピーナッツバターとジャムを塗り、更にバターを加えて風味を出しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free PBJ Toast"
msgid_plural "wheat-free PBJ Toast"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用トースト(PB&J)"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free PBJ Toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of wheat-free toast with peanut butter and jelly on top, with added "
"butter for flavor."
msgstr "穀物が入っていないパンパンにピーナッツバターとジャムを塗り、更にバターを加えて風味を出しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "cornbread"
msgid_plural "cornbread"
msgstr[0] "コーンブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "cornbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling cornbread, a Native American recipe that quickly became "
"a staple of U.S. cuisine."
msgstr "ヘルシーで食べ応えのあるコーンブレッドです。元はネイティブアメリカンの食べ物でしたが、すぐにアメリカの食卓の定番になりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "johnnycake"
msgid_plural "johnnycakes"
msgstr[0] "コーンケーキ"

#. ~ Description of "johnnycake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A dense and tasty fried bread treat."
msgstr "腹持ちがよく美味しい揚げパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "corn tortilla"
msgid_plural "corn tortillas"
msgstr[0] "トルティーヤ"

#. ~ Description of "corn tortilla"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A round, thin flatbread made from finely ground corn flour."
msgstr "トウモロコシの粉で作った、薄くて円い平パンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "hardtack"
msgid_plural "hardtack"
msgstr[0] "堅パン"

#. ~ Description of "hardtack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A dry, virtually tasteless bread product capable of remaining edible without"
" spoilage for vast lengths of time.  So dry it is almost inedible by itself."
msgstr "長期間腐らせずに食べられる、カラカラに乾いたほとんど味がしないパンです。水気がなさすぎて、そのまま食べるのは非常に困難です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "soggy hardtack"
msgid_plural "soggy hardtack"
msgstr[0] "水戻し堅パン"

#. ~ Description of "soggy hardtack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A soggy, virtually tasteless bread product that has soaked up enough water "
"that it won't hurt your teeth when you chew it."
msgstr "噛んでも歯が痛くならない程度に柔らかい、水分を含んでフニャフニャになったほとんど味がしないパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "biscuit"
msgid_plural "biscuits"
msgstr[0] "ビスケット"

#. ~ Description of "biscuit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Hardtack's much more palatable descendant, thanks in large part to the "
"addition of milk in the recipe.  Crumbly on the outside, soft on the inside,"
" and delicious all the way through."
msgstr "材料に牛乳を足すことで非常に食べやすくなった堅パンです。外はカリカリ、中はサクサクしており、残さず美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ this item will generally inherit its values, so it is essentially a copy
#. of bread
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wastebread"
msgid_plural "wastebread"
msgstr[0] "廃棄パン"

#. ~ this item will generally inherit its values, so it is essentially a copy
#. of bread
#. ~ Description of "wastebread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Flour is a commodity these days and to deal with that, most survivors resort"
" to mixing it with leftovers of other ingredients and baking it all into "
"bread.  It's filling, and that's what matters."
msgstr "穀粉は今や貴重であり、生存者の多くは穀粉と他の食料の残りかすを混ぜ合わせて焼き上げ、パンを作っています。何よりも優先すべきは食べ応えです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "brown bread"
msgid_plural "brown bread"
msgstr[0] "ブラウンブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "brown bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Sweet bread made with molasses, with a consistency closer to cake."
msgstr "糖蜜を使った、ケーキのように甘いパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wheat-free brown bread"
msgid_plural "wheat-free brown bread"
msgstr[0] "穀物不使用ブラウンブレッド"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free brown bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, wheat-free bread made with molasses, with a consistency closer to "
"cake."
msgstr "糖蜜を使った、穀物が入っておらずケーキのように甘いパンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "hallula"
msgid_plural "hallula"
msgstr[0] "アジュージャ"

#. ~ Description of "hallula"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A type of bread popular in Chile and Bolivia.  Prepared using animal lard or"
" oil, it resembles a large, round scone.  In the pre-Cataclysm world, it "
"would usually be filled with savory ingredients."
msgstr ""
"チリやボリビアで人気のあるパンの一種です。獣脂や油が入っており、見た目は大きな丸いスコーンに似ています。大変動以前の世界では、辛みのある食材を挟んで食べていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Mycus wine must"
msgid_plural "Mycus wine musts"
msgstr[0] "ミカズワイン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "Mycus wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented Mycus wine.  A goopy white mess, made from Mycus fruit.  It "
"smells sweetly of mushrooms."
msgstr "ミカズフルーツを原料とする、発酵前の濃厚な白ワインです。キノコの甘い香りがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Marloss wine must"
msgid_plural "Marloss wine musts"
msgstr[0] "マーロスワイン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "Marloss wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented Marloss wine.  A soft pinkish mess, made from Marloss berries.  "
"It has a strong aroma, but you're not quite sure if it's a good or bad one."
msgstr "発酵していないマーロスワインです。マーロスの果実から作られた薄桃色の液体からは強い香りが漂っていますが、出来の良し悪しはよく分かりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wort"
msgid_plural "whiskey worts"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "whiskey wort"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented whiskey.  The base of a fine drink.  Not the traditional "
"preparation, but you don't have the time."
msgstr "未発酵のウイスキーです。上質の酒を造る基礎になります。伝統的な仕込みの業も時間もないのが残念です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wash"
msgid_plural "whiskey washes"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー(未蒸留)"

#. ~ Description of "whiskey wash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled whiskey.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "発酵した後蒸留していないウイスキーです。全く甘みがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "gin mash"
msgid_plural "gin mashes"
msgstr[0] "ジン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "gin mash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Unfermented gin mash.  Fermenting it will produce gin."
msgstr "未発酵のジンです。発酵させると酒になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "gin wash"
msgid_plural "gin washes"
msgstr[0] "ジン(未蒸留)"

#. ~ Description of "gin wash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Gin wash, after the junipers have had time to add flavor.  Ready to be "
"distilled or drunk as is."
msgstr "ジュニパーベリーで風味をつけた、未蒸留のジンです。蒸留してもいいですが、そのまま飲むことも可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "sake mash"
msgid_plural "sake mash"
msgstr[0] "清酒もろみ"

#. ~ Description of "sake mash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"A fine mix of water, koji rice and yeast, ready to be fermented into sake "
"once set in a fermenting vat."
msgstr "水、米麹、酵母をよく混ぜ合わせたものです。発酵大桶に入れて発酵させれば、日本酒が完成します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "unfermented soy sauce"
msgid_plural "unfermented soy sauce"
msgstr[0] "醤油もろみ"

#. ~ Description of "unfermented soy sauce"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Brine with mashed soybeans, wheat flour and koji mold added to it.  If you "
"want to make soy sauce from this, the next step would be to let it ferment."
msgstr "塩水に潰した大豆と穀物、麹菌を加えたものです。発酵すれば醤油が完成します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "unstrained soy sauce"
msgid_plural "unstrained soy sauce"
msgstr[0] "生醤油"

#. ~ Description of "unstrained soy sauce"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Nearly-finished soy sauce that still has some solid particles floating in "
"it.  Still needs to be strained, and also pasteurized to get rid of harmful "
"bacteria."
msgstr "まだ固形物が混じっている、完成間近の醤油です。これをろ過し、低温殺菌で有害な細菌を取り除けば醤油になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "vodka wort"
msgid_plural "vodka worts"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカ(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "vodka wort"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented vodka.  Water with sugar from the enzymatic breakdown of malted "
"grains, or just added in pure form."
msgstr "発酵を終えていないウォッカです。酵素分解された麦芽や未分解の麦芽が混ざってできた甘い液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "vodka wash"
msgid_plural "vodka washes"
msgstr[0] "ウォッカ(未蒸留)"

#. ~ Description of "vodka wash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled vodka.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "発酵した後蒸留していないウォッカです。全く甘みがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "rum wort"
msgid_plural "rum worts"
msgstr[0] "ラム酒(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "rum wort"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented rum.  Sugar caramel or molasses brewed into sweet water.  "
"Basically a saccharine soup."
msgstr "未発酵のラム酒です。カラメルと糖蜜を水に溶かして仕込んでいます。まだ単なる甘ったるい液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "rum wash"
msgid_plural "rum washes"
msgstr[0] "ラム酒(未蒸留)"

#. ~ Description of "rum wash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled rum.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "発酵した後蒸留していないラム酒です。全く甘みがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "fruit wine must"
msgid_plural "fruit wine musts"
msgstr[0] "果実酒(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "fruit wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented fruit wine.  A sweet, boiled juice made from berries or fruit."
msgstr "未発酵の果実酒です。果物やベリーの搾り汁を煮沸した甘いジュースです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "plain mead must"
msgid_plural "plain mead musts"
msgstr[0] "プレーンミード(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "plain mead must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Unfermented plain mead.  Diluted honey and yeast."
msgstr "希釈した蜂蜜に酵母を加えた、未発酵の蜂蜜酒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "hopped mead must"
msgid_plural "hopped mead musts"
msgstr[0] "ホップミード(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "hopped mead must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented hopped mead.  Diluted honey cooked with hops for a bitter note, "
"then cooled down and infused with yeast."
msgstr "未発酵のホップ入り蜂蜜酒です。希釈した蜂蜜をホップと共に煮込んで苦味を出し、冷やしてから酵母を加えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "spiced mead must"
msgid_plural "spiced mead musts"
msgstr[0] "スパイスミード(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "spiced mead must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Unfermented spiced mead.  Diluted honey infused with spices and yeast."
msgstr "希釈した蜂蜜に酵母を加えた、未発酵の香辛料入り蜂蜜酒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "dandelion wine must"
msgid_plural "dandelion wine musts"
msgstr[0] "タンポポワイン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "dandelion wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented dandelion wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and "
"dandelion petals."
msgstr "タンポポの花を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、タンポポの花を混ぜて作った、粘り気のある液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "burdock wine must"
msgid_plural "burdock wine musts"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウワイン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "burdock wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented burdock wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and "
"burdock roots."
msgstr "ゴボウの根を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、ゴボウの根を混ぜて作った、粘り気のある液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "pine wine must"
msgid_plural "pine wine musts"
msgstr[0] "松脂ワイン(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "pine wine must"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented pine wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and pine "
"resin."
msgstr "松脂を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、松脂を混ぜて作った、粘り気のある液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "beer wort"
msgid_plural "beer worts"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造ビール(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "beer wort"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented homebrew beer.  A boiled and chilled mash of malted barley, "
"spiced with some fine hops."
msgstr "未発酵の自家醸造ビールです。大麦の麦芽もろみを煮沸してから冷やし、新鮮なホップで味を調えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "seltzer wort"
msgid_plural "seltzer worts"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造ハードセルツァー(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "seltzer wort"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented seltzer.  A boiled and chilled mash of refined sugar and fruit."
msgstr "精製した砂糖と果物を煮詰めて冷やした、未発酵のハードセルツァーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "moonshine mash"
msgid_plural "moonshine mashes"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造酒(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "moonshine mash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented moonshine.  Just some water, sugar and corn, like good ol' "
"auntie's recipe.  Using pumpkin instead of corn would reduce the amount of "
"extra sugar you need to add."
msgstr ""
"未発酵の自家醸造酒です。水と砂糖とトウモロコシしか使っていない、おばあちゃんが作る昔ながらの酒です。トウモロコシの代わりにカボチャを使えば、砂糖の含有量を減らせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "moonshine wash"
msgid_plural "moonshine washes"
msgstr[0] "自家醸造酒(未蒸留)"

#. ~ Description of "moonshine wash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Fermented, but not distilled moonshine.  Contains all the contaminants you "
"don't want in your moonshine."
msgstr "発酵した後蒸留していない自家醸造酒です。不純物が混ざっているので良い酒とは言えませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "curdling milk"
msgid_plural "curdling milks"
msgstr[0] "半凝乳"

#. ~ Description of "curdling milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Milk with vinegar and natural rennet added.  Used for making cheese if left "
"in a fermenting vat for some time."
msgstr "食用酢と天然レンネットを加えた乳です。チーズを作るにはこれを発酵大桶に入れてしばらく待ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "unfermented vinegar"
msgid_plural "unfermented vinegars"
msgstr[0] "食用酢(未発酵)"

#. ~ Description of "unfermented vinegar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of water, alcohol and fruit juice that will eventually become "
"vinegar when fermented in a vat."
msgstr "水とアルコール、フルーツジュースを混ぜ合わせた液体です。発酵大桶に入れてしばらく経つと酢になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "growing wild yeast"
msgid_plural "growing wild yeasts"
msgstr[0] "野生酵母(増殖)"

#. ~ Description of "growing wild yeast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"A sugary solution with some naturally occurring yeast.  If placed in a "
"fermenting vat and given time, it will eventually produce a more sizeable "
"yeast culture."
msgstr "糖分入りの水に天然酵母を加えた液体です。発酵大桶に入れてしばらく経つと酵母培養液になります。"

#. ~ Malt weight per volume taken from https://www.aqua-
#. calc.com/calculate/volume-to-weight
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "malting grain"
msgid_plural "malting grain"
msgstr[0] "発芽穀物(浸漬中)"

#. ~ Malt weight per volume taken from https://www.aqua-
#. calc.com/calculate/volume-to-weight
#. ~ Description of "malting grain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Malting grain that can be used for brewing."
msgstr "醸造に使うために水分に浸してある植物です。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "malting grain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "After soaking the grain and waiting, it has finished malting."
msgstr "穀物を水に浸してしばらく置くと、発芽穀物になりました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "malting grain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "The grain has not malted yet."
msgstr "穀物はまだ発芽していません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "malted grain"
msgid_plural "malted grain"
msgstr[0] "発芽穀物"

#. ~ Description of "malted grain"
#. ~ Description of "barley"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Grainy cereal used for malting.  A staple of brewing everywhere.  It can "
"also be ground into flour."
msgstr "主にビールやウイスキーの醸造に使われる穀物です。もちろん挽いて粉にして使うこともできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "soaking dandelion"
msgid_plural "soaking dandelion"
msgstr[0] "タンポポエキス(浸漬中)"

#. ~ Description of "soaking dandelion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Soaked dandelions that can be used for brewing."
msgstr "醸造できる、水に浸したタンポポです。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soaking dandelion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"After soaking the dandelions in boiling water, the juice can be used for "
"making wine."
msgstr "湯に浸したタンポポからエキスが十分に抽出されており、ワインを作ることができます。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soaking dandelion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "The dandelions need more time."
msgstr "タンポポエキスはもう少し置いておく必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "soaked dandelion"
msgid_plural "soaked dandelion"
msgstr[0] "タンポポエキス"

#. ~ Description of "soaked dandelion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Dandelions soaked in hot water, used for making dandelion wine."
msgstr "タンポポワインの材料となる、湯に浸したタンポポです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "fermenting yogurt"
msgid_plural "fermenting yogurts"
msgstr[0] "ヨーグルト(発酵中)"

#. ~ Description of "fermenting yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Milk inoculated with lactobacillus.  It requires some time fermenting to "
"hopefully end up as delicious yogurt."
msgstr "乳酸菌を混ぜた牛乳です。時間をかけて発酵させれば、美味しいヨーグルトが出来上がります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "fermenting yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"The milk has finished fermenting and turned into a slightly clumpy yogurt."
msgstr "牛乳の発酵が完了し、適度に固いヨーグルトになりました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "fermenting yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "The yogurt is still fermenting."
msgstr "まだヨーグルトの発酵が終わっていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "meat/fish"
msgid_plural "meat/fish"
msgstr[0] "肉/魚"

#. ~ Nutrition information based on whitefish
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "fillet of fish"
msgid_plural "fillets of fish"
msgstr[0] "魚肉"

#. ~ Nutrition information based on whitefish
#. ~ Description of "fillet of fish"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "An uncooked fish fillet.  Makes a passable meal raw."
msgstr "調理していない魚の切り身です。そのままでも十分食べられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "scrap of fish"
msgid_plural "scraps of fish"
msgstr[0] "屑魚肉"

#. ~ Description of "scrap of fish"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This is a tiny scrap of edible fish.  It's not much, but it'll do in a "
"pinch."
msgstr "食べられる魚の身の切れ端です。味は今一つですが、いざというときは食べるしかありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of fish"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of fish"
msgstr[0] "屑魚肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked fish"
msgid_plural "cooked fish"
msgstr[0] "魚肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked fish"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A cooked fish fillet.  Very nutritious."
msgstr "栄養価が高い、調理した魚の切り身です。"

#. ~ Nutrition information based on whitefish
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of lobster meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of lobster meat"
msgstr[0] "ロブスター"

#. ~ Nutrition information based on whitefish
#. ~ Description of "chunk of lobster meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A chunk of uncooked lobster meat."
msgstr "調理していないロブスターの身です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked lobster"
msgid_plural "cooked lobster"
msgstr[0] "ロブスター(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked lobster"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A chunk of delicious cooked lobster meat."
msgstr "美味しく調理されたロブスターの身です。"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on squid. if you know more pls expand
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "fillet of mollusk"
msgid_plural "fillets of mollusk"
msgstr[0] "貝肉"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on squid. if you know more pls expand
#. ~ Description of "fillet of mollusk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The raw flesh of a mollusk.  Must be cleaned and cooked before eating."
msgstr "軟体動物の切り身です。食べる前に洗って調理する必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked mollusk"
msgid_plural "cooked mollusk"
msgstr[0] "貝肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked mollusk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Cooked mollusk meat.  Devoid of any parasites or bacteria due to heat, the "
"only thing left to do is add sauce."
msgstr "調理した軟体動物の切り身です。熱を加えることで寄生虫や細菌を除去しました。後はソースがあればいいのですが。"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on a serving of 6 snails. if you know
#. more pls expand
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "purged gastropod"
msgid_plural "purged gastropods"
msgstr[0] "剥き身(湯煮)"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on a serving of 6 snails. if you know
#. more pls expand
#. ~ Description of "purged gastropod"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A handful of lucky gastropods that have been prepared for cooking by "
"repeatedly boiling and washing them to remove their mucus and pathogens."
msgstr "煮沸と洗浄を繰り返して粘液や病原体を完全に取り除いた、食べても安全な軟体動物の剥き身です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked gastropod"
msgid_plural "cooked gastropod"
msgstr[0] "剥き身(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked gastropod"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Cooked gastropods.  A bit low on calories, but high in protein."
msgstr "調理した貝肉です。カロリーはやや低いものの高タンパクです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "human stomach"
msgid_plural "human stomachs"
msgstr[0] "人間の胃"

#. ~ Description of "human stomach"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The stomach of a human.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "人間の胃袋です。耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "large human stomach"
msgid_plural "large human stomachs"
msgstr[0] "大きな人間の胃"

#. ~ Description of "large human stomach"
#. ~ Description of "large demihuman stomach"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The stomach of a large humanoid creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "大きな人型生物の胃袋です。耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of human fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of human fat"
msgstr[0] "人間の脂肪塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of human fat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A chunk of raw fat, harvested from a human body."
msgstr "人間から採取した脂肪です。"

#. ~ *May* have been commercially traded.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "human tallow"
msgid_plural "human tallows"
msgstr[0] "精製人脂"

#. ~ *May* have been commercially traded.
#. ~ Description of "human tallow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  It will remain "
"edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods "
"and projects."
msgstr "人間の脂肪を水と混合し高温で加熱して抽出した、白く滑らかな塊です。非常に長持ちし、多くの食品や道具の材料として利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "human lard"
msgid_plural "human lards"
msgstr[0] "人脂"

#. ~ Description of "human lard"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered human fat.  It will remain edible for a"
" very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many foods and "
"projects."
msgstr "人間の脂肪を高温で加熱して抽出した、白く滑らかな塊です。非常に長持ちし、多くの食品や道具の材料として利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "human flesh"
msgid_plural "human fleshes"
msgstr[0] "人肉"

#. ~ Description of "human flesh"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A chunk of raw meat, butchered from a human body."
msgstr "人間から採取した生の肉塊です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked creep"
msgid_plural "cooked creeps"
msgstr[0] "人肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked creep"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A cooked slice of some unpleasant person.  Tastes great."
msgstr "調理を施した、大嫌いなアイツの薄切り肉です。味は最高です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of meat"
msgstr[0] "肉塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of raw meat.  You could eat it as-is, but cooking it is better."
msgstr "肉の塊です。そのままでも食べられますが、調理した方が良さそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "animal blood"
msgid_plural "animal blood"
msgstr[0] "動物の血液"

#. ~ Description of "animal blood"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Blood extracted from a living creature."
msgstr "生物から採取した血液です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of porkbelly"
msgid_plural "chunks of porkbelly"
msgstr[0] "豚バラ肉"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A fatty cut of pork from the belly, popular in some cuisine.  With proper "
"technique, it can be used to create bacon.  Not safe to consume in its "
"current raw form."
msgstr ""
"豚のあばら骨付近の肉の中でも、特定の料理によく使われる脂身が多い部位です。適切に調理すれば、ベーコンを作ることができます。生のまま食べるのは危険です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "slab of raw cured porkbelly"
msgid_plural "slabs of raw cured porkbelly"
msgstr[0] "生ベーコンブロック"

#. ~ Description of "slab of raw cured porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Porkbelly that has been preserved and flavored with salt and sugar to draw "
"out the moisture from the first layer.  Still raw, it is ready for smoking "
"into bacon."
msgstr "表面から水分を抜くために塩と砂糖で漬けて、風味を付けた豚バラ肉です。まだ生の状態であり、燻製すればベーコンになります。"

#. ~ High price to reflect the rarity and value of bacon. Note that this is
#. three pieces of it.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "large slab of uncut bacon"
msgid_plural "large slabs of uncut bacon"
msgstr[0] "ベーコンブロック"

#. ~ High price to reflect the rarity and value of bacon. Note that this is
#. three pieces of it.
#. ~ Description of "large slab of uncut bacon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A huge slab of uncut smoked bacon.  You can eat it as is, but it would be "
"more efficient to cut it into smaller portions with a knife."
msgstr "切り分けていない巨大なベーコンです。そのままでも食べられますが、ナイフで切り分けた方が効率的に消費できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
msgid_plural "slices of raw curing porkbelly"
msgstr[0] "生ベーコンブロック(脱水中)"

#. ~ Description of "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Porkbelly in the process of becoming fully cured with salt and sugar, "
"capable of becoming bacon.  The flavor is slowly developing at this stage, "
"and is significantly unpleasant due to the residual salt.  Activate it once "
"completed to make use of the final product."
msgstr ""
"塩と砂糖で漬けて脱水している途中の豚バラ肉です。水が抜ける段階でゆっくりと風味が増しますが、今の状態では塩味が強すぎて美味しくありません。脱水が完了した状態で使用すると、生ベーコンブロックが完成します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"You pat off a bit of extra brine from the slice; this piece of meat is now "
"fully cured."
msgstr "余分な塩水を軽く振り落とし、肉が完全に硬くなったことを確認しました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The meat isn't fully cured yet."
msgstr "肉はまだ硬くなっていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "scrap of meat"
msgid_plural "scraps of meat"
msgstr[0] "屑肉"

#. ~ Description of "scrap of meat"
