#. ~ Description of "scrap of mutant meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tiny scrap of raw meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It smells "
"unappealing, to say the least."
msgstr "重度の変異を起こしている動物の肉の切れ端です。控えめに言っても不味そうな臭いがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "mutant humanoid meat"
msgid_plural "mutant humanoid meats"
msgstr[0] "変異人肉"

#. ~ Description of "mutant humanoid meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Raw meat butchered from the body of a heavily mutated creature that was "
"unsettlingly humanoid in appearance.  It has odd bits of fur and other "
"tissue lodged in it that clearly don't belong.  You'd have to be crazy or "
"starving to eat this."
msgstr ""
"重度の変異を起こしている人型の化け物から採取した生の肉塊です。奇妙な毛皮やよく分からない組織の断片が混じっており、明らかに異常です。よっぽどの狂人か餓死寸前でなければ、これを食べようとは思えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "mutant human blood"
msgid_plural "mutant human blood"
msgstr[0] "人間の変異血液"

#. ~ Description of "mutant human blood"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Blood extracted from a heavily mutated human."
msgstr "重度の変異を起こしている人間から採取した血液です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked cretin"
msgid_plural "cooked cretins"
msgstr[0] "変異人肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked cretin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Cooked meat from a heavily mutated humanoid.  Now that the worst bits have "
"been picked out, it's probably digestible, if not very appetizing."
msgstr "酷く変異した人型の化け物の肉を調理したものです。最悪の選択をせざるを得ない状況なのですから、食欲はそそりませんが消化は可能でしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of tainted mutant meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of tainted mutant meat"
msgstr[0] "汚染変異肉塊"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked tainted mutant meat"
msgid_plural "cooked tainted mutant meats"
msgstr[0] "汚染変異肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "smoked tainted mutant meat"
msgid_plural "smoked tainted mutant meats"
msgstr[0] "汚染変異肉(燻製)"

#. ~ Description of "smoked tainted mutant meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Rotten mutant meat that has been heavily smoked for preservation."
msgstr "長期保存のためにしっかりと燻製した、汚染されている変異体の肉です。"

#. ~ This item should not get any use whatsoever, it is merely conservation of
#. mass and an attractor for carrion.
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<name_b>"
#. ~ generic negative/hostile pronouns
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "butchery refuse"
msgid_plural "butchery refuse"
msgstr[0] "廃棄部位"

#. ~ This item should not get any use whatsoever, it is merely conservation of
#. mass and an attractor for carrion.
#. ~ Description of "butchery refuse"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Eugh.  This is a mess of dirt, excreta, connective tissue, and bits of "
"matter like hair and claws, leftover from the butchering process.  Eating it"
" isn't even worth thinking about, but disposing of it might be a concern as "
"it could attract vermin."
msgstr ""
"うげぇ。垢、排泄物、結合組織や細かい毛、爪などがごちゃ混ぜになった塊です。食べるなんて考えたくもありませんが、放っておくと害虫が寄ってくる原因になるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked meat"
msgid_plural "cooked meats"
msgstr[0] "肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of cooked meat.  It's filling and nutritious, but unseasoned and a "
"bit bland."
msgstr "調理した肉塊です。食べ応えがあり栄養価も高いですが、味付けされていないため少し物足りません。"

#. ~ Luxury good.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked fatty meat"
msgid_plural "cooked fatty meats"
msgstr[0] "豚バラ肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Luxury good.
#. ~ Description of "cooked fatty meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of cooked fatty meat.  Although absent of vitamins, it is very "
"filling and delightfully greasy."
msgstr "調理した脂っこい肉塊です。ビタミンは含まれていませんが、脂肪分が豊富で食べ応えがあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of meat"
msgstr[0] "屑肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked mutant meat"
msgid_plural "cooked mutant meats"
msgstr[0] "変異肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked mutant meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "A cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal."
msgstr "変異した動物の肉塊を調理したものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of mutant meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of mutant meat"
msgstr[0] "変異屑肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked scrap of mutant meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tiny scrap of cooked mutant meat.  It is small enough that it's hard to "
"tell how disgusting it is."
msgstr "変異体の屑肉を調理したものです。身が細かすぎるため、そこまで嫌悪感はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "roasted bone marrow"
msgid_plural "roasted bone marrow"
msgstr[0] "骨髄(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "roasted bone marrow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Bone marrow, fully cooked to eliminate any parasites.  Tasty!"
msgstr "骨髄にしっかりと火を通し、寄生虫を除去したものです。美味しいですよ！"

#. ~ Conditional name for "roasted bone marrow" when FLAG matches CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "marvin marrow"
msgid_plural "marvin marrow"
msgstr[0] "人骨髄(調理済)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw offal"
msgid_plural "raw offals"
msgstr[0] "臓物"

#. ~ Description of "raw offal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A selection of uncooked internal organs and entrails.  Filled with essential"
" vitamins, but most people consider it a bit gross unless it's very "
"carefully prepared."
msgstr "調理していない内臓類です。必須栄養素が豊富ですが、よほど丁寧に調理しない限り、好き好んで食べようとする人はいません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked offal"
msgid_plural "cooked offal"
msgstr[0] "臓物(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked offal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A selection of cooked organs and entrails.  Filled with essential vitamins, "
"but pretty unappetizing in this form."
msgstr "調理した内蔵類です。必須栄養素が豊富ですが、このまま食べても美味しくはありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "mutant organs"
msgid_plural "mutant organs"
msgstr[0] "変異臓物"

#. ~ Description of "mutant organs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "Raw organs from a giant mutant bug."
msgstr "巨大な突然変異体の昆虫から採取された臓器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked mutant bug organs"
msgid_plural "cooked mutant bug organs"
msgstr[0] "変異臓物(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked mutant bug organs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A selection of cooked mutant bug organs.  Looks awful, but if you give it a "
"try, you'll find -- that it's worse than it looks."
msgstr "変異した虫の臓物を調理したものです。見た目は最悪ですが、実際に食べてみると...更に最悪であることが分かります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "pickled offal"
msgid_plural "pickled offal"
msgstr[0] "臓物(酢漬け)"

#. ~ Description of "pickled offal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A mass of entrails and organ meat, preserved in brine.  Packed with "
"essential vitamins, and although it looks like a lab specimen, it actually "
"tastes pretty palatable."
msgstr "塩水に浸けて保存性を高めた内蔵類です。まるで実験室の標本ですが、意外と美味しく、必須栄養素も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "canned offal"
msgid_plural "canned offal"
msgstr[0] "臓物(保存食)"

#. ~ Description of "canned offal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Cooked organ meat and entrails, preserved by canning.  Unappetizing, but "
"filled with essential vitamins."
msgstr "調理して容器に密封した新鮮な内蔵です。食欲はそそりませんが、必須栄養素が豊富に含まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "stomach"
msgid_plural "stomachs"
msgstr[0] "胃"

#. ~ Description of "stomach"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The stomach of a woodland creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "野生動物の胃です。耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "large stomach"
msgid_plural "large stomachs"
msgstr[0] "大きな胃"

#. ~ Description of "large stomach"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "The stomach of a large woodland creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "大型の野生動物の胃です。耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "meat jerky"
msgid_plural "meat jerky"
msgstr[0] "ミートジャーキー"

#. ~ Description of "meat jerky"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Salty dried meat that lasts for a long time, but will make you thirsty."
msgstr "日持ちする塩味の乾燥肉です。食べると喉が渇きます。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat jerky" when FLAG matches CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
