#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "The egg of a butterfly.  They are usually found clustered on leaves."
msgstr "チョウの卵です。通常は葉の上に複数産みつけられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "moth egg"
msgid_plural "moth eggs"
msgstr[0] "卵(ガ)"

