#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "ice cream"
msgid_plural "ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "アイスクリーム"

#. ~ not technically a drink, but is quasi-liquid enough that it'd get all
#. over everything if you carried it
#. ~ Description of "ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "A sweet, frozen food made with milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "ミルクとたっぷりの砂糖で作った、甘い冷菓です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "dairy dessert"
msgid_plural "dairy dessert scoops"
msgstr[0] "ラクトアイス"

#. ~ Description of "dairy dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Government regulations dictate that since this isn't *technically* ice "
"cream, it can be called a dairy dessert instead.  You can't really taste the"
" difference."
msgstr "政令によればこれは*厳密には*アイスクリームではないため、ラクトアイスと呼ばれています。しかし、味にそれほど違いはありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "chocolate ice cream"
msgid_plural "chocolate ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "チョコアイスクリーム"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, frozen food made with chocolate milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "チョコミルクとたっぷりの砂糖で作った、甘い冷菓です。"

#. ~ based on hoodsie cups, a popular brand in new england
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "sundae cup"
msgid_plural "sundae cups"
msgstr[0] "サンデーカップ"

#. ~ based on hoodsie cups, a popular brand in new england
#. ~ Description of "sundae cup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A small cup of frozen dairy dessert that is half chocolate, half vanilla, "
"and all delicious."
msgstr "チョコレート味とバニラ味のアイスが一つになった、とても美味しい乳製品デザートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "candy ice cream"
msgid_plural "candy ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "キャンディアイス"

#. ~ Description of "candy ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Ice cream with bits of chocolate, caramel, or other sweet candy mixed in."
msgstr "チョコレートやキャラメルなどの甘い菓子を混ぜ込んだアイスクリームです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "fruity ice cream"
msgid_plural "fruity ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "フルーツアイス"

#. ~ Description of "fruity ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "Small bits of sweet fruit have been tossed into this ice cream."
msgstr "甘い果物が入っているアイスクリームです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "frozen custard"
msgid_plural "frozen custard scoops"
msgstr[0] "フローズンカスタード"

#. ~ Description of "frozen custard"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A treat made famous on Coney Island, made like ice cream but with egg yolk "
"added in.  Its storing temperature is warmer, and it lasts a little longer "
"than regular ice cream."
msgstr ""
"コニーアイランド名物の、卵黄を使ったアイスクリームです。通常のアイスクリームよりも少し溶けにくく、保存温度が高くても多少長持ちする点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "frozen yogurt"
msgid_plural "frozen yogurt scoops"
msgstr[0] "フローズンヨーグルト"

#. ~ Description of "frozen yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Tarter than ice cream, this is made with yogurt and other dairy products, "
"and is generally lower-fat compared to ice cream."
msgstr "ヨーグルトなどの乳製品から作られた冷菓です。アイスクリームより酸味が強く、低脂肪です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "sorbet"
msgid_plural "sorbet scoops"
msgstr[0] "シャーベット"

#. ~ Description of "sorbet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "A simple frozen dessert made from water and fruit juice."
msgstr "水と果汁で作ったシンプルな冷菓です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "gelato"
msgid_plural "gelato scoops"
msgstr[0] "ジェラート"

#. ~ Description of "gelato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Italian-style ice cream.  It is denser and less airy, giving it a richer "
"flavor and texture."
msgstr "イタリア風のアイスクリームです。粘り気が強く空気があまり含まれていないため、豊かな風味と食感を楽しめます。"

