msgid "fruit slice"
msgid_plural "fruit slices"
msgstr[0] "薄切り果物"

#. ~ Description of "fruit slice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Fruit slices soaked in a sugar syrup to preserve freshness and appearance."
msgstr "果物を薄く切り、甘いシロップに漬け込んで鮮度と見た目の劣化を防いだものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "canned fruit"
msgid_plural "canned fruit"
msgstr[0] "果物(保存食)"

#. ~ Description of "canned fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This sodden mass of preserved fruit was boiled and canned in an earlier "
"life.  Bland, mushy, and losing its color."
msgstr "新鮮なうちに煮沸して密封保存されていた、グチャグチャの果肉です。色が抜けて型崩れしており、本来の味も薄れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "pumpkin yeast bread"
msgid_plural "pumpkin yeast bread"
msgstr[0] "カボチャパン"

#. ~ Description of "pumpkin yeast bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A festive autumnal bread with a golden color in either rolls or sliced "
"loaves of bread."
msgstr "秋の祝祭で食べる、黄金色に輝くロールパンもしくは食パンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "hardtack pudding"
msgid_plural "hardtack puddings"
msgstr[0] "堅パンプディング"

#. ~ Description of "hardtack pudding"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more "
"palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water and flour to "
"make dough, followed by kneading in pieces of fruit.  The dough is then "
"boiled into bread pudding chunks and topped with sweeteners.  Soldiers would"
" call this a dessert."
msgstr ""
"南北戦争時代のアメリカで生まれた、堅パンを食べやすくするための歴史あるレシピです。まず堅パンを砕き、水と穀粉を練り込み生地を作ります。この生地に刻んだ果物を加え、茹でて甘味料をトッピングすれば完成です。この料理が兵士にとってのデザートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
msgid_plural "Jerusalem artichoke fruit desserts"
msgstr[0] "キクイモフルーツサラダ"

#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Chopped Jerusalem artichoke combined with any fruit that is in season or at "
