msgid "purifier"
msgid_plural "purifiers"
msgstr[0] "変異治療薬"

#. ~ Description of "purifier"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"This thick, flesh-hued liquid helps revert the mutated to baseline humanity,"
" but cannot remove mutagen present in the bloodstream.  Not for use on "
"animals."
msgstr ""
"この濃厚な肉色の液体には、変異した肉体を元の状態に戻す効果があります。ただし、血中の変異原を除去することはできず、人間以外の生物に使うこともできません。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "purifier"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "You drink the purifier."
msgstr "変異治療薬を摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "purifier primer"
msgid_plural "purifier primers"
msgstr[0] "変異治療プライマー"

#. ~ Description of "purifier primer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"This chunky, flesh-hued injection does wonders for returning mutants to "
"humanity, but perhaps counter-intuitively, it requires regular mutagen to "
"function.  Do not use on animals."
msgstr ""
"変異した人間を元の状態に戻す強力な効果をもつ、粘つく肉色の注射剤です。何とも妙な話ですが、この薬の材料には通常の変異原成分が必ず入っています。絶対に動物には摂取させないでください。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "purifier primer"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "You inject the processed purifier."
msgstr "変異治療薬を注入しました。"

