"A large, spiky citrus fruit.  Delicious and a great source of Vitamin C, "
"though a bit sour."
msgstr "棘がある大きな果物です。少し酸味がありますが、ビタミンCを美味しく摂取できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "subterraenean coconut"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
