"A tropical fruit with a hard, hairy shell and a hollow inside full of "
"liquid."
msgstr "硬くて毛深い殻の中に液体が入っているトロピカルフルーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "peach"
msgid_plural "peaches"
msgstr[0] "モモ"

#. ~ Description of "peach"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "This fruit's large pit is surrounded by its tasty flesh."
msgstr "大きな種の周りに美味しい果肉が付いた果物です。"

#. ~ yes, it really does have that much water in it
#. ~ Item name
