#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This bowl is covered in cartoon dogs and a logo that reads 'Paw Patrol'."
msgstr "ボウルにはイヌのイラストと「パウ・パトロール」のロゴが大きく描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"There are orange and blue fish chasing each other around the rim of this "
"bowl."
msgstr "ボウルの縁にはオレンジ色と青色の魚が互いを追いかける絵が描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This bowl is shaped like the head of a silly frog with the opening forming "
"the mouth."
msgstr "ボウルには縁を口に見立てたひょうきんなカエルの顔が描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie bowl"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "There are cute farm animals decorating this bowl."
msgstr "ボウルの所々にかわいらしい家畜のイラストが描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "sippy cup"
msgid_plural "sippy cups"
msgstr[0] "子供用カップ(250ml)"

#. ~ Description of "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic cup with a spill-proof lid, designed for use by children."
msgstr "中身がこぼれないように蓋が付属した、子供用のプラスチック製コップです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This cup is decorated with cartoon bears."
msgstr "このコップにはクマのイラストが描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This cup has a cartoony picture of the Avengers wrapped around the side."
msgstr "コップの側面にはアベンジャーズの漫画イラストが描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This sippy cup is made of plastic in bright clashing colors."
msgstr "コップは鮮やかなツートンカラーで塗られています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This is a simple blue sippy cup with tooth marks around the spout."
msgstr "飲み口に噛み跡が残っているシンプルな青色の子供用コップです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This cup is decorated to look like a pokeball."
msgstr "モンスターボールが描かれたコップです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "There are cute anthropomorphic fruits decorating this cup."
msgstr "コップの所々に果物を擬人化したかわいらしいイラストが描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "sippy cup"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This sippy cup is decorated with crayon-like text that reads 'I love you'."
msgstr "コップにはクレヨンで書かれたような「だいすき」という文字がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "fork"
msgid_plural "forks"
msgstr[0] "フォーク"

#. ~ Description of "fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A fork, if you stab something with it, you eat it right away.  Wait… "
"nevermind."
msgstr "フォークです。何か食べたい時は、これで突き刺して口に運びましょう。いや...別に必要ありませんね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "plastic fork"
msgid_plural "plastic forks"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てフォーク"

#. ~ Description of "plastic fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A plastic disposable fork.  Great for picnic lunches in the post-apocalyptic"
" wasteland."
msgstr "プラスチック製の使い捨てフォークです。崩壊した世界でのピクニックにぴったりです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "spoon"
msgid_plural "spoons"
msgstr[0] "スプーン"

#. ~ Description of "spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "Do not try to bend the spoon.  That is impossible."
msgstr "スプーンを曲げようとしちゃダメ。そんなのは無理。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "plastic spoon"
msgid_plural "plastic spoons"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てスプーン"

#. ~ Description of "plastic spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic disposable spoon.  Easier to bend than the metal variety."
msgstr "プラスチック製の使い捨てスプーンです。金属製のものより簡単に折れ曲がります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "kiddie spoon"
msgid_plural "kiddie spoons"
msgstr[0] "子供用スプーン"

#. ~ Description of "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic spoon designed for use by children."
msgstr "子供用のプラスチック製スプーンです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This spoon is striped in bright primary colors."
msgstr "スプーンには鮮やかな原色の縞模様が描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This spoon is styled to look like a bulldozer."
msgstr "ブルドーザーをモチーフにした形のスプーンです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This spoon is covered in cartoon dogs and a logo that reads 'Paw Patrol'."
msgstr "スプーンにはイヌのイラストと「パウ・パトロール」のロゴが大きく描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "There is a cute cartoon bear on the handle of this spoon."
msgstr "スプーンの持ち手にはかわいらしいクマのイラストが描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "There are cartoon cats all over this spoon."
msgstr "ネコのイラストが描かれたスプーンです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "kiddie spoon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This spoon has a silhouette of a giraffe going down the handle."
msgstr "スプーンの持ち手はキリンの姿を模しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "butter knife"
msgid_plural "butter knives"
msgstr[0] "バターナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "butter knife"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A dull knife, absolutely worthless in combat.  Excellent for spreading soft "
"things on bread."
msgstr "戦闘では何の役にも立たない、刃のないナイフです。柔らかいものをパンに塗るのに最適です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "plastic knife"
msgid_plural "plastic knives"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てバターナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "plastic knife"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A plastic butter knife.  It's actually a bit sharper than its metal "
"counterpart, but that doesn't make it any more effective as a weapon."
msgstr "プラスチック製のバターナイフです。金属製のものより若干鋭いですが、やはり武器として使うには不向きです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "plastic straw"
msgid_plural "plastic straws"
msgstr[0] "ストロー"

#. ~ Description of "plastic straw"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A plastic straw, for drinking things and littering."
msgstr "飲料を飲んだ後はゴミとして捨てられる、プラスチック製のストローです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "corkscrew"
msgid_plural "corkscrews"
msgstr[0] "コルク抜き"

#. ~ Description of "corkscrew"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"Many a pleasant date has been ruined by forgetting this important tool."
msgstr "この大事な道具を紛失したせいで楽しいイベントが台無しになった人は多いと聞きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "vegetable peeler"
msgid_plural "vegetable peelers"
msgstr[0] "ピーラー"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable peeler"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A simple tool for peeling the outer skin off fruits and veggies without "
"stabbing yourself."
msgstr "手を切ることなく野菜や果物の皮を剥ける、シンプルな作りの調理器具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "bottle opener"
msgid_plural "bottle openers"
msgstr[0] "栓抜き"

#. ~ Description of "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A simple lever for popping open bottles."
msgstr "瓶の栓を抜くシンプルな作りの器具です。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is shaped like a zombie head, the mouth pops open the "
"bottle."
msgstr "この栓抜きはゾンビの頭を模した形をしており、口の部分で栓を開けるようになっています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a lightsaber."
msgstr "ライトセーバーのような形状の栓抜きです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a revolver."
msgstr "リボルバー銃のような形状の栓抜きです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is engraved with the words 'I'll die before I give you my"
" beer'."
msgstr "栓抜きには「ビールを譲るくらいなら死ぬ」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is emblazoned with a logo for an HVAC contracting "
"company."
msgstr "栓抜きには空調設備関係の企業ロゴがプリントされています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This bottle opener reads 'Corporate Team Building Exercise 1999'."
msgstr "栓抜きには「企業チーム育成訓練1999」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This bottle opener reads 'I'd rather be drinking whiskey'."
msgstr "栓抜きには「ウイスキーが飲みたい」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a phaser."
msgstr "光線銃のような形状の栓抜きです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "bottle opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "This novelty bottle opener is designed to look like a hobo clown."
msgstr "流浪のピエロの姿がデザインされた、記念品の栓抜きです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "spork"
msgid_plural "sporks"
msgstr[0] "スポーク"

#. ~ Description of "spork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"The bastardized hybrid of a spoon and fork, with all the power and "
"capabilities of both in a more annoying to use package."
msgstr "スプーンとフォークの粗悪な混合物です。双方の性能を一つにまとめようとしたことで、一層扱い辛くなってしまっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "foon"
msgid_plural "foons"
msgstr[0] "フーン"

#. ~ Description of "foon"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "Clearly the superior instrument.  Sporks are just imitators."
msgstr "先端がフォークになっている先割れスプーンです。食器として明らかに優れており、スポークは単なる模倣品に過ぎないでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "chopsticks"
msgid_plural "pairs of chopsticks"
msgstr[0] "箸"

#. ~ Description of "chopsticks"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"One of the most popular eating utensils in the world.  Does double duty as a"
" way of dealing with especially fragile vampires."
msgstr "世界で最も普及している食器の一つです。脆弱な吸血鬼を退治する道具としての側面も持っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json data/mods/MMA/bludgeons.json
msgid "ladle"
msgid_plural "ladles"
msgstr[0] "おたま"

#. ~ Description of "ladle"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "When you need to scoop some soup, this is the utensil for you."
msgstr "スープを掬う時に必要な調理器具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "whisk"
msgid_plural "whisks"
msgstr[0] "泡立て器"

#. ~ Description of "whisk"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A tool designed for finely mixing ingredients or introducing air into the "
"blend.  Also known as a 'wire whip', but it's a less effective weapon than "
"that name makes it sound."
msgstr ""
"食材同士をよく混ぜ合わせたり、生地に空気を含ませたりする際に使われる調理器具です。「ワイヤーウィップ」とも呼ばれますが、強そうな名前とは裏腹に、武器として扱うには向きません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "potato masher"
msgid_plural "potato mashers"
msgstr[0] "ポテトマッシャー"

#. ~ Description of "potato masher"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A tool for mashing potatoes and soft root vegetables; it cannot do the "
"twist."
msgstr "ジャガイモや柔らかい根菜を押し潰す調理器具です。ホリーズの歌のようにツイストは踊れません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "garlic press"
msgid_plural "garlic presses"
msgstr[0] "ガーリックプレス"

#. ~ Description of "garlic press"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A tool for squashing a clove or two of garlic into a fine paste."
msgstr "ニンニクを圧搾してペースト状に加工する調理器具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "can opener"
msgid_plural "can openers"
msgstr[0] "缶切り"

#. ~ Description of "can opener"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A tool for opening cans that lack pull-tabs.  Now that you think about it, "
"you haven't seen any of those around lately."
msgstr "プルタブのない缶を開ける道具です。そういえば、最近あまり見かけなくなりましたね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "carving fork"
msgid_plural "carving forks"
msgstr[0] "カービングフォーク"

#. ~ Description of "carving fork"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A utensil used to hold meat still while you slice it.  It's like a tiny "
"pitchfork, or a very large dinner fork."
msgstr "肉をスライスするときに押さえておくための道具です。小さなピッチフォーク、あるいは大きなディナーフォークのような形をしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "spatula"
msgid_plural "spatulas"
msgstr[0] "ゴムべら"

#. ~ Description of "spatula"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A rubber scraper for making sure you get every last scrap of cookie dough."
msgstr "クッキー生地を最後のひと塊まで確実に掬い取るゴム製のヘラです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "rolling pin"
msgid_plural "rolling pins"
msgstr[0] "麺棒"

#. ~ Description of "rolling pin"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A stout piece of hardwood, turned and sanded smooth, with rounded handles at"
" the ends.  This timeless kitchen tool also doubles as a very effective "
"club."
msgstr ""
"硬く丈夫な木製の円柱の両端に丸みを帯びた持ち手が付いた、食材を混ぜ伸ばす調理器具です。この時代を超越した道具は、非常に実戦的な棍棒にもなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "pot"
msgid_plural "pots"
msgstr[0] "鍋"

#. ~ Description of "pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food."
msgstr "お湯を沸かしたり、色々な料理を作ったりする際に役立つ鍋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "cast-iron pot"
msgid_plural "cast-iron pots"
msgstr[0] "鉄鍋"

#. ~ Description of "cast-iron pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This hefty black pot is made from cast iron and coated in a sturdy enamel."
msgstr "丈夫なエナメルでコーティングされた、鋳鉄製の大きな黒い鍋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "copper pot"
msgid_plural "copper pots"
msgstr[0] "銅鍋"

#. ~ Description of "copper pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food.  Made "
"from copper, with a lining of tin to prevent metal from leaching into acidic"
" foods."
msgstr ""
"お湯を沸かしたり、色々な料理を作ったりする際に役立つ鍋です。銅製ですが、酸性の食品に金属が溶け出さないよう内側が鈴でコーティングされています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "casserole pot"
msgid_plural "casserole pots"
msgstr[0] "キャセロール鍋"

#. ~ Description of "casserole pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A ceramic pot made for both cooking and serving, particularly one-pot "
"dinners."
msgstr "鍋料理で頻繁に使われる、調理してそのまま食卓に出せるセラミック製の鍋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "stock pot"
msgid_plural "stock pots"
msgstr[0] "スープ鍋"

#. ~ Description of "stock pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A large pot with 20 gauge walls and a thick aluminum bottom, used for making"
" soup stocks.  You could fit a whole turkey in there, with a bit of shoving."
msgstr "スープを煮込むための、厚さ約5.8mmのアルミニウム製大型鍋です。少々狭いですが、七面鳥が丸ごと入るサイズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "canning pot"
msgid_plural "canning pots"
msgstr[0] "寸胴鍋"

#. ~ Description of "canning pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A very large 25 liter pot, primarily meant for canning food in glass jars "
"via the water bath method, though it can cook normal foods just as well.  "
"Canning foods with it will require a lot of water.  If you're only canning a"
" couple of jars at a time, you'd fill it up with rocks or something to "
"displace the water above the lids."
msgstr ""
"25Lの容量を持つ非常に大きな鍋です。食料入りの瓶をたっぷりの水で煮沸して瓶詰めを作るのが主な用途ですが、一般的な調理も可能です。瓶詰め加工には大量の水が必要ですが、加工後の水は煮沸されて飲料水になります。一度に数個しか煮沸しない場合は、石などを鍋に入れて水位を上げ、瓶の蓋まで水に浸かるようにしましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "clay canning pot"
msgid_plural "clay canning pots"
msgstr[0] "陶製寸胴鍋"

#. ~ Description of "clay canning pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A very large 25 liter earthenware pot, primarily meant for canning food via "
"the water bath method, though it can cook normal foods just as well.  "
"Canning foods with it will require a lot of water.  If you're only canning a"
" couple of jars at a time, you'd fill it up with rocks or something to "
"displace the water above the lids."
msgstr ""
"25Lの容量を持つ、非常に大きな陶製の鍋です。食料入りの瓶をたっぷりの水で煮沸して瓶詰めを作るのが主な用途ですが、一般的な調理も可能です。瓶詰め加工には大量の水が必要ですが、加工後の水は煮沸されて飲料水になります。一度に数個しか煮沸しない場合は、石などを鍋に入れて水位を上げ、瓶の蓋まで水に浸かるようにしましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "cast-iron frying pan"
msgid_plural "cast-iron frying pans"
msgstr[0] "フライパン(鋳鉄)"

#. ~ Description of "cast-iron frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A cast-iron pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "鋳鉄製のフライパンです。まともな近接武器ですが、ちゃんと料理にも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "steel frying pan"
msgid_plural "steel frying pans"
msgstr[0] "フライパン(鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "steel frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A steel frying pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "スチール製のフライパンです。まともな近接武器ですが、ちゃんと料理にも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "copper frying pan"
msgid_plural "copper frying pans"
msgstr[0] "フライパン(銅)"

#. ~ Description of "copper frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A copper frying pan, coated in a thin layer of tin.  Makes a decent melee "
"weapon, and is used for cooking."
msgstr "表面が錫でコーティングされた銅製のフライパンです。まともな近接武器ですが、ちゃんと料理にも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "makeshift pot"
msgid_plural "makeshift pots"
msgstr[0] "簡易鍋"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of metal crudely hammered into a cooking pot.  Good enough to cook "
"food and boil water, but not as useful as proper cookware."
msgstr ""
"板金を荒っぽく打ち伸ばして鍋らしき形に仕上げたものです。火の上で食料を温めたりお湯を沸かしたりするにはこれで十分ですが、当然ちゃんとした鍋のほうが使いやすく、役に立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "makeshift copper pot"
msgid_plural "makeshift copper pots"
msgstr[0] "簡易銅鍋"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift copper pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A cooking pot crudely hammered out of copper.  Good enough to cook food and "
"boil water, but not as useful as proper cookware."
msgstr ""
"銅板を荒っぽく打ちのめして鍋らしき形に仕上げたものです。火の上で食料を温めたりお湯を沸かしたりするにはこれで十分ですが、当然ちゃんとした鍋のほうが使いやすく、役に立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "kettle"
msgid_plural "kettles"
msgstr[0] "やかん"

#. ~ Description of "kettle"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A stovetop kettle for boiling water."
msgstr "コンロで湯を沸かすためのやかんです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "mesh colander"
msgid_plural "mesh colanders"
msgstr[0] "ざる"

#. ~ Description of "mesh colander"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel mesh colander, for washing rice and vegetables, or "
"straining liquid off from noodles or other foods."
msgstr "米や野菜を洗ったり、麺などの食品の水気を切ったりする際に便利な、ステンレス製のざるです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "splatter guard"
msgid_plural "splatter guards"
msgstr[0] "スプラッターガード"

#. ~ Description of "splatter guard"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel mesh screen for preventing flying oil from getting all "
"over your nice counters (or you) when frying."
msgstr "揚げ物をするときに跳ねた油が素敵なキッチンカウンター(もしくは料理人)にかからないようにするための、ステンレス鋼製の網です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "cutting board"
msgid_plural "cutting boards"
msgstr[0] "まな板"

#. ~ Description of "cutting board"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A large, flat piece of wood for chopping vegetables on without ruining your "
"knife or your countertop."
msgstr "包丁やキッチンカウンターを傷めずに野菜を刻むための、大きく平らな木の板です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "meal tray"
msgid_plural "meal trays"
msgstr[0] "サービストレイ"

#. ~ Description of "meal tray"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel tray used for serving food in cafeterias, mess halls, or "
"similar places."
msgstr "カフェテリアや食堂などで食事を提供する際に使われる、ステンレス製のトレイです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "pizza cutter"
msgid_plural "pizza cutters"
msgstr[0] "ピザカッター"

#. ~ Description of "pizza cutter"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "A utensil used for cutting pizza.  Practically useless in combat."
msgstr "ピザを切る道具です。戦闘ではまったく役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "icecream scoop"
msgid_plural "icecream scoops"
msgstr[0] "アイスディッシャー"

#. ~ Description of "icecream scoop"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A utensil used for scooping icecream into bowls.  It has a spring powered "
"lever to assist."
msgstr "アイスクリームを器に盛りつける道具です。バネ式のレバーが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "cheese grater"
msgid_plural "cheese graters"
msgstr[0] "チーズグレーター"

#. ~ Description of "cheese grater"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel cheese grater with a plastic grip.  It is used to shred "
"cheese."
msgstr "プラスチック製の持ち手が付いた、ステンレス鋼のチーズグレーターです。チーズを細かくおろすのに使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "cast-iron dutch oven"
msgid_plural "cast-iron dutch ovens"
msgstr[0] "ダッチオーブン"

#. ~ Description of "cast-iron dutch oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A cast-iron dutch oven, suitable for boiling, broiling, roasting, baking, "
"stewing, frying and any other method of cooking."
msgstr "茹でる、焼く、炒める、炙る、煮る、揚げるといったあらゆる調理に適した、鋳鉄製のダッチオーブンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "improvised oven"
msgid_plural "improvised ovens"
msgstr[0] "簡易ダッチオーブン"

#. ~ Description of "improvised oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A large pot converted into an improvised oven, suitable for basic baking on "
"a hot surface."
msgstr "大きめの鍋を改造して作った、高温で料理を炙るのに適した簡易的なダッチオーブンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "clay pot oven"
msgid_plural "clay pot ovens"
msgstr[0] "陶製ダッチオーブン"

#. ~ Description of "clay pot oven"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift oven made of a big clay pot with a lid, containing firebricks to"
" hold heat and a smaller pot to bake in."
msgstr "小さな鍋を耐熱レンガで囲み、それを更に大きな陶製の鍋に入れて蓋をした、即席のダッチオーブンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "aluminum frying pan"
msgid_plural "aluminum frying pans"
msgstr[0] "フライパン(アルミ)"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum frying pan"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"An aluminum frying pan.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is used for "
"cooking."
msgstr "アルミニウム製のフライパンです。まともな近接武器ですが、ちゃんと料理にも使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "aluminum pot"
msgid_plural "aluminum pots"
msgstr[0] "アルミ鍋"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum pot"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"A cooking pot, useful for boiling water and making all kinds of food.  Made "
"from aluminum."
msgstr "お湯を沸かしたり、色々な料理を作ったりする際に役立つアルミニウム製の鍋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "envelope"
msgid_plural "envelopes"
msgstr[0] "封筒"

#. ~ Description of "envelope"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A flat paper container with a sealable flap, used to enclose a letter or "
"other paper goods."
msgstr "手紙などを封入できる、薄い紙製の袋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "letter"
msgid_plural "letters"
msgstr[0] "手紙"

#. ~ Description of "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from one person to another, usually put in an envelope.  "
"Reading it would be rude."
msgstr "通常は封筒に入れて送る、人から人へのメッセージを綴った紙です。勝手に読むのは失礼にあたります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "postcard"
msgid_plural "postcards"
msgstr[0] "ポストカード"

#. ~ Description of "postcard"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A piece of thick, rectangular paper intended for writing and mailing without"
" an envelope."
msgstr "封筒に入れずにそのままメッセージを郵送できる、厚手の長方形の紙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "gift card"
msgid_plural "gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード"

#. ~ Description of "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A small card that can be exchanged for goods or services from a particular "
"business, usually given as a gift."
msgstr "特定企業の商品やサービスと交換できる、贈り物として渡されることが多い小さなカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "restaurant gift card"
msgid_plural "restaurant gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード(レストラン)"

#. ~ Description of variant "restaurant gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A gift card for a local restaurant, covering the cost for an entire meal."
msgstr "地元のレストランで使える、一食分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "$20 gift card"
msgid_plural "$20 gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード($20)"

#. ~ Description of variant "$20 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $20 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local clothing store."
msgstr "地元の衣料品店で使える、20ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "barbershop gift card"
msgid_plural "barbershop gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード(理髪店)"

#. ~ Description of variant "barbershop gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This gift card could be exchanged for a free cut at a local barbershop."
msgstr "地元の理髪店で使える、ヘアカット無料券です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "$100 gift card"
msgid_plural "$100 gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード($100)"

#. ~ Description of variant "$100 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $100 electronic gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local "
"megastore."
msgstr "地元の超大型店で使える、100ドル分の電子ギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
#, c-format
msgid "5% discount card"
msgid_plural "5% discount cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード(5%割引)"

#. ~ Description of variant "5% discount card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This gift card gives you a 5% discount for purchases at your local shopping "
"mall.  Can only be redeemed once."
msgstr "地元のショッピングモールで使える、1回分の会計が5%割引になるギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "$5 gift card"
msgid_plural "$5 gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード($5)"

#. ~ Description of variant "$5 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $5 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local bookstore."
msgstr "地元の書店で使える、5ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "$10 gift card"
msgid_plural "$10 gift cards"
msgstr[0] "ギフトカード($10)"

#. ~ Description of variant "$10 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $10 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local hardware store."
msgstr "地元の工具店で使える、10ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "greeting card"
msgid_plural "greeting cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード"

#. ~ Description of "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A piece of card stock meant to convey an expression of sentiment."
msgstr "想いを伝えるためのカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "greeting card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card for expressing best wishes.  Its corners are decorated with "
"paintings of flowers and leaves."
msgstr "贈られた人の幸せを願うグリーティングカードです。四隅に花や葉が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "baby shower card"
msgid_plural "baby shower cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(懐妊祝い)"

#. ~ Description of variant "baby shower card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A baby blue greeting card with a drawing of a teddy bear holding an "
"umbrella.  Words printed on it read: \"It's getting closer by the hour, so "
"let's have a baby shower!\""
msgstr ""
"傘をもったテディベアが描かれた、淡い青色のグリーティングカードです。「その時が刻一刻と近づいていますね。ベビーシャワーパーティーを開きましょう！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "birthday card"
msgid_plural "birthday cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(誕生日)"

#. ~ Description of variant "birthday card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card given to a person to celebrate their birthday.  This one has"
" a floral design."
msgstr "誕生日を祝う、花柄デザインのグリーティングカードです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "congratulations card"
msgid_plural "congratulations cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(卒業祝い)"

#. ~ Description of variant "congratulations card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This greeting card displays a picture of a graduate tossing their graduation"
" cap.  Above the cap is the word 'CONGRATULATIONS'."
msgstr "卒業帽を投げ上げる学生が描かれたグリーティングカードです。「おめでとう」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "farewell card"
msgid_plural "farewell cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(送別)"

#. ~ Description of variant "farewell card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This is a white greeting card with a stylized drawing of an empty road.  "
"Words printed on it read: \"You're going places (literally).  Wishing you "
"the best!\""
msgstr "前へ続く道が描かれた白いグリーティングカードです。「(見ての通り)道は広がっています。ベストを尽くせますように！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "friendship card"
msgid_plural "friendship cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(友情)"

#. ~ Description of variant "friendship card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card with a stylized picture of a donut and a coffee cup.  Above "
"the picture, it says 'I am thankful for our friendship' and below are the "
"words 'we are better together'."
msgstr ""
"ドーナツとコーヒーカップが描かれた、お洒落なグリーティングカードです。絵の上下に「素敵な友情に感謝」「これからもずっと一緒」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "get well card"
msgid_plural "get well cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(見舞い)"

#. ~ Description of variant "get well card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This greeting card displays a cartoon turtle in a cozy blanket sipping hot "
"tea.  Above the turtle, it says 'Wishing you a SPEEDY recovery!'"
msgstr ""
"フワフワの毛布に包まって温かい紅茶を飲むカメのイラストが描かれたグリーティングカードです。イラストの上に「早くよくなってね！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "retirement card"
msgid_plural "retirement cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(退職祝い)"

#. ~ Description of variant "retirement card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card wishing the recipient a long and happy retirement.  This one"
" displays a drawing of a rocking chair surrounded with white roses."
msgstr "退職後も末永く幸せであることを願うグリーティングカードです。白いバラに囲まれたロッキングチェアが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "sympathy card"
msgid_plural "sympathy cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(追悼)"

#. ~ Description of variant "sympathy card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A black greeting card with a picture of a dimly lit candle.  Words printed "
"on it read: \"Please accept our deepest and most heartfelt condolences at "
"this challenging time.\""
msgstr ""
"ほのかに灯るロウソクが描かれた、黒色のグリーティングカードです。「このたびは誠にご愁傷様です。心よりお悔やみ申し上げます」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "thank you card"
msgid_plural "thank you cards"
msgstr[0] "グリーティングカード(感謝)"

#. ~ Description of variant "thank you card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A plain white greeting card featuring an expression of gratitude to the "
"recipient."
msgstr "相手への感謝の気持ちを込める、無地の白いグリーティングカードです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "XLR cable"
msgid_plural "XLR cables"
msgstr[0] "オーディオケーブル"

#. ~ Description of "XLR cable"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A balanced cable used for sending audio signal.  The connectors have three "
"prongs."
msgstr "オーディオ信号の送信に使われる平衡ケーブルです。コネクタには3つのピンが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "speaker cable"
msgid_plural "speaker cables"
msgstr[0] "スピーカーケーブル"

#. ~ Description of "speaker cable"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"This audio cable connects one speaker to a powered head, or one speaker to "
"another."
msgstr "スピーカーと電源が入った再生機器、もしくはスピーカー同士を接続するためのケーブルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "instrument cable"
msgid_plural "instrument cables"
msgstr[0] "シールドケーブル"

#. ~ Description of "instrument cable"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"Known as an instrument cable because it is usually used to connect a guitar "
"to a powered amp, it is an unbalanced cable with 1/4\" male connectors on "
"each side."
msgstr ""
"通常はギターと電源が入ったアンプを接続するために使うため、楽器ケーブルという名前でも知られています。片側に6.3mmのオスコネクタを備えた不平衡ケーブルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "headphones"
msgid_plural "headphones"
msgstr[0] "ヘッドフォン"

#. ~ Description of "headphones"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A pair of headphones that cover your ears for improved sound quality and "
"private listening.  This pair is from a well-known brand that is very high "
"quality, with a detachable 1/8\" cable.  Comes with a 1/8\" to 1/4\" "
"adaptor."
msgstr ""
"高い音質で一人静かに音楽を楽しめる、耳を覆って使うヘッドフォンです。着脱可能な3.5mmプラグ付きケーブルを備えた、非常に高品質なことで有名なブランドの製品です。6.3mm変換アダプタも付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "XLR microphone"
msgid_plural "XLR microphones"
msgstr[0] "マイク"

#. ~ Description of "XLR microphone"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A microphone used to record or amplify sound.  Comes with a clip.  Has a "
"3-pin XLR connector on the bottom in order to connect to an amp."
msgstr "音声の録音や増幅に使われる、クリップが付いた一般的なマイクです。底面にはアンプに接続するための3ピンXLRコネクタが備わっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "microphone stand"
msgid_plural "microphone stands"
msgstr[0] "マイクスタンド"

#. ~ Description of "microphone stand"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight telescoping boom stand made of aluminum and painted black.  "
"About 6' tall when full extended, or 3' when closed fully.  Has threads for "
"a mic clip on one end."
msgstr ""
"伸縮して高さを調整できる、黒色の軽量なアルミ製ブームスタンドマイクです。高さは限界まで伸ばすと約183cm、逆に縮めると約91cmになります。片方の端にマイククリップを固定するネジが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "guitar stand"
msgid_plural "guitar stands"
msgstr[0] "ギタースタンド"

#. ~ Description of "guitar stand"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A small, oddly-shaped piece of aluminum hardware with three legs.  When "
"placed on the ground, this can support one guitar in an upright position."
msgstr "奇妙な形をした、3本足のアルミ製器具です。立てておくことで、1台のギターを直立状態で支えられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "plectrum"
msgid_plural "plectra"
msgstr[0] "ピック"

#. ~ Description of "plectrum"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A flat piece of plastic with a pointed tip, designed for plucking the "
"strings of an instrument."
msgstr "ギターやマンドリンの弦を弾くために使う、一端が尖った平たいプラスチック製の道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid "mixer"
msgid_plural "mixers"
msgstr[0] "PAミキサー"

#. ~ Description of "mixer"
#: data/json/items/generic/music.json
msgid ""
"A device with faders, switches, and knobs that mixes input signal and sends "
"it to two output XLR cables, a left one and a right one."
msgstr ""
"入力信号をミックスして右チャンネル、左チャンネルそれぞれのオーディオケーブルに出力する、フェーダーやスイッチ、ツマミ類を備えたデバイスです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "human skull"
msgid_plural "human skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(人間)"

#. ~ Description of "human skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a human being.  Carrying this around probably isn't going to "
"win you any friends."
msgstr "人間の頭蓋骨です。こんなものを持ち歩いていたら、友達ができませんよ。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "large canine skull"
msgid_plural "large canine skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(大型イヌ科)"

#. ~ Description of "large canine skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a wolf or a dog.  Essential material for building an "
"articulated wolf skeleton."
msgstr "オオカミかイヌの頭蓋骨です。オオカミの骨格標本を作るのに欠かせない部位です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "small canine skull"
msgid_plural "small canine skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(小型イヌ科)"

#. ~ Description of "small canine skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a small canine, likely a small dog breed."
msgstr "小型犬のものと思われる小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "tiny canine skull"
msgid_plural "tiny canine skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(超小型イヌ科)"

#. ~ Description of "tiny canine skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a tiny canine, likely a Chihuahua or another similarly sized "
"dog breed."
msgstr "チワワに近いサイズの犬種のものと思われる、非常に小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "small feline skull"
msgid_plural "small feline skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(小型ネコ科)"

#. ~ Description of "small feline skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a small feline, likely a house cat."
msgstr "イエネコのものと思われる小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "rodent skull"
msgid_plural "rodent skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(げっ歯類)"

#. ~ Description of "rodent skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a small rodent, most likely a rat."
msgstr "ラットのものと思われる小さなげっ歯類の頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "pig skull"
msgid_plural "pig skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ブタ)"

#. ~ Description of "pig skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a pig, either a domestic or a wild one."
msgstr "家畜のブタか野生のイノシシの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "sheep skull"
msgid_plural "sheep skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ヒツジ)"

#. ~ Description of "sheep skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a domestic sheep."
msgstr "家畜のヒツジの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "goat skull"
msgid_plural "goat skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ヤギ)"

#. ~ Description of "goat skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a goat with the horns still attached."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、ヤギの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "cow skull"
msgid_plural "cow skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ウシ)"

#. ~ Description of "cow skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a bovine, likely a domestic cow, with the horns still attached."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、家畜のウシの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "horse skull"
msgid_plural "horse skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ウマ)"

#. ~ Description of "horse skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a horse.  Given the circumstances you can be pretty sure it was"
" a domestic horse."
msgstr "ウマの頭蓋骨です。状況からして、ほぼ間違いなく家畜のウマのものでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "deer skull"
msgid_plural "deer skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(シカ)"

#. ~ Description of "deer skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a cervine, either a deer or a reindeer, with the antlers still "
"attached."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、シカかトナカイの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "moose skull"
msgid_plural "moose skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(ヘラジカ)"

#. ~ Description of "moose skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "The skull of a moose, unmistakable thanks to the antler shape."
msgstr "ヘラジカの頭蓋骨です。特徴的な枝角のお陰で、間違えようがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid "tusked moose skull"
msgid_plural "tusked moose skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨(変異ヘラジカ)"

#. ~ Description of "tusked moose skull"
#: data/json/items/generic/skulls.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a moose, unmistakable thanks to the antler shape and… tusks?  "
"Okay, maybe this did not belong to a normal moose after all."
msgstr "ヘラジカの頭蓋骨です。特徴的な枝角のお陰で、間違えようがない筈ですが、この牙は...やはり普通のヘラジカではないのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "spare parts"
msgid_plural "spare parts"
msgstr[0] "予備部品"

#. ~ Description of "spare parts"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"Items which are not themselves useful but are instead requirements for "
"crafting or repairs"
msgstr "それ自体に使い道はありませんが、製作や修復に必要な部品です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "drive belt"
msgid_plural "drive belts"
msgstr[0] "駆動ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "drive belt"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A synthetic rubber V-belt with steel reinforcement fibers.  Commonly fitted "
"to engines or other industrial equipment."
msgstr "スチール繊維で補強された合成ゴム製のVベルトです。一般的には、エンジンや工業機器に装着して使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "makeshift drive belt"
msgid_plural "makeshift drive belts"
msgstr[0] "簡易駆動ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift drive belt"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"An improvised belt useful for repairing engines or other industrial "
"equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr "他に良い手段が無いときに使う、エンジンや工業機器を修復するための即席ベルトです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "air filter"
msgid_plural "air filters"
msgstr[0] "エアフィルター"

#. ~ Description of "air filter"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A plastic box containing creped paper used to filter the air supply for "
"combustion engines or other industrial equipment."
msgstr "燃焼機関や工業機器の空気供給口に取り付ける、プラスチック製の箱です。中には薄い紙の層が詰まっており、空気をフィルタリングします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "makeshift air filter"
msgid_plural "makeshift air filters"
msgstr[0] "簡易エアフィルター"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift air filter"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"An improvised air filter useful for repairing engines or other industrial "
"equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr "他に良い手段が無いときに使う、エンジンや工業機器の修復に用いる即席エアフィルターです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "automotive filter"
msgid_plural "automotive filters"
msgstr[0] "自動車フィルター"

#. ~ Description of "automotive filter"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "A steel can containing filter paper designed for automotive use."
msgstr "自動車用に設計された、ろ紙の束が入った鋼製の円筒缶です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "makeshift automotive filter"
msgid_plural "makeshift automotive filters"
msgstr[0] "簡易自動車フィルター"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift automotive filter"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"An improvised automotive filter useful for repairing engines or other "
"industrial equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr "他に良い手段が無いときに使う、エンジンや工業機器の修復に用いる即席自動車フィルターです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "glow plug"
msgid_plural "glow plugs"
msgstr[0] "予熱プラグ"

#. ~ Description of "glow plug"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A cylindrical heating device designed to be screwed in to a diesel engine to"
" aid starting in cold weather."
msgstr "外気が寒いときにディーゼルエンジンを始動させるための、円筒状の加熱装置です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "high-pressure pump"
msgid_plural "high-pressure pumps"
msgstr[0] "高圧ポンプ"

#. ~ Description of "high-pressure pump"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical pump capable of achieving high pressures.  Far beyond "
"anything you could reasonably improvise."
msgstr "高圧を保つことができる複雑な機械式ポンプです。即席で作った物とは比べ物にならない性能を持っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "mechanical pump"
msgid_plural "mechanical pumps"
msgstr[0] "機械式ポンプ"

#. ~ Description of "mechanical pump"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A simple cast iron mechanical impeller pump.  It's not good for much of "
"anything on its own."
msgstr "井戸から飲み水を汲み上げるために使う、昔ながらの機械式ポンプです。個人で使用するにしても少々心もとない性能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "compressor"
msgid_plural "compressors"
msgstr[0] "コンプレッサー"

#. ~ Description of "compressor"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"An electrically-powered device which compresses gas to increase pressure.  "
"Used in fridges, air conditioners and many other appliances."
msgstr "ガスに高圧をかけて圧縮する電動装置です。冷蔵庫やエアコンなど、多くの家電製品で利用されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "nitrogen membrane filter"
msgid_plural "nitrogen membrane filters"
msgstr[0] "窒素フィルター"

#. ~ Description of "nitrogen membrane filter"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A straight pipe with high-tech membrane filter inside it, designed to "
"separate nitrogen from compressed air that is pumped through it."
msgstr "まっすぐなパイプの中にはろ過フィルターが入っており、内部を通る圧縮空気から窒素だけを分離できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "magnet"
msgid_plural "magnets"
msgstr[0] "磁石"

#. ~ Description of "magnet"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A small but strong permanent magnet made from alnico alloy, which produces a"
" magnetic field that attracts ferromagnetic materials such as steel.  Useful"
" for crafting."
msgstr "アルニコ合金製の強力な小型永久磁石です。磁場を発生させており、鉄などの強磁性素材を引き寄せます。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "heavy duty pipe"
msgid_plural "heavy duty pipes"
msgstr[0] "高耐久パイプ"

#. ~ Description of "heavy duty pipe"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A section of steel pipe with very thick walls built to contain very high "
"pressure, probably intended to be a part of industrial equipment."
msgstr "非常に高い圧力にも耐えられる、産業機器に使われているような分厚い鋼鉄製のパイプです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "set of heavy duty pipe fittings"
msgid_plural "sets of heavy duty pipe fittings"
msgstr[0] "高耐久管継手セット"

#. ~ Description of "set of heavy duty pipe fittings"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A loose assortment of very thick-walled steel pipe fittings - end caps, pipe"
" junctions, and similar items.  Probably intended to be a part of industrial"
" equipment."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の高耐久パイプに使われるエンドキャップ、分岐継手などの継手が複数揃っています。産業機器の部品として使われるもののようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "heavy duty valve"
msgid_plural "heavy duty valves"
msgstr[0] "高耐久バルブ"

#. ~ Description of "heavy duty valve"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A short section of thick-walled pipe with a valve integrated into it, "
"allowing an operator to regulate the flow of gas or liquid through it."
msgstr "気体や液体の流れを調節できるバルブが付属した、頑丈で短いパイプです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "pressure gauge"
msgid_plural "pressure gauges"
msgstr[0] "圧力計"

#. ~ Description of "pressure gauge"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A short section of thick-walled pipe with a device which shows the internal "
"pressure built into it."
msgstr "内部の圧力を表示する計器が付属した、頑丈で短いパイプです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "pyrometer"
msgid_plural "pyrometers"
msgstr[0] "パイロメーター"

#. ~ Description of "pyrometer"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "A small electronic device used for measuring high temperatures."
msgstr "高温を測定する際に使われる小型電子機器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "industrial compressor"
msgid_plural "industrial compressors"
msgstr[0] "工業用コンプレッサー"

#. ~ Description of "industrial compressor"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A bulky and very powerful compressor which can produce very high pressure if"
" fitted to a pipe.  Much more powerful than whatever you'd find in common "
"household appliances."
msgstr ""
"一般的な家電製品で使われているものよりはるかに強力な、大型のコンプレッサーです。配管に取り付ければ、非常に高い圧力を発生させることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "large pressure vessel"
msgid_plural "large pressure vessels"
msgstr[0] "大型圧力容器"

#. ~ Description of "large pressure vessel"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"An enormously bulky and heavy steel vessel with thick walls.  Likely meant "
"to be a reaction chamber for industrial processes requiring high pressure."
msgstr "高圧がかかる工業用の反応槽に使われるような、巨大で重厚な鋼鉄製の容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "small pressure vessel"
msgid_plural "small pressure vessels"
msgstr[0] "小型圧力容器"

#. ~ Description of "small pressure vessel"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A rather small steel vessel with thick walls designed to contain high "
"pressure.  Quite heavy for its size."
msgstr "高圧にも耐える小型の鋼鉄製容器です。サイズの割には重く感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "set of pipe fittings"
msgid_plural "sets of pipe fittings"
msgstr[0] "管継手セット"

#. ~ Description of "set of pipe fittings"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A loose assortment of metal pipe fittings - end caps, pipe junctions, and "
"similar items.  They can be used in a variety of projects."
msgstr "エンドキャップ、分岐継手などの金属パイプ用継手が複数揃っています。色々な作業に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid "simple crank mechanism"
msgid_plural "simple crank mechanisms"
msgstr[0] "簡易クランク"

#. ~ Description of "simple crank mechanism"
#: data/json/items/generic/spares.json
msgid ""
"A simple cranking mechanism, consisting of a bent metal arm attached at a "
"right angle to a rotating shaft.  It can be used to convert circular motion "
"into reciprocating motion, or vice versa, by means of muscle power."
msgstr ""
"折れ曲がった金属製のアームを回転軸に取り付けただけの、シンプルなクランク機構です。人力で円運動を往復運動に、またはその逆に変換することができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid "clothes hanger"
msgid_plural "clothes hangers"
msgstr[0] "ハンガー"

#. ~ Description of "clothes hanger"
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid ""
"A plastic clothes hanger with a metal hook to hang something on a rail."
msgstr "レールなどに掛けられる金属製のフックが付いた、プラスチック製の衣類用ハンガーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid "storage line"
msgid_plural "storage lines"
msgstr[0] "ハンギングチェーン"

#. ~ Description of "storage line"
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid ""
"A four foot long collection of carabiners for hanging items while camping."
msgstr "キャンプで道具を吊るす際に使う、カラビナが複数付いた長さ約1.2mのロープです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "storage line"
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid "Small carabiner."
msgstr "小型カラビナ"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "storage line"
#: data/json/items/generic/storage.json
msgid "Large carabiner."
msgstr "大型カラビナ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short cordage piece"
msgid_plural "short cordage pieces"
msgstr[0] "簡易紐(15cm)"

#. ~ Description of "short cordage piece"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of natural cordage.  Useful for some "
"purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper string."
msgstr "天然の繊維を編んで作った長さ約15cmの紐です。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常の紐ほど丈夫ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long cordage piece"
msgid_plural "long cordage pieces"
msgstr[0] "簡易紐(90cm)"

#. ~ Description of "long cordage piece"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of natural cordage.  Useful for some "
"purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper string."
msgstr "天然の繊維を編んで作った長さ約90cmの紐です。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常の紐ほど丈夫ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short string"
msgid_plural "short strings"
msgstr[0] "紐(15cm)"

#. ~ Description of "short string"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of cotton string."
msgstr "長さ約15cmの綿製の紐です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long string"
msgid_plural "long strings"
msgstr[0] "紐(90cm)"

#. ~ Description of "long string"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of cotton string."
msgstr "長さ約90cmの綿製の紐です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short leather lace"
msgid_plural "short leather laces"
msgstr[0] "革紐(15cm)"

#. ~ Description of "short leather lace"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 6-inch (or about 15 cm) long piece of leather lace.  Useful for some "
"purposes, but not as flexible as proper string."
msgstr "長さ約15cmの革紐です。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常の紐ほど柔軟ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long leather lace"
msgid_plural "long leather laces"
msgstr[0] "革紐(90cm)"

#. ~ Description of "long leather lace"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 3-foot (or about 90 cm) long piece of leather lace, made from smaller "
"pieces that are tied together.  Useful for some purposes, but not as "
"flexible as proper string."
msgstr "短い革紐を束ねて長さ約90cmほどに伸ばしたものです。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常の紐ほど柔軟ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short rope"
msgid_plural "short ropes"
msgstr[0] "ロープ(1.8m)"

#. ~ Description of "short rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long piece of rope.  Wear it over a shoulder and "
"tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "長さ約1.8mのロープです。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "short rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
#, c-format
msgid "You use an elaborate knot to tie your %s to your %s"
msgstr "%sを%sにしっかりと結び付けました。"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "short rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "Tie what to the rope?"
msgstr "ロープで結ぶアイテムを選択"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long rope"
msgid_plural "long ropes"
msgstr[0] "ロープ(9m)"

#. ~ Description of "long rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 30-foot (or about 9 m) long rope.  Useful for keeping yourself safe from "
"falls.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"長さ約9mのロープです。高所から落下しないように身体を固定できます。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short vine"
msgid_plural "short vines"
msgstr[0] "蔓(1.8m)"

#. ~ Description of "short vine"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long vine.  Wear it over a shoulder and "
"tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr "長さ約1.8mの蔓です。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long vine"
msgid_plural "long vines"
msgstr[0] "蔓(9m)"

#. ~ Description of "long vine"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy 30-foot (or about 9 m) long vine.  Could easily be used as a rope."
"  Strong enough to suspend a large corpse for butchering.  Wear it over a "
"shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr ""
"全長約9mの丈夫な蔓です。簡易的なロープの代わりになります。丈夫なので、死体を吊るして解体するときにも使えます。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "short cordage rope"
msgid_plural "short cordage ropes"
msgstr[0] "簡易ロープ(1.8m)"

#. ~ Description of "short cordage rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 6-foot (or about 180 cm) long piece of rough rope, woven from natural "
"cordage.  Useful for some purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper "
"rope.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie items to it as a temporary carrying "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"天然の繊維を編んで作った長さ約1.8mの粗末なロープです。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常のロープほど丈夫ではありません。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "long cordage rope"
msgid_plural "long cordage ropes"
msgstr[0] "簡易ロープ(9m)"

#. ~ Description of "long cordage rope"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"A 30-foot (or about 9 m) long rough rope, woven from natural cordage.  Not "
"strong enough to hold up to falls, but still useful for some things, such as"
" suspending large corpses for butchering.  Wear it over a shoulder and tie "
"items to it as a temporary carrying solution."
msgstr ""
"天然の繊維を編んで作った長さ約9mの粗末なロープです。使い道はいくつかありますが、通常のロープほど丈夫ではありません。アイテムを結び付けて肩にかければ、荷物の一時的な運搬手段として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "fibrous stalk"
msgid_plural "fibrous stalks"
msgstr[0] "繊維屑"

#. ~ Description of "fibrous stalk"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "A rather green stick.  Very fibrous."
msgstr "多量の繊維質が含まれている緑がかった茎です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid "rubber band"
msgid_plural "rubber bands"
msgstr[0] "輪ゴム"

#. ~ Description of "rubber band"
#: data/json/items/generic/string.json
msgid ""
"An elastic loop of rubber commonly used to hold multiple objects together."
msgstr "複数の物体を束ねるために使う、ゴム製の輪です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "talking doll"
msgid_plural "talking dolls"
msgstr[0] "お喋り人形"

#. ~ Description of "talking doll"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"This is a talking doll, meant for children.  Fortunately it still works, and"
" you could unload the batteries out of it."
msgstr "子供用の喋る人形です。幸運にもまだ動作するようですが、電池を取り外す事もできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "figurine"
msgid_plural "figurines"
msgstr[0] "フィギュア"

#. ~ Description of "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "Some kind of figurine.  It does not have much use nowadays."
msgstr "小さな立体造形物です。今となっては特に使い道もありません。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "Shaped like a human female.  It was made to wear different clothes."
msgstr "これは人間の女性のフィギュアです。様々な服を着せられる作りになっています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"This one wears a hat.  It wears a glove on it's right hand that has three "
"blades sticking out."
msgstr "これは帽子をかぶった人物のフィギュアです。刃が三本突き出した手袋を右手にはめています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A blue unicorn that covers it's eyes with it's hooves.  It's in a sitting "
"position."
msgstr "これは青色のユニコーンのフィギュアです。座り込み、蹄で目を覆っています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A pink unicorn that covers it's ears with it's hooves.  It's in a sitting "
"position."
msgstr "これはピンク色のユニコーンのフィギュアです。座り込み、蹄で耳を覆っています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A purple unicorn that covers it's mouth with it's hooves.  It's in a sitting"
" position."
msgstr "これは紫色のユニコーンのフィギュアです。座り込み、蹄で口を覆っています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "It seems to wear a reindeer suit.  It has a skull for a head."
msgstr "これはトナカイの着ぐるみを着た骸骨のフィギュアのようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "It looks like a swamp monster with scales over it's body."
msgstr "これは全身に鱗が生えたスワンプモンスターのフィギュアのようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "It looks like the reaper.  In it's left hand is a scythe."
msgstr "これは左手に鎌を持った死神のフィギュアのようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "A mermaid sitting on a rock.  It has red hair."
msgstr "これは、岩に腰掛けている赤髪の人魚のフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"It seems to wear an avocado suit.  In the left hand is a salt shaker and in "
"the right hand is a spoon.  It's in a sitting position."
msgstr "これはアボカドの着ぐるみを着た人物のフィギュアのようです。左手に塩の小瓶、右手にスプーンを持ち、座り込んでいます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"Looks like someone's hero.  You can bend the arms and legs to give it "
"different stances."
msgstr "これは何かの作品のヒーローのフィギュアのようです。腕や脚を曲げて、色々なポーズを取らせることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "swimming kickboard"
msgid_plural "swimming kickboards"
msgstr[0] "ビート板"

#. ~ Description of "swimming kickboard"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A swimming kickboard, would be a great training aid for the beach or the "
"pool, if only they weren't full of zombies and mutant fish."
msgstr "水泳で使うビート板です。ゾンビや変異した魚さえ居なければ、ビーチやプールで水泳の練習をするのに最適な道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "badminton shuttlecock"
msgid_plural "shuttlecocks"
msgstr[0] "シャトルコック"

#. ~ Description of "badminton shuttlecock"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "A high-drag projectile used in the sport of badminton."
msgstr "高速で飛ぶバドミントン用具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "golf tee"
msgid_plural "golf tees"
msgstr[0] "ゴルフティー"

#. ~ Description of "golf tee"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of wood meant for holding a golf ball slightly off the "
"ground."
msgstr "ゴルフボールを地面からわずかに高い位置に置くための、木製の釘のような道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "golf ball"
msgid_plural "golf balls"
msgstr[0] "ゴルフボール"

#. ~ Description of "golf ball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "A small, hard plastic ball with round indentations on it."
msgstr "表面にたくさんの窪みがついた、硬化プラスチック製の小さなボールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "pool ball"
msgid_plural "pool balls"
msgstr[0] "ビリヤードボール"

#. ~ Description of "pool ball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A colorful, hard plastic ball for playing games on a pool table.  "
"Essentially a rock."
msgstr "ビリヤード台に載せて競技に使う、色鮮やかな硬化プラスチック製ボールです。本質的には石と同じようなものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "bowling ball"
msgid_plural "bowling balls"
msgstr[0] "ボウリングボール"

#. ~ Description of "bowling ball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy ball with finger holes for better grip.  Before the "
"apocalypse, its main purpose was to be rolled along waxed floors."
msgstr "大きく重いボールです。世界が滅ぶ以前の主な用途は、ワックス掛けされた床をゴロゴロと転がすことでした。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "baseball"
msgid_plural "baseballs"
msgstr[0] "野球ボール"

#. ~ Description of "baseball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A baseball, good for throwing at enemies.  Getting hit with one of these "
"hurts a lot more than you might think."
msgstr "敵に向かって投擲するのにちょうどいい野球ボールです。これが身体に当たると想像以上に痛いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "football"
msgid_plural "footballs"
msgstr[0] "フットボール"

#. ~ Description of "football"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"An oval-shaped ball made of leather and string, it's easily thrown but does "
"little damage.  You could take it apart into leather if you wanted."
msgstr ""
"革を糸で縫い合わせて作った楕円形のボールです。投げやすい形状ですが、ぶつけてもダメージはほとんどありません。分解して革を再利用することもできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/generics.json
msgid "basketball"
msgid_plural "basketballs"
msgstr[0] "バスケットボール"

#. ~ Description of "basketball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "A high-quality, size 7 indoor basketball."
msgstr "7号サイズの高品質な屋内用バスケットボールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "volleyball"
msgid_plural "volleyballs"
msgstr[0] "バレーボール"

#. ~ Description of "volleyball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "A standard regulation volleyball."
msgstr "標準規格のバレーボールです。"

#. ~ lazerlyte trainer target was used as a reference
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "aim game target practice kit"
msgid_plural "aim game target practice kits"
msgstr[0] "照準訓練キット"

#. ~ lazerlyte trainer target was used as a reference
#. ~ Description of "aim game target practice kit"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A collection of laser guns and targets designed to help you practice "
"shooting.  The spot you 'hit' is displayed on the targets."
msgstr "レーザーポインターと的がセットになった、射撃訓練グッズです。的にはレーザーを当てた位置が表示される機能が付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "beach volleyball"
msgid_plural "beach volleyballs"
msgstr[0] "ビーチボール"

#. ~ Description of "beach volleyball"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A brightly colored beach volleyball.  It is slightly larger than a regular "
"white one."
msgstr "色鮮やかなビーチボールです。一般的なバレーボールよりも少し大きなサイズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "hockey puck"
msgid_plural "hockey pucks"
msgstr[0] "ホッケーパック"

#. ~ Description of "hockey puck"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A heavy circular block of solid rubber, normally used for playing hockey.  "
"You can throw it to cause some serious harm."
msgstr "硬いゴム製の重い円形のパックです。通常はホッケーの試合で使いますが、敵に投げつけて深刻なダメージを与えることもできます。"

#. ~ Description of "mannequin"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A figure of an adult human, as seen in the display case at the mall.  It "
"might be able to fool some zombies if it could attract their attention."
msgstr "ショッピングモールのショーウィンドーにあるような、成人サイズの人形です。ゾンビの気を引くことができれば、囮として活用できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json data/json/monsters/misc.json
msgid "mannequin decoy"
msgid_plural "mannequin decoys"
msgstr[0] "マネキンデコイ"

#. ~ Description of "mannequin decoy"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"A figure of an adult human, as seen in the display case at the mall.  This "
"one is cradling a talking doll.  It can make sound when powered by batteries"
" and can be used to distract some zombies."
msgstr ""
"ショッピングモールのショーウィンドーにあるような、お喋り人形を抱きかかえた成人サイズの人形です。起動すると電池駆動で音を発し、一部のゾンビの気を引くことができます。"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "mannequin decoy"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid "You activate the talking doll on the mannequin."
msgstr "マネキン人形に取り付けたお喋り人形を起動しました。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "mannequin decoy"
#: data/json/items/generic/toys_and_sports.json
msgid ""
"Your mannequin seems to have a mind of its own!  If you see this, an error "
"has occurred."
msgstr "マネキン人形は意思を持ちました！このメッセージが表示された場合はエラーが発生しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "10mm/.40 revolver"
msgid_plural "10mm/.40 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/ﾘﾎﾞﾙﾊﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "10mm/.40 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A classic six-shooter revolver chambered for 10mm and .40 rounds."
msgstr "10mmと.40口径弾を6発装填できるクラシックなリボルバー銃です。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "10mm/.40 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "S&W 610"
msgid_plural "S&W 610"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/S&W 610)"

#. ~ Description of variant "10mm/.40 revolver" of gun "S&W 610"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"The Smith and Wesson 610 is a classic six-shooter revolver chambered for "
"10mm rounds, or for S&W's own .40 round."
msgstr "S&W社製のクラシックな6連発リボルバーです。弾薬は10mmオート弾、または自社製の.40S&W弾を使用します。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "compact Glock pistol"
msgid_plural "compact Glock pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/小型ｸﾞﾛｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A small pistol accepting Glock magazines and chambered in 10mm.  Because of "
"its size, it is easy to carry, but it has rather fierce recoil."
msgstr "グロック弾倉に対応している、10mm口径の小さなハンドガンです。小型なので持ち運びは楽ですが、反動はかなり強くなっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Glock 29"
msgid_plural "Glock 29s"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/ｸﾞﾛｯｸ29)"

#. ~ Description of variant "compact Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 29"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A modestly sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  It is easy to carry because of its small size, but also "
"recoils fiercely."
msgstr ""
"大成功を収めたグロックのサイズを、一回り小さくしたものです。強力な10mmオート弾を装填します。小さいため持ち運びに適していますが、反動が強いのも特徴です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid "Glock pistol"
msgid_plural "Glock pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(ｸﾞﾛｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "グロック弾倉に対応している、10mm口径のセミオートピストルです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Glock 20"
msgid_plural "Glock 20s"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/ｸﾞﾛｯｸ20)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 20"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  The third model of Glock designed, all other full-sized,"
" large framed Glocks are adaptations of this one."
msgstr ""
"大成功を収めたグロックと同じサイズですが、この銃は強力な10mmオート弾を装填します。グロックシリーズの第三弾であり、他の大型グロックのフレームは全てこの銃を基にしています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Glock 40 MOS"
msgid_plural "Glock 40 MOSs"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(10mm/ｸﾞﾛｯｸ40 MOS)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 40 MOS"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered "
"in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly more "
"accurate and powerful shots, and the extra slide length means the sights are"
" a little easier to use.  It also features Glock's Modular Optic System, "
"making aftermarket optics much easier to mount."
msgstr ""
"大成功を収めたグロックと同じサイズですが、この銃はロングスライドモデルであり10mmオート弾を装填します。銃身が長くなったことで正確で強力な射撃が可能になり、スライドの長さのお陰で照準器も使いやすくなりました。グロック社のモジュラーオプティックシステムを搭載しており、市販の光学部品をより簡単に取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "BA10 rifle"
msgid_plural "BA10 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(10mm/BA10)"

#. ~ Description of gun "BA10 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic rifle chambered in 10mm and accepting BA10 magazines."
msgstr "BA10弾倉に対応している、10mm口径のセミオートライフルです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "BA10 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "BA10"
msgid_plural "BA10s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(10mm/BA10)"

#. ~ Description of variant "BA10 rifle" of gun "BA10"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"The MP5/10 served the FBI briefly alongside their 10mm Auto pistols, adding "
"to the caliber's overall mystique.  Though the gun's usage was short-lived, "
"a handful of clones were made and sold occasionally.  This semi-automatic "
"clone manufactured by Brethren Arms features a welded-on M1913 rail and a "
"collapsible arm brace."
msgstr ""
"FBIで短期間使われていたことが原因で、オートピストルと同じくように神秘性が高まった銃です。使用期間は短かったもののわずかにクローン品が作られ、時折市場に現れました。ブレザレン・アーマメント社が製造したこのセミオート式クローンはM1913のレールが溶接されており、折り畳めるアームブレースが付属しています。"

#. ~ Firing mode of gun "BA10 rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Glock SMG"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "RM20 autoshotgun"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "American-180"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "G36 assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M249S"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M16 burst rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M16 auto rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "SIG assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "AUG assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Browning Automatic Rifle"
