" Platform."
msgstr "ハブ01製のHWPに対応する、大容量40発箱型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/json/items/gun/robofac_gun.json
msgid "HWP 40/50-round 4.6/5.7 magazine"
msgid_plural "HWP 40/50-round 4.6/5.7 magazines"
