"希少価値の高い日本刀です。装甲の薄い敵に対して致命的なダメージを与えられますが、装甲の厚い相手にも有効です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened katana"
msgid_plural "hardened katana"
msgstr[0] "日本刀(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very effective against armor.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"希少価値の高い日本刀です。装甲の薄い敵に対して致命的なダメージを与えられますが、装甲の厚い相手にも有効です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼入炭素鋼で作られており、柄の形状は手によく馴染みます。武器全体のバランスも完璧で、刃は鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered katana"
msgid_plural "tempered katana"
msgstr[0] "日本刀(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very effective against armor.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"希少価値の高い日本刀です。装甲の薄い敵に対して致命的なダメージを与えられますが、装甲の厚い相手にも有効です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼戻炭素鋼で作られており、柄のフィット感、全体のバランス、刃の切れ味、全てにおいて完璧です。これぞ匠の技の結晶です。"

#. ~ Description of "katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A dull, cheaply-made replica of a rare sword from Japan."
msgstr "希少価値の高い日本刀...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Description of "katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A rare sword from Japan.  While it's got the right edge and weight, the "
"pommel feels like it'll just snap off, and the blade seems pretty worn."
msgstr "希少な日本の刀です。本物の刃が付いてはいるのですが、まるでなまくらで、柄頭も無くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge two-handed sword from Germany.  Even "
"blunted, it still packs a wallop."
msgstr "ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。依然として強烈な一撃を叩き込めます。"

#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  You're not quite sure it's supposed "
"to be this bendy."
msgstr "ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。想像していたよりずっと折れやすそうに見えます。"

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of an Early Modern sword that saw use in the "
"16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer"
" rapiers."
msgstr ""
"16世紀から18世紀頃にかけて使われていた剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。細身のレイピアとの対比として、ブロード(幅広の)ソードと呼ばれました。"

#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a curved sword associated with cavalry from "
"the Early Modern period onwards."
msgstr "近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベル...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Description of "rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A blunted, cheap replica of a thin sword with an ornate handguard.  It looks"
" like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick,"
" it makes any battle a stylish battle."
msgstr "華美な鍔が付いた、紳士と剣士が好む細剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。軽量で素早く扱えるため、どんな戦いもスタイリッシュにこなせます"

#. ~ Description of "wakizashi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheap replica of the more common wakizashi.  Smaller and lighter "
"than a katana, but still effective in combat."
msgstr "日本生まれの脇差...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。日本刀よりも短くて軽いですが、効果的な武器であることに変わりはありません。"

#. ~ Description of "wakizashi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A comparatively common Japanese short sword.  There's something not quite "
"right about this one."
msgstr "日本生まれのショートソードです。この刀は作りにどこか粗があるような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of "kris"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A dull, cheap replica of a wavy-bladed dagger from Southeast Asia."
msgstr "波打つ刃をもつ、東南アジア生まれの短剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ basically 2x the weight, 1.3x the damage, 2.5x the resources of a single
#. machete to cover the fact that it's two weapons, each with a hand guard
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "pair of butterfly swords"
msgid_plural "pairs of butterfly swords"
msgstr[0] "胡蝶刀"

#. ~ basically 2x the weight, 1.3x the damage, 2.5x the resources of a single
#. machete to cover the fact that it's two weapons, each with a hand guard
#. ~ Description of "pair of butterfly swords"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A matched pair of traditional Shaolin butterfly swords.  They are about the "
"same size as machetes, but have hand guards and wider blades."
msgstr "少林寺拳法で使う伝統的な一組の胡蝶刀です。サイズはマチェットと同程度ですが、刃の幅が広く、ハンドガードが付いています。"

#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade "
"is easy to handle in close quarters."
msgstr "船乗りや海賊が愛用したことで知られる、幅広のサーベルです。刃渡りが短いため、接近戦でも楽に扱えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel cutlass"
msgid_plural "mild steel cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "カトラス(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel cutlass"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade is easy to handle in close quarters.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"船乗りや海賊が愛用したことで知られる、幅広のサーベルです。刃渡りが短いため、接近戦でも楽に扱えます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel cutlass"
msgid_plural "medium steel cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "カトラス(中炭素鋼)"

