msgid "glass shard"
msgid_plural "glass shards"
msgstr[0] "ガラス片"

#. ~ Description of "glass shard"
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"A broken shard of glass covered in sharp edges.  You could use it as a "
"weapon, but you might want to wear gloves."
msgstr "割れた鋭いガラスの破片です。武器として使うこともできますが、手袋を着用しておきましょう。"

