msgid "You open the nightlight's cover."
msgstr "常夜灯のカバーを開きました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "candle"
msgid_plural "candles"
msgstr[0] "ろうそく"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a thick candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn"
" for quite a long time.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "太いろうそくです。光は弱いですが、とても長持ちします。着火にはライターやマッチが必要です。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You light the candle."
msgstr "ろうそくに火をつけました。"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a thick candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn"
" for quite a long time.  This candle is lit."
msgstr "太いろうそくです。光は弱いですが、とても長持ちします。火がついています。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The candle winks out."
msgstr "ろうそくの火がふっと消えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "electric lantern (off)"
msgid_plural "electric lanterns (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動ランタン(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "electric lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a battery-powered lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "電池駆動式のランプです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。オンにすることで明かりが点きます。"

