msgstr "ランタンの火が消えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "glowstick"
msgid_plural "glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト"

#. ~ Description of "glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a small blue light glowstick.  Use it to bend the plastic and break "
"the glass cylinder inside to start the reaction.  It will produce a small "
"amount of light."
msgstr "青く光る短い棒です。折り曲げると中の容器が割れて、中身が化学反応を起こし、淡く発光します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You activate the glowstick."
msgstr "ケミカルライトを点けました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "dead glowstick"
msgid_plural "dead glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト(使用済)"

#. ~ Description of "dead glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "This is a spent glowstick.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "使用済みのケミカルライトです。使い道のないゴミですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "active glowstick"
msgid_plural "active glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト(発光)"

#. ~ Description of "active glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an active glowstick and is producing light.  It will last for a few "
"hours before burning out."
msgstr "発光中のケミカルライトです。数時間光を発し続けます。"

#. ~ Dying message of tool "active glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The glowstick fades out."
msgstr "ケミカルライトの光が消えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "flare"
msgid_plural "flares"
msgstr[0] "発炎筒"

#. ~ Description of "flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
