"This is a light-emitting circuit that has been wired directly to a battery."
"  It provides some weak light and can't be turned off until the battery "
"dies."
msgstr "電池と直接繋がっている発光回路です。弱い光を発しており、電池が切れるまで消灯できません。"

#. ~ Dying message of tool "lightstrip"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The lightstrip dies."
msgstr "ストリップライトの光が消えました。"

#. ~ This doesn't make too much sense, flavor-wise, but it's the best I can
