#. ~ Roughly in the 70cm×70cm×1.5mm to 1m×1m×0.75mm range. Has to be folded /
#. rolled up when in inventory, so 75% density compared to solid block.
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/plating.json
