#, c-format
msgid "A %s explodes!"
msgstr "%sが爆発しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"With a high-pitched shriek, the wretch's belly splits open, and gore-smeared"
" winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "甲高い悲鳴とともに真菌風船ゾンビの腹が裂け、内部から翼をもつ血塗れの獣が這い出してきました！"

#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "fungal wretch"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "swollen wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
msgid "the stretched skin of the abdomen"
msgstr "腹部の薄い皮"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal raptors"
msgstr[0] "真菌猛禽ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator "
"darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human "
"hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
"  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is "
"made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"翼を使って空を飛ぶゾンビです。人間の手のような形状の、真菌に覆われたスポンジ状の3枚の翼が生えています。翼の付け根には、細く鋭い複数の棘が突き出ています。地球上で見たこともないような姿ですが、不思議なことに各部位は確かに人間のものです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dark wyrm"
msgid_plural "dark wyrms"
msgstr[0] "ダークウィルム"

#. ~ Description of monster "dark wyrm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated worm living deep underground.  It has a round, gaping mouth "
"lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue "
"slime."
msgstr ""
"地下深くに生息する、変異した巨大な蠕虫です。ぽっかりと開いた口の中には短剣のような歯が並んでおり、全身の皮膚が泡立つ青い粘液に覆われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "graboid"
msgid_plural "graboids"
msgstr[0] "グラボイド"

#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous beast the size of a semi truck with a tripartite mouth that "
"opens to reveal hundreds of writhing tongues with razor sharp edges.  It "
"keeps most of its enormous body hidden underground."
msgstr ""
"三方向に裂けるように口を開く、トレーラーほどのサイズの巨大な怪物です。口の中には鋭いギザギザの付いた舌が無数にうごめいています。巨体の大部分は地下に隠れています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "graboid"
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant worm"
#. ~ Death message of monster "slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "brain slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "big slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie hollow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s splits in two!"
msgstr "%sが2つに分裂しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "half worm"
msgid_plural "half worms"
msgstr[0] "ハーフワーム"

#. ~ Description of monster "half worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "負傷した巨大ワームの切断部位です。不規則にのたうっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant worm"
msgid_plural "giant worms"
msgstr[0] "巨大ワーム"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge, mutated creature that might once have been a nightcrawler.  It "
"possesses a large fanged mouth and a long slender body that comes up to your"
" shoulder, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"かつてはミミズだったと思しき大型の変異生物です。成人の肩程の位置にある口からは牙が覗いており、地中へと続く体の先には地上部分の何倍もの体長が隠れている事は想像に難くないでしょう。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "large worm"
msgid_plural "large worms"
msgstr[0] "大型ワーム"

#. ~ Description of monster "large worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated subterranean creature similar to a "
"nightcrawler.  It possesses a fanged mouth and a long slender body that "
"comes up to your knees, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"大ミミズに似た姿の、不穏なほど大きく変異した地中生物です。口からは牙が生えており、その細身を使って人間の膝へ這い上ります。地中に隠れるのが得意です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "cockroach"
msgid_plural "cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "ゴキブリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "小型犬ほどの大きさの、変異した攻撃的なゴキブリです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "skittering plague"
msgid_plural "skittering plagues"
msgstr[0] "感染ゴキブリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its"
" primary food source.  The diet of infected flesh doesn't seem to harm it, "
"but something about the roach's biology is clearly changing.  It doesn't "
"seem interested in you."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビを食べ過ぎたような姿をした、巨大で不快なゴキブリです。ゾンビの肉を食べてもピンピンしていますが、普通のゴキブリと比べて生態が明らかに変化しています。こちらには興味を抱いていないようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "感染ゴキブリ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth"
" on a healthy diet of zombie flesh.  It still has enough natural instinct "
"left to avoid approaching you."
msgstr ""
"生まれた時からゾンビの肉を食べて育った、ラットほどのサイズの不快なゴキブリの変異体です。まだ本能が残っているのか、こちらに近付こうとはしません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビゴキブリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and "
"started to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its "
"thorax, and it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"巨大なゴキブリがゾンビを食べ続け、やがて無秩序に変異し始めました。胴から余分な肢が生えており、自分より遥かに大きな生物に対しても攻撃的です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "巨大ゴキブリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all"
" it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr "イヌほどの大きさの変異したゴキブリです。サイズの優位性を感じ取り、人間を食料と見なすようになりました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "巨大ゴキブリ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "ラットほどのサイズの、変異したゴキブリの幼体です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "巨大ゴキブリ(産卵期)"

#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr "小型犬ほどのサイズの変異したゴキブリです。卵が入った腹部が大きく膨らんでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "bee"
msgid_plural "bees"
msgstr[0] "ミツバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "小型犬ほどのサイズの変異したハチです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "巨大ハチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black "
"and yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr "キッチンナイフのような針をもつ、イヌほどのサイズの昆虫です。黒と黄色の縞模様は近寄る者に警告するサインです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "超巨大ハチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr "黒と白のまだら模様の体表と凶悪そうな針をもつ、変異した非常に巨大なハチです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "centipede"
msgid_plural "centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ムカデ"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"小型犬ほどのサイズの色鮮やかなムカデの変異体が、地面を素早く這い回っています。こちらを獲物だとは思っていないようですが、毒には注意が必要です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "巨大ムカデ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"全長約2mの大ムカデです。牙から恐ろしい毒液が滴り、敵を拘束する複数の小顎を打ち鳴らし、棘が生えた数十本の肢を忙しく動かしています。小さな複眼が2つありますが、ほとんど触覚を頼りにして移動方向を決めているようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "女王ムカデ"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its"
" young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the "
"underbrush."
msgstr ""
"更に大きく成長した巨大ムカデが、とぐろを巻いて巨大な卵塊や様々なサイズの幼生を囲んでいます。時折、小さなムカデが群れの外へと押し出され、下の茂みのへ落ちていきます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "群れの闘争に巻き込まれた小さなムカデが振り落とされました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "巨大装甲ムカデ"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of "
"metallic gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living "
"animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialised to hunt "
"prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if "
"you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"メタリックグレーの外殻で覆われた巨大な変異ムカデは、生物というよりも暴走する列車のように見えます。牙はギザギザに尖っており、少なくとも自身と同じくらい十分な装甲をもった獲物を狩る用途に特化しているようです。戦ってみようなどと考えない方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "giant dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "巨大ヤゴ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"トンボの幼虫である、肉食性の水生生物です。通常は体長約1cm程度で主に小魚を食べていますが、この個体はナマズほどのサイズまで成長しています。折り畳まれた鋭い下顎は、棘が付いた槍のような形状に変化しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "巨大トンボ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to"
" the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized"
" pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"鮮やかな緑色のトンボです。子供ほどのサイズまで成長したにもかかわらず、超高速で飛び回っています。頭部にある虹色の複眼はバスケットボールサイズまで肥大し、獲物を捕らえることに特化した肢の先には湾曲した爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "連結巨大トンボ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"腹部が膨らんだ単一の巨大な昆虫のように見えますが、実際には2匹のトンボが交尾している姿であり、それぞれが連結してハート型を形作っています。翅と腹部の辺りから卵嚢がダラダラと出てきており、定期的に艶やかな卵塊を生み落とします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "firefly"
msgid_plural "fireflies"
msgstr[0] "ホタル"

#. ~ Description of monster "firefly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It "
"looks strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"大型のイエネコほどのサイズまで成長した、ホタルの変異種です。まだ見ぬ仲間に気付いてもらうために、明るく輝く腹部を上下に揺らしています。人間などの他の生物には興味がないようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "fly"
msgid_plural "flies"
msgstr[0] "ハエ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr "変異したイエバエです。小型犬ほどのサイズで、甲高く悲しげな羽音を立てています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "巨大ハエ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr "イヌほどのサイズの巨大なイエバエです。絶え間なく非常に大きな騒音を撒き散らしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "超巨大ハエ"

#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cow, creating a loud buzzing sound as it "
"inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr "ウシほどのサイズの変異したイエバエが、大きな羽音を立てながら所在なさげに浮遊しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "mosquito"
msgid_plural "mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "蚊"

#. ~ Description of monster "mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering "
"erratically."
msgstr "変異した蚊です。小型犬ほどのサイズで、不規則に唸りながら羽ばたいています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "巨大蚊"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito the size of a dog, fluttering erratically.  Its face"
" is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr "不規則に飛び回る、イヌほどの大きさの変異した蚊です。顔には鋭く尖った長い吻が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "超巨大蚊"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a cow, with huge, thin wings and legs.  Its "
"face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr "長細い翅と肢をもつ、ウシほどのサイズの変異した蚊です。顔には槍のように長い吻が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "cellar spider"
msgid_plural "cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "ユウレイグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr ""
"「あしながおじさん」という別名でも知られる、気味が悪いほど大きなユウレイグモです。胴は人間の頭ほどのサイズがあり、細長い肢は人間の膝あたりまで伸びています。不安になるほど滑らかな動きで、こちらから逃げようとします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大ユウレイグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into "
"three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles "
"chittering in anticipation."
msgstr ""
"常に動き回っている巨大な茶色いクモです。胴は人間の子供ほどのサイズがあり、細長い肢は人間の胸あたりまで伸びています。肢の先端は3又に分かれています。より小さなものと異なり、明らかにこちらを狩ろうとしており、大顎を鳴らして追い掛けてきます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "mommy long-legs"
msgid_plural "mommy long legs"
msgstr[0] "巨大ユウレイグモ(産卵期)"

#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of "
"crawling spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing"
" on her long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in"
" you."
msgstr ""
"驚くほど用心深い性格の、巨大なユウレイグモです。人間の頭ほどのサイズの卵塊を大顎で支え、様々な大きさの大事な子グモたちを巣から落とさないよう長い肢で慎重にバランスを取っています。こちらに興味はなさそうです。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "クモの幼体が巣から落ちてきました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨大ユウレイグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""
"キチン質でできた無数の肢は、一見すると好き勝手に動き絡み合っているようにも見えますが、ウシほどのサイズの胴をかろうじて支えています。頭胸部から伸びた肢には歪んで痙攣しているだけのものもありますが、頭部、特に大顎は今も正常に機能しているようです。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "歪んだ肢が不規則に動き出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "detached spider leg"
msgid_plural "detached spider legs"
msgstr[0] "クモの肢"

#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?"
"  off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular "
"clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr ""
"変異したユウレイグモがダメージを受けた際に、頭胸部から生えていた奇形の肢が取れて...勝手に這い回っているようです。先端から生えた爪は不規則に動いて近付くものを掴もうとし、やみくもに暴れています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "jumping spider"
msgid_plural "jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "ハエトリグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr "変異したクモです。小型犬ほどのサイズで、前肢が長く、目が大きく、牙は更に発達しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大ハエトリグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of inquisitive-"
"looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr "大きな前肢とキョロキョロ動く4つの目を持つ、イヌほどのサイズのクモです。とても素早く跳躍し、樹木の頂上まで一瞬で到達できます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨大ハエトリグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and"
" a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"発達した前肢と膨らんだ胸部が特徴的な、ウシほどのサイズの変異した毛深いクモです。運動能力は巨大化によって低下しており、何故か腐った卵のような臭いがします..."

#. ~ Death message of monster "missile spider"
#. ~ Death message of monster "cleaner bot"
#. ~ Death message of monster "unstable flesh-raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes!"
msgstr "%sが爆発しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "トダテグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big "
"eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "変異した茶褐色のクモです。イヌほどのサイズで、胸部は球根のような形状をしており、目が大きく、特大の牙をもっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大トダテグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr "胸部が球根型をした、巨大な茶褐色のクモです。不用心な獲物を捕らえる罠として使う、深い穴を掘ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨大トダテグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark"
" brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to"
" see the light of day again."
msgstr ""
"強力な太い肢と球根のような形状の胸部が特徴的な、ウシほどのサイズの変異した濃い茶色のクモです。地下の巣に引き込まれた犠牲者は、二度と日の目を見ることはできません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "クモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "web spinning spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and"
" oversized fangs."
msgstr "変異した薄灰色のクモです。イヌほどのサイズで、肢が長く、目が大きく、特大の牙をもっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become "
"ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr "変異により巨大化した薄灰色のクサグモです。木々の間に巨大な網を張り、獲物が引っ掛かるのを待ち構えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨大グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wyrd spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in "
"color.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from "
"fleeing."
msgstr "ウシほどのサイズの変異したクサグモです。肢は長く、体色は薄い灰色です。獲物が逃げないように、網を伝ってのそのそと移動します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "immature giant web spider"
msgid_plural "immature giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大グモ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "immature giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young "
"to be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter"
msgstr "ビール瓶ほどのサイズのクサグモの幼体です。まだ毒性がなく、上手に歩くこともできません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "black widow spider"
msgid_plural "black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "クロゴケグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a small dog with a long legs, big eyes, "
"and oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr "変異した黒色のクモです。小型犬ほどのサイズで、肢が長く、目が大きく、特大の牙をもっています。胸部に砂時計の形をした赤い模様があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "巨大クロゴケグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr "イヌほどのサイズの変異したクロゴケグモです。胸部に砂時計の形をした赤い模様があります。毒性は非常に高く、命にかかわります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "超巨大クロゴケグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "black death widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass "
"shape on its thorax.  Still possesses its infamous venom, but it probably "
"doesn't even need that to crush you like a bug."
msgstr ""
"ウシほどのサイズの変異したクロゴケグモです。胸部に砂時計の形をした赤い模様があります。毒性は非常に高いですが、毒を食らうよりも先に羽虫のように潰されることでしょう。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "giant black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "巨大クロゴケグモ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Even as a newborn, this "
"foul creature knows only how to kill."
msgstr "巨大クロゴケグモの恐ろしい子供たちです。生まれたばかりのこの生き物は、相手を殺す手段以外何も知りません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wolf spider"
msgid_plural "wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "毒グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with eight long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "イヌほどのサイズの、褐色の毛が生えたクモの変異体です。8本の長い肢をもち、2つの特に大きな目玉と長い牙が目立ちます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大毒グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves "
"quickly and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr "変異により巨大化した毒グモです。元の大きさの約30倍の体長があります。獲物を捕らえる為に迅速かつ積極的に行動します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨大毒グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "necrowolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr "ウシほどのサイズの、変異した毛深い毒グモです。牙が更に発達しましたが、体重の増加によって動きは鈍くなっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "スズメバチ(幼虫)"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"口の部分を示す痕跡を除けば何の特徴もない、イヌほどのサイズの白い幼虫です。巣の中にさかさまにぶらさがっており、働きバチによって供給されるミンチと引き換えに甘い香りの液体を垂れ流します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "スズメバチ(蛹)"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It "
"looks like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its "
"legs and wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""
"成長して巨大なハチに変態しようとしているハチの幼虫です。白く薄い膜で覆われてまったく動きませんが、膜の下にはしっかりとした肢と翅が詰まっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp"
msgid_plural "wasps"
msgstr[0] "スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her jet-"
"black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr "真っ黒な外殻と威嚇的な黄色い縞模様が特徴的な、大型のネコほどのサイズの巨大なスズメバチです。不規則に飛び回り、小型の獲物を探しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp guard"
msgid_plural "wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "兵隊スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"突然変異したスズメバチが巣の周囲を騒がしく飛び回っています。餌を探しているハチは巣から離れさえすれば落ち着くでしょうが、巣への脅威と見なせば攻撃を躊躇しません。長居は禁物です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp queen"
msgid_plural "wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "女王スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white "
"egg in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper "
"walls of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer "
"cells seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"人間と同じサイズにまで成長した、変異したスズメバチの女王です。パルプで作られた巣の中を飛び回り、空の部屋に一つずつ卵を産み付けます。ずいぶん窮屈そうですが、大きめの部屋を新たに作ったようです..."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "巨大スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends "
"in a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"スズメバチは次の世代を養うための目ぼしい食事を求めて周囲を飛び回っています。不吉な黄色の縞模様で彩られた腹部の先端から、包丁ほどのサイズの針が顔を覗かせています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "巨大兵隊スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While"
" her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't"
" linger."
msgstr ""
"人間サイズのスズメバチが巣の周囲を騒がしく飛び回っています。餌を探しているハチは巣から離れさえすれば落ち着くでしょうが、巣への脅威と見なせば攻撃を躊躇しません。長居は禁物です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "巨大女王スズメバチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused "
"she still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"ウマと同じサイズにまで成長した、娘たちを束ねるスズメバチの女王です。腹部は卵によって膨れ上がり、翅も長い間使っていませんが、部下が侵入者の鎮圧に失敗したときには女王が立ち塞がります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "寄生バチ(幼虫)"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr "シャベルのような一対の大きなアゴが付いた、リスほどの大きさの白いうじむしです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "寄生バチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge "
"ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a "
"suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"イヌほどのサイズにまで成長した、腹部から巨大な産卵管を垂らして飛ぶ色鮮やかな寄生バチです。大量の子供たちが快適に暮らせる家を探して飛び回っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "兵士寄生バチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts"
" dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is "
"fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"更に大きく成長し、翅と産卵管を同族に嚙み砕かれた寄生バチです。巣の中を警備しており、運び込まれた不幸な宿主が目的を果たすまで死なないよう見張っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "宿主シカ"

#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr "身体が麻痺し、やせ衰えたシカです。こちらの存在に気付いても逃げられず、恐怖に染まった目を痙攣させながらぬかるんだ巣の中を走り回っています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr "宿主が突然動いたことで、寄生バチの幼虫が何匹か体内から逃げ出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "宿主イヌ"

#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near"
" it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in "
"its tail."
msgstr "瀕死のイヌが、粘液と血溜まりの中で息を切らしています。近づくとかすかに鼻を鳴らしますが、痙攣する尻尾が気になります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "宿主クモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its "
"chitin is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"仰向けに転がった巨大な変異クモは、足を常に痙攣させ続けています。関節部から半透明の粘液が染み出しており、多数の穴が開いたキチン質の外殻が目に付きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "ant"
msgid_plural "ants"
msgstr[0] "アリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "キチン質の装甲で覆われた、イヌほどのサイズの変異した赤いアリです。蠢動する触角と見るからに危険な顎を持っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "巨大アリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "キチン質の装甲で覆われた巨大な赤いアリです。蠢動する触角と見るからに危険な顎を持っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "acidic ant"
msgid_plural "acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "強酸アリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr "膨れた腹部の終端に小さな管をもつ、イヌほどのサイズの茶色いアリの変異体です。管からは光沢のある液体が定期的に滴り落ちています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "巨大強酸アリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr "膨れた腹部の終端に小さな管をもつ、巨大な赤いアリです。管からは光沢のある液体が定期的に滴り落ちています。"

