#. ~ Variant name of mutation "Hair: buzz cut"
#: data/json/mutations/appearance_hair_styles.json
msgid "Hair: purple, buzz cut"
msgstr "髪型(紫/丸刈り)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hair: purple, buzz cut" of mutation"Hair: buzz
