#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"EMPLOYEE NAME: Joseph Shert\n"
" EMPLOYEE TITLE: Receptionist\n"
" REVIEW DATE: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" REVIEW BY: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
"\n"
" Joseph is always on time for work and gets along well with coworkers.  However, he has trouble taking direction and often speaks out against his superiors [See attached email: Housekeeping].\n"
" Joe speaks a big game but unfortunately does not perform to the Shady Hills standard.\n"
" As our standard is extremely important for the health and wellbeing of our residents, I have no choice but to recommend termination.\n"
"\n"
" Signed,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
" Reception Manager"
msgstr ""
"従業員名: ジョセフ・シェルト\n"
" 所属: 受付係\n"
" 評価日: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" 評価者: ブライアン・ローターズ、受付部門マネージャー\n"
"\n"
" ジョセフは常に出勤時間を守り、同僚との仲も良好である。しかし、指示に従うのが苦手で、上司に対して不満を述べることが多い[添付メール参照: 清掃部門の件]。\n"
" 掲げる目標は大きいが、残念ながら能力はシェイディヒルズの望む水準に達していない。\n"
" 従業員の水準は、入所者の健康と福祉にとって非常に重要な事項であり、当従業員の解雇を推奨せざるを得ない。\n"
"\n"
" 署名\n"
" ブライアン・ローターズ\n"
" 受付部門マネージャー"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "RETURN TO RECORD"
msgstr "記録一覧へ戻る"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"EMPLOYEE NAME: Connie Malackey\n"
" EMPLOYEE TITLE: Receptionist\n"
" REVIEW DATE: 05-xx-xxxx\n"
" REVIEW BY: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
"\n"
" Connie gets along well with coworkers.  I have occasionally needed to remind her to start work on time as clocking in late is detrimental to other employees and, ultimately, our precious residents.  Connie works hard on assigned tasks but often lacks the drive to seek out additional tasks.\n"
" I am recommending a generous 0.5% pay wage increase per corporate policy.\n"
"\n"
" Signed,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
" Reception Manager"
msgstr ""
"従業員名: コニー・マラッキー\n"
"所属: 受付係\n"
"評価日: 05-xx-xxxx\n"
"評価者: ブライアン・ローターズ、受付部門マネージャー\n"
"\n"
"コニーの同僚との仲は良好である。遅刻が目立ち、他の従業員、ひいては何より優先すべき入所者に悪影響を及ぼすため、時間通りに始業するよう注意することもしばしばある。与えられた業務は懸命にこなすが、それ以外の業務を自ら進んで探す意欲に欠けている。\n"
"経営方針に従い、当従業員の給与を0.5％引き上げることを推奨する。\n"
"\n"
"署名\n"
"ブライアン・ローターズ\n"
"受付部門マネージャー"

