#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Hello again.  What do you need?"
msgstr "また会ったな。何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "*waves you over.  \"Hey <name_g>.  How's it going for you?\""
msgstr "*は手を挙げて挨拶した。「やあ<name_g>。調子はどうだい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。話したことはなかったね。はじめまして。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Who are you?  Where am I right now?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だ？ここは何の場所なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Just passing through, don't mind me."
msgstr "ただの通りすがりだから、気にしないで。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I wanted to talk."
msgstr "話がしたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Could I have some food?"
msgstr "食べ物を貰えないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I heard the joinees could get some food here."
msgstr "信徒はここで食料を貰えると聞いた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Okay, shoot."
msgstr "ああ、いいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Sure, what's up?"
msgstr "もちろん、どうした？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "ALright, lets chat."
msgstr "よしきた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "How are you holding up?"
msgstr "調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Is there any way I could join the community?"
msgstr "このコミュニティに加わる方法はないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, forget about it."
msgstr "気が変わった、お喋りは止めよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "On second thought, I gotta go.  See ya, <name_g>."
msgstr "気が変わった、お喋りは止めよう。さようなら、<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"This is the New England Community Church, I should say it's one of their old"
" retreats.  I'm Simon, the head chef around here."
msgstr "ここはニューイングランドコミュニティ教会、昔からある避難所の一つってところかな。私はサイモン、ここで料理人をやってる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"I used to volunteer as a cook in a homeless shelter.  I met the church "
"through that job; their missionaries would come by every so often and hand "
"out essentials to people living there, then give a sermon in one of the back"
" rooms.  Katherine and I wound up going to one of their sermons, and we've "
"stayed connected since.  Working in that shelter taught me to cook on a "
"shoestring budget; that's really useful these days, ya know."
msgstr ""
"私は以前、ホームレスシェルターで料理のボランティアをしていたんだ。この教会を知ったのはその頃だ。宣教師がシェルターへ時々やってきて皆に生活必需品を配り、その後部屋に集まって説教をするんだ。キャサリンと私は説教を聞きに行ったときにであって、それ以来ずっと一緒だよ。シェルターで働いてた経験があるから、低予算料理は得意なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Where's your family now?"
msgstr "あなたの家族はどこにいるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>.  See you around."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。また会おう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Katherine's probably in the bunks right now, and Jeremiah's next door.  Feel"
" free to say hello sometime."
msgstr "キャサリンは今は寝台の方だろうし、ジェレミアは隣の部屋だ。よかったら挨拶してくるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"It's been a while since anyone gave out meals.  We're low on supplies around"
" here, I can't spare any.  I'm sorry."
msgstr "ここ最近は食事の配給を止めているんだ。備蓄が少ないから、食べ物の余裕もない。悪いね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Would you accept any money for it?"
msgstr "料金を支払ったら食べ物を貰えるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Please?  I need it for my family."
msgstr "何とかできないか？家族のために食べ物が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"They can, but we're limited on the portions for now.  Hope you enjoy it, and"
" come back tomorrow for another."
msgstr "あまりたくさんは配れないけど、はいどうぞ。明日もお楽しみに。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "No, I wouldn't.  Like I said, we don't have any to spare."
msgstr "いいや、無理だ。さっきも言ったけど、備蓄が足りないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "It was worth a shot, I guess."
msgstr "分かった、言ってみただけだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already "
"told you, rules are rules."
msgstr "私にだって家族はいるさ。納得できないかもしれないが、先ほど言った通り、ルールはルールだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I guess I'll starve."
msgstr "飢え死にしそうだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Could be better, could be worse, but I'm not complaining.  I have everything"
" I need here; my family, a nice job, and roof over my head.  I only wish God"
" was as forgiving to others as to me."
msgstr ""
"良くなるかもしれないし、悪くなるかもしれない。でも、文句は言わないよ。必要なものはここに揃っている。家族、素晴らしい仕事、そして屋根。神が他の人にも慈悲深さを示してくださることを、願うばかりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Good to hear that."
msgstr "ひとまずは安心だな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You'd have to talk to Gemma or Julian about that.  I'm sure there's a way, "
"though."
msgstr "ジェマかジュリアンに相談してみるといい。何か方法がある筈だよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr "やあ、どうも。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "You're back."
msgstr "また来たのか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "So…?"
msgstr "何だ...？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Hello.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr "ごきげんよう、何してるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Just stopping by for a moment.  See ya."
msgstr "ちょっと寄ってみただけだ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だっけ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Could I borrow something from the stock?"
msgstr "在庫から物資を少し拝借できないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Has anyone stolen from here?"
msgstr "食料を盗む人間がいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have?"
msgstr "食料はどれくらいあるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'm a guard.  I'm making sure this stockpile is alright."
msgstr "私は警備員だ。ここの備蓄の見張っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nope, you can't do that.  I'd like to help you, bit we've already got enough"
" mouths to feed."
msgstr "いや、無理だ。困っているのは分かるけど、ここの人員を養うだけで精一杯だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Could some money persuade you?"
msgstr "お金で解決できないだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I can give these people one less mouth to feed, if you'd prefer that."
msgstr "そんなに大変なら、ここに減らせる人員が一人いるじゃないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  See ya."
msgstr "分かったよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nobody's tried to yet.  It can get a little boring sometimes, standing "
"around and doing nothing."
msgstr "今のところは誰もいない。やることもなく立っているだけだと、ちょっと退屈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I can understand that.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "確かにそうかもしれない。何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I hope it isn't too boring.  See ya."
msgstr "暇すぎるのも考え物だな。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "That's private info, <name_g>."
msgstr "それは機密情報だ、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  I gotta go."
msgstr "分かった。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nope, it couldn't.  Don't try and <swear> bribe me again, you <swear> "
"<name_b>."
msgstr "いいや、ダメだ。<swear>、賄賂の話は二度とするな、<swear>、<name_b>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Geez, I'm leaving."
msgstr "ちぇっ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Alright, alright.  Here's some food and water, <name_b>.  Get out of my "
"<swear> sight."
msgstr "分かった、分かったよ。ほら、水と食料だ、<name_b>。さっさとどこかへ行ってくれ、<swear>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Keep that in mind."
msgstr "分かったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Okay, here's some food and water.  Don't tell anyone I gave you that."
msgstr "分かったよ、ほら、食料と水だ。このことは誰にも言うなよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I won't.  Pleasure doin' business."
msgstr "分かっている。いい取り引きだったな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Picky Meals"
msgstr "しょっぱい料理"

#. ~ Description of mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 20 pounds of salt."
msgstr "20個の塩を集めましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a supply of salt."
msgstr "塩が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't"
" just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could "
"you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr "些細なことに思えるかもしれないが、食塩が不足し始めている。食塩は調味料としてだけでなく、保存食を作るのにも不可欠なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't forget to tell me when you have them."
msgstr "持ってきたら忘れずに私に言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "大丈夫、毛皮がなくても何とかするよ。もし気が変わったら、また言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr "色々な場所に置いてある。家屋の台所やレストラン、食料品店でよく見かけるな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found 'em?"
msgstr "どうだ？揃ったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。心配しないで、ちゃんとお礼はするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, it's not that important."
msgstr "気にしないで、それほど重要な仕事でもない。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Pickled Meals"
msgstr "酸っぱい料理"

#. ~ Description of mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 5 glass jars."
msgstr "5個のガラス瓶(3L)を見つけましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need several glass jars."
msgstr "ガラス瓶が何本か必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""
"これはさっきの仕事より少し重大だ。備蓄用の生鮮食品を保存する瓶が足りないんだ。全ての食料を塩で保存する訳にもいかない。ガラス瓶がもっとあれば、自力で保存食を作れるんだ。取りあえず5本あれば何とかなるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr "引き受けてくれてありがとう。心配事が一つ減ったよ。これで保存食の問題は解決だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "もし気が変わったら教えてよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Glass jars are not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residential "
"areas."
msgstr "ガラス瓶を見つけるのは簡単だ。住宅地で探せばいい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the jars?"
msgstr "ガラス瓶は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr "助けてくれてありがとう。これはお礼だ。他にも頼みたい仕事がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "緊急の仕事ではないから、気にしないで。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Prickled Meals"
msgstr "精いっぱいの料理"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a butcher knife."
msgstr "ブッチャーナイフを見つけましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need something sharper."
msgstr "もっと鋭い刃物が必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything "
"hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that "
"often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr ""
"ここにはブッチャーナイフが無いんだ。これじゃあ硬い食材を切るのも難しい。頻繁に使うものでもないが、手元にあれば安心だ。探してきてくれないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr "引き受けてくれてありがとう。この鈍いナイフじゃ何も切れないからな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "仕方ない、ステーキナイフで代用するか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Butcher knives are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in "
"kitchens."
msgstr "ブッチャーナイフは珍しい刃物じゃない。普通は台所で見つかるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have that knife now?"
msgstr "ブッチャーナイフを持ってきたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done."
msgstr "助けてくれてありがとう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Busy While Working"
msgstr "仕事中の暇潰し"

#. ~ Description of mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 3 mystery novels."
msgstr "3個の本(一般/ミステリー小説)を見つける。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "ミステリー小説を読みたいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Hmm, that would be great!  But if you do, please bring more than just one.  "
"I could read a single novel in a day.  Could you get me… 3 mystery novels?"
msgstr ""
"ああ、本当にありがとう！でも、1冊じゃ物足りないな。1日で読み終えてしまうからね。そうだな...ミステリー小説を3冊持ってきてもらえるかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "見つけたら持ってきてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "問題ないよ。もし気が変わったら戻ってきてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "私なら図書館と本屋を探すな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "本は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token"
" of my gratitude."
msgstr "ありがとう。しばらくは読書に夢中になれる。これは感謝のしるしだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Could you give them to me?"
msgstr "こっちに渡してくれよ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Fine.  I can read something else."
msgstr "別にいいよ。何か他の本を探そう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a guitar string"
msgstr "ギターの弦を入手する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a wire to be used as a guitar string."
msgstr "ギターの弦として使えるワイヤーを入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a new guitar string."
msgstr "新しいギターの弦が欲しいな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of my guitar strings busted from where I smacked a zombie.  If you could"
" get me a wire, I can rig it to work as a substitute."
msgstr "ゾンビを殴ったときにギターの弦を一本切ってしまったんだ。ワイヤーで代用できるから、持ってきてほしい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you a performance when you get back with it."
msgstr "助かるよ。ワイヤーが無事に見つかったら、演奏を聴かせてあげる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I'll just skip that note."
msgstr "出ない音だけ抜かして弾くしかないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any old wire should do."
msgstr "古いワイヤーでも大丈夫。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  This should last for a while."
msgstr "本当にありがとう！これでしばらくは大丈夫だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, I'll do it myself."
msgstr "気にしないで、自分で探すから。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well Construction"
msgstr "井戸工事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find eight pipes for Darryl Johnson."
msgstr "ダリル・ジョンソンのために8本のパイプを入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need eight pipes to start construction."
msgstr "工事を始めるにはパイプが8本必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that's some enthusiasm, pal.  Ever since our water supply shut off, "
"we've been using the nearby river for most of our water needs.  Who knows "
"how many bloated corpses have decayed in that.  I want to construct a well, "
"but I'm missing some building materials - eight pipes to be exact."
msgstr ""
"さて、やりがいのある仕事だぞ。水道が止まっちまって以来、ここでは近くの川の水を使ってる。あんな川、上流にどれだけ腐った死体が溜まってるか分かったもんじゃない。そこで、井戸を作ろうと思い立ったんだが、材料が足りない。具体的には、パイプが8本足りないんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best, pal.  I appreciate it."
msgstr "助かるよ。頑張ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance."
msgstr "気が変わったら、また来てくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Try disassembling some lockers.  Just don't destroy our furniture, we'll be "
"needing it."
msgstr "ロッカーを分解してみるといい。おっと、ここの家具は止めろ。使ってるんだからな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, do you have them?"
msgstr "さて、持ってきたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Great, I can finally start constructing this thing."
msgstr "よくやった、これでやっと工事に取り掛かれる。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Water Pump Construction"
msgstr "揚水ポンプ工事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a mechanical pump for Darryl Johnson."
msgstr "ダリル・ジョンソンのために機械式ポンプを入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a mechanical pump to finish construction."
msgstr "工事を終えるには機械式ポンプが必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's less like a well, and more like a covered pit currently.  I'll need you"
" to find a mechanical pump, one that will make this <swear> thing work."
msgstr "完成はしたが、これじゃ井戸というより、屋根が付いた穴だな。機械式ポンプを探してきてくれないか。それがなきゃ井戸じゃない、<swear>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr "気を付けて行けよ。"

