#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance.  We need skilled survivors."
msgstr "機会があればまた来てくれ。技術を持った生存者は常に必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Try disassembling another well."
msgstr "どこかの井戸を分解してみたらどうだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr "機械式ポンプは見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Much obliged, survivor.  Thanks to you, we don't need to worry about where "
"our water's gonna come from.  Here, take this as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "サバイバーよ、あんたにゃ頭が上がらんね。これで水の出処の心配をしなくて済む。これは感謝の印だ、受け取ってくれ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgstr "鶏小屋工事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 150 nails for Darryl."
msgstr "ダリルに150個の釘を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need nails to build a chicken coop"
msgstr "鶏小屋を建てるのに釘が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about "
"raising some livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm "
"the other day, but I don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 "
"nails, I can start building one."
msgstr ""
"水も安定供給できるようになったし、家畜を飼おうかと考えてるんだ。この間農場で見つけたニワトリを飼いたいが、まだ鶏小屋がない。釘が150本あれば、すぐにでも作れるんだがな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr "簡単な仕事なのに。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You could take apart some furniture in town, or make them yourself."
msgstr "街にある家具を解体するか、自作してもいいかもな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Got the nails?"
msgstr "釘は手に入れたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come"
" back and buy some!"
msgstr "助かった。早速鶏小屋作りに取り掛かろう。一週間もすれば卵を産むようになる。その時は買いに来てくれよ！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt I"
msgstr "狩りの戦利品1"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Help Russell Connelly expand his trophy collection by gathering three hunks "
"of slime glob."
msgstr "3個の粘液の塊を入手し、ラッセル・コネリーの戦利品コレクションに加えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need your help…"
msgstr "助けが必要だ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I have the location for an alien crash site.  I want you to investigate and "
"bring me anything you'd find interesting."
msgstr "宇宙人の墜落現場が判明した。調査して、目を引くものがあったら持ってきてほしい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Good luck out there!"
msgstr "頑張ってくれよ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's all right.  Not everyone is cut out for this."
msgstr "いいさ。こういう仕事が向いてない奴だっている。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Worst case scenario you'll be covered in slime.  There's nothing to fear, I "
"hope."
msgstr "運が悪くても、粘液まみれになるだけだろう。何も怖がることはない。多分な。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck, survivor?"
msgstr "収穫はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Good one!  Survivor, you have just passed my test.  I knew you could do it."
"  Your work shall be rewarded!"
msgstr "いいぞ！テストは合格だ。あんたならできると思ってた。その功績を称えて報酬を贈ろう！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You liar!"
msgstr "嘘つきめ！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt II"
msgstr "狩りの戦利品2"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Continue the quest for trophies by finding an unhatched spider egg."
msgstr "孵化していないクモの卵を戦利品として持ち帰りましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"<the_cataclysm> didn't spare us humans.  Our former selves would look at us "
"in disgust at the things we do for survival.  At least, that's what I was "
"told.  I heard reports of arachnids deep in the woods.  I can't exactly "
"pinpoint where their webs are, but I'm sure you'll figure it out once you're"
" stuck in them.  I'd like me a spider egg!"
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>は俺たち人類を見捨てちゃいなかったんだ。生き残るために今からやることをかつて人類が聞いたら、きっと軽蔑するだろうな。というか、さっき実際に言われた。森の奥にクモの巣があるらしい。詳しい場所は知らんが、絡みついて動けなくなるからすぐ分かるだろう。どうしてもクモの卵を食べてみたいんだ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever beast is waiting for you."
msgstr "助かる。どんな化け物が出てきても大丈夫なように、準備はしておけよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry <name_g>, I wouldn't send you on a suicide mission, would I?"
msgstr "心配するな、<name_g>。俺はあんたを無理やり送り出したりはしないぞ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr "上手くいったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice catch!  Friend, you've proven yourself to be an extraordinary survivor."
"  Maybe there's still hope for humanity.  I'll take that egg, thank you very"
" much.  Here's your reward and some bullets for your effort."
msgstr ""
"よくやった！あんたは並外れたサバイバーだってことが証明されたぞ。きっと、人類には希望が残っている。その卵は頂いておく、ありがとう。苦労を掛けたな、今回の報酬と弾薬だ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt III"
msgstr "狩りの戦利品3"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Bring one last trophy to Russell Connelly.  Harvest a sting from a bee."
msgstr "ラッセル・コネリーに最後の戦利品として、ハチの針を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you."
"  Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the "
"closest one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring "
"it to me."
msgstr ""
"復讐の旅路みたいに思えてきたな。これが最後の仕事だ。巨大なハチの巣を見たことはあるか？ここから一番近い奴の場所を知ってる。そこのハチを狩って、針を持ってきてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may God guide your path."
msgstr "健闘を祈る。あんたの道行きは神が導いてくださるさ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "こんなに熱心に取り組むのも、かえって体に悪い気がしてきたな..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray"
" work anymore."
msgstr "俺があんたなら、銃とブッチャーナイフを持っていくね。虫よけスプレーは、きっと無意味だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How is the hunt going, survivor?  Any luck?"
msgstr "狩りの調子はどうだ？手に入れたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, partner, this might just be the end of the road.  I hope you enjoyed "
"it as much as I have.  In the meantime… here's your reward, a handful of "
"icons, that's all I have left.  Spend them all, I think you've deserved it."
msgstr ""
"おお、相棒よ、これで一区切りかもしれないな。狩りを楽しんでもらえたなら俺も嬉しいよ。それはともかく...報酬はこれだ。聖画カード、全部持って行ってくれ。あんたにはそれだけの価値がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You give up now?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good "
"man to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr "諦めるのか？ 信頼に足る善き人が居なくなってしまっては、この国も終わりだな...諦めると言うなら、しかたない。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "End The Nightmare"
msgstr "悪夢の終わり"

#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr "ザカリーが夜に寝付けない原因を排除しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck with that horror?"
msgstr "化け物を倒してくれたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Now I can finally get a nights sleep.  Here, I've got some "
"icons saved up, I want you to have them."
msgstr "おお、ありがとう！これでやっと一晩ぐっすり眠れる。ほら、貯めてた聖画カードだ、持っていってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can still hear it, crying out in the night."
msgstr "今でも夜中に泣き叫ぶ声が聞こえてくるんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <swear> mess."
msgstr "私は厄介事の解決なんてごめんだからな、<swear>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Fungus Among Us"
msgstr "紛れ込んだ真菌"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purge the cultists in exchange for <reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "カルト教団員を粛正しましょう。報酬は聖画カードを<reward_count:icon>枚です。"

