msgid "We need help…"
msgstr "助けが必要なんだ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a weird fungus that started to invade ever since <the_cataclysm>, "
"and several individuals in strange robes are cultivating it.  I've seen what"
" it can do, so I need you to execute them and destroy all traces of these "
"strange mushrooms."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>以来、奇妙な菌類を見かけるようになりました。それを栽培している、風変わりなローブを着た人間も、何人か目撃しています。私は、あの菌がどんな特性をもつのかこの目で見てしまいました。あなたには、栽培者を断罪し、あの菌類の痕跡をすべて破壊してもらいたいのです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "God bless you!"
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "That fungus is going to kill us all if it isn't stopped."
msgstr "あの菌を止めねば、私たちも死ぬでしょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Despite how fast it grows, it's highly vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "成長は早いですが、火にはとても弱いようです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Caravan"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Blood Gulch"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Have you dealt with them?"
msgstr "対処してくれたかい？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I don't like killing people, but this time we had too.  Here, "
"take this; its some of our internal money that we've started using.  You "
"know those religious pamphlets shaped like bills people would leave?  These "
"are some of those, couldn't stand 'em myself."
msgstr ""
"ありがとうございます。殺人は恐ろしい行為ですが、今回ばかりは仕方がない。さあ、受け取ってください。これは、私たちがここで使っている通貨のようなものです。紙幣に似せた教会広告が置いてあるのを見たことありませんか？これも似たようなものです。私はあの宣伝方法が嫌いでした。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "We'll have to try again, I suppose."
msgstr "もう一度、挑戦してみるしかないな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Relic Recovery"
msgstr "遺物の安置"

#. ~ Description of mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Retrieve a religious relic for Greenwood in exchange for <reward_count:icon>"
" icons."
msgstr "グリーンウッドに小さな遺物を渡しましょう。報酬は聖画カード<reward_count:icon>枚です。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been looking to spruce up this place with some iconography, and a small"
" relic would do just that.  It'd help tremendously with morale around here, "
"so I need you to find one for me."
msgstr ""
"ここに何か聖像を置きたいと思っているのです。小さな遺物など、まさにぴったりですね。置けばきっと、皆の士気も高まるに違いありません。探してきていただけますか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Please bring it back as soon as possible."
msgstr "なるべく早く持ってきてもらえると助かります。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help us…"
msgstr "手伝ってもらえると助かるのですが..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I know most cathedrals keep small relics, that's a good place to look."
msgstr "大抵の大聖堂には、小さな遺物が保管されていると思います。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  Take these for your trouble."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。これは謝礼です。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to make my own, I guess…"
msgstr "そうですか、自作するしかないか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Bible Belt"
msgstr "聖書地帯"

#. ~ Description of mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Find twenty King James Bibles for Greenwood in exchange for "
"<reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "グリーンウッドに20冊の本(一般/聖書:欽定訳)を渡しましょう。報酬は聖画カード<reward_count:icon>枚です。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"When we skipped town during <the_cataclysm>, most of us left our possessions"
" behind.  We only have a few Bibles here for all of us, and they're starting"
" to fall apart.  If you could get 20 more, in the King James version, I'd "
"pay well for them."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>で街から避難してきた人は大抵、着の身着のまま逃げるしかありませんでした。ここに聖書は数冊しかなく、しかもかなり傷んできています。欽定訳聖書を20冊持ってきてもらえたら、高く買い取りますよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A book store should have enough, I'll mark one for you."
msgstr "書店に行けば見つかる筈です。知っている店の場所を教えておきましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Remnants of Civilization"
msgstr "文明の名残り"

#. ~ Description of mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find ten rolls of toilet paper for Julian Ray."
msgstr "ジュリアン・レイに10個のトイレットペーパーを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a job for you…"
msgstr "頼みたい仕事がある..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, yes you can.  You see, we're running low on toilet "
"paper.  It's not something we can't live without, but it's luxury we can "
"afford.  I can pay you handsomely if you find us ten rolls toilet paper."
msgstr ""
"実を言うと、ぜひ頼みたい仕事がある。そう、トイレットペーパーの在庫が足りないんだ。絶対に必要とまでは言えないが、あると嬉しい消耗品だろう。トイレットペーパーを10ロール持ってきてくれたら、十分な対価を支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, that's great.  Good luck."
msgstr "よし、本当に助かるよ。頑張ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Changed your mind already?"
msgstr "気が変わったのか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You remember what toilet paper is, right?"
msgstr "トイレットペーパーがどこに置いてあるかは、知ってるよな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How's the search going?  Any luck?"
msgstr "どうだ？順調か？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Maybe you people aren't so bad after all."
msgstr "ありがとう。やっぱり君はいい奴だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Could you give it to me then?"
msgstr "こっちに渡してくれよ？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "The Honeymooners"
msgstr "新婚期"

#. ~ Description of mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get two wedding rings for Julian."
msgstr "ジュリアンのために2個の結婚指輪を用意しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get two wedding rings."
msgstr "結婚指輪を2つ用意してもらいたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Olwen and I have been dating for a while now, and I was planning on asking "
"her to marry me.  I never got the chance to buy our rings before "
"<the_cataclysm>, but I think I'll surprise her with some in a few days.  If "
"you could get me two of them, I'll pay a fair price: $250 in icons."
msgstr ""
"オルウェンとはもう長い付き合いになる。そろそろ結婚を申し込もうと考えている。<the_cataclysm>以前は指輪を買う機会もなかったけど、そろそろ指輪を渡して驚かせるのもいいかなと思ってさ。もし、結婚指輪を2つ持ってきてくれたら、支払いは聖画カードになるけど、適正価格の250ドル分きっちり支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks <name_g>, I'm counting on you."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。頼りにしているよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd mean so much to the both of us, and there's a lot of money involved."
msgstr "僕ら二人にとって本当に大事なことなんだ。報酬ならちゃんと支払うよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"A jewelry store should have a pair.  If not, I'd check a wedding venue."
msgstr "宝石店にペアで置いてある筈だ。それがだめなら、結婚式の会場はどうだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the rings?"
msgstr "結婚指輪は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Here's the money, as per our terms.  I really do appreciate this."
msgstr "さあ、約束通り報酬を支払おう。心から感謝しているよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "What good is this?"
msgstr "そんな嘘をついて何になる？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to look for them myself…"
msgstr "自分で探すしかないか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
msgstr "妊娠補助剤を手に入れる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get Gemmas fertility supplements."
msgstr "妊娠補助剤を手に入れてジェマに渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some supplements."
msgstr "薬剤を探しているの。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"To be honest, I'm not alright.  Have you met Darryl?  He's my husband, and "
"we had a go at getting a baby recently.  The thing is, its not happening.  "
"Now that we're in a safe spot, on our feet again, I want to try.  I'm trying"
" to find some fertility supplements.  I ordered some before <the_cataclysm>,"
" but I never got to pick them up.  If you'd go over and get them for me, I'd"
" pay you."
msgstr ""
"実を言うと、悩みがあるの。ダリルにはもう会った？私の夫よ。以前に子供を作ろうとしたんだけど、ダメだった。ようやく安全な場所に落ち着けたから、もう一度挑戦してみようと思ってね。そこで、あなたには妊娠補助剤を探してもらいたいのよ。<the_cataclysm>以前に注文してあったんだけど、持ってくることができなくて。もし持ってきてくれたら、謝礼をお出しするわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This means so much to me."
msgstr "これは私にとって、とても大事なことなの。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "They should be near the counter, or on a shelf."
msgstr "カウンターの近くか、棚に置いてあったと思うわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found my pills?"
msgstr "薬剤は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Darryl will be so happy to hear about this!  Take there for "
"your payment, it must've been hard for you."
msgstr "まあ、ありがとう！ダリルもきっと喜ぶわ！大変だったでしょうね、この謝礼を受け取って。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How unfortunate…"
msgstr "それは残念..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find cactus seeds"
msgstr "サボテンの種を見つける"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find ten cactus seeds for Gemma."
msgstr "種(サボテン)をジェマに渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some cactus seeds."
msgstr "サボテンの種が必要なの。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to try growing some new plants.  I've never tried growing "
"cactus; if you could find some seeds for me, I'd pay you."
msgstr "何か新しい植物を育てたくなってきたわ。サボテンに挑戦してみようかしら。もし種を持ってきてくれたら、謝礼をお出しするわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I suppose more local fauna could work."
msgstr "植物が身近にあればここが活気づくと思うのだけれど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd try a gardening store or a home supply store would have some."
msgstr "園芸店やホームセンターにならある筈よ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found any cactus seeds?"
msgstr "サボテンの種は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate that, here's your money.  Parts of the cactus, such as the "
"fruit, are edible.  I'll have to ask Simon if he can experiment with some of"
" them."
msgstr "ありがとう、さあ、謝礼を受け取って。サボテンの膨らんだところは食べられるらしいのよ。一度サイモンに言って、料理を試作してもらおうかしら。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Retrieve Thorazine"
msgstr "抗精神病薬を手に入れる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 75 anti-psychotics for Jane."
msgstr "ジェーンに75個の抗精神病薬を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some antipsychotics."
msgstr "向精神薬が必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of antipsychotics, and Arturo is starting to see things "
"again.  I'd pay for seventy-five antipsychotic pills, and be eternally "
"grateful."
msgstr ""
"アルトゥーロの幻覚症状が再発したのに、向精神薬を切らしてしまった。持ってきてくれると非常にありがたい。75錠用意してもらえれば、代金を支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Arturo will be happy to get these."
msgstr "ありがとう。これでアルトゥーロも安心するだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Would you please reconsider?  Arturo's had some bad hallucinations before, "
"he'll go crazy without them."
msgstr "考え直してくれないか？アルトゥーロは以前も酷い幻覚症状が出たことがある。薬がないと耐えられそうにない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "The storage room of a pharmacy should have them."
msgstr "薬局の保管庫にあるはずだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the antipsychotics?"
msgstr "向精神薬は見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"God bless you, <name_g>.  Arturo shouldn't have to worry about his "
"hallucinations for a long time."
msgstr "<name_g>、神の祝福あれ。これでアルトゥーロもしばらくは幻覚の心配をせずに済む。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Renewable Energy"
msgstr "自然エネルギー"

#. ~ Description of mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a solar panel for Corrie."
msgstr "コリーにソーラーパネルを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a plan…"
msgstr "計画があるんだ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Okay, great.  We're gonna create a charger and a generator all in one.  "
"Here's the battle plan.  Zack could create the framework, you'll get me a "
"solar panel, the rest I can craft or repurpose from the bus.  Helena's "
"promised us a reward if this thing lives up to her standards."
msgstr ""
"よし、これに決めた。蓄電装置と発電機を一体にした装置を作るんだ。作戦はこう。ザックが骨組みを作るでしょ。あなたはソーラーパネルの調達をお願いね。他に必要なものは、一から作るかバスの部品を再利用しよう。ヘレナも、まともな装置を作れたら報酬を支払うって約束してくれたよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"With my brains and your brawn we'll make an excellent team.  A regular solar"
" panel will do just fine."
msgstr "知力担当の私と体力担当のあなた、きっといいチームになるはず。ああ、ソーラーパネルは普通の性能の奴で十分だよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "No electricity for us then."
msgstr "このままだと、電気が使えなくなっちゃう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "All you need is a good wrench and a solar car."
msgstr "必要なのは、ソーラーカーと優秀なレンチだけ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the solar panel?"
msgstr "ソーラーパネルは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"The great work is now complete.  Are you good with words, by the way?  I was"
" thinking, maybe you should be the one to negotiate with Helena.  But "
"whatever you do, don't accept their icons.  Our work is worth a lot more "
"than their valueless currency."
msgstr ""
"これで傑作が完成したね。ところで、喋るのは得意？考えてたんだけど、多分、あなたがヘレナ報告した方がいいと思うの。どう報告するにせよ、聖画カードは受け取っちゃダメだからね。あんな無意味な通貨より、私たちの仕事はずっと価値の高いものなんだから。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will"
msgstr "作家志望"

#. ~ Description of mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 800 sheets of paper for Felicity Powell."
msgstr "フェリシティ・パウエルに800枚の紙を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some paper."
msgstr "紙が必要ね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since <the_cataclysm> happened, I've had a surprising amount of free time.  "
"I want to start writing, but there's very little paper around here.  For the"
" time being, eight hundred sheets should do; I'll pay if you can get it for "
"me."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>以来、意外と暇な時間が多いんだよ。小説の執筆を始めたはいいけど、この辺りには紙がほとんどない。とりあえずは、800枚あれば足りるかな。持ってきてくれたら買い取るよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, you'll be the first to see my writing."
msgstr "ありがとう。私の作品の最初の読者になってもらわないとね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can understand that.  The offer's still available if you reconsider."
msgstr "まあそうだろうね。もし気が変わったら、いつでも言ってちょうだい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A bookstore or office supply should have tons of it."
msgstr "書店やオフィスなら、備品として大量にありそうだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the paper?"
msgstr "紙は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I appreciate it.  I'll get to work on my manuscript."
msgstr "助かるよ。早速執筆作業に取り掛かろうか。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Writers' Will II"
msgstr "作家志望2"

#. ~ Description of mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 30 pencils for Felicity Powell."
msgstr "フェリシティ・パウエルに30本の鉛筆を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some pencils."
msgstr "鉛筆が必要ね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been writing for a bit, and I've used up my pencils.  If you could get "
"me thirty more, I'll give you some money."
msgstr "執筆を続けていたら、もう鉛筆を使い切ってしまったんだ。30本持ってきてくれたら買い取るよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I do appreciate it."
msgstr "感謝するよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can understand that.  The offer's available if you reconsider."
msgstr "まあそうだろうね。もし気が変わったら、いつでも言ってちょうだい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "An office building should have tons."
msgstr "オフィスビルの中には沢山ありそうだね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the pencils?"
msgstr "鉛筆は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much!  I'll get back to work on my manuscript, I should have it"
" ready in a month or so."
msgstr "本当にありがとう！さて、執筆作業に取り掛からないと。一か月くらいで完成すると思うよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some oxycodone"
msgstr "オキシコドンを手に入れる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find seven oxycodone pills for Theresa."
msgstr "テレサに7個のオキシコドンを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some pills."
msgstr "薬が必要なの。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've got an idea to solve my problem.  I'll pay you if you can find seven "
"oxycodone pills for me; the ones they used to prescribe after a surgery."
msgstr "私の困りごとを解決できる方法を考えたの。手術の後に処方されたりする、オキシコドンという薬を7錠持ってきてくれたら、お礼を支払うわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, <granny_name_g>.  I'm glad the youngsters still help the elderly."
msgstr "ありがとう、<granny_name_g>。若い方が年寄りを助けてくれると、嬉しいものね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I can understand your hesitation <granny_name_g>.  I wouldn't worry about it"
" too much."
msgstr "ためらう気持ちも分かるわ、<granny_name_g>。もし私が頼まれたら気にせず引き受けてしまうけどね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"An old doctors office should have some.  They have those fancy autodocs "
"upstairs."
msgstr "昔からある診療所なら置いてる筈よ。2階には立派なオートドクって機械があったわね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found my painkillers?"
msgstr "鎮痛剤は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want you to have these few things of mine, I won't be needing them "
"anymore.  I think I'll take a walk in the woods, get some fresh air for "
"these old bones…"
msgstr "さあ、受け取ってちょうだい。大事に貯めておいたものよ。私は新鮮な空気を吸いに、ちょっと森へ散歩に出掛けてくるわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Deceitful rogue, you…"
msgstr "あなたは酷い悪党ね..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Dinner for Two"
msgstr "二人のディナー"

#. ~ Description of mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a candle for Jeremiah."
msgstr "ジェレミアにろうそくを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a candle."
msgstr "ろうそくが欲しいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Have you met Chloe?  She's the girl with the butcher knife, came here with "
"Sonia.  This may sound silly, but I want to ask her out on a date, have a "
"picnic some time.  The only thing I need to get this plan to come together "
"is a candle.  If you happen to find one, I'll pay you for it."
msgstr ""
"もうクロエには会った？ソニアと一緒にここへ来た、ブッチャーナイフを持ってる女の子だ。笑わないでほしいんだけど、今度彼女をデートに誘って、一緒にピクニックへ行こうと思ってる。この計画を実現するためには、ろうそくが必要なんだ。もし持ってきてくれたら、買い取るよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 30 Glass Bottles"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Mushroom Spores"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Season Of The Stones"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 motorbike tires"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Please?  The dating scene isn't that big around here."
msgstr "どうしても無理？ここじゃデートなんて滅多にできないんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Someone's house might have one."
msgstr "誰かの家に置いてあるかもな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the candle?"
msgstr "ろうそくはあった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Bleach"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles of antiseptic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I appreciate it."
msgstr "感謝するよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's too bad…"
msgstr "それは残念..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Fishy Business"
msgstr "生臭い仕事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find three cans of tuna for Katherine."
msgstr "キャサリンに3個のツナ(保存食)を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get some tuna."
msgstr "ツナ缶が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've had a craving for fish recently.  Could you find three cans of tuna for"
" me?  I'll pay you for them."
msgstr "最近、どうも魚の味が恋しいんだよ。ツナ缶を3つ探してきてもらえない？代金はちゃんと払うから。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Alright.  I'll do it myself."
msgstr "分かった。自分で何とかする。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A house or grocery store should have some."
msgstr "民家とか、食料雑貨店を探してみるといいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the fish?"
msgstr "ツナ缶は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, here's your payment."
msgstr "感謝するわ。謝礼を受け取って。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Natural Chemistry"
msgstr "自然化学"

#. ~ Description of mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a chemistry set for Kostas."
msgstr "コスタスに化学実験セットを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a chemistry set."
msgstr "化学実験セットが必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to start making more concentrated remedies for more serious "
"cases, but I don't have a way of refining any herbs to that degree.  I'd pay"
" for a chemistry set."
msgstr ""
"もっと深刻な病にも対応できるよう、更に濃縮したレメディを作ることにした。だが、どれだけ薬草があっても、精製する手段がない。化学セットを用意してくれたら、買い取ってでも手に入れるのだが。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "We could all use the medicine, including you."
msgstr "薬は皆に必要だろう。お前さんもな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A laboratory or pharmaceutical factory should have one."
msgstr "研究所や製薬関係の施設にあるはずだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the chemistry set?"
msgstr "化学実験セットは見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Blessings be unto you."
msgstr "お前さんに神のご加護がありますように。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Pebble Pusher"
msgstr "石材業者"

#. ~ Description of mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 814 pounds of gravel (5,600 pebbles) for Kostas."
msgstr "コスタスに5600個の小石を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 5,600 pebbles."
msgstr "小石が5600個必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Demand for my herbal medicine has gone up recently, and I'm struggling to "
"get all of my ingredients sustainably.  I'm going to build some planters on "
"the rooftop, but I lack the material to do so in full.  I'd compensate you "
"fairly for 814 pounds of gravel."
msgstr ""
"近頃は私の薬の需要が増えており、安定して素材を手に入れるのに苦労している。そこで、屋上にプランターを並べようと思っているのだが、材料が足りず、作業が進まない。小石を5600個持ってきてくれたら、公正な値段で買い取ろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I understand that it seems formidable, but there is a good deal of money for"
" you."
msgstr "面倒に思うのは分かるが、謝礼は弾むぞ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"An outdoor emporium should have some.  Of course, you could always dig them "
"up from a lakeshore or driveway."
msgstr "アウトドア関係の店に行けばあるはずだ。もちろん、湖岸や舗装道を掘削してもいいだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the rocks?"
msgstr "石は見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Blessings be unto you.  I'll start on the garden right away."
msgstr "お前さんに神のご加護がありますように。さて、さっそく庭造りに取り掛かるか。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Out Of This World Cures"
msgstr "超自然の癒し"

#. ~ Description of mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a marloss berry for Kostas."
msgstr "コスタスにマーロスベリーを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a marloss berry."
msgstr "マーロスベリーを手に入れたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to experiment with some of the more…  otherworldly fauna that "
"have appeared recently.  I saw these pink berries inside a fungal "
"infestation the other day before I burned it with a Molotov.  If you could "
"get me one, I can pay you with a discount on my medicine."
msgstr ""
"近頃世界に現れた、ある種の...特異な生物について研究してみたい。先日、例の菌糸を火炎瓶で燃やしている最中に、ピンク色の果実を見かけたのだ。もし持ってきてくれたら、私が作った薬を安値で売ろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd wear a hazmat suit while I'm in there.  Those spores are absolutely "
"nasty for your health, if my observations of <zombies> nearby are any "
"indication."
msgstr "私なら、防護服を着て向かうだろうな。付近にいた<zombies>を観察して分かったのだが、あの胞子には害がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the berry?"
msgstr "果実は見つけたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'll have to be careful with this thing, thanks for getting it for me.  "
"Let's see what this can do…"
msgstr "ありがとう、くれぐれも気を付けて取り扱わねば。一体どのような果実なのだろう..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Did you eat the thing?  Please tell me your joking."
msgstr "まさか渡す前に自分で食べてしまったのか？冗談だと言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Digital Revolution"
msgstr "デジタル革命"

#. ~ Description of mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get a e-ink tablet PC for Tom Powell."
msgstr "トム・パウエルにE-InkタブレットPCを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get an e-ink tablet PC."
msgstr "E-InkタブレットPCが必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've assembled quite a collection of evidence in my research, and I want an "
"easier way to organize it.  If you could get me one of those e-ink tablets, "
"I could scan all my documents into an easily-preserved digital format.  "
"There's some money for you, too."
msgstr ""
"研究のためにかなりの量の証拠を集めたけれど、整理するのが大変だ。E-Inkタブレットがあれば、文書を丸ごとスキャンして、保存しやすいデジタルデータに変換できる。持ってきてくれたら、謝礼を支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  The truth is ever closer!"
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。真実の解明まであと少しだ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Don't you want to know the truth behind <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>の真相を知りたくはないのか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check an electronics store for one."
msgstr "僕だったら電器店を探すだろうな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the tablet?"
msgstr "タブレットPCは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Here's the money I promised you.  I'll start organizing my collection."
msgstr "さあ、約束した謝礼だ。早速コレクションの整理を始めるとしよう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Missing Persons"
msgstr "失踪者"

#. ~ Description of mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 25 missing person posters for Tom Powell."
msgstr "トム・パウエルに25枚の行方不明者ポスターを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 25 missing posters."
msgstr "行方不明者ポスターが25枚必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want to take a look at some of the missing posters for any links.  If you "
"could get me twenty-five of them, I could start my analysis.  Make sure to "
"get posters for adults, I don't think any children could provide links."
msgstr ""
"行方不明者ポスターを集めて、何か共通点がないか調べたい。25枚もあれば、分析できるだろう。大人の行方不明者のポスターで頼むよ。子供だと共通点を見つけにくい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There should be plenty on poster-boards around town.  A police station "
"should have a lot."
msgstr "街中にたくさん掲示してある筈だ。特に警察署には多いだろうね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the posters?"
msgstr "ポスターは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I wonder what the link could be.  Too much information?  Government "
"conspiracy?  Aliens?  I'll have to find out."
msgstr "共通点はどこだろう。何かを知り過ぎた？政府の陰謀？宇宙人？早速調べてみないとな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Finding Files"
msgstr "ファイル検索"

#. ~ Description of mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 200 files for Tom Powell."
msgstr "トム・パウエルに200個のファイルを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 200 files."
msgstr "ファイルが200冊必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to broaden my horizons with my research, now I need more "
"general documents for examination, get the big picture.  If you could get me"
" two hundred files, on anything, I'll pay you for them."
msgstr ""
"もっと研究の範囲を広げることにしたんだ。早速だけど、研究のためにもっと一般的な文書を集めたい。真実の全体像を把握するためにね。中身は何でもいいから、ファイルを200冊持ってきてくれたら、謝礼を支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Office buildings, police stations, any high-profile place should have what "
"we want."
msgstr "オフィスビルや警察署、見つけやすい場所にあるはずだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the files?"
msgstr "ファイルは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should occupy my work for a while.  Thanks <name_g>, we'll discover the"
" truth one of these days."
msgstr "これで研究がはかどるぞ。ありがとう、<name_g>。真実が明らかになる日は近い。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Mathematical Measures"
msgstr "数学的手法"

#. ~ Description of mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find some MatheMAX for Olwen Powell."
msgstr "オルウェン・パウエルにマスマックスを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get MatheMAX software."
msgstr "マスマックスというソフトを入手してほしい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've started working on a small project of mine which requires a great deal "
"of computational input.  A piece of MatheMAX software would be a great help."
msgstr ""
"個人的なプロジェクトを立ち上げたんだけど、大量の計算入力作業をしなくちゃならない。マスマックスって名前のソフトウェアがあれば、とても助かるんだけどな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Doing this many calculations by hand isn't very fun, you know."
msgstr "こんなにたくさんの計算を手作業でやるなんて、あまり考えたくないね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check one of the local schools for a USB stick with it."
msgstr "学校に置いてあるUSBに入ってるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the software?"
msgstr "ソフトウェアは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This'll be quite useful in the future.  Thank you, <name_g>."
msgstr "これで今後の作業が捗るよ。ありがとう、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Radio-active"
msgstr "無線通信"

#. ~ Description of mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get six antennae for Olwen Powell."
msgstr "オルウェン・パウエルに6個のアンテナを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get six antennae."
msgstr "アンテナが6本必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Corrie and I have been working on a way to get in touch with anyone who's "
"still out there, and we've started rigging up an internet-to-radio "
"broadcast.  The only thing we need are antennae, six of them specifically."
msgstr ""
"コリーと私で、まだ生きてる人間と連絡を取る方法を考えていて、無線インターネット送信を整備しようってことになった。あと必要なのはアンテナ6本だけなんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This could give us a prosperous future, <name_g>."
msgstr "これでまともな生活ができるようになるかもね、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "We've got to see how many people are out there."
msgstr "生存者がいても、呼びかけてみないと何も始まらないじゃないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A radio tower should have some lying around in storage."
msgstr "電波塔の倉庫に眠ってるはず。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the antennae?"
msgstr "アンテナは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now we can get in touch with a lot more people, see what's out there.  Thank"
" you, <name_g>."
msgstr "これでたくさんの人と連絡を取って、外の様子をもっと知れるようになる。ありがとう、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Cotton Conundrum"
msgstr "コットンの困難"

#. ~ Description of mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 300 cotton patches for Maria Serrano."
msgstr "マリア・セラーノに300枚の端切れ(綿)を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 300 cotton patchworks."
msgstr "綿布の端切れが300枚必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm starting to run low on cotton for my sewing.  I think three hundred "
"cotton patches should hold me for a while; I'll pay you for them if you get "
"me some."
msgstr "裁縫に使う綿布がもうなくなりそう。端切れが300枚もあれば、しばらくは大丈夫だと思うんだけど。調達してきてくれるなら、代金を支払うよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Great stuff!"
msgstr "ありがと！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How am I supposed to tailor if I have nothing to tailor with?"
msgstr "材料がなくなったら、仕立てもできなくなるんだよ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You could try cutting up some unneeded sweaters from a clothing store, or "
"you could make some yourself."
msgstr "服屋で売ってるものや自作したもので、使ってない服を切ってみたらどうだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the cotton?"
msgstr "綿布の端切れはあった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  This should do me for a while."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。これでしばらくは大丈夫。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Spinning Wheels"
msgstr "糸車"

#. ~ Description of mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find an electric spinning wheel for Maria Serrano."
msgstr "マリア・セラーノに電動糸車を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get an electric spinning wheel."
msgstr "電動糸車がほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want to try making my own cloth, it's getting harder to find the "
"quantities I need.  I'll buy an electric spinning wheel if you can find one,"
" it'd vastly expedite the process."
msgstr "生地を自分で作ってみたいけど、必要な量を揃えるまでが大変なんだ。作業がはかどる電動糸車を持ってきてくれたら、買い取るよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd really help me in getting your stuff to you faster."
msgstr "協力してくれたら、あなたが注文した衣服も早く作れるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A textile museum should have one lying around."
msgstr "織物資料館に置いてあるかもね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the spinning wheel?"
msgstr "電動糸車は見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This is wonderful!  I'll really be able to put the pedal to the metal!"
msgstr "すごい！これで作業がスピードアップできる！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Plumbing Maintenance"
msgstr "配管のメンテナンス"

#. ~ Description of mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 200 pipes for Helena Misinter."
msgstr "ヘレナ・ミシンターに200本のパイプを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 200 pipes."
msgstr "パイプが200本必要なのです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"We were in the process of refurbishing the retreat when <the_cataclysm> "
"interrupted us.  Some of the plumbing around here was troublesome, and we "
"need to fix that.  200 pipes should be all we need to finish it."
msgstr ""
"私たちはこの建物を改修しているまさにその時、<the_cataclysm>に見舞われました。厄介な配管工事が終わっておらず、取り掛かる必要があるのです。パイプを200本、調達してきてください。それだけあれば工事を進められます。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God protect you."
msgstr "あなたに神のご加護がありますように。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll find someone else, then."
msgstr "仕方ありませんね、他の方に頼みます。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"A public works or a craft shop should have some lying around.  If not, try a"
" steel mill."
msgstr "公共土木施設や工芸品店へ行けば、たくさん見つかるでしょうね。あとは、製鉄所などどうでしょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the pipes?"
msgstr "パイプは見つかりましたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "As expected for such a person…"
msgstr "この程度の方だったとは..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Planning Planers"
msgstr "プレーナーのプラン"

#. ~ Description of mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find two planers for Helena Misinter."
msgstr "ヘレナ・ミシンターに2個のプレーナーを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get two planers."
msgstr "プレーナーが2台必要です。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking to construct some fortifications around the church, should any "
"of Satan's devils decide to run amok.  We have most of the material needed "
"for such an undertaking, but processing our raw lumber is taking far too "
"long.  I've heard a planer could do such in a fraction of the time; I'll pay"
" for two of them."
msgstr ""
"近くで悪魔の手下が暴れると困るので、教会の周りを要塞のように囲もうと考えています。資材はほぼ揃っているのですが、原木の加工には途方もない時間がかかります。プレーナーという工具を使えば、加工もあっという間に済むと聞きました。2台用意してもらえたら、代金を支払いましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd poke around any industrial sites for some."
msgstr "工業施設にならあるかもしれませんね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the planers?"
msgstr "プレーナーはありましたか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purging Heresy"
msgstr "異端者の粛正"

#. ~ Description of mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill some bandits for Helena Misinter."
msgstr "ヘレナ・ミシンターのために盗賊たちを殺しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purge the heretics."
msgstr "異端者を粛正するのです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Blasphemy, heresy, the righteous judgement of God!  I have found the scum of"
" Hell pillaging a church for valuables!  Even in <the_cataclysm>, I shall "
"not stand for this.  I want you to go there and wipe those <swear> <name_b>s"
" from the Earth."
msgstr ""
"神の冒涜者、異端者には、神の名のもとに正義の裁きが必要ですわ！悪魔の手下のカス共が教会で貴重品を略奪していると聞きました！たとえ<the_cataclysm>のただ中であろうと、赦しがたい蛮行です。現地へ向かい、その<name_b>共を地上から消し去っていただけると助かります、<swear>。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Righteous judgement shall come!"
msgstr "正義の裁きを下しましょう！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Are you standing with them?"
msgstr "あなたもアレと同類なのですか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Attack at night to surprise them.  Barring that, go in full force, guns "
"blazing.  I wouldn't try to call a horde in, I don't want to ruin such a "
"holy place."
msgstr ""
"夜間に奇襲攻撃を掛けるのがいいでしょうね。それが無理なら、銃を構えて全力で突撃することです。神聖な地を穢したくはありません。ゾンビを呼び寄せるのは止めていただきたいですね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Are the heretics purged?"
msgstr "異端者は粛正されましたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Why have you failed us?!"
msgstr "私を裏切ったのですか！？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Preservation of Substenance"
msgstr "食料備蓄"

#. ~ Description of mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find five canning pots for Helena Misinter."
msgstr "ヘレナ・ミシンターに5個の寸胴鍋を渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get five canning pots."
msgstr "寸胴鍋が5つ必要です。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"While we are blessed with a bountiful stock, we need a way to preserve our "
"newer food, mainly those potatoes Darryl's growing.  Fortunately, he brought"
" a book on canning things.  We need five canning pots to get the setup going"
" in full fashion."
msgstr ""
"食料の備蓄は増えてきましたが、生鮮食品、特にダリルが育てているジャガイモの保存方法を考えなければなりません。幸いなことに、彼は保存食作りの本を持っていました。本格的な保存食を作るには、食料を瓶に詰めるための寸胴鍋が5つは必要なのだそうです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May the Lord bless you."
msgstr "主のご加護がありますように。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "An old factory might have one, or a hobby shop."
msgstr "昔ながらの工場や、趣味の道具を売っている店にあるかもしれませんね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the canning pots?"
msgstr "寸胴鍋は見つかりましたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Substenance"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  You're welcome to some of our first batch, if you're interested."
msgstr "助かりました。よかったら、初めて作った保存食を貰ってください。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Investigate the Center"
msgstr "避難センターを調べる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Go to the location Helena told you about and see who's there."
msgstr "ヘレナが指定した地点へ行き、どんな人物がいるのか調べましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "See who's over there."
msgstr "指定した地点にいる人物を調べてきてください。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr "このメッセージが見えている場合は、バグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "What have you found out?"
msgstr "何か発見はありましたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should be very useful to us.  Now we can truly begin our march of "
"righteousness."
msgstr "私たちにとって非常に有益な情報ですね。これでようやく、正義を世に広めることができます。"

