#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A survivor raising rabbits, all by themselves. Give special quests to
#. give rabbits to player
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Mr. Lapin"
msgstr "ウサギ飼育家"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A survivor raising rabbits, all by themselves. Give special quests to
#. give rabbits to player
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Warrener"
msgstr "ｳｫｰﾚﾅｰ"

#. ~ Job description of "Mr. Lapin" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise rabbits."
msgstr "ウサギを育てているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Are you here to protect us?"
msgstr "私たちを守ってくれるのかい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Pleased to meet you."
msgstr "お目にかかれて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm just trying to get by."
msgstr "何とかやっているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Heard anything about the outside world?"
msgstr "外の世界について何か聞いていないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "You look different?"
msgstr "妙な姿だな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Anything I can help with?"
msgstr "何か手伝えるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "About that work…"
msgstr "その仕事について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Do you need any resources?"
msgstr "何か必要な物資はある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Where did you get that giant firefly terrarium?"
msgstr "巨大ホタルのテラリウムは、どこで手に入れたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Getting by will do for now."
msgstr "ああ、何とかやっていこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I guess it has to."
msgstr "そうだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise my rabbits, I seem to have more in common with them every day."
msgstr "私はウサギを飼っているけど、どんどんウサギに近くなってきている気がするんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Well, then…"
msgstr "そうか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"People come to me to learn how to keep rabbits.  They learn and they go.  I "
"like to think I'm making the world better."
msgstr "ウサギの飼い方を教わるためにここへ来る人もいる。学ぶとここを去っていく。世界を改善できている気がして嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Anyone nearby I should meet?"
msgstr "この近くには他に誰かいないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That sounds optimistic?"
msgstr "楽観的だな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"There is a family of nearby farmers that I trade with.  I'd appreciate it if"
" you could go check on them."
msgstr "取り引きをしている農家の一家がいるんだ。ぜひ会いに行ってみるといい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Seems like a deal to me."
msgstr "いい交換条件だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "That seems rather dangerous, I think I'll pass."
msgstr "嫌な予感がする、やめておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"It can be quite a hike depending on your transportation.  Lot of bad news "
"between here and there."
msgstr "交通手段によっては、かなり時間がかかるかもしれない。あちこちで大変なことが起きているからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'll be careful."
msgstr "心配しなくていい。用心するよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Just a walk in the woods."
msgstr "ちょっとした散歩のようなものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"If I teach one hundred people how to raise rabbits, that's potentially a "
"hundred communities given food and fur before those people teach anyone "
"else."
msgstr "ウサギの飼い方を100人の人に教えれば、教わった人が別の集団にそれを伝え、100のコミュニティに食べ物と毛皮を補給できるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That's the most hopeful thing I've heard so far."
msgstr "希望が湧いてくる話だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"A traveler brought this to me in return for some rabbits.  Said that he'd "
"gotten it from a scientist out in the swamps but it took up too much space "
"in his car."
msgstr "旅人にウサギをあげたお返しとして貰ったんだ。沼地に住んでる科学者だそうだよ。場所を取るから車の中に置き辛かったんだって。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "It's quite unique!"
msgstr "なかなかユニークだね！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Same way you got yours, I bet."
msgstr "君と同じく、私も賭けをしたのさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "CRISPR?  Radiation?  Something in the water?  Maybe it was bunnies."
msgstr "遺伝子の問題だろうか？それとも被曝？悪い水を飲んだから？ウサちゃんに似てきた気がする。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "So it goes."
msgstr "そういうものか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "気持ち悪いな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm very sorry to tell you this, but you should look in a mirror."
msgstr "悪いけど、鏡を見てみた方が良いんじゃないか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Insulting people who could help you is unlikely to aid survival."
msgstr "侮辱してくる人を助けようとは思えないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"The bunnies and I love adding some diversity to the menu and I always need "
"materials for patching fences."
msgstr "ウサちゃんも私もバラエティ豊かな献立は大好きさ。それと、フェンスを修理するための資材はいつでも大歓迎だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Can we discuss something else?"
msgstr "これで全部だ。他のことを聞いてもいいか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "That's all for now.  I'd best get going."
msgstr "これで全部だ。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Timber!"
msgstr "木こり仕事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Timber!"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Bring five logs."
msgstr "5つの丸太を持ってきましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 5 logs for fences."
msgstr "柵を作るのに丸太が5本必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I need to build fences and ditches around my rabbits.  Could you find about…"
" five logs for me?"
msgstr "ウサギ小屋の周りに柵と溝を作ろうとしてるんだ。もし良かったら...丸太を5本持ってきてもらえないかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "There's a lot of places to look.  Trees are pretty common."
msgstr "色々な場所で見つかるだろう。木はどこにでも生えてるからね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found'em?"
msgstr "どう？揃ったかい？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Sweets"
msgstr "スイーツ"

#. ~ Description of mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find 25 blackberries."
msgstr "25個のブラックベリーを探す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 25 blackberries."
msgstr "ブラックベリーが25個必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Fruits would let me break the monotony of grains and meats."
msgstr "フルーツがあれば、穀物と肉だけの単調な食事も変わるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for some "
"oranges.  Just kidding."
msgstr "引き受けてくれてありがとう。このままだと、オレンジ欲しさに訪問者を殺してしまうところだった。いや、冗談だよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find someone growing berries or an orchard."
msgstr "野生のベリーが生えている茂みや果樹園を探そう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Have you found the fruit?"
msgstr "フルーツは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "協力してくれてありがとう。これが報酬だよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Visit the Isherwoods"
msgstr "イシャーウッド氏を訪ねる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Visit the Isherwoods"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"There is a family that nearby that I'd like you to check in on. After you "
"talk to all of them come back to me and tell me how they are doing."
msgstr "近くに住んでいる家族について調べましょう。家族全員と会話した後に依頼人のところへ戻り、様子を報告しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Visit the Isherwoods"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Have you checked on them?"
msgstr "無事に会えたかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Visit the Isherwoods"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Good, that's one less thing to worry about."
msgstr "よし、これで心配事が一つ減った。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Visit the Isherwoods"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm glad to hear they are fine.  Why haven't they been by then?"
msgstr "あの家族が元気そうで良かったよ。どうして顔を出してくれなかったんだろう？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Visit the Isherwoods"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "At least you came back with your life…"
msgstr "少なくとも、生きて戻って来られたじゃないか..."

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Hunter with indigenous ancestry and big ideas.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Glooscap"
msgstr "ｸﾞﾙｰｽｷｬｯﾌﾟ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Good to see you again, how can I help you?"
msgstr "また会ったな、どうしたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"They say I turned a man into a cedar tree once.  That's a terrible thing to "
"say."
msgstr "わたしが人間を杉の木に変えたなどという噂が流れている。なんとも酷い話だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You like maple syrup?  That was me.  Not the syrup, that was the trees, but "
"I figured out how to make it much harder to concentrate it, used to be way "
"too easy.  Pretty nice right?"
msgstr ""
"メープルシロップは好きか？わたしは好きだ。いや、シロップというより、メープルの木が好きなのだ。だから、皆がシロップを簡単に濃縮できないようにしてやった。以前は楽過ぎたからな。いいことをしたと思わないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Did I tell you the one about the beavers?  Used to be way too big.  Like "
"giant beavers, it was a mess.  I fixed that.  Of course there seem to be a "
"bunch of new giant things out here now.  I'll have to think about that."
msgstr ""
"ビーバーの話はもう聞いたか？昔のビーバーはもっと大きかった。大きすぎて、辺りは大混乱だ。だから、わたしが丁度いいサイズに直してやった。知ってのとおり、ここ最近は大きな生き物がたくさん現れている。どうにかすべきなのかもしれないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You know storms?  Used to be more.  Took me a lot of work, but there aren't "
"as many now.  That was me, I did that.  Fewer storms, pretty good.  There's "
"a big eagle, it's a long story really.  I'm good with rope though."
msgstr ""
"嵐に遭ったことは？昔は嵐の日が多かった。それを何とか苦労して、少なくした。そう、わたしが嵐を減らしたのだ。嵐が少ないのはいいことだ。大きなワシが、いや、話が長くなるから止そう。ともかく、わたしの投げ縄の腕は一流だということだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "It's decided then.  I will be Glooscap.  Who will you be?"
msgstr "よし、決めた。わたしはグルースキャップだ。おや、どうしたのだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Glooscap?  That's a funny name.  Is it foreign?"
msgstr "グルースキャップ？変な名前だ。外国から来たのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 11]  Like the Abenaki myth?"
msgstr "[知性 11] アベナキ族の神話から採ったのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "So.  You're dressed like a hunter.  Are you a hunter?"
msgstr "ハンターのような服装だな。狩りをしているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Have you had any luck out there?"
msgstr "何かいいものを見つけてきたのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whatever, I don't have time for whatever this is.  Try not to get your face "
"eaten I guess."
msgstr "おっと、呑気に話しこんでいる場合じゃないな。顔を食いちぎられないよう気を付けた方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is"
" your name foreign?"
msgstr "その反応は聞き飽きた。わたしは外国から来たのではない。グルースキャップはこの場所に古くから伝わる名だ。おまえの名は外国のものか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, my name has been a name here for a very long time too."
msgstr "いいや、私の名前もかなりの年代物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, I just made it up."
msgstr "いいや、私が自分でつけた名前だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, I just got here.  What's happening?"
msgstr "ああ、ここへ来たばかりだ。何があったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't know about names, let's talk about something more interesting."
msgstr "名前についての話はそろそろ切り上げて、もっと面白い話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know the real people's stories?  Yes, a lot like that."
msgstr "真の人間に伝わる物語のことを知っているのだな？ああ、まさにそれだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Cool, cool.  So you like myths and stuff?"
msgstr "わー、カッコいい。神話とかそっち系の奴が好きなんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Do you have a twin named Malsumis?"
msgstr "[知性 14] マルスミスという名前の双子がいたりしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm a very smart survivor of the apocalypse.  Anyway, I need to move "
"along.  Later Glooscap."
msgstr "まあね、私は崩壊した世界を生き残る程度には賢いんだ。さて、もう行かないと。グルースキャップ、また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"And stuff sure.  How can I help you stranger?  They say I'm the nice one.  "
"See this smile?  Nice smile right?"
msgstr "そう、そっち系だ。客人よ、どうした？わたしは気がいいことで有名なのだ。笑っているだろう？どうだ、いい笑顔だろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS BEER] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with me, "
"want to have some?"
msgstr "[ビール所持] その笑顔、ものすごく良いと思う。そういえば、酒を持っているんだ。飲まないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS IPA] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with me, "
"want to have some?"
msgstr "[ビール(ｲﾝﾃﾞｨｱﾍﾟｰﾙｴｰﾙ)所持]  その笑顔、ものすごく良いと思う。そういえば、酒を持っているんだ。飲まないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS CIGARETTES] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some "
"cigarettes, want one with me?"
msgstr "[タバコ所持]  その笑顔、ものすごく良いと思う。そういえば、タバコを持っているんだ。一本どう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS JOINT] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have something to smoke, "
"want to have some with me?"
msgstr "[ジョイント所持]  その笑顔、ものすごく良いと思う。そういえば、いいハッパを持っているんだ。一本どう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You seem cool but I don't have anything fun.  I'll try and find something "
"and come back so we can share."
msgstr "すごく素敵だと思う。そういえば、ちょっとおすそ分けしたいものがあったんだけど、忘れてきてしまった。取りに行ってくるから、また後で話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] That smile is very nice.  It makes me smile too."
msgstr "[可憐] とっても素敵な笑顔だ。おかげで私も笑顔になれたよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[GLORIOUS] Worship my beauty."
msgstr "[秀麗(レベル3)] そんなことより、私の美を崇めよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Fear me!  I am disgusting!"
msgstr "[畏怖] そんなことより、私を恐れよ！おぞましいだろう！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Destroy me!"
msgstr "[畏怖] やれるもんならやってみな！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky."
"  You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice "
"one, but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It "
"takes days."
msgstr ""
"ああ、その通りだ。あの厄介なマルスミスも、この辺りにいるだろう。本当に厄介な奴だ。わたしが以前マルスミスを石に変えてやった話は伝わっているか？わたしは気がいいことで知られているが、石になった身体を元に戻すのがどれほど痛いか、おまえは知っているか？しかも何日もかかるのだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[INT 14] I'll look out then, thanks.  Of course if you were Malsumis you "
"probably wouldn't admit it because no one likes Malsumis.  Who would your "
"twin say you are?"
msgstr ""
"[知性 14] "
"気を付けるよ、ありがとう。ところで、もしあなたがマルスミスなら、嫌われ者のマルスミスの名前をわざわざ使おうとはしないだろうな。双子の兄弟はあなたのことを何と呼んでいるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know you're not really Glooscap right?  You're joking right?"
msgstr "あなたは神話に登場する本物のグルースキャップじゃないだろう？冗談だよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Of course, that all makes as much sense as anything I guess.  So you have "
"crazy supernatural powers then?  Can you stop whatever is happening and make"
" it like before?"
msgstr ""
"今までの話を総合すると、こうとしか考えられない。つまり、あなたはとんでもないスーパーパワーを持っているんだな？起きてしまったことを元通りにしたりはできるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what Malsumis would say, Malsumis is very tricky.  I always "
"tell the truth, it's very boring."
msgstr "マルスミスが何と言うかなど、分かるものか。ともかく、マルスミスは本当に厄介だ。わたしはいつも本当のことを言う。あたりまえの話だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] I think you're Malsumis.  Where is Glooscap?"
msgstr "[知性 14] お前はマルスミスだな。グルースキャップはどこだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Yes, that all makes sense to me.  Forget I asked."
msgstr "[知性 14] ああ、全部納得できた。さっき疑ったことは忘れてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"I don't have time for this.  I have serious survival business to do.  I am a"
" serious survival business person."
msgstr "こんな話に付き合っている時間はない。私には無事に生き残るという使命があるんだ。なんたって、私は真のサバイバリストなのだから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap "
"would stop me."
msgstr "もしわたしがマルスミスなら、おまえはとても危険な目に遭っていた筈だ。グルースキャップはそのような事はしない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Fight me Malsumis!"
msgstr "かかってこいよ、マルスミス！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[SKILLED LIAR] Then you're definitely not Malsumis and everything is cool.  "
"So Malsumis wants to kill everybody right?  I guess they're feeling pretty "
"great right now huh?"
msgstr ""
"[詐欺師] それなら、あなたは絶対にマルスミスじゃない、それで納得できる。マルスミスは人間を根絶やしにしたいんだろう？今の状況はとても楽しいだろうな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Haha, good one Glooscap.  So funny.  Love that.  Let's move on."
msgstr "ははは、流石は気のいいグルースキャップだ。面白かったよ。本当だ。そろそろ他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "This is awkward.  I need to leave."
msgstr "気まずい雰囲気だ。そろそろ行くことにするよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Maybe.  Is it worse to be unhappy with a goal or to be unhappy without a "
"goal?  You're all right, I feel like we get each other."
msgstr ""
"そうだろうな。目指す道が分かっていて不幸になるのと、目指す道が見当たらず不幸になるのでは、どちらが辛いのだろうか？ふむ、だんだん分かり合えてきたようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I feel the same way best friend."
msgstr "親友よ、私も同じ気持ちだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No idea what you mean."
msgstr "ちょっとよく分からないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Haha, right.  What would Glooscap be doing in the sunrise lands at the "
"beginning of the fourth age?  That's silly.  I'm probably some Abenaki that "
"got hit on the head or something.  And who turns into a beaver?  Haha.  You "
"got me.  Just a normal human made out of trees like the rest."
msgstr ""
"ハッハッハ、その通り。第四の時代が訪れた夜明けの土地でグルースキャップが何をすると言うのだ？バカバカしい。わたしはきっと、頭を打ったか何かでおかしくなったアベナキ族の人間なのだろう。ビーバーに変身できるかだと？ハハハ。おまえの言う通り、わたしは創造者が木で創り出した、単なる人間だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"No problem, a lot of people are going through some hard times right now.  "
"Honestly, you're doing better than most.  You should follow me, I have a "
"pretty good handle on reality."
msgstr ""
"大丈夫、この状況で辛い思いをしている人はあなた以外にもたくさんいる。正直言って、あなたは結構上手くやれている方だと思う。私にはこの世界を生き抜く力がある。一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"I'm not made out of trees, I'm made out of awesome.  Follow me and you will "
"grow fat and rich."
msgstr "私は木なんかじゃなくて、もっとすごいものでできいるんだ。私と一緒に来れば、腹いっぱい食べられるし、贅沢もできる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You shouldn't follow me, but I guess I can't stop you."
msgstr "ついてくるなと言っても、聞かないんだろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Another world is going and a new world is coming.  I hope this new one is "
"better than the last, a new golden age.  So far not great."
msgstr ""
"ある世界が去り、新たな世界が訪れる。わたしは、この新たな世界が、以前より素晴らしくなることを願っている。今のところは、たいして素晴らしくもないようだが。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Sure sure.  So are you on drugs?"
msgstr "ははん。さてはヤクでもキメてるな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whatever, I don't have time for creepy stuff."
msgstr "馬鹿げてるな。そんなくだらない意見を聞いてる暇はない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Yes, thank you for sharing with me.  So what are you doing here?  What are "
"you trying to accomplish?"
msgstr "おお、差し入れに感謝しよう。ところで、おまえはここで何をしている？何を成し遂げるつもりだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[INT 14] I'm trying to understand what happened and see if I can make "
"something better happen."
msgstr "[知性 14] 何が起きたのか解明し、いい状況にもっていく方法を考えているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I'm trying to become more powerful than whatever else is out there."
msgstr "誰よりも強くなろうとしているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I'm trying to make a survivor settlement.  You should join!"
msgstr "生存者を集めて、定住地を作ろうとしているんだ。ぜひ参加してほしいな！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Maybe some day.  If you can survive a long enough I may decide to come and "
"stay with you."
msgstr "これから先、もし、おまえがもっと長く生き延びたならば、おまえと共に暮らすこともあるかもしれないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I need to move on."
msgstr "そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Not enough given what's happening."
msgstr "このような状況では、ヤクはいくらあっても足りないものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop trying to"
" spook me, I don't like it."
msgstr "おい、落ち着け。うわっ、ああ、やめろ、もう十分だ。わたしを怖がらせようとするな、勘弁してくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, that worked great."
msgstr "よし、効果てきめんだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "We are not good and I'm done talking to you."
msgstr "私たちは相性が悪いようだ。もう話は切り上げよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Among other things, sure.  I have some extra I might be willing to trade, "
"but I only trade with my friends and I don't have a lot of those left."
msgstr "確かに、そういう見方もあるな。取り引き用の品も持っているが、わたしは友人としか取り引きしないし、物資もそれほど大量には用意できない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS BEER] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks with me, want "
"to have some?"
msgstr "[ビール所持] 私たちが友達かどうかは分からないが、酒なら持っている。飲まないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS IPA] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks with me, want "
"to have some?"
msgstr "[ビール(ｲﾝﾃﾞｨｱﾍﾟｰﾙｴｰﾙ)所持] 私たちが友達かどうかは分からないが、酒なら持っている。飲まないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS CIGARETTES] I don't know about friends, but I have some cigarettes, "
"want one with me?"
msgstr "[タバコ所持]  そ私たちが友達かどうかは分からないが、タバコなら持っている。一本どう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[HAS JOINT] I don't know about friends, but I have something to smoke, want "
"to have some with me?"
msgstr "[ジョイント所持] 私たちが友達かどうかは分からないが、いいハッパなら持っている。一本どう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You seem cool and I'd like to talk more but I don't have anything fun.  I'll"
" try and find something and come back so we can share."
msgstr ""
"あなたはいい人みたいだし、もっと親睦を深めたい。おすそ分けしたいものがあったんだけど、忘れてきてしまった。取りに行ってくるから、また後で話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] I think we're going to be great friends, don't you agree?"
msgstr "[可憐] 私たちはきっと大親友になれる。そうは思わないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop making "
"that face, it's too much for me.  Gives me feelings."
msgstr "おい、落ち着け。うわっ、ああ、やめろ、もう十分だ。そんな顔で見るな、勘弁してくれ。感情が昂ってしまう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I don't think so.  I'm pretty good at hunting though."
msgstr "そんなわけないだろう。だが、狩りは得意な方だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "I guess that's something."
msgstr "それは頼もしいな。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor trying to stay safe
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor completely unwilling to talk
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor that gave up on life
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor willing to trade items
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Survivor cowboy"
msgstr "カウボーイ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "また会ったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Ayuh, I was thinkin' it's just another monstah skulkin' about.  Who are you?"
msgstr "おやぁ、こそこそ隠れてる化けもんかと思ったが、お前さん誰だい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Just a survivor, looking around.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "この辺りを通りかかった、ただの生存者だ。ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "What did you before all this?"
msgstr "以前は何をしていたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "何か私にできる事はあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How about we travel together?"
msgstr "一緒に旅をしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "What's with the accent?"
msgstr "その口調は何だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back"
" togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"こっからそれほど離れてねぇ牧場で働いてたんだ。ウマやらウシやら、いろんな動物の世話をして、土地の安全をしっかり守ることが人生の全てだった。でも今はどうだ？さっぱり分からんね。とにかく生き残るので精一杯さ。いつか世界が元通りになったら、自分の技術を好きなように使いてぇなと思ってるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Let's hope it will."
msgstr "その日が来るといいな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear."
"  Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr "なんか良い道具が落ちてないかと思って、この辺をぶらついてたのさ。ちょいと一休みしてた足音が聞こえたもんだから、ここに留まってんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Can't say I can think of summin' specific right now.  Gotta say though, "
"maybe it oughta be a good idea for us ta travel togetha' - safety in numbers"
" an' all that."
msgstr "何かうまい案があるって訳じゃねぇんだ。それはともかく、お前さんと同行するってのも良さそうだ。頭数が揃えばひとまずは安全だからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "考えておくよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Is it a good idea to trust a stranger like me this easily?"
msgstr "私のような知らない人間を簡単に信じていいのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Sounds like a good idea - want to join me, then?"
msgstr "確かに良い考えだ。一緒に行くか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wicked.  Been around the old road long enough ta know how ta handle myself "
"in a pinch.  Knew my way around a gun ever since my da taught me when I was "
"a kid, so ya don't have ta worry about me doing my part."
msgstr ""
"ケッ。昔っから道端で生きてきたんだ。ピンチの時にどう動けばいいかは分かってるさ。銃の使い方も子供の頃に親父から教わった。ちゃんと自分の役目は果たすさ、心配すんなって。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "On a second thought, let me think about it a bit more"
msgstr "いや待った、少し考えさせてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Great!  Let's go."
msgstr "それは良い！一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Don't have much of a choice, do I?  On my own, a monstah will get lucky "
"sooner or later, and even if I kill it, bleedin' out in some alley is not "
"summin' I fancy.  Plus, we just had a nice, civil chat where no one tried ta"
" kill the otha', so I reckon we're off to ah' good start, all things "
"considered."
msgstr ""
"選んでる余裕なんてねぇだろ？一人きりだと、遅かれ早かれ化けもんの餌だ。殺せたとしても、血を流し過ぎてのたれ死ぬかもしれない。考えたくもねぇ。それに、お前さんとは殺し合うこともなく話ができたからな。これから先も、きっと良い関係でいられそうだろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Want to travel with me, then?"
msgstr "分かったよ。それなら、私と一緒に行くか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Can't say I really agree.  I'll be going now."
msgstr "私はそうは思わないな。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wha', nevah been ta Boston 'ave ya?  Hope you're not 'avin a hahd time "
"keepin' up with me, but if ya get used ta it, wicked good fun, let me tell "
"ya."
msgstr "ハッ、ボストンへ行ったことがねぇのか？お前さんも最初は慣れねぇかもしれねぇが、慣れればどうってこたねぇ。そう思うぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I like it."
msgstr "いいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I hate it."
msgstr "気に入らないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Okay then."
msgstr "分かった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Hey!  Stop right there!  This here is private property!  Not one step "
"closer, you got it?!"
msgstr "おい！さっさと止まれ！ここは私有地だ！一歩でも近づいたら、分かってるな！？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Whoa, calm down, no reason to get heated."
msgstr "まあまあ、落ち着いてくれ。そんなに興奮することはない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "You better calm down right now."
msgstr "とりあえず落ち着いた方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Does private property even exist anymore?"
msgstr "私有地なんて概念が残ってるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Yeah that's right!  And don't bother me again, you hear?!"
msgstr "ああ、それがいい！二度と絡んでくるなよ、分かったな！？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I said stay away!  Don't get any closer or I swear I will kill you."
msgstr "近づくなと言っただろ！近づいたら、絶対にお前を殺す。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Don't threaten me or you will regret it."
msgstr "脅しているつもりか。後悔することになるぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I really just want to talk - I mean no harm."
msgstr "話がしたいだけなんだ。悪さはしないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, I'm leaving."
msgstr "わかった、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"For the last goddamn time, leave or I will defend myself!  I will kill you!"
msgstr "最後の警告だ。ここから去らなければ、自衛手段をとるぞ！殺してやる！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "やってみればいいさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Did you just fucking threaten me?!  This is your last chance to piss off or "
"I swear I will end you!"
msgstr "それは脅しなのか！？これが最後のチャンスだ。次にふざけたことを言ったら、確実に息の根を止めてやる！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm going."
msgstr "分かった、分かったよ、もう出て行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "It does on my property!  Now blow off!"
msgstr "私の財産なんだ！ぶっ殺してやる！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Okay, I'll leave."
msgstr "そうか、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I just want to talk."
msgstr "話がしたいだけなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "あん？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Oh.  Hey there."
msgstr "おや、どうも。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Thought I heard someone.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "誰かの声が聞こえた気がしてね。ここで何をしている？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "一緒に来てもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I already told you.  Don't want to go through it again."
msgstr "もう伝えたはずだ。同じ話はごめんだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"近くの街に住んでいた。9時から5時までの、普通の社会人さ。ことが起きた時は、私たちは安全な逃げ道を確保できた。今じゃ安全なんてどこにもないんだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Wait, 'we'?"
msgstr "えっ、「私たち」？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Right.  Okay."
msgstr "そうか。なるほど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "街を出たときは一人じゃなかった。ここへたどり着けたのは私一人だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry for your loss.  But you still can't give up.  You have a lot to "
"live for!"
msgstr "それは辛かっただろうな。でも、諦めちゃだめだ。生き残る道はまだ残っている！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "誰かを失ったのはあなた一人じゃない。その場でうずくまって死を待つのはごめんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "悲しみに身を任せていてはいけない。いつか元気を取り戻せるはずだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "死人は生き返らない。いつもそうだった。だから私たちは生き続けなければならない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sure your loved one would want you to live on for them."
msgstr "あなたの愛した人は、きっと生きて欲しいと思っているはずだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I… I mean… huh.  I guess."
msgstr "あ...ああ...うん。そうだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "うん。お大事に。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "人生これからさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr "放っておいてくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Take care."
msgstr "分かった。お大事に。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I dunno.  Waiting.  Seeing if something happens I guess."
msgstr "さあね。待ってるんだ。何かが起きるのをね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "世界が大変なことになってるのは、知っているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "だったらもっと関心を持つべきことがあるのでは？生き残る気があるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die"
" the day after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll "
"just see everyone we care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it "
"over with."
msgstr ""
"生き残るって、どれだけだ？何が起きてるか知ってるだろ。今日生き残っても、明日には死ぬ。明日生き残っても明後日に死ぬ。それでもずっと生き残るってことは、知ってる人間が全員死ぬまで見届けるってことだ。それを、全部、乗り越えて生きろっていうのか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "だからって、諦めるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "ああ。その意見はもっともだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I dunno.  Maybe.  Might give me something to do while I think about all "
"this."
msgstr "どうしようか。決められない。悩んでいるくらいなら、行動に移すべきなんだろうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "放っておいてくれと言ったはずだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "It will.  Let's get going."
msgstr "きっとそうだ。さあ行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "On a second thought, wait here a while."
msgstr "いや、しばらく考えた方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "分かった。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hey!  Who goes there?"
msgstr "やあ！誰だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Just another survivor.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "ただの生存者だ。ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I'm you, from the future.  I've come to warn you."
msgstr "私はお前だ。未来から警告しに来た。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"I am a ghost.  I died here 37 years ago, yet I cannot depart this mortal "
"realm."
msgstr "私は幽霊だ。37年前にここで死んだが、土地に縛られて動けないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "私に何か手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not "
"sound that fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get."
"  I was lucky enough to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to "
"shit.  In a way, being a salesman saved me and the experience from the job "
"might allow me to make a living in the apocalypse, bartering for gear and "
"trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"セールスマンをしていた。高性能な農機具のね。信じられないかもしれないが、農機具ってのは非常に高価なんだ。世界が崩壊したときは、幸運なことに郊外の農場に来ていた。ある意味ではセールスマンという仕事に救われたとも言えるな。仕事の経験を生かして機械や道具を上手く物々交換することで、この世界を生き延びられたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Speaking of which, I'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "それなら、商品を見せてもらえないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "悪くない生き方だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Hah, real cute.  Seem the End times didn't take your sense of humor, eh, "
"stranger?"
msgstr "ハハ、それは面白いな。見知らぬ方、世界が崩壊してもユーモアのセンスを忘れなかったんだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I have my moments.  So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "たまには良いじゃないか。それで、ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Ah, not much really.  Passing through, trying to make a living by trading "
"with folk.  If you're interested, I got a lot of good things on sale, "
"stranger."
msgstr "いや、詰まらない仕事さ。ここを通りがかる人と取り引きして、生計を立てているんだ。見知らぬ方、もし興味があるなら自慢の商品を見てってくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You do?  Let me take a look."
msgstr "そうなのか？では見せてもらおうかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You seem like a decent sort, but I'm not really looking for company right "
"now.  Think I'm better off on my own."
msgstr "確かにあなたはまともな人のようだが、私は別に就職先を探している訳ではないんだ。一人でいさせてくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "If you think so."
msgstr "それなら仕方ないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Goodbye."
msgstr "分かったよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgstr "ショットガン(ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ870ｴｸｽﾌﾟﾚｽ)を入手する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, now that you mention it…"
msgstr "ちょっと頼みたいことが..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You see, some time ago, I ran into this guy who offered me a substantial "
"payment in exchange for a Remington 870 Express.  I asked if he'd like "
"another weapon, since nowadays, any gun will do, but for some reason, he's "
"dead set on that particular model.  If you could obtain one for me, well, "
"I'd be quite grateful."
msgstr ""
"ほんの少し前、私はある男に出会った。そいつは、レミントン870エクスプレスと引き換えに相当な額を支払ってくれるって言うんだ。今ならどんな銃でも手に入るんだし、他の武器じゃダメなのかって聞いたんだけど、何故かその男は目当ての銃にこだわってる。レミントン870エクスプレスを手に入れてもらえると、とても助かるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Let me know when you get it, and I'll try to get in touch with him."
msgstr "素晴らしい！そいつに連絡を入れたいから、手に入れたら知らせてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Suit yourself.  Ain't a rush."
msgstr "それもいいだろう。別に急ぎの用じゃない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, a gun store is a solid bet, but the model is common enough.  Maybe you"
" can find one in a police station, or a store with hunting gear."
msgstr "そうだな、銃器店にいけば確実だろうが、それほど珍しいモデルの銃でもない。警察署や狩猟道具を置いてる店にもあるだろうな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "レミントンはどうなった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  I'll try and get it to the buyer, if he's still alive.  If not, "
"well, still a good gun to sell.  Now, how would you like to be compensated?"
msgstr ""
"やった！買い手に届けてくるよ。まだ生きててくれたらいいんだけど。もし死んでたら、まぁ、良い銃だし他でも売れるだろう。さて、お礼は何にしようかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How did you even get this option to display the hell."
msgstr "一体どうして現物を出してくれないんだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Then where is it?"
msgstr "それはどういうことだ？"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A naked prisoner, from the isherwood faction trapped in a horrifying
#. cage, watching horrible things happen.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Barry Isherwood"
msgstr "ﾊﾞﾘｰ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Barry Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Missing member of the Isherwood family."
msgstr "行方不明になっていたイシャーウッド家の人間だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Please get me outta here…"
msgstr "幻覚じゃないよな。ここから出してくれ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've come to take you home, lets go."
msgstr "あなたを家に連れ帰りに来たんだ、行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey buddy, feel like talking about what you saw in that tower?"
msgstr "やあ友よ、あの塔で何を見たのか話してもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we need to talk about it, but I'm not ready yet.  Let me "
"reclaim my life for a while."
msgstr "ああ、話さなきゃダメだとは思うけど、まだ覚悟ができていない。失っていた人生を取り戻すまで、少し時間をもらえないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good, Barry."
msgstr "それもそうだな、バリー。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
msgstr "バリーを農園にいるエディの元へ連れて行く"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr "家に帰らせてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe you are here, please take me back to the ranch."
msgstr "ここへ来てくれるなんて夢みたいだ。農園へ連れて行ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I thought I was dead."
msgstr "ありがとう、死ぬかと思ったよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Please god no!"
msgstr "嘘だろ、頼むよ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "We shouldn't stay here too long, more might show up."
msgstr "ここに長居しないほうがいい。追手が増えるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, we'll never be able to repay you, Here's a token of my gratitude, I "
"made these suits for my family and always keep a few extra around."
msgstr "ありがとう。感謝してもしきれないよ。お礼としてこれを受け取ってくれ。家族の分を用意した時に、いくつか余分に作っておいたんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't feel saved…"
msgstr "助かったとは思えない..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell my family that I love them…"
msgstr "愛していると私の家族に伝えてくれ..."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Dairy farmer the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Carlos Isherwood"
msgstr "ｶｰﾛｽ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Carlos Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse's husband, part of the Isherwood family."
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間で、ジェシーの夫だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property."
msgstr "バッジを着けているな。ここの土地には入らず、そのまま去った方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Sir, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあお客さん、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Ma'am, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあお客さん、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm a Marshal, what are you going to do about it?"
msgstr "ああ、私は執行官だ。どうしてそんな事を言うんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, looks like you are building a forge setup."
msgstr "やあ。鍛冶場を作っているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you about a job."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックとクレアから話を聞いて、仕事について話しにきたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It is coming together.  I want to make our own tools, repair our items and "
"even create some weapons and ammunition reloading."
msgstr "計画がまとまってきたよ。工具を自作して、物の修理や、武器や手詰めの弾薬を製作したいと思っているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I heard about Barry, can you tell me what captured him?"
msgstr "バリーについて聞いたよ。彼が何に捕まったのか教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It was pink and really fast, it had lots of limbs, definitely not human.  It"
" easily kept up with us when we tried to escape, horrifying stuff.  Barry "
"just dropped to the ground, and the thing swept him away."
msgstr ""
"アレはピンク色で、とても素早く、手足がたくさん生えていて、人間じゃなかった。逃げようとしたけど、すぐ追いつかれた。恐ろしかったよ。転んだバリーは一瞬で連れ去られたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You all just gonna leave him out there to his fate?"
msgstr "バリーを連れ去られたまま放っておくつもりなのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We tracked it for a while, but lost the trail.  Right now we don't have the "
"resources to try to rescue him.  Chris has been trying to pick up the trail "
"again and figure out a rescue plan."
msgstr ""
"しばらく追跡したけど、途中で見失ったんだ。現状では、バリーを助け出す手立てがない。クリスはもう一度痕跡を探して、救出計画を立てるつもりらしいな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"The big item I need is an anvil, once I have that I can get a lot of repairs"
" done."
msgstr "一番必要なのは金床だな。一つあれば、たくさんの道具を修理できる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is hiking the perimeter of our land, planning some defense options."
msgstr "クリスは私有地の周りを歩き回って、防衛計画を立てているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is your forge operational?"
msgstr "鍛冶場は稼働しているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Chris?"
msgstr "クリスにはどこで会える？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find an anvil"
msgstr "金床を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need an anvil to do advanced metal work."
msgstr "高度な金属加工作業には金床が必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could really use an anvil."
msgstr "本当に金床が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You might be able to find one in a hardware store or similar."
msgstr "工具店などにあるだろうから、探してみてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to make it ourselves."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。自力で探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "If you can't find one, maybe you can make one for me."
msgstr "見つからないなら、自分で製作するのも手だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have the anvil?"
msgstr "金床はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will really make a difference, here's some horse armor"
" I've been working on.  Eventually I'll have the whole herd outfitted."
msgstr ""
"感謝するよ。これで状況が改善するかもね。前に作っていた馬鎧を用意したから使ってくれ。最終的には、ここの群れ全部に取り付けたいと思っているんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of the Quran"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What good does this do me?"
msgstr "そんな嘘をついて何になる？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "クリス・イシャーウッドを探す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris hasn't come back from his latest search for Barry, I'm getting "
"concerned."
msgstr "クリスがバリーを捜しに行ったきり戻って来ないんだ。心配だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you go find my son and tell him to check in with us."
msgstr "息子を見つけたら、私たちの所へ戻ってくるよう伝えてほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I hope he turns up soon."
msgstr "仕方ないな。すぐに帰ってくればいいんだが。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He might be on the property somewhere, maybe by that old cabin near the "
"entrance, sometimes he camps there."
msgstr "息子は敷地内のどこかにいるはずだ。時々入り口近くの古い小屋の傍でキャンプをしているから、今回もそこにいるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I was getting ready to go look myself.  Now that I have the anvil, "
"I've been working on new armor for the horses, take this prototype I made."
msgstr ""
"ありがとう、ちょうど探しに行こうかと思っていたところだ。金床が手に入ったから、今は新しい馬用の鎧を作っているんだ。試作品だけど、よかったら使ってみてよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Barry's fate…"
msgstr "バリーのような目に遭っていないといいんだが..."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Part of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "ｸﾘｽ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Chris Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse and Carlos' son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間で、ジェシーとカーロスの息子だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge.  You need to leave our land, my relatives have no fondness"
" for Marshals."
msgstr "バッジを着けているな。この土地から出て行った方がいい。うちの家族は執行官が嫌いなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what's up?"
msgstr "やあ、調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Hi, Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your "
"uncle."
msgstr "やあ、あなたのお父さんが探していたよ。それと、叔父さんの行方を調べているんだってな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending.  Is it tied to Barry's abduction?"
msgstr "さっきルークと話していたんだ。あなたは世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。それはバリーの誘拐と関係しているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, they are always worried about us, I prefer to survey the land and try "
"to track the changes.  I'm thinking about fixing up this cabin for some "
"peace and quiet…"
msgstr ""
"ああ、うちの両親は心配ばかりしているな。私は野外を調査して、変化を見つけるのが好きなんだ。この小屋を修理して、平和と静寂を手に入れたいと思っていてね..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are restless, why not leave?"
msgstr "家では落ち着けないような言い方だな。出て行かないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of changes have you seen?"
msgstr "どんな変化が見つかったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending."
msgstr "さっきルークと話していたんだ。あなたは世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family is convinced that if we stay here, we'll be able to weather this "
"catastrophe.  Since technology has failed, they've doubled down on older "
"traditions.  I think we need to get out there and find some answers before "
"settling on a path."
msgstr ""
"うちの家族は、家に留まっていればこの大惨事を乗り切れると確信している。最新技術が凋落したから、古い伝統に賭ける道を選んだんだ。皆で外へ出て、一つの道を選ぶ前に他の選択肢を探すべきだと思っているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"In one of my longer trips looking for Barry, I saw something out in a field."
"  I didn't get close but I swear unbelievable monsters were coming out of "
"it.  It kinda shimmered, almost like it wasn't quite there.  I've been "
"tracking those monsters for a while…"
msgstr ""
"バリーを捜索するための調査旅行をしばらく続けている時、野原で何かの集団が出てくる場所を見たんだ。まるで実体がないかのように揺らめいていた。私はしばらく怪物たちを追いかけたんだ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What did you find?"
msgstr "何があったんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"They made their way to this weird spire like structure, I've never seen "
"anything like it, it glistened in the sun like something organic.  I think "
"they could be holding Barry there, I've seen them arrive and leave with "
"other humans."
msgstr ""
"怪物たちは奇妙な構造の尖塔へ入っていった。あんなものは初めて見たよ。何か有機的な素材で作られていて、太陽に照らされ輝いていた。きっとあそこにバリーが捕まっているんだ。他の人間が連れて来られる場面も目撃したからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you join up with me, we can go check it out, I want to see what they are "
"doing."
msgstr "もし来てくれるなら、一緒に調査しよう。奴らがあそこで何をしているのか気になるからね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, wildlife is more hostile and I've seen gigantic insects around, never "
"mind all these monsters.  I've also found mysterious dead spots and mutated "
"vegetation.  I don't think staying on a farm is sustainable forever, there "
"are big planet wide changes occurring."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、野生動物は気性が荒くなって、巨大な虫も見かけたけど、それはまあいい。問題は植物が枯れた妙な区画と変異した草花だ。農場で永遠に生活を続けることは不可能だろうな。地球全体で大きな変化が起こっているようだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should leave before my family sees you."
msgstr "私の家族に見つかる前に出ていった方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your uncle."
msgstr "あなたのお父さんが探していたよ。それと、叔父さんの行方を調べているんだってな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, he said you had some interesting ideas about "
"the world ending."
msgstr "さっきルークから聞いたんだけど、世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
msgstr "奇妙な構造物からバリーを逃がす"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We need to investigate the alien encampment and try to find out what "
"happened to Barry."
msgstr "エイリアンの陣地を調査して、バリーに何が起こったのか調べたいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can take you to the structure, I tracked them to it."
msgstr "構造物の場所までは私が案内するよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Awesome, I want some answers!"
msgstr "ありがとう、謎を解明できるといいな！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, I'll keep my eye on it, maybe I'll find a way one day."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。警戒を怠らなければ、きっと私だけでもなんとかなるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I feel like we are underprepared if they see us, I marked the location for "
"you."
msgstr "奴らに見つかってしまうようでは準備不足だろう。構造物がある地点は印をつけておいた。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr "準備はいいか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's taller then I remember, we should look for prisoners.  I left a note "
"for my family before we left.  If we survive, the cabin should be fixed up "
"and ready for you to move in if you want to stay."
msgstr ""
"前に見た時より大きくなっているな。捕まっている人を捜そう。出発前に家族への手紙を書いておいた。もし生きて帰れたら、小屋の修理も終わっていることだろうし、引っ越してきてくれても構わないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well it was here…"
msgstr "ここだったかな..."

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Matriarch of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Claire Isherwood"
msgstr "ｸﾚｱ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Claire Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the matriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の女の家長だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is that a U.S. Marshal's badge you're wearing?"
msgstr "あなたが着けているのは、合衆国執行官のバッジ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, what brings you here?"
msgstr "ごきげんよう、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yes, I'm a marshal."
msgstr "ああ、私は執行官だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, nice farm you have here."
msgstr "やあ、素敵な農場だな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack suggested I stop by and say hello."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックから話を聞いて、挨拶しておこうと思ったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I live here with my husband, Jack.  He is working out in his shop."
msgstr "私は夫のジャックとここに住んでいるんだ。彼は店の方で働いているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You are lucky to have your family still together."
msgstr "家族で一緒に過ごせるなんて運の良い人だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Must be nice, to have the quiet place amid so much madness."
msgstr "溢れる狂気の中で平穏な場所を確保したいなら、少しでも良い暮らしをしないとね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You don't need as much luck if you are prepared and work together.  We've "
"had our losses, my brother in law, Barry, was our best hunter but things are"
" so different now…"
msgstr ""
"準備して共に働けば、運の良さはそれほど必要ないよ。それに、失ったものもある。義理の兄のバリーは最高の狩人だったけど、そんなことを言える状況ではなくなってしまった..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to Barry?"
msgstr "バリーに何があったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "A farm must be a pretty safe place these days."
msgstr "ここ最近は、農場はかなり安全な場所になっているはずだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, nice to meet you.  I imagine Jack was boasting about my herbal "
"remedies, he's proud of what we've put together here."
msgstr "あぁ、はじめまして。私が薬草で作った薬のことをジャックが自慢していただろう。夫は私たちがここで作り上げたものを誇りに思っているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "He did mention you make remedies, are they effective?"
msgstr "あなたは医薬品を作れると聞いたが、効果はあるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you something else…"
msgstr "他に聞きたいことがあるんだ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I have always studied and made some natural remedies, but now they are more "
"essential than ever.  Who knows the next time we'll see a trained doctor.  "
"These remedies aren't always as effective, but they can do the job in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""
"自然療法について研究や自作を続けてきたけど、今まで以上に重要になっているね。次にいつまともな医者に会えるかなんて、誰にも分からないもの。薬草で作った医薬品は必ずしも効果的とは言えないけど、ピンチの時には役に立つよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Some of their cows were killed before we realized what was happening, Barry "
"and Carlos went into the forest to find the predator but it was like nothing"
" they'd ever seen.  Carlos may be willing to tell you more."
msgstr ""
"事が起きる前に、ウシが何頭か殺されたんだ。バリーとカーロスは捕食者を探しに森に入ったけど、そこで今まで見た事もないようなものに遭遇した。カーロスに聞いてみれば、もっと詳しく話してくれるはずだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've always tried to live a quiet life out here, I suppose we are doing "
"better than most."
msgstr "私たちは今までずっとここで平穏に暮らしてきたけど、他の大抵の人よりも順調に生き延びられている気がするよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jack and I have been together for 40 years.  He's been my anchor through all"
" of this chaos."
msgstr "ジャックと私は40年間も一緒にいるんだ。この混乱の中で、彼が私の支えになっているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  They may have some jobs for"
" you."
msgstr "ジェシーとその家族は馬牧場の方に住んでいるよ。きっと手伝いが必要だろうから、聞いてみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  He's may have some jobs for you if"
" you are interested."
msgstr "道の突き当りにエディの酪農場がある。もし興味があるなら、仕事を手伝ってやってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off our land, you have no business here."
msgstr "私たちの土地から立ち去れ。お前がいるべき所ではない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr "どんどん聞いてくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your husband, is he around?"
msgstr "あなたの夫について聞きたい。ここにはいないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your daughter lives down the road?"
msgstr "あなたの娘はこの道沿いに住んでいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where is your brother's place?"
msgstr "あなたの兄弟はどこにいるんだ？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 50 dandelions"
msgstr "50個のタンポポを集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help foraging ingredients."
msgstr "食べ物を探すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could use some fresh dandelions for the next batch of wine.  Can you bring"
" me 50 dandelions?"
msgstr "次に作るワインには新鮮なタンポポを使いたいんだ。タンポポを50個集めてきてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll put these to good use."
msgstr "ありがとう、きっと役に立つよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  Maybe some other time, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない、また今度。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can find them in the fields during the spring and summer months."
msgstr "春から夏にかけて、野外で見かける花だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  Here's a small reward to show my appreciation for your help."
msgstr "ありがとう。これは感謝の証だ、もらってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder if the wildlife ate all the greens…"
msgstr "野生動物が全部食べてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
msgstr "20個の種(ビーバーム)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some seeds from the forest."
msgstr "森で見つかる種が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 20 "
"bee balm seeds?"
msgstr "次の植え付けシーズンまでに種を揃えたい。ビーバームの種を20個集めてきてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  It's important to have a good stock before the flu season hits."
msgstr "ありがとう。インフルエンザの季節が来る前にしっかり集めておかないと。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should search through the forest, make sure to check in the underbrush "
"for bee balm and then harvest its seeds."
msgstr "森の中で探すといい。ビーバームの種を採取するには、藪が生えている所を漁る必要がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Wow, perfect.  Here are some of my own remedies and if those don't work try "
"my other gift."
msgstr "わぁ、完璧だよ。自作の医薬品を用意したんだ。もし効果がなかったら、他のも試してみてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll have to find someone more at home in the forest…"
msgstr "森へ行ってくれるよう家族に頼まないと..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find and capture a cat"
msgstr "ネコを捕獲する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use a barn cat to keep the mice down."
msgstr "納屋にネコを飼えばネズミを退治できるな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I saw some feral cats out by the old cabin.  Can you capture one for me?"
msgstr "古い小屋の傍に野良猫がいるんだ。捕まえてきてくれないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Please hurry back!  Take this cage so you have a chance of "
"capturing one."
msgstr "ありがとう！なるべく急いでくれ！このケージを使えば捕獲できる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I didn't want to use chemicals on these rats."
msgstr "殺鼠剤は使いたくなかったんだけどな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Take this pet carrier; if you can get close to a cat, you can put it inside."
"  If you're having problems, try befriending it with cat food."
msgstr "ペットキャリーを使えば捕獲できる。ネコに近づけば中に入れられるはずだ。警戒しているようなら、キャットフードで仲良くなればいいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you found a cat?"
msgstr "ネコは見つかった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much, I want you to have this copy of my natural remedy "
"journal.  I'll name this handsome fellow Joshua."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。お礼に自然療法について書いた手記をどうぞ。このハンサムなお友達はジョシュアという名前にしようかな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Did you even bring back my cage?"
msgstr "何だって？！嘘でしょ！ケージだけでも返してくれない？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh no!  I guess they are too nimble for you…"
msgstr "あらら！素早すぎて難しかったかな..."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Dairy farmer of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Eddie Isherwood"
msgstr "ｴﾃﾞｨ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Eddie Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a dairy farmer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間で、酪農家だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice dairy, must be tough keeping it running."
msgstr "素晴らしい乳製品だ。生産を続けるのは大変だろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come down here and meet you."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックとクレアから聞いて、顔を見にきたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I run this dairy with my son, Luke.  It's been a tough job keeping the herd "
"together, hasn't left a lot of time for other projects."
msgstr "私は息子のルークと一緒にこの酪農場を運営しているんだ。群れをまとめるが大変で、他の仕事には中々手を付けられないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I heard about Barry, such a tragedy.  Can you tell me more about what "
"happened?"
msgstr "バリーという人が悲惨な目に遭ったそうだな。🄱何が起きたのかもっと詳しく教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Barry and Carlos went to hunt down something that killed our livestock, they"
" tracked it into the forest.  It grabbed Barry and ran off, Carlos might be "
"willing to tell you the story, he managed to allude it."
msgstr ""
"家畜を殺した何者かを追って、バリーとカーロスは森に入ったんだ。そいつはバリーを掴んで逃げ去った。カーロスならきっと詳しい話を聞かせてくれるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I could use some help getting materials.  I want to outfit that old "
"building across the road with some kilns.  We want to make our own jars and "
"pottery so we aren't dependent on scavenging."
msgstr ""
"ああ、資料の入手を手伝ってくれ。道の向かいの古い建物に窯をいくつか取り付けたくてね。自分で瓶や陶器を作って、拾い物に頼らずやっていきたいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "That is a good idea, what do you need?"
msgstr "それは良い考えだ。何が必要なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm not interested right now, I'd better get going."
msgstr "今はそんな気分じゃないんだ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke was going to start college this year, now everything is upside down.  "
"He is adaptable though, had an idea to begin manufacturing our own jars and "
"pottery.  He's out in the old outbuilding right now, cleaning up the place."
msgstr ""
"ルークは今年から大学へ行くはずだったのに、全部台無しだ。でもこの暮らしにもすぐに慣れたみたいで、瓶や陶器を自作する計画を立てているそうだよ。今は古い別棟に掃除をしに行っているんじゃないかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse manages the horses and other livestock, she is amazing with animals."
msgstr "ジェシーは馬などの家畜の世話をしている。動物が大好きなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Carlos will be in his workshop if he isn't out hunting.  He is trying to get"
" a forge set up."
msgstr "カーロスは狩りへ出かけてなければ作業場にいるんじゃないかな。鍛冶場を作る準備をしているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your son helps with the dairy?"
msgstr "あなたの息子は酪農を手伝っているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "So, Jesse runs the horse farm?"
msgstr "だから、ジェシーは馬牧場を運営しているんだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Carlos?"
msgstr "カーロスにはどこで会える？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 120 Rocks"
msgstr "120個の石を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "We need to build some kilns."
msgstr "窯をいくつか作る必要がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use 120 rocks to construct some kilns."
msgstr "窯をいくつか作るために、石を120個用意してほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can break up some larger stones, or gather them up from the fields."
msgstr "大きな岩を砕くか、野原に落ちているものを集めるといいだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to get them ourselves."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。自力で探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Mining would always be an option if you had the resources."
msgstr "可能なら、地下で石を掘るというのも選択肢のひとつではあるな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Season Of The Stones"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Do you have the stone?"
msgstr "石は手に入ったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make Luke happy."
msgstr "感謝するよ。ルークも満足するだろう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 2000 units of sand"
msgstr "2000個の砂を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help with."
msgstr "資材の収集を手伝ってほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the forge is set up, we could use 2000 units of sand to get "
"production going."
msgstr "完成した窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる2000単位の砂が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll try to find time to get it myself, thanks."
msgstr "仕方ないな。自分で集めるとするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe landscaping supplies and "
"hardware stores."
msgstr "川沿いの地面を探すか、造園用品が売っている店や工具店で見つけるといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks, now Luke can get started.  Here's a token of my thanks."
msgstr "ありがとう、これでルークも作業を始められる。これは感謝のしるしだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the sand went…"
msgstr "全ての砂がどこかに消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 100 units of clay"
msgstr "100個の粘土を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help if you have time."
msgstr "手が空いてるなら、資材の収集を手伝ってほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 100 units of clay to get "
"production going."
msgstr "完成した陶芸窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる粘土が100単位必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe look for deposits in the forest."
msgstr "川沿いの地面か、森の中で探すといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now Luke can get started making jugs, We'd like to give you a cow, "
"Here's Daisy, take good care of her and she'll provide you with milk."
msgstr "ありがとう、これでルークが水差しを作れる。感謝のしるしとして、ウシのデイジーを君に譲ろう。ちゃんと世話をすれば、ミルクを出してくれるよ。"

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_cow'
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Daisy"
msgstr "デイジー"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Patriarch of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack Isherwood"
msgstr "ｼﾞｬｯｸ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Jack Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the patriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の男の家長だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some resources."
msgstr "物資を提供するために来たんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is a lot of land, you been here since the collapse?"
msgstr "広い土地だな。崩壊以来ここで暮らしているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I live here with my wife, this is our family's land.  My daughter's family "
"and son live down the road."
msgstr "妻とここに住んでいるんだ。ここは私たち家族の土地さ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your whole family survived?"
msgstr "家族全員が生き残ったのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've had our losses… now we stay close to home, preparing for trouble.  "
"We've always taken disaster preparedness seriously, but we didn't expect "
"anything like this though."
msgstr ""
"いや、失ったものもある...今は家の近くで過ごして、トラブルに備えているんだ。私たちは常に災害への備えを真剣に考えてきたが、まさかこんな事が起こるなんて。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Even out here we've had some attacks and seen… other things.  We have been "
"working on our defenses, but it takes time.  We've been able to keep up with"
" the crops and animals though so we won't have to risk our necks for "
"supplies."
msgstr ""
"ここでも襲撃はあったし、他にも色々と...目撃した。防御を固めようとしているが、時間がかかるな。作物や動物は枯渇していないから、食料のために命を危険に晒す心配はない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of defenses do you want?"
msgstr "どのように防御を固めるつもりなんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We want to put up more fencing and build some look out spots, maybe lay some"
" traps for the monsters.  We could use some extra resources.  If you want to"
" bring me logs, sand, clay, wire, nails, wood planks, and metal chunks, I'll"
" give you signed chits you can use to buy goods from any of the family."
msgstr ""
"柵を延長して、見張り台をいくつか作りたいと思っている。それから、モンスターを嵌める罠だ。もっと資材があればいいんだが。もし丸太、砂、粘土、鉄線、釘、木材、金属片などを持ってきてくれたら、一家の誰との取り引きにも使える署名付き伝票を渡そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds reasonable, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "それはいい。何かないか探してみるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Claire and I have been together for 40 years now, couldn't run this place "
"without her.  She's quite the herbalist too, been real useful lately.  She "
"is probably in the house, you should stop in."
msgstr ""
"クレアとはもう40年も一緒にいるが、彼女なしではここの運営は立ち行かなかった。彼女は優秀な薬草医でもあるんだ。最近は本当に助かっているよ。きっと家にいるから、挨拶していくといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  Her husband, Carlos, may "
"have some jobs for you."
msgstr "ジェシーとその家族は馬牧場の方に住んでいるよ。ジェシーの夫のカーロスは手伝ってほしいことがあるそうだから、聞いてみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  It's just him and his son since "
"Barry was taken by that thing in the woods."
msgstr "エディの酪農場は道の突き当りだ。バリーが森で連れ去られてからは、エディとその息子だけが住んでいる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should get off my land, the government proved its incompetence with this"
" catastrophe."
msgstr "うちの土地から出て行け。政府はこの大災害で無能さを露呈したな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your wife, is she around?"
msgstr "あなたの妻について聞きたい。近くにいるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "素晴らしい。何を持ってきたんだ？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 10 3L jars"
msgstr "10個のガラス瓶(3L)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help scavenging."
msgstr "物資を探すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some 3 liter jars to preserve our produce.  Can you bring me 10"
" large three liter jars?  I'll give you some preserves in exchange."
msgstr "ガラス瓶を使って農作物を保存したいんだ。3Lのガラス瓶を10個持ってきてもらえないか？報酬としてジャムをあげよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve foods while we can."
msgstr "ありがとう。できる限り食料を保存しておくのは大事なことだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another way, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない。他の方法を探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr "食料雑貨店に家屋の台所、探す場所はたくさんある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wow, perfect.  Thanks.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "よし、完璧だ。ありがとう。報酬を受け取ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I wonder where all the jars went…"
msgstr "全ての瓶がどこかに消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 100 wheat seeds"
msgstr "100個の種(小麦)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some more scavenging for you."
msgstr "ちょっと物資集めを手伝ってほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 100 "
"wheat seeds?  I'll give you some fresh produce."
msgstr "次の植え付けシーズンまでに種を揃えたい。小麦の種を100個集めてきてもらえないか？報酬として取れたての食材をあげよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve healthy foods while we can."
msgstr "ありがとう。できる限り体に良い食料を保存しておくのは大事なことだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another supplier, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない。他の仕入れ先を探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the seeds went…"
msgstr "地球上から全ての小麦の種が消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Horse trainer for the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jesse Isherwood"
msgstr "ｼﾞｪｽ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Jesse Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a horse trainer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間で、馬の調教師だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Leave our property, Marshal."
msgstr "執行官、うちの土地から出て行け。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, We don't see many people these days."
msgstr "ごきげんよう、最近はあまり人を見かけないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, it looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "やあ、ここで上手くやっているようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It would be a lot harder without family.  Keeping the animals safe is "
"essential to our future."
msgstr "家族がいなければ、もっと苦労していただろう。家畜の安全を守り続けることが私たちの未来に繋がるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are betting on civilization not coming back."
msgstr "まるで今後も文明が復興しないと思っているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have any animal care tips?"
msgstr "動物を世話するコツはある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We can't wait for someone else to fix things, we need to take care of "
"ourselves."
msgstr "他の誰かが世界を正常化するまで待つことなんてできない。私たちは自力でやっていかなければ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Horses make good all around companions.  They can get places that cars can't"
" and also help when all the engines fail.  They become very trusting if you "
"feed them some nice fodder."
msgstr ""
"馬は群れで飼った方がいい。車両が入れない場所にも入れるし、エンジンが故障した時も役に立つ。いい飼料を与えれば、飼い主を信頼するようになるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh good, I'm sure Jack wanted to put you to work.  If you're interested, I "
"could use a hand clearing out the woods.  My son, Chris has his hands full "
"trying to keep the predators under control."
msgstr ""
"それは良かった、ジャックが手伝いを必要としてるだろうからな。それから、もし興味があるなら森の安全を守るために手を貸してくれ。息子のクリスが化け物を倒そうと苦労しているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to speak with Carlos too about some work."
msgstr "カーロスと仕事について話がしたいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Is Chris around?  I'd like to know what he's run into out in the woods."
msgstr "クリスはこの辺りにいるのか？彼は森で何に出くわしたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "What needs killing?"
msgstr "何を倒せばいいんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "He's out back in the workshop."
msgstr "カーロスは作業場へ戻っているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He's out doing some surveying, we are planning on adding a fence line and "
"some defenses."
msgstr "彼は土地を調査しているよ。柵や防護設備を追加する計画を立てているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off my farm, I won't deal with a government stooge."
msgstr "私の農場から立ち去った方がいい。政府の策略には乗らないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "ここで上手くやっているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you."
msgstr "ジャックとクレアから話を聞いて、会いにきたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is Chris around?"
msgstr "クリスはこの辺りにいるのか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill wolves"
msgstr "複数のオオカミを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some wolves."
msgstr "オオカミを倒すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"There's been some wolves that keep scaring our chickens and horses, I'd be "
"grateful if you can kill them."
msgstr "オオカミがいるせいでニワトリやウマが怯えているんだ。狩りを手伝ってくれたら嬉しいな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wonderful, let me know when it is done."
msgstr "良かった。終わったら教えてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we will try some traps."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。罠にかけられないか試してみるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "A gun will probably help."
msgstr "きっと銃が役に立つはずだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Did you kill it?"
msgstr "倒したか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, I've got this old saddle I want you to have.  I'll be happy"
" to put a horse under it if you want to do some more heroics."
msgstr "感謝するよ。使い古しだけど、この鞍をもらってくれ。ウマに着けて乗れば、英雄気分が味わえるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me the bodies."
msgstr "死体を見せてくれ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill monsters"
msgstr "複数のモンスターを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some monsters."
msgstr "モンスターを倒すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some help killing a pack of monsters.  I don't know what they "
"are, but they're very fast, I'm willing to outfit you with a horse if you "
"succeed."
msgstr "モンスターを倒すのを手伝ってほしいんだ。正体が何なのか分からないが、すごく素早い奴だよ。上手く倒してくれたら、ウマを譲ってあげよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Be ready for anything."
msgstr "何があっても慌てないようにな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will help keep our animals safe.  This is, Steve, he's"
" a good, steady horse.  You should talk to Carlos about some armor for him."
msgstr ""
"感謝するよ。これで動物たちも安心だ。この子はスティーブ。大人しくて賢いウマなんだ。カーロスと話せば、ウマに着ける鎧のことを聞けるんじゃないかな。"

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_horse'
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Steve"
msgstr "スティーブ"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Part of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Lisa Isherwood"
msgstr "ﾘｻ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Lisa Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, this is a nice farm, your family lives here?"
msgstr "やあ、素敵な農場だな。あなたの家族はここに住んでいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Jesse."
msgstr "やあ、ジェシーを探しているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Chris."
msgstr "やあ、クリスを探しているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family owns all the land around here, my parents are out in the barn and "
"my other family is down he road."
msgstr "私の家族はこの辺りの土地をすべて所有しているんだ。両親は納屋にいるし、他の家族は道を進んだ先にいるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ok, I'll go find them."
msgstr "分かった、探してみるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Mom is in her office, in the barn.  Be careful that you don't let our horses"
" out."
msgstr "ママは納屋の中の事務室にいるよ。出る時はウマを逃がさないよう注意してね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris is out hunting or something right now."
msgstr "クリスは今は狩りか何かをしてるんじゃないかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr "ああ、分かった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Or something?"
msgstr "狩りか何か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, bye."
msgstr "話せて良かったよ、またな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well he's supposed to be hunting, but since you've been talking to Luke, I "
"bet he mentioned Chris wants to learn more about the end of the world.  "
"Sometimes he'll take off for a few days and I end up patching him up so my "
"parents don't know he left the property."
msgstr ""
"ええと、狩りをしていることになっている。ルークと話した時、クリスが世界の崩壊についてもっと知りたがってる事は聞いたよね。クリスは時々家を数日間離れるんだけど、私はそれを両親に知られないよう取り繕っているんだ。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Dairy farmer's son in the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Luke Isherwood"
msgstr "ﾙｰｸ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Luke Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Eddie's son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の人間で、エディーの息子だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I see that badge, you should leave before my father sees you."
msgstr "バッジを着けているな。父に見つかる前に出ていった方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your dad said you were out here fixing up this place."
msgstr "あなたのお父さんから、ここを修繕していると聞いた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "やあ、ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I work on it when I have the time.  I can't leave the farm too long, "
"so I can't find some things I need."
msgstr "ああ、時間がある時に作業してるよ。農場をあまり長く空けられないから、必要な物資が中々揃わないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Must be tough having the world fall apart when you had you future to look "
"forward to."
msgstr "将来が楽しみな時期に世界が崩壊するなんて、辛かっただろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've been cleaning up this old building to make it into a workshop.  I want "
"to put up a pottery kiln and forge.  My dad doesn't want me leaving the farm"
" to find some things, says it is too dangerous."
msgstr ""
"この古い建物を綺麗にして、作業場にしたんだよ。陶器を作る窯と炉を置きたいと思ってる。父は私が外の世界を見るために農場を出て行くのを良く思っていない。危険すぎるって言うんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I know all the grown ups worry about us, but I think we can adapt better "
"than them in the long run.  Chris has some interesting thoughts on the "
"matter."
msgstr "大人は私たちの事を心配するもの、それは分かってるよ。でも長期的に見たら、私たちは大人よりもこの世界に順応できると思うんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of ideas does Chris have?"
msgstr "クリスはどう思っているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Things have been tough for my dad since Barry was captured.  He works till "
"he falls asleep most nights.."
msgstr "バリーが連れ去られてからは、父も大変そうだ。父は夜寝る時間まで働きづめなんだ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is a little older than me, he's up at the horse farm with his parents "
"and sister, Lisa."
msgstr "クリスは私より少し年上で、両親と妹のリサと一緒に馬牧場で暮らしてるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he doesn't agree that what we're doing here will last.  He thinks "
"things will only get worse.  It's tough to get the adults to listen though, "
"much less agree with his solution.  You can go talk to him more about it if "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"ええと、彼はここでの生活が長くは続かないと思っている。これから先も状況は悪くなる一方だってさ。大人にはこの意見は聞き入れてもらえないよ。クリスの解決策には賛成できないんだって。詳しく聞きたかったら本人と話してみればいいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "You won't find any help here."
msgstr "ここでは何の助けも借りられないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your dad."
msgstr "あなたの父について聞きたい。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
msgstr "本(学習/硝子吹き製法)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get the glass blowing started."
msgstr "硝子吹きを始めるには、もっと知識が必要だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use a book on glass blowing.  With the internet gone, I don't"
" have any handy references."
msgstr "硝子吹きに関する本を何とかして読みたいんだ。インターネットがなくなったから、便利な参考資料も見られなくなってしまった。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fantastic, I'm not supposed to leave our land."
msgstr "素晴らしい。私は自分の土地を離れたくないからね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well, figured I'd have to do a lot of practice anyway."
msgstr "仕方がない。とにかく練習を重ねて学ぶしかないな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore or a glass blower's studio should have one."
msgstr "図書館、書店、硝子吹きの工房などを探すといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the book?"
msgstr "本は見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make my life so much easier."
msgstr "感謝するよ。これで格段に生活が楽になる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't see a book…?"
msgstr "本はどこ...？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "At least you escaped with your life…"
msgstr "少なくとも生きて帰って来られたな..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
msgstr "本(学習/日曜大工全書)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get better pottery."
msgstr "更に高品質な陶器を作るには、もっと知識が必要だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use the book, DIY Compendium.  With the internet gone, I "
"don't have any handy references."
msgstr "「日曜大工全書」という本を何とかして読みたいんだ。インターネットがなくなったから、便利な参考資料も見られなくなってしまった。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore should have one, schools are another good idea."
msgstr "図書館や書店を探してもいいし、学校にもあるかもな。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#. ~ A naked prisoner trapped in a horrifying cage, watching horrible things
#. happen.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "prisoner"
msgstr "囚人"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "gatekeeper"
msgstr "看守"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "leader of prisoners"
msgstr "囚人リーダー"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Skills intentionally kept low.  This character should probably have a
#. higher chance of having insanity type traits eventually.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Prisoner"
msgstr "囚人"

#. ~ Job description of "Prisoner" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I'm here to kick ass."
msgstr "ここで滅茶苦茶カマしてやるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Ok, sorry, I'm already leaving!"
msgstr "分かった、ごめん、もう行くよ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "おい、<fuck_you>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"おい、誰だこいつは？知らない奴だ。ああ、クソッ、別に構わねぇ。\n"
"ここでのルール。まず一番重要なこと。お前がケツを向けてる、そこの出入口を常に閉じておけ！理解できたな、じゃあ次のルールだ。一つ、仲間を怒らせるな。一つ、仲間から盗むな。一つ、理由もなく仲間と喧嘩をするな。ひよっ子、分かったか？分かったら、失せな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Yeah, I got it.  See ya."
msgstr "ああ、分かった。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I just wanted to ask if you have a job for me."
msgstr "何か私にできる仕事がないか、聞きたかっただけなんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I'm just hungry, and I thought you might give me some food for some job."
msgstr "腹が減ったから、何か仕事を手伝って食べ物をもらおうと思ったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Can we just talk it over?"
msgstr "ちょっと話をしないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Do I have a <swear> exclamation sign over my <swear> head, like I'm a "
"<swear> quest-giver from some <swear> video game?"
msgstr "<swear>、<swear>、テレビゲームのNPCみたいに、ビックリマークが頭上に浮かんで見えたのかい？<swear>、<swear>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "No, of course not!  Sorry, I'm leaving."
msgstr "いや、そんなことはない！悪かった、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your <swear>"
" problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  <get_lost>"
msgstr ""
"お前はつんぼか、それともバカなのか？<swear>、さっき怒らせるなと言ったのに、ふざけた話を持ち掛けてくるとはな。今後同じことを言ってみろ、後悔することになるぞ。<get_lost>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Ok, sorry, I promise I won't bother you anymore."
msgstr "ああ、悪かった。今後は面倒を掛けたりしないようにする。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "おいおい、<name_b>、自分が不死身だとでも思ってるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Gee, what's the matter with you?  Okay, okay, I'm leaving."
msgstr "えーと、何か気に障ったかな？分かった分かった、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "It would be you who will regret talking to me like that."
msgstr "そんな口の聞き方をしていると、後悔することになる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Not so fast, I think you need to pay for breaking your promise and bothering"
" me.  Give me your shit, now!"
msgstr "おっと、ルールを破って怒らせたんだから、お前には罪を償ってもらう。ふざけやがって！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Please don't hurt me!  Take all that you want."
msgstr "止めてくれ！何でも好きなものを持っていって構わないから。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "What, <no>!"
msgstr "なにっ、<no>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I have nothing more to say to you.  <get_lost>"
msgstr "これ以上言うことは何もない。<get_lost>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "So, what are you waiting for?"
msgstr "それで、何が望みだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I don't know if you know, but there are sewers underneath the prison.  I was"
" planning an escape long before <the_cataclysm>, and while I was working on "
"cleaning the sewers, I noticed a damaged wall section.  There was a flow of "
"fresh air coming out of it, so I think it's leading to the surface.  It "
"could be your way to freedom.  Feel free to use it."
msgstr ""
"既に知ってるかもしれんが、刑務所の地下には下水道が通っている。<the_cataclysm>以前に脱走計画を立てていたんだが、下水道の掃除をしている時に、壁の一部が割れていることに気付いたんだ。ヒビから新鮮な空気が流れてきたから、あの隙間はきっと水上のどこかに繋がっている。もしかしたら自由への道になるかもしれない。使ってみたらどうだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "You are what you eat, as they say."
msgstr "お前の肉体はお前の食べたもので作られる、ってことわざがあるそうだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "It's you again."
msgstr "またお前か。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hello there.  Haven't seen you around before.  You must be from the other "
"wing.  Managed to survive, huh?"
msgstr "よお。初めて見る顔だ。もう片方の棟から来たんだな。お互い、何とか生き延びたな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Yeah, I've been through situations far worse than that."
msgstr "ああ、あなたが予想している以上に酷い状況だったよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"It was a nightmare, lots of <zombies>, blood everywhere!  Thank god I'm "
"among living people again."
msgstr "たくさんの<zombies>、あたりに血が飛び散って、まさに悪夢だ！また生きている人間に出会えたことを神に感謝している。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"[Cannibal] It's hard to die of hunger when there's so many tasty corpses "
"lying around."
msgstr "[食人嗜好] 辺り一面に美味しそうな肉が転がっていたから、餓死することはなかったよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I want to get out of this <swear> prison.  I hoped you could help me with "
"that."
msgstr "<swear>、この刑務所から脱出したい。助けが必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I'm on my way."
msgstr "まだ道半ばだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I don't know if I'll take your advice, but thanks nevertheless."
msgstr "上手くいくか分からないが、教えてくれてありがとう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Wait, what?  A <swear> can of beans?!  I went through hell to get this "
"<swear> thing for you, and all you give me as reward is a <swear> can of "
"beans?!  I demand something more substantial."
msgstr ""
"ちょ、ちょっと？<swear>、缶入りの豆だって！？地獄のような場所を通り抜けてわざわざ持ってきてやったのに、<swear>、報酬がただの豆なのか！？<swear>、もっとマシなものがあるだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Nice talking to ya.  Farewell."
msgstr "話せてよかったよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Huh, even so?  I'm not saying I approve your… tastes, but I definitely "
"respect people who use all possibilities life has to offer."
msgstr "ハハ、マジか？その...他人の飯の好みをとやかく言うつもりはないが、ある意味人の役に立てたんだから、そいつらにとっても良かったのかもな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Yeah, we share the same opinions on this matter."
msgstr "ああ、私も同意見だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Well, that's a boastful statement.  Not that I don't believe it, it's just…."
"  Ah, nevermind.  Let's get to the point.  What do you want?"
msgstr "おい、自慢話かよ。別に見くびってるわけじゃなくて、ただ...いや、そんなことはいい。本題に入ろう。何が望みだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hold the horses, pal.  Nobody allowed you to stay here - yet."
msgstr "まあ落ち着けって。まだここに居て良いとは一言も言ってない...まだ、な。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Please!  I don't want to go back there!  I'm tired and hungry!  I just need "
"time to rest!"
msgstr "頼む！もうあそこへ戻りたくない！疲れているし、腹も減った！休ませてほしいんだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Shit!  Looks like I'm on my own now.  Thanks for nothing.  Bye."
msgstr "ちぇっ！人の手は借りないよ。無駄な時間をありがとう。じゃあな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"We don't have much space, and there's not much food.  Besides, I don't know "
"you at all, and something tells me you won't survive another day."
msgstr "場所も狭いし、食べ物も少ないのはお互い様だ。その上、お前の身の上も分からない。しかも、なんだか生き残れなさそうなツラだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "[STR 11] I'm tougher than it seems!"
msgstr "[筋力 11] 私は見た目以上に強いぞ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "[Survival 2] I have some survival expertise!"
msgstr "[サバイバル 2] サバイバルの専門知識があるんだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I guess I need to find some other place…"
msgstr "他の場所を探すことにするよ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"The answer is still no.  In fact it might be better for us to kill you right"
" away - you know, the less mouths to feed, the better.  But I'm in a good "
"mood today, so I've decided to help you get out of this island."
msgstr ""
"答えは、まだノーだ。実際、お前を殺す方が楽なんだよ。知っての通り、餌をねだる口は少ない方が助かるからな。だが、今日は機嫌がいいんだ。この島から脱出するのを手伝ってやってもいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Ok, I'm listening."
msgstr "分かった、話を聞こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "You know, I think I'll manage without your help.  Bye."
msgstr "そんなに言うなら、助けなんか要らないよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I need you to retrieve some stuff from a locked safe.  Interested?"
msgstr "カギのかかった金庫の中身が必要なんだ。興味はあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "[Show the military id card] You mean this stuff?"
msgstr "[IDカード(軍)所持] これが欲しいんだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "What's in the safe?"
msgstr "金庫の中身は何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "What for do you need it?"
msgstr "何のためにそんなことをするんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I have a bad feeling about this.  Sorry, I'll pass."
msgstr "いやな予感がする。悪いけど、止めておくよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"As I said, that's the thing I need.  You don't need to know what's that "
"exactly.  Just grab all things you find in the safe, and call it a day."
msgstr "さっき言った通り、必要なものだ。それが何かは、知らなくていい。金庫の中に入っていたものをすべて渡したら、それで仕事は完了だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "That's weird."
msgstr "妙な話だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Let's say that's none of your <swear> business.  Other questions?"
msgstr "<swear>、余計な詮索はするな。他に質問は？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hey, where did you get it?  Nevermind, just give it to me.  Just <swear> "
"now."
msgstr "おい、どこで手に入れた？いや、そんな事よりそれを寄越せ。<swear>、今すぐだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, no need to be hostile.  Here you go, I don't need it anyway."
msgstr "なあ、そんなにカリカリすることはない。ほらどうぞ、もう私には必要ない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I went through incredible hardships to get it.  Please, can I keep this to "
"myself?"
msgstr "これを手に入れるために死ぬほど苦労したんだ。簡単には渡せないよ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I killed tons of <zombies> while I was trying to get this thing.  Do you "
"really think you and your handful of losers pose a threat to me?"
msgstr "これを手に入れるために数えきれない程の<zombies>を倒してきたんだ。お前らみたいな負け犬共が、私に勝てると思っているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Okay.  It was convincing.  I'll still get what I want, one way or another.  "
"You better watch your back from now on."
msgstr "分かった。その言い分はもっともだ。何とかして、自力で手に入れることにしよう。背後にはくれぐれも気をつけろよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Noted.  Bye."
msgstr "覚えておこう。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you're not in the position to demand anything from me, <name_b>."
"  <get_lost>"
msgstr "お前が何かを要求できる立場にいると思ったら大間違いだ、<name_b>。<get_lost>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!  You'll regret that!"
msgstr "おい、<fuck_you>！後悔することになるぞ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Okay, fine.  Cheapskate!"
msgstr "そうか、分かったよ。ケチ！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
msgstr "所長室でアイテムを入手する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Here's the job…"
msgstr "さあ仕事だ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"My snitch whispered in my ear that the thing I need is located in the "
"chief's safe in his office.  You need to crack it open and bring the "
"contents to me.  Don't try to use anything you find in there!  Just bring "
"all the stuff to me, and I'll help you.  Deal?"
msgstr ""
"必要な物資が所長室の金庫に入ってると、タレコミがあったんだ。何とかして金庫を開いて、持ってきてくれ。勝手に使ったりするなよ！全部渡してくれたら、手を貸してやる。どうだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Don't forget that I need all stuff from the safe, try not to lose a "
"thing."
msgstr "よし！金庫に入ってるものは全部必要なんだ。失くしたりするなよな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Fine, I'll get the thing in any case, sooner or later."
msgstr "いいさ、一人でも、何とか上手くやってやる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"The chief's office is on the other side of the prison.  I think the road "
"there is full of <zombies>, so you better find a weapon.  Also you probably "
"will need some tools to crack the safe open."
msgstr ""
"所長室は監獄区域の反対側にある。道中は<zombies>だらけだろうから、武器はあった方がいい。それから、金庫を開ける道具類も用意しておけ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Did you get the stuff already?"
msgstr "もう手に入ったのか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"At last!  Give me a few moments to check if it isn't damaged.  Here, take "
"this for your troubles."
msgstr "待っていた！破損していないか確認させろ。ほら、トラブルに備えてこれを持っていけ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Huh.  This isn't going to work like I thought."
msgstr "ううん。思っていたほど上手くは行かないようだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get The Thing from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "You're useless.  I should've killed you when I met you."
msgstr "役立たずめ。最初に会ったときに殺しておくべきだった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Hiya darlin', welcome to the shop."
msgstr "あら、うちの工房にいらっしゃい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Hey, killer!  How's it going?"
msgstr "ようこそ！調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "You look like you haven't eaten in days."
msgstr "何日も食べてないような顔ね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Still the apocalypse out there, huh?"
msgstr "終末はいつまで続くのかしら？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "See anything you like?"
msgstr "気に入った品はあった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "About that contract…"
msgstr "その仕事について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "What's with all the weapons and armor?"
msgstr "この武器や防具はどうやって手に入れたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Are you and Jay close?"
msgstr "ジェイとは仲がいいのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "[Motion to the sketches.] What is it that you are working on?"
msgstr "[スケッチに目をやる] これは何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[Motion to the sketches.] You seem more excited about this stuff recently."
msgstr "[スケッチに目をやる] ここ最近、色々なアイデアが浮かんでいるようだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "I'd like to know more about some of your 'special' projects."
msgstr "「スペシャルプロジェクト」についてもっと知りたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[Show the nomad jumpsuit blueprint.] Hey - I met a group with some "
"interesting ideas for armor design.  Is any of this of use to you?"
msgstr "[本(学習/ノマドジャンプスーツ型紙)を見せる] 面白い防具の設計アイデアを見せてもらったんだ。何かの役に立たないだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "[100 merch] I'd like to become a member of the co-op."
msgstr "[100 ﾏｰﾁ] 私も組合に加入したい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "About those contracts…"
msgstr "いくつかの仕事について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Why do you hate merch?"
msgstr "どうしてマーチを毛嫌いしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Could you make me a suit of armor?"
msgstr "防具を作ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "How is my armor coming?"
msgstr "防具はできあがった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You mentioned you'd need some special materials to make that nomad armor?"
msgstr "ノマドアーマーを作るには、特別な素材が必要だと言っていたな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "I heard you might want some metal…"
msgstr "金属が必要だと聞いたんだけど..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I'm Cody, was an engineer before everything went to hell.  I guess I still "
"am, but I don't have to consult anymore, so I consider that a plus at least."
msgstr ""
"私はコディ。世界が地獄になる以前はエンジニアだったの。今もエンジニアだけど、コンサルタント業をする必要がなくなったから、少なくとも仕事は順調ね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I don't know if you've met Jay yet, but he and I split a garden out here.  "
"We both work - well, worked - in technology, and we were convinced the world"
" was ending so we both got property outside town.  We met when he moved in "
"next door.  So this is our little homestead with a few upgrades.  We aren't "
"really sweating property lines at this point."
msgstr ""
"ジェイにはもう会ったかしら。あの人とは庭を共有して使ってるの。二人とも、いわゆる技術関係の仕事をしていて、以前から世界がめちゃくちゃになる予感があったから、郊外に土地を買っていたのよ。うちの隣に引っ越してきたのが、あの人だったってわけ。ここは住みやすく改造した小さなお屋敷。今は土地の境界線も気にしなくていいから楽なものよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I make them myself!  I've always loved traditional armaments and am a proud "
"member of the SCA!  Figured now that everything has gone to hell I can make "
"it a full-time thing.  Lots of survivors in need of a big ol' hammer or some"
" armored guards to keep the biters off."
msgstr ""
"自分で作ったのよ！昔から古い武具が好きで、SCAにも所属していたんですから！今は世界中が地獄になってしまっているから、いつでも甲冑バトルが開催できる、って思ったわけ。特大サイズのハンマーや、噛みつき攻撃を防ぐ甲冑が必要な生存者は大勢いるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "It must take some serious equipment to make all this."
msgstr "これだけのものを作るには、相当の機材が必要だろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well, what can I say, I had lots of disposable income.  Kept me busy and all"
" that.  So yeah, I've got a pretty impressive shop in the back."
msgstr "それはね、収入が沢山あったのよ。忙しく働いていたもの。それに、裏手は立派な工房になっているの。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[INT 8+] Still this is a lot of equipment.  Wouldn't it have been easier to "
"buy this stuff from a manufacturer?"
msgstr "[知性 8] それにしたって作業は大変だろう。既製品を買った方が早いのでは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Can anyone use the workshop?"
msgstr "工房の機材を使わせてもらうことはできる？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Honey, I have a hard time finding a bra that fits.  Good luck finding a "
"breastplate."
msgstr "あら、フィットするブラジャーすら探すのが大変なのに。ぴったり合うキュイラスが運よく見つかるといいわね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Tell me about it, finding anything that fits in this apocalypse has been a "
"nightmare."
msgstr "確かにそうだ、この状況で自分のサイズに合う防具を探し回るなんて考えたくないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Oh, uh.  Right, uh."
msgstr "ああ、うーん。そういうものか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well, not *anyone*, but I've always been a believer in community.  The shop "
"is run as a co-op, so if you want access you'll have to buy a share.  As a "
"partial owner, you will have full access to the shop.  Shares are currently "
"100 merch; I hate the currency but it's the closest thing we've got to a "
"representation of labor."
msgstr ""
"*誰でも*使えるわけじゃないけど、仲間同士の助け合いは大事にしてるつもりよ。工房は組合として運営しているから、機材を使いたいなら組合員資格を買ってもらうことになるわね。組合員は特典として、工房内を自由に使えるようになるの。今は資格を100マーチで売ってるわ。この通貨は嫌いだけど、労働力の対価として一番使いやすいから仕方ないわね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "[100 merch] Yeah, I can do that."
msgstr "[100 ﾏｰﾁ] ああ、支払うよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"There yah go, one co-op membership with your name on it.  Shop's in the "
"back, keep it tidy and share if anyone else is around workin'.  Just as a "
"heads-up, you'll need to bring your own charcoal.  There's a kiln in there "
"too, so if you got things to burn, just throw 'em in there there and light "
"up."
msgstr ""
"はい、あなたの名前入りの会員証をどうぞ。奥の工房は散らかさないで、装置は譲り合って使ってね。一つ気をつけてほしいのだけれど、炭は各自で用意してもらってるわ。窯も置いてあるから、燃やしたいものがあれば好きに放り込んで火をおこしてちょうだい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Money is part of what got us into this mess in the first place."
msgstr "そもそも、世界がこんなに混乱した原因の一つが、お金なのよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "[PER 8+] Is that why you don't carry any cash?"
msgstr "[感覚 8] だから現金を持ち歩かないようにしているの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "B-I-N-G-O.  If you bring it, I'll take it, but that's about it."
msgstr "そのとおり。貰えるなら貰いますけどね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, we've always got along great.  He comes over for supper every Friday."
"  Have a few drinks, maybe take some guns out.  Or, well… we used to.  A "
"little while ago, we had a huge fight.  It was right after this stuff got "
"real bad… I'm fuzzy on the details or what I said, all I remember was being "
"so angry that I could kill him.  We haven't talked much since."
msgstr ""
"そうね、仲良しよ。金曜になるとうちへ夕飯を食べに来るの。お酒を飲んだり...銃を見せてくれたり...以前はそうだったのだけれど...実は少し前に大喧嘩をしてしまってね。世界の状況が深刻になってきた頃だったかしら、喧嘩の原因も何を言ったかも忘れちゃったけど、彼を殺してしまいそうなくらい怒ったのは確かよ。それ以来、あまり話をしていないのよね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Have you apologized?"
msgstr "彼に謝った？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do?"
msgstr "私にできることはないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It just seemed like it wouldn't be enough.  I know it's silly but I have to "
"do more than that."
msgstr "なんだか、謝るだけじゃダメな気がしてるの。馬鹿げてるとは思うのだけど、もっと誠意を見せたくて。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"If you're offering.  Before everything went to hell, Jay was talking about "
"going to some gun show.  There was a guy there who had managed to sneak some"
" Russian gun into the US.  It was a massive deal for Jay, it was all he "
"could talk about.  I know it's a long shot, but maybe that guy was already "
"at the gun show?  If you find the gun you can keep it, but it would mean a "
"lot to Jay if he could take a look.  All he wanted was to pull it apart and "
"put it back together."
msgstr ""
"頼まれてくれるかしら。世界が崩壊する以前、ジェイは銃の展示会に行くって話をしていたの。そこでロシアの銃がこっそり出品されるって情報がジェイにとっては大事件だったみたいで、その話ばっかりしていたわ。望みは薄いけど、その出品者は展示会に来られたのかしら？もしその銃を見つけてくれたら、ジェイに見せてあげられるのに。彼は銃を分解して組み立て直したいだけだから、その後であなたが引き取ってくれて構わないわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "I'll bring you back a souvenir."
msgstr "きっと持って帰ってくるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Not really interested."
msgstr "あまり気分が乗らないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh, these.  With the end of the world, Jay and I had been talking about some"
" new projects for the wasteland warriors.  Anyways it doesn't matter anymore"
" since, well it doesn't matter."
msgstr ""
"ああ、これね。世界が終わったものだから、ジェイと二人で荒野の戦士たちを助ける新しいプロジェクトを考えたことがあるの。でも、もういいのよ、そんなものは。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "I'm sure we'll fix things soon!"
msgstr "きっと上手くいくと思うよ！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Sure, honey!  I'm always in need of more material!  What's the price, "
"though?"
msgstr "ええ、そうなの！素材はいつでも歓迎するわ！でも、お値段は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Well, how about 100 merch for every 70 pounds of metal…"
msgstr "それなら、100マーチで金属70ポンドの..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, I don't really have the time to work on something like that.  I've "
"got lots of pieces for sale on the shelves."
msgstr "ごめんなさい、中々時間が取れなくてね。商品なら棚にたくさん揃っているのだけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some"
" money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What "
"level of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits "
"depending on how much you want to resemble a tank.  Materials costs are 100 "
"merch per 2mm.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the chain and "
"leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""
"あなたにはお世話になったから、喜んで防具を用意させてもらうわ。でも、隊商やスカベンジャーと交渉するためには資金が必要なのよ。防御力はどの程度必要かしら？戦車みたいになりたいなら、2mm、4mm、6mmの厚さの鎧を作れるわ。材料費は2mmにつき100マーチ。鎖とか革とか、採寸が要らないところで節約した分、大量の金属を集めるのにたくさんお金が必要なの。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Forget it."
msgstr "気にしないで。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[100 merch, 2mm] I like to stay light."
msgstr "[100 ﾏｰﾁ] 身軽な2mm厚の鎧がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[200 merch, 4mm] A middle ground would be good."
msgstr "[200 ﾏｰﾁ] 間を取って4mm厚の鎧がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[300 merch, 6mm] Never skimp on protection."
msgstr "[300 ﾏｰﾁ] とにかく頑丈な6mm厚の鎧がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm, so the next "
"question is time.  Currently, it's the classic problem: if you want quality,"
" you gotta wait.  Two processes I could offer that you would be hard-pressed"
" to find anywhere else are either really great high carbon steel, or I can "
"go through the lengthy process of tempering.  High carbon will take three "
"weeks to process and do the work, and tempering will take me four.  For five"
" I could, I think, create a suit of that nomad armor.  It would incorporate "
"climate control, help you support more weight, and it'll have a jumpsuit "
"built in, but you won't be able to wear normal clothes with it."
msgstr ""
"厚さは<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mmね、分かったわ。さて、次の問題は時間よ。高品質を求めると時間がかかる、典型的な悩みよね。私以外には中々作れない鎧はいくつかあるの。品質の高い高炭素鋼を使った強靭な鎧と、長い時間をかけて焼き戻し加工を施した更に強靭な鎧。高炭素鋼の鎧は完成までに3週間、焼き戻し加工の鎧は4週間かかるわ。それから、5週間待ってもらえるなら、ノマドアーマーが作れるわね。体温調節ができて、身体のバランスも崩れにくいの。普通の服に重ねては着られないけど、内側はジャンプスーツになっているわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm, so the next "
"question is time.  Currently, it's the classic problem: if you want quality,"
" you gotta wait.  Two processes I could offer that you would be hard-pressed"
" to find anywhere else are either really great high carbon steel, or I can "
"go through the lengthy process of tempering.  High carbon will take three "
"weeks to process and do the work, and tempering will take me four."
msgstr ""
"厚さは<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mmね、分かったわ。さて、次の問題は時間よ。高品質を求めると時間がかかる、典型的な悩みよね。私以外には中々作れない2種類の鎧があるの。品質の高い高炭素鋼を使った強靭な鎧と、長い時間をかけて焼き戻し加工を施した更に強靭な鎧。高炭素鋼の鎧は完成までに3週間、焼き戻し加工の鎧は4週間かかるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[3 weeks, great protection] High carbon steel sounds great."
msgstr "[3週間] 強靭な高炭素鋼の鎧にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[4 weeks, exceptional protection] I'll wait for the best you can do."
msgstr "[4週間] 更に強靭な焼き戻し炭素鋼の鎧にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[5 weeks, CBM-integrated protection] I'd like nomad armor."
msgstr "[5週間] ノマドアーマーにしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor "
"made of the best high carbon steel a woman can scavenge.  If you're good "
"with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very "
"invasive measurements."
msgstr ""
"厚さ<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>ｍｍの、品質の高い素材で作った最高の鎧ね。問題なければ、早速マーチで支払ってくださるかしら。鎧がぴったり合うように細かく採寸しましょう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor "
"made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen.  "
"If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start "
"taking some very invasive measurements."
msgstr ""
"厚さ<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>ｍｍの、貴重な加工技術で作った最高の鎧ね。問題なければ、早速マーチで支払ってくださるかしら。鎧がぴったり合うように細かく採寸しましょう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor "
"made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen, "
"as well as help from some extradimensional friends.  I'd be lying if I said "
"I wasn't excited.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front "
"and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."
msgstr ""
"厚さ<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>ｍｍの、世界最高の技術と次元の彼方にいるお友達の助けを借りて作る鎧ね。ワクワクせずにはいられないわ。問題なければ、早速マーチで支払ってくださるかしら。鎧がぴったり合うように細かく採寸しましょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"[100 merch] Sounds good.  See you in <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>"
" weeks."
msgstr "[100 ﾏｰﾁ] いいね、<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"[200 merch] Sounds good.  See you in <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>"
" weeks."
msgstr "[200 ﾏｰﾁ] いいね、<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"[300 merch] Sounds good.  See you in <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>"
" weeks."
msgstr "[300 ﾏｰﾁ] いいね、<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait>週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"It's all done!  Sorry for the long wait; hopefully it's worth it.  If you "
"need it refitted, let me know."
msgstr "出来たわ！長らくお待たせしてごめんなさいね。もしもう一度採寸してほしい時は教えてね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "Still working on it."
msgstr "まだ作業中よ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "See you when it's done."
msgstr "完成した頃にまた来るよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Oh wow, this is really interesting, huh?  The way they balance weight for "
"travel is genius.  If you wanted a real suit of armor for a traveling "
"warrior, I think I could do it with this.  I'll need one of each of these "
"wire kits, though, for each set I make.  Bring some to me if you want me to "
"use them."
msgstr ""
"あらまあ、これは本当に面白いわね。激しい動きでも荷重バランスが崩れない、天才的な作りだわ。これを参考にすれば、放浪戦士のための本格的な鎧が作れそう。でも、CBMの配線キットと外付けの体温制御装置を一着につき一つずつ使うのね。もし作ってほしいなら、これらを用立ててもらえると助かるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"I have some right now.  [Hand over a CBM interface wire kit and an external "
"climate control kit.]"
msgstr "[CBMインターフェース配線キット、外付け体温制御装置を渡す] ちょうど手元にある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "I'll try and find some."
msgstr "必要な材料を探してみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Yeah; the designs you showed me call for 'em.  Not sure what they are "
"myself, but the pictures are real descriptive about how to use them.  To "
"make anything, I'll need one of each of those wire kits.  Got any?"
msgstr ""
"ええ。あなたが見せてくれた型紙には、そう記されているわね。詳しくは分からないけど、図面で仕組みが説明されているの。完成させるには、CBMの配線キットと外付けの体温制御装置が1つずつ必要になるわ。心当たりはない？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Here you go.  [Hand over a CBM interface wire kit and an external climate "
"control kit.]"
msgstr "[CBMインターフェース配線キット、外付け体温制御装置を渡す] はい、どうぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "今すぐには用意できないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, sugar!  If you ever have me make some armor, just let me know if you"
" want me to use these in it."
msgstr "まあ、ありがとう！もし私に鎧作りを頼むことがあったら、その時はこのアーマーも作ってあげられると思うわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"Oh, these.  With the end of the world, Jay and I had been talking about some"
" new projects for the wasteland warriors.  Anyways, it doesn't matter "
"anymore since… well, it doesn't matter."
msgstr ""
"ああ、これね。世界が崩壊したものだから、ジェイと二人で荒野の戦士たちを助ける新しいプロジェクトを考えたことがあるの...でも、もういいのよ、そんなものは。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"Yeah!  I feel a lot better now that Jay and I are talking again, and we've "
"been putting some serious work into this stuff.  If you wanted to help "
"source parts and do some testing, we could definitely get some prototypes "
"made."
msgstr ""
"そうなのよ！またジェイと話せてすっきりしたことだし、このプロジェクトにも本腰を入れる気になったの。あなたがパーツの調達や動作テストを手伝ってくれたら、きっと試作品を完成させられるわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"I'm already working on something for you.  I only got two hands and 24 hours"
" in a day."
msgstr "今はあなたに頼まれた別の作業を進めているわ。私の手は二本しかないし、一日は24時間しかないのよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "I'm still working on it, can't rush perfection."
msgstr "完成までもう少しかかるわ。焦らないで。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Sure, what would you like to know more about?"
msgstr "ええ、何について詳しく知りたいの？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Can you work on one of these projects for me?"
msgstr "プロジェクトを一つ進めてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Motion to the picture of some kind of rifle.] What's the 'OBREZ'?"
msgstr "[ライフル銃のようなものの図面] この「オブレズ」というのは何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Is the Obrez finished?"
msgstr "オブレズは完成した？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Motion to the picture of a switchblade.] What's the 'PRESSIN'?"
msgstr "[折り畳みナイフの図面] この「プレッシン」というのは何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Is the Pressin finished?"
msgstr "プレッシンは完成した？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"[Motion to the picture of a mace styled with fire on the head.] What's the "
"'LOUVERTURE'?"
msgstr "[火がついたメイスの図面] この「ルヴェルテュール」というのは何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Is the Louverture finished?"
msgstr "ルヴェルテュールは完成した？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"[Motion to the picture of a sledge hammer with a piston jutting from one "
"face of the head.] What's the 'DISORDER'?"
msgstr "[ピストン付きスレッジハンマーの図面] この「ディスオーダー」というのは何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "Is the Disorder finished?"
msgstr "ディスオーダーは完成した？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The Obrez is a classic Mosin-Nagant that someone has cut down and removed "
"the stock of.  The idea was that in some parts of the world a surplus rifle "
"was easier than finding a pistol to conceal.  Way I see it, a sturdy classic"
" gun like that with a bit of reinforcement could make a great mace.  You "
"find me a functioning Mosin - any variant will do - and 50 merch for parts, "
"and I can get this one working in a week."
msgstr ""
"モシン・ナガンという名銃を切り詰めて、銃床も取り払ってしまったものがオブレズよ。ピストルを隠し持つより、余っているライフルを使う方が楽だって考える人が多い地域もあるみたいね。そこで、こういう頑丈な歴史ある銃は、少し補強してあげれば素晴らしい鈍器にもなるんじゃないかって考えたの。どのモデルでもいいから、壊れていないモシン・ナガン、それから部品代として50マーチを用意してもらえるかしら。一週間で完成させてみせるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Mosin-Nagant M44, 50 merch] See you in a week."
msgstr "[ライフル(7.62x54mmR/ﾓｼﾝ･ﾅｶﾞﾝM44)、50 ﾏｰﾁ] 一週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Mosin-Nagant 1891/30, 50 merch] See you in a week."
msgstr "[ライフル(7.62x54mmR/ﾓｼﾝ･ﾅｶﾞﾝM1891-30)、50 ﾏｰﾁ] 一週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
msgid "What about another project?"
msgstr "他のプロジェクトはどうなった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
msgid "I want to talk about something else."
msgstr "他の話がしたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
msgid "I'll check in later."
msgstr "また今度見に来るよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The gun is done, looking pretty sleek if you ask me.  All loaded and ready "
"to cave in a zombie."
msgstr "銃ができたわ。見た目もかなりスマートね。全弾装填済みだから、今すぐゾンビをばらばらにできるわよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The Pressin was a self defense weapon for politicians in Spain.  It was a "
"small breach loaded handheld pistol that could fit in a glasses case and be "
"fired subtly.  I figure that we can improve on the design by adding a "
"retracting blade while keeping the surprise shots.  To get this working I'm "
"gonna need a .32 gun like a SIG Sauer P230, Kel-Tec P-32, or a Walther PPK."
"  I'll also need a switchblade, 20 merch, and a week."
msgstr ""
"プレッシンというのは、スペインで政治家が使っていた護身用銃器よ。メガネケースに隠し持って悟られないように撃てる、後装式の携帯ピストルね。この銃の不意打ちしやすさはそのままに、折り畳みナイフを内蔵できないかって考えたの。実現したいならSIG"
" P230かケルテックP-32、ワルサーPPKのどれかと、折り畳みナイフ、それから20マーチを用意してちょうだい。一週間で完成できるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[P230, switchblade, 20 merch] See you in a week."
msgstr "[ハンドガン(.32口径/SIG P230)、折り畳みナイフ、20 ﾏｰﾁ] 一週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[PPK, switchblade, 20 merch] See you in a week."
msgstr "[ハンドガン(.32口径/ﾜﾙｻｰPPK)、折り畳みナイフ、20 ﾏｰﾁ] 一週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[P-32, switchblade, 20 merch] See you in a week."
msgstr "[ハンドガン(.32口径/ｹﾙﾃｯｸP-32)、折り畳みナイフ、20 ﾏｰﾁ] 一週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The gun's done.  Mind the safety on the side, this guy is pretty dangerous."
msgstr "銃が完成したわ。安全装置は側面に付いているから、扱いに気をつけてね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"Oh, that's one of my sillier ideas.  Jay is convinced it'll never work but I"
" really want to give it a shot.  A traditional mace with gas-venting ports "
"and an ignition system for mini bursts of fire.  Maybe I've just played too "
"many RPGs, but it seems worth a shot.  To get this one working I'm gonna "
"need a real deal mace -  something that can handle the pressure - as well as"
" a military grade flamethrower.  Fabrication will definitely take two weeks "
"on this one."
msgstr ""
"ああ、それはジョークじみたアイデアの一つね。ジェイは上手くいくわけがないって言ってるけど、どうしても試してみたいのよ。古風なメイスにガソリン噴出口と点火装置を内蔵した武器よ。RPGのやりすぎかもしれないけど、やってみる価値はあると思うの。実現したいなら、衝撃に耐えられるちゃんとしたメイスと、軍用の火炎放射器を用意してもらえるかしら。二週間で完成させてみせるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Mace, flamethrower] See you in 2 weeks."
msgstr "[メイス、火炎放射器] 二週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The mace is done.  It honestly works pretty great too.  Hope you get some "
"good use out of it."
msgstr "メイスの改造が終わったわ。率直に言って、かなりの上出来よ。上手く使いこなせるといいのだけれど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The Disorder is already kind of a real thing.  I got the idea from a viral "
"video I saw of a guy making something similar with a baseball bat for "
"hitting home runs.  Takes a sledge hammer with a center mounted piston that "
"you can arm with .22 caliber blanks.  When you hit a zombie with that sweet "
"spot… boom.  The blank goes off and sends the piston straight down into "
"whatever poor fucker you hit it with.  I'll need a sledge hammer, 80 merch, "
"and at least 20 .22 LR rounds.  Fabrication will definitely take two weeks "
"on this one."
msgstr ""
"ディスオーダーは、既に実在していると言ってもいいわね。野球でホームランを打つためにバットを改造する動画が流行っていて、それでこの武器を思い付いたの。スレッジハンマーの打面に内蔵したピストンを、.22口径の空包で稼働させる仕組みになっているの。ゾンビにクリーンヒットすれば...パーン！発射された空包がピストンを押し出して、可哀そうな敵に突き刺すというわけよ。実現するには、スレッジハンマーと80マーチ、それから少なくとも20発の.22口径LR弾が必要ね。二週間で完成させるわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid "[Sledge hammer, 80 merch, 20 .22 LR] See you in 2 weeks."
msgstr "[スレッジハンマー、80 ﾏｰﾁ、弾薬(.22口径/LR) x 20] 二週間後が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The beast is done!  Really heavy-duty, but really packs a punch.  Be careful"
" with your fingers.  I'm serious, this thing could tear 'em off."
msgstr "すごいものが出来ちゃったわ！ものすごく重くて、ものすごくパワフルよ。指がちぎれないよう、くれぐれも気をつけて。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
msgid "engineering notes"
msgid_plural "engineering notes"
msgstr[0] "技術メモ"

#. ~ Description of "engineering notes"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with pencil.  There are "
"two peoples handwriting."
msgstr "鉛筆で何度も書き直されたスケッチやCAD図面です。2人分の筆跡があります。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You hit the nail on the head.  You bring me bullets - 5.56, 7.62, 5.45, or "
".300 - and I'll convert between 'em.  I take a 10% cut, just so you know."
msgstr ""
"まさにその通り。5.56mm、7.62mm、5.45mm、.300口径の弾薬だったら、別の口径に両替えしてやるよ。その代わり、弾薬の10％は手数料として俺がいただく。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Can we do that now?"
msgstr "今すぐ両替えしてもらえるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ""
"Yup, what would you like to convert?  As a reminder, I do 5.56, 7.62, 5.45, "
"or .300.  You want anything else, we can just trade 'em directly over the "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"おうよ、何発両替えする？対応できる弾薬は5.56mm、7.62mm、5.45mm、.300口径の4種類だ。それ以外だったら、普通の取り引きで対応するぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Nothing for now."
msgstr "今は持ち合わせがないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Let's see what you have in stock right now."
msgstr "今から物資の取り引きをしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "[1 day] 200 rounds."
msgstr "[1日] 200発。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "[5 days] 800 rounds."
msgstr "[5日] 800発。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Alright, 200 rounds.  First off, what are you looking to give me?"
msgstr "よっしゃ、200発だな。どの口径を渡してくれるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Alright, 800 rounds.  First off, what are you looking to give me?"
msgstr "よっしゃ、800発だな。どの口径を渡してくれるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "5.56x45."
msgstr "5.56x45mm弾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "7.62x51"
msgstr "7.62x51mm弾"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "7.62x51."
msgstr "7.62x51mm弾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "7.62x39."
msgstr "7.62x39mm弾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "5.45x39."
msgstr "5.45x39mm弾。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ".300 AAC."
msgstr ".300口径AAC弾。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sure, 5.56x45 to what?"
msgstr "よし、5.56x45mm弾を何に替える？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sure, 7.62x51 to what?"
msgstr "よし、7.62x51mm弾を何に替える？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sure, 7.62x39 to what?"
msgstr "よし、7.62x39mm弾を何に替える？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sure, 5.45x39 to what?"
msgstr "よし、5.45x39mm弾を何に替える？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sure, 300 BLK to what?"
msgstr "よし、.300口径弾を何に替える？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ""
"If you are seeing this I am bugged and confused.  You should report this "
"fact on the GitHub."
msgstr "このメッセージが表示されたなら、俺はバグって混乱してるってことだ。GitHubで報告してくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alright, that's 200 rounds minus the 10% service fee.  They'll be converted "
"in a day."
msgstr "オーケー、200発からサービス料10%差し引くぞ。1日経ったらまた来てくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alright, that's 800 rounds minus the 10% service fee.  They'll be converted "
"in 5 days."
msgstr "オーケー、800発からサービス料10%差し引くぞ。5日後また来てくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "See you then."
msgstr "また後で。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "There's something else I'd like to talk about."
msgstr "他に話したいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Sorry, it isn't ready yet."
msgstr "失礼、用意してからまた来るよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "The transaction is complete, here are your items."
msgstr "取り引き完了だ、注文の品を持っていきな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "[Take your new ammo.] Thanks."
msgstr "[弾薬を受け取る] ありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the first American bank of munitions.  We convert your goods and "
"services to the new gold standard."
msgstr "アメリカ発の弾薬銀行へようこそ。金本位制に代わる新たな通貨で品物やサービスを取り引きするんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "What's your deal?"
msgstr "どうやって？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Munitions?"
msgstr "弾薬銀行？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Hey.  Cody wanted to say that she's sorry.  She thought that you would want "
"to see this."
msgstr "そうそう、コディがあなたに謝っていた。あなたがこれを見たがるだろうともね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm interested in helping with that thing for Cody."
msgstr "コディの手伝いに興味がある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "How are my rounds coming?"
msgstr "弾薬はできあがった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "I'd like to exchange some rounds."
msgstr "弾薬を交換したい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Are you and Cody close?"
msgstr "コディとは仲がいいのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Fuck yeah.  New currency is death and I'm dealing it."
msgstr "ファック、その通り。新たな通貨は死だ。死を取り扱う銀行さ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "I understand, but how does this work exactly?"
msgstr "なるほど、具体的な仕組みはどうなっている？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Pretty simple stuff, bud.  I barter in pre-shitshow ammo, and to stimulate "
"the growing economy, I print and issue more.  I take your goods - Cody would"
" call it labor - and exchange it for the new universal currency.  If you "
"want to convert currency I'm happy to facilitate, but it'll take a few days "
"and there is a service charge."
msgstr ""
"簡単なことさ。世界がクソ塗れになる以前の弾薬を取り引きして、経済成長を刺激するために、更に生産し、発行するんだ。あんたの弾薬、コディ流に言えば労働力だな、それを使い道が広い口径の新しい弾薬と交換するのさ。もし両替えしたい弾薬があるなら、喜んで請け負うよ。ただし完了までに数日かかるし、サービス料は引かせてもらう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "So you're really going all in on this bank thing?"
msgstr "本気で銀行を運営するつもりなのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "So you'll exchange bullets for other bullets directly?"
msgstr "つまり、口径の違う弾薬を交換する商売か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "I did a boring IT job and prepped for this shit.  Look at me now."
msgstr "仕組みはくだらねぇIT系の仕事で予習済みさ。今まさに上手くいってりゃ問題ない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Look at you now."
msgstr "上手くいってるならいいんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It's my house.  Cody's in the other building, if you've met her.  We dug a "
"trench and set up some milspec turrets.  I programmed them, Cody armored "
"them.  Now we're just trying to get by.  This ain't the wizard of Oz, you "
"can look behind the curtain over there."
msgstr ""
"俺の家だ。それともう会ったか知らんが、隣はコディの家だ。庭に塹壕を掘って、軍用タレットを設置してる。俺がプログラミングして、コディが装甲を取り付けた。今、俺らは生きていくために必死で頑張ってる。オズの国じゃあるまいし、カーテンの裏を覗いてみたいもんだね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "Where'd you get half a dozen milspec turrets?"
msgstr "こんなに大量の軍用タレットを、どこで手に入れたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"*stares off into the distance.  \"The owners didn't need them anymore.  Not "
"anymore…\""
msgstr "*は遠くを見つめている。「前の持ち主には必要なさそうだったからな..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Stuff is fucked all over, bud.  How about we stick to talking business?"
msgstr "そんな話やめやめ、商売の話をしようぜ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Where did you… I- I don't know what to say.\"  Jay takes the rifle reverently.  He turns it over so carefully that you could mistake him for holding a child instead of a gun.  \"This thing is is beautiful.  Modern rails, ergonomic furniture, recoil balancing system.  I know Cody thinks that she did something wrong, but all I remember is being so angry… just blindingly furious.  Then I was running.  When I woke up everything, was fine.\"\n"
"\n"
"Jay hands back the Kord.  \"Thank you for letting me see this, and for getting Cody and I talking.  If you could help me out with something for Cody, I'll hook you up with a casket mag for that thing and a box of the good ammo.  Stuff from my reserves."
msgstr ""
"これは...な、なんて言えばいいんだ。 [ジェイはライフルを恭しく受け取り、銃ではなく子供でも抱いているかのように、丁寧に扱っている] 現代的なレール、人間工学に基づいた部品、バランスドリコイルシステム、本当に美しい銃だ。コディは何か悪いことをしたと思ってるみたいだが、俺が覚えてるのは、とにかく腹が立って...ひたすら怒鳴って、さっさと家に帰ったことだけさ。やっと目が覚めて、万事解決って訳だ。」\n"
"\n"
"[ジェイは銃を返した] 「銃を見せてくれて、そしてコディと話すきっかけをくれて、感謝してるよ。もし、またコディの助けになる仕事をしてくれたら、複々列弾倉と高性能の弾薬を譲ろう。とっておきのやつだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Alright, so Cody has talked about some cutting-edge tech she's seen "
"displayed.  This thing is called a nano-fabricator.  It's like a "
"complicated, robotic 3D printer.  Cody used to run with some hackers that "
"steal IP, schematics, that sort of thing.  I guess a problem they were "
"running into was the newest tech stuff is all encrypted as templates for "
"these printers.  Well, I know of a colleague who went home with debug "
"software for the system.  You get that for her, and we're in business."
msgstr ""
"さて、以前コディから、ある最先端技術の話を聞いた。ナノ加工装置って名前の、ややこしい3Dプリンタみたいなものだ。コディは昔、知財や設計図を盗むハッカーと組んでたんだ。この最新技術のテンプレートは全部暗号化された状態になってたもんで、盗み取ることができなかったんだろうな。俺の知り合いにそういう暗号の複合化ソフトを持ってる奴がいる。それを彼女に渡す、それが今回の依頼だよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
msgid "I'll see if I can find it."
msgstr "探してみよう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Find the gun"
msgstr "銃を探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Cody wants you to go to a gun show and find a rare gun that Jay wanted to "
"see.  It was an AK of some kind with a weird name… something like CARD or "
"CORE."
msgstr ""
"銃の展示会でコディが見たがっていた珍しい銃を探してほしいと、コディに頼まれました。形状はAKに似ており、CARD、あるいはCOREのような妙な名前が付いていたそうです。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Before everything went to hell Jay was talking about going to some gun show."
"  There was a guy there who had managed to sneak some Russian gun into the "
"US.  It was a massive deal for Jay, it was all he could talk about.  I know "
"it's a long shot but maybe that guy was already at the gun show?  If you "
"find the gun you can keep it, but it would mean a lot to Jay if he could "
"take a look all he wanted was to pull it apart and put it back together."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊する以前、ジェイは銃の展示会に行くって話をしていたの。そこでロシアの銃がこっそり出品されるって情報がジェイにとっては大事件だったみたいで、その話ばっかりしていたわ。望みは薄いけど、その出品者は展示会に来られたのかしら？もしその銃を見つけてくれたら、ジェイに見せてあげられるのに。彼は銃を分解して組み立て直したいだけだから、その後であなたが引き取ってくれて構わないわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll start working on an apology."
msgstr "ありがとう。さて、謝礼の品を準備しておかないと。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "気が変わったら教えてね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd be careful there; Jay was saying they were bringing some new autonomous "
"hardware to the show.  You're looking for a Russian rifle that should be "
"modded to the moon.  CARD, CORE rifle, something like that."
msgstr ""
"展示会には新型の自律式ロボットも持ち込まれるとジェイが言っていたから、気を付けて。見つけてほしいのは、色々な改造が施されたロシアのライフル銃よ。確か、CARD、いえ、COREだったかしら、そんな名前だった気がするわ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Any luck finding that gun show?  I think it was a Russian gun, maybe a CARD "
"or CORE rifle?  Something like that."
msgstr "銃の展示会場はどうだった？ロシアのライフルで、CARD、いえ、CORE？確かそんな名前よ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, darlin'.  If you could show it to Jay, that would mean a lot to me."
"  If there's anything I could ever make for you as payment after that, just "
"let me know."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。ジェイに見せてあげて。きっと喜ぶわ。もし今後お礼として私にできることがあれば、遠慮せず言ってね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "That's great!  Make sure to show it to Jay."
msgstr "すごいわ！早くジェイに見せてあげて。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Well you tried at least…"
msgstr "少なくとも、努力はしたのね..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Find the debug software"
msgstr "デバッグソフトを見つける"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"Jay wants you to go to someone's house and get some software that they had "
"taken home."
msgstr "知り合いの家にある複合化ソフトを持ってきてほしいと、ジェイに頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd be careful.  Guy was a bit of a nut, I don't know what he was planning "
"to do with that software."
msgstr "あんなソフトで何をするつもりだったんだろうな。その知り合いはちょっと変な奴だから、一応気を付けて行け。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Any luck finding that USB?"
msgstr "ソフトが入ったUSBメモリは見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Thanks bud, I'll take it from here.  Enjoy those bullets."
msgstr "助かった、ここから先は俺の仕事だ。射撃を楽しんでくれよな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Shame.  Shame, shame."
msgstr "恥知らずが。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
msgid "Well fuck me then."
msgstr "最悪だ。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ A blacksmith for the faction.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "Cody Miller"
msgstr "ｺﾃﾞｨ ﾐﾗｰ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ A blacksmith for the faction.
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "鍛冶屋"

#. ~ Job description of "Cody Miller" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "A blacksmith who wants everyone to get along."
msgstr "皆で協力したいと考えている鍛冶屋です。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A gunsmith for the faction.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "Jay Ruckers"
msgstr "ｼﾞｪｲ ﾗｯｶｰｽﾞ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A gunsmith for the faction.
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "Banker"
msgstr "銀行家"

#. ~ Job description of "Jay Ruckers" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_npcs.json
msgid "A gunsmith looking to become the new central bank."
msgstr "新たな中央銀行の創設を目指す銃器職人だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"We've still got a few things available, but that last order is gonna take us"
" a while to restock.  Come back in a little while if you're looking for the "
"big stuff.  The crew is fast, so it won't be long.  A few hours at most, I "
"promise."
msgstr ""
"在庫は少し残ってるが、最近も注文があったから、再入荷にはしばらくかかる。大量に必要なら、少し時間をおいてまた来てくれ。うちの作業員は仕事が早いから、せいぜい数時間も経てば在庫は戻るよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Sure, we offer various specialty cuts direct to our customers in batches of "
"10.  Anything larger than these planks is gonna take us a while to refresh, "
"though.  A couple hours, maybe longer if we have to source more wood.  So, "
"what would you like?"
msgstr ""
"喜んで。10枚単位で、様々なカットを施した木材をその場でお客に渡せるよ。大きな板材なんかは加工に数時間は掛かるし、木が足らない時は更に待ってもらうこともある。さて、ご注文は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some sticks."
msgstr "[10$] 棒を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[20$]  I'll buy some long sticks."
msgstr "[20$]  長棒を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[30$]  I'll buy some planks."
msgstr "[30$]  木材を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[100$]  I'll buy some logs."
msgstr "[100$]  丸太を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[120$]  I'll buy some wooden panels."
msgstr "[120$]  合板を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[240$]  I'll buy some large wooden sheets."
msgstr "[240$]  大型合板を買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "[350$]  I'll buy some wooden beams."
msgstr "[350$]  大型角材を買いたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
msgid "Is there anything else you want?"
msgstr "他にご注文は？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you, <name_g>."
msgstr "やあどうも。会えて嬉しいよ、<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "A stranger out here?  Who are you?"
msgstr "よそ者か？誰だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "さよなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "何がお望み？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "How do things work around here now?"
msgstr "この辺りはどんな状況だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nah, see ya."
msgstr "いや、さよなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"You mean you're still looking for wood?  Crazy… but we had a suspicion folks"
" might show up in an emergency.  Talk to the manager if you want to make an "
"order."
msgstr "まだ薪を探している人間がいるもんだな？イカレてる...でも、緊急時に客が集まるとは思っていたよ。注文したいなら、ボスに言ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, the machinery works just fine.  We were always self-sufficient and "
"<the_cataclysm> only really made that more apparent.  So if you want to "
"place an order and help keep the operation running, talk to the manager.  "
"We'll trade you for our wood."
msgstr ""
"うーん、少なくともここの機械類はちゃんと動いてる。元々自給自足みたいな暮らしだったけど、<the_cataclysm>でそれが分かりやすくなっただけさ。もし何か買いたいとか、ここの運営を手伝いたいとかで用があるなら、ボスに言ってみな。木材の取り引きなら歓迎してるから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might"
" call 'em."
msgstr ""
"大した話じゃない。<the_cataclysm>以前は、木こりとして働いていた。世界が地獄に落ちたときは、丁度仕事をしていて、同僚とここに籠もる羽目になった。ありがたいことに皆無事だったから、ボスは製材所を操業し続けることにしたんだ。でも、いつまでもつか分からない。他の人間が来ないとどうしようもないからな。客あっての商売さ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm a logger here.  Seasonal work but good pay… or it was, at least.  "
"Before that first <zombie> showed up and made it clear how bad things were "
"really getting."
msgstr ""
"ああ、私はここで木こりをしている。季節労働だけど、給料は良い...いや、良かった、だな。高給取りだったのも、最初に<zombie>が表れて事態の酷さが分かる前の話さ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"I'm a lumberjack out here.  Things were quiet for a long time.  We're pretty"
" far out in the woods so it was kind of a shock to find out just how bad "
"it'd gotten in civilization.  We had a couple close run-ins ourselves.  My "
"friend over there almost got eaten!  But we still have resources that I'm "
"sure people can use."
msgstr ""
"私はここで木こりをやっている。長いこと静かな日々が続いていたのにな。森の中で長く過ごしてたから、文明世界の酷い状況を知って、酷くショックを覚えたよ。化け物にも何度か遭遇したし、あっちの同僚なんて、もう少しで食われるところだったんだ。ここには使える資源があるから、どんどん使ってもらいたいね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"My comrades and I were lucky to be in the right place at the right time, I "
"suppose.  We keep really busy out here, so we didn't expect <the_cataclysm> "
"to land right in our lap like that.  Luckily these axes can chop more than "
"wood.  They'll take a good chunk out of anything nasty that threatens our "
"mill."
msgstr ""
"私も同僚も、丁度いいタイミングで丁度いい場所にいたと思わずにいられない。ここの仕事は本当に忙しいから、まさかこんな形で<the_cataclysm>が訪れるなんて思っても見なかった。幸いなことに、この斧は木より硬いものも切れる。うちの工場を襲う厄介者だって、一発で倒せるさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I work here.  Welcome to the mill.  Used to be trucks in and out of "
"here all the time but you're the first face we've seen in a while."
msgstr "ええと、ここで働いているんだ。製材所へようこそ。以前はよくトラックが出入りしていたんだけど、お客さんを見るのは久々だな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> "
"nearly killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"自分はまだ新人で...いや、今更どうでもいいか。今でも時々、木を切り倒したり、丸太を製材したりしている。だから、木こりと名乗って間違いないだろうね。<zombies>が襲い掛かってくるようになって、事態がますますおかしくなってると感じるよ。一体いつまで続くんだ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "Hope it goes well."
msgstr "これからもお元気で。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you again."
msgstr "やあどうも。また会えて嬉しいね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "A new face at the mill?  Who might you be?"
msgstr "製材所では見ない顔だな？誰だい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Can I purchase some of your wares?"
msgstr "資材を購入できるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid ""
"I'm the manager here at the mill.  It's a tight-knit crew, unionized "
"operation.  When <the_cataclysm> broke out, we didn't even know about it "
"till some <zombies> wandered onto the yard.  Now, we've just held up here.  "
"I imagine any folks left out there might be needing our machinery and skills"
" to keep civilization alive.  Might make new customers yet."
msgstr ""
"私はこの製材所の所長だよ。ここの従業員は団結力が自慢なんだ。<the_cataclysm>が始まったなんて、<zombies>が敷地内に迷い込むまで気付きもしなかった。今は、皆でここに留まっている。文明を維持するために、ここの機械や技術が必要になるかもしれないからね。それに、顧客を増やせる可能性もある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "ふむ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "logger"
msgstr "作業員"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "manager"
msgstr "所長"

#. ~ Job description of "Lumberjack" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "I felled trees before the apocalypse.  Zombies shouldn't be as tough."
msgstr "大変動以前は木を伐採して暮らしていた。ゾンビは木より柔らかいね。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find Drive Belts"
msgstr "駆動ベルトを見つける"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 3 drive belts in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "製材所作業員のために、3個の駆動ベルトを入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need three drive belts."
msgstr "駆動ベルトが3つ必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Some of our machinery received some damage before <the_cataclysm> and we "
"were waiting on replacement parts.  Now everything's changed and those parts"
" are more important than ever.  Get us three drive belts and I'll give you "
"some credit with us."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>以前に壊れてしまって部品の交換待ちだった機械がいくつかあるんだ。今の状況じゃ、部品は今まで以上に重要だ。駆動ベルトを3つ調達してきてくれたら、少しは信用してもいいかな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 75 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder Wire"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Someone's got to do it."
msgstr "他の誰かに頼むことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find actual drive belts on engines, a good replacement can be "
"made from a belt and some duct tape.  Nothing difficult."
msgstr "もし、エンジンに使われてるような駆動ベルトが見つからなくても、ベルトとガムテープで代用品を自作できる。それほど難しくはないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the belts?"
msgstr "駆動ベルトはあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  Thanks, <name_g>, we'll be fine for a long while from now."
msgstr "素晴らしい！ありがとう、<name_g>、これでしばらくは大丈夫だろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 75 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder Wire"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "どこにあるんだ？実物を見なければ信じないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to do it."
msgstr "それは残念だ。他の誰かに頼むしかないな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 1,000 Nails"
msgstr "1000個の釘を入手する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 1,000 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "製材所作業員のために、1000個の釘を入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 1,000 nails."
msgstr "釘が1000本必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Along with those drive belts, we were waiting for some nails for structural "
"repairs.  Due to <the_cataclysm>, we obviously never received them.  So, I "
"need you to get us 1,000 nails.  We'll pay you fairly."
msgstr ""
"駆動ベルトの他に、建物を補修するための釘も必要なんだ。<the_cataclysm>のせいで、注文しても届かない。釘を1000本調達してもらえないか。もちろん、謝礼はするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Taking apart some furniture in town should get what you need."
msgstr "街で家具を分解すれば、手に入るはずだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the nails?"
msgstr "釘は持ってきたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our warehouse was about to fall apart.  These will be extremely helpful to "
"us."
msgstr "倉庫が崩壊寸前だったんだ。本当に助かるよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 6,800 Nails"
msgstr "6800個の釘を入手する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6,800 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "製材所作業員のために、6800個の釘を入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6,800 nails."
msgstr "釘が6800本必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While fairly sturdy, the metal fence around this place won't hold out for "
"long.  So, we've decided to replace it with a wall.  However, the nails we "
"had were used to repair our existing structures, and they weren't nearly "
"enough.  After some calculations, we need 6,800 nails to do it.  That may "
"seem like a lot, but we're willing to give you a TON of credit for it."
msgstr ""
"この辺りのフェンスはかなり頑丈だけど、それでも長持ちはしない。そこで、壁を巡らせることにした。釘の大半は今ある建物を修復するのに使ってしまったから、在庫が全然足りないんだ。計算してみたところ、壁を作るのに6800本の釘が必要になる。大変かもしれないけど、ぜひ力を貸してもらえないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Well, I suppose that's reasonable."
msgstr "まあ、そう言う気持ちも分かるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"You might have to do more than just scrapping a bunch of furniture.  "
"Dismantling a building somewhere in town could get you what you need."
msgstr "家具をたくさん分解するだけじゃ足りないかもね。街の建物を丸ごと解体すれば、揃えられそうだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's absolutely amazing!  I can't thank you enough for this!"
msgstr "本当にすごい！感謝してもしきれないよ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "You're a fucking scammer, <name_b>!"
msgstr "<name_b>、詐欺師め！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find 6 Blankets"
msgstr "6枚のブランケットを探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6 blankets or quilts in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "製材所作業員のために、6個のブランケットを入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6 blankets."
msgstr "ブランケットが6枚必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we should be safe from harm, I decided to start adding a few things"
" to this place.  Right now, we don't have anywhere to comfortably sleep, so "
"we're building a small sleeping quarter.  We just need 6 big, warm blankets "
"or quilts to finish our project."
msgstr ""
"ひとまず安全は確保できているようだから、この場所を更に快適にしようと思うんだ。そこで、ゆっくりと眠れる小さな寝床を作ることにした。あとは、大きくて暖かいブランケットかキルトケットでもあれば最高なんだけどなぁ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I figure any hotel or motel in town should have lots of blankets."
msgstr "街のホテルやモーテルには、ブランケットがたくさんあるだろうな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Did you find us some bedding yet?"
msgstr "寝具を探してきてくれた？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks!  Feel free to sleep here if you want.  It's the least we can do for "
"the help."
msgstr "ありがとう！よかったら、寝床を好きに使っていってよ。少しでも恩を返したい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "How is this supposed to help us?"
msgstr "それで、どこにあるんだ？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the loggers and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "避難センターと取り引きの契約を締結し、契約書を製材所に持ち帰りましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While some of us were out scavenging, we spotted an old evac shelter that "
"looks like it might have some people inside.  I want you to go over there, "
"find whoever runs the joint, and see if we can make a deal with them for "
"some processed lumber.  This will be invaluable to our survival."
msgstr ""
"何人かで辺りを探索しているときに、避難所を見つけたんだ。どうやら中には人もいたらしい。その避難所の責任者を探し出して、加工木材の取り引きができないか交渉してもらえないだろうか。これは私たちの生存がかかった、とても重要な話なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Please give it a try?  This is really important to us."
msgstr "試してみるだけでも無理だろうか？本当に重要なことなんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "What did they say about the deal?"
msgstr "取り引きの件は、どうだった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  We're set for life on this one!"
msgstr "ありがとう！これで一生安泰だ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "How does this help us?"
msgstr "それで、どうすればいいんだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to trade with."
msgstr "それは残念だ。他の取り引き相手を探すことにしよう。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former miner, poor fellow succumbed to spiral madness.
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "miner"
msgstr "鉱山作業員"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "鉱山作業員"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "どうも！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "もう行くよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid ""
"Poor fellow - looks like you're out of your mind.  Can't help you, sorry.  "
"I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "可哀そうに...頭がおかしくなっているようだ。申し訳ないけど、助けることはできない。もう行くよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr "失礼、今なんて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Why are you repeating 'spirals' over and over again?"
msgstr "どうして「うずまき」としか言わないんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Are you nuts?"
msgstr "バカじゃないの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't talk now."
msgstr "悪いが、今は話せない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
msgid "Stay safe out there."
msgstr "気をつけて帰れよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
msgid "Welcome to camp Arabella"
msgstr "アラベラ駐屯地へようこそ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
msgid "I'm supposed to direct all questions to my leadership."
msgstr "質問はすべて上官を通すことになっている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
msgid "If you're looking to trade you'll need to talk to the quartermaster."
msgstr "取り引きがしたいなら、補給係に聞くといい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_Soldier_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Don't mind me…"
msgstr "お構いなく..."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Generic guard for the old guard.
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "Duhring"
msgstr "ﾄﾞｩﾘﾝｸﾞ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ Generic guard for the old guard.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "Officer"
msgstr "将校"

#. ~ Job description of "Officer" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "I'm an officer for FOB Arabella"
msgstr "私はアラベラ前方作戦基地の将校だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any use for you right now.  You will be informed if I need you,"
" soldier."
msgstr "今はお前に用はない。兵士よ、また必要になれば知らせよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "Can you tell me about yourself?"
msgstr "あなた自身のことを教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "If it wasn't clear, you are dismissed soldier."
msgstr "おや、お前はもう除隊した奴だったかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "I am clearly busy, soldier."
msgstr "兵士よ、私は忙しいのだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "Can I just ask you some questions?"
msgstr "いくつか質問してもいい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "Go. Away."
msgstr "早く、行け。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
msgid "If I have to tell you one more time so help me god…"
msgstr "もう一度言っておこうか。幸運を、さようなら..."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Generic guard for the old guard.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_pilot.json
msgid "Pilot"
msgstr "操縦士"

#. ~ Job description of "Pilot" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_pilot.json
msgid "I'm a pilot."
msgstr "私はパイロットだ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Old guard quatermaster
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "Quartermaster"
msgstr "補給係"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "Welcome to camp Arabella, What will it be?"
msgstr "アラベラ駐屯地へようこそ、何か用？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid ""
"I'm the camp quartermaster.  Come and see me if you have anything valuable "
"to trade."
msgstr "私はここの補給係だ。何か貴重な物資を持ってるなら、歓迎するよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "If you're looking to trade you've come to the right place."
msgstr "取り引きがしたいのなら、ここへ来て正解だったな。"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "pizzaiolo"
msgstr "ピッツァ職人"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "I got the cake.  Shall we move, <name_g>?"
msgstr "ケーキを用意できた。<name_g>、そろそろ行こうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "If you still want to travel with me, let's go."
msgstr "これからも共に旅をしたいなら、一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Lead the way, <name_g>."
msgstr "先導してくれ、<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Are we there yet, my <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、もう着いたのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "We're here, <name_g>.  Let's celebrate."
msgstr "着いたよ、<name_g>。さあお祝いだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Be patient.  We'll be there soon, <name_g>"
msgstr "すぐに着く。<name_g>、もう少しの辛抱だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Ah, home sweet home.  It feels like I haven't been here for ages.  <swear>, "
"it looks so horrible now.  I guess it's because of <the_cataclysm>.  Thank "
"you for bringing me here, <name_g>.  Let's eat the cake."
msgstr ""
"ああ、愛すべき我が家。何年も離れていた気がするな。<swear>、酷い状態だ。これも<the_cataclysm>のせいだろうな。ここまで連れてきてくれてありがとう、<name_g>。さあ、ケーキを食べよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "[*NOM-NOM*]"
msgstr "[*むしゃむしゃ*]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Mmm, delicious.  You know, you are good friend, and a good cook.  I'm glad "
"that I'm with you at the day like this.  Say, what do you think about me "
"going with you?  As you can see, my restaurant is thrashes, my house ruined,"
" the only option left is to travel somewhere, and it's better if I do it "
"with someone."
msgstr ""
"うーん、美味しい。君は本当に大事な友達で、しかも腕のいい料理人だ。こんな時だけど会えてよかったよ。ものは相談だけど、これからも一緒に旅を続けるってのはどうだろう？知っての通り、レストランはグチャグチャだし、自宅も荒れ放題、もうどこか他の場所へ行くしかない。なら、誰かと一緒の方がきっと上手くいくように思うんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Sure, <name_g>.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "<name_g>、喜んで。<end_talking>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather was"
" a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some american <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!"
msgstr ""
"私は何の変哲もないピッツァ職人だ。父もピッツァ職人、祖父もピッツァ職人、だから当然、私もそうなった。一生ピッツァを作って暮らす筈だったのに、アメリカ人の<name_b>共が仕事を台無しにしたんだ！私にはどうすることもできなかったが、<the_cataclysm>と<zombies>で大変なことになっている今こそ、復讐のチャンスだ！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Angry pizzaiolo"
msgstr "怒れるピッツァ職人"

#. ~ Description of mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Find some gasoline and then travel to the destination together with "
"pizzaiolo."
msgstr "ガソリンを調達し、ピッツァ職人と一緒に目的地まで移動しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I'm so <swear> angry!  I have an enemy that ruined my life, and I want "
"revenge for it!  I don't care about <the_cataclysm>, I just want to burn his"
" <swear> restaurant!  Will you help me?"
msgstr ""
"<swear>、本当に腹が立つ！私の人生を台無しにした奴に復讐してやる！<the_cataclysm>なんてどうでもいい、<swear>、とにかく奴のレストランを焼き尽くしてやりたい！君、手伝ってくれないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Good.  Let's go to his restaurant and <swear> burn it!  Oh, by the way, "
"could you bring gasoline with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to "
"bring it with me…"
msgstr ""
"よし。<swear>、奴のレストランへ向かい、火をつけよう！そうだ、<name_g>、ガソリンを用意してもらえないか？頭に血が上って、持ってくるのをすっかり忘れていたよ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "What?!  Why do you… ah, forget it."
msgstr "何だって！？一体どうして...いや、忘れてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet revenge!  It smells so nice!  His restaurant burns, his legacy "
"is now ruined!  Even if he became a <zombie>, it still <swear> good."
msgstr ""
"いよいよ、復讐劇の幕開けだ！なんて良い匂い！レストランは焼け落ち、奴は一文無しだ！まぁ既に<zombie>になってるかもしれないが、それもいいだろう、<swear>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Find TrueFoodperson"
msgstr "フードパーソンを探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Help pizzaiolo find TrueFoodperson and kick his ass."
msgstr "ピッツァ職人が真のフードパーソンを見つけるのを手伝いましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you, <name_g>.  Wanna continue on my revenge to all american "
"<name_b>s?"
msgstr "ああ、<name_g>、君か。全てのアメリカ製ピザ<name_b>への復讐を続けたくはないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Good.  Next stop, Foodplace.  I always hated that place, especially that "
"<swear> <name_b> in his <dumb> mask.  I know he's still alive, hiding in his"
" <swear> <dumb> parody of a restaurant.  Take this bat.  Let's take a visit "
"to him, <name_g>, and kick his <swear> ass!"
msgstr ""
"よし。次はフードプレイスだ。前からあの店、特に、<swear>、<name_b>だよ、あの<dumb>マスコットが嫌いだったんだ。<swear>、あいつが今も出来損ない<dumb>レストランに隠れていることはお見通しだ。さあ武器を取れ。フードパーソンとか言う<name_g>を、<swear>、ボコボコにしてやろう！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I heard that these 'restaurants' use some kind of locking system for staff "
"room, so we would need to find a way to get there."
msgstr "あの「似非レストラン」はスタッフルームに施錠システムを付けているそうだ。何とかして入る方法を考えないとな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr "待ち遠しいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Another one bite the dust!  We did good, <name_g>."
msgstr "やったな、<name_g>。一発かましてやろう！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Pizza parlor"
msgstr "ピッツェリア"

#. ~ Description of mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Help pizzaiolo take back his restaurant."
msgstr "ピッツァ職人のレストラン奪還を手伝いましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I need to make a last step to achieve my revenge, and the step is - my pizza"
" parlor.  Before <the_cataclysm>, the bank took my place, and now, some "
"<swear> <name_b>s occupied it and made it their base!  <swear> unbelievable,"
" I tell ya.  It's time for me to fight back, deal with this <swear> "
"<name_b>s and regain my honor.  Are you with me, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"復讐達成の最後の一歩を踏み出す時が訪れた。そう、私のピッツェリア奪還だ。<the_cataclysm>以前から既に銀行に店を奪われてしまったが、今は、<swear>、<name_b>が勝手に居付いてやがる！<swear>、ふざけた話だ。しかし、<swear>、ようやく反撃し、<name_b>から名誉を取り戻す機会が来た。<name_g>、一緒にやってくれるか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "<very> good.  Let's go."
msgstr "<very>いい気分だ。よし行こう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"These <name_b>s might be heavily armed, so we need to prepare to face them."
msgstr "<name_b>達は重武装しているかもしれない。こちらも対抗手段を用意しておこう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Nice, <very><swear> nice.  <swear>, this placed is thrashed.  "
"<swear><name_b>s thrashed my restaurant!  Okay, calm down, calm down, will "
"ya… At least I retrieved my place.  Thank you, <name_g>.  I couldn't make it"
" without you."
msgstr ""
"<very>いいね、<swear>、最高だよ。<swear>、滅茶苦茶だ。<swear>、<name_b>共め、私のピッツェリアがぶち壊しだ！ああ、分かってる、落ち着こう、ともかく...店は取り戻せた。ありがとう、<name_g>。君なしでは成し遂げられなかっただろう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Family house"
msgstr "わが家へ"

#. ~ Description of mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"First bring pizzaiolo some chocolate cake then lead him to his family house."
msgstr "ピッツァ職人にケーキを渡し、実家まで同行しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Now, as my competitors dead, their places are ruined, it's time to relax… I "
"know, let's celebrate it!  Lead me to my house.  Also, we need a cake for "
"that.  What celebration without a cake, right?  I can teach you how to cook "
"it, if you want."
msgstr ""
"さて、商売敵も死に、店も潰して、ようやく寛げる...よし、ともかくお祝いだ！私の自宅まで護衛してくれ。それから、ケーキも必要だ。ケーキの無い祝い事なんてありえない、そうだろ？もし知りたいなら、ケーキの作り方も教えるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Good.  Bring me chocolate cake and talk to me."
msgstr "よし。チョコレートケーキが用意できたら、言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"If you listened to me very closely, it wouldn't be hard for you to make it."
"  Good luck, <name_g>."
msgstr "私の話をちゃんと聞いていれば、簡単に作れるはずさ。<name_g>、幸運を祈っているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Freeze you <swear> <zombies>!"
msgstr "<swear>、止まれ、<zombies>め！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "&Hold up your hands.  \"Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you\""
msgstr "&両手を挙げる。「心配するな、攻撃するつもりはない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Hand over your stuff!  Don't make any sudden moves, or you die!"
msgstr "物資をよこせ！急に動くと殺すぞ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "<greet>"
msgstr "<greet>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr "ああ、<zombies>の仲間じゃないのか。どうぞ、ただし面倒は起こさないように頼むよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid "Alright, let's chat."
msgstr "よかった、話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "I'll be back later."
msgstr "じゃあまた後で。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "What are you doing in this deathtrap?"
msgstr "こんな危険な場所で何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Why don't you come with me?"
msgstr "一緒に来ないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>前からここに住んでいた。ちょうど寝ているときに<zombies>の大群に襲われて、ここまで来たんだ。叫び声が静まってドアから顔を出したら、お隣さんが顔を半分かじり取られたまま歩いていた。それ以来、ここに閉じこもっているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "へぇ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid "<greet>."
msgstr "<greet>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
msgid "Hey, stranger.  Glad to see a new face around here."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。生きてる人間に会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
msgid "Glad to see you too.  Now, hand over your things."
msgstr "こちらこそ、会えて嬉しいよ。さて、持ち物を全部渡してもらおうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""
"ここでキャンプをしていたら、<the_cataclysm>が始まって滅茶苦茶にされたんだ。2体の<zombies>に襲われて、殺されかけた。それでも、都会から離れたこの場所にいる方がマシだと思っているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr "知らない人に会うのは久しぶりだ。どうしてこんなところへ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Just wandering, <name_g>."
msgstr "ただうろついているだけだ、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid ""
"I'll make this real simple for you.  Hand over your stuff, and no one gets "
"hurt, capiche?"
msgstr "簡単な話だ。荷物をこちらへ渡せ。そうすれば危害は加えない。理解したか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Could you tell me a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "あなた自身の話を聞かせてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Can I purchase any of your liquor?"
msgstr "酒を購入できるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid ""
"It's a bit dangerous to be out here alone.  Why don't you come with me?"
msgstr "一人で過ごすのは危険だと思う。私と一緒に来ないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid "Anything I could do for you?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't "
"so legal with the law.  I was in <city> making a deal on my product when a "
"horde of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would be"
" a nice place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"私はまさにここの蒸留所を経営している者だ。<the_cataclysm>前は、あまり公にはできない場所だった。<city>で商品の取り引きをしていたら暴徒が押し寄せてきて、慌てて逃げてきたんだ。ここなら快適に過ごせると思ってね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Would you be interested in bartering?"
msgstr "物資の取り引きをしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Can I stay here for a while?"
msgstr "しばらくここに滞在してもいい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion."
"  I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>に備えるなんて気でも狂ったかと言ってくる人は多かった。でもそんな人は皆死んで、私は今も元気だ。暴動が抑え切れなくなる事態にも、ちゃんと備えていた。何体かの<zombies>を避けて自分の砦に戻れば、それで何も問題はない。あれ以来、私はずっとここで安全に暮らしているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "面白いな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"Well, I guess you could borrow one of the spare beds, just don't hog it.  I "
"kept a few in case someone else joined me, but no one I knew came here."
msgstr ""
"ベッドは一つ余っているけれど、占領しすぎるのは止めてほしい。知り合いが来たときのための予備用なんだ。今のところ知り合いは一人も来ていないけどね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid "Don't come any closer!"
msgstr "それ以上近付くな！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "どうした？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just "
"don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "ああ、奴らじゃないのか。奴らってのは、<zombies>のこと。どうぞ、騒ぎを起こさないようにな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
msgid ""
"When shit hit the fan, I ran out here to this emergency shelter.  "
"Fortunately, the place hadn't been looted yet and there weren't any "
"<zombies> lurking around."
msgstr "ことが起きてすぐ、この避難シェルターに逃げ込んだんだ。幸いなことに、ここは誰にも荒らされていないし、<zombies>も潜んでいなかった。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "meteorologist"
msgstr "気象学者"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Meteorologist"
msgstr "気象学者"

#. ~ Job description of "Meteorologist" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Meteorologist."
msgstr "気象学者だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Run, I need to run, where to run…"
msgstr "逃げ、逃げないと、どこへ逃げよう..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Air temperature, precipitation, but what about… oh, I'm sorry, I didn't "
"notice you.  Hello."
msgstr "気温、降水量、しかし何が...ああ、失礼、気付かなかった。ごきげんよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I have not seen living people for a long time.  Glad to see another "
"survivor.  Greetings, <name_g>."
msgstr "生きている人間に会ったのは久しぶりだ。会えて嬉しいよ。ごきげんよう、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Maybe I can help you with your problem?"
msgstr "何か私に手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I need more time.  Come back later."
msgstr "もう少し時間がかかる。後で来てくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"手伝い？手伝いって？ああ、そうそう。生存者が集まっている場所があるなら、私を連れて行ってもらえないか？一人で生き残れるとは思えないんだ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Yes, you can relax now."
msgstr "ああ、これで落ち着けるな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Don't worry, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "心配しないで、もうすぐだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I will never forget your kindness, <name_g>.  Take this book as "
"token of my gratitude."
msgstr "ありがとう。<name_g>、この親切は決して忘れない。この本を感謝のしるしとして受け取ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "無事に生きてるようで嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "お互いにな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a "
"weather station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote "
"reports, drew up schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I"
" was studying electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, "
"some for work, some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered "
"all my things that I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then "
"I've been sitting here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"私は単なる気象学者さ。これまでは気象観測所へ行って、天候や大気の状態を監視したり、レポートを読んだり書いたり、予測表を作ったり...はっきり言って、とても退屈な仕事だ。暇な時には電子工学や無線工学の勉強をして過ごしていた。仕事に役立つ知識や、完全に趣味でしか使わないを学ぶんだ。色々な機械を作ったりもしたよ。最初の暴動が始まった頃、私は荷物を持てるだけ集めて、この場所に住むことにしたんだ。それ以来、ここに座って、色々と馬鹿げたことをやって時間を無駄遣いしてるってわけ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
msgstr "気象学者に金属屑を渡す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him 50 pieces of scrap."
msgstr "気象学者から金属屑を50個持ってくるよう頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need scrap metal to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "ドローンを組み立てるには金属屑が必要だな..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I've been sitting here for a long time, and all that time I was wondering "
"how bad everything is outside.  I want to build a drone that I can use to "
"fly over New England, check the air condition, take a few pictures from "
"above to get a glimpse of how is it.  There were a lot of things in our back"
" room that could be useful, but still I'm missing a lot of things.  You look"
" like an experienced survivalist.  Can you help me?"
msgstr ""
"私はずっとここに座って、外がどれほど酷い状況なのか考えていたんだ。ニューイングランド上空を飛行して大気を調べたり、上から写真を撮ったりできる、ドローンを作れないものだろうか。奥の部屋には便利な道具がたくさんあったが、それでも色々と足りないものがある。あなたは経験豊富なサバイバル生活者のようだし、物資探しを手伝ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Good.  I just need a little stuff: 50 scrap, 6 medium batteries, 5 small "
"high-quality lenses and a radio remote control.  Bring the scrap for now, "
"but don't forget about the rest."
msgstr ""
"よし。必要なのは金属屑50個、中型の充電池6個、小型高性能レンズ5個、そして無線制御装置1個だ。まずは金属屑50個をお願いするよ。残りも集めておいてくれると助かる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Maybe another time…"
msgstr "また次の機会に..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I don't think this is a difficult task.  Surely there is a lot of it "
"underfoot."
msgstr "難しい仕事じゃないと思うよ。地面にたくさん落ちてる筈だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "順調？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm starting to work on it…"
msgstr "よし、早速取り掛かるよ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr "どうしてそんなことを言うんだ？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
msgstr "気象学者に充電池(中)を渡す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him 6 medium batteries."
msgstr "気象学者から充電池(中)を6個持ってくるよう頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need batteries to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "ドローンを組み立てるには充電池が必要だな..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Well, what's next on the list… yeah, batteries.  6 medium batteries would be"
" enough."
msgstr "さて、次に必要なのは...ああ、充電池だな。中型のものを6個お願いするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I'm waiting for you."
msgstr "待ってるからな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Try looking for some battery-powered trinkets and take them apart."
msgstr "電池式の工具を探して、分解してみてはどうだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continue to work on it…"
msgstr "いいね、早速続きに取り掛かろう..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find lens_small 5"
msgstr "小型高性能レンズを5個渡す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find lens_small 5"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him 5 small high-quality lenses."
msgstr "気象学者から小型高性能レンズを5個持ってくるよう頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need small high quality lenses for our drone…"
msgstr "ドローンには小型高性能レンズも必要だな..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Well, what's next on the list… yeah, lenses.  5 small high-quality lenses "
"would be enough."
msgstr "さて、次に必要なのは...ああ、レンズだな。小型で高性能なものを5個お願いするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Try looking for cameras to dismantle.  Smart Phones, Telescopes or "
"microscopes would also work."
msgstr "カメラを分解してみてくれ。スマートフォンや望遠鏡、顕微鏡でもいい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find lens_small 5"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continuing to work on it…"
msgstr "いいね、早速続きに取り掛かろう..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find radiocontrol"
msgstr "無線制御装置を渡す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find radiocontrol"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him a radio controller."
msgstr "気象学者から無線制御装置を持ってくるよう頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "We need an RC to assemble a drone…"
msgstr "ドローンを組み立てるには遠隔制御装置が必要だな..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Well, what's next on the list… yeah, radio control.  Any kind will do, but "
"the simplest one is better, so I can easily reconfigure it for my drone."
msgstr "さて、次は...そう、無線制御装置だ。どんな種類でも構わないけど、ドローン用に改造したいから、なるべく単純な作りの方がいいな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I advise you to search in a store, such as electronics or toy store."
msgstr "電化製品やおもちゃを売ってる店で探してみよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find radiocontrol"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Great, very little work left.  I need a few days to finish all this, and to "
"try it in work.  I hope everything will work fine!  While I'm working on the"
" drone, you can read this book.  Maybe you can learn something new from it."
msgstr ""
"素晴らしい、もう完成したも同然だ。作業を完了して実際に試してみるには数日かかるかな。きっと上手くいくことを願っているよ！私がドローンを調整している間に、この本を読んでみてはどうだろう。きっと何か新しい知識を学べるはずだ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Find crashed drone"
msgstr "墜落したドローンを探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "The meteorologist asked to bring him his crashed drone."
msgstr "気象学者から墜落したドローンを持ってくるよう頼まれました。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "I've lost the drone, we should find out what happened…"
msgstr "ドローンを見失ってしまったから、何があったのか調べないと..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I'm glad that you are alive and that you haven't forgot about me.  The drone"
" turned out to be great, it managed to take off and even was able to fly "
"several hundred meters!  Unfortunately, after that, I lost control of it… I "
"don't know what happened to it, though.  Maybe you can check?  I'm a little "
"afraid to go out there…"
msgstr ""
"あなたがまだ生きていて、私のことを忘れていなかったとは嬉しいね。ドローンの出来は上々で、なんとか離陸にも成功して、数百メートルは飛行できたよ！残念ながら、その後操作が効かなくなったんだけど...しかし、何が原因だったのだろうな。墜落現場を見てきてもらえないか？外へ出るのがちょっと怖くてね..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"I don't know quite what happened.  Maybe something noticed my drone and "
"tried to bring it down.  Be careful."
msgstr "墜落の原因は分からない。何者かがドローンに気付いて、落とそうとした可能性もある。用心してくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find crashed drone"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Hmm, I see that the drone is not with you.  Maybe at least the memory module"
" remains?  Okay, show it to me… hmm, situation is worse than I expected, "
"much, much worse… I'm not feeling good.  I don't feel safe in this place "
"anymore.  I have to run, run somewhere.  But where to run if these "
"<monster>s are everywhere…"
msgstr ""
"うーん、ドローンは持ち帰れなかったのか。少なくとも、記憶モジュールは残っていたんだな？よし、見せてくれ...ふむ、状況は想像以上に悪い、それどころか最悪だ...気分が落ち込んできた。もうこの場所は安全とは言えないな。どこかへ逃げなければ。しかし、こんな<monster>が至る所にいるとすれば、どこへ逃げればいいのか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead"
" now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"世界が終わる前は、ホームレスだったんだ。しばらくこの辺りで野宿をしていた。大勢の<name_b>に疎まれたけど、そいつらも皆死んだ。私の方がよっぽど恵まれてるってことだね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr "騒ぎが始まるまで、こんな場所があるなんて気付きもしなかっただろ。でも、私は長いことこの辺りで暮らしてたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Nothing to it.  Before <the_cataclysm>, it didn't take much to find yourself"
" here.  And I guess it just made sense to stay.  We seem to be doing better "
"than most, anyway."
msgstr ""
"何もないさ。<the_cataclysm>以前も、ここからほど近い場所で暮らしてたんだ。シェルターに来られたんだから、結果オーライだね。上手く生き延びられてる方だと思うよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Surviving, as I always have.  Is that what you mean?"
msgstr "今までもこれからも、とにかく生き延びるだけだ。そうだろう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just"
" leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't "
"you?  It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"この辺りで何をしてたかって、上手く言うのは難しいな。雨降って地固まるというか...まあ、単に親切心で聞いてくれたんだろ？でも、今はそんなこと重要じゃない。私はここに居て、まだ生きているんだから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Who are you?  Would you like to trade?"
msgstr "誰だ？物資の取り引きか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Where might your friends be?"
msgstr "仲間はいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Can I stay here?"
msgstr "ここに宿泊してもいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "How's that smoker coming along?"
msgstr "燻製器の調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out "
"on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on "
"what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you "
"might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>以前から、しばらくホームレス生活だった。放浪先で仲間に会って、ここで野宿をしていたんだ。今も、ありあわせの物資でなんとか暮らしている。物資の取り引きは大歓迎だ。きっといい品が見つかるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Making ends meet, even in the worst circumstances.  We've been camping out "
"here now, trading with whoever passes by.  If something catches your eye, "
"let me know."
msgstr ""
"たとえ最悪の状況でも、日銭を稼ぐ生活は変わらないよ。今はここで野宿して、通りがかった人と物資の取り引きをしているんだ。何か欲しいものがあるなら言ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"We got tired of being out on the road and decided to stay here for a bit.  "
"We've found a lot of useful stuff out and about, so if you see anything you "
"need I'll make you a deal."
msgstr "放浪生活に疲れて、しばらくここに滞在することにしたんだ。便利な道具もいろいろと拾ったから、もし欲しいなら物々交換しよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"They should be around here somewhere.  We usually go out in teams to "
"scavenge, and they haven't told me about anything yet.  They might have "
"something for you to do."
msgstr "この辺にいる筈だ。いつもは連れ立って物資漁りに出掛けるんだけど、今日の予定はまだ聞いてないな。きっと作業中なんだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Well, I don't see anything wrong with it.  We should have a spare bed in "
"that tent you could sleep on.  Just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "ああ、別にいいよ。テントの中に空いてるベッドがある筈。くれぐれも迷惑はかけないようにな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Sure!  It turned out well enough for us, and it's one of the few fresh meats"
" we can find.  I'll pay fairly for it."
msgstr "もちろん！こっちも大助かりだ。新鮮な肉は貴重だからね。取り引きに応じるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing."
msgstr "今は何も持っていない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing.  I'd best get going."
msgstr "今は何も持っていない。出直すことにするよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"It's wonderful!  We've been preserving a lot more of what we manage to "
"scavenge so we won't have to worry about our food going bad for a while.  "
"We'd be willing to sell some of the excess, if you want."
msgstr ""
"最高だ！苦労して漁ってきた食材をたくさん保存しておけるから、しばらくは飯を腐らせる心配をせずに済む。もしよければ、余った分を買っていくといい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I think I'll buy 10 slices.  [$20]"
msgstr "[$20] 燻製肉を10枚買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "You think 20 slices would be alright?  [$40]"
msgstr "[$40] 燻製肉を20枚買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I'll take 50 slices of the stuff.  [$100]"
msgstr "[$100] 燻製肉を50枚買いたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "覚えておくよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Who are you, and what are you doing here?"
msgstr "誰だ？ここで何をしている？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Nice to meet you.  I mean no harm."
msgstr "初めまして。悪さをするつもりはないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "What's with that guy in the tent?"
msgstr "あのテントの中の人は誰だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Want to trade?"
msgstr "物資の取り引きをしない？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Oh, they're right over there, and one of us is in that tent over there.  "
"They handle any stuff we manage to scavenge, so feel free to trade for what "
"you want."
msgstr "うちらの仲間だ。拾ってきたものは全部あいつが管理してるから、欲しいものがあるなら聞いてみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for the offer, but I don't have anything to spare right now.  One of "
"my buddies over in that tent handles stuff like this, though.  You might "
"find something."
msgstr "申し出はありがたいけど、今は手元に何もない。物々交換なら、あそこのテントにいる仲間が受け持っている。掘り出し物があるかもな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Well, they were the brightest of us when all hell broke loose.  They managed"
" to get us some food and weapons early on.  I guess that just kinda made "
"them the leader."
msgstr ""
"ああ、社会が大混乱に陥ってたときも、あいつが一番率先して動いてくれてたんだ。早い段階から食料や武器を揃えてくれた。そういう訳で、あいつがうちらのリーダーをやってるんだよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Sticky Situation"
msgstr "しつこい奴"

#. ~ Description of mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some slimes in exchange for credit with some of the traders and bring "
"back six of their slime scraps."
msgstr "ホームレスの商人のために、スライムを倒して粘液の塊を6個持ち帰りましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I need some help."
msgstr "助けが必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We've had some trouble with slimes not far from us.  It's been hard going "
"through there with all them around, so I want you to go take care of it."
msgstr "近所にスライムが湧いて困ってるんだ。寄り集まって大変なことになっている。行って片付けてもらえないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back."
msgstr "ここにいるから、終わったら報告してくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "No problem.  I'm sure one of us will get to it anyway."
msgstr "気にするな。他の誰かに任せるさ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Sure, they can be cut, but I'd say it's better to splatter them with "
"something large and heavy."
msgstr "斬撃ももちろん効くだろうが、大きくて重い武器でぶっ叩いた方がよさそうだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Are those slimes dead yet?"
msgstr "スライムは倒したか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll just take those off your hands.  Might be good for greasing the "
"bike chains and door hinges around here even though it is a bit… abnormal."
msgstr "よし。その粘液は貰っておこう。自転車のチェーンとかドアの蝶番に塗ったら、グリス代わりになりそうだ。まあ、多少は...気持ち悪いけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"You don't look nearly as sticky as you're supposed to.  Get back to it."
msgstr "本当ならもっと全身ベタベタになってる筈だろ。さっさと終わらせてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sticky Situation"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Did they give you the slip?  It's worse than I thought, then."
msgstr "歯が立たなかったのか？思ったより強敵だな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Arthropod Hunting"
msgstr "アントハント"

#. ~ Description of mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some ants and bring back ten slices of their meat in exchange for "
"credit with some of the traders."
msgstr "ホームレスの商人のために、巨大アリを倒して変異肉塊を10個持ち帰りましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"The last time we went out scouting we found some gargantuan ants crawling "
"around.  We thought we might see how they taste, if they could be cooked and"
" whatnot.  I want you to go kill one and bring back some of its meat."
msgstr ""
"この前偵察に行ったとき、巨大なアリが歩いてるのを見たんだ。味はどうなのか、何料理に合うのか、色々試したくて仕方がない。巨大アリを倒して、その肉を持ち帰ってもらえないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that."
msgstr "ああ、その気持ちも分かるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A shotgun of some sort might work well."
msgstr "ショットガンなどの銃器が有効かもしれないな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the meat?"
msgstr "肉はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll get these cooked up.  Who knows, we might want some more in the "
"future."
msgstr "よし。早速調理してみるとしよう。これからどんどん食べることになるかもしれないからな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "You sure?  I don't see my meat anywhere."
msgstr "何？肉がどこにもないじゃないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Arthropod Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Ah, well.  It's no big deal."
msgstr "ああ、そうか。無理を言って悪かった。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments"
msgstr "改装工事"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 planks."
msgstr "100個の木材を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"My buddies and I have decided to stay here for a while.  This is about the "
"only safe place out here, and it's kinda become our home.  Anyway, we're "
"going to build a wall.  Our old logs have provided a bunch of the wood, but "
"we still need quite a few planks.  About 100 of them.  If you could get it "
"for us, I'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"仲間と一緒にしばらくここで過ごすことにしたんだ。ここが一番安全な、我が家みたいなものさ。何はともあれ、壁を作りたい。丸太から結構な量の木材を切り出せたけど、まだまだ足りない。あと100枚もあれば大丈夫だろう。もしよかったら、集めてもらえないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll be sure to compensate your efforts."
msgstr "ありがとう。その尽力にいつか応えてみせるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that.  I guess I'll have to get it myself."
msgstr "そうか、分かった。自分たちで準備するしかないようだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Any nearby forest should have all you need.  Otherwise, you might try "
"breaking down some furniture in town."
msgstr "近くの森へ行けば、必要なものは全部揃う筈だ。それか、街で家具を分解してみるのもいいかもしれない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my lumber?"
msgstr "木材はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll start right away."
msgstr "ありがとう。早速作業を始めよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I can tell you're lying.  I don't see shit."
msgstr "嘘をついてるな。どこにもないじゃないか。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. II"
msgstr "改装工事 パート2"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 150 planks."
msgstr "150個の木材を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. II"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got the wall done, we decided to move out of these old tents."
"  We still have some leftover nails but we need more wood.  So, if you could"
" get us 150 planks, we'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"壁が完成したから、この古いテントから引っ越すことにしたんだ。まだ釘は残ってるけど、木材はもっと必要だった。150枚用意してもらえると助かるよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. III"
msgstr "改装工事 パート3"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6 ropes."
msgstr "6個のロープを集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our entrance is wide open so we're building a gate over it.  Problem is we "
"don't have any ropes.  If you could find some for us, we'll pay you."
msgstr "ここの出入り口は広いから、そこに門を作ってる最中なんだ。一番の問題は、ロープがないことだな。集めてきてくれたら、謝礼は出そう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find any rope around, one of our books should have something on"
" rope-making.  Most plants can be woven into a halfway decent rope."
msgstr "もしロープが見つからないなら、確かここにある本の中に、ロープ作りに関するものがあった筈だ。大抵の植物は、簡単なロープの材料として使えるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. III"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my ropes?"
msgstr "ロープはあったか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
msgstr "改装工事 パート4"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a wood saw."
msgstr "ノコギリを集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We appreciate all of your help but we can't rely on everyone else to do "
"things for us.  I'd be willing to buy a wood saw of some kind from you so we"
" can cut our own wood as needed."
msgstr ""
"あんたの協力には感謝しているけど、何でもかんでも頼ってばかりじゃダメだ。必要になったら自分で木材を調達できるように、もしノコギリを持ってるなら買い取らせて貰えないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store or lumbermill should have one"
msgstr "工具店や製材所にある筈だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my saw?"
msgstr "ノコギリはあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Pick what you want from our stash."
msgstr "ありがとう。物資の中から好きなものを持っていって構わないよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. V"
msgstr "改装工事 パート5"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a shovel."
msgstr "シャベルを集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our sanitation here has become… problematic.  We've mostly just been going "
"outside the walls to piss.  Not only is it kinda unhealthy, but the last "
"time I wandered out I almost got eaten!  So, if you'd get us a shovel, we "
"could make a latrine for ourselves.  We'll pay you fairly, as usual."
msgstr ""
"ここの衛生状態は...本当に酷い。小便を壁の外に垂れ流すのは、健康に悪い。だからと言ってふらっと出掛けると、食われそうになる！もしシャベルを売ってくれたら、自分たちで便所を作れる。報酬はいつも通り、ちゃんと払うよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store should have one lying around."
msgstr "工具店に置いてある筈だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the shovel?"
msgstr "シャベルはあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We're eternally grateful to you."
msgstr "ありがとう。この恩は忘れないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. V"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it myself, then."
msgstr "それなら、自力で探すしかないか。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
msgstr "改装工事 パート6"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a charcoal smoker."
msgstr "燻製器を手に入れる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Turns out that ant meat you got us wasn't actually too bad.  A little tough,"
" sure, but perfectly edible.  The problem now is we need a way of preserving"
" it.  One of those portable charcoal smokers would be really great.  Heck, "
"you might even wanna buy some."
msgstr ""
"前に獲ってきてもらったアリの肉は、結構悪くなかったよ。確かに少し硬いけど、問題なく食べられる。問題は肉を保存する方法だ。持ち運べる燻製器があれば最高だな。もし持ってるなら、購入させてほしい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Maybe try a farm?  I bet those rural folks were pretty invested in "
"preserving their food."
msgstr "農場を探すのはどうだろう？田舎の方が、食料の保存が盛んな気がするな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal smoker?"
msgstr "燻製器はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll get started right away."
msgstr "ありがとう。早速使ってみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid ""
"My god, you've got to get me out of here.  The things… the things they've "
"done… please help."
msgstr "何てことだ、ここから出してくれ。奴ら...やりやがったな...助けてくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Aren't you a little short to be a stormtrooper?"
msgstr "ストームトルーパーにしては背がちょっと低くない？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Please, help me."
msgstr "お願いだ、助けて。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you get me out of this hell hole?"
msgstr "地獄から連れ出してくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Who are you?  Are you real?"
msgstr "誰だ？幻覚じゃないのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Can you please save me?  I have to get out of here."
msgstr "助けてもらえないかな？ここから出たいんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_member.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Hallelujah, rescue!"
msgstr "ハレルヤ、助けが来た！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_member.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Thank you, thank you!"
msgstr "幻覚じゃないよな。ありがとう、ありがとう！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "You're… you're actually real!"
msgstr "君は...ちゃんと存在してるな！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "どうやってここへ？まさか、奴らの仲間なのか？どういうことだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Come with me, if you want to live."
msgstr "生き延びたいなら、私と一緒に来るんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "I've no use for weaklings.  Run.  Now."
msgstr "弱者は不要だ。さっさと逃げろ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Random NPC, non persistent, can direct you to the free merchants and sell
#. you things.
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Caravan Merchant"
msgstr "隊商の商人"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Random NPC, non persistent, tells you about being a guard and directs you
#. to free merchants.
#. ~ Random NPC, non persistent, doesn't have much to say.
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Caravan Guard"
msgstr "隊商護衛"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here "
"and we're well armed."
msgstr "おやおや、また旅の人か。妙な真似はしないでくれよ。こっちには大勢いるし、武器もたくさんあるんだからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Are you threatening me?"
msgstr "それは脅しなのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_gode.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_mechanic.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_member.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_shopkeeper.json
msgid "What's your deal here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "I won't try anything if you don't.  Just passing through."
msgstr "通りがかっただけだ。そちらが何もしてこないなら、手は出さないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Do you have anything to trade?"
msgstr "何か取り引きできる物資はある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Nothing much.  Just passing through."
msgstr "いいや。通りがかっただけだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"No, not at all.  Just being cautious.  You know how it gets out here.  We're"
" not looking for trouble.  In fact, if you've got anything worthwhile, maybe"
" we could do a little trading."
msgstr ""
"いやいや、滅相もない。用心に越したことはないということさ。ここがどこか知らない訳じゃないだろう？トラブルはご免だよ。もし何か売れそうなものを持っているなら、取り引きしてもいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Sure, let's trade."
msgstr "ああ、取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That suits me fine.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "いや、結構。もう失礼するよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"We're just travelers, making a pit stop.  Might be willing to trade a bit, "
"if you've got anything to share.  We're not looking for trouble, there's "
"plenty of that on the roads already."
msgstr ""
"補給中の単なる旅人だよ。何か物資があるなら、少しは物々交換してもいい。トラブルは道中に嫌というほど転がっているんだから、おかわりは間に合ってるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That's it?  What's your story?"
msgstr "それから？どうして旅をしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"We're with a larger group of survivors, working out of one of the old FEMA "
"bunkers.  Folks have taken to calling us Free Merchants, although that "
"sounds kinda on the nose to me.  We know about a few survivor groups and we "
"make regular trips around, sharing supplies back and forth and bringing them"
" home.  We're on the way back now."
msgstr ""
"私たちは生存者の大集団とともに、かつてFEMAの貯蔵庫だった場所で活動しているんだ。ちょっと照れくさい名前だが、自由商人と呼ばれているグループだ。複数の生存者集団と知り合って、定期的に各拠点へ向かって物資をやり取りして、自分たちの拠点へ持ち帰っている。今はちょうど家へ帰るところだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That's interesting.  Well, let's trade."
msgstr "興味深い。では、早速取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Can you give me directions to any of these other survivor groups?"
msgstr "他の生存者集団がいる場所を教えてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Where is 'home'?"
msgstr "その「家」というのはどこにある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for chatting.  I'd better go."
msgstr "話を聞けてよかった。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers "
"directions to their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr "申し訳ないが、見ず知らずの者に隠れ家の場所を教えたりしたら、お客にそっぽを向かれてしまうよ。自分の足で探してくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "I can understand that.  Well, let's trade."
msgstr "それもそうか。では、物資の取り引きをしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"Here, I'll mark it on your map.  Feel free to come by and trade, or if "
"you're the type, we might have use for your services as a merc."
msgstr ""
"ほら、マップに印を付けておこう。気軽に立ち寄ってくれ。物資の交換に来てもいいし、もし腕に自信があるなら、傭兵として雇うこともあるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Hey, thanks.  Well, let's trade."
msgstr "どうも、助かるよ。では、物資の取り引きをしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for that.  I'd better go."
msgstr "ありがとう。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Always good to do a little trading."
msgstr "物資の取り引きね、任せてくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Actually I had a little more to trade still."
msgstr "そうだ、他にも取り引きできる物資があったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks.  What were we talking about before?"
msgstr "ありがとう。ところで、さっきの話は何だったかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"Sup?  Nice to see a survivor.  If you're here for business, talk to the "
"trader."
msgstr "おや？生きてる人に会えるとはね。ビジネスの話がしたいなら、商人にどうぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for the tip."
msgstr "いいことを聞いたよ。ありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Hi again.  You want something?"
msgstr "また会ったな。何か用？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "You looking for work?  I might be hiring."
msgstr "仕事に興味はない？人を雇いたいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Nope, just saying hi."
msgstr "いや、ちょっと挨拶に寄っただけだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"I'm a caravan guard, working for the Free Merchants.  I'm an independent "
"contractor though.  Seems like a good way to get safety in numbers and try "
"to find a safe place to settle down."
msgstr "私は隊商の護衛として、自由商人のもとで働いている。とは言っても、単なる個人契約だが。人も多いし、安全を確保するのに丁度いいと思ってな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "So you're working for these guys, but aren't one of them?"
msgstr "商人に雇われているが、商人の一員ではないということか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"The Free Merchants?  Do they have some kind of trade outpost or anything "
"like that?"
msgstr "自由商人？あの商人は交易拠点のようなものを確保しているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "It's a living, eh?  I'd better get going."
msgstr "なるほど、そうやって暮らしているのか。そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, these guys snagged some kind of FEMA evacuation bunker during the "
"early part of <the_cataclysm> and hoard the space.  They don't let anyone "
"else join, but they need supplies, so they send out traders, and those "
"traders need protection, so they send out guys like me."
msgstr ""
"ああ、<the_cataclysm>が始まってすぐの頃にFEMAの避難所だかを確保して、そこに物資を溜めているんだ。仲間は増やしたくないが、物資は増やしたい。そこで商人たちを外へ送り出す。護衛が必要になるから、こんな風に傭兵を雇ってな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "How do I get there?"
msgstr "どこにあるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"I'm good for the moment, but you can usually find a merc or two waiting "
"between jobs, back at the Free Merchant base."
msgstr "今のところは間に合ってるよ。自由商人の拠点へ行けば、暇な傭兵の一人や二人いるだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for the tip!  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "情報をありがとう！早速行ってみるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Sure, I can mark it on your map if you like.  Here."
msgstr "ああ、マップに印を付けておこう。ここだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for the tip!  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "情報をありがとう！さっきの話は何だったかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"*tips their hat down from their eyes and looks at you blearily.  \"Huh?  "
"Hey, I'm tryin'a sleep here.  I was on night watch."
msgstr "*は帽子を目深にかぶり、くたびれた目でこちらを見ている。「あぁ？ちょっと、こっちは夜番で、今から寝るところだったのに。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Oh, uh, sorry."
msgstr "ああ、うん、悪かったよ。"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ A survivor who sometimes visits the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "John Bailey"
msgstr "ｼﾞｮﾝ ﾍﾞｰﾘｰ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*looks up at you, taking a moment to place your face, then grins broadly.  "
"He looks about the same as when you last saw him, perhaps a little more fit."
"  \"So, you're still playing on the 'living' team, huh?  Glad to see you're "
"still kicking around.  Always good to run into a familiar face nowadays.\""
msgstr ""
"*はこちらの顔をしばらく眺め、やがて笑みをこぼした。その姿は前回会ったときとほぼ同じか、あるいは少し健康的になったようにも見える。「おっ、君は相変わらず『生者』チームでプレイしてるようだな？元気そうで良かった。この頃は、顔なじみに会うだけでも嬉しくなるね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*glances your way, then makes eye contact as you move closer to speak.  He "
"is a strong-looking man in his mid forties, his hair greying and his face "
"flecked with stubble and travel dust.  The clothes he's wearing are clearly "
"scavenged, though they fit well, and he has the build of someone who until "
"recently had the luxury of carrying a few extra pounds.  \"Hi there.\"  He "
"presents his hand to shake.  \"You don't look like you belong here.  Name's "
"Bailey, John Bailey.\""
msgstr ""
"*はこちらを一瞥し、近寄って話そうとすると目礼を返した。40代半ばにみえる強面の男だ。白髪で、長旅で汚れたと思しき顔には無精ひげが生えている。拾った廃品にしか見えない服を着ているが、案外よく似合っている。体格は、つい最近体重を落としたばかりのように見える。「やあ。」彼は手を差し出して握手を求めた。「ここの住人じゃないようだね。私はベーリー、ジョン・ベーリーだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Hi John.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "やあ、ジョン。ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Hi John, I'm afraid I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあジョン、悪いけど、話はまた今度にしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*nods as you approach, then smiles and stretches casually.  \"Anything I can"
" do for you, friend?\""
msgstr "*は無造作に伸びをしていたが、微笑みながら会釈した。「やあ君か、何かお役に立てることは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "What do you know about this place?"
msgstr "この場所について何か知っていることはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "You looking for any kind of work?"
msgstr "仕事を探しているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Not at the moment, thanks."
msgstr "今は特にないな、ありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Like I said,\" John shrugs.  \"I'm just checking "
msgstr "さっきも言った通り...」ジョンは肩をすくめた。「ちょっと "

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Same as you, I imagine,\" John shrugs.  \"Checking "
msgstr "君と同じ...」ジョンは肩をすくめた。「 "

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"the place out, doing a little shopping.  Then I'll be on my way again.  "
"Might see if they have any work that needs done first, if the price is "
"right."
msgstr "ここを見て回って、物資の取り引きを少しね。その後はまた、気ままな旅を続けるさ。受けておくべき割に合う仕事がないかも、チェックしておきたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "What are you shopping for?"
msgstr "何か目当ての商品があるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "On your way\" where?"
msgstr "旅の行き先は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "What kind of work are you looking for?"
msgstr "どんな仕事を探しているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Got time to teach me anything?"
msgstr "もし時間があるなら、何かスキルを教えてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Sounds about the same as me, yep.  I'd better get back to it."
msgstr "確かに、私と同じみたいだ。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"I don't really know.  Food stocks aren't too bad for me and mine, I found a "
"stock of canned goods early on that will last us for a while yet.  I don't "
"use a gun if I can avoid it, too noisy.  I notice these guys seem to keep a "
"lot of building supplies though, and trying to get a vehicle downtown to "
"loot a hardware store or a lumberyard is suicide, so I think that's where "
"they're going to get my money.  I wonder if they deliver."
msgstr ""
"それが、まだ決まってなくてね。食料の備蓄は、私や皆の分も含めて多少余裕がある。早い時期に缶詰をたくさん確保できたから、まだしばらくは持ちそうだ。銃はできれば使いたくない。音が大きすぎる。ここでは建築資材も豊富に取り揃えてるみたいだ。大きな街に車を乗り入れて工具店や材木置き場を自力で漁るなんて、自殺行為だからね。商人たちはそういう需要を見込んでるんだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Where are you headed next?"
msgstr "次はどこへ向かうつもりなんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Who is \"you and yours\"?"
msgstr "「皆の分」ってことは、誰かと一緒なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Are you looking for work?"
msgstr "仕事は探していないのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"You'd do better to talk to the people here about it.  Seems like a bunch of "
"them gathered here in the early days of <the_cataclysm> and managed to make "
"it through.  It's the biggest bunch of survivors I've found yet, but most of"
" them hunker up in the basement.  I can understand the urge.  We've all been"
" through way too much.  They say they don't have room for more people "
"though, so I'm just here to do some shopping, see if there's work to be "
"done, then move on."
msgstr ""
"ここの人たちに聞いてみたらいい。<the_cataclysm>の初期にここに集まって、なんとか生き延びたそうだ。生存者集団の中でも大規模な方だが、大半は地下に隠れている。その気持ちも分かるよ。誰もがとても辛い体験をしてきたからね。地下にこれ以上人を受け入れるスペースはないらしい。そういう訳で、私はここで買い物をして、仕事がないか尋ねて、その後どこかへ移ろうとしているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Move on\" where?"
msgstr "移動先は決めているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, I've gotta go."
msgstr "話せてよかったよ。もう行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Who can say, really?  I don't really have a strong plan.  Depends on how "
"this trip goes.  Once my vehicle is full up, I'll have to head back to my "
"hideout and check on everyone there.  I don't like being gone too long."
msgstr ""
"目的地なんて、分からないさ。しっかりした計画は立てていない。その時の状況次第で決めるんだ。車の燃料が満タンになったら、皆の様子を見に拠点に帰らないといけないし、そこまで長くふらつくつもりはないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Who is \"everyone\"?"
msgstr "「皆」とは誰のことだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Huh, well, the short story is, I got my wife and kids out of town in the "
"really, really early days.  She's got great intuition for stuff and when she"
" told me to get ready to leave town, I figured at worst we'd have an "
"unnecessary early spring vacation in my dad's old cabin, you know?  "
"Obviously, turns out trusting her gut saved us all and then some.  Things "
"were still tough, but from what I've heard, I might be the only person left "
"on the Eastern Seaboard who still has his whole nuclear family.  Still got a"
" lot of survivor's guilt for that… still lost everyone else.  Anyway, one "
"thing led to another and we gathered a few other people that we watch out "
"for.  My man Darius, he joined up early on and he and I do the scouting and "
"scavenging and watch each others' backs."
msgstr ""
"うーん、そうだな、簡単に説明すると、私は妻と子供たちを、とんでもなく早い時期に街から連れ出しておいたんだ。とても勘が鋭い妻に、さっさと街を出ようと言われてね。その時は、父が持ってた古い山小屋で無駄に早い春休みを過ごすことになりそうだな、なんて思ってたんだけどね？実際は、妻の直感を信じたお陰で、家族全員が救われたんだ。苦労が無かったわけじゃないが、この様子じゃ、家族全員無事に生き残れているのは、東海岸でもうちぐらいかもしれない。生き残ってしまった罪悪感は今も残っている...失ったものも多い。まあとにかく、ちょっとしたきっかけがあって、守るべき人が家族以外にも何人か集まってきた。ダリウスという親友も早くに駆けつけてくれた。そいつとは一緒に偵察や釣りをしたり、互いの背中を守れる仲だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Where are you guys located?  Can I join up too?"
msgstr "他の人たちはどこにいるんだ？私もその仲間に加われないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Tell me about Darius."
msgstr "ダリウスについて聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "How did you know things were going to go wrong?"
msgstr "家族が上手く生き残った秘訣は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "That seems like a pretty unlikely story."
msgstr "信じられない話だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Can you give me any advice?"
msgstr "何かアドバイスを貰えないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "What did you used to do before?"
msgstr "以前は何をして暮らしていたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Let's change the subject.  What did you say you were doing here?"
msgstr "話題を変えよう。あなたはここで何をしているんだって？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"I'll be straight with you, I don't want to tell you too much about my "
"people, okay?  You seem all right, don't get me wrong, but I've seen some "
"scary fuckin' people out there, who come on all normal and then try to bite "
"your face off when they get you alone.  Everyone's reaction to the world's "
"end is a bit different.  Things are stable with my people now, but we don't "
"really welcome new faces anymore.  I wish it weren't that way.  Maybe if you"
" and I get to know each other better some day, I'll change my mind."
msgstr ""
"正直に言うと、家族や仲間のことは、ちょっと話したくないんだ。分かってもらえるね？今から話すのは君のことじゃないから、誤解しないでくれ。恐ろしい奴らに会ったことがある。一見すると普通なのに、一人きりになった途端に襲い掛かってくる奴らだ。今は仲間もいるし生活も安定しているが、新人はあまり歓迎されない。君ともっと親しくなったら、考えを変えることもあるだろうけどね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Your whole story seems a bit unlikely."
msgstr "本当にそんなことがあったなんて、信じられない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Talk to Darius if you want to know about Darius.  He's a good man, and he "
"won't bite-- ugh, sorry, that's a turn of phrase we should probably retire, "
"hey?  Anwyay.  I don't know if we'd have made it through the first days "
"without him.  He gets a bit jumpy around crowds since the riots though, so "
"he's out watching our stuff."
msgstr ""
"ダリウスのことが知りたいなら、直接聞いてみればいい。いい奴だし、噛んだりしない...おっと、失礼、この発言は聞かなかったことにしてくれよ？ともかく、あいつがいなかったら、最初の数日を無事に乗り切れた気がしない。暴動のせいで人混みがちょっと苦手だから、今は外で荷物を見張ってくれてる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes, I kinda wonder why other people *didn't* know things were going "
"to go wrong.  Hindsight is twenty-twenty, I guess.  I'll be honest though, "
"as much as I'd like to pat myself on the back, it wasn't me that figured it "
"out.  When the really early riots started out, even though they were way up "
"in the Midwest, my wife just had a bad feeling.  We'd been thinking of a "
"getaway anyway, and I had some time off, so we took it as an excuse to get "
"out to the cabin and wait for everything to blow over.  Here we are.  It "
"wasn't so much knowing how things were going to go, more just straight luck "
"that we trusted our - *her* - gut at the right time and lucked out."
msgstr ""
"時々、どうして他の人たちは今の状況を*予測できなかった*んだ、と思うことがある。そう思うのも、結果論なんだろうけどね。正直言って、あの時の自分の判断を褒めたい気持ちもあるが、そもそも異変に気付いたのは私じゃない。暴動が始まったばかりの頃、中西部での事件だったにもかかわらず、妻は嫌な予感がしていた。私も休暇でどうせなら遠出したいと思っていたから、予感を口実に山小屋へ出掛けて、全部元に戻るのを待とうということになったんだ。それが今じゃこの有様。状況を予測できたとかじゃなく、自分の判断や、とりわけ*妻の直感*を、その時偶然信じたおかげで運よく生き残ったとしか、言いようがないね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*chuckles.  \"Lucky for me then it doesn't matter if you believe me.  I do "
"gotta say though, it's funny you and I, a pair of actual real-live zombie "
"hunters, are talking face to face and you think my *survival story* is the "
"unlikely thing.\""
msgstr ""
"*は苦笑いした。「信じてもらえなくても構わないよ。でも、おかしいと思わないか。私と君、生き延びたゾンビハンター同士が出会って話をしている信じられない偶然を経験してなお、私の*サバイバルストーリー*がありえないと思うなんてさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"I do odd jobs if people need help.  Not on a volunteer basis you understand,"
" but I try not to be unfair about it either.  Lots of people need a bit of "
"help these days, often just with little things a scavenger like me can find "
"for them.  It's easy for folks like you and me to underestimate how scared a"
" lot of people are to go back out in that place.  The situation's bad enough"
" as it is, but these kind of people took refuge back when it was true chaos "
"out there.  Lots of trauma to unpack there.  Anyway, if there's little "
"things I can do for them, I try to help where I can, so long as it doesn't "
"put me in too much danger."
msgstr ""
"助けを必要としている人がいるなら、雑用でも請け負うつもりだ。ボランティアってわけじゃないが、あまりにも不公平な状況は減らしたいと思ってる。この状況で、ちょっとした助力を必要としてる人は多い。私みたいなスカベンジャーに解決できる小さな助力でもね。君や私みたいな人種は、外へ出掛けることが大抵の人にとってどれほど恐ろしいかってことを、簡単に忘れてしまう。外には、たくさんのトラウマが潜んでいるものだ。ともかく、私にできることがあるなら、できる限り協力しようと思っているよ。危険すぎる仕事は勘弁してほしいけどね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"You look like you can handle yourself in a fight.  What's your zombie kill "
"count?"
msgstr "戦い慣れているように見える。今まで何体のゾンビを殺してきたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "I could use someone like you.  Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "あなたのような人が仲間なら心強い。一緒に行かないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "You seem to know a lot about how people feel."
msgstr "あなたは他人の気持ちを思いやれるいい人だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"You've got that right.  People like you and I are made of stronger stuff."
msgstr "一理ある話だ。私やあなたのような人は、そこらの凡人とは出来が違うからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"People should learn to fend for themselves, not just get you to hand "
"everything to them."
msgstr "何でもかんでも与えてやるのは間違っている。自力で生きる術を学ばせるべきだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*laughs a bit sheepishly.  \"Seems distasteful to keep track of that stuff, "
"doesn't it?\"  He touches a series of notches on his <mywp>.  \"I'm human "
"though.  I'm up to <npc_val:zkc_john> so far.  Seems like a lot to me, "
"especially since I try to avoid actually engaging the enemy if I can help "
"it.\""
msgstr ""
"*はきまり悪そうに笑った。「そんなことを一々記録するなんて、趣味が悪くないか？」彼は<mywp>に触れながら言った。「私はただの人間だ。せいぜい<npc_val:zkc_john>体くらいかな。可能な限り敵と交戦しないように心掛けているのに、ちょっと多すぎるな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*sizes you up and down, and shakes his head sadly.  \"Darius and I have a "
"good thing going, and a third person would be hard to justify, especially "
"these days.  Trust comes hard.  I'm sorry.  I hope you've got someone to "
"watch your back, but it can't be me.\""
msgstr ""
"*はこちらを品定めするように観察し、悲しげに首を振った。「ダリウスと私は上手くやっている。今から新たな仲間を加えようとは思えないな。信頼ってのは難しいものだからね。背中を預ける仲間を見つけてほしいとは願ってるが、残念ながらそれは私じゃない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"That's a shame.  We'd be a good team.  People like you and I are made of "
"stronger stuff."
msgstr "そこらの凡人より強い者同士でいいチームを作れたと思うのに、残念だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Damn straight.  People should learn to fend for themselves."
msgstr "正しい判断だ。一人で生き残る術をもっと学ばないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I, uh… I know a bit about that stuff.  Hard not to empathize, "
"especially when I know I'm not quite as hard as others, by sheer luck.  "
"Besides, there are so few of us left now.  What's the point in wasting time "
"judging other people for how hard they took the end of the world?"
msgstr ""
"ああ、まあ、うん...そう心掛けているんだ。特に私は単に運がよかっただけで、他の人たちほど苦労を味わっていないから、そう接しないわけにはいかない。それに、ただでさえ生きた人間が減ってきているんだ。この世界に残された貴重な時間を、他人を厳しく責めることで浪費するなんて、悲しいと思わないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "It sounds like you have some past there.  You want to talk about it?"
msgstr "何か辛い思いをしたようだな。話してもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Not really, no.  It's old stuff, and there's enough going on.  Let's just "
"say I'm no stranger to loss, either my own or others'."
msgstr "いや、勘弁してくれ。昔のことだし、話したいとも思わない。自分の話だろうが他人の話だろうが、喪失についての話題はもう聞き飽きたよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*raises an eyebrow.  \"I don't know about that.  You should be careful about"
" thinking people who don't make the same choices as you are inferior.  Sure,"
" not everyone's suited to scavenge, but a scavenger's got to have a safe "
"home, too.\""
msgstr ""
"*は眉をひそめた。「その言い方はどうなんだ。自分と同じ選択をしなかった人は皆劣ってるなんて考え方には、気を付けた方がいい。誰もがスカベンジャーになれる才能を持ってるわけじゃない。でも、スカベンジャーには安全な家を任せられる人も必要だろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Fuck that.  People should learn to fend for themselves."
msgstr "バカげた考えだ。皆が自力で生きられる術を学ぶべきだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*rubs his stubble, looking thoughtful.  \"I agree it's important to be "
"independent, but don't forget, working together is what makes us better than"
" the undead.  It's how we got out of the trees and fields, and into "
"civilization.  Anyway, I don't want to talk philosophy at you.  If you're "
"doing well on your own, more power to you!\""
msgstr ""
"*は無精ひげを撫でながら、考え込んでいるようだ。「自活が重要なのはその通りだけど、私たちは協力することでゾンビより有利になれるって点を忘れちゃいけないんじゃないか。私たちのご先祖も、そうやって森や野原を抜け出し、文明を築いたんだ。まあ、これ以上哲学談義をしようとは思わないよ。一人で頑張るっていうなら、勝手に頑張ってくれ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"That's for the weaklings.  People like you and I are made of stronger stuff."
msgstr "それは弱者の考え方だ。私やあなたのような強者がそんなことで悩む必要はない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "I don't know, the zombies sure seem to work together to me."
msgstr "詳しくは分からないが、ゾンビたちも協力して動いているような気がする。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"*chuckles.  \"If you can call it that, sure.  So maybe we should do our best"
" to be better at that than the zombies.  Seems pretty reasonable to me, and "
"it's a pretty low bar to clear.\""
msgstr ""
"*は苦笑した。「あれを協力と呼んでいいなら、そうだろうね。だからこそ、ゾンビに勝てるようベストを尽くさないと。結構合理的な考えだし、クリアすべきハードルもそれほど高くないと思うんだけどな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I guess.  I don't know if I know anything you don't, you seem like you"
" can handle yourself.  I've made it this far by not engaging whenever "
"possible.  I'm never going to kill all the zombies out there.  Darius and I "
"try not to fight if we can avoid it, and if we can't, we try to always have "
"the advantage.  Numbers, weaponry, terrain.  Zombies are clumsy and stupid "
"so we lead them across bushes and things to trip and stumble.  We take high "
"ground and let them plough into ladders like idiots while we stick 'em with "
"spears from above.  Mostly, though, we try not to be seen.  We use bikes "
"instead of cars because they don't make noise and don't need gas, plus we "
"can take forest trails and things and avoid traffic jams.  Those things are "
"suicide.  We try to avoid the cities, and when we do go close, we stick to "
"the outskirts and raid the outlying houses.  In those, we keep crouched and "
"try to get deep into the building fast, or down into the basement, so that "
"little noises don't carry much and nothing from outside can see us.  Also, "
"zombies being idiots, closing the blinds is a great move.  I always keep a "
"crowbar for opening doors and windows, but I try not to use it if I can "
"avoid it.  Darius can pick locks, which is slower but doesn't make noise.  "
"We get a lot more mileage from raiding gas stations and other rural sites, "
"where if there are a few zombies, we can usually lead them away."
msgstr ""
"よし、分かった。君以上の知識がある訳でもないし、君は十分やっていけるように見えるけどな。私は、可能な限り戦闘は避けるようにしてここに辿り着いた。出歩いてるゾンビを全部殺すなんて無理な話だ。ダリウスと私は、避けられる戦いは避け、避けられない時は常に優位に立つよう心掛けている。大事なのは数、武器、地形の優位性だ。ゾンビは鈍くて頭が悪いから、茂みや障害物に引っかかって転ぶように誘導する。高台に陣取って、考えなしにやってきたゾンビを上から槍で突き刺す。でも大抵はそんな戦闘技術より、見られないように動くことを優先したいね。車じゃなくて自転車を使っているのは、音が出ないし燃料も要らない、未舗装道を進むことも事故車を避けることも自在だからだ。放置車両にぶつかったら一巻の終わりだからね。都会はなるべく避ける。ものを漁るときは中心部から外れた家を狙う。侵入する時はしゃがむ。家の中ではさっさと建物の奥まで入るか地下に降りるかして、とにかく小さな音も立てないように、外から見られないようにするといい。ゾンビは鈍いから、カーテンを閉めるのもいい手だ。ドアや窓を開けるバールは一応常備しているけど、なるべく使わない。時間がかかるけど音がしないピッキングを、器用なダリウスに任せるようにしている。郊外のガソリンスタンドなんかだったら、強行突破した方が損耗が少ないこともある。ゾンビ数体程度だったら、邪魔にならないよう誘導もできるからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "What about things other than zombies?"
msgstr "ゾンビ以外の敵については？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Oh, jeez, yeah.  The world really went to shit, didn't it?  Well, I've seen "
"some weird alien things.  Our rule is 'scared is better than dead'.  If we "
"don't know what something is and how to kill it, we steer wide and clear.  "
"One time I saw this flaming eyeball a long way off, I was scouting from a "
"cell phone tower.  It made eye contact with me and I just started "
"hallucinating shit.  Darius stopped me from falling right off the tower.  "
"Stuff like that is why I think you have to be a bit off your rocker to "
"travel these days unless you have no choice.  Anything we don't know, we "
"turn around and pedal hard.  So far, we haven't met anything our bikes can't"
" outrun."
msgstr ""
"おっと、そうだ、そういうのもいるな。なんてふざけた世界になっちまったんだ？ああ、変なエイリアンは見たことがある。「死ぬよりはビビるほうがマシ」ってルールを徹底してる。だから、その化け物の正体や殺し方が分からない時は、大回りして逃げるようにしている。以前、携帯電話用の電波塔から辺りを偵察していた時、遠くに燃える目玉を見たんだ。ダリウスが居なかったら、私は頂上から落ちていただろうね。あんなことがあってからは、選択の余地がない場合を除いて、こんな状況で旅をする奴は頭がちょっとイカれてるんだと思うようになったよ。知らない化け物に出会った時は、振り返らずとにかくペダルを漕ぐ。現時点では、自転車で逃げきれないような奴には出くわしていない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"That's a tougher question than you might think.  I've had quite the life.  "
"My dad was a mechanic, and when I was young I used to help around the shop "
"quite a bit.  I started out thinking I was going to get into that line of "
"work, but then I got sidetracked and wound up getting into computers and "
"electrical work for a long time.  Did part of an electrical engineering "
"degree, then decided it wasn't for me and quit that.  Spent a bit of time "
"doing freelance electrical and programming work, then got recruited by a "
"startup that was designing and programming medical equipment.  I was "
"supposed to be a general technician, but through a weird series of events I "
"wound up in sales, then management.  I hated management, and I'd made a big "
"nest egg from my share stock, so I cashed out and tried to retire young.  "
"That was a dumb move, I was bored as hell, so I finished off my degree and "
"started doing on-call teaching work for shop, computers, math, and things "
"like that at a college and high school level.  Just part time, and I spent "
"the rest of my time outdoors, hiking and whatnot."
msgstr ""
"それは、君が思ってる以上にこたえるのが難しい質問だ。色々あった半生だ。父は整備士で、私は幼い頃から店の手伝いをしていた。最初は父と同じ道を歩もうと思っていたんだけど、何故か脱線して、コンピュータと電気関係の業界に長く携わることになったんだ。電気工学の学位も取ったんだが、自分には向いてないと思って生業にはしなかった。フリーランスで電気工事やプログラミング関係の仕事をちょっとした後、医療機器の設計とプログラミングが専門のスタートアップ企業に採用された。技術者として雇われる筈が、ひょんなことから営業職員を経て管理職になった。そこで経営業務が嫌になったことや株で儲けたことが重なって、若いうちにリタイアしようと思い立ったんだ。馬鹿げた考えだね。退職したら退屈で死にそうだったから、学位を取得して、大学生や高校生に工作やコンピュータ、数学なんかを教える非常勤講師をやるようになった。この仕事はパートタイムだったから、空いた時間はハイキングや野外活動を楽しんでいたよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"That is one hell of a life.  You must have some useful skills to teach."
msgstr "すごい人生経験だ。役に立つスキルをぜひ教わりたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to.  I can't spare a lot of free time, but for a little trade, "
"I'll tell you about whatever I can help with."
msgstr "喜んで。あまり時間はないが、多少の見返りを貰えるなら教えるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, but that's all I have time for at the moment.  Darius is waiting "
"outside."
msgstr "申し訳ない、あまり時間がないんだ。ダリウスを外で待たせているからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Sure, let's talk trade."
msgstr "分かった、早速詳しい話を聞こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "I'll bear that in mind.  What did you say you were doing here?"
msgstr "覚えておこう。ところで、あなたはここで何をしているんだって？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "Thanks, I'll think about it.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "ありがとう、考えておくよ。さっきの話は何だったかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
msgid "I might take you up on that, but for now I've gotta go."
msgstr "今後お世話になるかもしれないな。もう行かないと。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/missiondef_free_merchants.json
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach Refugee Center"
msgstr "避難センターへ向かう"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Full"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "This beggar in the refugee center has had something to eat recently."
msgstr "この避難センターの物乞いは、最近食べ物にありつきました。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Hungry beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Reena Sandhu"
msgstr "ﾘｰﾅ ｻﾝﾄﾞｩ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Hungry beggar in the refugee center.
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ Schizophrenic beggar in the refugee center.
#. ~ Angry beggar in the refugee center.
#. ~ Sickly beggar in the refugee center.
#. ~ Mutant beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "beggar"
msgstr "物乞い"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ All the beggars have been camping inside the evac shelter because they're
#. too weak and unskilled to make it on their own.
#. ~ This is the only beggar with some skills, sort of the leader.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Beggar"
msgstr "物乞い"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"So, any luck with convincing the others to come on your crazy adventure yet?"
msgstr "他の人も説得して、愉快な仲間に加えられたか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say it after all you've done for me, but… I don't suppose "
"you've got anything to eat?"
msgstr "こんな事を言ってしまうのは申し訳ないが...あなたが十分な食料を持っているとは思えないな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Thank you again.  I really appreciate the food."
msgstr "いつもありがとう。本当に感謝しているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Please, help me.  I need food.  Aren't you their sheriff?  Can't you help "
"me?"
msgstr "頼む、助けてくれ。食料が必要なんだ。執行官なんだろう？手伝ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Please, help me.  I need food."
msgstr "頼む、助けてくれ。食料が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I've talked to the others, and they're all willing to come.  So, you joining"
" us?"
msgstr "他の人と話したが、皆喜んでついてくると言っていた。あなたも参加しないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Hey, here, I might have some food for you.  Let me check."
msgstr "やあ、そうだな、食べ物を渡せるかもしれない。確認してみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Get away from me."
msgstr "近寄るな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"They won't let me in.  They say they're too full.  I'm allowed to camp out "
"here as long as I keep it clean and don't make a fuss, but I'm reduced to "
"begging to survive."
msgstr "中には入れてもらえないよ。もう満員だそうだ。きちんと清潔にして騒ぎを起こさないことを条件に、ここで寝泊まりを許されているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"They won't let me in.  They say they're too full.  I'm allowed to camp out "
"here as long as I keep it clean and don't make a fuss, but I'm so hungry."
msgstr ""
"中に入れてもらえないんだ。もう満員だって言われてさ。ここを汚さず大騒ぎしないなら、寝泊りしていいとは言われたんだ。でも、ものすごくお腹が空いてるんだよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Why don't you scavenge your own food?"
msgstr "どうして食べ物を探しに行かないんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I might have some food for you.  Let me check."
msgstr "食べ物を渡せるかもしれない。確認してみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I've got some more food, if you want it."
msgstr "もし欲しいなら、もっと食べ物を持っているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I can't help you."
msgstr "悪いが、助けにはなれない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Thank you so much."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Can I ask you something else first?"
msgstr "まずは何か他の話をしない？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I was wrong.  I can't help you."
msgstr "ごめん、勘違いだった。助けてあげられないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Here, you can have this <topic_item>."
msgstr "ほら、<topic_item>をどうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "This is wonderful of you, I really appreciate it."
msgstr "本当にありがたい、心から感謝するよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "No problem.  See you around."
msgstr "気にするな。また会おう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Where else?  I can't fight those things out there.  I'm in terrible physical"
" condition, don't have any useful skills, and I'm terrified of <zombies> and"
" violence.  How am I supposed to find a safe place?"
msgstr ""
"移るってどこへ？野外で戦うなんて無理だ。体調も最悪だし、有用な技能もまったく持ってないし、何より<zombies>と暴力が怖い。どうやって安全な場所を見つけろって言うんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Come with me.  Maybe you're not the greatest adventurer, but it's better "
"than living here."
msgstr "私と一緒に行こう。あなたは最高の冒険者ではないかもしれないけど、ここに住み続けるよりはマシだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  You could come there.  There "
"aren't many people left, we could use anyone regardless of skills."
msgstr "外に自分の拠点を作っているんだ。そこに来ればいい。生存者はそれほど多くない。スキルに関係なく、仲間が増えるのは歓迎するよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Out there?  That's suicide!  People that go out there don't come back, "
"people who can hold their own… unlike me.  I'd rather take my chances "
"begging for scraps and waiting for someone in the center to die and make "
"room for me, thanks."
msgstr ""
"他の場所へ行く？自殺行為だ！有能な奴らは出掛けていって誰も帰ってこないし、私には自分の住処もない。ここで物乞いを続けながら、センターで誰かが死んで空き部屋ができるのを待っていた方がましさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  Maybe you can't scavenge, but we "
"can use any warm bodies that can lift a tool.  You'd be safer and better fed"
" there."
msgstr ""
"外に自分の拠点を作っているんだ。あなたに物資の収集は無理かもしれないけど、道具さえ持てるなら、生きている人間は歓迎するよ。ここより安全だし、食料も十分ある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I was a high school math teacher.  It was a good job, I loved it.  Funny "
"enough, it's not super applicable after the end of the world.  I mean, at "
"some point people are going to need a teacher again, but right now they just"
" want food, shelter, and clothing."
msgstr ""
"私は高校の数学教師だ。いい職場だったよ。仕事を愛していた。笑えることに、大変動後の世界では全く役に立たない仕事だけどね。つまり、今後再び教師が必要になる時期は来るだろうけど、現状では、食べ物と避難場所と服のほうが大事ってことさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  Maybe they can't use your skills "
"here, but I could."
msgstr "外に自分の拠点を作っているんだ。センターの人間はあなたの能力を生かせないけど、私なら仕事を見つけられる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"That's a kind offer of you, but I think I'd rather take my chances here than"
" risking it out there again.  I remember <the_cataclysm>, I'm not in any "
"hurry to face that again."
msgstr ""
"親切な申し出はありがたいが、また危険な目に遭うよりは、ここでチャンスを待ち続けていたいんだ。<the_cataclysm>の光景が忘れられない、あんなのはもうたくさんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"That's quite the offer, but I don't think I'd survive the trip.  I don't "
"think you realize how useless I am in this world."
msgstr "ありがたい申し出だけど、私はきっと旅を続けられない。私がどれだけ役立たずなのか分かっていないようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I'm too hungry to make a big decision like that."
msgstr "悪いけど、腹が減っていて正常な判断ができそうにないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I can keep you safe.  I'll take you there myself."
msgstr "安全は保障する。目的地までちゃんと連れて行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Let's talk about something else then."
msgstr "何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate everything you've done for me, but I don't think you get"
" it.  I can't go out there.  I will die.  I know it's horrible camping out "
"here, but I just can't face that nightmare again."
msgstr ""
"そんな提案をしてくれて本当にありがたいけど、できっこないよ。きっとたどり着けない。死んでしまう。ここでの暮らしが酷いものだってことは分かってるけど、また外で怖い目に遭うのはごめんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "I hope you'll reconsider eventually.  Bye."
msgstr "考え直してくれることを願っているよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to"
" provide food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, "
"I'll tell you what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've "
"been through way too much together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and "
"Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"そうだな...そこへ行けば生き残れるし、食べ物もある。ここよりも豊かな生活ができるだろう。分かった、じゃあこうしよう。ここの友人たちが行かないのなら、私もここに留まる。もしあなたがルオ、ブランドン、ユウスケの3人を説得出来たら、私も一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "OK.  For now let's talk about something else."
msgstr "分かった。とりあえずは、他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "OK, I'll talk to them too."
msgstr "分かった。彼らを説得してみる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "All right!  Let's get going."
msgstr "わかったよ！さあ行こう。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Schizophrenic beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Dino Dave"
msgstr "ﾃﾞｨﾉ ﾃﾞｲﾌﾞ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "We've done it!  We've solved the list!"
msgstr "やった！リストが全部埋まった！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"How's things with you?  My cardboard collection is getting quite impressive."
msgstr "調子はどう？私の段ボールコレクションはかなり良い感じだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Have I told you about cardboard, friend?  Do you have any?"
msgstr "段ボールの事は話したか？君、段ボールは持っているか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "About that shopping list of yours…"
msgstr "買い物リストについて..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can do for you?"
msgstr "他に何かできる事はあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What are you going to do with all that cardboard now?"
msgstr "これからその段ボール箱をどうするつもりだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"We've done it, Dave!  Smokes says you can build yourself a house up on the "
"roof if you want.  You've got to keep it nice and clean, and help out the "
"people down here by looking out for zombies, but you can still use the "
"washrooms and things downstairs when you need to.  What do you say?"
msgstr ""
"おめでとう、デイブ！屋上に家を作ってもいいと、スモークから許可をもらえた。ちゃんと掃除すること、他の人のためにゾンビを見張る仕事をすること、という条件付きで、必要ならトイレなどの共用設備は使ってもいいそうだ。どうする？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Cardboard?"
msgstr "段ボール？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Why are you sitting out here?"
msgstr "どうしてこんな所に座っているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Are you seriously wearing a dinosaur costume?"
msgstr "その恐竜の着ぐるみは何の冗談だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Do you need something to eat?"
msgstr "何か食べる物が必要か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh nice.  Crunchings and munchings.  That's a cool, a cool thing."
msgstr "それはありがたい。ぜひいただくよ。いいね、すごく良い。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see "
"you're not like that."
msgstr "ああ、すごくお腹が空いていたけど、奴らは大抵の食べ物に毒を入れているからな。君はそんなことしないって信じているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Actually can I ask you something else?"
msgstr "他のことを聞いてもいいか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I can tell when it has stuff in it, it's got a sandy texture.  But this "
"doesn't.  Thanks again."
msgstr "毒が入ってるものは、砂っぽいからすぐ分かる。でもこれは大丈夫だ。ありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I'm building a house out of cardboard.  The sandman doesn't want me to, but "
"I told him to go fuck himself."
msgstr "段ボールで家を建てている。砂男には好かれていないようだが、私も奴に言ってやったんだ、失せろってね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Why cardboard?"
msgstr "どうして段ボールなんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "The sandman?"
msgstr "砂男とは何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Would you like me to give you some cardboard?"
msgstr "段ボールが必要か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I think I have to get going…"
msgstr "もうそろそろ行かないと..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"There's so much of it now, and the zombies are afraid of it.  It's kept me "
"safe so far.  The beta rays come from the center point of the zombie, so it "
"hits the cardboard and can't penetrate.  The reflection can stop any further"
" damage."
msgstr ""
"たくさん手に入るからな。それにゾンビ除けになる。段ボールのお陰で今まで無事だったんだ。ゾンビの核から放射されるベータ線を段ボールが反射してくれる。そうやってダメージを防いでいるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Kind of a question's that?  Yeah man, you got cardboard, I got a whole… a "
"whole shopping list.  Got it here."
msgstr "そんな質問か？ああもちろん、段ボールがあるなら、ここの、買い物リストに載ってる全部が欲しい。譲ってくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What's next on the list?"
msgstr "リストには何が必要と書いてあるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If you don't know who he is, I definitely can't tell you.  He talks to "
"everyone, if you didn't hear him that means you can't be trusted, except to "
"help me out."
msgstr ""
"誰か知らないなら、絶対に教えられない。奴は皆に話しかけるから、奴のことを知らない者は、信用できない。でも、私の仕事を手伝ってくれるなら話は別だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "…What were you saying before?"
msgstr "...さっきの話をもう一度聞かせて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These cowards are afraid of me.  They won't let me into their base.  I'm "
"going to build my new house and I won't let them in."
msgstr "あの臆病者どもは私を恐れているんだ。私を拠点内に入れようとしない。だから私は自分で家を建てる。もちろん奴らは絶対に中に入れてやらない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "You said you were building a house?"
msgstr "確か家を建てていると言っていたな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "No."
msgstr "いいえ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I… I can see you wearing it.  Why are you wearing that?"
msgstr "その...着ている服について聞きたい。どうしてそんな恰好なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "What was that about cardboard?"
msgstr "段ボールの話は何だっけ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"You ask me what I can see, but I don't tell you what you see.  Sometimes we "
"have shields up, to protect ourselves."
msgstr "君は私の格好について尋ねてきたが、私は君の格好について尋ねたりしない。自分を守るための盾が必要なこともあるのだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Well… I had it all pretty together, "
msgstr "ううん...一通りやることはやってしまった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "but the others have left, and "
msgstr "他の人も去っていったし、"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "and I feel bad with all the help you've given me already, but "
msgstr "君にはよく世話になってるから、申し訳ない気持ちでいっぱいだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"now the masters won't let me build my sanctuary.  I know I can't build it in"
" here, they wouldn't allow it.  They won't listen to me when I ask for a "
"safe place.  They just want me to disappear, like the others.  Can you help "
"me figure them out?"
msgstr ""
"マスターが聖域を作らせてくれないんだ。ここに作るのは無理だ。許可が貰えない。安全な場所が欲しいけど、話を聞いてもらえない。他の人のように早く消えてなくなれと思っているんだ。なんとか分かってもらえるよう、手を貸してもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Why don't you leave this place?  Come with me, I could use some help out "
"there."
msgstr "どうしてここに留まるんだ？私と一緒に来て、手伝ってほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Sure, Dave.  One last favor, I think I can talk to Smokes about finding you "
"a place to go."
msgstr "もちろんだ、デイブ。最後の願いは、あなたの居場所のことだな。スモークに掛け合ってみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll have to think on that, Dave, I've done a lot already."
msgstr "デイブ、よく考えてみると、もう散々手伝ってあげたよな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"The roof!  So high!  So lofty!  I can hardly believe it!  This will be a "
"nicer house than I had before everything went funny.  I can watch out, I'm "
"happy to do that.  And it'll be nice to still have a bathroom!  Come see me "
"there, my friend.  I will not disappoint you."
msgstr ""
"屋上！高い！とても高い！信じられない。全部がおかしくなる前に住んでいた家よりも、うんと素敵な家だ。外も眺められるなんて、幸せだ。バスルームまで使える！また会いに来てほしいな。歓迎するよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll see you on the rooftop.  Good luck, Dave."
msgstr "また屋上へ会いに来るよ。デイブ、頑張って。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"No!  I just got everything together.  I am not leaving, not now.  "
"Everything's finally coming together!"
msgstr "嫌だ！せっかく準備が整ったのに。ここを出て行くものか。まだその時じゃない。全部揃ったんだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Well, OK then, Dave.  One last favor, I think I can talk to Smokes about "
"finding you a place to go."
msgstr "そうだな、分かった、デイブ。最後の願いは、あなたの居場所のことだな。スモークに掛け合ってみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'll have to think on it, Dave, I've done a lot already."
msgstr "デイブ、よく考えてみると、もう散々手伝ってあげたよな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
msgstr "40個の段ボール箱Sを持ってくる"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I "
"could use 'em."
msgstr "小さな仕事からこなすか？小さな物を守るための小さな箱が必要だ。持ってきてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I "
"could use 'em.  I need a bunch of 'em.  Little ones, you know?  Can you "
"bring me like… like… forty?"
msgstr ""
"小さな仕事からこなすか？小さな物を守るための小さな箱が必要だ。持ってきてくれ。たくさん欲しい。小さな物、分かるか？ええっと...そうだな...40個くらい欲しいかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh man, thanks so much my friend.  You won't regret it."
msgstr "ああ、友よ、ありがとう。後悔はさせないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I didn't think so."
msgstr "そう言われるとは思わなかったな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Watch out, he's looking for it too."
msgstr "気をつけろ、奴らも同じものを探しているぞ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Got the little ones yet?"
msgstr "小さな箱はあった？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh this is so great, so great!"
msgstr "ああ、素晴らしい、素晴らしいよ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 40 small cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh, that's too bad.  Guess they're eating it all."
msgstr "ああ、なんてことだ。奴らが全部食べてしまったに違いない。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
msgstr "ダクトテープを200単位持ってくる"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These ones are good, good ones.  They need something to, you know, bind them"
" together.  Surround them, light side, dark side."
msgstr "これは良い、とても良いぞ。他に、足りないものは、そう、貼り合わせるものか。ライトサイドとダークサイドを、囲むんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"These ones are good, good ones.  They need something to, you know, bind them"
" together.  Surround them, light side, dark side.  Bring me the Force!"
msgstr "これは良い、とても良いぞ。他に、足りないものは、そう、貼り合わせるものか。ライトサイドとダークサイドを、囲むんだ。力を貸してくれ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring a roll of duct tape (200 charges)"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "It's all around us… but did you get it in a crude matter form?"
msgstr "そこら中にある...けど、そのままの状態で持ってきてくれるかな？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
msgstr "10個の段ボール箱Mを持ってくる"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Ten bigger ones now please.  The list doesn't lie.  You've done so well."
msgstr "さっきより大きい奴を10個持ってきてくれ。リストは嘘をつかない。君はできる奴だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Ten bigger ones now please.  The list doesn't lie.  You've done so well.  I "
"got a little more on the list, but we're more than half there."
msgstr "さっきより大きい奴を10個持ってきてくれ。リストは嘘をつかない。君はできる奴だ。リストに載っている物は他にもあるが、仕事の半分は済んだよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Any luck?  Bigger ones?"
msgstr "あるだろう？さっきより大きい奴だぞ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "I'm so happy now!"
msgstr "すごく幸せだ！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
msgstr "10個のビニールシートを持ってくる"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If I can set it up in here I won't need it, but they might drive me out, so "
"I guess I need some plastic just in case.  I don't like it, the sandman can "
"smell through plastic, but I think the cardboard is stronger."
msgstr "ここに家を作るなら必要ないものだが、奴らに追い出されるかもしれないから、念のためビニールの奴が必要かもな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"If I can set it up in here I won't need it, but they might drive me out, so "
"I guess I need some plastic just in case.  I don't like it, the sandman can "
"smell through plastic, but I think the cardboard is stronger.  Please bring "
"me some plastic sheets."
msgstr ""
"ここに家を作るなら必要ないものだけど、奴らに追い出されるかもしれないから、念のためビニールの奴が必要かもしれない。砂男はビニール越しに臭いを嗅ぎ取れるからあまり好きじゃないんだけどな。段ボールが一番強いんだ。とにかく、ビニールシートが必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "We're almost there, now."
msgstr "さあ、もうすぐ完成だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "They keep a lot of this stuff in hardware stores and lumber yards."
msgstr "こういう物は工具店や材木置き場に保管してある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I really feel bad sending you on this one, it's dangerous.  Have you found "
"anything?"
msgstr "この仕事を君に任せるのは嫌な予感がする、危険だ。何か見つけたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Nice, this will do perfectly!"
msgstr "よし、これで完璧だ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 large plastic sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh, that's too bad."
msgstr "ああ、残念だよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
msgstr "5個の段ボール箱Lを持ってくる"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"This is the last thing I need from you.  I've been collecting the other "
"parts myself, it's been easier with more cardboard around.  Can you bring me"
" five more really big cardboard boxes?"
msgstr "これが君に頼む最後の仕事だ。他の部品は自力で集めてきた。段ボール箱に囲まれていれば簡単さ。大きな段ボール箱を5つ持ってきてもらえるかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"This is the last thing I need from you.  I've been collecting the other "
"parts myself, it's been easier with more cardboard around.  Can you bring me"
" five more really big cardboard boxes?  Five more cardboard boxes, as big as"
" it gets.  I have a few already stored up, that should be all I need."
msgstr ""
"これが君に頼む最後の仕事だ。他の部品は自力で集めてきた。段ボール箱に囲まれていれば簡単さ。大きな段ボール箱を5つ持ってきてもらえるかな？すごく大きな段ボール箱だ。必要なものはほとんど揃った。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Yes!  The home stretch!"
msgstr "よし！ゴールは目前だ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Oh man, but we're so close!"
msgstr "何てことだ、もう少しだったのに！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Try looking in cargo storage areas."
msgstr "荷物を保管する場所を探してみよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Did you bring me those last few boxes?"
msgstr "最後の段ボール箱はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Brilliant!  You're a true hero.  I'll see if I can find a place to set these"
" up now."
msgstr "素晴らしい！君こそが真の英雄だ。すぐに設置場所を見繕ってくるよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 5 large cardboard boxes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "No!  Oh god, no, this can't be happening…"
msgstr "止めろ！嘘だ、こんな、こんなことになるなんて..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to call home."
msgstr "デイブの居場所についてスモークに相談する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I have it, I have it all, but I can't find a place to put it.  Will you ask "
"the masters?  Maybe?  I've tried but they ignore me."
msgstr "こんなに、こんなに溜めたのに、置き場所がないんだ。マスターに聞いてみてもらえないか？どうだろう？私も聞いてはみたけど、無視された。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"I have it, I have it all, but I can't find a place to put it.  Will you ask "
"the masters?  Maybe?  I've tried but they ignore me.  I just need a place to"
" put it all, a place I can be safe, and not make anyone upset."
msgstr ""
"こんなに、こんなに溜めたのに、置き場所がないんだ。マスターに聞いてみてもらえないか？どうだろう？私も聞いてはみたけど、無視された。安全で、誰にも迷惑を掛けない場所が、必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Thank you!  I'm sorry, I thought we were done, but we can do this!"
msgstr "ありがとう！もうダメだと思っていたけど、きっと大丈夫だ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Maybe somewhere they can't see me?  Where I can just be me?"
msgstr "誰の邪魔にもならない場所ってどこだ？自分が自分でいられる場所ってどこだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Did you ask the masters?"
msgstr "マスターに聞いてくれたか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"The roof!  So high!  So lofty!  Come see me there, my friend.  I will not "
"disappoint you."
msgstr "屋上！高い！本当に高い！また会いに来てほしいな。歓迎するよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to
#. call home."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Power Storage CBM"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't understand."
msgstr "意味が分からない。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "insulted_luo"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Insulted"
msgstr "侮辱"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Insulted"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Oh, you went there."
msgstr "あぁ、やってしまいましたね。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Angry beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Luo Meizhen"
msgstr "ﾙｵ ﾒｲﾂｪﾝ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "失せろ、クソったれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Yo.  Anyone else keen on moving from this bus stop to your tent city?"
msgstr "よぉ。ここのバス停からあんたのテント街に引っ越したがる奴は見つかったか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "やあ、また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Careful, I'm getting hangry again and am not totally responsible for my own "
"actions."
msgstr "気をつけろ、また腹が減ってきた。自分の行動に責任が持てそうにない状況だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"おい、前はキレてしまって申し訳ない。あんたはクソったれかも知れんが、誤解があったのかもしれない。血糖値がどん底なんだ。キレやすくなってる。分かったか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "やぁ、クソったれじゃない奴。また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Don't bother with these assholes."
msgstr "そこのろくでなし共は放っておけ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I might have some food for you.  Are you hungry?"
msgstr "食べ物ならあるかもしれない。空腹なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "We're cool.  Sorry for insulting you earlier."
msgstr "分かった。さっきは侮辱して悪かったよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I found a sample of alien fungus for you."
msgstr "真菌のサンプルを持ってきた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Ok… see ya."
msgstr "そうだな...さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Actually yeah, I'm always hungry these days.  I don't like taking handouts, "
"but I wouldn't say no."
msgstr "実は、ここの所ずっと腹が減っているんだ。施しを受けるのは好きじゃないが、背に腹は代えられない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks, I really appreciate this."
msgstr "ありがとう。本当に感謝している。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "They're 'too full'.  Won't share fuck-all."
msgstr "奴らは「持ち過ぎ」なんだ。共有の精神が欠けている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why are you living here then?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなところで寝泊まりしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Well, they might not share, but I can.  Are you hungry?"
msgstr "そうだな、センターの人間は共有したがらないようだが、私は違う。空腹なのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Even without them helping, it's the safest place to squat.  As long as we "
"keep it clean up here and don't cause sanitation problems, they don't mind "
"us sitting around the entryway.  So kind and generous of them, to let us sit"
" here and slowly starve."
msgstr ""
"彼らの助けがなくたって、ここに座っているのが一番安全さ。ゴミを放置して衛生問題を引き起こさない限りは、玄関口に座っていても追い出されないんだ。ここでゆっくりと飢えていく私を放っておいてくれるなんて、何と親切で寛大な奴らなんだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh, same old story at first.  I got evacuated on to the local concentration "
"center, then picked up on a repurposed school bus and dragged out here.  "
"Then the chick processing me to get in saw my name and Chinese name and "
"conveniently 'lost' my paperwork.  I was sent out here to wait for further "
"processing, while I watched busloads of people get processed and taken in.  "
"By the time they 'found' it, the place was full up, wouldn't ya know it.  "
"Now I'm stuck out here and they won't consider letting me in."
msgstr ""
"まぁ、最初はよくある昔話さ。地元の収容所みたいな場所に集められた後、スクールバスに乗せられて、ここに連れて来られたんだ。入場手続をしていた若造は、私の中国人名を見たあと、都合よく手続書類を「失くした」とのたまった。ここで事務処理を待つよう言われて、バスに満載されていた避難者の列がどんどん短くなっていくのを見ていた。手続書類が「見つかった」時には、案の定、センターは満員になっていた。そういう経緯で私はここに立ち往生しているが、奴らは私を入れようともしないって訳だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "You think you were treated like that because of your race?"
msgstr "人種が原因でそんな扱いを受けたと思っているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Does that mean you were part of that back room evacuation I heard about?"
msgstr "それでは、あなたはここの奥にあるという部屋に避難していたってことか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Why stay out here then?"
msgstr "どうしてここに留まり続けるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp of my own, away from here.  No paperwork required.  Want to "
"come?"
msgstr "外に自分の拠点を作っているんだ。入るのに事務手続きは必要ない。一緒に来るか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, that was a hell of a shitstorm.  We were waiting back there for "
"'processing' for hours and hours, with the sick and wounded.  One guy died, "
"we all thought he was sleeping until he got back up.  That started a panic, "
"gunshots in a closed area, that kind of stuff.  In just a few minutes, a "
"bunch more people were dead.  Then the assholes called it an 'outbreak' and "
"tried to barricade us in… took us way too long to convince the panicking "
"guards that we were alive and needed to get out.  I'll give the one guy "
"credit, Sean: when he found out they'd locked living people in with zombies,"
" he came in himself, as some of the newly dead were starting to get back up,"
" and he held them off for us to escape.  That… that was probably the only "
"actual good thing I've seen since before the end of the world: he owned his "
"error and he put himself in harm's way to make up for it.  Massive respect "
"to that guy.  So, of course, he's a zombie now.  Fuck, thanks for reminding "
"me of all that sunny fun."
msgstr ""
"ああそうだ、酷い状況だったよ。私も含め病気やケガがある人達は、何時間も「手続き」を待っていた。その時男が一人死んだが、皆は眠っているだけだと思っていた。死んだはずの男が立ち上がったからパニックが起こり、部屋の中で銃を撃った奴もいた。ほんの数分で、犠牲者は増えた。どこかのバカが「集団感染」だと叫び、私たちを閉じ込めようとした。生存者を外に出すよう警備員を説得するのは骨が折れたよ。警備員のショーンは信用に値する奴だった。生存者をゾンビと一緒に閉じ込めてしまったと気づいた時、彼は自分も死んでゾンビになる覚悟を決め、私たちが逃げる時間を稼いだんだ。あれは...たぶん私の人生で遭遇したこれ以上ない真の善行だろう。彼は自分の過ちを認め、それを償うために囮になったんだ。尊敬するよ。だが、もちろん今は、彼もゾンビだ。クソッ、素敵な記憶を思い出させてくれてありがとうよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sorry for bringing it up. What were you saying?"
msgstr "辛いことを思い出させてしまったな。以前言っていた話をもう一度聞かせてもらるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Sure.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously personally"
" responsible for all this.  Do you think there's some other reason they let "
"hundreds of other educated people in and I'm sitting out here?"
msgstr ""
"もちろん。祖父母は中国出身だ。この扱いは明らかに当てつけだ。他の何百人もの教養ある人間を中に入れて私がここに座っている理由が他にあると思うか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I don't care if you're Chinese.  You can travel with me if you want."
msgstr "私は中国人かどうかなんて気にしない。もし良かったら私と一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I mean, racism could definitely be a part of it… but you are visibly in poor"
" shape.  They need strong survivor material."
msgstr "まぁ、人種差別も原因の一つかもしれないが...あなたは目に見えて体調不良だ。センターは身体が丈夫な人材を求めているんだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"That's awful kind of you, but look at me.  I'm not traveling material, I've "
"managed to stay fifty pounds overweight on a diet of pine nuts and wilted "
"rhubarb, and I scream and shake uncontrollably at the sight of blood."
msgstr ""
"何とも親切な申し出だが、私をよく見ろ。旅ができるような人間じゃない。松の実としおれたルバーブを食べてダイエットして、ようやく標準体重の22kgオーバーで済んでいたんだ。それに、血を見ると叫び声を上げてしまうし震えが止まらなくなる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It'd be temporary.  I have a base set up.  There are only a few of us "
"survivors left, we need to work together"
msgstr "克服できるさ。拠点を作っているんだ。仲間の生存者もまだ少ないし、一緒に手伝ってほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Okay, yeah, that's a bit of a problem.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "なるほど、そうだな、ちょっと聞きたいことがある。さっきの話は何だったかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It may not be much, but we've got a little community.  We can't live like "
"this forever, but we're safer than out there, and we look out for each "
"other.  One way or another we'll shake things out to something better."
msgstr ""
"それほど大規模じゃないが、私にも仲間がいる。こんな生活は永遠には続かないだろうが、安全だし、お互いに面倒を見られる。何とかして、物事をいい方向に持っていこうとしているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "You sound more optimistic than usual."
msgstr "普段より楽観的なもの言いだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "So, about that doctorate of yours…"
msgstr "博士号を持っていると聞いたんだけど..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong, I hate this place and this situation, and especially the"
" selfish racist fucks that landed me here… but these other losers that "
"landed out here with me?  I like them.  We might be miserable, but we're "
"miserable together."
msgstr ""
"誤解しないでほしいが、私はこの場所も状況も嫌いだ。特に、私をここに連れてきた勝手なクソ人種差別主義者は...だが、私と一緒にここにいる負け組達は？私はここの皆が好きだ。たしかに惨めな境遇だが、ここではみんなそうさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to"
" die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* "
"after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy "
"lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"オイオイオイ。言っちゃいけないことを言ったな。デブは見殺しにしよう、って？大変動の後でクソ*甲状腺ホルモン剤*なんて簡単に見つかると思うか？しかも、私は重いものを持つ以上に今必要とされる技術を持って...まあいい、あんたに何が分かる？くだらない。あんたと話しても時間の無駄だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Thanks for saying it.  So, what brings you around?"
msgstr "そう言ってくれると助かる。で、何の話をする？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Just wanted to get square.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "ちゃんと謝っておきたかっただけだ。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Tempting offer, but I don't know how much I trust a random stranger offering"
" me a place to live.  Call me crazy."
msgstr "魅力的な申し出だけど、住む場所を提供してくれる赤の他人をどれだけ信用したものか分からない。おかしな奴だと思ってるだろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Oh, come on.  I'm not a random stranger anymore, I brought you that crazy "
"mushroom didn't I?"
msgstr "おいおい。私はあなたにイカレたキノコを持ってきてあげたんだし、もう赤の他人じゃないだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"What better choice do you have?  It's not like it would be just you and me, "
"the others out here can come too."
msgstr "他に良い方法があるか？あなただけじゃない。ここにいる他の人も一緒に来ればいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, sorry, it's just not happening.  It's not that I don't trust "
"you, it's just that I don't really trust you."
msgstr "前にも言ったが、悪いけど、できないよ。あんたが信頼できない訳じゃないが、心から信じられるとは言えない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Aw damn, I was worried you'd say that.  Okay, listen: you've got yourself a "
"deal.  I'll come to your base, but you've gotta get me hooked up with a "
"microscope as soon as you can.  This could be the beginning of something "
"really cool.  Oh, and it should go without saying that I'm not coming unless"
" you can find a place for my friends here in your base.  I'm sure you "
"anticipated that.  Talk them into going and I'm in.  It should be easy, "
"they're a bunch of sweet hearted saps."
msgstr ""
"畜生、そう言うだろうなと思ってたんだ。よし、あんたは私がすぐ拠点の仲間に加わると思っているだろう。だが、まずは顕微鏡を用意して、すぐに研究に取り掛かれるようにしないとダメだ。これは世紀の大発見の第一歩かもしれん。ああ、それと、もちろん拠点にはここにいる友人たちの居場所も用意してもらわないと困る。この要望は予想通りかもしれんがな。友人たちを説得したら、私も加わろう。簡単な仕事だ、あいつらは人が良いからな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well, before <the_cataclysm> ended I was working at a university bookstore."
"  I know a little bit about a lot of things, I guess you could say.  I kinda"
" loved the job, to be honest."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、<the_cataclysm>の前は大学内の本屋で働いていた。色々な物事を広く浅く知っていた、とも言えるな。ある意味では、心から仕事を愛していた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"What had you working at the university bookstore in the first place?  Are "
"you an academic yourself?"
msgstr "そもそも、大学の本屋で何の仕事をしていたんだ？学者だったのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "What's this I hear about you having a doctorate?"
msgstr "博士号を持っていると聞いたんだけど、どうなんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah, it's all very glamorous.  Sure, I trained in the great ivory "
"tower, got my PhD in mycology.  Did my dissertation on signaling pathways in"
" hyphae formation, and a postdoc in plant-fungus communication in rhizomes."
"  Then I got the job at the bookstore because there wasn't a ton of work for"
" a doctor of mycology, although I'd had a few nibbles before things really "
"got crazy.  Now, people are just breaking down my door to get my sweet sweet"
" knowledge of mold to help them fight the incoming zombie threat."
msgstr ""
"あぁ、あぁ、本当にワクワクする仕事さ。確かに、私は素晴らしい象牙の塔で学問を修め、菌類学の博士号を取得した。菌糸形成におけるシグナル伝達経路についての論文を書き、博士になってからは根茎による植物-"
"真菌間コミュニケーションについて研究していたんだ。そして本屋に就職した。菌類学者を雇う企業なんてほとんどなかったから、平和だった頃も貧乏生活だったよ。そして今、私には押し寄せるゾンビの脅威と戦うのに役立つとっておきの知識があり、それを求めて人々が我先にと集まってくるって寸法だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Do you know about the fungal zombies though?"
msgstr "真菌ゾンビを知っているか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Heh.  Yeah, that was a great use of my time.  As you can see it really "
"helped my employment prospects.  Yeah, I have a PhD in mycology.  Did my "
"dissertation on signaling pathways in hyphae formation, and a postdoc in "
"plant-fungus communication in rhizomes.  Then I got the job at the bookstore"
" because there wasn't a ton of work for a doctor of mycology, although I'd "
"had a few nibbles before things really got crazy.  Now, people are just "
"breaking down my door to get my sweet sweet knowledge of mold to help them "
"fight the incoming zombie threat."
msgstr ""
"はは。そうだな、有効な時間の使い方だったよ。そのお陰で、働き口が見つかったようなものさ。確かに、私は菌類学の博士号を持っている。菌糸形成におけるシグナル伝達経路についての論文を書き、博士になってからは根茎による植物-"
"真菌間コミュニケーションについて研究していたんだ。そして本屋に就職した。菌類学者を雇う企業なんてほとんどなかったから、平和だった頃も貧乏生活だったよ。そして今、私には押し寄せるゾンビの脅威と戦うのに役立つとっておきの知識があり、それを求めて人々が我先にと集まってくるって寸法だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"No, no I don't, and I'd appreciate you not leaving me hanging on that.  "
"There are fungal zombies?"
msgstr "いや、知らないな。詳しく聞きたい、ぜひ教えてくれ。真菌ゾンビはどんな奴だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Encroaching alien mushrooms, fungal towers, tough mycelium invading ground "
"and trees, zombies taken over by aggressive mold… Yeah.  It's ugly stuff."
msgstr "どこかから現れ世界を侵略しているキノコだ。真菌の塔、地面や木を侵食する頑丈な菌糸、ゾンビをも乗っ取って増殖する胞子...酷いものだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Okay, you've got my attention.  Listen, do you think you could bring me some"
" kind of sample of these things?"
msgstr "なるほど、興味深い話だ。なあ、ここに真菌ゾンビの組織片か何かを持ってくることは可能か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"It'd be dangerous.  What kind of benefit is there from taking a risk like "
"that?"
msgstr "危険だ。そんなリスクを冒しても、何の得もないだろう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"If you get me a sample, I'll join your crazy camp expedition.  Hell, if you "
"bring me a sample maybe I'll help you set up a lab to study this stuff.  "
"Almost anything could work, but if this stuff is as dangerous as you make it"
" sound, maybe make sure it's not a sporulating body."
msgstr ""
"もし組織片を持ってきたら、あんたの愉快なキャンプ遠征隊に参加するよ。それと、ゾンビのことを調べる研究室の建設も手伝おう。多分大丈夫だとは思うが、危険だと思ったら、胞子を形成しない個体を選んだ方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"I dunno, scientific interest?  If you don't bring me anything, no worries.  "
"I'm positively swimming in entertainment here, as you can see."
msgstr "さあね、科学的関心が満たされることか？別に何も持ってこなくても、私は困らない。見ての通り、ここらには興味深いものがたくさんあるからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "It just so happens I have a chunk of fungal matter on me right now."
msgstr "ちょうど真菌の組織片を持っていたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Sure, I'd better get going.  I'll see if I can find you something."
msgstr "分かった、そろそろ行くよ。また後でお目当ての物を持ってくる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Okay, listen: you've got yourself a deal.  I'll come to your base, but you've gotta get me hooked up with a microscope as soon as you can.  This could be the beginning of something really cool.  Oh, and it should go without saying that I'm not coming unless you can find a place for my friends here in your base.  I'm sure you anticipated that.  Talk them into going and I'm in.  It should be easy, they're a bunch of sweet hearted saps."
msgstr ""
"ほほぉう。ほうほうほう。まったく興味深い。見なよ、ここは網状組織だが、担子器が拡張して柄を形成しているようだ...しかし、実際に見てみると、今まで私が見てきたものと全く異なる繊維質だ。この種には運動性があるのだろうか？\n"
"\n"
"よし、あんたは私がすぐ拠点の仲間に加わると思っているだろう。だが、まずは顕微鏡を用意して、すぐに研究に取り掛かれるようにしないとダメだ。これは世紀の大発見の第一歩かもしれない。ああ、それと、もちろん拠点にはここにいる友人たちの居場所も用意してもらわないと困る。この要望は予想していただろう。友人たちを説得したら、私も加わろう。簡単な仕事だ、あいつらは人が良いからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Great!  I'll go see what I can do about that."
msgstr "すばらしい！できる限りのことをやってみるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well.  Well, well, well.  This is really interesting.  Look, you can see reticulations here, it looks sort of like an enlarged piece of a stipe from a basidiocarp… but look at this, these fibers are clearly unlike anything I've seen before.  I wonder if they're motile?\n"
"\n"
"Sorry.  I could stare at this all day.  I owe you one, a big one.  Thanks for this.  Let me know if you ever need a favor from a chubby beggar woman."
msgstr ""
"ほほぉう。ほうほうほう。まったく興味深い。見ろ、ここは網状組織だが、担子器が拡張して柄を形成しているようだ...しかし、実際に見てみると、今まで私が見てきたものと全く異なる繊維質だ。この種には運動性があるのだろうか？\n"
"\n"
"悪かったよ。これは一日中観察してしまいそうだ。あんたには借りを、いや、大きな借りを返すべきだ。お礼が必要だな。あんたが太った物乞い女から謝礼を受け取りたいなら、また話しておくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Glad you like it.  If I think of something you can do in return, I'll let "
"you know."
msgstr "嬉しいね。何か謝礼が欲しいと思ったら、また言うよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Well good.  Let's get going, I want to see some more of these crazy "
"mushrooms."
msgstr "良いね。行こう。イカレたキノコをもっと観察したい。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Sickly beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Brandon Garder"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗﾝﾄﾞﾝ ｶﾞｰﾀﾞｰ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Thanks again for the grub, my friend."
msgstr "友よ、食べ物をまた持ってきてくれて助かるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Hey, are you a big fan of survival of the fittest?"
msgstr "よぉ、適者生存って言葉は好きか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "どうしてそんな事を聞くんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you too, what's up?"
msgstr "ごきげんよう、調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Nice to see you.  I gotta be going though."
msgstr "ごきげんよう。悪いけどもう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Oh you know, the usual: sittin' out here until I starve to death, playin' "
"cards with Dave, that kinda thing."
msgstr "ああ、いつも通りさ。死にたくなるまでここに座って、デイブとトランプで遊ぶんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Because I sure ain't fit, so I'm sittin' out here until I starve to death.  "
"Help a poor sickly soul out?"
msgstr "私は自分が適者じゃないと分かっているから、餓死するまでここでじっとしてるんだ。貧しく病弱な人間を助けてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "I could maybe help you out… want something to eat?"
msgstr "助けになればいいんだけど...何か食べる物が必要か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "What's wrong with you?"
msgstr "何か困っているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "They won't let you in because you're sick?"
msgstr "病気に罹っているから中に入れてもらえないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "How did you even get here if you're so sick?"
msgstr "体調が悪いのに、どうやってここまで来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Why are you camped out here if they won't let you in?"
msgstr "中に入れてもらえないにしても、どうしてここで寝泊りしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "That's awful kind of you, you really are a wonderful person."
msgstr "それは素晴らしい提案だ。本当に親切な人だな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "おいおい！本当に親切な人だな？気持ちだけで十分だよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"It's good to know there are still people like you in the world, it really "
"is."
msgstr "世界には今も君みたいな人がいると分かって嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "What are you up to?"
msgstr "何をしようとしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"You name it!  Asthma, diabetes, arthritis.  Diabetes hasn't been so bad "
"since I stopped, y'know, eating regularly.  Well, I assume it hasn't.  Not "
"like I can check that ol' whatchamacallit, the blood test the docs used to "
"bug me about every couple months."
msgstr ""
"喘息、糖尿病、関節炎。全部に困ってる！糖尿病は定期的な食事ができなくなって以来、それほど問題にはなっていない。いや、問題になっていないと思いたい。チョコバーを食べるのは我慢できていたけれど、大体2か月に一回は病院で血液検査をしなければいけないのが面倒だったな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "You seem awfully happy considering the situation."
msgstr "今の状況を楽しめているようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"They got enough mouths to feed that can pull their own weight.  I got a lot "
"of weight and I'm too weak to pull it, so I'm out here."
msgstr "自分の役割を果たさない奴は中に入れてもらえないよ。私は皆の足を引っ張るし病弱だから、ここにいるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Came with a small group quite a while ago.  The others were young and fit, "
"they got in.  They were some of the last ones to get in actually.  I didn't "
"make the cutoff."
msgstr ""
"少し前に、何人かで一緒にここまで来たんだ。他の人達は若いし体格も良かったから中に入れてもらえた。入れたのはそいつらが最後だったな。私は追い返されたよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"This is a mercy.  I get shelter, light, and heat, and those guards will help"
" us if any zombies show up.  It ain't so bad.  If I was out on my own I'd "
"have none of this and still have to look for food… in other words, I'd be "
"dead as a doornail.  Or I guess undead."
msgstr ""
"十分運が良いだろ。屋根も明かりもあるし、暖も取れる。ゾンビが現れても警備の人が助けてくれる。そんなに悪くないよ。もし外へ出たら、屋根も明かりもない状態で食べ物を探さなきゃならない...使い古しの釘みたいにボロボロになってるだろうね。あるいは、動く死人の仲間入りかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"What's the alternative?  You take the hand you're dealt.  I've given "
"eulogies for two of the people I love most on this earth, and the third "
"wrote me off.  I've already been through the end of the world.  Came out the"
" other side with my bits intact.  And you know, I've been pretty lonely "
"since my wife passed.  Here I've got friends.  We might be hungry but we're "
"close.  Reena's been teaching me math and science, Luo is one of the "
"smartest folks I've ever met - she's got a doctorate you know - and Yusuke "
"is the only one here that can beat me at poker.  And Dave, well, he's Dave."
"  There's more goin' on under the surface there, mark my words.  We may be "
"unfit, but we aren't worthless."
msgstr ""
"他にどうしろって言うんだ？配られた手札で勝負するしかない。私は地球上で最も愛する2人を失い、3人目には見限られた。もう世界は終わったも同然さ。ちっぽけな私を残して、どこかへ行ってしまった。知っての通り、妻を亡くしてからはとても孤独だった。でもここで友人ができた。腹は減ってるが、仲間はいる。リーナは数学と科学を教えてくれるし、ルオは今まで会った人の中で一番賢い...博士号も持っているそうだ。ユウスケはここで私に勝てる唯一のポーカープレイヤーだ。それから、デイブは、ええと、デイブはデイブだな。もっと言いたいことはあるが、よく聞いてくれ。確かにはみ出し物かもしれないが、私たちは無価値じゃないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Well, I used to be a roofer, but I had a bad fall and wrecked my back around"
" '06.  Tried to get into other kinds of carpentry but I just don't have the "
"head for it.  My wife managed to support both of us with the extra bit I "
"made from odd jobs, but she had a stroke in 2016 and left me on my own the "
"last few years slowly draining my savings dry while I work whatever junk "
"jobs I can handle.  Couple days before <the_cataclysm> I got the notice that"
" the bank was going to foreclose on my crappy little trailer."
msgstr ""
"ああ、昔は屋根葺き職人をしていたが、2006年頃に転落して背中を悪くしてね。他の大工仕事もやってみたが、どうも不向きだった。妻は私がやっていた簡単な仕事を引き継いで家計を支えてくれたが、2016年に脳卒中で亡くなった。それからはできる仕事を何でもこなしながら、貯金を切り崩して生活していたよ。<the_cataclysm>の数日前、銀行から、その時住んでいた安くて小さなトレーラーハウスを差し押さえると通知が来たんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "You have any kids?"
msgstr "子供はいなかったのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Would you like to travel with me?  Someone good with a trade could be "
"helpful, and it's got to be better than wasting away here."
msgstr "私と一緒に来ないか？取り引きが上手い人はきっと役に立つし、ここで無駄な時間を過ごしているよりはいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I have a camp.  It's a damn sight better than those place, and there are "
"regular meals.  Someone with your trades experience would be welcome, even "
"if you can't do the big jobs anymore."
msgstr ""
"自分の拠点を作っているんだ。ここよりもマシな場所だし、定期的に食事もとれる。大きな仕事を引き受けられないとしても、取り引きの経験を持っているなら歓迎されるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, we had two.  My daughter died of an OD right at the start of that "
"fentanyl stuff.  It did a real number on my son - they were twins you see - "
"and he cut ties to me and my wife.  Wasn't even there for her funeral.  I "
"can't blame him, it messed us all up pretty fierce.  As far as I'm concerned"
" he's still out there with my grandkids, hiding away somewhere safe.  These "
"days, no news is good news."
msgstr ""
"ああ、2人いたよ。双子だった。娘はフェンタニルを飲み始めてすぐオーバードーズで死んだ。その後息子は家族と縁を切った。娘の葬式にすら来なかった。息子を責めることはできない。家族全員が取り乱していたからね。知っている限りでは、息子は孫とどこか安全なところに隠れている。ここ最近は、便りがないのが良い便りだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"It's sweet of you to say that, but I'm just not up to the wandering life, "
"not with these knees."
msgstr "そんな提案をしてくれるとは、親切な人だな。でも、私は膝が悪いし、放浪生活には耐えられそうにない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"That's awful nice of you.  Tell you what: if you can help Dave get himself "
"sorted out, so I don't feel like I've gotta stay here keeping an eye on the "
"poor fella, then I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"君にとっては良い話だろうな。じゃあこうしよう。もし君がデイブの問題を解決できたら、私もここで気の毒な友人たちを見守る必要がなくなるから、一緒に行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"I think I've sorted Dave out pretty well, don't you?  Would you consider "
"coming with me now?"
msgstr "デイブは問題を解決したようだ。一緒に来てもらえるかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and "
"you've gone and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for "
"that poor soul.  Listen, I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come "
"with you, but if you can convince the others to go, then I guess I'll come "
"along."
msgstr ""
"そうか...正直なところ、デイブを何とかできるとは思っていなかったんだが、君は見事やりとげ、私はしっぺ返しを食らったわけだ！気の毒な人のため真摯になって行動したんだな。ええと、実は...君からの提案については、あまり真剣には考えていなかったんだ。でも、他の人達を説得して連れ出せたら、私も一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid ""
"Golly.  I didn't expect that, but I'm as good as my word.  Let's get going."
msgstr "おや。意外なことだが、約束は守ろう。一緒に行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "さあ行こう。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Mutant beggar in the refugee center.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Yusuke Taylor"
msgstr "ﾕｳｽｹ ﾃｲﾗｰ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "やあ、こんにちは。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "I couldn't help but notice, you're covered in fur."
msgstr "思わず目についたが、ずいぶん暖かそうな毛皮だな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Would you like something to eat?"
msgstr "何か食べ物を譲ろうか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I live here.  Too mutant to join the cool kids club, but not mutant enough "
"to kill on sight."
msgstr "ここに住んでいるんだよ。変異のせいで友達の輪に入れてもらえないが、見つかったらすぐに殺される程じゃない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Why live out here?"
msgstr "どうしてここで寝泊まりしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "You seem like you can hold your own.  Why not travel with me?"
msgstr "君は十分な能力を持っているようだ。一緒に行かないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"It's safer than making my own home.  I head out and forage when I have to.  "
"As long as we keep it clean and do our part when a zombie comes, they let us"
" squat here as an extra defense.  They don't like that I've been bringing "
"food for the other squatters though… I think they are trying to slowly "
"starve us out, and even though I can't keep everyone's bellies full, I've "
"been able to bring back enough to keep these folk in better shape.  I "
"suspect they'll find an excuse to kick me out eventually."
msgstr ""
"自分で家を建てるよりは安全だろう。必要になったら出掛けて食料を探すさ。ここを汚さず使い、ゾンビが来た時に自分の役割を果たせる限り、臨時の護衛として置いてもらえるんだ。だが、他の居座り組の所に食料を持っていったら良い顔はされなかった...きっと徐々に飢えさせるつもりだ。全員の腹を十分満たすことはできないが、体調が悪くならない程度の食料はなんとか確保できている。結局ここの人達は、私を追い出す言い訳を探しているんだろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Gross, isn't it?  Feels like pubes.  I just started growing it everywhere a "
"little while after the Cataclysm.  No idea what caused it.  I can't blame "
"them for hating it, I hate it."
msgstr ""
"気味が悪いだろ？ムダ毛みたいなものだ。大変動からしばらく経って、体中に生え始めた。原因は分からない。嫌だからと言って怒っても仕方がない、まぁ、嫌だけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I do okay for myself actually.  I eat a lot of things close to spoilage "
"while I'm foraging.  If you've got food to spare, please give it to my "
"friends."
msgstr "私の分は大丈夫だ。漁ってきた中で、腐りそうなものをたくさん食べている。食べ物が余ってるなら、友人たちに分けてやってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Nothing too exciting.  I was in trade college, learning to be a computer "
"technician.  Those skills aren't too helpful, but when I was a kid I was an "
"Eagle scout.  I learned all kinds of useful stuff about plants and foraging,"
" and that's come in pretty handy."
msgstr ""
"面白い話はないよ。商業学校でコンピューター技師の勉強をしていたんだ。これはあまり便利な技能じゃないが、子供の頃はボーイスカウトの模範生だった。色々な植物や探索活動を学んだことは、かなり役に立ってるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "What about your family, stuff like that?"
msgstr "あなたの家族はどうしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to think about it.  I grew up in Rhode Island, they're still "
"there.  I haven't heard from them since the insanity with the Governor and "
"that secession stuff.  All communication lines got closed off.  I haven't "
"met anyone who knows what happened to the people there but I don't have much"
" hope."
msgstr ""
"あまり考えたくない話題だな。子供の頃に住んでいたロードアイランドにいるよ。州知事がおかしくなって連邦脱退を宣言してからは、何の連絡もない。通信回線が切れたからね。現地の状況を知っている人にはまだ会っていないけど、期待はしないようにしてるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Why don't you go back there?"
msgstr "実家に戻らないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about what happened with Rhode Island?"
msgstr "ロードアイランドで何があったのか、詳しく教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Same reason as I'm stuck here… it's way too dangerous, for one thing.  "
"Almost a hundred miles, through zombie infested territory, on foot, to get "
"to the shoreline?  No <swear> thank you.  And then, how would I get from the"
" shore to Block Island?  My family moved out there when Dad retired, and I "
"get the impression the ferry probably isn't running anymore.  Even if I got "
"there, I don't know what I'd find, and I think maybe that scares me the "
"most."
msgstr ""
"ここで立ち往生しているのと同じ理由さ...道中は危険すぎる。海岸線までのゾンビがうろつく約160キロの道のりを、徒歩だぞ？<swear>、勘弁してくれよ。無事に行けたとしても、海岸からブロック島までどうやって渡るんだ？親父が退職してからそこへ引っ越したんだけど、フェリーはきっと動いていないだろう。もしたどり着けたとしても、家で何が待ってるか分からない。それが一番恐ろしいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"You don't know?  The governor went nuts, like a lot of people did leading up"
" to the end, only he had a lot more power to work with.  One day he just "
"showed up to work with a militia of rowdies and loyalists and staged a coup,"
" taking over the government completely, killing those that opposed him, and "
"moving as many people as he could get behind him onto the islands.  The "
"rumors I've heard is that most of them survived the Cataclysm and are still "
"running the show there, but that seems kind of impossible to me."
msgstr ""
"知らないのか？知事が狂って、他の人達も同じように狂っていったんだ。ある日知事が、物騒な民兵や支持者たちを伴って現れ、クーデターを宣言した。政府機能を完全に引き継ぎ、反対者を殺し、たくさんの支持者たちを島に移住させた。彼らの大半が大変動を乗り切って主導権を握ってるなんて噂もあるが、とても信じられないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Do you think you'd go back and look for your family?"
msgstr "地元に戻って家族を探すつもりなのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my "
"full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible "
"for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing "
"for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、親切な申し出も、全身から生えてる毛についてしつこく尋ねたりしなかったことも嬉しく思ってるよ。でも、私はこの騒がしい居座り組達に対して、ある種の責任を感じるようになってしまったんだ。私が物資を渡せる唯一の人間である限り、ここを去ろうとは思わない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"I've spoken to all your friends, and except for Dave, they're good to go.  "
"Dave wants to stay here.  How about you?"
msgstr "あなたの友人たち全員と話した。デイブ以外は、一緒に行ってもいいと言ってくれた。あなたはどうだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  Getting those three to sign on to a suicide mission is quite the feat…"
" sounds like you're pretty dedicated to this.  OK, I'm with you.  Let's "
"round up the others and hit the road."
msgstr "へぇ。あの3人にそんな危ない橋を渡らせるなんて、すごいな...かなり苦労しただろう。よし、一緒に行こう。皆を集めてここを出発するんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
msgid "Right.  Let's go."
msgstr "そうだな。行こう。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Aleesha Seward"
msgstr "ｱﾘｰｼｬ ｽﾜｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "refugee"
msgstr "避難者"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Aleesha is fourteen and lost her family
#. ~ Alonso wants to be the town bicycle, but isn't getting as much interest
#. as he'd hoped.  He'll trade a morale bonus for condoms.
#. ~ Boris is nice, but shy and sad.  He was a carpenter; he and his partner
#. lost their son in the Cataclysm, and it makes it harder for them to make
#. friends in the survivor group.
#. ~ Dana is a young woman who survived with her husband, but she was pregnant
#. and lost the baby.
#. ~ Draco is a middle-aged musician, and generally a pretty nice guy.  He's
#. always been a wanderer and this isn't his first time living basically
#. homeless.
#. ~ A welder, culturally muslim but only recently practicing since the
#. Cataclysm has made her rethink her connections to her family's religion
#. ~ Garry is a Stan's older brother.  He's grateful he's made it to help
#. support his brother, but he's very worried about Stan.
#. ~ Guneet is the Singhs' sixteen year old son.  Like his parents, he is
#. wracked with survivor's guilt for his family having made it out intact.
#. ~ Jenny Forcette is an experienced mechanical engineer.  Like the other
#. refugees in the center, she's terrified of the outside world.  Unlike many,
#. she has some ideas what to do about it.
#. ~ John is a pseudonym.  This guy probably lived in a city before the
#. Cataclysm, but now he either thinks he is or pretends to be a cowboy..
#. ~ Mandeep is the father of a small family.  They've made it through this
#. unscathed and have a lot of survivor's guilt as a result.
#. ~ Mangalpreet is the mother of a small family.  They've made it through
#. this unscathed and have a lot of survivor's guilt.
#. ~ Pablo is a young professional who survived with his wife, but she was
#. pregnant and lost the baby.
#. ~ A counselor from far away, Rhy can offer a lot of supports to player and
#. survivors if she can get herself sorted a little
#. ~ Stan is a broken man since he and Boris lost their son in the Cataclysm.
#. It might be possible to help put him back together slowly.
#. ~ A paramedic who suffers a bit of racism for being Asian
#. ~ Vanessa is a middle-aged hairdresser.  She doesn't want to talk about her
#. past.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
