"<full_name>\n"
"<full_name>\n"
"<full_name>\n"
"<full_name>\n"
"<full_name>\n"
"皆がいなければ生きていられなかった。決して忘れない。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a drawing of a cartoon character smashing a zombie corpse with a "
