"\n"
"DO NOT APPROACH OR TRY TO CAPTURE, BRUNO CAN BE AGGRESSIVE TO STRANGERS AND UNFAMILIAR DOGS\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE HIM, CALL 413-555-8476 AT ANY TIME\n"
