msgid ""
"LOST DACHSHUND: DANNY\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a brown, long-haired dachshund with very fluffy ears.]\n"
"\n"
"SHY!  Do not chase!\n"
"\n"
"Call or text 413-555-9095 or visit danny-doggo.com if you have any information.\n"
