#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"LOST POLICE DOG\n"
"BISCUIT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a German Shepherd posing for an official K-9 badge photo in uniform, behind it is the American flag.]\n"
"\n"
"Do not attempt to pet or capture him, he has PTSD and may be agitated!\n"
"\n"
"German Shepherd\n"
"Last seen in the park next to Littleton Church on 9th April\n"
"\n"
"If you've seen him or know where he is please phone me\n"
"774-555-7217"
msgstr ""
"警察犬失踪\n"
"ビスケット\n"
"\n"
"[星条旗をバックに警察犬バッジ付きウェアを着てかしこまっているジャーマンシェパードの宣材写真]\n"
"\n"
"PTSDを患っています。興奮することがあるため、撫でたり捕獲しようとしたりしないでください。\n"
"\n"
"ジャーマンシェパード\n"
"4月9日、リトルトン教会横の公園で姿を目撃されています。\n"
"\n"
"見かけた方、居場所をご存じの方はご連絡ください\n"
"774-555-7217"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"MISSING DOG\n"
"A CRY FOR HELP FOR OUR FURRY FRIEND.\n"
"\n"
"MARSHMALLOW\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a large-sized Great Pyrenees with a beautiful, thick white coat.  It looks like a polar bear at a glance.]\n"
"\n"
"BREED: Pyrenean Mountain Dog\n"
"FUR: white without patches, thick double coat\n"
"AGE: 6 years old\n"
"COLLAR: bright yellow\n"
"\n"
"Marshmallow has been missing since 17 April and was last seen in Century Park in Weston.\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE CONTACT AT:\n"
"339-555-6206 or 339-555-7877"
msgstr ""
"行方不明\n"
"愛犬の捜索にご協力ください。\n"
"\n"
"マシュマロ\n"
"\n"
"[シロクマと見間違えてしまいそうなほど大きな、白く美しい毛並みをもつグレートピレニーズの写真]\n"
"\n"
"犬種: ピレニアン・マウンテン・ドッグ\n"
"体毛: ブチのない白色、厚い毛並み\n"
"年齢: 6歳\n"
"首輪: 明るい黄色\n"
"\n"
"マシュマロは4月17日から行方不明になっています。最後に目撃されたのはウェストンのセンチュリー・パークです。\n"
"\n"
"連絡先:\n"
"339-555-6206 または 339-555-7877"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"HELP US FIND OUR MISSING DOG\n"
"<3 MR. RUFFLES <3\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a white labrador retriever holding a tennis ball in its paws, smiling at the camera.]\n"
"\n"
"BREED: Labrador Retriever\n"
"AGE: 4 Years old\n"
"COLOR: White\n"
"WEIGHT: 43 Lbs.\n"
"HEIGHT: 25 Inches\n"
"MANNERISMS: Friendly, loves playing fetch, will come when called\n"
"\n"
"Any information you could provide would be helpful!\n"
"We love Mr. Ruffles so much and miss him dearly!\n"
"\n"
"CALL OR TEXT: 781-555-3980"
msgstr ""
"イヌの捜索にご協力をお願いします\n"
"<3 ミスター・ラッフルズ <3\n"
"\n"
"[前足でテニスボールを挟みながらカメラに目線を向ける、白いラブラドール・レトリバーの写真]\n"
"\n"
"犬種: ラブラドールレトリバー\n"
"年齢: 4歳\n"
"毛色: 白\n"
"体重: 20kg\n"
"体高: 64cm\n"
"性格: 人懐っこい、遊び好き、呼べば来る\n"
"\n"
"どんな些細な情報でも結構です！\n"
"大好きなラッフルズと再会できるよう、ご協力下さい！\n"
"\n"
"電話またはSMS: 781-555-3980"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"LOST PET ALERT\n"
"HELP US FIND PRINCESS!\n"
"REWARD: $150\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a short-coated white pitbull wearing an American flag bandana.]\n"
"\n"
"DESCRIPTION:\n"
"NAME: Princess — SEX: Female — AGE: 6\n"
"BREED: American Pit Bull Terrier\n"
"PERSONALITY: Loves chewing toys and kids — KNOWS: Sit, stay, roll\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE HIM, PLEASE CALL 508-555-7266\n"
"Last seen near Doyle Park wearing his US flag bandana."
msgstr ""
"迷子のペット\n"
"プリンセスを探してください！\n"
"報酬: 150ドル\n"
"\n"
"[星条旗のバンダナを付けた、毛が白く短いピットブルの写真]\n"
"\n"
"詳細:\n"
"名前: プリンセス、性別: メス、年齢: 6歳\n"
"犬種: アメリカン・ピット・ブル・テリア\n"
"性格: 噛めるおもちゃと子供が好き、しつけ: おすわり、待て、回れ\n"
"\n"
"見かけたら508-555-7266に電話してください\n"
"ドイルパーク付近で、星条旗のバンダナを付けた姿が目撃されています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"[Photograph: close-up of a cute Rottweiler puppy.]\n"
"\n"
"I'M LOST!\n"
"\n"
"My name is Toto, I'm a 0.5 y/o male rottweiler, and I was last seen in Milford near the public pond wearing a red & white collar.  Please help me return home, my owners miss me very much!\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE FOUND THIS DOG OR THINK YOU HAVE SEEN IT, PLEASE CONTACT US: 617-555-7788"
msgstr ""
"[かわいらしいロットワイラーの子犬の写真]\n"
"\n"
"迷子です！\n"
"\n"
"ぼくの名前はトト、0歳半のオスのロットワイラーです。ミルフォードにある公共池の近くで迷子になりました。赤と白の首輪をしています。家に帰るのを手伝って！\n"
"\n"
"この犬を見かけた方、見覚えがある方はご連絡ください: 617-555-7788"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"MISSING!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: an adorable Samoyed puppy with a carefully groomed coif.  It wears a pink tie to avoid being mistaken for a fluffy puffball.]\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE HELP ME FIND MY DOG!\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE HER, CALL 781-555-0045\n"
"\n"
" ● My dog's name is Luna.\n"
" ● She's a 1 y/o female Samoyed breed.\n"
" ● She wears a pink tie and a pink collar with \"Luna\" written on it.\n"
"\n"
"Missing from Connor Street, Gardner, MA.\n"
"Please call with any sightings.  She is very loved and very missed!"
msgstr ""
"行方不明！\n"
"\n"
"[毛を丁寧に整えられた、愛らしいサモエドの子犬の写真。ピンク色のリボンを付けていないと、単なる毛玉と間違えてしまいそうな見た目をしている]\n"
"\n"
"愛犬の捜索にご協力ください！\n"
"\n"
"見かけた方は、781-555-0045にお電話ください。\n"
"・名前はルナです。\n"
"・1歳のメスのサモエドです。\n"
"・ピンクのリボンと、「ルナ」と書かれたピンクの首輪を付けています。\n"
"\n"
"マサチューセッツ州ガードナーのコナー通りで迷子になりました。\n"
"目撃された方はお電話ください。愛情を受けて育った、非常に人懐っこい犬です！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"HELP LAIKA COME HOME!\n"
"\n"
"[Illustration: a mixed-breed dog wearing a fishbowl helmet, floating in space.]\n"
"\n"
"Last seen on 3 November 1957 orbiting Earth in a spaceship.  If found, please return to Baikonur Cosmodrome, Kazakhstan."
msgstr ""
"ライカをおうちに帰して！\n"
"\n"
"[透明な球状のヘルメットを被って宇宙空間に浮かぶ雑種犬のイラスト]\n"
"\n"
"1957年11月3日、宇宙船で地球を周回する姿が目撃されたのを最後に、失踪しています。発見された方はカザフスタンのバイコヌール宇宙基地にお返しください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"MISSING\n"
"PLEASE CHECK PICTURE/SHEDS/GARAGES\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a black-and-white shorthair cat sleeping in a sunbeam.]\n"
"\n"
"Schmeeda is a black female short-haired cat with a large white spot on her back.  She wears a deep blue collar with a small bell attached to it.  She went missing on 19th March at around midnight.  She is microchipped.\n"
"\n"
"$500 REWARD OFFERED\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE ANY INFORMATION:\n"
"CALL 857-555-3146"
msgstr ""
"行方不明\n"
"周囲や物置、ガレージを探してみてください\n"
"\n"
"[日だまりの中で寝ている白黒の短毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"シュミーダは短毛のメスで、毛は黒く、背中に大きな白いブチがあります。小さな鈴が付いた濃いブルーの首輪をしています。3月19日の深夜に行方不明になりました。マイクロチップが埋め込まれています。\n"
"\n"
"報酬500ドル\n"
"\n"
"情報をお持ちの方はご連絡ください:\n"
"電話 857-555-3146"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"LOST PET!\n"
"Please help me find my cat!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a ginger longhair cat rolled over on his back, playing with dangling feathers.]\n"
"\n"
" ● His name is Charlie\n"
" ● He has greenish-yellow eyes\n"
" ● Ginger in color, long-haired\n"
" ● Likes playing, especially with laser pointers\n"
" ● Last seen on Flint Street, Charlton\n"
"\n"
"If sighted, please call Martha at:\n"
"978-555-5467"
msgstr ""
"迷子のペット！\n"
"猫の捜索にご協力ください！\n"
"\n"
"[仰向けになって羽毛のおもちゃで遊ぶ、茶色い長毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"・チャーリー\n"
"・瞳は緑色に近い黄色\n"
"・明るい茶色の長毛\n"
"・レーザーポインターを追いかけるのが好き\n"
"・最後に目撃されたのはチャールトンのフリント通り\n"
"\n"
"目撃された方は、マーサまでお電話ください:\n"
"978-555-5467"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"LOST CAT\n"
"\n"
" - ADULT BLACK & BROWN MALE MAINE COON CAT\n"
" - WHITE ON NECK AND MUZZLE\n"
" - WEARS REFLECTIVE GREEN COLLAR\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a large cat with a dense coat of fur sleeping in a plastic lawn chair.  He looks uncomfortable.]\n"
"\n"
"Loki from Shutesbury, MA.\n"
"\n"
"TAKE A PIC IF YOU CAN + PLEASE DON'T CHASE\n"
"617-555-9958"
msgstr ""
"迷い猫\n"
"\n"
" - オス、メインクーン\n"
" - 毛は黒色と茶色で、首と鼻先は白色\n"
" - 反射材が付いた緑色の首輪を着用\n"
"\n"
"[人工芝が生えた椅子の上で居心地悪そうに寝転んでいる、大きな毛深い猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"ロキはマサチューセッツ州シューツベリー出身です。\n"
"\n"
"できれば写真を撮ってください。追い掛けないでください。\n"
"617-555-9958"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"MISSING CAT ALERT\n"
"\n"
"781-555-2647\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a slender white cat with a grayish face peeking out a small cardboard box.]\n"
"\n"
"This adorable Siamese cat is called COCOA.\n"
"He is new to the area and escaped out of the door.  He is microchipped and has a name tag on his collar.  He is very nervous around strangers and may flee if he thinks you are going to catch him.\n"
"\n"
"If you see him or think you have seen a purrson like him, please call me ASAP.  We love him and miss him dearly."
msgstr ""
"迷い猫のお知らせ\n"
"\n"
"781-555-2647\n"
"\n"
"[小さな段ボール箱から顔を覗かせる、痩せた薄灰色の猫]\n"
"\n"
"愛らしいシャム猫の名前は、ココアといいます。\n"
"引っ越してきたばかりで、玄関から脱走してしまったようです。マイクロチップを埋め込んでおり、首輪にはネームタグが付いています。知らない人に対して非常に憶病で、捕まえようとすると逃げてしまう可能性があります。\n"
"\n"
"見かけた方、似ている猫を見た気がする方は、大至急ご連絡ください。愛猫と再会できるよう、どうかご協力をお願いします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"!! HELP ME !!\n"
"My name is Pippa and I am lost!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a long-haired cat with a round face and short muzzle sitting on a floral carpet.]\n"
"\n"
"I'm getting on with age, so I don't remember how to get home.  I am a (traditional) Persian longhair with silky white fur and brownish eyes.  I was wearing a red collar with my name tag on it.\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE CALL (413)555-1688 IF YOU SEE ME\n"
"(AND TAKE A PICTURE IF YOU CAN)"
msgstr ""
"！！助けて！！\n"
"私はピッパです。家に帰りたい！\n"
"\n"
"[花柄のカーペットの上に座る、丸顔の長毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"私は歳を取っており、帰り道が分かりません。私は(トラディショナルタイプの)ペルシャ猫で、絹のような白く長い毛並みをしており、目の色は茶色です。名札がついた赤い首輪を付けています。\n"
"\n"
"私を見かけたら、(413)555-1688に電話してください\n"
"(できれば写真を撮っておいてください)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a shorthair cat with rosette markings training its claws on a scratching post.]\n"
"\n"
"Cheddar is a male 3.5 y/o brown Bengal cat who went missing on April 8.  She was last seen wearing a striped collar.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE HIM, CONTACT US IMMEDIATELY: 978-555-3760\n"
"\n"
"YOU CAN HELP!\n"
"Please photograph this poster and share it on social media."
msgstr ""
"迷い猫\n"
"\n"
"[爪とぎ柱に爪を立てている、ヒョウ柄の短毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"チェダーは3歳半のオスのベンガル猫です。4月8日に行方不明になりました。当時は縞模様の首輪を付けていました。\n"
"\n"
"もし見かけたら、すぐにご連絡ください: 978-555-3760\n"
"\n"
"あなたの助けが必要です！\n"
"このポスターを撮影して、SNSで拡散してください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"DEXTER IS LOST!\n"
"AGAIN!!!  He was scared off by the neighbor's dogs on 6th May & doesn't know how to get home…\n"
"…he's not very clever at finding his way back!\n"
"He's a 3 y/o male Devon Rex cat with soft gray fur and big blue eyes.\n"
"He's chipped and should be wearing a yellow collar with a tag that has his name & my phone number on it.\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a short-haired gray cat sitting next to four similar-looking felines.  Dexter is circled in and has a bright red arrow pointing at him.]\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE MY DEXTER, PLEASE DIAL 978-555-8152!\n"
"\n"
"!!!REWARD OFFERED!!!"
msgstr ""
"デクスターが失踪！\n"
"またしてもです！5月6日に近所の犬に吠えられて逃げ、帰り道が分からなくなったようです...\n"
"...とんだ方向音痴猫ですね！\n"
"3歳のオスのデボンレックスで、灰色の柔らかい毛と大きな青い目が特徴です。\n"
"チップを埋め込んでおり、黄色い首輪に名前と電話番号を書いたタグが付いています。\n"
"\n"
"[5匹の灰色の短毛猫が並んで座っている写真。そのうち行方不明になっている1匹が丸で囲まれ、矢印で示されている]\n"
"\n"
"デクスターを見かけたら978-555-8152に電話してください！\n"
"\n"
"！！！報酬あります！！！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"ATTENTION\n"
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a hairless, wrinkled cat with lemon-shaped eyes wearing a striped T-shirt.]\n"
"\n"
"RAMSES went missing from the car park at Companion Care Vets in Oakland on 30th March.\n"
"He is a Canadian Sphynx with a gray spot covering its stomach.\n"
"She is wearing a striped T-shirt and a pink collar.\n"
"\n"
"If found, please contact me at: ifoundramsesthecat@gmail.com"
msgstr ""
"お知らせ\n"
"迷子猫\n"
"\n"
"[縞模様の猫用Tシャツを着用した、毛のない皺だらけの皮膚と大きな目が特徴的な猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"ラムセスは3月30日、オークランドのコンパニオン・ケア動物病院の駐車場で行方不明になりました。\n"
"お腹に灰色のブチがあるカナディアン・スフィンクスです。\n"
"縞模様のTシャツを着ており、ピンク色の首輪を付けています。\n"
"\n"
"見つけた方はifoundramsesthecat@gmail.comまでご連絡ください"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"HAVE YOU SEEN MARBLES?\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a gray cat with gently curving stripes covering its body.  It stares at the camera as if it's hypnotized by it.]\n"
"\n"
"MARBLES IS VERY FRIENDLY AND ENERGETIC.  MISSING SINCE THE EVENING OF MARCH 21.  IF SPOTTED OR FOUND, PLEASE CALL ME AT 774-555-9361.\n"
"\n"
"THANK YOU!!!"
msgstr ""
"マーブルズを知りませんか？\n"
"\n"
"[催眠術にでもかかったかのようにカメラを熱心に見つめる、全身に緩やかな縞模様が入った猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"マーブルズはとても人懐っこく、活動的です。3月21日の夜から行方不明になっています。発見された方は774-555-9361までお電話ください。\n"
"\n"
"よろしくお願いします！！！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"PLEASE PLEASE HELP ME!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a longhaired tri-color coat with heterochromia lying on top of a cat tree.]\n"
"\n"
"My name is Buttons and I'm a calico cat with large orange and black patches.  My left eye is blue and the other is green.  I went missing on the evening of April 15th and I haven't been seen since.  I love people and will come if called.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE SEEN BUTTONS, PLEASE DON'T HESITATE TO CONTACT ME: 508-555-1050"
msgstr ""
"ご協力をお願いします！\n"
"\n"
"[キャットタワーの頂上で寝転んでいる、左右の瞳の色が異なる長毛種の三毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"私の名前はボタンです。オレンジ色と黒色の大きなブチがある三毛猫です。左目はブルー、右目はグリーンです。4月15日の夕方から迷子になって、どこにいるか分かりません。人に慣れていて、呼ぶと寄ってきます。\n"
"\n"
"もしボタンを見かけたら、遠慮なくこちらにお電話ください: 508-555-1050"

