#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "exosuit frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid "Leg small hardpoint 1"
msgstr "脚部小モジュールスロット1"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "exosuit frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid "Leg small hardpoint 2"
msgstr "脚部小モジュールスロット2"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid "exosuit frame (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit frames (on)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツフレーム(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit frame (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid ""
"This is a standard exosuit frame.  Designed to be modular, it can accept a "
"variety of power supplies, defensive and offensive systems, and utility "
"tools.  Slots exist for the torso, back, arms, and legs.  It is turned on "
"and continually drawing power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"標準的な外骨格スーツ用フレームです。モジュール式になっており、各種電源、防御・攻撃システム、ユーティリティツールを搭載できます。胴、背中、四肢にスロットを備えています。電源が入っており、電力を消費し続けている状態です。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "boarding axe"
msgid_plural "boarding axes"
msgstr[0] "ボーディングアックス"

#. ~ Description of "boarding axe"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy axe with a pick opposite the blade.  A composite "
"titanium/Kevlar handle provides a sturdy grip that protects against "
"electrical shocks and high temperatures.  Designed for use by soldiers "
"wearing strength-enhancing exosuits, it's quite heavy.  Activate it to fold "
"it into a compact module."
msgstr ""
"刃の反対側につるはしが付いた頑丈な斧です。チタンとケブラーの複合素材でできた持ち手は丈夫で握りやすく、電撃や高温から使用者を保護します。筋力を強化する外骨格スーツを着用した兵士が使う設計になっているため、かなり重量があります。使用するとコンパクトに折り畳みます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "boarding axe"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "You fold the axe in on itself."
msgstr "ボーディングアックスを折り畳みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "makeshift boarding axe"
msgid_plural "makeshift boarding axes"
msgstr[0] "簡易ボーディングアックス"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift boarding axe"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"This is an oversized axe made from scraps of salvaged metal.  While not as "
"versatile or durable as the boarding axe, it still packs a punch."
msgstr "廃材で作った特大サイズの斧です。正規のボーディングアックスほど汎用性や耐久性はありませんが、十分な威力が期待できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "heavy mining drill"
msgid_plural "heavy mining drills"
msgstr[0] "大型掘削ドリル"

#. ~ Description of "heavy mining drill"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable roadheader, designed to chew through the toughest rock "
"with three carbide-tipped mining heads.  Heavy cables run from the module to"
" a handheld trigger mechanism.  Currently inactive, it still makes a "
"powerful blunt weapon."
msgstr ""
"非常に硬い3つのドリルチップで強固な岩盤を掘削する、手持ち式の掘削機です。モジュールから手元のトリガーまで、太いケーブルが通っています。現在は起動していませんが、そのままでも強力な鈍器として活躍します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heavy mining drill"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "You activate the drill's motor."
msgstr "ドリルの電源を入れました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "heavy mining drill"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "There is not enough charge to activate the drill."
msgstr "ドリルを起動する電力が不足しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "heavy mining drill (on)"
msgid_plural "heavy mining drills (on)"
msgstr[0] "大型掘削ドリル(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "heavy mining drill (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable roadheader, designed to chew through the toughest rock.  "
"Currently active, the drill heads are a blur."
msgstr "非常に硬い3つのドリルチップで強固な岩盤を掘削する、手持ち式の掘削機です。電源が入っており、ドリルヘッドが激しく振動しています。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heavy mining drill (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "You deactivate the drill."
msgstr "ドリルの電源を切りました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "exosuit claws"
msgid_plural "exosuit claws"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ用クロー"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit claws"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"A pair of oversized and articulated hydraulic gauntlets with fingertips "
"ending in cruel talons."
msgstr "両手の指先に凶悪そうな爪が生えている、特大の油圧駆動多関節ガントレットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "392-UASTA plasma torch"
msgid_plural "392-UASTA plasma torches"
msgstr[0] "プラズマ溶接トーチ(392-UASTA)"

#. ~ Description of "392-UASTA plasma torch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"One of the many versions of UASTA certified plasma torches, essentially a "
"civilian plasma railgun used to deliver focused waves of plasma for "
"precision welding or metal cutting.  This is a larger, more powerful model "
"meant to be used by an exosuit for heavy engineering tasks.  Heavy cables "
"run from the module to a handheld trigger mechanism."
msgstr ""
"UASTA認証を取得しているプラズマトーチの様々なバリエーションの一つです。本質的には民間用プラズマレールガンですが、プラズマを一点に集中することで精密溶接や金属切断を可能にしています。このモデルは外骨格スーツを使う作業を想定しており、より大型で高出力です。モジュールから手元のトリガーまで、太いケーブルが通っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "exosuit power cutter (off)"
msgid_plural "exosuit power cutters (off)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツパワーカッター(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit power cutter (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"A huge, multi-fuel powered saw with a diamond blade, mounted on an exosuit."
"  If it has fuel, it can be turned on to turn it into a powerful metal "
"cutting tool.  Heavy cables run from the module to a handheld trigger "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
"外骨格スーツに取り付けて使う、ダイヤモンドブレードを備えた巨大な多種燃料駆動のカッターです。燃料があれば、強力な金属切削工具として利用できます。モジュールから手元のトリガーまで、太いケーブルが通っています。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit power cutter (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 1 liter."
msgstr "ガソリンタンク(1L)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid "exosuit power cutter (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit power cutters (on)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツパワーカッター(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit power cutter (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"A huge, multi-fuel powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling "
"blur.  It's consuming fuel and can be used as a fantastic tool for cutting "
"metal.  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort"
" of thing."
msgstr ""
"ダイヤモンドブレードを備えた巨大な多種燃料駆動のカッターです。ガソリンを消費して、強力な金属切削工具として利用できます。もし興味があるのなら、恐ろしい武器として使うことも可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit power supply unit"
msgid_plural "exosuit power supply units"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ電源ユニット"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit power supply unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"Designed to attach to an exosuit's back, this is a large rechargable battery"
" with an integrated UPS."
msgstr "外骨格スーツの背面スロットに装着する、UPS内蔵の大型充電式バッテリーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit gasoline ICE power supply"
msgid_plural "exosuit gasoline ICE power supplies"
msgstr[0] "ガソリン駆動式外骨格スーツ電源ユニット"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit gasoline ICE power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"Designed to attach to an exosuit's back, this is an internal combustion "
"engine generator with an integrated UPS, fueled by gasoline."
msgstr "外骨格スーツの背面スロットに装着する、ガソリン駆動UPSを内蔵した内燃エンジン式発電機です。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit gasoline ICE power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "This is a tank for gasoline.  Holds up to 10 liters."
msgstr "ガソリンタンク(10L)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit turbine power supply"
msgid_plural "exosuit turbine power supplies"
msgstr[0] "タービン駆動式外骨格スーツ電源ユニット"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit turbine power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"Designed to attach to an exosuit's back, this is an adaptive gas turbine "
"generator with an integrated UPS, capable of using nearly any fuel type."
msgstr "外骨格スーツの背面スロットに装着する、ほぼあらゆる種類の燃料に対応できるUPS内蔵の専用ガスタービン式発電機です。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit turbine power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 5 liters."
msgstr "ガソリンタンク(5L)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit ASRG"
msgid_plural "exosuit ASRGs"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ用ASRG"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit ASRG"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a prototype Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator, "
"intended to power an exosuit indefinitely.  The layered shielding saves "
"space but is quite heavy, and while labeled 'Compact', this only just fits "
"on the exosuit frame.  Due to the complexities of manufacturing, it cannot "
"be repaired, only replaced."
msgstr ""
"外骨格スーツへ電力を無限に供給できる、試作段階の小型スターリング放射性同位体発電機です。何層もの遮蔽を重ねることで省スペース化を図ってはいますが、かなり重く、「小型」と銘打たれている割に、サイズは外骨格スーツフレームと同程度です。製造法が複雑なため、損傷しても修理はできず、交換して対応します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit auxiliary battery"
msgid_plural "exosuit auxiliary batteries"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ補助バッテリー"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit auxiliary battery"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a rechargeable auxiliary power unit that attaches to an exosuit "
"hardpoint."
msgstr "外骨格スーツのスロットに装着する、充電式の補助電源ユニットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit small auxiliary battery"
msgid_plural "exosuit small auxiliary batteries"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ小型補助バッテリー"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit small auxiliary battery"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a small rechargeable auxiliary power unit that attaches to an "
"exosuit hardpoint."
msgstr "外骨格スーツのスロットに装着する、充電式の小型補助電源ユニットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit load support module (off)"
msgid_plural "exosuit load support modules (off)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ運搬支援モジュール(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit load support module (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module significantly increases the exosuit's weight bearing at the cost"
" of increased power consumption."
msgstr "このモジュールを起動すると、電力消費は増加しますが、外骨格スーツの耐荷重を大幅に向上させる効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit load support module (off)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit small load support module
#. (off)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit AR research module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "Turn on module"
msgstr "起動"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit load support module
#. (off)"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit small load support
#. module (off)"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "mounted lamp (off)"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "recoil mitigation system
#. (off)"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit forcefield generator"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit AR research module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "There is not enough charge to activate the module."
msgstr "モジュールを起動する電力が不足しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit load support module (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit load support modules (on)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ運搬支援モジュール(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit load support module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module significantly increases the exosuit's weight bearing at the cost"
" of increased power consumption.  It is turned on and continually drawing "
"power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"このモジュールを起動すると、電力消費は増加しますが、外骨格スーツの耐荷重を大幅に向上させる効果を発揮します。電源が入っており、電力を消費し続けています。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit load support module (on)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit small load support module
#. (on)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit AR research module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "Turn off module"
msgstr "停止"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit load support module (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit small load support module (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit AR research module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You deactivate the module."
msgstr "モジュールの電源を切りました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit small load support module (off)"
msgid_plural "exosuit small load support modules (off)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ小型運搬支援モジュール(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit small load support module (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module increases the exosuit's weight bearing at the cost of increased "
"power consumption."
msgstr "このモジュールを起動すると、電力消費は増加しますが、外骨格スーツの耐荷重を向上させる効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit small load support module (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit small load support modules (on)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ小型運搬支援モジュール(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit small load support module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module increases the exosuit's weight bearing at the cost of increased "
"power consumption.  It is turned on and continually drawing power.  Use it "
"to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"このモジュールを起動すると、電力消費は増加しますが、外骨格スーツの耐荷重を向上させる効果を発揮します。電源が入っており、電力を消費し続けています。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit multi lense zoom module"
msgid_plural "exosuit multi lense zoom modules"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ用マルチレンズモジュール"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit multi lense zoom module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A series of strangely shaped hexagonal lenses that flutter about inside your"
" helmet.  As the lenses shift things around you stay perfectly in focus no "
"matter your eyesight or distance.  It can be mounted to an exosuit helmet."
msgstr ""
"ヘルメットの内部で稼働する、六角形の奇妙なレンズ装置です。レンズが稼働することで、視力や距離に関係なく周囲のものにピントを合わせることができます。外骨格スーツのヘルメットに装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "mounted lamp (off)"
msgid_plural "mounted lamps (off)"
msgstr[0] "照明モジュール(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "mounted lamp (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a light that can be secured to an exosuit hardpoint.  It has two "
"levels of brightness."
msgstr "外骨格スーツのスロットに装着できるライトです。明るさを二段階調整できます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mounted lamp (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You turn the lamp on low."
msgstr "照明を弱に設定しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "mounted lamp (low)"
msgid_plural "mounted lamps (low)"
msgstr[0] "照明モジュール(弱光)"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "mounted lamp (low)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "Turn to high"
msgstr "強光に切替"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mounted lamp (low)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You turn the lamp on high."
msgstr "照明を強に設定しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "mounted lamp (high)"
msgid_plural "mounted lamps (high)"
msgstr[0] "照明モジュール(強光)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "recoil mitigation system (off)"
msgid_plural "recoil mitigation systems (off)"
msgstr[0] "反動軽減システム(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "recoil mitigation system (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module takes partial control of the exosuit while firing, damping "
"recoil.  Activate before firing."
msgstr "銃器発射時に外骨格スーツの一部を制御し、反動を軽減するモジュールです。発射する前に起動しておく必要があります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "recoil mitigation system (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You activate your suit's recoil dampeners."
msgstr "反動軽減システムを起動しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "recoil mitigation system (on)"
msgid_plural "recoil mitigation systems (on)"
msgstr[0] "反動軽減システム(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "recoil mitigation system (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You turn off the recoil mitigation system."
msgstr "反動軽減システムを停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit air supply module"
msgid_plural "exosuit air supply modules"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ呼吸モジュール"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit air supply module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a SCBA, a self-contained breathing apparatus.  A series of tanks "
"contain a tailored bacteria that processes Co2 back into breathable air over"
" time."
msgstr "SCBAと呼ばれる自給式呼吸器です。複数のタンク内には特殊なバクテリアが入っており、時間をかけて二酸化炭素を呼吸可能な空気に戻します。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit air supply module"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit air supply module
#. (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's tank is exhausted."
msgstr "%s内の空気が使い果たされました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit air supply module (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit air supply modules (on)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ呼吸モジュール(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit air supply module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a SCBA, a self-contained breathing apparatus.  A series of tanks "
"contain a tailored bacteria that processes Co2 back into breathable air over"
" time.  It is activated and will supply breathable air."
msgstr ""
"SCBAと呼ばれる自給式呼吸器です。複数のタンク内には特殊なバクテリアが入っており、時間をかけて二酸化炭素を呼吸可能な空気に戻します。モジュールは起動しており、呼吸可能な空気を供給できる状態です。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit air supply module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
#, c-format
msgid "You deactivate your %s."
msgstr "%sを停止させました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit structural imager module"
msgid_plural "exosuit structural imager modules"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ撮像モジュール"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit structural imager module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualizing objects hiding "
"behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  "
"While normally used to diagnostic potential faults within the internal "
"systems of spaceships, the ability to peer between obstacles grant it "
"obvious surveillance applications.  It can be mounted to an exosuit helmet."
"  It can be activated to reveal a small conical area around you."
msgstr ""
"壁や保守パネルなどのあらゆる視覚的障壁に阻まれた物体をスキャンし視覚化できる、コンパクトな撮像ツールです。通常は宇宙船の内部システムの潜在的故障を診断するために使われますが、障害物越しに視界を確保できるため、監視用途にも使われます。外骨格スーツのヘルメットに装着でき、起動すると使用者を中心とした円錐形の範囲内を透視できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit climbing assist module"
msgid_plural "exosuit climbing assist modules"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ登攀補助モジュール"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit climbing assist module"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This module uses a combination of spikes, hooks, and magnets to aid the "
"wearer in climbing."
msgstr "使用者の登攀を補助する、スパイク、フック、マグネットを組み合わせたモジュールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit dynamic maneuvering unit"
msgid_plural "exosuit dynamic maneuvering units"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ動的推進ユニット"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit dynamic maneuvering unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A large collection of tanks and nozzles, this module converts hydrogen to "
"plasma, propelling the user between spaceships or across rough terrain and "
"gaps.  The thrust is insufficient for sustained flight in a gravity well, "
"but can still launch you forward at extreme speed and deliver a powerful "
"blow on landing."
msgstr ""
"本来は宇宙船外や高低差の多い地形、渓谷などを移動するための、水素をプラズマに変換するタンクとノズルが組み合わさった巨大な機械です。この推力では重力圏での長時間飛行は不可能ですが、超高速で前進することができます。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit dynamic maneuvering unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is the maneuvering unit's fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of "
"pressurized fuel."
msgstr "推進ユニット燃料タンク(10L)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit forcefield generator"
msgid_plural "exosuit forcefield generators"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ力場発生装置"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit forcefield generator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A set of powerful field generators intended for UICA marines in boarding "
"actions.  The first setting provides excellent protection against melee "
"attacks, while the second protects against ballistic projectiles.  Due to "
"power draw and heat dissipation issues the unit cannot operate both fields "
"simultaneously, forcing users to make rapid decisions as combat unfolds."
msgstr ""
"UICA海兵隊員が移乗攻撃の際に使用する、強力な力場を発生させる装置です。対近接攻撃と対弾道弾の、2通りの防御モードを切り替えて使います。消費電力と放熱の問題から2つのモードを同時に稼働することはできず、戦闘の状況に応じて迅速な判断を迫られることになります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit forcefield generator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You turn the forcefield on to protect against bash and cut attacks."
msgstr "力場を起動し、打撃や斬撃から身を守るモードに設定しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit forcefield generator (bash & cut)"
msgid_plural "exosuit forcefield generators (bash & cut)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ力場発生装置(打撃/斬撃耐性)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit forcefield generator (bash & cut)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A set of powerful field generators intended for UICA marines in boarding "
"actions.  It is currently active, drawing power, and protecting against 25 "
"points of bash and cut damage."
msgstr ""
"UICA海兵隊員が移乗攻撃の際に使用する、強力な力場を発生させる装置です。現在電力を消費して力場を発生させており、打撃・斬撃被ダメージを25ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit forcefield generator (bash &
#. cut)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "Turn to kinetic/pierce"
msgstr "銃弾/刺突耐性に切替"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit forcefield generator (bash & cut)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You toggle the forcefield to protect against ballistic and pierce."
msgstr "力場を銃弾や刺突攻撃から身を守るモードに切り替えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit forcefield generator (ballistic & pierce)"
msgid_plural "exosuit forcefield generators (ballistic & pierce)"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ力場発生装置(銃弾/刺突耐性)"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit forcefield generator (ballistic & pierce)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A set of powerful field generators intended for UICA marines in boarding "
"actions.  It is currently active, drawing power, and protecting against 40 "
"points of ballistic and piercing damage."
msgstr ""
"UICA海兵隊員が移乗攻撃の際に使用する、強力な力場を発生させる装置です。現在電力を消費して力場を発生させており、銃弾・刺突被ダメージを40ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit forcefield generator (ballistic &
#. pierce)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "You deactivate the forcefield module."
msgstr "力場発生装置の電源を切りました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit medical injector"
msgid_plural "exosuit medical injectors"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ医療用注射装置"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit medical injector"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"A combination medical monitor and drug injection system, this module is "
"intended to keep the pilot in the field longer."
msgstr "着用者をより長く活動できるようにするための、医療用モニターと薬剤注入システムを組み合わせたモジュールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "exosuit microgenerator"
msgid_plural "exosuit microgenerators"
msgstr[0] "外骨格スーツ超小型発電ユニット"

#. ~ Description of "exosuit microgenerator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid ""
"This is a compact radioactive power unit that attaches to an exosuit "
"hardpoint.  While it charges slowly, the fuel source will last years."
msgstr "外骨格スーツのスロットに取り付ける、小型の原子力発電ユニットです。充電速度は非常に遅いですが、動力源は何年も長持ちします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
