#. ~ Description of "exosuit cartridge charger"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "This is a charging port designed to accept power cartridges."
msgstr "電力カートリッジに対応した充電ポートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
