#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "The Backrooms"
msgstr "The Backrooms"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I took all the supplies.  I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "「物資は全部もらった。ごめん。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up."
"  Someday I will\""
msgstr "「いつか目を覚ます。いつか目を覚ます。いつか目を覚ます。いつか目を」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"eat the walls\""
msgstr "「壁を食べろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STAY QUIET\""
msgstr "「静かにしろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"pray that you find the same peace I have found\""
msgstr "「私が見つけた安らぎと同じものを、あなたも見つけられますように」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"IF YOU MOVE IT WILL HEAR YOU\""
msgstr "「動くと音を聞かれる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"My name is Susan Li.  If you're reading this, I'm dead.  I leave "
"everything I own to\""
msgstr "「私の名前はスーザン・リーです。もしこれを読んでいる人がいるなら、私はもう死んでいます。私は自分の持ち物をすべて」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"225 steps from the vending machines to the couch room…  Turn left…  141 "
"steps from the couch room to the portal…\""
msgstr "「自販機から255歩でソファの部屋...左に曲がる...ソファの部屋から141歩でポータル...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Welcome to Hell :)\""
msgstr "「地獄にようこそ :)」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"know because I was wearing my watch.  Today was another bad day.  They "
"nearly saw me as I hauled wood back to the big room, and I lost half of it "
"running away.  Tomorrow, I plan\""
msgstr "「は時計をしていたから分かる。今日も最悪の日だった。大部屋に薪を運んでいるところを目撃されかけて、半日くらい逃げ続けた。明日は」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I AM IN A TOP SECRET FACILITY BUILT BY THE GOVERNMENT!!  I HAVE BEEN "
"ILLEGALLY KIDNAPPED!!  PLEASE HELP ME!!\""
msgstr "「私は政府が建設した極秘施設にいます！！拉致されました！！助けてください！！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"What do you want?  Am I supposed to confess??  What am I waiting for???\""
msgstr "「何が望みだ？罪の告白か？？いつまで待てばいい？？？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"…602,651  602,652  602,653  602,654  602,655  602,656  602,657…\""
msgstr "「...602651 602652 602653 602654 602655 602656 602657...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I AM IN A SMALL ROOM WITH MANY DESKS.  I CAN'T STAY HERE.  COME FIND ME.\""
msgstr "「机がたくさんある狭い部屋にいる。もうここにはいられない。私を捜してくれ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"This note has a bunch of lines all over it.  It looks like it might be a "
"map, but nothing is labeled and you're already hopelessly lost."
msgstr "[この紙切れには大量の線が引かれている。地図のように見えるが、目印や文字は何も書かれておらず、現在地を知るのは不可能だ。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This paper is covered in dried blood…  Gross."
msgstr "[この紙には乾いた血が付着している...気味が悪い。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This note is covered with tally marks, front to back."
msgstr "[この紙には裏から表までびっしりと数を数えるための記号が描かれている。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO\""
msgstr "「だめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめだめ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I KILLED THEM.  I HAD TO.\""
msgstr "「奴らを殺した。仕方がなかった。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Casey Blumenthal.  Age 34.  Bangor, Maine.  Hotel receptionist.  The last "
"thing I remember was tripping on a power cord.\""
msgstr "「ケイシー・ブルメンタール。34歳。メイン州バンゴー。ホテルの受付。電源コードに躓いたのが最後の記憶。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME\""
msgstr "「わたしにつきまとうな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"IT'S CHASING ME\""
msgstr "「おいかけられている」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Abandon hope, all ye who read this.\""
msgstr "「これを読んだ者は一切の希望を捨てよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This note just has scribbles on it."
msgstr "[この紙切れには意味不明な走り書きが残っている。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me OUT.  LET ME OUT.\""
msgstr "「ここから出して。ここから出して。ここから出して。ここからだして。ここからだして。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STAY HERE\""
msgstr "「ここにいろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I have been blessed.\""
msgstr "「私は祝福された。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"CIGARET SHORTAGE EASILY EXPLAINED!  The cigaret industry says Americans are "
"smoking at the fastest rate in history - that's why there's a shortage!  The"
" final production figure will be 257 million in 1943, compared with 243 "
"million in 1942.  Add to this tax-free shipments to armed forces - which "
"were 32 million this year and increasing, up from 8 million in 1942 - and "
"civilians would be struggling this year were it not for excellent crops!"
msgstr ""
"『タバコ不足を分かりやすく解説！』タバコ業界によれば、アメリカ人は史上最速のスピードでタバコを消費しています...端的に言えばタバコ不足の原因はこれです！タバコの生産量は1942年が2億4300万本だったのに対し、1943年には2億5700万本に達する見込みです。軍へ供給される非課税タバコは、1942年の800万本に対し今年は3200万本まで増加しています...タバコ葉が豊作にでもならない限り、民間人は今年もタバコの入手に苦労しそうです！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"STRIKE ORE NEAR KENDALL!  A special of the 15th to the Miner from Lewistown "
"states that there is much excitement around Kendall over the reported "
"striking of a hitherto unknown ore in the Fergus tract, extending out on the"
" flat from the Bullard property, and claims are being located in all "
"directions!  Potential experts on the unknown metal are to arrive in the "
"week."
msgstr ""
"『ケンドール近郊で新鉱石発見！』15日にルイスタウンで発行された鉱夫新聞によれば、ケンドール近郊のブラード家所有土地からファーガス家所有土地にかけて広がる平地で、今まで知られていなかった鉱石が発見されました！この鉱石に関して様々な見解が各方面から主張されており、専門家が今週中に現場を訪れる予定です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"THE WEATHER: Fair tonight and Wednesday.  THIS IS REAL COMFORT!  That is "
"what they say when they try one of TROUTMANS' Vudor chair hammocks, $3.50; "
"ask to see them!  Buy one of these for the Fourth of July: Flag, size 5x8 "
"feet, pole and rope ready to hang; price, while they last, $1.75 -- "
"TROUTMANS'!"
msgstr ""
"『天気予報: 今夜から水曜日にかけて晴天。非常に快適！』トラウトマンズ社のブドルチェアハンモック(定価 "
"$3.50)をお試しいただければ、快適さを実感できます。7月4日までにぜひお買い上げください。布サイズ5x8フィート、ポールとロープはご購入後すぐにお使いいただけます。現在の在庫に限り$1.75！"
" (トラウトマンズ社)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"ABRAMS CONFIDENT S. VIET TAKEOVER IS SUCCESS:  Gen. Creighton W. Adams, "
"commander of US troops in South Vietnam, praised the South Vietnamese army "
"today and said its forces have \"tremendous confidence\" in their continued "
"success.  The disappearance of Gen. Bessemer last month has \"not "
"disheartened the troops\", although Adams has admitted his death at enemy "
"hands is \"likely\"."
msgstr ""
"『エイブラムス将軍、南ベトナム占領の成功を確信』南ベトナム駐留米軍司令官クレイトン・W・エイブラムス将軍は本日、南ベトナム軍を激励し、軍の継続的勝利に「多大な自信」をもっていると述べました。先月消息を絶ったベッセマー将軍に関しては、敵の攻撃による戦死について「可能性はある」と認めながらも、「部隊の戦意は低下していない」と主張しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"LUNCH MENUS:  MONDAY, February 16 - NO SCHOOL.  TUESDAY, February 17 - Corn "
"dog with catsup and mustard, potatoes au gratin, bread and butter, buttered "
"spinach, apple half, milk.  WEDNESDAY February 18 - Wildcat goulash, "
"buttered green beans, hot rolls and butter, orange jello with pears, milk.  "
"THURSDAY, February 19 - Tacos with cheese and lettuce, applesauce, milk.  "
"FRIDAY, February 20 - Creamed turkey over mashed potatoes, peanutbutter "
"sandwiches, cherry shortcake, chocolate milk."
msgstr ""
"『ランチメニュー』2月16日(月) 学校はお休みです。2月17日(火) "
"ケチャップとマスタード入りコーンドッグ、ポテトグラタン、パン、バター、ほうれん草のバター炒め、リンゴ半分、牛乳。2月18日(水) "
"簡単グヤーシュ、インゲンマメのバター炒め、ホットロール、バター、オレンジゼリー、洋ナシ、牛乳。2月19日(木) "
"チーズとレタスのタコス、アップルソース、牛乳。2月20日(金) "
"七面鳥のクリーム煮、マッシュポテト、ピーナッツバターサンド、サクランボのショートケーキ、チョコレートミルク。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT SOUGHT:  Eberhard Technologies, Inc. is looking for"
" a full-time (37.5 hours) Administrative Assistant.  This position requires "
"a person with excellent organizational and computer skills, capable of "
"professional discretion in their daily life.  Extensive benefits offered.  "
"Send resume to thaskins@eberhardphoenix.com."
msgstr ""
"『管理補佐スタッフ募集』エベラール・テクノロジー社では、フルタイム(37.5時間)勤務の管理補佐スタッフを募集しています。優れた組織能力とコンピュータースキルをお持ちの方、日頃から専門職にふさわしい行動力を発揮できる方をお待ちしています。福利厚生充実。履歴書はthaskins@eberhardphoenix.comにお送りください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"SEARCH FOR PILOT WHO SAW UFO, DISAPPEARED:  Authorities Wednesday called of "
"a ground, air, and sea search for a pilot who vanished after radioing that "
"his lightplane was being pursued by an unidentified flying object.  An air "
"force reconnaissance plane searched 1,000 square miles of ocean for George "
"Valentina and his Cessna 182.  At one point, Valentina radioed, \"It's not "
"an aircraft…  It's…\" before the transmission broke off.  Residents of King "
"Island have reported sightings of bright and trailing lights over the past "
"six weeks."
msgstr ""
"『UFO目撃のパイロット、消息を絶つ』未確認飛行物体に追跡されていたことを無線で報告したパイロットが消息を絶ちました。水曜日、政府当局は陸空海軍の総力を挙げてパイロットの捜索を行うと発表しました。海域周辺1000平方マイルにおいて、空軍偵察機がセスナ182"
" "
"とそのパイロット、ジョージ・ヴァレンティナ氏の捜索を行っています。「飛行機ではない...あれは...」という言葉を最後に、ヴァレンティナ氏との交信は途絶えました。当海域では過去6週間にわたり、動き回る明るい光がキング島の住民に目撃されています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"HALLOWAY ANNOUNCES SWEEPING BUDGET BILL.  As rhetoric surrounding national "
"defense spending ramps up, Senate Majority Leader Halloway has announced a "
"controversial bill that would cut over $700 billion from multiple federal "
"organizations, including arts funding and welfare.  He introduced the bill "
"by saying, \"We stand on the edge of a new age of science and discovery, and"
" a new age of danger from enemies abroad.  Hardworking Americans can benefit"
" most by getting involved in our new civilian science programs and making a "
"difference there.  No more sitting at home playing video games!\""
msgstr ""
"『ハロウェイ氏、予算削減法案を発表』国防費を巡る論戦が激化する中、上院多数党院内総務のハロウェイ氏が、芸術や福祉など複数分野の連邦機関において予算総額7000億ドル以上を削減するという、物議をかもす法案を発表しました。氏は法案に関して、以下のように述べています。「科学と発見の時代はもはや風前の灯火、我々は国外の敵という脅威に立ち向かう新時代を迎えている。展開を予定している民間科学プログラムに参加すれば、恩恵は十分に受けられる。もう家の中でテレビゲームに熱中する必要もない！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"COUNTRY MUSIC FESTIVAL STILL ON.  Predictions of inclement weather won't "
"stop Huey Brooks, owner of Brooks Entertainment, from putting on his famous "
"country music festival.  The event has moved to the Springfield Masonic "
"Center and begins two hours earlier, at 5PM.  As the whereabouts of self-"
"admitted \"party boy\" Jerry Kenny remain unknown, local legend Poppy "
"Summerfield has been brought in to fill his slot."
msgstr ""
"『カントリーミュージックの祭典、開催中』悪天候が予報されているものの、ブルックス・エンターテイメントのオーナーであるヒューイ・ブルックス氏が大規模なカントリーミュージックフェスティバルを中止することはないようです。今後のイベントはスプリングフィールド・メイソン・センターに会場を移し、予定より2時間早い午後5時から開演します。「お祭り男」ジェリー・ケニーの行方が依然として不明であるため、地元の伝説的アーティストであるポピー・サマーフィールドが代役を務めます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"KIDNAPPING IN WESTFIELD?  After a week of intense searching, chasing leads "
"across the state, the Oriole County Sheriff's Department have still "
"uncovered no leads in the disappearance of Kasey Akron, 31, postal worker "
"and mother of two.  Akron disappeared without a trace while on the job in "
"Westfield, a small village with a population of only 824, on September 24th."
"  Her vehicle was found still running, undelivered mail left inside.  Her "
"mother tearfully testified to the Oriole Free Press, \"Kasey was a happy and"
" loved woman.  Wherever she is, we know she wants to come home!\"  "
"Detectives previously suggested that Akron may have departed with someone "
"she knew, but have not made any arrests so far."
msgstr ""
"『ウェストフィールドで誘拐事件か？』郵便局員で二児の母親でもあるケイシー・アクロンさん(31歳)の失踪について、オリオール郡保安官事務所は一週間にわたって州内で捜査を続けていますが、いまだに何の手掛かりも得られていません。アクロンさんは9月24日、人口わずか824人の小さな村、ウェストフィールドで勤務中に突然失踪しました。配達中の車のエンジンは掛かったままで、内部には未配達の郵便物が残されていました。彼女の母親が、オリオール・フリープレス社の取材に対し、涙ながらに答えています。「ケイシーは皆に愛され、幸せに暮らしていました。どこにいるのか分かりませんが、家に帰りたがっているに決まっています！」担当刑事による会見では、アクロンさんが知人と共に行動していた可能性が示唆されていますが、現時点でその人物の逮捕には至っていません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MYSTERY IN DRESDEN: Nefarious happenings are nothing new for the ever-"
"tumultuous GDR, but the peculiar mystery of two missing actors has captured "
"international attention.  Nani Wolf and Angela Weiss were slated to perform "
"in mere moments, spotted entering their dressing room with fellow company "
"members testifying to every minute and every angle, but when the curtain "
"call came, they were nowhere to be found!  Region police are baffled, but "
"have concluded there was no sign of foul play.  The girls just disappeared!"
msgstr ""
"『ドレスデンで謎の事件発生』激動のドイツ民主共和国では不吉な事件など日常茶飯事かもしれませんが、二人の女優が行方不明になった奇妙な事件は世界各国からの関心を集めています。ナニ・ヴォルフとアンジェラ・ヴァイスの出演時間は、ほんの僅かでした。出番が終わって楽屋へ入る姿も、複数の劇団員が様々な位置から目撃しています。しかし、カーテンコールが始まっても、二人は現れませんでした！地元警察も困惑していますが、事件性はないと結論付けています。少女たちは、ただ忽然と姿を消したのです！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MISSING MAN: Gerald Bienkowski, age 47.  Disappeared: April 14.  Last seen "
"leaving Tony's Watering Hole in Burlington.  Believed to be of sound mind, "
"but possibly in danger.  If seen, contact local police.  Do not approach."
msgstr ""
"『行方不明者』ジェラルド・ビエンコウスキー、47歳。4月14日、バーリントンにあるトニーの酒場を出て以降行方不明。健康体だが、不安定な状態。目撃者は地元警察にご連絡ください。不用意に近寄らないよう気を付けてください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MISSING WOMAN: Anne Demir, age 33.  Disappeared: May 3.  Last seen driving "
"SOUTH of Dallas on I-45 at 8:45pm.  NEW DETAILS HAVE RE-OPENED THIS "
"INVESTIGATION.  New witness footage confirms Demir's car driving SOUTH "
"rather than north, as previously reported."
msgstr ""
"『行方不明者』アン・デミル、33歳。5月3日午後8時45分、45号線を通ってダラス南部へ向かう途中で失踪。新情報の判明により捜査が再開されました。新たな目撃情報によれば、デミルさんの車は北ではなく南へ向かっていたとのことです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"NO TRACE FOUND in search for missing Lisa Hawthorne and her boyfriend Shaun "
"after 58 Civil Air Patrol members spent three days scouring the area near "
"Twelve Mile Trail.  The couple's car was found roadside near the northern "
"trailhead and they were reported missing shortly after.  The couple were "
"\"on a daily hike in a place completely known to them\", says detective "
"Aretha Wesson, who personally knew the two intrepid young athletes."
msgstr ""
"『失踪者の手掛かりなし』リサ・ホーソンさんとそのボーイフレンドであるショーンさんが行方不明となり、トゥエルブ・マイル・トレイル周辺で民間空中哨戒部隊58名を動員した3日間の捜索が行われましたが、手掛かりは見つかっていません。車両が北部の登山口に近い路肩で発見され、まもなく捜索願が提出されました。二人は有望なアスリートであり、プライベートで交友があったアレッサ・ウェッソン刑事はこのように述べています。「二人はこの現場で毎日ハイキングをしており、よく知っていた筈です」"

