#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Enforcement manual"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Enforcement manuals"
msgstr[0] "本(武術/C.R.I.T執行官マニュアル)"

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Enforcement manual"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "An advanced military manual on C.R.I.T Enforcer melee."
msgstr "C.R.I.Tの近接攻撃術について記した高度な軍用マニュアルです。"

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
msgstr "C.R.I.T執行官戦闘術"

#. ~ Description of martial art "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid ""
"A defensive style that is centered around stunning swings, knockback and "
"grounding enemies.  Each attack landed increases your armor and offers other"
" combat bonuses based on stats."
msgstr ""
"周囲の敵に対して気絶、吹き飛ばし、転倒効果をもつ防御的な戦闘スタイルです。命中する度に防御力が増加し、その他の戦闘ボーナス効果が付与されます。"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "You ready yourself to stand your ground."
msgstr "覚悟を決めました。"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s draws a line in the sand."
msgstr "%sは地面に一線を引き、戦線を定めました。"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "Bulwark"
msgstr "強固な砦"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Enforcement" in martial art "Bulwark"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You stand firmly.\n"
"\n"
"+1 bash damage, +1 bash, cut, and stab armor, bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 10% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"堅固に立ちはだかります。\n"
"\n"
"打撃与ダメージ+1、打撃/斬撃/刺突耐性+1、筋力x10%の打撃/斬撃/刺突耐性上昇\n"
"1ターン継続、最大蓄積数2"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "Unyielding Front"
msgstr "不屈の前線"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Enforcement" in martial art "Unyielding
#. Front"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stand strong in the face of adversity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 40% of Strength, +1 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""
"逆境にもめげずに立ち向かいます。\n"
"\n"
"筋力x40%の命中上昇、打撃/斬撃/刺突耐性+1"

#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "Reprimand"
msgstr "急所狙い"

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Reprimand"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "You clock %s's in a weak spot to knock em down"
msgstr "%sの急所に一撃を加えて打ち倒しました"

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Reprimand"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
