msgstr "砕打"

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Roomsweeper"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "You steady your arm and release a crushing blow at %s"
msgstr "狙いを定め、%s目がけて腕を勢いく振り下ろしました"

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Roomsweeper"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> releases a crushing blow at %s"
msgstr "<npcname>は%s目がけて勢いよく腕を振り下ろしました"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "C.R.I.T CQB manual"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T CQB manuals"
msgstr[0] "本(武術/C.R.I.T CQBマニュアル)"

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T CQB manual"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "An advanced military manual on C.R.I.T general CQB."
msgstr "C.R.I.Tの一般的なCQB技術について記した高度な軍用マニュアルです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Melee Training"
msgstr "C.R.I.T武器鍛錬"

#. ~ Description of mutation "C.R.I.T Melee Training"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid ""
"You have received CQB training.  For every hit you land, gain themed combat "
"bonuses."
msgstr "CQBの訓練を受けています。攻撃が命中する度に、様々な戦闘ボーナスを得られます。"

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "C.R.I.T CQB"
msgstr "C.R.I.T CQB"

#. ~ Description of martial art "C.R.I.T CQB"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid ""
"A style centered around rapid strikes and piercing jabs.  Each attack landed"
" adds a plethora of combat bonuses."
msgstr "素早い攻撃と激しい突きを中心とした戦闘スタイルです。攻撃が命中する度にボーナス効果が付与されます。"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T CQB"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "You shift your weight for the oncoming fight."
msgstr "迫りくる戦いに備えて重心を調整しました。"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "C.R.I.T CQB"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares for hand-to-hand battle."
msgstr "%sは取っ組み合って戦う準備を整えました。"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T CQB"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "Fluid Tenacity"
msgstr "流水の構え"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T CQB" in martial art "Fluid Tenacity"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You move like water.\n"
"\n"
"Dodging skill increased by 10% of Dexterity, -10% move cost, move cost reduced by 5% of Dexterity.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"水のようにしなやかに動きます。\n"
"\n"
"器用x10%の回避スキル上昇、行動コスト-10%、器用x5%の行動コスト低下\n"
"2ターン継続、最大蓄積数5"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T CQB"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
msgid "Tactful Initiative"
msgstr "戦術的牽制"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T CQB" in martial art "Tactful Initiative"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_MeleeBuffs.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have gained an advantage by always remaining mindful of common weaknesses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy, armor, and dodge increased by 15% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"弱点を常に意識しておくことで優位性を保ちます。\n"
"\n"
"器用x15%の命中・耐性・回避上昇"

