#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid "companion potato"
msgid_plural "companion potatoes"
msgstr[0] "コンパニオンポテト"

#. ~ Description of "companion potato"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid ""
"Seems like some kind of Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating System, attached"
" to a potato."
msgstr ""
"ジャガイモに取り付けられた遺伝的生命形態およびディスクオペレーティングシステム(Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating "
"System)のようなものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid "SpOreos"
msgid_plural "SpOreos"
msgstr[0] "真菌オレオ"

#. ~ Description of "SpOreos"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavors such "
"as Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human "
"Civilization."
msgstr ""
"ミカズ工業が販売している大人気クッキーです！マーロス味、アンズタケ味、侵略味、不可避的な人類文明滅亡味といったような、病みつきになる風味のお菓子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgstr[0] "パワーサースト(マナナ味)"

#. ~ Description of "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"POWERTHIRST in new Manana flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of "
"testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal"
" meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr ""
"パワーサーストにマナナ味が新登場。信じられない量のテストステロン配合。信じられません。まるでヤクの缶詰みたい！これヤクの缶詰ですね。パワーサーストはヤクの缶詰です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgstr[0] "パワーサースト(フィズビッチ味)"

#. ~ Description of "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
