#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"人々に演説を聞かせる日々を過ごし、たくさんの人を説得し、オフィスにいる間は様々な約束を取り付け続けていました。投票基盤となる有権者たちは死亡、あるいは吸収され、敵対勢力がアメリカ中枢に居座ってしまった状況で、人の心を掴むのは至難の業です。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
