"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr "どういうわけか変異体たちの注意を引いてしまい、今や周囲一帯を囲まれています。逃げ出すつもりなら徹底抗戦する必要がありそうです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr "侵略軍に気づかれていない、遠方の安全な場所へたどり着きました。頼れるものは自分自身だけです..."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr "侵略軍に気づかれていない、遠方の安全な場所へたどり着きました。頼れるものは自分自身だけです..."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr "パニックと混沌の中を避難している時に、酷い傷を負ってしまいました！適切な治療が受けられないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr "パニックと混沌の中を避難している時に、酷い傷を負ってしまいました！適切な治療が受けられないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the explosions are "
"fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing "
"out here."
msgstr ""
"気が付いたら森の中にいました。文明からかけ離れたこの場所まで届く悲鳴や爆発音はわずかですが、これから何をするのか考えておいた方が良さそうです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
