msgid "Kevlar-lined elephant-sized peto"
msgid_plural "Kevlar-lined elephant-sized petos"
msgstr[0] "闘牛象用装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar-lined elephant-sized peto"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as horse protection for bullfighting.  You could put this on"
" a friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"元々は闘牛に参加するゾウが装着していた、革と厚手のケブラーを縫い付けたマットレスのような重い布製防具です。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin elephant armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin elephant armors"
msgstr[0] "象鎧(シリコンキチン)"

