msgid "chitin elephant armor"
msgid_plural "chitin elephant armors"
msgstr[0] "象鎧(キチン)"

#. ~ Description of "chitin elephant armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from chitin "
