msgstr "キチンのメッシュ素材で自作した、それぞれクリニエール、ペイトレール、クルーピエと呼ばれる象鎧です。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid "chainmail elephant armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail elephant armors"
msgstr[0] "象鎧(チェーンメイル)"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail elephant armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for elephants as protection.  "
"You could put this on a friendly elephant."
msgstr "ゾウの体を保護する厚手のチェーンメイルです。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather elephant bardings with caparison"
msgstr[0] "象鎧(硬化革)"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a battle between a monstrous demon and a"
" regal warrior astride an elephant and wielding an elaborate vajra.  You "
"could put this on a friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、ゾウに跨った厳めしい戦士が凝った意匠の金剛杵を振るって怪物と戦う様子が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a being, a goddess?  with many arms "
"bearing different items with one large uncovered breast on the left side.  "
"You could put this on a friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、大きな左胸が露出した多腕の女神らしき人物が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts several charging elephants trampling "
"enemy soldiers.  You could put this on a friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、突進して敵兵を踏み潰すゾウの群れが描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts an assortment of diamonds and gems.  You"
" could put this on a friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、ダイヤモンドなど多数の宝石が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a man in rich garments and a full "
"uncovered belly, riding in an elaborate chariot.  You could put this on a "
"friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、腹を丸出しにして古代戦車に乗る裕福そうな男が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts several identical smiling men in turbans"
" of various bright colors performing a dance.  You could put this on a "
"friendly elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、鮮やかな色のターバンを巻いた同じ顔立ちの男たちが笑顔で踊る様子が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather elephant barding with caparison"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for elephants, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a fierce, three-horned dinosaur bursting"
" out the side of a 1970s-era van.  You could put this on a friendly "
"elephant."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる象鎧一式です。布飾りには、1970年代のワゴン車の側面を突き破って飛び出してくる獰猛な三本角の恐竜が描かれています。友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather elephant barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather elephant bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "象鎧(骨)"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather elephant barding with bones"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
msgid ""
"Leather elephant barding with decorative bones affixed, meant to invoke fear"
" in bandits and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly "
"elephant."
msgstr "革製の象鎧の表面に骨を貼り付けて装飾し、ごろつきや盗賊団、商人たちを恐怖に陥れます！友好的な大型四足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
