#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "駝鳥鎧"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "Kevlar-lined ostrich-sized peto"
msgid_plural "Kevlar-lined ostrich-sized petos"
msgstr[0] "闘牛駝鳥用装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar-lined ostrich-sized peto"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as horse protection for bullfighting, but adapted for the "
"noblest of beasts.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"元々は闘牛に参加するダチョウが装着していた、革と厚手のケブラーを縫い付けたマットレスのような重い布製防具ですが、これは最も高貴な獣のために作られているようです。友好的な二足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "駝鳥鎧(シリコンキチン)"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin ostrich armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a "
"friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"シリコンキチンのメッシュ素材で自作した、それぞれクリニエール、ペイトレール、クルーピエと呼ばれる駝鳥鎧です。友好的な二足歩行動物に装着できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
