msgid_plural "gargoyleosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビガルゴイレオサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "gargoyleosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This lightly armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a rigid spiked tail, a "
"beak, and sturdy spikes along the sides.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "硬い棘付きの尾、くちばし、側面から生えた頑丈な棘、軽装甲をもつ四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
