"短いくちばしと発達した頭頂部をもつ、鱗が生えた巨大な恐竜です。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Ridgeback Ripper"
msgid_plural "Ridgeback Rippers"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビヒパクロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Ridgeback Ripper"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a tall ridge down the back, a short beak and a "
"wide, rounded head crest, dead but walking, eyes vacant and swollen.  Its "
"entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"背中から尾にかけての隆起、短いくちばし、幅が広く丸みを帯びた頭頂部をもつ、鱗が生えた巨大な恐竜です。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Skull Breaker"
msgid_plural "Skull Breakers"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビパキケファロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Skull Breaker"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur, covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid.  Its hard-looking domed head "
"sits on a body bulging with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。硬そうな頭部が特徴であり、酷い傷を負っており、全身の筋肉が肥大しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Leaping Leptoceratops"
msgid_plural "Leaping Leptoceratops"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビレプトケラトプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Leaping Leptoceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A shambling, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a bony crest and beak.  Its "
"entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "骨ばったフリルとくちばしをもつ四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Zuni Flood"
msgid_plural "Zuni Floods"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビズニケラトプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Zuni Flood"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A four-legged dinosaur with a tall thin bony head crest, two long brow "
"horns, and a beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and "
"swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"骨ばった細長いとさか、目の上から生えた二本の角、くちばしが特徴的な、四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Spear Lizard"
msgid_plural "Spear Lizards"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビスティラコサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Spear Lizard"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a spiked frill, a hooked beak, "
"and a long horn above the nose.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"棘が生えたフリル、鉤状のくちばし、鼻の上から伸びた長い角が特徴的な、巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Pain Central"
msgid_plural "Pain Centrals"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビセントロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Pain Central"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a beak and long horn above the "
"nose.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"くちばしと鼻の上から生えた角が特徴的な、サイのような姿をした恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Horn Hook"
msgid_plural "Horn Hooks"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビエイニオサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Horn Hook"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a hooked beak, long frill, and "
"long horn curving forward towards the nose.  Its entire body bulges with "
"distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"鉤状のくちばし、長いフリル、鼻の上から前方に湾曲して伸びる角が特徴的な、巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Achelosaurus Anvil"
msgid_plural "Achelosaurus Anvils"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアケロウサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Achelosaurus Anvil"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest with two long "
"curved spikes and three rough bosses above the eyes and nose as well as a "
"short tail and hooked beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles "
"and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"二本の長い棘が付いた骨ばった大きく長いフリルと、目と鼻の上に膨らんだ三つの突起、短い尾と鉤状のくちばしが特徴的な、大型四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Dino Rhino"
msgid_plural "Dino Rhinos"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビパキリノサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dino Rhino"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with two massive bony "
"bosses on its brow and nose.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles "
"and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"目の上と鼻に巨大な骨のこぶが生えた、サイのような姿の酷い傷を負った巨大四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Crashing Chasm"
msgid_plural "Five Horn Death Punches"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビカスモサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Crashing Chasm"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest from which "
"three short horns emerge above the eyes and beak.  Its entire body bulges "
"with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"骨ばった長いフリル、目とくちばしの上から突き出た三本の短い角が特徴的な、巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Five Horn Death Punch"
msgid_plural "Five Horn Death Punches"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビペンタケラトプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Five Horn Death Punch"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest from"
" which four long horns and a short nose horn emerge.  Its entire body bulges"
" with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"盾のような硬質のフリルと4本の長い角、鼻から生えた短い角が特徴的な、サイに似た巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Kosmic Horror"
msgid_plural "Kosmic Horrors"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビコスモケラトプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Kosmic Horror"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a bony crest and two "
"wavy side horns.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen,"
" festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"骨ばったフリルと2本の湾曲した角をもつ、サイのような姿をした恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Bull Dino"
msgid_plural "Bull Dinos"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビトロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Bull Dino"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a bony crest from "
"which two wicked-looking horns emerge.  Its entire body bulges with "
"distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"骨ばったフリルと2本の鋭い角をもつ、酷い傷を負ったサイのような姿の巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Triceratruck"
msgid_plural "Triceratrucks"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビトリケラトプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Triceratruck"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a bony crest from "
"which three wicked-looking horns emerge.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
"  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"盾のような骨ばったフリルと3本の大きな角が特徴的な、サイに似た大型恐竜のゾンビです。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Godlike Goliath"
msgid_plural "Godlike Goliath"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビテスケロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Godlike Goliath"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a beaked bipedal dinosaur covered with tattered "
"feathers and black, putrid liquid.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、くちばしが生えたフラフラと歩く二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Winged Horror"
msgid_plural "Winged Horrors"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビディモルフォドン"

#. ~ Description of monster "Winged Horror"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"The ragged but flying corpse of a large feathered reptile with a long, "
"pointed, toothless beak and a long, pointy head crest.  Its entire body "
"bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"翼がボロボロになった、大型翼竜のゾンビです。刃が生えておらず先端が尖ったくちばしと、角のような頭部の突起が特徴的です。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビディロフォサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady dilophosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
" bipedal dinosaur with sharp teeth and bulges on the head."
msgstr "全身が不気味な影に覆われており、鋭い歯が生えた大きな頭をもつ二足歩行恐竜の輪郭だけがぼんやりと見えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady ceratosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady ceratosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビケラトサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady ceratosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"an enormous, bipedal dinosaur with horns, spikes, and big sharp teeth."
msgstr "全身が不気味な影に覆われており、角と棘と大きな鋭い歯をもつ巨大な二足歩行恐竜の輪郭だけがぼんやりと見えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady spinosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady spinosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビスピノサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady spinosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
" huge, bipedal dinosaur with a tattered sail.  The head is long and narrow, "
"with a V-shaped snout."
msgstr ""
"全身が不気味な影に覆われており、ボロボロの帆を背負った巨大な二足歩行恐竜の輪郭だけがぼんやりと見えています。。頭部は細長く、口が尖っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady torvosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady torvosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビトルヴォサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady torvosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
" large, bipedal dinosaur with a large head and a tail."
msgstr "全身が不気味な影に覆われており、大きな頭と尾をもつ巨大な二足歩行恐竜の輪郭だけがぼんやりと見えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady allosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady allosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビアロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady allosaurus zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "shady acrocanthosaurus zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "shady siats zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "acrocanthosaurus nightstalker"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
" large, bipedal dinosaur with big, sharp teeth."
msgstr "全身が不気味な影に覆われており、尖った大きな歯をもつ巨大な二足歩行恐竜の輪郭だけがぼんやりと見えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady acrocanthosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady acrocanthosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビアクロカントサウルス"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady siats zombie"
msgid_plural "shady siats zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビシアッツ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady dryptosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady dryptosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冥暗ゾンビドリプトサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady dryptosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
" large, bipedal dinosaur with feathery edges.  The head looks big and the "
