#. ~ Description of "magnum ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol_magnum.json
msgid ""
"Magnum ammunition, developed from early handgun hunting efforts and "
"popularized by law enforcement usage.  It is more powerful than common "
"pistol ammo.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which "
"offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration"
" compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"狩猟に使われていた初期のハンドガン用に開発され、法執行機関への導入によって普及した弾薬です。一般的な拳銃弾よりも高威力です。単なる鉛玉に比べて汚損が少なく、信頼性と貫通力も改善した、古くは「ボール」と呼ばれていたフルメタルジャケット弾です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol_magnum.json
