#: data/mods/Magiclysm/morale_types.json
msgid "Enjoyed Iocus"
msgstr "気分が楽しくなる魔法を堪能した"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "魔法使い志望者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Would-be Wizard" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr "魔法使いになれると書かれたカラフルなパンフレットを見つけました。世界が崩壊し始めたというのに、妙にのどかな話です。"

