msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "アースシェイパー見習い"

#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Earthshaper" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr "戦いは苦手でしたが、その克服に役立ついくつかの魔法をコーチから教わりました。"

