#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "テクノマンサー見習い"

#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Technomancer" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr "テストでズルをするために使っていた魔法は、大変動の世界で他の用途に役立つかもしれません。"

