#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Slime Breath"
msgstr "粘つく息"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath is sticky and slimy somehow.  This won't damage your "
"interactions with people but it's definitely noticeable."
msgstr "呼気がどことなくネバネバ、ヌルヌルしている気がします。人付き合いに支障はありませんが、少し気になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Chimeric Breath"
msgstr "酷い口臭"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chimeric Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath could metaphorically melt lead.  It's horrible.  It's so bad "
"that it can actually distract from your attempts to intimidate someone."
msgstr "鉛さえ溶かしてしまう気さえする、酷い口臭です。信じられません。他人を威嚇しようとしても、口臭の方を気にされて威嚇にならないほどの酷さです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgstr "デバッグ呪文(デバッグ専用)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Spell Mutation"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "デバッグ専用の呪文を最大レベルの状態で習得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Fish"
msgstr "変化(魚)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Fish"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are fish-like.  Just keep swimming!"
msgstr "魚のような姿になりました。泳ぎ続けましょう！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Bear"
msgstr "変化(クマ)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Bear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"You are bear-like, granting you raw bestial power in exchange for "
"intelligence."
msgstr "クマのような姿になりました。知力と引き換えに、獣のような野生の力を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Deer"
msgstr "変化(シカ)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Deer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"You are deer-like, giving you the ability to move quickly and escape danger."
"  It is hard to use your arms in combat, however."
msgstr "シカのような姿になりました。素早く移動し、危険な存在から逃げ延びる力を手に入れましたが、このような腕で戦うのは難しそうです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Mirror Displacement"
msgstr "鏡面変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mirror Displacement"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You aren't where you seem to be."
msgstr "実際の位置と異なる場所にいるように見えています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Horns"
msgstr "悪魔の角"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Horns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"Large ram horns curl around your ears on each side of your head.  Gives you "
"a headbutt attack and head protection."
msgstr "大きなヒツジの角が両耳の傍から生えています。頭突き攻撃が可能になり、頭部の装甲としても使えます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Hooves"
msgstr "悪魔の蹄"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Hooves"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your toes have merged into cloven hooves, like that of a goat.  You also "
"have coarse brown fur from the waist down."
msgstr "つま先から下が、ヤギのような蹄の生えた足に変異しています。更に、腰から下が粗い茶色の毛皮に覆われています。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demonic Possession"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"You are possessed by a greater demon, giving you great strength and combat "
"abilities but reducing your fine motor control skills.  This gives you a "
"slower crafting speed and the inability to cast spells."
msgstr ""
"高位の悪魔に憑りつかれたことで、強大な力と戦闘技術を得ましたが、細かな作業は困難になっています。製作速度が遅くなり、呪文詠唱ができない状態です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Claws"
msgstr "悪魔の鉤爪"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Skin"
msgstr "悪魔の肌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Skin"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Your skin is crimson."
msgstr "肌の色が真っ赤です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Goat Tail"
msgstr "ヤギの尻尾"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goat Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "You have a short, stubby goat tail."
msgstr "短くちっぽけなヤギの尻尾が生えています。"

