msgid_plural "shrub-ox"
msgstr[0] "エウケラテリウム"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massively built bovine sometimes found browsing in the woods.  It has "
"dark, long wool and two big, curved horns."
msgstr "森の中で草を食んでいる姿をよく見かける、巨大なウシです。黒く長い毛皮と、大きく湾曲した2本の角が特徴です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "shrub-ox calf"
msgid_plural "shrub-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "エウケラテリウム(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile shrub-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "エウケラテリウムの幼体です。角や毛皮はまだそれほど長くありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "wood-ox"
msgid_plural "wood-ox"
msgstr[0] "ブーテリウム"

#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A large-built bovine sometimes found browsing in high altitude woods.  It "
"has a thick, long coat of wool and two short, curved horns."
msgstr "高地の森の中で草を食んでいる姿をよく見かける、体格の立派なウシです。厚く長い毛皮と、湾曲した短い2本の角が特徴です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "wood-ox calf"
msgid_plural "wood-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "ブーテリウム(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile wood-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "ブーテリウムの幼体です。角や毛皮はまだそれほど発達していません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Mayfield's goat"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat"
msgstr[0] "ジャコウウシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"Soergelia mayfieldi - a sturdily built ruminant, not unlike a goat but more "
"massively built.  It has light-brown wool and two vicious looking horns that"
" are curved forward."
msgstr "ヤギの体格をがっしりさせたような姿の反芻動物です。毛色は薄茶色で、前方に湾曲した二本の鋭い角が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Mayfield's goat kid"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat kids"
msgstr[0] "ジャコウウシ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat kid"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile Mayfield's goat.  It's horns have not grown far yet, and its wool"
" is still short, white, and quite fluffy."
msgstr "ジャコウウシの幼体です。角はまだあまり伸びておらず、毛皮も白色で短くフワフワしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "ancient bison"
msgid_plural "ancient bison"
msgstr[0] "ムカシバイソン"

#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massive, meaty bovid that roams the steppes in large herds.  It is "
"insulated against the cold with a thick layer of wool.  Two short horns "
"appear from its bushy head wool."
msgstr ""
"大草原を群れで移動する、筋肉質で巨大なウシ科の動物です。羊毛のような厚い毛皮で寒さを防ぎ、特に毛が密集している頭部からは短い2本の角が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "ancient bison calf"
msgid_plural "ancient bison calves"
msgstr[0] "ムカシバイソン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile ancient bison.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "ムカシバイソンの幼体です。角や毛皮はまだそれほど発達していません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Scott's horse"
msgid_plural "Scott's horses"
msgstr[0] "エクウス・スコッティ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "Scott's horse foal"
msgid_plural "Scott's horse foals"
msgstr[0] "エクウス・スコッティ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing around "
"its head joyously."
msgstr "ウマの幼体です。親の近くで興奮気味に駆け回り、楽しそうに首を振っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Giant horse"
msgid_plural "Giant horses"
msgstr[0] "大型ウマ"

#. ~ Description of monster "Giant horse"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massive species of Equus that looks like a draft horse, just bigger.  If "
"you dare come close to it, you might be able to get this one to trust you "
"enough to ride it."
msgstr "挽馬のように大きなウマ属の一種です。近寄ってみれば、信頼関係を築いて騎乗させてもらえるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Giant horse foal"
msgid_plural "Giant horse foals"
msgstr[0] "大型ウマ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Giant horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing "
"around its head joyously."
msgstr "大型のウマの幼体です。親の近くで興奮気味に駆け回り、楽しそうに首を振っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Camelops"
msgid_plural "camelops"
msgstr[0] "カメロプス"

#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A huge, woolly two-humped camel that roams far and wide across the american "
"continent.  It looks at you irritated, chewing on some long grass."
msgstr "アメリカ大陸を縦横無尽に駆け巡る、密集した毛皮をもつ巨大なフタコブラクダです。長い草を食みながら、怒ったような顔でこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Camelops foal"
msgid_plural "Camelops foals"
msgstr[0] "カメロプス(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile camelops.  Its humps haven't grown to full size yet, but it is "
"already covered in a thin layer of wool."
msgstr "カメロプスの幼体です。まだコブは発達していませんが、暖かそうな毛皮に覆われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "flat-headed peccary"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "フラットヘッドペッカリー"

#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It is "
"smaller than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, and also a bit "
"smaller than its close relative, the long-nosed peccary.  Different to "
"these, it is a quite social and friendly creature - unless its young are "
"threatened."
msgstr ""
"ゴワゴワとした茶色の毛皮をもつ、短足のブタのようなずんぐりとした動物です。ヨーロッパに生息するイノシシより小型です。近縁種のロングノーズペッカリーよりも小さく、子供に手を出さない限り非常に大人しく友好的である点が異なります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "flat-headed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "フラットヘッドペッカリー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile flat-headed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  "
"Its playful squeaks delight your heart."
msgstr "短足のブタのようなずんぐりとしたフラットヘッドペッカリーの幼体です。楽しそうな鳴き声が心を和ませてくれます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "long-nosed peccary"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "ロングノーズペッカリー"

#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It just a "
"bit smaller than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, but considerably "
"bigger than its close relative, the flat-headed peccary.  Different to the "
"latter, they are solitary and more aggressive, but still appreciate good "
"food."
msgstr ""
"ゴワゴワとした茶色の毛皮をもつ、短足のブタのようなずんぐりとした動物です。ヨーロッパに生息するイノシシよりは少し小さいです。近縁種のフラットヘッドペッカリーよりはかなり大きく、単独で行動し、より攻撃的ですが、美食家である点は共通しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "long-nosed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "ロングノーズペッカリー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile long-nosed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  "
"Its playful squeals delight your heart."
msgstr "短足のブタのようなずんぐりとしたロングノーズペッカリーの幼体です。楽しそうな鳴き声が心を和ませてくれます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A large, muscular species of wolf, with incredibly strong and sharp teeth "
"capable of penetrating the thick hides of mammoths and giant sloths."
msgstr "大型で筋肉質なオオカミの一種です。マンモスやメガテリウムの厚い皮を突き破れるほど強く鋭い牙をもっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "dire wolf cub"
msgid_plural "dire wolf cubs"
msgstr[0] "ダイアウルフ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile dire wolf.  It runs around as excited as aimless, occasionally "
"barking joyously."
msgstr "ダイアウルフの幼体です。目的もなく興奮気味に走り回り、時折楽しそうに吠えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "sabre-toothed cat"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cats"
msgstr[0] "サーベルタイガー"

#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-colored, "
"spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous sabre-like upper canine teeth "
"look menacing."
msgstr "サイズはトラに似ていますが、トラより逞しく、尾は短く、毛皮は斑点のある砂色をしています。サーベルのように発達した牙が上顎から生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "sabre-toothed cat cub"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cat cubs"
msgstr[0] "サーベルタイガー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile sabre-toothed cat.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than "
"its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "サーベルタイガーの幼体です。幼体としてはかなり大きいですが、子を守るため死に物狂いで戦う成体に比べれば比較的安全です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion"
msgid_plural "cave lions"
msgstr[0] "ホラアナライオン"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"This fierce looking sister of the European cave lion is a fast hunter, but "
"usually likes to spend its days laying in the sun."
msgstr "獰猛なヨーロッパホラアナライオンの近縁種です。素早く動いて狩りをしますが、普段は日向ぼっこを好みます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion cub"
msgid_plural "cave lion cubs"
msgstr[0] "ホラアナライオン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile cave lion.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its "
"parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "ホラアナライオンの幼体です。幼体としてはかなり大きいですが、子を守るため死に物狂いで戦う成体に比べれば比較的安全です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "bobcat cub"
msgid_plural "bobcat cubs"
msgstr[0] "ボブキャット(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile bobcat.  It already moves with enthusiasm, but with much less "
"grace and dexterity than its parent."
msgstr "ボブキャットの幼体です。既に活発に動いていますが、親と比べると優雅さや器用さはかなり劣ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant beaver"
msgid_plural "giant beavers"
msgstr[0] "カストロイデス"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A big rodent feeding off of wood, known for building dams that set entire "
"regions under water.  About the size of a calf."
msgstr "ダムを造ってあたり一帯を水没させてしまうことで知られる、木材を食べる子牛ほどのサイズのネズミです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant beaver cub"
msgid_plural "giant beaver cubs"
msgstr[0] "カストロイデス(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile giant beaver.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "既にかなりの大きさがある、カストロイデスの幼体です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "large claw sloth"
msgid_plural "large claw sloths"
msgstr[0] "メガテリウム"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 meters, gracefully wandering "
"through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food "
"to support its massive body weight."
msgstr "氷河のようにゆったりと森を徘徊する、体高が約3mある巨大なナマケモノです。その巨体を維持するため、常に食べ物を探しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "large claw sloth cub"
msgid_plural "large claw sloth cubs"
msgstr[0] "メガテリウム(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile large claw sloth.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "既にかなりの大きさがある、メガテリウムの幼体です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "stag moose"
msgid_plural "stag moose"
msgstr[0] "ケルヴァルケス"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A big deer-like creature, standing more than 2m tall with impressive antlers"
" crowning their head."
msgstr "体高が約2mある大きなシカのような動物です。頭部から立派な枝角が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "stag moose cub"
msgid_plural "stag moose cubs"
msgstr[0] "ケルヴァルケス(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile stag moose.  Pretty big already, but its antlers have not grown "
"yet."
msgstr "ケルヴァルケスの幼体です。既にかなりの大きさですが、まだ枝角は生えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "woolly mammoth"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoths"
msgstr[0] "ケナガマンモス"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge elephant-like animal covered in thick, long hair, shielding it "
"against the cold.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-"
"curving tusks."
msgstr "全身を覆う厚く長い毛で寒さを防ぐ、巨大なゾウのような動物です。上向きに反った2本の長い牙をゆったりと揺らしながら歩きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "woolly mammoth cub"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoth cubs"
msgstr[0] "ケナガマンモス(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"This big baby mammoth is already covered in thick brown wool, but the "
"menacing tusks of their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "既に茶色の厚い毛皮に覆われている、大きなマンモスの幼体です。成体がもつ威嚇的な牙はまだ生えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "mastodon"
msgid_plural "mastodons"
msgstr[0] "マストドン"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"Shorter, but more massive than a woolly mammoth, and - crucially - much less"
" hairy.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving "
"tusks."
msgstr "ケナガマンモスより体格が大きく、毛皮が短く薄いマンモスです。上向きに反った2本の長い牙をゆったりと揺らしながら歩きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "mastodon cub"
msgid_plural "mastodon cubs"
msgstr[0] "マストドン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"This big baby mastodon is already quite muscular, but the menacing tusks of "
"their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "既に体格がかなりがっしりしている、大きなマストドンの幼体です。成体がもつ威嚇的な牙はまだ生えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant short-faced bear"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bears"
msgstr[0] "アルクトドゥス"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A bear weighing about a ton, standing at literal eyelevel with man, as long "
"as it isn't towering above you on it's long, muscular hind legs.  Has a "
"wide, short snout, giving it's face an almost feline expression.  Its not "
"particularly aggressive, but doesn't tolerate threats to itself or its cubs."
msgstr ""
"長い後ろ足で立ち上がらない限りは人間と同程度の体高がある、体重約1トンほどのクマです。鼻は広く短く、まるでネコ科動物のような顔立ちです。特に攻撃的な性格ではありませんが、自身や子供に対する脅威には容赦しません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant short-faced bear cub"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "アルクトドゥス(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant short-faced bear.  Still a massive bear and a considerable "
"threat on its own, but the real danger will come from its highly protective "
"parent."
msgstr "アルクトドゥスの幼体です。巨大なクマというだけでかなりの脅威ですが、真の脅威は幼体を守っている親クマの襲来です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "great auk"
msgid_plural "great auks"
msgstr[0] "オオウミガラス"

#. ~ Description of monster "great auk"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A large flightless sea bird that bears some resemblance to penguins, "
"although it has a much larger beak.  It has a black and white coat with a "
"characteristic white spot around its eyes."
msgstr "ペンギンに似た、飛べない大型の海鳥です。くちばしはかなり大きく、毛色は白と黒で、目の周囲だけ白くなっているのが特徴です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "white chick"
msgid_plural "white chicks"
msgstr[0] "ひな鳥(白色)"

#. ~ Description of monster "white chick"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A tiny grey-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "灰色に近い羽色の小さなひな鳥です。様々な種が混血している可能性があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "glyptotherium"
msgid_plural "glyptotherii"
msgstr[0] "グリプトテリウム"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge herbivore that almost resembles a giant tortoise due to its hard "
"outer shell, although it is a close relative to armadillos.  Normally, this "
"species prefers much warmer climates.  This individual probably lost its way"
" at some point."
msgstr ""
"アルマジロの近縁種ですが、装甲が発達しており巨大なゾウガメのようにも見える、巨大な草食動物です。通常はもっと暖かい気候を好むため、この個体は恐らくどこからか迷い込んできたのでしょう。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "glyptotherium young"
msgid_plural "glyptotherium youngs"
msgstr[0] "グリプトテリウム(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium young"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile glyptotherium.  Its shell is not quite fully developed, having an"
" almost leathery feel to it."
msgstr "グリプトテリウムの幼体です。装甲はまだ十分に発達しておらず、革のような質感です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "American zebra"
msgid_plural "American zebras"
msgstr[0] "ハガーマンホース"

#. ~ Description of monster "American zebra"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A hooved grazing mammal with a brown-and-white striped coat.  ."
msgstr "被毛が褐色と白色の縞模様になった、蹄をもつ草食哺乳類です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile American zebra.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing"
" around its head joyously."
msgstr "ハガーマンホースの幼体です。親の近くで興奮気味に駆け回り、楽しそうに首を振っています。"

