"A Snake whose body is made out of licorice, at least it's the red type."
msgstr "全身が赤いリコリスでできているヘビです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "licorice snake hatchling"
msgid_plural "licorice snake hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "リコリスヘビ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "licorice snake hatchling"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A baby snake made entirely out of licorice, possibly the children of the "
"larger licorice snakes."
msgstr "全身がリコリスでできたヘビの幼体です。恐らくより大きなリコリスヘビの子供でしょう。"

