#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_candy_shop"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_start_locations.json
msgid "Candy Shop"
msgstr "菓子店"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "chocolate bog"
msgstr "チョコレート犬"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid "shallow chocolate"
msgstr "浅いチョコ溜まり"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow chocolate"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid ""
"The chocolate isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be tasty."
msgstr "それほど水深が深くない液状のチョコレートです。水密性のある容器を使えば、カカオ液を汲み入れられます。飲んでも美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid "deep chocolate"
msgstr "深いチョコ溜まり"

#. ~ Description of terrain "deep chocolate"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid ""
"The chocolate here is deep enough to drown in.  With a watertight container,"
" you could gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be "
"tasty."
msgstr "溺れるほど水深が深い液状のチョコレートです。水密性のある容器を使えば、カカオ液を汲み入れられます。飲んでも美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "caramel"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten caramel.  In some "
"places, caramel coated fruit is a delicacy."
msgstr "溶融したキャラメルで構成された、光を発する非常に熱い液体です。フルーツのキャラメルがけという珍味が名物の地域があるそうですよ。"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/mods/Mythos/harvest.json
msgid ""
"You crack open the hard chitin of the outer barrel to get at the alien flesh"
" beneath."
msgstr "内側の奇妙な肉を取り出すために、筒状の硬いキチン質を割り開きました。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Mythos/modinfo.json
msgid "[WIP] Mythos Mod - No Zombies"
msgstr "変更 - [開発途中]神話MOD(ゾンビ削除)"

#. ~ Description of MOD "[WIP] Mythos Mod - No Zombies"
#: data/mods/Mythos/modinfo.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Removes all the zombies (including fungus zombies), cyborgs and robots from "
"the game - a very work-in-progress start to a more Lovecraftian-focused "
"version of Cataclysm set in the 1920s, with 99.9% of the population "
"mysteriously disappearing at midnight of day 0.  Players will take on the "
"roles of investigators in a variety of professions battling the denizens of "
"the shadows to recover and rebuild society."
msgstr ""
"ゲームから真菌ゾンビを含むすべてのゾンビ、サイボーグ、ロボットを削除します。1920年代のある真夜中、全人類の99.9%が謎の失踪を遂げる事態からゲームが始まる、ラブクラフト的な要素を更に増量した「現時点で未完成の」MODです。プレイヤーは様々な職業の探索者となり、社会の正常化と復興を目指して影の世界の住人達と戦います。"

#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS"
#: data/mods/Mythos/species.json
msgid "a mythos creature"
msgstr "神話生物"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid "electric refrigerator"
msgstr "電気冷蔵庫"

#. ~ Description of furniture "electric refrigerator"
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A very modern tall metal storage container that, if powered, will freeze "
"food and other perishables for preservation."
msgstr "非常に先進的な、背の高い金属製の保存容器です。電力が供給されていれば生鮮食品などを冷蔵保存できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid "icebox"
msgstr "冷蔵箱"

#. ~ Description of furniture "icebox"
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A traditional wooden icebox, designed to chill food and other perishables "
"for preservation if stocked with ice."
msgstr "昔ながらの木製の冷蔵箱です。中に氷を入れることで、生鮮食品などを冷蔵保存できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid "automatic washing machine"
msgstr "自動洗濯機"

#. ~ Description of furniture "automatic washing machine"
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, chunky drum that uses soap and large amounts of water to wash "
"batches of clothes with minimal effort, with a built in mangle on top."
msgstr "石鹸と大量の水を使って手間をかけずに衣類をまとめて洗う、ずんぐりとした形の大型容器です。上部には水絞り機が付いています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid "cast-iron stove"
msgstr "鋳鉄ストーブ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cast-iron stove"
#: data/mods/Mythos/furniture_and_terrain/1920s_furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large cast-iron stove heated by a wood burning fire.  With multiple oven "
"compartments, it is the centerpiece of any kitchen, good for cooking or "
"heating food, and safe to have indoors."
msgstr ""
"薪をくべて暖をとる、鋳鉄製の大型ストーブです。複数の火室があり、暖房としても加熱調理機としても使えます。室内で安全に火を起こせる、キッチンの中心的存在です。"

#. ~ Description of "household washing machine"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An appliance used to do laundry, not of much use without power and plumbing."
"  You could probably scrap it for parts."
msgstr "洗濯に用いる電化製品ですが、電力と水道が通っていなければあまり役には立ちません。分解すれば部品を利用できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "deep one corpse"
msgid_plural "deep one corpses"
msgstr[0] "ディープワンの死体"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a male deep one."
msgstr "ディープワンのオスの死体です。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a female deep one."
msgstr "ディープワンのメスの死体です。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "乾いた血に塗れたディープワンの死体です。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a deep one with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "背中を刺された痕跡が残っているディープワンの死体です。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The dead body of a deep one.  Its forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of its head."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。額に大きな弾痕が残っており、後頭部は酷く損傷しています。"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead deep one body, as if torn apart with enormous "
"force.  Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr "強い力で引き裂かれたように見えるディープワンの上半身です。断面から臓器がはみ出しています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-caliber "
"weapon."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。小口径の銃で背中を数回撃たれたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A deep one corpse gored by arms fire chest to thighs, leaving the face "
"eerily and fishily pristine."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。胸から太ももにかけて銃創でグチャグチャになっており、顔は不自然なほどに崩れています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one.  It appears to have been shot in the forehead at a"
" very close range leaving you a good view of its brain matter."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。至近距離から額を撃たれたようで、脳が露出しています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one, its legs and arms covered in blood.  It appears to"
" have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。脚と腕は血に塗れており、太ももは銃で撃たれたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one who appears to have been shot to death.  Its right "
"arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr "射殺されたと思われるディープワンの死体です。右腕が肩とかろうじて繋がっており、今にもちぎれそうです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one unblemished but for the bloody hole atop its head, "
"its bald scalp intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr "ディープワンの死体です。頭部に血塗れの穴が開いている以外は無傷です。禿げた頭部に脳や肉、ショットガンの弾がこびりついています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A large, greenish-gray amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's"
" wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its "
"gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping "
"gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."
msgstr ""
"緑がかった灰色の皮膚をもつ、水陸両生の大きな人型生物です。幅が広く締まりのない頭は、まるで魚のようです。大きな瞳で周囲に睨みを利かせており、四肢には非常に鋭い爪が生えています。飛び跳ねるような妙な歩き方で移動し、四足歩行をすることもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "rat-thing"
msgid_plural "rat-things"
msgstr[0] "ネズミ怪物"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat-thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A small brown rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  Its face is "
"strangely human-like, as are its tiny hands."
msgstr "長いヒゲと大きな瞳が特徴的な、小さな茶色のネズミです。顔や小さな手は、どことなく人間に似ています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "shantak"
msgid_plural "shantak"
msgstr[0] "シャンタク鳥"

#. ~ Description of monster "shantak"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, scaly avian monster larger than an elephant.  It has slimy, "
"reptilian skin, a pair of membranous, bat-like wings and a horse-like head "
"at the end of a long neck."
msgstr ""
"ゾウよりも巨大な、鱗が生えた鳥のような化け物です。爬虫類のような滑らかな皮膚をもち、翼はコウモリに似た膜状で、長い首の先にウマのような頭が付いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "dark young"
msgid_plural "dark young"
msgstr[0] "黒い仔山羊"

#. ~ Description of monster "dark young"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A horrifying, pitch-black monstrosity, seemingly made of ropy tentacles.  It"
" stands as tall as a tree on stumpy, hoofed legs, and its flanks covered in "
"puckered maws, dripping green goo."
msgstr ""
"世にも恐ろしい、好き勝手に動く触手が生えた真っ黒な化け物です。背丈は樹木のように高く、足は硬い蹄のようで、脇腹に開いた口から緑色の粘液を垂らしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "ghoul"
msgid_plural "ghouls"
msgstr[0] "グール"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghoul"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its "
"rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mold."
msgstr "イヌに似た頭部、蹄の生えた足、鋭い爪をもった人型の怪物です。ゴムのような肌は青白く、カビに覆われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "ghast"
msgid_plural "ghasts"
msgstr[0] "ガスト"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghast"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This vaguely humanoid creature is almost as big as a pony.  It has long "
"hooved legs on which it hops, clawed hands, and a hideous noseless head with"
" oversized teeth."
msgstr ""
"ポニーほどのサイズの、どことなく人間に似ている生物です。蹄が生えた跳躍力の高い脚、爪が伸びた手、そして巨大な歯が覗く鼻のない不気味な顔が特徴です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "elder thing"
msgid_plural "elder things"
msgstr[0] "古のもの"

#. ~ Description of monster "elder thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A strange alien creature with a star-shaped head and numerous writhing "
"appendages arranged radially around its barrel-shaped body."
msgstr "星型の頭部と、樽のような胴から放射状に広がり蠢く無数の器官が特徴的な、奇妙な異星生物です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "nightgaunt"
msgid_plural "nightgaunts"
msgstr[0] "ナイトゴーント"

#. ~ Description of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This lanky ebon humanoid has batlike wings and a long prehensile tail, yet "
"its most unsettling feature is its lack of a face."
msgstr "コウモリのような翼と長く器用な尾をもつ怪物です。一番の特徴は、顔が存在しないことです。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s melts into wisps of darkness."
msgstr "%sは闇の中に解け消えました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "servitor of the outer gods"
msgid_plural "servitors of the outer gods"
msgstr[0] "外なる神の従者"

#. ~ Description of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A constantly-flickering mass of eyes, mouths, and tentacles hanging in the "
"air, emitting a piping noise from flutes of bone."
msgstr "目と口と触手が一体となった塊が空中に浮かび、明滅しながら骨のフルートを吹き鳴らしています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds into itself and disappears."
msgstr "%sは肉体を折り畳むように縮ませ、消失しました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange "
"whistling noises which send cold shivers of primal terror down your spine."
msgstr ""
"半ポリープ状の、見るからに地球外生物といった姿の怪物です。全体が同一の素材からなり、翼が無いにもかかわらず空を飛びます。耳にすると背筋が冷たく凍る、奇妙な笛の音を発生させています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  Its form "
"writhes and changes before your eyes, filling you with unnameable horror."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な歪んだ頭部と巨大な爪状の部位をもつ、ヘビに似た怪物です。黒いゴムのような材質の翼によって体をなんとか支えています。のたうち回り、形を変えるその姿を目の当たりにすると、言いようのない恐怖を感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "berry-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "berry-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "果粒のような物体"

#. ~ Description of "berry-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Bloom "
"uncontested and partake of the Fruit.  We can't have that, can we?"
msgstr "もし我々がこの物体を放置すれば、他の者が「花畑」に侵入し「果実」を摂取するだろう。そのような事態を許容すべきではない。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "seed-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "seed-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "種子のような物体"

#. ~ Description of "seed-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Garden "
"uncontested and partake of the Seed.  We can't have that, can we?"
msgstr "もし我々がこの物体を放置すれば、他の者が「庭園」に侵入し「種子」を摂取するだろう。そのような事態を許容すべきではない。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "gelatin-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "gelatin-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "ゼラチンのような物体"

#. ~ Description of "gelatin-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Spire "
"uncontested and partake of the Sap.  Wait, how did you even GET this anyway?"
msgstr "もし我々がこの物体を放置すれば、他の者が「尖塔」に侵入し「樹液」を摂取するだろう。待て、お前はどのようにしてこれを手に入れた？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "fruit-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "fruit-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "果実のような物体"

#. ~ Description of "fruit-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"We do not exist at the moment.  Clever little human, no doubt debugging to "
"see this?  We will not permit you to join us while we are modded out."
msgstr ""
"我々は現時点では存在しない。少し知恵の働く人間が、デバッグ中に発見したものと推測する。我々が存在を隠している間は、我々に加わることを許可しない。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fungal mass"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Thick ropes of Mycal matter have covered the ground here completely.  It's "
"soft to the touch, but you sink into it, making moving across it difficult."
msgstr "菌糸で作られた太い縄が密集しています。柔らかな触り心地ですが、踏みしめると足が沈むため、移動は困難です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fungal clump"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Alien mold and stems mingle tightly here, creating a sort of fungal bush."
msgstr "地球外の菌糸と茎がしっかりと混じりあい、まるで茂みのように固まっています。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "No Fungal Monsters"
msgstr "削除 - 真菌人"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Fungal Monsters"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes fungal monsters and regions from the game."
msgstr "真菌汚染地域と真菌人を削除します。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "flaming_eye_warming_up"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/effects.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Warming Up"
msgstr "フレーミングアイ準備動作"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flaming Eye Warming Up"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/effects.json
msgid "You got a bad feeling about this flaming eye's intentions."
msgstr "フレーミングアイの動作を見ていると、嫌な予感がします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Destruction Ray"
msgstr "デストラクション・レイ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Destruction Ray"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Pre-nerf flaming eye's destruction ray."
msgstr "弱体化する以前のフレーミングアイの破壊光線です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Damage"
msgstr "フレーミングアイダメージ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flaming Eye Damage"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Damage with the destruction ray."
msgstr "破壊光線にダメージを付与します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Notify"
msgstr "フレーミングアイ準備動作"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flaming Eye Notify"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye warms up before activating its destruction ray."
msgstr "フレーミングアイは破壊光線を発射する前に準備動作を行います。"

#. ~ Description of "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive chicken walker.  Using this item involves placing it on "
"the ground, loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56 rounds and 40mm "
"cartridge grenades in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition,"
" set aside whatever ammunition you do NOT want to give the robot) and "
"turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the chicken walker "
"will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack "
"all enemies with a built-in firearm and grenade launcher."
msgstr ""
"停止状態のチキンウォーカーです。使用すると所持している手詰めでない5.56mm弾と40mm弾が装填され(弾薬を指定個数だけ装填したい場合は、装填しない分の弾薬を一旦地面に置いて下さい)、設置された状態で起動します。起動時のプログラムの書き換えと配線に成功すると、使用者を味方として認識して追従もしくは周囲の探索を開始し、内蔵銃器とグレネードランチャーであらゆる敵を攻撃します。"

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"The chicken walker rises to its feet, sways away from you and begins "
"surveying the area."
msgstr "チキンウォーカーは脚部を展開し、周囲の探索のために動き出しました。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "The chicken walker whirrs and aims directly at you.  Take cover!"
msgstr "チキンウォーカーは唸るような音を発し、こちらに狙いを定めました。隠れましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "chicken walker chassis"
msgid_plural "chicken walker chassis"
msgstr[0] "シャシー(チキンウォーカー)"

#. ~ Description of "chicken walker chassis"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the "
"skeleton and armor of the chicken walker."
msgstr "チキンウォーカーから全ての稼働部品と電子機器を取り除いて残った、骨組みと装甲部品です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "Beagle chassis"
msgid_plural "Beagle chassis"
msgstr[0] "シャシー(小型無人戦車)"

#. ~ Description of "Beagle chassis"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the "
"skeleton and armor of the Beagle tank."
msgstr "小型無人戦車から全ての稼働部品と電子機器を取り除いて残った、骨組みと装甲部品です。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
msgid "No Hope"
msgstr "変更 - No Hope"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Hope"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"- Significantly reduced amount of places with guaranteed loot spawns.\n"
"- Loot spawn in buildings is drastically reduced, especially for food, tools, guns etc.\n"
"- Most buildings are destroyed, vandalized, or looted.\n"
"- Most cars are destroyed or at least damaged.  Intact cars are nearly impossible to find.\n"
"- Fuel is much harder to find, almost all cars have no fuel in tanks.\n"
"- Marauders, looters, and bandits everywhere.\n"
"\n"
"See extended description in README.md.\n"
"\n"
"To get the mod author's intended playing experience, consider:\n"
"- Enabling wandering hordes.\n"
"- Setting item spawn scaling factor to 0.5 or lower.\n"
"- Setting spawn rate scaling factor to 1.5 or higher."
msgstr ""
"- アイテムの生成が保証されている地点を大幅に削減します。\n"
"- 特に食料、道具、銃などの生成量は激減します。\n"
"- 大抵の建物は破壊されているか、荒されているか、略奪されています。\n"
"- 大抵の車両は破壊されているか、少なくとも破損しています。新品の車両を見つけるのはほぼ不可能です。\n"
"- 燃料を見つけるのが困難になります。ほとんどの車両のタンクは空になっています。\n"
"- いたるところに襲撃者、略奪者、盗賊がいます。\n"
"\n"
"詳細はREADME.mdを参照してください。\n"
"\n"
"以下の設定で、MOD製作者の意図しているゲームプレイが実現されます。\n"
"- さまよう大群を有効化\n"
"- アイテム生成頻度が0.5以下\n"
"- モンスター発生頻度が1.5以上"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "laser turret"
msgid_plural "laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "レーザータレット"

#. ~ Description of monster "laser turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art revolving laser cannon system with three barrels that charge from"
" high-capacity batteries embedded in its hull."
msgstr ""
"TX-5LR "
"Cerberusは旧世代機をアップグレードしたタレットです。3丁の最新式レーザー砲で武装しており、内部には電力補給用の大容量バッテリーが埋め込まれています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "turret"
msgid_plural "turrets"
msgstr[0] "タレット"

#. ~ Description of monster "turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-1 Guardian, a small, pill-shaped automated gun turret"
" using state of the art ATR systems to dynamically reorient itself to new "
"friends and enemies alike.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when "
"its magazine is empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi "
"automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"General Atomics社のTX-1 "
"Guardianは、砲弾の形をした小型自動発砲タレットです。最新式の自動ターゲット認識技術を利用し、新たな味方や敵を自動的に判別することが可能です。射撃は全方位をカバーしますが、弾切れの際に再装填するシステムはなく、セミオートモードにしか対応していません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "antimateriel turret"
msgid_plural "antimateriel turrets"
msgstr[0] "対物タレット"

#. ~ Description of monster "antimateriel turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-107A1 Interdictor, an automated .50BMG antimateriel rifle."
"  Credited with forestalling countless car-bombing attempts, it has always "
"been kept under extremely tight control, so as to itself maintain extremely "
"tight control of its area.  And then the Cataclysm struck."
msgstr ""
"Leadworks社のT-107A1 "
"Interdictorは、.50口径BMG弾を使用する対物ライフルタレットです。車両への砲撃を未然に防ぎ、地区一帯を制圧するために厳格な管理の元運用される、と信じられてきました。しかし、そこに大変動が訪れました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "milspec turret"
msgid_plural "milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] "軍用タレット"

#. ~ Description of monster "milspec turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-4A1 Sentry.  It features improved firmware over General "
"Atomics' TX-1 9x19mm model and an automated 5.56mm carbine."
msgstr ""
"Leadworks 社のT-4A1 Sentryは、 General Atomics社製TX-1 "
"9x19mm銃モデルや無人機の5.56mmカービンよりも性能の高いファームウェアを搭載しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""
"M153を搭載したCROWS "
"IIから派生した、自律運用ソフトウェアによって強化された無人タレットです。大変動前に米軍によって数千機が展開され、操作者を危険に晒すことなく歩兵と交戦できる点が評価されていました。このタレットはM240を搭載しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tripod"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Honda Regnal, a tall robot walking on three spidery legs.  For weapons, "
"it has a trio of spiked retractable cables and a flamethrower mounted on its"
" head."
msgstr "ホンダ社のRegnalは、3本脚のクモのような背の高いロボットです。回収ケーブル付きスパイク3本と頭部の火炎放射器で武装しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
msgid_plural "Beagle Mini-Tank UGVs"
msgstr[0] "小型無人戦車"

#. ~ Description of monster "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Beagle is a refrigerator-sized urban warfare UGV.  Sporting an "
"anti-tank missile launcher, 40mm grenade launcher, and numerous anti-"
"infantry weapons, it's designed for high-risk urban fighting."
msgstr ""
"ノースロップ社のBeagleは、冷蔵庫サイズの小型無人戦車です。対戦車ミサイルランチャー、40mmグレネードランチャー、そして多数の対歩兵兵器を搭載し、危険度の高い市街戦向けに設計されています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "chicken walker"
msgid_plural "chicken walkers"
msgstr[0] "チキンウォーカー"

#. ~ Description of monster "chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armored robot walking on a "
"pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade "
"launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself "
"against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production "
"was limited due to a legal dispute."
msgstr ""
"ノースロップ社のATSVは、逆関節二足歩行式の大型重武装装甲ロボットです。生産当時の目的が法的紛争の解決に限られていたにもかかわらず、対車両40mmグレネードランチャー、対人5.56mm銃で武装しており、表面に電撃をまとわせる効果的な防衛機能を有しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "security bot"
msgid_plural "security bots"
msgstr[0] "警備ロボット"

#. ~ Description of monster "security bot"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Watchman X-1 is a production series of heavily armored combat "
"robots.  Initially designed for military patrol and escort service, it rolls"
" on a set of hydraulic treads and is armed with a M16A4."
msgstr ""
"ノースロップ社製のWatchman "
"X-1は重装甲戦闘用ロボットシリーズの一つです。当初は軍の哨戒や護衛任務用途で開発されました。油圧で歩行し、M16A4ライフルで武装しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "moose"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Eastern moose, the largest living species of deer.  The bulls are quite "
"ill-tempered, especially in the rutting season."
msgstr "アメリカ東部に生息するヘラジカは、シカ科の最大種です。雄牛は発情期になると、非常に怒りっぽくなります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, "
"it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat "
"and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about; its "
"unearthly presence filling you with dread at the prospect of falling under "
"its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"人間と同じぐらい巨大な眼球が、何らかの未知の力によって空中に浮かんでいます。猫のようなスリット状の瞳孔と鮮やかな黄色い虹彩をもつ瞳は、全体が超自然的に青く揺れる炎で包まれており、周りには黒い触手がゆらゆらと漂っています。その不気味な存在の悪意ある凝視に晒されると、精神が恐怖で満たされます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "A piercing beam of light bursts forth!"
msgstr "空気を引き裂くような鋭い光線が発射されました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "staring eye"
msgid_plural "staring eyes"
msgstr[0] "スターリングアイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "staring eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Its unearthly presence filling you with dread"
" at the prospect of falling under its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"人間大の巨大な目玉が、どのような手段によってか空を飛んでいます。不気味な存在感を放っており、今にもこちらを睨みつけてくるような予感がします。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wall"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid ""
"The stereotypical wall with wooden support structure filled with insulation "
"and drywalled.  Paint job is the all too common and neutral off-white or "
"cream color, it could use more vibrant paint."
msgstr ""
"断熱材で満たされた石積み壁を木製の支持構造で補強した一般的な壁です。色はどこでも見かけるような普通のオフホワイトやクリーム色ですが、より派手な塗料で塗り替えることも可能です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid "red carpet, overhead light"
msgstr "絨毯(赤)と天井灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red carpet, overhead light"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A soft red carpet with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling "
"above."
msgstr "赤色の柔らかい絨毯です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid "rock floor, overhead light"
msgstr "床(石)と天井灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock floor, overhead light"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of rock and stone with a still-functioning light "
"attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "比較的平坦な岩の床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Signage placed on map landscapingsupplyco_1b
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/landscaping_supply.json
msgid "BOULDERS and SLABS"
msgstr "岩、石材"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "Bandit Ambush"
msgstr "盗賊の襲撃跡"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Bandit Ambush"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "There were bandits here."
msgstr "盗賊に襲撃された痕跡があります。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "Bandit Campsite"
msgstr "盗賊の野営地"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Bandit Campsite"
#. ~ Description of map extra "Bandit Hideout"
#. ~ Description of map extra "Bandit Gravesite"
#. ~ Description of map extra "Bandit Outpost"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "There are bandits here."
msgstr "盗賊がいます。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "Bandit Hideout"
msgstr "盗賊の隠れ家"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "Bandit Gravesite"
msgstr "墓地の溜まり場"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/map_extras/map_extras.json
msgid "Bandit Outpost"
msgstr "盗賊の前哨基地"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc.json
msgid "Raider"
msgstr "レイダー"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_NPC_Food/modinfo.json
msgid "Disable NPC Needs"
msgstr "削除 - NPCの欲求"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Disable NPC Needs"
#: data/mods/No_NPC_Food/modinfo.json
msgid "Makes NPCs not require food, water or rest."
msgstr "NPCが飲食や休憩を必要としなくなります。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_Rail_Stations/modinfo.json
msgid "No Rail Stations"
msgstr "削除 - 鉄道駅"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Rail Stations"
#: data/mods/No_Rail_Stations/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes above-ground rail stations from the game."
msgstr "地上の鉄道駅を削除します。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Only_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid "No Monsters"
msgstr "削除 - モンスター"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Monsters"
#: data/mods/Only_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Removes all monsters from the game, save for those in the WILDLIFE category."
msgstr "野生動物以外の全モンスターを削除します。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
msgid "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
msgstr "変更 - NPCに無害なポータル嵐"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Makes Portal Storm enemies only attack the player.  Without this critical "
"NPCs can die to Portal Storm enemies in very unfair ways.  More work needs "
"to be done on AI and faction base security before it will be safe to disable"
" this."
msgstr ""
"ポータルの嵐によって発生した敵がプレイヤーキャラクターのみを攻撃するようになります。このMODを無効化すると、ポータルの嵐によってNPCが非常に理不尽な死を迎える可能性があり、NPCの自動行動や拠点での作業の下準備がより煩雑になります。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
msgid "Rummaging"
msgstr "追加 - 収納家具"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Rummaging"
#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Some furniture containers need to open the door to scavenge, to enhance the "
"thrill of scavenging."
msgstr "アイテム漁りのスリルを高めるために、扉が付いた収納家具などを追加します。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgid "Standard combat test suite"
msgstr "変更 - 戦闘テスト用MOD"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Standard combat test suite"
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"A set of standard character loadouts to facilitate objective monster "
"testing.  Disables all but the test scenarios."
msgstr ""
"モンスターの強さなどを客観的に判断するための、基準となるキャラクターが設定されたMODです。テスト用シナリオ以外のシナリオは無効化されます。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  You also took the time "
"to cobble together some improvised weaponry!"
msgstr "パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着き、時間をかけて即席武器を用意しました！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  You also took the time "
"to cobble together some improvised weaponry!"
msgstr "パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着き、時間をかけて即席武器を用意しました！"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Scavenger"
msgstr "スカベンジャー"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Scavenger"
msgstr "スカベンジャー"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger" for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are getting by in the Apocalypse.  Your gear is still scavenged from the"
" ruins of the old world, but you have gathered the skills to use it to good "
"effect.  Midsummer start."
msgstr ""
"崩壊した世界で何とか生き延びています。装備は旧世界の残骸から拾ってきたものですが、有効活用できるだけのスキルは持っています。開始季節は夏です。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger" for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are getting by in the Apocalypse.  Your gear is still scavenged from the"
" ruins of the old world, but you have gathered the skills to use it to good "
"effect.  Midsummer start."
msgstr ""
"崩壊した世界で何とか生き延びています。装備品は旧世界の残骸から拾ってきたものですが、有効活用できるだけのスキルは持っています。開始季節は夏です。"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "サバイバー"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "サバイバー"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Survivor" for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are as close to thriving as anybody can be these days.  Your gear is "
"handcrafted with the threats of the new world in mind, and your skills are "
"honed to perfection.  Mid-autumn start."
msgstr "誰にも負けないくらい絶好調です。装備品は新世界の脅威を考慮して自作し、スキルも完璧なまでに磨かれています。開始季節は秋です。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Survivor" for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are as close to thriving as anybody can be these days.  Your gear is "
"handcrafted with the threats of the new world in mind, and your skills are "
"honed to perfection.  Mid-autumn start."
msgstr "誰にも負けないくらい絶好調です。装備品は新世界の脅威を考慮して自作し、スキルも完璧なまでに磨かれています。開始季節は秋です。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgid "Standard early game combat test area"
msgstr "戦闘テスト基準エリア(ゲーム序盤)"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Standard early game combat test area"
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgid "There are some improvised weapons nearby."
msgstr "即席武器が付近に用意してある、ゲーム序盤の戦闘の基準となるエリアです。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgid "Standard midgame combat test area"
msgstr "戦闘テスト基準エリア(ゲーム中盤)"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Standard midgame combat test area"
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
