msgstr "丁寧に世話をされている変異したセミの卵です。中の幼虫は通常の変異セミより臆病で大人しいようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/eggs.json
msgid "tame water beetle egg"
msgid_plural "tame water beetle eggs"
msgstr[0] "卵(飼育ゲンゴロウ)"

#. ~ Description of "tame water beetle egg"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/eggs.json
msgid ""
"The egg of a water beetle.  This one has been carefully tended for.  The "
