#. ~ Description of achievement "The Truth is out there"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/achievements/achievements.json
msgid ""
"You can quickly deduce the events leading to every death scene you come "
"across, unfortunately the cause is now always either zombie or suicide."
msgstr "死体を見ただけで、自慢の推理力で死因をたちまち突き止めます。残念ながら、大抵の死因はゾンビか自殺のどちらかですが。"

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_gains_deduction_level_5"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Investigation skill level 5 gained"
msgid_plural "Investigation skill level 5 gained"
msgstr[0] "推理スキルがレベル5に達した"

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_avatar_changeling_kills"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/achievements/statistics.json
msgid "changeling killed"
msgid_plural "changelings killed"
msgstr[0] "体のチェンジリングを殺した"

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_avatar_vampire_kills"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/achievements/statistics.json
msgid "vampire killed"
msgid_plural "vampires killed"
msgstr[0] "体の吸血鬼を殺した"

#. ~ Male memorial remove log of effect type "Blood Spiders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Eradicated the spiders in their blood."
msgstr "血中のクモを根絶しました。"

#. ~ Female memorial remove log of effect type "Blood Spiders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Eradicated the spiders in their blood."
msgstr "血中のクモを根絶しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "faewild"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "glamoured"
msgstr "鮮麗"

#. ~ Description of effect type "glamoured"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The world is beautiful and breathtaking but maybe also terrifying."
msgstr "この世界の息を呑むほどの美しさは、恐怖と表裏一体のものなのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "glamoured"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Colors brighten and vision sharpens."
msgstr "色彩が鮮やかになり、視界が研ぎ澄まされました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "glamoured"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The world becomes a duller place."
msgstr "世界が鈍く濁って見えます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Angled"
msgstr "ひずみ"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Canted"
msgstr "歪み"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Mirrored"
msgstr "反転"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are viewing the world as if from an orchestra pit."
msgstr "一段低い位置から世界を眺めているような感覚に陥りました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel your body moves mirrored to the thoughts in your head."
msgstr "肉体が思考とは真逆に動いてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your vision suddenly feels as if it shifted down and to the left."
msgstr "視界が突然、左下にズレたような気がしました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel the universe vibrating."
msgstr "宇宙が振動しているように感じます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The hum in your bones subsides."
msgstr "骨に響く振動音が静まりました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body accepts your presence once more."
msgstr "肉体が自己を再び受け入れました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A mirror cracks in the distance."
msgstr "どこかで鏡が割れ、世界は元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Balefire"
msgstr "野火"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Foxfire"
msgstr "狐火"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "St. Elmo's Fire"
msgstr "鬼火"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Balefire, Foxfire, St. Elmo's Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"The flames sometimes obstruct your vision, yet you feel no pain from them."
msgstr "熱くない炎に視界を遮られています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Balefire, Foxfire, St. Elmo's Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You body shines like a lit beacon."
msgstr "肉体が明かりを灯されたように輝いています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Balefire, Foxfire, St. Elmo's Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body is dimly covered in ephemeral flames."
msgstr "肉体が淡い炎に包まれ、おぼろげに光っています。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Balefire, Foxfire, St. Elmo's Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The flames distract you."
msgstr "炎に視界を遮られました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "manic_fugue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Manic Fugue"
msgstr "黙考"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Manic Fugue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your creative state is happening."
msgstr "創造力を膨らませています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Brimming with Creativity"
msgstr "ひらめき"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "One Amazing Idea"
msgstr "冴えたアイデア"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Several Inspired Tangents"
msgstr "才気煥発"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Brimming with Creativity, One Amazing Idea,
#. Several Inspired Tangents"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have one incredibly amazing idea."
msgstr "非常に素晴らしいアイデアが頭に浮かびました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Brimming with Creativity, One Amazing Idea,
#. Several Inspired Tangents"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You've got a few theories you'd like to explore."
msgstr "頭の中で理論を探求しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Brimming with Creativity, One Amazing Idea,
#. Several Inspired Tangents"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your brain can't hold any more brilliance."
msgstr "頭脳がフル回転しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "night_sight"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Night Sight"
msgstr "ナイト・サイト"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Night Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The darkness loses its shape and your eyes return to their usual hue."
msgstr "瞳の色が元に戻り、暗闇の中の景色は溶け消えました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dread_weight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Existential Dread"
msgstr "実存的恐怖"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Existential Dread"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Is there any point to forward movement?"
msgstr "前進することに意味はあるのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Existential Dread"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The air around you chills as existence loses its appeal!"
msgstr "周囲の空気が凍りつき、世界が色褪せていきます！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Existential Dread"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The weight is lifted from your mind and the air warms."
msgstr "心の重荷が消え、周囲の空気が熱を取り戻しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_quenched"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Flush"
msgstr "飲血"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_quenched"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Tick-like"
msgstr "大量飲血"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "poisoned_blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Poisoned blood"
msgstr "毒の血"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Poisoned blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have poisoned your own blood!"
msgstr "血液が毒されました！"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "poisoned_blood2"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your blood turns to acid and melts through your body."
msgstr "血液が酸に変化し、体内を溶かしています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Bloodthirst"
msgstr "血の渇き"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Reddened Eyes"
msgstr "赤い瞳"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Wan"
msgstr "青白い皮膚"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your complexion is wan and spent."
msgstr "顔がひどくやつれており、生気がありません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and have turned dark red.  You feel a constant hunger, "
"like the food you eat is no longer nourishing you."
msgstr "皮膚は青白く、瞳は赤黒く変化しています。常に空腹感が解消されず、食べた物が養分になっている気がしません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your skin is pale and your eyes are thoroughly bloodshot."
msgstr "皮膚は死人のように青白く、瞳は真っ赤に充血しています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel the blood rushing from the wound and then a pressure that reminds "
"you of backwash."
msgstr "傷口から流れた血液が逆流して体内に戻っていくような感覚を味わいました。"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin, Pallor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "You succumb to your deadly necrotic condition."
msgstr "全身が致命的な壊死状態に陥りました。"

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Contracted a bloodborne pathogen out of legend."
msgstr "古くから伝わる血液感染性病原体に感染しました。"

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes,
#. Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Contracted a bloodborne pathogen out of legend."
msgstr "古くから伝わる血液感染性病原体に感染しました。"

#. ~ Male memorial remove log of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Rid themselves of a horrific curse of the blood."
msgstr "恐るべき血の呪縛から解放されました。"

#. ~ Female memorial remove log of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes,
#. Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Rid themselves of a horrific curse of the blood."
msgstr "恐るべき血の呪縛から解放されました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_ascendant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Terminal Porphyria"
msgstr "重度光線過敏症"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is deathly white and will redden and burn when exposed to the sun."
msgstr "青白い皮膚が日光に当たると、赤く焼けただれてしまいます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You've chosen to embrace this illness and enhance your curse."
msgstr "この病を受け入れ、呪われた力を更に強めることを選びました。"

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Willingly left their humanity behind."
msgstr "喜んで人間性を捨てました。"

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Willingly left their humanity behind."
msgstr "喜んで人間性を捨てました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_post_mortal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgstr "吸血鬼"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is deathly white, your eyes are solid red except for a huge pupil,"
" the only food you can consume is human blood, and if sunlight hits you that"
" part of your body instantly burns."
msgstr ""
"皮膚は死人のように白く、眼は大きく開いた瞳孔以外真っ赤に染まり、人間の血液以外何も摂取できません。日光に晒された部位は一瞬にして焼けただれます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Becoming a monster is a matter of degrees until one day it isn't and you can"
" no longer remember why morality seemed important."
msgstr ""
"人間誰しもその身に怪物的な要素を抱えているものですが、モラルの重要性が分からなくなってしまっては、完全に怪物になったとしか言いようがありません。"

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Terrorized the remnants of humanity til there were none left."
msgstr "数少ない人類を、最期の一人になるまで恐怖に陥れ続けることになりました。"

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Terrorized the remnants of humanity til there were none left."
msgstr "数少ない人類を、最期の一人になるまで恐怖に陥れ続けることになりました。"

#. ~ Male memorial remove log of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Found a miracle in a world full of the dead."
msgstr "死人だらけの世界で奇跡を見出しました。"

#. ~ Female memorial remove log of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Found a miracle in a world full of the dead."
msgstr "死人だらけの世界で奇跡を見出しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "withering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Corpse-like"
msgstr "死体同然"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "withering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Eternal Slumber"
msgstr "生き血不足(重)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "withering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Hypomia"
msgstr "生き血不足(中)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "withering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Sallow"
msgstr "生き血不足(軽)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"One day blood may spill on your lips and wake you from your slumber, but "
"until then you are a corpse."
msgstr "いつか生き血が口元に注がれ、息を吹き返すときが来るかもしれませんが、それまでは死体も同然です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Severe blood deficiency has left you looking emaciated no matter what your "
"weight is."
msgstr "重度の生き血不足です。たとえ体重が何キロあろうと、ガリガリにやせ細っています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"The absence of raw blood from your diet has left you wan, pale and "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr "食事から生き血を摂取できないため、肉体が衰え、顔色が悪くなり、体調が悪化しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your body is weakened and your need to feed is a constant pain in your "
"chest."
msgstr "体調が悪化しています。必要な栄養を摂取できず、胸元の痛みが消えません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Most of your thoughts now revolve around blood, how good it tastes and where"
" you might find it."
msgstr "血液のこと、血液の味、血液の在り処についてばかり頭に浮かびます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your blood lust is slaked."
msgstr "生き血を渇望する思いは満たされました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You've almost consumed enough blood to feel normal again."
msgstr "十分な血液を摂取し、正常な感覚を取り戻しました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Corpse-like, Eternal Slumber, Hypomia,
#. Sallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "More blood and you'll start to feel even better."
msgstr "血液を更に摂取すれば、もっと元気になれそうです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "eyegleam"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Eye gleam"
msgstr "輝く瞳"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_weave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Blood Weave"
msgstr "血の守り"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "blind_rage"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Blind Rage"
msgstr "ブラインド・レイジ"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blind Rage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Perfect hatred"
msgstr "強烈な憎悪の力で攻撃します。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind Rage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "AAAAARGH!!"
msgstr "グアァァァ！！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_stamina_eff"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Circulatory"
msgstr "サーキュレイトリー"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Circulatory"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel a deep energy in your muscles, exuberant and coiled."
msgstr "筋肉にエネルギーを循環させ、活力を高めます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dodge"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Dodge"
msgstr "回避"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dodge"
#. ~ Description of spell "Dodge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Shun their attacks."
msgstr "攻撃を回避します。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dodge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reaction speed is increased."
msgstr "反応速度が上昇しました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dodge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reaction speed turns back to normal."
msgstr "反応速度が元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_endurance"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Endurance"
msgstr "エンデュランス"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Endurance"
#. ~ Description of spell "Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Take the blows.  Don’t let the world kill you."
msgstr "この世界に殺されないように、防御力を高めます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your sense of touch is blunted for a bit, but your skin feels more dense."
msgstr "触覚が少し鈍くなりましたが、肌が分厚く硬くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_melee_damage"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Physical Instrument"
msgstr "フィジカル・インストゥルメント"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Physical Instrument"
#. ~ Description of spell "Physical Instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Your body is a tool of destruction.  Use it effectively."
msgstr "肉体は破壊のための道具です。効果的に使いましょう。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Physical Instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You can feel a bubbling energy in your muscles."
msgstr "筋肉にエネルギーが湧き上がってきました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Physical Instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The feelings in your muscles subside."
msgstr "筋肉に集まっていた力が消え去りました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_speed_eff"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Rush"
msgstr "ラッシュ"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A burst of speed and stamina."
msgstr "速度とスタミナを大幅に向上させます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your lungs seem to gain capacity and your legs feel longer."
msgstr "肺活量が高まり、足が軽くなったような気がします。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body shrinks back into its normal space."
msgstr "速度とスタミナが元の状態に戻りました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body is slow."
msgstr "身体の動きが鈍っています。"

#. ~ Field intensity level
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/field_type.json
msgid "rainbow glimmer"
msgstr "極彩の光"

#. ~ Field intensity level
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/field_type.json
msgid "nauseating tension"
msgstr "震える大気"

#. ~ Field intensity level
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/field_type.json
msgid "broken reflections"
msgstr "壊れた影"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "You take a blood treatment."
msgstr "血液浄化剤を投与しました。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "The light seems less bright and the air fresher."
msgstr "降り注ぐ光が弱まり、空気が美味しく感じられるようになりました。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"You seem to be feeling a little better, but the thirst for blood remains."
msgstr "少し気力が回復しましたが、血を渇望する気持ちは今も残っています。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"You no longer instantly turn red in sunlight, but your skin is still "
"concerningly pale."
msgstr "肌を日光に晒してもすぐに赤く腫れることはなくなりましたが、青白さが気になります。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"Your veins burn and ache.  What were you thinking trying this?  You are "
"already one of the damned!"
msgstr "血管が沸騰するように熱く、痛みます。どうしてこんなことをしてしまったのでしょう？この肉体は呪われています！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "golden monolith"
msgstr "黄金のモノリス"

#. ~ Description of furniture "golden monolith"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A shiny golden monolith covered in shimmering pictograms.  There is a mist "
"condensing near it."
msgstr "金色に輝く象形文字が表面に刻まれたモノリスです。周囲には霧が立ちこめています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radio controls"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This specialized looking radio receiver equipment covers most of a table.  "
"It doesn't seem to be fully operational."
msgstr "テーブルの大部分を占めている、特殊な外観の電波受信装置です。完全には稼働していないようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "bat roost"
msgstr "コウモリの巣箱"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bat roost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A series of raised horizontal slats for bats to rest on right above eye "
"level, covered in tiny claw marks.  Below, there is a pull-out drawer that "
"collects guano so it can be easily washed out, similar to a litter box."
msgstr ""
"身長より少し低い位置に水平に固定されている薄板は、コウモリの寝床として作られており、小さな爪痕がいくつも残っています。下部にはゴミ箱のような引き出し容器が付いており、猫用トイレのように糞を一か所に集めて洗い流せます。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid ""
"A faux wall positioned and joined seamlessly with the wall, this wall looks "
"pretty normal."
msgstr "いたって普通の壁に見えますが、壁に偽装したパネルが他の壁と継ぎ目なく接合されています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open secret door"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid ""
"This apparently normal segment of wall has opened to reveal a secret "
"passage."
msgstr "何の変哲もない壁が開き、秘密の通路が現れました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "moon tear chain links"
msgid_plural "moon tear chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "moon tear chain links"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Small metal rings, suitable for constructing chainmail, made from moon "
"tears."
msgstr "チェーンメイルを製作するのに適した、小さな月涙鉱製の鎖です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
msgid_plural "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x21mm/ｷﾞｭﾙｻﾞSP-10 7N29)"

#. ~ Description of "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The 9×21mm Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed viper') round is a "
"Russian handgun round designed to defeat body armor that was developed by "
"TsNIITochMash for its SR-1 Vektor semi-automatic pistol and SR-2 Veresk "
"submachine gun.  The 7N29 AP loading fires a 6.7 g (103 gr) bullet at 410 "
"m/s (1,300 ft/s) with 560 J (410 ft⋅lb) of muzzle energy, and will "
"reportedly penetrate two 1.2 mm titanium plates, plus 30 layers of Kevlar, "
"at 50 m (160 ft).  The disadvantage of the rounds is that high impact "
"velocities are needed for them to work effectively, so the bullets are "
"relatively light to maximize their muzzle velocity.  This means they will "
"lose velocity relatively quickly, limiting their effective range."
msgstr ""
"9x21mmギュルザ(Гюрза、ロシア語でマルハナクサリヘビという意味)弾は、ツニートチマッシ社がセミオートピストルのSR-1ベクターとサブマシンガンのSR-2ベレスク用に開発した、ボディアーマーを貫通するロシア製の拳銃弾です。徹甲弾である7N29は重量6.7g(103グレーン)の弾頭を秒速410m(1300フィート)で発射し、エネルギーは560J(410ポンド・フィート)に及び、50m(160フィート)先にある厚さ1.2mmのチタン板2枚と30層のケブラー素材を突き抜けると報告されています。有効に機能するためには初速を高める必要があることが、この弾薬の欠点と言えます。重量が軽く速度が比較的早く低下してしまうため、有効射程距離は限られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "aetheric charge"
msgid_plural "aetheric charge"
msgstr[0] "エーテル"

#. ~ Description of "aetheric charge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "Charged ether pulled out of the void between all things."
msgstr "万物の空隙から取り出されたエーテルです。"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "aetheric_charge"
msgstr "aetheric_charge"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo_type.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "fae blood"
msgid_plural "fae blood"
msgstr[0] "妖魔の血液"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "9x21mm"
msgstr "9x21mm弾"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "throwing knives"
msgstr "投げナイフ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "guano"
msgid_plural "guano"
msgstr[0] "糞(コウモリ)"

#. ~ Description of "guano"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"A fresh pile of bat guano; this could probably be used to make some great "
"fertilizer."
msgstr "新鮮なコウモリの糞です。効果の高い化学肥料の材料になりそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
msgid "strategic points of interest tourist map"
msgid_plural "strategic points of interest tourist maps"
msgstr[0] "観光ガイド偽装マップ"

#. ~ Description of "strategic points of interest tourist map"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
msgid ""
"A tourist brochure that has markings on it in places that clearly aren't the"
" advertised tourist 'zebras?'."
msgstr "明らかに観光施設ではない「ゼブラ」と呼ばれる地点に印が付いた、観光ガイドマップのようなものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
msgid "left behind note"
msgid_plural "left behind notes"
msgstr[0] "書き置き"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
msgid "grimy handwritten recipe"
msgid_plural "grimy handwritten recipes"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/薄汚れた手書きレシピ)"

#. ~ Description of "grimy handwritten recipe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
msgid ""
"A scrap of paper.  Something's written on it, scrawled in bad handwriting.  "
"You can barely make out the words 'Blood treatment' followed by a list of "
"ingredients."
msgstr "紙切れに、乱れた文字で何かが書いてあります。「血液浄化」という単語と、材料のリストだけがかろうじて読み取れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "nether organs"
msgid_plural "nether organs"
msgstr[0] "妖魔臓物"

#. ~ Description of "nether organs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "These organs came from a beast from the nether."
msgstr "異界の魔物から採取された臓器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "raw shimmer pelt"
msgid_plural "raw shimmer pelts"
msgstr[0] "光輝粗毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "raw shimmer pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing animal from a "
"specific region of the Nether.  It still has the fur attached.  You can cure"
" it for storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"異界の特定地域の生物から剥ぎ取って丁寧に折り畳んだ生の毛皮です。まだ毛が付いています。保存処理をして鞣せば保管できますが、どうしても空腹で仕方ないというのなら食べてもいいでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of fae meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "妖魔肉塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of fae meat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered meat from a fae beast.  You could eat it raw, but cooking "
"it is better."
msgstr "新鮮な妖魔の肉です。生食も可能ですが、調理した方が良さそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "scrap of fae meat"
msgid_plural "scraps of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "妖魔屑肉"

#. ~ Description of "scrap of fae meat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This is a tiny scrap of edible meat from a fae beast.  It's not much, but "
"it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr "妖魔の食べられる屑肉です。味は今一つですが、いざというときは食べるしかありません。"

#. ~ Description of "fae blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "Blood, from a specific part of the Nether.  Disgusting!"
msgstr "異界の特定地域の生物から採取した血液です。気持ち悪いですね！"

#. ~ Description of "cooked meat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of freshly cooked fae meat.  It's filling and nutritious, "
"but unseasoned and a bit bland."
msgstr "調理済みの新鮮な妖魔の肉塊です。食べ応えがあり栄養価も高いですが、味付けがされておらず淡白です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of fae meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "妖魔屑肉(調理済)"

#. ~ Conditional name for "smoked meat" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. fae
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
msgid "smoked fae"
msgid_plural "smoked fae"
msgstr[0] "妖魔肉(燻製)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/casing.json
msgid "9x21mm casing"
msgid_plural "9x21mm casings"
msgstr[0] "空薬莢(9x21mm)"

#. ~ Description of "9x21mm casing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/casing.json
msgid "An empty casing from a 9x21mm round."
msgstr "9x21mm弾の空薬莢です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid "Flesh roots seed"
msgid_plural "Flesh roots seeds"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 肉の根"

#. ~ Description of "Flesh roots seed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"This seed might be more accurately compared to a bulb, because like a bulb "
"you dug it out of the home it had made and chopped off its extremities and "
"are now preparing to plant it in a new location; only, in this instance the "
"hole was dug into the chest of a dead vampire minion and the new location is"
" nestled against the still-beating heart of a patient."
msgstr ""
"球根のような物体です。元あった場所から掘り出し、余計な部位を切り落とし、新たな場所に植える準備ができています。ここで言う元あった場所とは、もちろん吸血鬼のしもべの胸の中のことを指し、新たな場所とは、生きた人間のまだ脈動している心臓の隣のことを指しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generator"
msgid_plural "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generators"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 吸血鬼血液発電装置"

#. ~ Description of "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"What reason could anyone have making a bionic power generator that runs off "
"the blood of vampires?  After some thought, one option that occurs to you "
"would be the possibility that by limiting the fuel options, a vampire is "
"also limiting the opportunities for a rogue minion to use its bionics "
"against its master."
msgstr ""
"吸血鬼の血液で動く発電CBMなんて、何の理由があって作られたのでしょう？考えた末に浮かんだ答えは、燃料となる血液を限定することで、吸血鬼のしもべが主人に無断でCBMを使うことを制限するため、というものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid "chiropteran signal cbm"
msgid_plural "chiropteran signal cbms"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 反響定位装置"

#. ~ Description of "chiropteran signal cbm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A jar-like container that includes a set of vocal cords with a large hood at"
" the top of them and rootlike tendrils at the base connecting to a "
"microchip."
msgstr ""
"瓶状の容器に声帯のような膜が付いており、上部には大きなフードが設置されています。フードの付け根からコードが根のように伸びており、その先端にはマイクロチップが付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
msgid_plural "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizers"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 大型反響定位装置"

#. ~ Description of "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A jar-like container that includes a set of oversized and reinforced vocal "
"cords with a large hood at the top of them and rootlike tendrils at the base"
" connecting to a microchip."
msgstr ""
"瓶状の容器に大きく丈夫な声帯のような膜が付いており、上部には大きなフードが設置されています。フードの付け根からコードが根のように伸びており、その先端にはマイクロチップが付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid "Crypt Spore Vaporizer"
msgid_plural "Crypt Spore Vaporizers"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 吸血鬼共生菌散布装置"

#. ~ Description of "Crypt Spore Vaporizer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A syringe that extends out into two tubes that snake up through the nostrils"
" and down to the lungs in order to get the spores deep into their new home, "
"where they can best spread through the body."
msgstr "シリンジから伸びた2本のチューブを鼻孔から肺まで通し、共生菌を新たな住処の奥深く、全身に最も効率よく行き渡る位置に送り込みます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "OA jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "OA jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプスーツ(OA)"

#. ~ Description of "OA jumpsuit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A brown jumpsuit with OA written in big yellow block letters on the back."
msgstr "茶色のジャンプスーツです。背面に黄色のブロック体で大きくOAと記されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid "candy wrapper"
msgid_plural "candy wrappers"
msgstr[0] "包み紙"

#. ~ Description of "candy wrapper"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"\"Wyld Candy, our flavors span the possible\" is emblazoned proudly upon "
"this shiny colorful wrapper."
msgstr "「ワイルドキャンディ、可能性を広げる味」という一文が記されたカラフルな包装紙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "faewild dust"
msgid_plural "faewild dusts"
msgstr[0] "妖精の粉"

#. ~ Description of "faewild dust"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A shimmering silvery dust.  Narcotic with the street name of Faewild.  "
"Causes the user to see colors not normally visible to the naked human eye."
msgstr "煌めく銀色の粉末は、妖精の粉という名前で知られる薬物です。人間の肉眼では見えない色が見えるようになります。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "faewild dust"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "You rub the glittering dust into your gums."
msgstr "キラキラと輝く粉末を歯茎にすり込みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "lotus blossom"
msgid_plural "lotus blossoms"
msgstr[0] "睡蓮花"

#. ~ Description of "lotus blossom"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A drug that became popular over the last few years before the Cataclysm.  It"
" appears to be exactly as its street name, a dark purple lotus blossom.  "
"It's known to be a strong painkiller while also causing vivid "
"hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"大変動が発生する数年前に流行した薬物です。その名の通り、濃い紫色のハスの花のような形状をしています。強い鎮痛効果がありますが、鮮明な幻覚を見せる作用があることで知られています。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "lotus blossom"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "You eat the purple lotus blossom."
msgstr "紫色の睡蓮花を摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "wyld candy"
msgid_plural "wyld candies"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドキャンディ"

#. ~ Description of "wyld candy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"Mixed candies purporting to come from 'Fair Folk Industries' these candies "
"appear in areas of the country thought to have significant crossover events."
"  It remains unknown whether these candies are produced by a company from "
"here taking advantage of a thin place or if they came from somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"「フェア・フォーク・インダストリー」が作っているとされるミックスキャンディは、アメリカ国内の境界事件が多発している地域でよく見られます。地元企業が薄利多売で広めているのか、それとも別のどこかから流入しているのか、まったく分かりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "questionable blood treatment"
msgid_plural "questionable blood treatments"
msgstr[0] "自家製血液浄化剤"

#. ~ Description of "questionable blood treatment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "This homemade blood treatment ."
msgstr "自家製の血液浄化剤です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "blurred aura"
msgid_plural "blurred auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(冥暗)"

#. ~ Description of "blurred aura"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"Your edges blur and expand and contract in ways that don't reflect reality."
"  Allows you to dodge two extra attacks in a given turn."
msgstr "身体の輪郭がぼやけて伸び縮みし、実際の行動と異なる動きをしています。1ターンに2回、追加で攻撃を回避できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dreamdross rapier"
msgid_plural "dreamdross rapiers"
msgstr[0] "レイピア(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross rapier"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin ephemeral sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the"
" preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes"
" any battle a stylish battle."
msgstr "華美な鍔が付いた、紳士と剣士が好む儚げな細剣です。軽量で素早く扱えるため、どんな戦いもスタイリッシュにこなせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dreamdross fighting knife"
msgid_plural "dreamdross fighting knives"
msgstr[0] "ファイティングナイフ(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross fighting knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral dagger is 15 inches long from the hilt to the tip, the blade "
"itself is a pearly white color and is extremely sharp double edged blade."
msgstr "柄から刃先まで約38cmの長さがある、儚げな両刃の短剣です。刃はパールホワイト色をしており、非常に鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dream armor"
msgid_plural "dream armor"
msgstr[0] "夢の鎧"

#. ~ Description of "dream armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A summoned medieval armor made from dreamdross.  It shimmers in the light "
"and provides some protection."
msgstr "召喚して着用する、夢鉱で作られた鎧です。ある程度の防御力が備わっており、光に照らされるとキラキラと輝きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Oneiric Hammer"
msgid_plural "Oneiric Hammers"
msgstr[0] "夢幻の鎚"

#. ~ Description of "Oneiric Hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"The platonic embodiment of a blacksmiths hammer.  This hammer is necessary "
"to forge or repair items made of forged dreamstuff."
msgstr "鍛冶屋の鎚の概念を具現化したものです。夢の素材を使ったアイテムの鍛造や修復に必要です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazine"
msgid_plural "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(9x21mm/SR-1ﾍﾞｸﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "An 18-round box magazine for use with the SR-1 Vektor 9x21mm pistol."
msgstr "9x21mmSR-1ベクターハンドガンに対応する18発箱型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 8-round box magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 8-round box magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/8発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 8-round box magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 8-round box magazine, for use with the AA-12 shotgun."
msgstr "AA-12ショットガンに対応する、12ゲージ弾を8発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製箱型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 32-round drum magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 32-round drum magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/32発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 32-round drum magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 32-round drum magazine, for use with the HAMMER dual "
"AA-12 turret system."
msgstr "2丁のAA-12を備えたタレットに対応する、12ゲージ弾を32発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製ドラム型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 vehicle drum magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 vehicle drum magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/64発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 vehicle drum magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 64-round drum magazine, for use with the AA-12 shotgun."
msgstr "AA-12ショットガンに対応する、12ゲージ弾を64発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製ドラム型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gunmod.json
msgid "FN integral suppressor"
msgid_plural "FN integral suppressors"
msgstr[0] "FN内蔵サプレッサー"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "FN integral suppressor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gunmod.json
msgid ""
"This is the integrated suppressor for the FN Five-seveN suppressor.  Its "
"large expansion chamber decelerates ammunition via several ports in the "
"barrel, rendering most ammo subsonic at the cost of terminal performance.  "
"It is not as effective as modern designs."
msgstr ""
"FNのファイブセブンに内蔵されたサプレッサーです。大きな拡張銃身内の複数の空気室を介すことで、弾薬の威力を犠牲にして亜音速まで減速させます。最新のものほど効果的ではありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "FN Five-seveN suppressor"
msgid_plural "FN Five-seveN suppressors"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(5.7x28mm/FNﾌｧｲﾌﾞｾﾌﾞﾝｻﾌﾟﾚｯｻｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "FN Five-seveN suppressor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round and with a built in "
"suppressor, the Five-seveN is a lightweight integrally suppressed pistol "
"with a very high capacity, best used against armored opponents."
msgstr ""
"FN社独自の5.7x28mm弾に対応する、サプレッサーを内蔵したピストルです。軽量で装弾数が非常に高く、武装した敵に対して使うのが有効です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
msgid_plural "SR-1 Vektor Gyurzas"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(9x21mm/SR-1ﾍﾞｸﾀｰ ｷﾞｭﾙｻﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The SR-1 Vektor also known as the Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed "
"viper') or Serdyukov SPS is a 9×21mm Gyurza semi-automatic pistol designed "
"for the Russian military.  It fires 9x21mm ammunition, which is rare in the "
"States."
msgstr ""
"ギュルザ(Гюрза、ロシア語でマルハナクサリヘビという意味)という別名でも知られるSR-1ベクター、あるいはセルジュコフSPSは、ロシア製の軍用9x21mmセミオートピストルです。アメリカ国内では珍しい9x21mm弾を発射します。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "Auto Assault-12"
msgid_plural "Auto Assault-12s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/AA-12)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Auto Assault-12"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The Atchisson Assault Shotgun, is an automatic combat shotgun developed in "
"1972 by Maxwell Atchisson.  The most prominent feature is reduced recoil."
msgstr ""
"アッチソン・アサルトショットガンは、1972年にマックスウェル・アッチソンが開発したフルオートコンバットショットガンです。反動をほとんど感じない点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
msgid_plural "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret systems"
msgstr[0] "タレット(AA-12)"

#. ~ Description of gun "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven dual AA-12s mounted together to match to a turret."
msgstr "専用の電動式AA-12を2丁搭載したタレットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "glasknife"
msgid_plural "glasknives"
msgstr[0] "結晶ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "glasknife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a knife that appears to be made of glass, it's much more durable "
"than glass appearing to be some sort of crystal with the strength of metal."
msgstr "ガラスのような素材で作られたナイフです。結晶は金属と同じくらいの強度であり、ガラスよりもはるかに高い耐久性を備えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "mirrored estoc"
msgid_plural "mirrored estocs"
msgstr[0] "鏡のエストック"

#. ~ Description of "mirrored estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A thin piercing sword no wider than two fingers side by side, it's mirrored "
"surface reflects the world back at it's wielders opponents and is difficult "
"to see to parry.  You've never felt a sword like this before."
msgstr ""
"指2本分ほどの幅しかない細身の剣です。鏡のような表面が周囲を映し出すことで、剣筋を読ませず、受け流すのが困難になります。このような使い心地の剣は今まで触れたことがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "frostrimed estoc"
msgid_plural "frostrimed estocs"
msgstr[0] "霜のエストック"

#. ~ Description of "frostrimed estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This sword is covered in shifting frost and seems to move of its own "
"volition in your hands."
msgstr "剣の表面を覆う霜は、手にするとまるで意志があるように揺らめきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "redcap club"
msgid_plural "redcap clubs"
msgstr[0] "レッドキャップの棍棒"

#. ~ Description of "redcap club"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A giant bloodstained club, barely human wieldable with two hands.  You see "
"whenever it connects with an enemy shadowy tendrils of blood stick to "
"whatever it hits and burn like acid."
msgstr "片手ではとても扱えそうにない、巨大な血染めの棍棒です。殴った瞬間に棍棒から血の色の触手が飛び出し、酸のように敵を焼き焦がします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Blood Tendrils"
msgstr "血の触手"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blood Tendrils"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Brownish reddish tendrils connect from the club to your enemies."
msgstr "茶色がかった赤色の触手が棍棒から飛び出し、敵を捕らえます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "pooka gladius"
msgid_plural "pooka gladii"
msgstr[0] "プーカのグラディウス"

#. ~ Description of "pooka gladius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A gladius covered in the whorls of Celtic knots.  Sparks seems to pop off "
"the edge of the blade."
msgstr "渦を巻くケルトの紋様で覆われた剣です。刃先から火花が散っているように見えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Distant Thunder"
msgstr "雷飛ばし"

#. ~ Description of spell "Distant Thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Sparks zap at your opponent."
msgstr "標的めがけて電撃を飛ばします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "Report CO001141"
msgid_plural "Report CO001141s"
msgstr[0] "報告書CO001141"

#. ~ Description of "Report CO001141"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A page from a report."
msgstr "報告書の1ページです。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A bright green post-it note."
msgstr "鮮やかな緑色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A bright gray post-it note."
msgstr "明るい灰色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A bright pink post-it note."
msgstr "鮮やかなピンク色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid "purity crackers"
msgid_plural "purity crackers"
msgstr[0] "ピュリティクラッカー"

#. ~ Description of "purity crackers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly hard cracker, squeezing it in your hand it feels as though "
"your teeth might break before the cracker.  The packaging on the side shows "
"a tall being feeding these crackers to a horned and four legged creature."
msgstr ""
"手でも割れにくく、噛めば前歯が折れてしまいそうなほど硬いクラッカーです。パッケージの側面には、角をもつ四足歩行生物にこのクラッカーを食べさる背の高い人物が描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid "golden bridle"
msgid_plural "golden bridles"
msgstr[0] "金の頭絡"

#. ~ Description of "golden bridle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid ""
"A golden bridle made of spun moon tears, gold, and incredibly strong hair "
"including associated tack that can be placed on a tamed mythical animal that"
" is capable of being ridden."
msgstr "月涙鉱と金と非常に丈夫な毛で作られた、黄金に輝く頭絡と手綱です。手懐けた神話生物に装着すれば、騎乗できるようになります。"

#. ~ not really sure how to convert density to weight in our system look at it
#. later.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "moon tears ingot"
msgid_plural "moon tears ingots"
msgstr[0] "月涙鉱鋳塊"

#. ~ not really sure how to convert density to weight in our system look at it
#. later.
#. ~ Description of "moon tears ingot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"An ingot of moon tears.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be used "
"for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr "月涙鉱の鋳塊です。サイズは約3cm×7cm×12cmで、そのまま様々な鍛冶作業に使えます。"

#. ~ Density 2g/ml.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "scrap dreamdross"
msgid_plural "scraps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱屑"

#. ~ Density 2g/ml.
#. ~ Description of "scrap dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap dreamdross useful in all kinds of "
"crafting ephemeral things."
msgstr "小さな夢鉱を集めたものです。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "lump of dreamdross"
msgid_plural "lumps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱塊"

#. ~ Description of "lump of dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "A heavy formed piece of dreamdross.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "非常に重い夢鉱の塊です。アイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "dreamdross ingot"
msgid_plural "dreamdross ingots"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱鋳塊"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross ingot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A forged ingot of dreamdross.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be"
" used for various reality forging tasks."
msgstr "夢鉱の鋳塊です。サイズは約3cm×7cm×12cmで、そのまま様々な鍛冶作業に使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
msgid "zebra badge"
msgid_plural "zebra badges"
msgstr[0] "ゼブラバッジ"

#. ~ Description of "zebra badge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
msgid ""
"A white piece of plastic with a picture of an agent and a barcode under it."
"  The lack of other details on this badge and badges like it led to them "
"being called 'Zebra Badges'.  May grant basic access to some Xedra areas."
msgstr ""
"スタッフの写真の下にバーコードが記された、プラスチック製の白い札です。この種のバッジには詳細な情報が記されておらずどれも同じように見えるため、通称「ゼブラバッジ」と呼ばれています。XEDRAが管理する一部のエリアへのアクセスが許可されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "光輝ファーブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of glimmer fur boots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "Boots lined with glimmer fur for warmth."
msgstr "光輝毛皮製の暖かいブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝ファーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XS glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝ファーブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur cloak"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "外套(光輝毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur cloak"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy glimmer fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The shimmering"
" nature of the fur made these garments coveted before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "きらめく毛皮で作られた重厚な外套です。光り輝く毛皮は大変動以前から珍重されていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "光輝ファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur coat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A glimmer fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm and very "
"rare before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "2つの小さなポケットが付いた光輝毛皮製のコートです。非常に暖かく、大変動以前から珍重されていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XL glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝ファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XS glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "XS glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝ファーコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(光輝毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur duster"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage.  "
"Shimmers in direct sunlight and would have been fancy clothing prior to the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"厚手の光輝毛皮で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。直射日光に当たるとキラキラと輝き、大変動以前から豪華な衣装として扱われていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XL glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XLダスターコート(光輝毛皮)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XS glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "XS glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XSダスターコート(光輝毛皮)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルスリーブ(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail arms, found in places where changeling bannermen are "
"numerous.  Each sleeve has straps to connect them with each other.  The lack"
" of fingers makes them less cumbersome and allows them to be used with "
"gloves."
msgstr ""
"チェンジリングの旗手がよく着用している、月涙鉱製チェーンメイルアームです。肩口にはベストと接合するためのストラップが付いています。指の部分は動きを妨げないように空いており、グローブと併用できます。金属に錆や腐食が発生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "XLチェーンメイルスリーブ(月涙鉱)"

