#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "phrygian cap"
msgid_plural "phrygian caps"
msgstr[0] "フリジア帽"

#. ~ Description of "phrygian cap"
#. ~ Description of "blood red cap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid ""
"A soft conical hat with the apex bent over.  Commonly worn in antiquity with"
" various cultures in Eastern Europe and Anatolia.  It later signified "
"freedom in both the American and French Revolutions."
msgstr ""
"頂点が折れ曲がった円錐形の柔らかい帽子です。古代の東欧やアナトリア地方で普段から着用されていましたが、その後のアメリカ独立戦争やフランス革命では自由の象徴として用いられました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "blood red cap"
msgid_plural "blood red caps"
msgstr[0] "赤いフリジア帽"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "Bleeding Cap"
msgstr "血を流す帽子"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bleeding Cap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "Blood starts seeping out of the cap, down your face."
msgstr "帽子から血が滲み出し、顔にかかりました。"

#. ~ I added a helmet to the summon
