#. ~ I added a helmet to the summon
#. ~ Description of "bloody redcap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid ""
"The cap develops a fearsome aura as the blood pours back out of the fibers."
msgstr "帽子から血が流れ出し、恐ろしい雰囲気を醸し出しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "flesh roots"
msgid_plural "flesh roots"
msgstr[0] "肉の根"

#. ~ Description of "flesh roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A layer of bulging rootlike structures distending the upper layers of skin."
"  Helps protect your body from damage."
msgstr "膨らんだ根のようなものが皮膚を覆っています。肉体を攻撃から守る効果があります。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "battery-powered laser pistol"
msgid_plural "battery-powered laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "電池式レーザーピストル"

#. ~ Description of gun "battery-powered laser pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"This handgun looks like it came from some sci-fi journal.  It has a recharge"
" slot that somehow is capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr "SF雑誌に掲載されそうな見た目のハンドガンです。充電スロットが付いており、原理は不明ですがほぼあらゆる種類の電池に対応しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "ray gun"
msgid_plural "ray guns"
msgstr[0] "レイガン"

#. ~ Description of gun "ray gun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"A ray gun with lots of cylinders and whorling cables that light up. It has a"
" recharge slot that somehow is capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr ""
"たくさんのシリンダーや渦巻くケーブルがピカピカ光っている光線銃です。充電スロットが付いており、原理は不明ですがほぼあらゆる種類の電池に対応しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "death ray"
msgid_plural "death rays"
msgstr[0] "デスレイ"

#. ~ Description of gun "death ray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"The Aetheric Death Ray, glowing a menacing green.  It hums with a barely "
"controlled hatred of organic life.  It must recharge on it's own as there "
"are no ports or battery slots on it.  It's sleek and smooth and evil."
msgstr ""
"威嚇的な緑色に輝くエーテリック・デス・レイです。カタカタと震え、有機物に対する憎悪をかろうじて抑えています。電源ポートや充電スロットは付いていないため、何らかの充電方法を探す必要があります。滑らかで艶がある、凶悪な銃です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "wolf sledge"
msgid_plural "wolf sledges"
msgstr[0] "ウルフスレッジ"

#. ~ Description of "wolf sledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"A long, solid, crafted steel haft, and a massive, comma-like head.  It feels"
" really massive, but it is easy to wield.  You even can whisper ancient "
"words to it while you throw it, and it will always return to your hands."
msgstr ""
"細工が施された長く硬い鋼鉄製の柄と、巨大な勾玉型のヘッドをもつハンマーです。非常に重く感じますが、簡単に振り回せます。古代の呪文を囁きながら投げれば、必ず手元に戻ってきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "bio detonator"
msgid_plural "bio detonators"
msgstr[0] "バイオデトネイター"

#. ~ Description of "bio detonator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"A long, huge barrel drum mortar with a plethora of wires.  It's hollow "
"inside, but it smells awful."
msgstr "おびただしい数のワイヤーが接続された、長く巨大な筒状の迫撃砲です。内部は空洞ですが、酷い臭いがします。"

#. ~ "message" action message of item "bio detonator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "The mortar makes a quiet, deep sound."
msgstr "迫撃砲は低い音を立てました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "bio-warhead"
msgid_plural "bio-warheads"
msgstr[0] "バイオウォーヘッド"

#. ~ Description of "bio-warhead"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"So you decided to become an inventor and instead of inventing something good"
" for mankind, you invented this?  You should be ashamed."
msgstr "発明家であると言いつつ、人類の役にも立たないこんなものを発明したのは何故ですか？恥を知りなさい。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "Vancian bill"
msgid_plural "Vancian bills"
msgstr[0] "ヴァンスの札"

#. ~ Description of "Vancian bill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"A small bill, full of some odd symbols.  Ripping it off cause the small "
"dimensional rip.  It will last only a few milliseconds, yet make enough "
"damage to kill something."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な記号で埋め尽くされた小さな札です。ちぎると小さな次元の裂け目が発生します。裂け目は数ミリ秒間しか持続しませんが、敵を殺すにはそれで十分です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "helmet of creative juices"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices"
msgstr[0] "創作意欲増強ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "helmet of creative juices"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"A small, weirdly shaped helmet that covers your head.  It isn't turned on "
"currently, but you can still wear it."
msgstr "頭部に着用する、奇妙な形状の小さなヘルメットです。現在電源は入っていませんが、着用することはできます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "The helmet turns on."
msgstr "ヘルメットを起動しました。"

#. ~ 30 charges per hour, ~16 hours for medium battery
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "helmet of creative juices (on)"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices (on)"
msgstr[0] "創作意欲増強ヘルメット(オン)"

#. ~ 30 charges per hour, ~16 hours for medium battery
#. ~ Description of "helmet of creative juices (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"The helmet of creative juices may look like a child's homemade toy, but its "
"effects when turned on are real enough.  While wearing it, your thoughts are"
" buffered from the outside world by a soft white noise that varies from "
"person to person as to what they actually hear.  Some hear the ocean, a fan "
"blowing or paper crumpling.  Whatever the sound, it helps you to think "
"faster and more creatively than before."
msgstr ""
"見た目は子供が手作りした玩具のようですが、起動したときの効果は本物です。着用している間は小さな雑音が流れて外界の音を遮断し、深く思考できるようになります。実際に聞こえる音は、波音、扇風機の羽音、紙をくしゃくしゃにする音など、人によって様々ですが、その音によってより速く、より創造的な思考を助けます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "The helmet turns off."
msgstr "ヘルメットを停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid "ion rifle"
msgid_plural "ion rifles"
msgstr[0] "イオンライフル"

#. ~ Description of "ion rifle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"Something something ion, something something wide area.  Don't even ask."
msgstr "イオンだかなんだかの力によって、広範囲をなんとかかんとかします。これ以上は何も説明できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid_plural "intricate and opulent clocks"
msgstr[0] "豪華なからくり時計"

#. ~ Description of "intricate and opulent clock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly intricate clock where every visible surface appears to be gilded or chrome.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"あらゆる箇所が金やクロム合金でメッキ掛けされた、非常に精巧な時計です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "crystalline rod"
msgid_plural "crystalline rods"
msgstr[0] "結晶の杖"

#. ~ Description of "crystalline rod"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"This crystal rod changes hue at random.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"次々と色を変え続ける結晶で作られた杖です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "baroque monitor"
msgid_plural "baroque monitors"
msgstr[0] "歪んだモニター"

#. ~ Description of "baroque monitor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A strange monitor with a variety of knobs and dials.  When you turn it on, it crackles and then begins tracking things that either aren't there or aren't visible to the naked eye.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"様々なツマミやダイヤルが付いた、奇妙なモニターです。電源を入れるとパチパチと音を立て、ある筈のないものや肉眼では見えないものを映し出します。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid_plural "several messes of tubes and wires"
msgstr[0] "絡まったチューブと配線"

#. ~ Description of "a mess of tubes and wires"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"What is it for?  What could it do?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何のためのものでしょうか？何ができるのでしょうか？\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "abstract sculpture"
msgid_plural "abstract sculptures"
msgstr[0] "抽象的な彫刻"

#. ~ Description of "abstract sculpture"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"It's a sculpture but you can't identify what it is of.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何かの彫刻ですが、何を表しているのか分かりません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "humming disc"
msgid_plural "humming discs"
msgstr[0] "震える円盤"

#. ~ Description of "humming disc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"It hums louder when you touch it.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"触ると音が大きくなります。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "an instrument"
msgid_plural "an instruments"
msgstr[0] "楽器"

#. ~ Description of "an instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"It looks like it could be a musical instrument.  But how would you play it?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"楽器のように見えます。どうやって演奏するのでしょうか？\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "very thin sheet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A sheet so light and thin that viewing it horizontally makes it almost invisible.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"水平にするとほとんど見えなくなるほど薄く軽い布です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "spiked sphere"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A prickly ball that, no matter the force you apply, somehow never feels as if it could cut.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"刺々しい見た目の球体ですが、どれだけ強く握っても何故かケガをしません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "malleable blob"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"Despite its looseness, this mass of goo keeps its shape as you fold it in your hands.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"非常に緩い粘液に見えますが、握っても形状が崩れません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "spiraling rod"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A rod with a bulbous, spiralling knob on the end that seems to spin as you look.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"先端に球根のような螺旋型のふくらみがあり、凝視し続けると回転しているように見えます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "small pin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"One of those pins you wear on your shirt, but this one has indecipherable symbols in place of a witty slogan.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"服に付けるブローチです。気の利いた文言ではなく、解読不能な記号が書いていあります。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "hollow tube"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A tube of unknown material.  A strange noise from nowhere can be heard when you place it next to your ear, as if something's inside.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"未知の素材でできたチューブです。耳に近付けると、中から奇妙な音が聞こえてきます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "regular tetrahedron"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A triangular pyramid, inconspicuous in every way.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何の特徴もない三角錐です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "translucent crystal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful crystal, which seems to suck in detail rather than merely obscuring it as light passes through.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"美しい結晶です。この結晶を通った光は、まるで結晶にすべて吸い取られてしまったかのように消えてしまいます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "twisted, knotted cord"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A bit of spiralling rope, disorienting you as your eyes vainly try to complete following the loop.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"もつれた紐を目で辿ろうとすると頭がくらくらします。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "crescent-shaped stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"The sound of the tide can be heard from this stone, as if it were a miniature moon moving the oceans.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"石から潮騒が聞こえてきます。まるで潮の満ち引きをつかさどる小さな月のようです。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid "magician's hat"
msgid_plural "magician's hats"
msgstr[0] "手品師の帽子"

#. ~ Description of "magician's hat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid ""
"Old school cylinder hat, used by illusionists in the whole world.  Maybe it "
"still remember some cool tricks?"
msgstr "世界中の奇術師が愛用している、古風なシルクハットです。もしかしたら、驚くべきトリックを披露してくれるかも？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid "warm ball"
msgid_plural "warm balls"
msgstr[0] "熱の球"

#. ~ Description of "warm ball"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid ""
"Small and light ball of glass with flickering flames inside.  The surface "
"feels scalding hot, yet the temperature does not change."
msgstr "内部で炎が揺らめいている、小さく軽いガラス球です。表面は焼け付くように熱く感じますが、実際の温度は上昇していません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "Magick 8-Ball"
msgid_plural "Magick 8-Balls"
msgstr[0] "マジック8ボール"

#. ~ Description of "Magick 8-Ball"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A fortune-telling device from the 1950s.  If you shake it and look at the "
"bottom it will give you detailed step by step instructions on how to do… "
"something."
msgstr "1950年代に流行った占い装置です。振ってから底を見ると...何かしらの詳しい手順を学ぶことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "glass dagger paperweight"
msgid_plural "glass dagger paperweights"
msgstr[0] "短剣型文鎮"

#. ~ Description of "glass dagger paperweight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"This paperweight in the shape of a small glass dagger emits a wet wheeze "
"like a punctured lung when held."
msgstr "小さな短剣の形をした、ガラス製の文鎮です。握ると、肺に穴が開いたような不快な声を発します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgid_plural "copies of Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgstr[0] "絵画(死の床のカラヴァッジオ)"

#. ~ Description of "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A previously unknown painting in Caravaggio's style of the artist himself "
"lying prone on his deathbed as black ichor seeps from a sword wound in his "
"side.  His own sword rests near his hand and his ever dying breath asks you "
"to take up his blade."
msgstr ""
"カラヴァッジオ特有のタッチで描かれた、未発表の絵画です。死の床に伏した画家自身が描かれており、脇腹の刺し傷から黒い液体が滲み出ています。画家の手には剣が握られており、この剣を持っていけと訴えているようにも見えます。"

#. ~ 'A small hand mirror.  Something wrong'.  I use
#. https://www.messletters.com/en/mirrored/ (the third option) but I guess it
#. doesn't work with non-Latin languages. Sorry translators.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgctxt "'hand mirror' but upside down"
msgid "ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
msgid_plural "sɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
msgstr[0] "鏡手"

#. ~ 'A small hand mirror.  Something wrong'.  I use
#. https://www.messletters.com/en/mirrored/ (the third option) but I guess it
#. doesn't work with non-Latin languages. Sorry translators.
#. ~ Description of "ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "·ɓuoɹʍ ɓuᴉɥʇǝɯoS  ·ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ ʅʅɐɯs Ɐ"
msgstr "。すましが気いしかおがか何。すで鏡手なさ小"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
msgid "a set of brass cylinders"
msgid_plural "sets of brass cylinders"
msgstr[0] "円筒印章セット"

#. ~ Description of "a set of brass cylinders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"These brass cylinders are engraved with cuneiform and could be rolled across"
" wet clay to create a page of writing per cylinder.  When you touch one of "
"the cylinders you hear a faint voice whisper 'Enki'."
msgstr ""
"真鍮製の円筒の表面には楔形文字が刻まれており、柔らかい粘土の上で転がすと、円筒1本につき1ページ分の文章が印字されるようになっています。円筒の一つに触れると、「エンキ」と小さく囁く声が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "deck of tarot cards"
msgid_plural "decks of tarot cards"
msgstr[0] "タロットカード"

#. ~ Description of "deck of tarot cards"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A deck of intricately designed tarot cards.  When you lay out your future "
"they seem to be trying to tell you to take a leap of faith."
msgstr "複雑なデザインのタロットカード一式です。未来を占うと、大丈夫だと信じて思い切ることが大事だと告げられたように感じました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "occult seal"
msgid_plural "occult seals"
msgstr[0] "神秘の印章"

#. ~ Description of "occult seal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"An intricate occult seal.  When you glance at the bottom left corner you "
"hear the sound of the ocean and smell the sea and a river starts flowing "
"through point to point of the seal."
msgstr "複雑なデザインの神秘的な印章です。シンボルの左下に目をやると、どこからか海の音と匂いが漂い始め、点から点へと流れる川を幻視しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "hurricane lamp with thorns"
msgid_plural "hurricane lamps with thorns"
msgstr[0] "茨のランタン"

#. ~ Description of "hurricane lamp with thorns"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"An old style hurricane lamp.  The handle appears to made of vines covered in"
" sharp thorns."
msgstr "古風なハリケーンランタンです。持ち手が棘だらけの茨で作られているように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "box of glass berries"
msgid_plural "boxes of glass berries"
msgstr[0] "ガラス細工のベリー"

#. ~ Description of "box of glass berries"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A box full of glass berries, when you get distracted you find yourself "
"crunching them in your mouth.  Each one tastes like a mouth full of blood, "
"that slowly changes to espresso."
msgstr ""
"箱に詰まったガラス細工のベリーは、気を抜くと口の中で噛み締めてしまいそうになります。口いっぱいに広がる血の味は、徐々にエスプレッソコーヒーの風味へと変化します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "polaroid of a missing person"
msgid_plural "polaroids of a missing person"
msgstr[0] "行方不明者のポラロイド写真"

#. ~ Description of "polaroid of a missing person"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A polaroid of someone you remember that went missing before the Cataclysm.  "
"It caught a ton of media attention because that were seen near what was "
"shortly after identified as a thin place between dimensions.  The more you "
"stare at the picture you begin to see wounds appear and disappear on the "
"person.  Sometimes they match your wounds that have healed."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に行方不明になった、思い出深い人物のポラロイド写真です。行方不明になる直前に写真が撮られ、しかも撮影現場が次元の狭間の付近だったと後に判明したため、この事件は多くのメディアの注目を集めました。写真を凝視していると、被写体の身体に傷が表れたり消えたりしているように見えます。既に治った自分自身の傷とまったく同じように見えることもあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "strange cup of coffee"
msgid_plural "strange cups of coffee"
msgstr[0] "奇妙なコーヒー瓶"

#. ~ Description of "strange cup of coffee"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small jar with coffee, moving in weird patterns with no apparent cause.  "
"After watching the swirls for some time, you are sure that it loops back on "
"its movements, like some sort of message."
msgstr ""
"原因不明の奇妙な渦を作っている、小さな瓶に入ったコーヒーです。渦をしばらく眺めていると、何かのメッセージが繰り返し伝えられているような気がしてきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "red devil blindfold"
msgid_plural "red devil blindfolds"
msgstr[0] "悪魔の目隠し布"

#. ~ Description of "red devil blindfold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A red fabric blindfold with a cartoonish devil over the eyes.  You feel some"
" anger when you put it on.  Did that devil just wink at you?"
msgstr ""
"目の位置に悪魔のイラストが描かれた、赤色の目隠し布です。着用すると、心の底から怒りがこみ上げてきます。悪魔に魅入られてしまったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "mother of pearl heart"
msgid_plural "mother of pearl hearts"
msgstr[0] "真珠色の心臓"

#. ~ Description of "mother of pearl heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A human heart grown in mother of pearl.  It beats loudly when you raise it "
"to your ear."
msgstr "真珠の母貝の中に保存されていた心臓です。耳を当てると大きな鼓動が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Description of "right eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Tiny human eye.  You can clearly see the green iris and red capillaries.  "
"You feel it can see you in the darkest places, which is so weird since it's "
"only an eye."
msgstr "緑色の虹彩と赤い毛細血管がはっきりと見える、小さな人間の目玉です。どれほど暗い闇に紛れようが、こちらを見透かされている気分になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "cerebellum"
msgid_plural "cerebellums"
msgstr[0] "小脳"

#. ~ Description of "cerebellum"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Small, smooth part of human brain.  Looks slippery.  Feels like rubber."
msgstr "小さく滑らかな、人間の脳の一部です。皺一つなく、ゴムのような弾力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "skull"
msgid_plural "skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨"

#. ~ Description of "skull"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "Tiny human skull.  His empty orbits are watching at you."
msgstr "小さな人間の頭蓋骨です。虚ろな眼窩がこちらを見つめています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "ring of Gyges"
msgid_plural "rings of Gyges"
msgstr[0] "ギュゲースの指輪"

#. ~ Description of "ring of Gyges"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Small ring.  There is nothing special about it, except the word \"Republic\""
" embossed on it."
msgstr "小さな指輪です。表面に「Republic(国家)」という単語が彫ってある以外、何の特徴もありません。"

#. ~ Description of "left eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Tiny human eye.  You can clearly see it has a blue iris and red capillaries."
"  You feel it can see you no matter how you hide."
msgstr "緑色の虹彩と赤い毛細血管がはっきりと見える、小さな人間の目玉です。どれほど上手く隠れようが、こちらを見透かされている気分になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "Enemy of the World"
msgid_plural "copies of Enemy of the World"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(エネミー・オブ・ザ・ワールド)"

#. ~ Description of "Enemy of the World"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small Korean novel, that describes the journey of an incredibly strong "
"protagonist attempting to save the world."
msgstr "とてつもなく強い主人公が世界を救うために旅をする、韓国の短編小説です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "horn"
msgid_plural "horns"
msgstr[0] "角"

#. ~ Description of "horn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Big, straight horn of unknown creature.  Could easily injure a careless "
"person."
msgstr "何の生物のものか分からない、まっすぐ伸びた大きな角です。注意して扱わないとケガをしそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "muscles"
msgid_plural "muscles"
msgstr[0] "筋肉"

#. ~ Description of "muscles"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Long fleshy tendon with joints on both sides.  They contract time to time."
msgstr "骨の両端に繋がっている、肉質の長い腱です。時折勝手に収縮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "pile of pain"
msgid_plural "pile of pains"
msgstr[0] "苦痛の塊"

#. ~ Description of "pile of pain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "There is nothing here.  It's uncomfortable to hold it."
msgstr "ここには何もありません。持っていると不快な気分になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "ray diagrams"
msgid_plural "copies of ray diagrams"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(光線図解)"

#. ~ Description of "ray diagrams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"These are diagrams covered in mathematical formulae and drawings of rays.  "
"You think there are some discussions about how to manipulate rays, rays of "
"what though?"
msgstr "数式と光線の図で埋め尽くされた書物です。光線を操作する方法について書かれているようですが、一体何の光線なのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "ray weapon schematics"
msgid_plural "copies of ray weapon schematics"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(光線兵器概要)"

#. ~ Description of "ray weapon schematics"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"These are designs you created in a manic episode.  They build upon the ray "
"diagrams you had found, and in your own handwriting is also written 'DEATH "
"RAY'.  Well, that's promising I guess."
msgstr ""
"躁状態のときに自ら執筆した図面です。実際に目にした光線が基になっており、馴染みのある筆跡で「殺人光線」と書いてあります。ふむ、これは期待できそうですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "wolf's mask"
msgid_plural "wolf's masks"
msgstr[0] "狼のマスク"

#. ~ Description of "wolf's mask"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"Huge, respirator-like mask, which covers the whole head, except the right "
"eye.  The tubes are not connected to anything, so you can't breath with the "
"mask on your face."
msgstr ""
"右目部分にだけ穴が開いた、顔全体を覆う巨大な人工呼吸器のようなマスクです。口元が完全に密閉されているため、マスクをした状態では呼吸ができません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "String Theory For Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of String Theory For Dummies"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(サルでもわかる超ひも理論)"

#. ~ Description of "String Theory For Dummies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"A small hardcover book, that describes a version of string theory that seems"
" quite preposterous."
msgstr "超ひも理論についてのかなり荒唐無稽な解説が載っている、ハードカバーの小さな書籍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "syringe with vermilion liquid"
msgid_plural "syringes with vermilion liquid"
msgstr[0] "注射器(朱色の液体)"

#. ~ Description of "syringe with vermilion liquid"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"Small syringe filled with dark red liquid.  The piston seems to be glued, "
"and you can't move it."
msgstr "鮮やかな朱色の液体が入った小型注射器です。ピストンが接着されているらしく、動かせません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "odd hundred-dollar strap"
msgid_plural "odd hundred-dollar straps"
msgstr[0] "奇妙な札束"

#. ~ Description of "odd hundred-dollar strap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"A hundred-dollar bills held together by a mustard currency strap.  Each bill"
" contain a sequence of symbols you can't understand, but can feel pounding "
"inside your skull."
msgstr "100枚の100ドル紙幣をマスタード色の帯封で束ねたものです。各紙幣には意味不明な記号の羅列が書いてあり、見ていると頭が混乱します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "tin foil hat"
msgid_plural "tin foil hats"
msgstr[0] "アルミ箔帽"

#. ~ Description of "tin foil hat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"Tiny hat, made from thin tin foil layer and a strainer.  You can't wear it, "
"because it's too small for your head."
msgstr "ざるに薄いアルミ箔を貼り付けて作った小さな帽子です。小さすぎて頭には被れません。"

#. ~ No, its 'Crimsonland'
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "video game disc"
msgid_plural "video game discs"
msgstr[0] "ゲームディスク"

#. ~ No, its 'Crimsonland'
#. ~ Description of "video game disc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"A small box with a video game disc.  The cover shows a man, surrounded by "
"monsters, who's shooting the monsters with a gun in each hand.  There is a "
"compact disc inside, but you can't pick it up."
msgstr ""
"テレビゲームのディスクが入った小さなケースです。表面には、辺りを包囲するモンスターに両手の銃を発砲する男が載っています。中にコンパクトディスクが入っていますが、取り出せません。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mapgen/map_extras.json
msgid "Golden Monolith"
msgstr "黄金のモノリス"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Golden Monolith"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mapgen/map_extras.json
msgid "A golden monolith sitting serenely overlooking the nearby terrain."
msgstr "金色のモノリスが周囲を見据え、静かにたたずんでいます。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mapgen/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "government office"
msgstr "庁舎"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monster_special_attacks/monster_special_attacks.json
msgid "Sucking bite"
msgstr "吸血攻撃"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "moroi"
msgid_plural "moroi"
msgstr[0] "モロイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "moroi"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"This creature looks more aware than most of the ferals you have seen and in "
"fact you might even suspect them of being normal if it weren't for the dried"
" blood caked around their mouth and down the front of their clothes.  The "
"light glints against what look to be sharp fangs in their mouth."
msgstr ""
"この人型生物は、これまで見てきたどの狂人よりも意識がはっきりしているようです。実際、口の周りと服に血がこびりついてさえいなければ、普通の人間としか思えません。口の両端からは鋭い牙のようなものが飛び出し、光を反射して輝いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "strigoi"
msgid_plural "strigoi"
msgstr[0] "ストリゴイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "strigoi"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly skinny corpse like creature moving with unnatural flexibility."
"  It sniffs the air and opens a mouthful of jagged teeth while the jaws keep"
" distending.  This could easily be the origin creature of Nosferatu."
msgstr ""
"不自然なほど滑らかに動く、やせ細った死体のような姿の生物です。周囲の空気を嗅ぐような動作をしており、顎は大きく発達し、口内にはギザギザとした歯が並んでいます。この生物が吸血鬼ノスフェラトゥの起源なのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield"
msgid_plural "renfields"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their "
"vampire masters."
msgstr "髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a pistol"
msgid_plural "renfields with pistols"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(ハンドガン)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a 9mm pistol with no respect for trigger "
"discipline.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。9mm拳銃を持ち歩いており、今にも発砲しそうです。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield fires their Glock!"
msgstr "レンフィールドはグロックを発砲しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a remington"
msgid_plural "renfields with shotguns"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(ショットガン)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a shotgun loosely one handed until they "
"take aim.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。ショットガンを片手に構え、狙いを定めています。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "レンフィールドはショットガンを発砲しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid_plural "renfields with flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(火炎放射器)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  A pilot light runs at the business end of their "
"flamethrower.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。手に持った火炎放射器の先端から、小さな火が漏れ出ています。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield shoots their flamethrower!"
msgstr "レンフィールドは火炎放射器を使用しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "cyber-renfield"
msgid_plural "cyber-renfields"
msgstr[0] "改造レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of monster "cyber-renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"A renfield enhanced with cybernetic modules.  These bloodhunting "
"monstrosities will crash through brick walls in search of their masters' "
"foes.  Someone with enough surgical skills might be able to pull some useful"
" bionics from their corpse.  Bionic claws snikt in and out until it finds a "
"target for its hate."
msgstr ""
"CBMで強化されたレンフィールドです。この血に飢えた怪物は主人の敵を見つけ出すためなら、レンガの壁すら突き破ります。強化された爪を出し入れしながら、憎しみをぶつける対象を探しています。外科的なスキルが十分に高ければ、死体からCBMを摘出できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "abominable renfield"
msgid_plural "abominable renfields"
msgstr[0] "巨大吸血コウモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"The Northern European Vampire bat, was discovered 8 years previous to the "
"Cataclysm in Lithuania.  Within those years it had spread across the entire "
"northern hemisphere.  It is larger than a regular bat and furrier allowing "
"it to remain active in the colder winters.  They do drink human and animal "
"blood as part of their sustenance.  It roosts in caves and other hollows, "
"and uses a form of echolocation to aerially navigate through tricky terrain "
"at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"大変動の8年前にリトアニアで発見され、一年も経たずに北半球全土に生息域を拡大した、ヨーロッパチスイコウモリです。通常のコウモリより大型で、毛皮が生えているため寒い冬でも活動できます。栄養補給のために人間や動物の血を吸い、洞窟などの狭い場所をねぐらにしています。エコーロケーションを使って複雑な地形を把握し、空中を素早く飛び回ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "giant bat"
msgid_plural "giant bats"
msgstr[0] "巨大コウモリ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "changeling wanderer"
msgid_plural "changeling wanderers"
msgstr[0] "チェンジリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "changeling wanderer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"The outline looks human but the movements of the limbs are too willowy and "
"sinuous, a small knife flickers between its fingers in and out of sight.  "
"Its clothing appears to be skintight silvery chain or scale mail, it shifts "
"in the light."
msgstr ""
"一見すると人間のようですが、四肢は非常にしなやかで、手の中に小さなナイフを隠し持っています。チェーンメイルかスケイルメイルのような銀色の装束は、光の加減でキラキラと輝いて見えます。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "changeling wanderer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "The changeling lithely throws a knife!"
msgstr "チェンジリングはナイフを素早く投げました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "changeling bannerman"
msgid_plural "changeling bannermen"
msgstr[0] "チェンジリングの旗手"

#. ~ Description of monster "changeling bannerman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A tall lithe humanoid of indeterminate gender, in silvery scale mail, with "
"archaic weapons.  Their sea-green eyes promise violence."
msgstr "古風な武器を持った背の高い性別不詳の人型生物が、銀色の粉をまき散らしています。青みがかった緑色の瞳の中に、暴力衝動が渦巻いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "redcap aspirant"
msgid_plural "redcap aspirants"
msgstr[0] "レッドキャップ"

#. ~ Description of monster "redcap aspirant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"With a red feathered plume rising out of their helmet, this large combatant "
"is clearly a cut above many of the foes you've faced.  Ogrish features stare"
" out from under the blood drenched helmet."
msgstr "兜に赤い羽根のような飾りを挿した、いかにも手強そうな難敵です。血に塗れた兜の下から、鬼のように厳めしい顔が覗いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "pooka aspirant"
msgid_plural "pooka aspirants"
msgstr[0] "プーカ"

#. ~ Description of monster "pooka aspirant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"This diminutive warrior possesses both animalistic features and custom made "
"arms and armor.  The twinkle in its eye seems to giggle as it readies its "
"weapons."
msgstr "手製の武器や鎧をもった、動物的な動きの戦士です。ギラギラと目を輝かせ、歪んだ笑みを浮かべて武器を構えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "March Lord"
msgid_plural "March Lords"
msgstr[0] "三月卿"

#. ~ Description of monster "March Lord"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this warlord of the border realm of "
"the Nether is clothed in silks and silvery tightly woven chainmail.  It "
"glares at you and an ethereal sword manifests in its hand."
msgstr ""
"絹の装束と銀色の強固なチェーンメイルを身にまとった、身長2m超の屈強な武将です。優美な剣を構え、異界と現実世界の境界に睨みを利かせています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "draugr"
msgid_plural "draugrs"
msgstr[0] "ドラウグ"

#. ~ Description of monster "draugr"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"One of the changelings risen as the undead.  Shudders and jerks interrupt "
"its previously smooth movements.  The silvery mail that covered much of its "
"body is now tarnished and where it is damaged it looks more like broken skin"
" than broken armor."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビとして蘇ったチェンジリングです。生前の優美な動きは失われ、常にフラフラと揺れています。全身を覆っていた銀色の鎧はくすみ、破損した部分はまるで皮膚ごと破れてしまったように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "overgrown and cracked mirror"
msgid_plural "overgrown and cracked mirrors"
msgstr[0] "真菌チェンジリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "overgrown and cracked mirror"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"What once would have been easily confused for a regular human, now tendrils "
"of fuzz hang loose from every wound this body received before and after "
"death."
msgstr "かつては普通の人間とそれほど変わらない外見でしたが、今は生前と死後に付けられたあらゆる傷口から菌糸を垂らしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "childlike fetch"
msgid_plural "childlike fetches"
msgstr[0] "フェッチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "childlike fetch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"It looks like either a child or a child sized doll.  However, the sharp "
"objects in its hands and the reflective nature of its eyes are the real "
"tells this isn't just a living child or doll.  You'd be hard-pressed to not "
"feel like you were killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""
"子供か、子供サイズの人形のような姿をしていますが、手には鋭利な武器を握り、目はギラギラと輝いています。この生物は単なる生きた子供や人形ではありませんが、実際の子供を殺してしまったときのような罪悪感を簡単に消せるわけではありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "daffodil warrior"
msgid_plural "daffodil warriors"
msgstr[0] "ダファディル"

#. ~ Description of monster "daffodil warrior"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"Wispy and willowy these fetches are the cannon fodder of the Fae.  Said to "
"grow in vast fields under the hill and harvested right before a battle "
"legends says they live but a day.  Its features are quite plant-like and one"
" arm ends in an ornate club."
msgstr ""
"他の妖魔から使い捨て兵士のように扱われる、小さく華奢なフェッチです。丘のふもとの広大な畑で育ったダファディルは戦いの直前に収穫され、寿命は一日しかもたないという言い伝えがあります。植物のような姿をしており、装飾の入った棍棒を片手で構えています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "daffodil warrior"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts into a rain of pollen!"
msgstr "%sは周囲に花粉をまき散らしました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "shimmer wolf"
msgid_plural "shimmer wolves"
msgstr[0] "光輝オオカミ"

#. ~ Description of monster "shimmer wolf"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly wolf.  Its luxurious fur shimmers in the "
"light.  If an Irish Wolfhound had an ancestor that couldn't be bothered to "
"mingle with mere mortal men it would be this wolf."
msgstr ""
"異界のオオカミの一種です。豊かな毛並みが光に照らされ、キラキラと輝いています。アイリッシュウルフハウンドの祖先が人間との交流を嫌っていれば、このような生物になっていたかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "goblin spider"
msgid_plural "goblin spiders"
msgstr[0] "化けグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A giant, dark gray goblin spider, the size of a pony and above the mandibles"
" where you would expect to see the eyes instead there is a child's face.  It"
" seems to vanish into the shadows if you take your eyes off it."
msgstr "ポニーほどのサイズがある、巨大な暗灰色の化けグモです。大きな顎の上には、複眼ではなく子供の顔が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "unicorn"
msgid_plural "unicorns"
msgstr[0] "ユニコーン"

#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  Impossible to confuse with a "
"regular horse even if you don't spot the spiraled horn coming from the head."
"  Rumor has it that some of the Fair Lords have ways to tame and ride this "
"magnificent creature."
msgstr ""
"発達した長くきらびやかなたてがみ、箒のような尻尾、強く引き締まった筋肉が特徴的な、蹄をもつ草食動物です。額に生えた螺旋模様の角を見ずとも、普通のウマと混同することはありません。高貴な妖精の中には、この荘厳な生物を乗りこなす方法を知っている者もいるそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "unicorn foal"
msgid_plural "unicorn foals"
msgstr[0] "ユニコーン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn foal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  It has a stubby nub of a horn "
"growth starting.  This one is still a juvenile; it'll take a while before it"
" can be ridden."
msgstr ""
"発達した長くきらびやかなたてがみ、箒に似た尻尾、強く引き締まった筋肉が特徴的な、蹄をもつ草食生物です。額からは短い角が生え始めています。まだ幼いため、すぐには騎乗できません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "mavka"
msgid_plural "mavkas"
msgstr[0] "マフカ"

#. ~ Description of monster "mavka"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful woman clad in diaphanous robes, that drift in the water along "
"with her lengthy hair.  As she steps up and across the water you never "
"manage to see her reflection.  Suddenly, the hair moves and grabs some small"
" animal and pulls it towards the creature."
msgstr ""
"長い髪を水に漂わせている、ローブをまとった美しく儚げな女性です。水面に立って移動しますが、その瞬間は決して目撃できません。髪の毛を素早く動かして小動物などを掴み、引き寄せる能力をもっています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "thrown knife"
msgid_plural "thrown knifes"
msgstr[0] "投げナイフ"

#. ~ Description of gun "thrown knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Shiny reflective throwing knife at the ready."
msgstr "光を受けてキラキラと輝くナイフが用意されています。"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 19"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid ""
"A poorly maintained and inaccurate version of the Glock 19 for renfields."
msgstr "レンフィールドが使っている、整備不良で精度の低いM9です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "renfield remington"
msgid_plural "renfield remingtons"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾝﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "renfield remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "A fake shotgun for renfields (because monster aiming is too lethal)."
msgstr "レンフィールド用の疑似セミオートライフルです(モンスターの照準が正確すぎるため)。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "flying shark"
msgid_plural "flying sharks"
msgstr[0] "フライングシャーク"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying shark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"It would be funny watching a shark swim through the air, between trees and "
"other objects like kelp under the water.  If it didn't mean the shark was "
"here, now and capable of flying after you.  Clearly something is off, here."
msgstr ""
"現実に存在しており、こちらを追って飛んでくる可能性さえなければ、海藻を掻き分けるように木々の間を進むサメを見れば、さぞ愉快な気持ちになれたことでしょう。明らかに何かが間違っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "endless snake"
msgid_plural "endless snakes"
msgstr[0] "無限のヘビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "endless snake"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"The tail of this snake doesn't seem to end.  Clearly there are places that "
"are not part of the tail of this snake, but when you watch it move you only "
"see the front of the body move forward while the rear stays in it's place "
"eternally elongating.  But that can't be true so your eyes snap to somewhere"
" else and that seems to be an appropriately length snake, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"このヘビは、どこまで行っても尾の先に辿り着けません。尾以外の部位は確かに存在していますが、前に進むときは体の前半分だけが進み、後ろ半分は永遠にその場に留まったままです。視界の端に留めている限りは、普通の長さのヘビにしか見えません。どういうことなのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "swarm of teeth"
msgid_plural "swarms of teeth"
msgstr[0] "歯の大群"

#. ~ Description of monster "swarm of teeth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "A buzzing whining sound accompanies this swarm of loose teeth."
msgstr "抜けた歯が群れをなし、ブンブンと唸っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "twin"
msgid_plural "twins"
msgstr[0] "写し身"

#. ~ Description of monster "twin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "Ethereal copy of you."
msgstr "自分にそっくりな姿をした霊体です。"

#. ~ Description of species "CHANGELING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a creature from under the hill"
msgstr "丘のふもとに棲む生物"

#. ~ Description of species "VAMPIRE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a variety of creatures that subsist off the blood of living humans"
msgstr "人間の生き血を吸う生物の一種"

#. ~ Description of species "NIGHTMARE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "creatures made from dreams, technically not alive"
msgstr "夢が生み出した怪物であり、厳密に言えば生物ではない"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamer"
msgstr "ドリーマー"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamers are people able to tap into the power of dreams and nearby "
"dimensions and create fantastical effects as a result.  They can even pull "
"some of this dream material into our world to build other things with it.  "
"Gains a spell to summon dreamdross scraps on demand."
msgstr ""
"ドリーマーは、夢の世界や近接した次元から力を引き出し、幻想的な効果をもたらします。夢で作られた素材を現実世界に持ち出し、別のものに作り替える力も持っています。呪文によって夢鉱屑を自由に生み出せます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Eater of Dreams"
msgstr "ドリームイーター"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater of Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"These people are aware of this cross-dimensional contamination and while "
"they can't pull anything over and make new things, they can eat anything "
"they find in our world that doesn't belong and gain abilities and powers "
"from that consumption.  They have larger than normal mana pools but regen "
"that mana much slower as a result, they can a spell to convert dreamdross "
"scraps directly into mana."
msgstr ""
"ドリームイーターは次元の混入を察知していますが、別次元から何かを持ち出したり一から何かを作り出したりはできません。現実世界に混じった異界のものを食らい、新たな技や力を獲得します。マナの最大容量が通常より多いですが、回復量は遅くなっています。呪文によって夢鉱屑をマナに変換できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamsmith"
msgstr "ドリームスミス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamsmith"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamsmiths can forge dreamdross into a more durable form and create "
"permanent items that can be repaired."
msgstr "ドリームスミスは夢鉱を鍛えてより頑丈にし、修復可能なアイテムを作り出す能力をもっています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Mad Genius"
msgstr "マッドジーニアス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mad Genius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"The Mad Genius uses their connection to other dimensions in order to "
"manipulate or even replace the physics of this realm with that of another.  "
"They turn toys and nonsense inventions into machines of incredible "
"sophistication and power, temporarily.  Roughly once a week they will accrue"
" enough creative sparks to create a random minor artifact."
msgstr ""
"マッドジーニアスは次元間の繋がりを利用して、現実世界の物理法則を操作したり、別世界の物理法則に置き換えたりすることができます。単なる玩具やナンセンスな発明品を、一時的に高度で強力な兵器へと変えてしまうことも可能です。思考が徐々に蓄積され、週に一回程度ランダムでアーティファクトを作り出せます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
msgstr "XEDRA神経工学インターフェース"

#. ~ Description of mutation "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid ""
"The compact bionic command and control interface interwoven with your "
"nervous system had a previous life inside of a cybernetic tribesperson.  "
"Best case scenario, none of them are on this Earth."
msgstr ""
"神経系に織り込まれた小型命令制御インターフェースは、かつてあるサイボーグ種族の体内に入っていたものです。この地球上に奴らが一体も存在しないというのが、最良の筋書きです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spider egg host"
msgstr "クモ寄生"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider egg host"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transforming into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transforming into Spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't feel very well.  On an existential level."
msgstr "決して良い気分ではありません。強い違和感があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transforming into Goblin"
msgstr "ゴブリン変化"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transformed into Goblin"
msgstr "ゴブリン変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel like you've left behind your old life and form."
msgstr "今までの生や形を捨て去ったような気分です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transforming into Spider"
msgstr "クモ変化"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transformed into Spider"
msgstr "クモ変化"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Haunted by your dreams made flesh"
msgstr "恐れる夢想家"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Haunted by your dreams made flesh"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Accompanied by your dreams made flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your dreams can change reality."
msgstr "夢が現実になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Accompanied by your dreams made flesh"
msgstr "同行する夢想家"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infected with the vampire disease."
msgstr "吸血鬼の病に感染しました。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infected with the vampire disease."
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal
#. hungers."
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have developed a thirst for the blood of your fellow humans."
msgstr "同族の血を欲しています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gleaming eyes"
msgstr "輝く瞳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gleaming eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes gleam lightly red as the light catches in them and with a few "
"drops of the stolen blood in your veins you are able to see in the dark."
msgstr "瞳が光を反射して赤く輝いています。吸った血の力を流し込むことで、暗闇でも目が見えるようになります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Recover Stamina"
msgstr "スタミナ回復"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Recover Stamina"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to boost and recover some of "
"your spent stamina."
msgstr "吸った血の力を使い、スタミナを回復させることができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Walking the shadowed path of blood."
msgstr "昏き血の道を歩む者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood."
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have new fangs to go along with your thirst for blood."
msgstr "血液を渇望する思いが強まり、立派な牙を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coagulant Weave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body prepares to prevent the lose of any blood to combat damage."
msgstr "肉体を強化し、ダメージによって血液が失われる事態を防ぐことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood spurred healing"
msgstr "血の治癒"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood spurred healing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh heals visibly while blood disintegrates hidden inside your veins."
msgstr "吸った血を分解して体内に取り込み、肉体を著しく回復させます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal hungers."
msgstr "永遠の渇望"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hypnotic gaze"
msgstr "魅了の瞳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypnotic gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You lock eyes with your prey and stun them with the force of your will."
msgstr "獲物を見つめて気絶させます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood driven speed"
msgstr "血の疾駆"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood driven speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body exceeds normal human reaction limits as blood turns to ash in your"
" veins."
msgstr "体内で血液を燃やし、通常の人間の反応限界を超越します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Spider Emergence"
msgstr "クモ出現"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spider Emergence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "The incubating goblin spider larvae flee their host."
msgstr "孵化したクモの幼生が宿主から飛び出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Eggsac Eruption"
msgstr "卵塊破裂"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Consume human blood"
msgstr "血液摂取"

#. ~ Description of spell "Consume human blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "You consume human blood to keep the thirst at bay."
msgstr "人間の生き血を摂取し、渇きを癒します。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate your gleaming eyes."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、輝く瞳を有効化できません。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to recover any stamina."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、スタミナを回復できません。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to fortify your flesh."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、肉体を強化できません。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to hypnotize your foes."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、敵を気絶させられません。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You lack the stolen lifeforce to accelerate your own."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、肉体を加速できません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
msgid "What can you tell me about Xedra?"
msgstr "XEDRAについて教えて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
msgid ""
"Are you talking about the Zebra agencies?  I probably don't know any more "
"than you do.  When things started getting weird about a decade ago, all "
"these new departments starting springing up out of Homeland Security.  Their"
" badges were just barcodes that if you scanned with your phone would put you"
" in contact with your local law enforcement, who'd vouch for them."
msgstr ""
"ゼドラって、ゼブラのことかな？そんなに色々知ってるわけじゃないけどね。10年くらい前からおかしな事件が増えてきて、国土安全保障省で新しい部署が次々作られたんだ。ゼブラのバッジはバーコードになっていて、携帯電話でそれを読み取ると、後ろ盾になってくれる地元警察を呼べるんだってさ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ spider victims could be hosts could be transforming.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "spider victim"
msgstr "クモの餌"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "Spider Victim"
msgstr "クモの餌"

#. ~ Job description of "Spider Victim" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "I've been captured by these spider things.  Please rescue me!"
msgstr "クモみたいな化け物に捕まっちまった。頼む、助けてくれ！"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ someone with dreaming powers
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "rescued dreamer"
msgstr "救出された夢想家"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "Captured Dreamer"
msgstr "囚われの夢想家"

#. ~ Job description of "Captured Dreamer" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid ""
"I dreamt of another world and something came and snatched me away from my "
"home."
msgstr "別世界の夢を見ていたと思ったら、家にやってきた何者かに連れ去られたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid ""
"I've been listening to those things eat the others they've brought back to "
"here."
msgstr "奴ら、他の人もここへ連れて来ては餌にしているようなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Can you get me out of this spider pit?"
msgstr "クモの巣を取ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "I hate spiders!"
msgstr "クモは大嫌いだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "Let's get out of here before more spiders show up."
msgstr "もっとクモがやってくる前に、一緒に逃げよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
msgid "I don't need another mouth to feed.  Get out of my sight."
msgstr "他人を養う余裕はない。失せろ。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/cbm_spells.json
msgid "Swarm of Bats"
msgstr "コウモリの大群召喚"

#. ~ Description of spell "Swarm of Bats"
#. ~ Description of spell "Giant Bat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/cbm_spells.json
msgid "Are you the Bat Man?"
msgstr "まるでバットマンですね？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/cbm_spells.json
msgid "Giant Bat"
msgstr "巨大コウモリ召喚"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "FBI Paranormal Investigator"
msgstr "FBI超常現象捜査官"

#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Paranormal Investigator" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to work for the Paranormal Investigation "
"Department of the FBI.  You got used to jokes at your expense, as well as "
"being constantly underfunded and disregarded by your superiors.  You were "
"returning from yet another case with nothing but a bag of suspicious candies"
" to show, when all hell broke loose.  Oh well, at least now you can be "
"certain that everyone still alive will believe you that the truth is out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前は、FBIの超常現象捜査部署で働いていました。自虐ジョークや慢性的な資金不足、後ろ盾になってくれない上司にも慣れてきたところです。ある事件の証拠となりそうな怪しい飴の包み紙を持ち帰ってきた丁度その時、世界が崩壊しました。少なくとも生き残っている人々は、真実がそこにあることを信じてくれるに違いありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "FBI Paranormal Investigator"
msgstr "FBI超常現象捜査官"

#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Paranormal Investigator" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to work for the Paranormal Investigation "
"Department of the FBI.  You got used to jokes at your expense, as well as "
"being constantly underfunded and disregarded by your superiors.  You were "
"returning from yet another case with nothing but a bag of suspicious candies"
" to show, when all hell broke loose.  Oh well, at least now you can be "
"certain that everyone still alive will believe you that the truth is out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前は、FBIの超常現象捜査部署で働いていました。自虐ジョークや慢性的な資金不足、後ろ盾になってくれない上司にも慣れてきたところです。ある事件の証拠となりそうな怪しい飴の包み紙を持ち帰ってきた丁度その時、世界が崩壊しました。少なくとも生き残っている人々は、真実がそこにあることを信じてくれるに違いありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Xedra Response Team Member"
msgstr "XEDRA対応スタッフ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Response Team Member" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before Xedra recruited you, you probably worked for the ATF or a PMC like "
"Kroll.  It was your job to investigate any cross-pollination incidents where"
" alternate physics regions crossed over the Nether and reached our world.  "
"Part exterminator part investigator, you made sure that any new resources "
"and contaminants were accounted for, including any intelligent life trying "
"to sneak into our world.  Local law enforcement and civilians called you "
"'Zebras' since your identification and badges only had a barcode instead of "
"any name/rank/number.  This job has shown you things you don't want to "
"remember but luckily the Zebra docs seem to have an endless supply of pills."
msgstr ""
"XEDRAの前はアルコール・タバコ・火器及び爆発物取締局か、あるいはクロールのような軍事企業に勤めていたのでしょう。異界の領域が物理的にこちらの世界と交わって引き起こされる事件を調査し、時には駆除していました。知的生命体を含めた新たな資源、あるいは汚染物質が現世に紛れ込んでいないかを確認するのが主な仕事です。身分証明書やバッジには名前や階級、連絡先の代わりに単なるバーコードだけが付いているため、地元の警察や民間人からは「ゼブラ」と呼ばれていました。この仕事では思い出したくもない光景を色々と魅せられてきましたが、幸いなことにゼブラの医者は薬を無限に補給してくれます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Xedra Response Team Member"
msgstr "XEDRA対応スタッフ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Response Team Member" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before Xedra recruited you, you probably worked for the ATF or a PMC like "
"Kroll.  It was your job to investigate any cross-pollination incidents where"
" alternate physics regions crossed over the Nether and reached our world.  "
"Part exterminator part investigator, you made sure that any new resources "
"and contaminants were accounted for, including any intelligent life trying "
"to sneak into our world.  Local law enforcement and civilians called you "
"'Zebras' since your identification and badges only had a barcode instead of "
"any name/rank/number.  This job has shown you things you don't want to "
"remember but luckily the Zebra docs seem to have an endless supply of pills."
msgstr ""
