#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Foreign Agent"
msgstr "外国諜報員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Foreign Agent" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You came here from another country trying to gain access to secrets the "
"United States had ripped from other worlds.  They probably had sent people "
"to your homeland to do the same.  You were out performing recon when the "
"Cataclysm struck and caught a ride with a stranger trying to find safety.  "
"Sadly you lost your companion and vehicle, getting lost in the process and "
"with now only a vague idea on how to get back to the safehouse, where you "
"hope your hidden gear remains untouched."
msgstr ""
"アメリカが異界から盗んだ秘密を知るため、他国からやってきました。おそらくは、アメリカも同じような諜報活動をしていたのでしょう。大変動が起きたときは丁度偵察に出掛けており、避難所へ向かっていた見知らぬ人と同行することになりました。残念ながら今は仲間も車も失っており、道も分からず、アジトへの帰り道も曖昧です。隠しておいた装備が盗まれていないことを祈りましょう。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Foreign Agent"
msgstr "外国諜報員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Foreign Agent" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
