#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Redness is creeping up from your wound.  You feel weak, and look pale."
msgstr "傷口が赤く変色しています。肉体が弱り、顔色も悪くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "The area around your zombie scratch is looking a little red."
msgstr "ゾンビにつけられた傷の周囲が少し赤くなっているような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Why is it so cold in here?  And so hot, at the same time?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなに寒気がするのでしょう？どうして熱さも感じているのでしょう？"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've been cut by a zombie.  Did it get infected?"
msgstr "ゾンビに引っ掻かれました。感染してしまったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie contagion, Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
