#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C7 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "C7 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C7ｱｻﾙﾄﾗｲﾌﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "C7 assault rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The C7A1 is the standard issue rifle for the Canadian military manufactured "
"by Diemaco.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle known for its "
"accuracy and controllable recoil."
msgstr ""
"C7A1は、ディマコ社が製造しているカナダ軍の標準装備ライフルです。ガス圧作動方式とロータリーボルト式を併用しており、精度の高さと反動の弱さで知られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "C7 assault rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C7"
msgid_plural "C7s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C7)"

#. ~ Description of variant "C7 assault rifle" of gun "C7"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The standard issue rifle for the Canadian armed forces, featuring a 20 in. "
"long barrel and full auto capabilities when fed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr "カナダ軍の標準装備ライフルです。銃身長は約50cmあり、STANAG弾倉から給弾するフルオート射撃が特徴です。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "C7 assault rifle"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C7A1"
msgid_plural "C7A1s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C7A1)"

#. ~ Description of variant "C7 assault rifle" of gun "C7A1"
#. ~ Description of variant "C8 carbine" of gun "C8CQB"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"This is the updated model of the C7 carbine, using a modified Weaver rail "
"instead of a carrying handle/iron sight assembly to assist in mounting "
"optics."
msgstr ""
"C7カービンの改良モデルです。キャリングハンドルとアイアンサイトの代わりに、光学部品を取り付けられる改造型ウィーバーレールが採用されています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C8 carbine"
msgid_plural "C8 carbines"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C8ｶｰﾋﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A carbine variant of the C7A1, recently introduced by the Canadian armed "
"forces.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its "
"unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm "
"and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"カナダ軍が近年導入したC7A1カービンを、更に改良したモデルです。精度が高く、小型で軽量ですが、メンテナンスを怠ると信頼性が低下することでも有名です。弾薬は5.56x45mm弾に対応しており、STANAG弾倉を装填できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C8"
msgid_plural "C8s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C8)"

#. ~ Description of variant "C8 carbine" of gun "C8"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The standard issue carbine for the Canadian armed forces, featuring a 14.5 "
"in. long barrel and full auto capabilities when fed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr "カナダ軍の標準装備カービンです。銃身長は約37cmあり、STANAG弾倉から給弾するフルオート射撃が特徴です。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C8CQB"
msgid_plural "C8CQBs"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C8CQB)"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "Browning Hi-Power"
msgid_plural "Browning Hi-Powers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(9mm/ﾌﾞﾛｰﾆﾝｸﾞﾊｲﾊﾟﾜｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Browning Hi-Power"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A licensed copy of the Browning Hi-Power, made by John Inglis and Company.  "
"Issued to officers and infantry in need of a weapon for confined spaces, "
"this is chambered in 9x19 Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"ジョン・イングリス社がライセンス生産したブローニング・ハイパワーです。閉所で発砲する機会がある警官や歩兵に支給され、9x19mmパラベラム弾を発射します。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M1911A1"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP and accepting M1911 "
"magazines."
msgstr ".45口径ACP弾を装填するセミオートハンドガンです。M1911弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "M1911A1" of gun "M1911A1"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An update to the original M1911, featuring an extended tang on the grip "
"safety to prevent hammer bite as well as a shorter trigger for smaller "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"M1911の改良モデルです。撃鉄が親指を挟まないようにグリップセーフティの突起が長くなっており、引き金も短くなっているため小さな手でも扱えます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C9"
msgid_plural "C9s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/C9)"

#. ~ Description of gun "C9"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A mountable machine gun used by Canadian infantry, feeding from a belt or "
"STANAG magazines in a pinch.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the"
" C9 is designed to fire many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"カナダ軍の歩兵が使っている携行用マシンガンです。弾帯から給弾しますが、非常時はSTANAG弾倉を使うこともできます。精度が低く、照準の制御も困難ですが、速やかに弾幕を展開できます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "C6"
msgid_plural "C6s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.308口径/C6)"

#. ~ Description of gun "C6"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The Colt Canada M6 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the"
" .30-caliber C5 GPMG.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the "
"shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr ""
"コルトカナダ社のC6は、.300口径のC5 "
"GPMGの後継として開発された汎用マシンガンです。大抵の人間はアクション映画の主人公ではないため、重すぎるこの銃を設置せずに撃つのは困難です。"

#. ~ Message describing the effect of hitting the "leg_mangled" weakpoint
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/monsters/weakpoints.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is knocked down, and doesn't look like it can get back up!"
msgstr "%sは倒れ、体勢を立て直せそうにありません！"

