msgstr "タンブルウィード"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tumbleweed"
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_furniture.json
msgid "Tumbleweed."
msgstr "タンブルウィードです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "outcrop"
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "周囲の地面から突き出した大きく鋭い岩場です。表面には凹凸があり、適切な靴を着用していれば昇降できます。"

