#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/innawood/modinfo.json
msgid "Innawood"
msgstr "変更 - 野外サバイバル"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Innawood"
#: data/mods/innawood/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"An untouched land that mankind has yet to reach.  Disables most traces of "
"civilization for that 'innawood' experience.  Recommend size of cities be "
"set to 0."
msgstr ""
"ゲームの舞台を人類未踏の地に変更します。文明の痕跡をほとんど削除することで、野外サバイバルを楽しめます。設定で街の大きさを0にすることをお勧めします。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Goat Man"
msgstr "ヤギ男"

#. ~ Description of profession "Goat Man" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Nobody around?  Oh well, it doesn't matter.  Your beloved goats are all you "
"need!"
msgstr "そんな生物は存在しないって？まあまあ、いいじゃないですか。愛すべきヤギたちが傍にいればそれで十分です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Goat Lady"
msgstr "ヤギ女"

#. ~ Description of profession "Goat Lady" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
