#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "In a Cave"
msgstr "洞窟の中"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "In a Cave"
msgstr "洞窟の中"

#. ~ Description of scenario "In a Cave" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰かいるようです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "In a Cave" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰かいるようです。"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "In a Cave"
#. ~ Starting location of scenario "A Lonely Cave"
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Cave"
msgstr "洞窟"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "A Lonely Cave"
msgstr "孤独な洞窟"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "A Lonely Cave"
msgstr "孤独な洞窟"

#. ~ Description of scenario "A Lonely Cave" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰もいないようです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "A Lonely Cave" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰もいないようです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bordered" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in a wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a "
"mysterious sky-high wall seen in the distance."
msgstr "パニックの波を掻き分けて、屋外の(比較的)安全な場所を確保しました。ただ一つ気になるのは、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁です。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bordered" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in a wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a "
"mysterious sky-high wall seen in the distance."
msgstr "パニックの波を掻き分けて、屋外の(比較的)安全な場所を確保しました。ただ一つ気になるのは、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁です。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Flight" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping"
" that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you "
"got lost and had to land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、現在地が分からなくなり、何もない野原に着陸するしか選択肢はありませんでした。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Flight" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping"
" that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you "
"got lost and had to land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、現在地が分からなくなり、何もない野原に着陸するしか選択肢はありませんでした。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  "
"When you look around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  "
"Just how hard did you hit your head?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に向かう途中で事故に巻き込まれました。辺りを見渡すと、車は先程まで走っていた筈の道とは違う場所に停まっています。頭を強く打ったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  "
"When you look around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  "
"Just how hard did you hit your head?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に向かう途中で事故に巻き込まれました。辺りを見渡すと、車は先程まで走っていた筈の道とは違う場所に停まっています。頭を強く打ったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_cave_innawood"
#: data/mods/innawood/start_locations.json
msgid "Cave - on the surface"
msgstr "洞窟(地上)"

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_cave_underground_innawood"
#: data/mods/innawood/start_locations.json
msgid "Cave - underground"
msgstr "洞窟(地下)"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/innawood/traps.json
msgid "summon trapdoor spider"
msgstr "トダテグモ召喚"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "clay car grid battery"
msgstr "家庭用粘土バッテリー(自動車)"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "clay car grid battery"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "A clay car battery wired into a static power grid."
msgstr "電気配線に接続して電力を供給できる自動車用粘土バッテリーです。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "clay grid battery array"
msgstr "家庭用粘土バッテリーアレイ(自動車)"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "clay grid battery array"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "A clay battery array wired into a static power grid."
msgstr "電気配線に接続して電力を供給できる自動車用バッテリーアレイです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild cotton"
msgstr "ワタ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild cotton"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A cotton plant, growing wild and feral."
msgstr "野生化したワタが自生い茂っています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild sugar beet"
msgstr "サトウダイコン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild sugar beet"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "Sugar beet plant, growing wild without human touch."
msgstr "野生化したサトウダイコンが生い茂っています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild cannabis"
msgstr "大麻草"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild cannabis"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A riotous snarl of cannabis, all stalks and five-pointed leaves."
msgstr "茎の先端に5枚の小葉がまとまって生えている、青々と茂った大麻草です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild pumpkins"
msgstr "カボチャ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild pumpkins"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tangled mess of hairy vines and pale yellow trumpet flowers.  Is that a "
"pumpkin hidden in this mess?"
msgstr "黄色いラッパ型の花と産毛が生えた蔓が絡み合っています。どこかにカボチャが実をつけているでしょうか？"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild corn"
msgstr "トウモロコシ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild corn"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Tall green stalks with what looks like hair growing out of nodes along its "
"length.  You're pretty sure this is corn."
msgstr "背が高い緑色の植物の節々に、長い毛を生やした実がなっています。これは間違いなくトウモロコシですね。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild beans"
msgstr "豆"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild beans"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A mess of vines strangling a dead bush.  There are pods and tiny white "
"flowers growing along them."
msgstr "枯れ草に蔓が絡みついており、あちこちに莢と白く小さな花をつけています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fermenting vat"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sealable vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "酢や酒を発酵させるための密封可能な大桶です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bulletin board"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A crude approximation of a 'real' bulletin board.  Good for pinning various "
"notices for other survivors to read."
msgstr "「本物の」掲示板に似せて作った、簡素な板です。他の生存者に読んでもらう様々な連絡事項を張り出せそうです。"

#. ~ Construction group name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "Build Innawood Bulletin Board"
msgstr "掲示板を設置する(Innawood)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "makeshift transformer"
msgid_plural "makeshift transformers"
msgstr[0] "簡易変圧器"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift transformer"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of cables around an iron core.  Useful for controlling voltage."
msgstr "ケーブルを巻いた鉄芯です。電圧を制御するのに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Liquid for milking flag, so more quench and volume and less toxins and
#. fun per unit.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "fresh honeydew"
msgid_plural "fresh honeydews"
msgstr[0] "甘露液"

#. ~ Liquid for milking flag, so more quench and volume and less toxins and
#. fun per unit.
#. ~ Description of "fresh honeydew"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "Turgid, but still liquid honeydew, fresh from the… bug."
msgstr "虫から採取したばかりの、とろみのある液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "シラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid ""
"A small roll of birchbark with cord, to tie around wounds to help stop "
"bleeding and protect from dirt.  It's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"シラカバの樹皮を小さく丸めたものに紐を付けただけの包帯です。傷口を覆って止血や保護に使いますが、何もしないよりはマシ程度の効果しかありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "salved birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "salved birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "軟膏付きシラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Description of "salved birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid ""
"Birchbark bandages with added garlic salve.  They're better for wounds but "
"not as good as real bandages."
msgstr "ニンニクの軟膏を塗ったシラカバ包帯です。傷口の保護に役立ちますが、本物の包帯には劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "light battery shell"
msgid_plural "light battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(小)"

#. ~ Description of "light battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a light battery.  It will need to be refilled to"
" be useful."
msgstr "小型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "medium battery shell"
msgid_plural "medium battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(中)"

#. ~ Description of "medium battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a medium battery.  It will need to be refilled "
"to be useful."
msgstr "中型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "heavy battery shell"
msgid_plural "heavy battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(大)"

#. ~ Description of "heavy battery shell"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a heavy battery.  It will need to be refilled to"
" be useful."
msgstr "大型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of "sewing kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a wrapped leather kit with a variety of needles, some wooden spools "
"for thread, small scissors, and a few other useful textile tools.  Use a "
"sewing kit on an article of clothing to attempt to repair or reinforce that "
"clothing.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr ""
"数本の針、木製の糸巻き、小さなハサミなどの裁縫に役立つ道具を革で包んだ裁縫セットです。使用すると、裁縫スキルを活用して衣服の修復や補強を試みます。"

#. ~ Description of "tailor's kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden "
"spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to "
"customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr ""
"数本の針、木製の糸巻き、小さなハサミ、千枚通しが入った高品質の裁縫セットです。裁縫スキルのレベル次第で、この道具を使って服や防具の仕立て直しや改造が可能になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid "fibercloth sheet"
msgid_plural "fibercloth sheets"
msgstr[0] "生地(植物繊維)"

#. ~ Description of "fibercloth sheet"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of fabric woven from plant fiber, suitable for "
"making clothing."
msgstr "縦約61cm、横約30cmの、衣類を仕立てるのに適した植物繊維の生地です。"

#. ~ Item name
