msgid "fibercloth patch"
msgid_plural "fibercloth patches"
msgstr[0] "端切れ(植物繊維)"

#. ~ Description of "fibercloth patch"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A 6 inch square fibercloth patch, suitable for use in repairing and "
"tailoring of clothing."
msgstr "約16cm四方の植物繊維の端切れです。衣服の修復や製作に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
msgid "blacksmith repair kit"
msgid_plural "blacksmith repair kits"
msgstr[0] "鍛冶修復キット"

#. ~ Description of "blacksmith repair kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armor.  It uses "
"charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it "
"easier to work."
msgstr "傷ついた金属製の道具や鎧を修復するための道具一式です。小さな陶器に入った炭で修復部分を加熱し、作業効率を高めます。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/vehicle_battery.json
