"A wet pit full of raw bog iron, suitable for bloomery refining if it was "
"extracted properly."
msgstr "鉄鉱石が混じった柔らかい地面です。上手く掘り出せば塊鉄炉で精錬できそうです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/furniture_and_terrain/veins.json
