msgstr "左手が凍り付いたように感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:451 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:452
msgid "Your left hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "左手が寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:453 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:454
msgid "Your right hand feels like ice."
msgstr "右手が凍り付いたように感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:453 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:454
msgid "Your right hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "右手が寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:455 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:456
msgid "Your left leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "左脚が厳しい寒さで意思に反して震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:455 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:456
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:457 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:458
msgid "Your legs uncontrollably shake from the cold."
msgstr "寒さで脚が震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:457 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:458
msgid "Your right leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "右脚が厳しい寒さで意思に反して震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:459 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:460
msgid "Your left foot feels frigid."
msgstr "左足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:459
msgid "Your left foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "左足が氷塊になったかのように固まっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:460
msgid "Your freezing left foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "左足が凍り付く程の寒さで上手くバランスを保てなくなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:461 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:462
msgid "Your right foot feels frigid."
msgstr "右足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:461
msgid "Your right foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "右足が氷塊になったかのように固まっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:462
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "右足が凍り付く程の寒さで上手くバランスを保てなくなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:475
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "熱で頭がガンガンします。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:477
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "大量の汗をかいています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:479 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:480
msgid "Your left hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "左手が汗をかき過ぎており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:481 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:482
msgid "Your right hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "右手が汗をかき過ぎており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:483
msgid "Your left leg is cramping up."
msgstr "左脚が痙攣を起こしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:485
msgid "Your right leg is cramping up."
msgstr "右脚が痙攣を起こしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:487
msgid "Your left foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "左足が暑さで腫れあがっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:489
msgid "Your right foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "右足が暑さで腫れあがっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:508
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "熱で幻覚が見えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:517 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:518
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "指が凍えており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:519 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:520
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:521 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:522
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:523 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:524
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "顔が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:550
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "眩い光に包まれ、瞬間移動しました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:570
msgid "You pass out."
msgstr "気絶しました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:604 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1316
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "近くに怪物が現れました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:605 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1317
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "近くに開いたポータルからモンスターが這い出てきました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:614
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "急に身震いしました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:628
msgid "Your vision is filled with bright lights…"
msgstr "視界が眩しい光で満たされました..."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:644
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "急にエクトプラズムに包まれました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:655
msgid "We have many colonists awaiting passage."
msgstr "順番待ちの入植者がたくさんいます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:684
msgid ""
"You're experiencing loss of basic motor skills and blurred vision.  Your "
"mind recoils in horror, unable to communicate with your spinal column."
msgstr "基本的な運動能力が失われ、視界もぼやけています。精神は恐怖にすくみ上がり、脊椎神経との通信が途絶しています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:685
msgid "You stagger and fall!"
msgstr "よろめいて倒れました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:700
msgid "There's some kind of big machine in the sky."
msgstr "空を見上げると、用途不明の大きな機械があります。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:703
msgid "It's some kind of electric snake, coming right at you!"
msgstr "機械の蛇か何かです。向かってきます！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:710
msgid ""
"Order us some golf shoes, otherwise we'll never get out of this place alive."
msgstr "ゴルフシューズを集めよとの勅命が下りました。さもなくばここから生きて出ることは叶わないでしょう。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:714
msgid "The possibility of physical and mental collapse is now very real."
msgstr "肉体と精神が破綻している可能性が非常に現実的なものになってきました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:716
msgid "No one should be asked to handle this trip."
msgstr "誰かなんとかしてくれないもんかなあ。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:726
msgid ""
"Your heart spasms painfully and stops, dragging you back to reality as you "
"die."
msgstr "心臓が激痛を伴いながら痙攣し、トリップ中の夢から死という現実に引き戻されました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:729
msgid ""
"You dissolve into beautiful paroxysms of energy.  Life fades from your "
"nebulae and you are no more."
msgstr "美しいエネルギーの爆発に溶けていきました。濁った角膜から魂が抜け、二度と戻ってくることはありませんでした。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:751
msgid "You bleed to death!"
msgstr "出血多量で死にました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:752
msgid "<npcname> bleeds to death!"
msgstr "<npcname>は出血多量で死にました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:757
msgid "Your heart can't keep up the pace and fails!"
msgstr "不整脈を起こしました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:784
msgid "Your skin looks pale and you feel anxious and thirsty.  Blood loss?"
msgstr "皮膚が青白くなり、不安や喉の渇きを感じます。失血が原因でしょうか？"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:786
msgid ""
"Your pale skin is sweating, your heart is beating fast, and you feel "
"restless.  Maybe you lost too much blood?"
msgstr "皮膚は青白く汗をかいており、鼓動が速まり、気持ちが落ち着きません。大量の失血が原因でしょうか？"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:788
msgid ""
"You're unsettlingly white, but your fingertips are bluish.  You are agitated"
" and your heart is racing.  Your blood loss must be serious."
msgstr "皮膚は異常なほど青白く、指先は真っ白です。興奮し、心臓は早鐘を打っています。あまりにも血を失いすぎたようです。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:790
msgid ""
"You are pale as a ghost, dripping wet from the sweat, and sluggish - despite"
" your heart racing like a train.  You are on the brink of collapse from the "
"effects of blood loss."
msgstr "皮膚は幽霊のように青ざめ、全身から汗が滴り落ちています。異常な心拍数の高さにもかかわらず、気だるさを感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:798
msgid "You feel dizzy and lightheaded."
msgstr "目眩がし、ふらつきました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:802
msgid "You feel tired and you breathe heavily."
msgstr "疲れを感じ、呼吸が荒くなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:806
msgid "You are anxious and cannot collect your thoughts."
msgstr "不安感が強すぎて、考えが上手くまとまりません。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:810
msgid "You are sweating profusely, but you feel cold."
msgstr "大量の汗をかいているにもかかわらず、寒さを感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:817
msgid "You huff and puff.  Your breath is rapid and shallow."
msgstr "息を切らしています。呼吸が浅く、速くなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:822
msgid "You drop to the ground, fighting to keep yourself conscious."
msgstr "その場に倒れ伏し、なんとか意識を保とうとしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:826
msgid "Your mind slips away."
msgstr "意識が途切れました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:857
msgid "You cannot breathe and your body gives out!"
msgstr "呼吸ができず、身体が動きません！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:858
